set key[id=12100121] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Blue Flame Fury]\\nOn hit, burns the \
    target with blue flames. Deals 2430 damage per second for 3 sec and stacks up to 50 times. If used with a \
    weapon above the belt's level, the ability will not work fully. This effect does not apply in battlefields or \
    arenas.</font>"
set key[id=12100121] guideDescription "<font color='#7A7A7A'>\\nA belt that has lost its mystical blue energy. The \
    front of the belt is decorated with a mask that looks just like Blue Rook. Part of it still feels hot to the \
    touch. Is there some way to raise the blue flames once more?</font>"
set key[id=12100122] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Blue Flame Fury]\\nOn hit, burns the \
    target with blue flames. Deals 25174 damage per second for 7 sec and stacks up to 100 times. If used with a \
    weapon above the belt's level, the ability will not work fully. This effect does not apply in battlefields or \
    arenas.</font>"
set key[id=12100122] guideDescription "<font color='#7A7A7A'>\\nA belt with mystical blue flames flickering on it, \
    radiating mysterious power. The front of the belt is decorated with a mask that looks just like Blue Rook. If \
    you look closely, it feels like the eyes in the mask glow blue.</font>"
