    who made headlines in Maple World, and suggests recalling the past year while going to meet people. \nGo to \
    $map:02000124$ to meet $npc:11000514$, the charismatic ruler of $map:02000124$."
set quest[questID=80000066] complete "Talk to $npc:11001002$ in $map:02000064$ or $map:63000032$"
set quest[questID=80000067] name "Her Fatal Charm"
set quest[questID=80000067] desc "$npc:11001002$ read the Maple Daily's first-anniversary special on the people \
    who made headlines in Maple World, and suggests recalling the past year while going to meet people. \
    \n$npc:11000515$, who shows off a haughty beauty in $map:02000216$, is rumored to be connected to the Black \
    Star Society. Go to $map:02000216$ to meet her."
