    who made headlines in Maple World, and suggests recalling the past year while going to meet people. \nMeet \
    $npc:11000015$, the leader of the vigilantes who protect peaceful $map:02000076$, and ask the secret to \
    beauty."
set quest[questID=80000069] complete "Talk to $npc:11001002$ in $map:02000064$ or $map:63000032$"
set quest[questID=80000070] name "Beautiful Idol"
set quest[questID=80000070] desc "$npc:11001002$ read the Maple Daily's first-anniversary special on the people \
    who made headlines in Maple World, and suggests recalling the past year while going to meet people. \
    \n$npc:11000406$, said to be Victoria Island's most popular man, is holding a fan meeting at $map:02000137$. \
    Go attend."
set quest[questID=80000070] complete "Talk to $npc:11001002$ in $map:02000064$ or $map:63000032$"
set quest[questID=80000071] name "The Square Man"
set quest[questID=80000071] desc "$npc:11001002$ read the Maple Daily's first-anniversary special on the people \
    who made headlines in Maple World, and suggests recalling the past year while going to meet people. \nThe head \
    of $npc:11000119$, the stalwart man guarding $map:02000001$, is said to be so flat you could set a kettle on \
    it. Go meet him and see if the rumor is true."
set quest[questID=80000071] complete "Talk to $npc:11001002$ in $map:02000064$ or $map:63000032$"
set quest[questID=80000072] name "The Man with a Hymn"
set quest[questID=80000072] desc "$npc:11001002$ read the Maple Daily's first-anniversary special on the people \
    who made headlines in Maple World, and suggests recalling the past year while going to meet people. \nAt the \
    top of the tall building in the middle of $map:02000100$, $map:02000158$, rumor has it $npc:11000252$ has job \
    applicants sing a hymn with his own name in it at their interviews... Go and confirm the truth."
set quest[questID=80000072] manual "Talk to $npc:11000252$ at $map:02000158$ in $map:02000100$"
set quest[questID=80000072] complete "Talk to $npc:11001002$ in $map:02000064$ or $map:63000032$"
