set key[id=1119180007015880] name "After that, you can hold the after-events.\nUse the gifts you received when you \
    reserved the wedding, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Commemorative Photo Ticket</font> and the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">After Party Ticket</font>, to hold <font color=\"#ffd200\">after-events</font> with your \
    guests!"
set key[id=1119180007015881] name "Do you have any other questions?"
set key[id=1119180007015882] name "How do I use the wedding hall reservation gift?"
set key[id=1119180007015883] name "How do I start the wedding?"
set key[id=1119180007015884] name "Use the gift you received when you reserved the wedding, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Commemorative Photo Ticket</font>, to move to a place where you can take commemorative \
    photos,\nand use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">After Party Ticket</font> to move to a place where you can play \
    little games with your guests.\nThe transfer portal stays open for 3 minutes, and the photo and after party \
    spaces stay open for up to 5 minutes."
set key[id=1119180007015885] name "There, you can freely change the angle as if you were at your own home while \
    taking photos,\nso have a great time taking <font color=\"#ffd200\">commemorative photos</font> freely with \
    your guests!"
set key[id=1119180007015886] name "Do you have any other questions?"
set key[id=1119180007015887] name "How do I start the wedding?"
set key[id=1119180007015888] name "When will we be recognized as a proper married couple?"
set key[id=1119180007015889] name "Hehe, really? From where I'm standing, your cheeks look rosy~ "
set key[id=1119180007015890] name "I hope today's wedding will be remembered as a happy and joyful memory, \
    $MyPCName$.\nCongratulations on your wedding!"
set key[id=1119180007015891] name "Congratulations on your wedding, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1119180007015892] name "I'm so happy to be at your wedding! Happy, so very happy!\nA happy, beautiful, \
