set key[id=1119180007015893] name "$MyPCName$, the day has finally come! Are you nervous? Star of the day?"
set key[id=1119180007015894] name "What should I do from here?"
set key[id=1119180007015895] name "I'm not nervous at all."
set key[id=1119180007015896] name "No more worrying. That's exactly why I came here, to tell you~"
