    color=\"#ffd200\">Marriage menu</font> to check your closeness and the messages you've written to each other."
set key[id=1119180007015907] name "After that, you can hold the after-events.\nUse the gifts you received when you \
    reserved the wedding, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Commemorative Photo Ticket</font> and the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">After Party Ticket</font>, to hold <font color=\"#ffd200\">after-events</font> with your \
    guests!"
set key[id=1119180007015908] name "Oh, right. You know that people who reserved a Luxury Wedding get a very \
    special gift, don't you?\nAfter the officiant declares you married, be sure to take out $item:20302962$ from \
    your mailbox and put it on!\nIf you wear it to the after-events, you'll sparkle and shine!"
set key[id=1119180007015909] name "Do you have any other questions~?"
set key[id=1119180007015910] name "How do I use the wedding hall reservation gift?"
set key[id=1119180007015911] name "How do I start the wedding?"
set key[id=1119180007015912] name "Use the gift you received when you reserved the wedding, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Commemorative Photo Ticket</font>, to move to a place where you can take commemorative \
    photos,\nand use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">After Party Ticket</font> to move to a place where you can play \
    little games with your guests.\nThe transfer portal stays open for 3 minutes, and the photo and after party \
    spaces stay open for up to 5 minutes."
set key[id=1119180007015913] name "There, you can freely change the angle as if you were at your own home while \
    taking photos,\nso have a great time taking <font color=\"#ffd200\">commemorative photos</font> freely with \
    your guests!"
set key[id=1119180007015914] name "Do you have any other questions~?"
set key[id=1119180007015915] name "How do I start the wedding?"
set key[id=1119180007015916] name "When will we be recognized as a proper married couple?"
set key[id=1119180007015917] name "Of course! I just cast a spell on $MyPCName$.\nToday you'll shine brighter, \
    look more wonderful and more beautiful than anyone.\nI guarantee it!"
set key[id=1119180007015918] name "Congratulations on your wedding, $MyPCName$!\nMay your today, your tomorrow, \
    and every day be beautiful!"
set key[id=1119200707015919] name "There are two ways to get a divorce.\nAn <font color=\"#ffd200\">uncontested \
    divorce</font>, where the two of you come to $map:84000002$ together and divorce quickly,\nand a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">forced divorce</font>, which one spouse can file without the other's consent."
set key[id=1119200707015920] name "An uncontested divorce can't be canceled once it's filed, and your partner's \
    consent is required. There is no reconsideration period.\nA forced divorce doesn't need your partner's \
    consent, but there is a 7-day reconsideration period and a fee paid by the one who files.\n"
set key[id=1119200707015921] name "If you want an uncontested divorce, come to me together with your spouse,\nand \
    if you want a forced divorce, go to $npcName:11004713[gender:0]$, the attorney in charge, in the room on the \
    right."
set key[id=1119200707015922] name "There are two ways to get a divorce.\nAn <font color=\"#ffd200\">uncontested \
    divorce</font>, where the two of you come to $map:84000002$ together and divorce quickly,\nand a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">forced divorce</font>, which one spouse can file without the other's consent."
set key[id=1119200707015923] name "An uncontested divorce can't be canceled once it's filed, and your partner's \
    consent is required. There is no reconsideration period.\nA forced divorce doesn't need your partner's \
    consent, but there is a 7-day reconsideration period and a fee paid by the one who files.\n"
set key[id=1119200707015924] name "The uncontested divorce is handled by $npcName:11004712[gender:1]$, the \
    attorney in the room on the left,\nand I handle forced divorces, so come see me if you need one."
set key[id=1120160807015925] name "$MyPCName$, you got through your wedding well. Congratulations."
set key[id=1120160807015926] name "How do I hold the after-events?"
set key[id=1120160807015927] name "How do I end the wedding completely?"
set key[id=1120160807015928] name "Use the gift you received when you reserved the wedding, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Commemorative Photo Ticket</font>, to move to a place where you can take commemorative \
    photos.\nThe transfer portal stays open for 3 minutes, and the photo space stays open for 5 minutes, so please \
    keep that in mind."
set key[id=1120160807015929] name "Do you have any other questions?"
set key[id=1120160807015930] name "How do I end the wedding completely?"
set key[id=1120160807015931] name "After the officiant's <font color=\"#ffd200\">declaration of marriage</font>, \
    you can talk to the officiant at any time and ask to end the wedding completely.\nOnce your partner agrees, \
    the wedding hall will close shortly and everyone inside will be moved out automatically."
set key[id=1120160807015932] name "Even if it isn't automatic, people can leave the wedding hall through the \
    portal, so it's fine to leave it up to the guests."
set key[id=1120160807015933] name "Do you have any other questions?"
set key[id=1120160807015934] name "How do I hold the after-events?"
set key[id=1120160807015935] name "Congratulations on your wedding, $MyPCName$! You were wonderful today."
set key[id=1120160807015936] name "How do I hold the after-events?"
set key[id=1120160807015937] name "How do I end the wedding completely?"
set key[id=1120160807015938] name "Use the gift you received when you reserved the wedding, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Commemorative Photo Ticket</font>, to move to a place where you can take commemorative \
    photos,\nand use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">After Party Ticket</font> to move to a place where you can play \
    little games with your guests.\nThe transfer portal stays open for 3 minutes, and the photo and after party \
    spaces stay open for up to 5 minutes.\nThere, you can freely change the angle as if you were at your own home \
    while taking photos,\nso have a great time taking <font color=\"#ffd200\">commemorative photos</font> freely \
    with your guests!"
set key[id=1120160807015939] name "There, you can freely change the angle as if you were at your own home while \
    taking photos,\nso have a great time taking <font color=\"#ffd200\">commemorative photos</font> freely with \
    your guests!"
set key[id=1120160807015940] name "Do you have any other questions?"
