set key[id=316160602004974] name "Hmm... Something seems to be going on at the Bidblaim manor... \nWould you go \
    and take a look?"
set key[id=316160602004975] name "Haa... "
set key[id=831174302000018] name "Welcome. This is $map:02000001$, and I'm $npc:11000160[gender:1]$.\nHow can I \
    help you?"
set key[id=831174302000028] name "W-well, that's... I'm just asking around here and there, that's all!\nAnyway! \
    I'm going to be busy from now on, so if you're so curious, go ask $npcTitle:11000169[gender:0]$ over there\nor \
    don't, whatever~"
set key[id=831174302000029] name "I told you I'm busy...\nIf you want to know why the Levee was cancelled, go ask \
    the armory\nguard over there!"
set key[id=831174302000030] name "Huh? What did you just say?"
set key[id=831174302000031] name "(Ask if he knows the real reason the Levee was cancelled.)"
set key[id=831174302000032] name "Uh... well... that's...\nHmm... "
set key[id=831174302000033] name "I don't know if there's some other reason the Levee was cancelled, but...\nyou'd \
    get your answer faster from $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ at $map:02000140$\nthan from an ordinary guardsman like \
    me."
set key[id=831174302000034] name "(Ask who $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ is.)"
set key[id=831174302000035] name "He's the royal steward, in charge of running the royal household.\nHe managed \
    all the preparations for this Levee, so he should know\nmuch more about why it was cancelled."
set key[id=831174302000036] name "I don't know if there's some other reason the Levee was cancelled, but...\nyou'd \
    get your answer faster from $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ at $map:02000140$\nthan from an ordinary guardsman like \
    me."
set key[id=831174302000037] name "Sigh...\nYou came looking for me? What can I do for you?"
set key[id=831174302000038] name "(Ask if he knows the real reason the Levee was cancelled.)"
set key[id=831174302000039] name "Ah... so you came all this way because of that too, $MyPCName$.\nLet me give you \
    the conclusion first... The Levee had to be\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">cancelled because we couldn't guarantee \
    the safety</font> of the huge crowd that gathered to see it."
set key[id=831174302000040] name "Of course, I know how disappointed the many people who traveled so far must \
    be,\nwith the Levee cancelled so suddenly.\nStill, I hope you'll understand the royal family's position: we \
    can't go ahead with\nan event that risks heavy casualties."
set key[id=831174302000041] name "(Ask what kind of danger there is, in detail.)"
set key[id=831174302000042] name "Well... the <font color=\"#ffd200\">earthquake we had recently is the biggest \
    risk</font>.\nThis is the first time such a big earthquake has hit near $map:02000001$,\nand the cause still \
    hasn't been clearly identified."
set key[id=831174302000043] name "If an earthquake struck in the middle of the Levee, wouldn't it be a\ndisaster \
    beyond repair?\nAnyway, as the person in charge of the Levee, I'd like to <font color=\"#ffd200\">apologize on \
    behalf of the\nroyal family</font> to you as well, $MyPCName$, who came from afar."
set key[id=831174302000044] name "I'd be grateful if you'd believe that <font color=\"#ffd200\">it was a decision \
    we had to make for everyone's safety</font>,\nand try to understand the royal family's position with a \
    generous heart."
set key[id=831174302000045] name "Say there, young man.\nDid you come to see the Levee too, and then hear it was \
    cancelled?"
set key[id=831174302000046] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302000047] name "I thought so...\nI carried this heavy load a long way around to get here, and \
    when I heard\nthe Levee was suddenly cancelled, I stormed over here in a rage."
set key[id=831174302000048] name "But then I saw $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ calmly explaining the royal side and \
    even bowing his head\nin apology, and my anger slowly died down.\nAmong the peddlers, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">everyone says the Tria royal steward is upright and\nhonest</font>, and it turns out that's \
    no idle rumor. "
set key[id=831174302000049] name "There must be plenty of people who came here angry over the cancellation, just \
    like us,\nand he kept smiling and calmly explained everything...\nHe even introduced buyers so we could sell \
    the goods we'd brought for the Levee...\nWhere else in the world will you find a man like that? "
set key[id=831174302000050] name "Ah, I've been rambling on. I shouldn't be standing around like this...\nTo reach \
    the buyer $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ introduced before sundown, I have to leave right\nnow. Oh... but what to \
    do...\nSorry to ask, but would you do me a favor?"
set key[id=831174302000051] name "(Ask what it is.)"
set key[id=831174302000052] name "I don't have time to go back to my lodging and check out.\nI'll give you my room \
    key. Could you go to $map:02000033$, hand it to $npc:11000390[gender:0]$,\nand check out for me?"
set key[id=831174302000053] name "Why did you turn back halfway?"
set key[id=831174302000054] name "(Say you left $item:30000163$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302000055] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302000056] name "Oh dear... I nearly made you walk for nothing.\nHere you go. Keep it safe this \
    time."
set key[id=831174302000057] name "Forgetting things already at your age?\nYou put it in your bag a moment ago. Go \
    on, search your bag!"
set key[id=831174302000058] name "Oh dear... your bag is full.\nTidy up your bag before you go around."
set key[id=831174302000059] name "Goodness... young folks these days seem to have a worse sense of direction than \
    I do."
set key[id=831174302000060] name "Welcome.\nHow can I help you?"
set key[id=831174302000061] name "(Hand over the room key received from $npc:11000179[gender:0]$ and ask to check \
    out.)"
set key[id=831174302000062] name "Strictly speaking, the guest should come in person... but he's probably already \
    gone...\nI suppose it can't be helped.\nBetween the guests leaving after hearing the Levee was cancelled and \
    the ones still\narriving without knowing, it's absolute chaos here."
set key[id=831174302000063] name "While we were waiting for the Levee, we were busy and frantic, but at least it \
    was exciting.\nNow, well... it's all disappointment and nothing but work. "
set key[id=831174302000081] name "Sigh... you're the one from before.\nDid $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ tell you why \
    the Levee was cancelled?"
set key[id=831174302000082] name "(Relay what $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ told you.)"
set key[id=831174302000083] name "Ah... I see...\nIf $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ said so, then it must be true.\nHe's \
    not the kind of man who'd lie to people... Sigh...\nIf only the Levee hadn't been cancelled... this wouldn't \
    have happened... "
set key[id=831174302000084] name "(Ask what's troubling him.)"
set key[id=831174302000085] name "Oh, it's... a thief...!\nMmph... no, never mind, it's nothing.\nWhat am I doing \
    telling someone I barely know... "
set key[id=831174302000086] name "(Persuade him that you'll help if he tells you what's wrong.)"
set key[id=831174302000087] name "Well... you see... the truth is...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">all the weapons have \
    vanished from the armory.</font>\nWith the Levee cancelled, we'd stored all the new weapons meant for \
    the\nevent in this armory, but... "
set key[id=831174302000088] name "I hardly ever left my post, and the lock was fastened...\nI have no idea when or \
    how it happened.\nIf it comes out that the weapons were stolen, I'll be thrown out of the guard for sure..."
set key[id=831174302000089] name "Would you help me recover the stolen weapons without anyone knowing?\nThere's a \
    rumor that <font color=\"#ffd200\">stolen goods are being traded among Tria's merchants...</font>\nand the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">stolen weapons</font> may be mixed in with them."
set key[id=831174302000090] name "Could you quietly look into it by visiting <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000004[gender:0]$</font>, who trades\nweapons most actively in $map:02000001$?"
set key[id=831174302000091] name "Could you quietly look into the stolen goods by visiting <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000004[gender:0]$</font>,\nwho trades weapons most actively in $map:02000001$?"
set key[id=831174302000092] name "What do you want to know?\nI don't know much besides weapons."
set key[id=831174302000093] name "(Ask if any weapons he traded recently seem like stolen goods.)"
set key[id=831174302000094] name "What a terrible thing to say!\nI only sell weapons I forge myself, hammering \
    away.\nI don't trade finished weapons, only iron ore for making them."
set key[id=831174302000095] name "The only recent deal was buying <font color=\"#ffd200\">iron ore that \
    $npc:11000170[gender:0]$ was offering\nat a low price</font>. That's all."
set key[id=831174302000096] name "Why do you keep bothering me?"
set key[id=831174302000097] name "(Press him on whether the iron ore sold to $npc:11000004[gender:0]$ was \
    stolen.)"
set key[id=831174302000098] name "S-stolen goods...? Don't go accusing innocent people.\nI just... heard someone \
    was selling iron ore cheap...\nAnyway, I bought the goods at a fair price and sold them to the merchants."
set key[id=831174302000099] name "(Ask who he bought the iron ore from.)"
set key[id=831174302000100] name "Um... that's...\nIt's a bit awkward to say..."
set key[id=831174302000101] name "(Persuade Leta to confess.)"
set key[id=831174302000102] name "(Threaten Leta into confessing.)"
set key[id=831174302000103] name "Sigh... the truth is...\nOn my way through $map:02000083$, I picked up a flyer \
    advertising a <font color=\"#ffd200\">rush sale of iron ore</font>.\nThat's all. "
set key[id=831174302000104] name "I was already on my way to $map:02000001$, so it seemed perfect.\nIron ore is \
    essential for making the guardsmen's armor, shields, and weapons,\nso it fetches a higher price in \
    $map:02000001$."
set key[id=831174302000105] name "Anyway... I went to the entrance of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000141$</font> written on the flyer,\nshowed it, and they guided me to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000173[gender:0]$</font>.\nIt felt creepy...\nbut the mood was such that I couldn't \
    just turn around and leave."
set key[id=831174302000106] name "I didn't know at the time, but only after coming to $map:02000001$ did I \
    learn\nthat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000173[gender:0]$ is a notorious fence</font>.\nI swear by the \
    heavens I didn't know they were stolen goods from the start."
set key[id=831174302000107] name "(Ask again where he bought the iron ore, to confirm.)"
set key[id=831174302000108] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000141$</font>...\nGo between the tall buildings \
    in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000083$</font>.\nHere... show them this <font color=\"#ffd200\">rush iron \
    ore sale</font> flyer I saw, and they'll let you\nin."
set key[id=831174302000109] name "Never tell anyone I told you.\nIf those guys find out, they'll track me down and \
    make me pay. Got it?"
set key[id=831174302000110] name "Okay, okay... I didn't know it was stolen at first either.\nI just saw a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">rush iron ore sale</font> flyer while passing through <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000083$</font>\nand went to see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000173[gender:0]$</font>, that's all."
set key[id=831174302000111] name "Only after coming to $map:02000001$ did I hear that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000173[gender:0]$ is\na notorious fence</font>.\nI really didn't know they were \
    stolen goods from the start."
set key[id=831174302000112] name "(Ask where he met $npc:11000173[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302000113] name "W-why are you back... "
set key[id=831174302000114] name "(Say you left $item:30000103$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302000115] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302000116] name "Ah... you're right...\nHere!"
set key[id=831174302000117] name "You put it in your bag earlier.\nTake another good look."
set key[id=831174302000118] name "Your bag looks way too heavy...\nWhy not tidy it up?"
set key[id=831174302000119] name "Oh... it's you... you scared me."
set key[id=831174302000120] name "Hey~! Yo~!\nWhere you headed?"
set key[id=831174302000121] name "(Show the flyer and say you're heading to $map:02000141$.)"
set key[id=831174302000122] name "Yo~ man~!\nYou're way, way too late. The iron ore's all sold out~"
set key[id=831174302000123] name "Only broker crew members can get into $map:02000141$ now~\nJust go home, wash \
    your feet, and go to sleep~ Yo~! Heh heh."
set key[id=831174302000124] name "Oh right! I promised to give you the iron ore trade records.\nLet me see... "
set key[id=831174302000125] name "Hmm... Hyna... $npcName:11000492[gender:0]$... Elkanto... Kims... \
    $npcName:11000526[gender:0]$... Burto...\n$npc:11000171[gender:0]$ ... Hm? Aha... "
set key[id=831174302000126] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\"> X/XX / $npc:11000171[gender:0]$ / iron ore \
    300kg</font>\nHere's the record you're looking for!\n$npcName:11000171[gender:0]$ is the boss of the junk \
    dealers in $map:02000084$."
set key[id=831174302000127] name "Take this to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000084$</font> and press <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000171[gender:0]$</font>,\nand you'll find out what you want to know.\nI'd better \
    slip back out the way I came. If fate allows, we'll meet again!"
set key[id=831174302000128] name "Shh! You haven't left yet?"
set key[id=831174302000129] name "(Say you left $item:30000105$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302000130] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302000131] name "You should've kept track of it from the start. You'll get me caught too.\nHere, \
    take this and hurry off."
set key[id=831174302000132] name "I thought I saw you put it in your bag... isn't it there?\nSearch well."
set key[id=831174302000133] name "How do you carry such a heavy bag?\nTidy it up before those guys catch you and \
    shake you down."
set key[id=831174302000134] name "This place is a bit of a maze.\nDon't wander off, just follow the corridor \
    straight out."
set key[id=831174302000135] name "What the!\nIf you're not here to sell junk, quit loitering and get out."
set key[id=831174302000136] name "(Show the iron ore trade document.)"
set key[id=831174302000137] name "Wh-what is this... where did you g-get that...\nWhy did you come to me with \
    that?"
set key[id=831174302000138] name "(Ask where he got the iron ore he handed to $npc:11000173[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302000139] name "If I tell you...?\nWill you forget I ever dealt with $npc:11000173[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302000140] name "Got it."
set key[id=831174302000141] name "(Say that's not possible.)"
set key[id=831174302000142] name "Well, the truth is...\nit's <font color=\"#ffd200\">iron ore made by melting \
    down the weapons meant for the guard's ceremony</font>...\nThere was so much of it that I skimmed off a tiny \
    bit unnoticed and handed it\nto $npc:11000173[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302000143] name "A <font color=\"#ffd200\">special order from a royal official</font> came in, \
    saying that with the Levee cancelled they\nwere no longer needed and I should melt them all down. "
set key[id=831174302000144] name "(Ask who the royal official placing the order was.)"
set key[id=831174302000145] name "I don't know that either.\nOnly porters came, claiming to be from the palace, \
    dumped a pile of weapons, and left."
set key[id=831174302000146] name "(Ask where the rest of the iron ore is.)"
set key[id=831174302000147] name "I loaded it all onto a truck that came from $map:02000001$."
set key[id=831174302000148] name "Then I can't tell you anything.\nHand that document over to me and promise to \
    leave me out of this.\nThen I'll tell you where the iron ore came from."
set key[id=831174302000149] name "Got it."
set key[id=831174302000150] name "Why, why, why!\nI told you everything, so why call me again?"
set key[id=831174302000151] name "(Ask about the truck that came from $map:02000001$.)"
set key[id=831174302000152] name "That? It was a Goldus courier truck.\nThe client said to go to our junkyard and \
    load up the iron ore."
set key[id=831174302000153] name "(Ask where the iron ore was delivered.)"
set key[id=831174302000154] name "How would I know that?\nThe courier who delivered it would know.\nIt came from \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>, so go ask the <font color=\"#ffd200\">courier</font> over \
    there."
set key[id=831174302000155] name "Go ask the <font color=\"#ffd200\">courier</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> about the rest."
set key[id=831174302000156] name "Yes? What brings you here?"
set key[id=831174302000157] name "(Ask about the iron ore loaded at $map:02000084$.)"
set key[id=831174302000158] name "Ah... we handle hundreds of parcels a day,\nso I can't remember each one..."
set key[id=831174302000159] name "You said it was loaded at $map:02000084$?\nI'll check the shipping log. Please \
    wait a moment."
set key[id=831174302000160] name "While you were at $map:02000140$, I found the shipping record.\nFrom \
    $map:02000084$... 12 cargo containers... \ncontents: iron ore... hmm...\nThere's no recipient name, only a \
    delivery address."
set key[id=831174302000161] name "(Ask for the delivery address.)"
set key[id=831174302000162] name "The address is...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">125 Royal Road, Queenstown</font>."
set key[id=831174302000163] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000064$</font> is a short walk from \
    $map:02000001$.\nIf the way seems too complicated, check the position of the portal to\n$map:02000064$ on the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">minimap</font>."
set key[id=831174302000164] name "Are you lost?\nCan I help you?"
set key[id=831174302000165] name "(Give the address and ask where it is.)"
set key[id=831174302000166] name "Ah, you've come to the right place.\nIt's the <font color=\"#ffd200\">warehouse \
    building right behind me</font>.\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">royal family has been renting the \
    building</font> for a while now."
set key[id=831174302000167] name "(Ask why the royal family rented a building.)"
set key[id=831174302000168] name "Ah, they said the royal storehouse was full because of the Levee \
    preparations.\nEven after the Levee was cancelled, a courier truck carrying container cargo\ncomes and goes \
    every other day."
set key[id=831174302000169] name "(Ask who manages the warehouse.)"
set key[id=831174302000170] name "Hmm... I've never seen anyone introduce themselves as the manager.\nWhen the \
    courier trucks come, I check their ID and pass, and\nI open the gate myself."
set key[id=831174302000171] name "(Ask to be let into the warehouse just once.)"
set key[id=831174302000172] name "That's difficult. I can only open the warehouse gate for people who carry\na \
    pass certified by the royal family."
set key[id=831174302000173] name "You find a ledger neatly laid out on the desk.\nYou flip through it..."
set key[id=831174302000174] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">X/X 23:00</font>\nRoyal Warehouse 1 / 2 boxes of gold \
    bars / Raymon 19300 mesos\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">X/X 22:00</font>\nRoyal Armory / new weapons 8t / pending \
    sale"
set key[id=831174302000175] name "Royal Armory... new weapons...\nThis may be a record related to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$ armory theft</font>."
set key[id=831174302000176] name "Royal Armory... new weapons...\nThis may be a record related to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$ armory theft</font>."
set key[id=831174302000177] name "$MyPCName$.\nYou were gone so long that I thought you'd forgotten my request. "
set key[id=831174302000178] name "(Hand over the suspicious ledger.)"
set key[id=831174302000179] name "What is this?"
set key[id=831174302000180] name "(Tell him to look at the ledger.)"
set key[id=831174302000181] name "Hm...? This is exactly like <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s \
    handwriting</font>...\nand it has <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s signature</font> \
    too...\nHmm..."
set key[id=831174302000182] name "Royal Armory... new weapons... pending sale...?\nTh-this is... the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">weapons missing from the armory</font>!!\nThen <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000492[gender:0]$</font> was behind it?!!"
set key[id=831174302000183] name "Come to think of it... the date written in this \
    ledger...\n$npc:11000492[gender:0]$ called me over to $map:02000140$ and I left my post for a moment.\nHe said \
    a relief guard was coming... Was that a scheme to rob the armory...?!"
set key[id=831174302000184] name "Looking at this ledger, it's not just the armory... I really... can't believe \
    it.\nHow could $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ do such a thing... "
set key[id=831174302000185] name "Ah... found it.\n$npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s home address is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">674 Flower Park, $map:02000119$</font>.\nTry heading over there."
set key[id=831174302000186] name "(Say thanks.)"
set key[id=831174302000187] name "Don't mention it.\nOh, but it's an old address, so it may be hard to find. If \
    you get confused,\nlook for the house with the repaired red roof in the Flower Park area."
set key[id=831174302000188] name "$npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s home address is <font color=\"#ffd200\">674 Flower \
    Park, $map:02000119$</font>.\nIt's an old address, so it may be hard to find.\nIf you get confused, look for \
    the house with the repaired red roof in the Flower Park area."
set key[id=831174302000189] name "The door isn't even locked, and the place is empty.\nIt's so unnaturally tidy \
    that it feels strange."
set key[id=831174302000190] name "It's a spotless room with nothing in sight, but there must be a clue \
    somewhere\nthat can trace $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s whereabouts."
set key[id=831174302000191] name "It's a spotless room with nothing in sight, but there must be a clue \
    somewhere\nthat can trace $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s whereabouts."
set key[id=831174302000192] name "He seems to have already passed away."
set key[id=831174302000193] name "Let's look around $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ for anything that could be a clue."
set key[id=831174302000194] name "Let's look around $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ for anything that could be a clue."
set key[id=831174302000195] name "$MyPCName$!!\nJust before the guard's investigation began, \
    $npc:11000492[gender:0]$, no, $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ disappeared, and it's\nbeen an uproar.\n$MyPCName$, \
    weren't you looking for $npc:11000492[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302000196] name "(Tell him what happened at $map:52000037$.)"
set key[id=831174302000197] name "What? $npc:11000492[gender:0]$... that man is dead? Haa... oh no...\nWe can't \
    stay here talking, we have to tell $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ right away."
set key[id=831174302000198] name "Now, please tell $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ everything about your investigation so \
    far,\nincluding that notebook you've just brought.\nPlease."
set key[id=831174302000199] name "Did you leave something behind?"
set key[id=831174302000200] name "(Say I left $item:30000023$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302000201] name "(Say I forgot what I was asked to do.)"
set key[id=831174302000202] name "Ah, right. Here you go."
set key[id=831174302000203] name "You looked like you were putting it in your bag just now...\nPlease check your \
    bag again."
set key[id=831174302000204] name "Your bag looks too heavy...\nWhy don't you tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=831174302000205] name "Please tell $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ everything about your investigation so \
    far,\nincluding that notebook you've just brought."
set key[id=831174302000206] name "$MyPCName$!\nI heard you investigated the armory theft at \
    $npc:11000169[gender:0]$'s request."
set key[id=831174302000207] name "We started investigating $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ right after \
    $npc:11000169[gender:0]$'s tip,\nbut his whereabouts are unknown. He left nothing behind."
set key[id=831174302000209] name "What? Is that true? $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ is dead...\nBefore we could even \
    uncover the truth of the armory theft... it never rains but it pours.\nWith no clues at all, this is \
    troublesome...  "
set key[id=831174302000210] name "(Say you also chased the suspected killer of Nelph but failed.)"
set key[id=831174302000217] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000055$</font> that come over from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000017$</font> next door\nroam all over town stealing the residents' belongings,\nand \
    this time it seems they swiped my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000019$</font> from my pocket."
set key[id=831174302000218] name "Those rascals have a habit of hiding stolen goods among the tree branches in the \
    forest,\nso if you shake the trees and look around, you might find it...\nBut I can't leave my post. "
set key[id=831174302000219] name "I'm sorry to ask, but could you search the <font color=\"#ffd200\">trees</font> \
    in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000017$</font>\nand find my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000019$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000220] name "I'm sorry to ask, but could you search the <font color=\"#ffd200\">trees</font> \
    in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000017$</font>\nand find my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000019$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000221] name "If those rascals had started wandering into the building with this \
    $item:30000019$,\nI'd have been fired as a guard on the spot. Thank you so much."
set key[id=831174302000222] name "I don't know how I'll repay this debt...\nIf you ever need my help, come find \
    me."
set key[id=831174302000223] name "(Ask him to let you into $map:02000020$.)"
set key[id=831174302000224] name "Ah... well... that's... "
set key[id=831174302000225] name "(Ask once more.)"
set key[id=831174302000226] name "Hmm... all right.\nIf you had bad intentions, you wouldn't have found the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000019$</font>\nfor me..."
set key[id=831174302000227] name "I'll unlock <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000020$</font> for you.\nBut... \
    please look around quickly and come back out."
set key[id=831174302000228] name "I'll unlock <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000020$</font> for you.\nBut... \
    please look around quickly and come back out."
set key[id=831174302000229] name "You're out!"
set key[id=831174302000230] name "(Thank you for opening the warehouse.)"
set key[id=831174302000231] name "Don't mention it. You helped me first, $MyPCName$.\nBut this stays a secret \
    between $MyPCName$ and me."
set key[id=831174302000442] name "They say the dead tell no tales...\nBut this notebook you found may be the key \
    to uncovering the truth hidden behind\nthe armory theft, and behind $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s death."
set key[id=831174302000443] name "This notebook bearing the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Barota Company \
    logo</font>...!!\nIf we can find its owner... we might learn something new."
set key[id=831174302000444] name "$MyPCName$!\nCould you take this notebook to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Barota \
    Company</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000139$</font>\nand find out <font color=\"#ffd200\">who the \
    notebook belongs to</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000445] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302000446] name "(Say you left $item:30000114$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302000447] name "(Say you forgot where to go.)"
set key[id=831174302000448] name "I understand you're shaken by $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s death... but\nbe \
    careful not to make mistakes from here on."
set key[id=831174302000449] name "You seem flustered.\nTake another look in your bag."
set key[id=831174302000450] name "Your bag looks quite heavy.\nHow about tidying it up before you leave?"
set key[id=831174302000451] name "Head to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Barota Company</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000139$</font>."
set key[id=831174302000452] name "Oh... $MyPCName$...?\nDon't you remember me? We met at $map:63000001$... "
set key[id=831174302000453] name "(Say you remember.)"
set key[id=831174302000454] name "(Say you don't remember.)"
set key[id=831174302000455] name "With the earthquake cutting off the roads and the Levee cancelled,\nI thought \
    I'd never see anyone from Maple Island again...\nIt's really nice to see you here."
set key[id=831174302000456] name "I'd like to invite you in and talk more, but as you can see, I've got \
    another\nunwelcome visitor at the moment and I'm in a bit of a bind...\nBy the way, what brings you here?"
set key[id=831174302000457] name "(Hand over the notebook and ask whose it is.)"
set key[id=831174302000458] name "Ah... this is <font color=\"#ffd200\">issued only to merchants of the Barota \
    Company</font>, but...\nI need to look at it more closely. Please give me some time."
set key[id=831174302000459] name "Oh, I must have mistaken you for someone else. Heh heh.\nBut what brings you \
    here?"
set key[id=831174302000460] name "(Hand over the notebook and ask whose it is.)"
set key[id=831174302000461] name "Hmm... this looks like the notebook of <font color=\"#ffd200\">our company head \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s notebook</font>.\nWe've been searching for him since he vanished without a word \
    several days ago...\nHmm... oh... !!!"
set key[id=831174302000462] name "(Ask why he's so surprised.)"
set key[id=831174302000463] name "No way...\nThis can't be!"
set key[id=831174302000464] name "Wh-what's wrong... "
set key[id=831174302000465] name "(Ask for the $item:30000114$.)"
set key[id=831174302000466] name "(Ask if he trusts $npc:11000526[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302000467] name "Oh no... that's... um...\nSigh... "
set key[id=831174302000468] name "You took it with you a moment ago... "
set key[id=831174302000469] name "Your bag looks heavier than our peddlers' bundles, $MyPCName$.\nHow about \
    tidying it up first?"
set key[id=831174302000470] name "Well... that's... he's still\nour company head, after all... "
set key[id=831174302000471] name "Hey!\nMind if I take a look at that notebook?"
set key[id=831174302000472] name "(Hand over the notebook.)"
set key[id=831174302000473] name "You said the notebook belongs to $npc:11000526[gender:0]$, the head of the \
    Barota Company, right? Heh.\nNow I see why $npcName:11000097[gender:0]$ got flustered."
set key[id=831174302000474] name "The storage inventory list of the Barota Company warehouse includes\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000046$</font>, which is banned from trade."
set key[id=831174302000475] name "He was shouting for solid proof that the Barota Company had circulated\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000046$</font>... heh heh... "
set key[id=831174302000476] name "$npcName:11000097[gender:0]$ seems desperate to deny it... hmph.\nBut if <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000046$</font> really turns up among the goods the Barota Company is\nholding, as \
    recorded in this notebook, there's no surer proof."
set key[id=831174302000477] name "$MyPCName$.\nCould you check whether there's any <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000046$</font> in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Barota Company's\ngoods \
    crates</font>?\nIf I go myself, they might claim I fabricated the evidence, heh heh."
set key[id=831174302000478] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">If you follow this road down, at the very end there's a \
    warehouse building\nwhere the Barota Company's crates are piled up</font>. Start looking there."
set key[id=831174302000479] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">If you follow this road down, at the very end there's a \
    warehouse building\nwhere the Barota Company's crates are piled up</font>. Start looking there."
set key[id=831174302000480] name "Well?\nWas there really any $item:20000046$ among the Barota Company's goods?"
set key[id=831174302000481] name "(Hand over the $item:20000046$.)"
set key[id=831174302000482] name "Now this is truly solid evidence.\nHey, $npcName:11000097[gender:0]$!\nYou see \
    the $item:20000046$ this friend found, right?"
set key[id=831174302000483] name "So stop making excuses about being wronged or innocent."
set key[id=831174302000484] name "With hard evidence in hand, we've got grounds to search the entire Barota \
    Company.\nAnd you showed up with this notebook just at the right time... what timing.\nWhich is why... I have \
    one more favor to ask."
set key[id=831174302000485] name "Go straight to $map:02000153$ in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000100$</font>,\ndeliver this notebook to Captain <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000044[gender:0]$</font>, and request search support.\nWe also need to find and press \
    the Barota Company head, a man named Raymon..."
set key[id=831174302000486] name "And don't forget to say it's a report from me, $npc:11000208[gender:0]$.\nIf you \
    don't make that clear, someone might steal\nthe credit from me."
set key[id=831174302000487] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302000488] name "(Say you left $item:30000114$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302000489] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302000490] name "Sigh... this isn't just any ordinary notebook.\nIt might be the evidence that \
    opens my road to promotion, so take good care of it."
set key[id=831174302000491] name "You stuffed it into your bag a moment ago.\nSearch your bag."
set key[id=831174302000492] name "How shabby... why are you lugging around so much stuff?\nTidy up your bag."
set key[id=831174302000493] name "Sigh... I'm getting anxious... can you really find your way to \
    $map:02000100$?\nDon't waste time getting lost, hurry up."
set key[id=831174302000494] name "Welcome. I am <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katvan</font>, captain of Dark Wind."
set key[id=831174302000495] name "(Show Raymon's notebook and relay $npc:11000208[gender:0]$'s request for \
    support.)"
set key[id=831174302000496] name "Anyway, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000526[gender:0]$</font>...\nThe amount \
    of illegal goods traded in the market has oddly been growing lately,\nand it turns out Barota Company head \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000526[gender:0]$</font> was at the center of it."
set key[id=831174302000503] name "The pipeline that pumps crude oil out of the ground has a problem.\nParts of the \
    pipeline have rusted, and oil is leaking out\nhere and there."
set key[id=831174302000504] name "If we leave it like this, never mind soil contamination, the crude oil supply \
    will shrink,\nand the industry, distribution, and even daily life of $map:02000100$ and the \
    surrounding\nregion will be seriously inconvenienced."
set key[id=831174302000505] name "We need to find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">rusty pipes</font> as soon as \
    possible, scrub off the rust, and repair them,\nbut this is a real mess...  "
set key[id=831174302000506] name "We need to find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">rusty pipes</font> as soon as \
    possible, scrub off the rust, and repair them,\nbut this is a real mess...  "
set key[id=831174302000507] name "With you lending a hand, it's a bit better.\nThanks for the hard work, I mean \
    it."
set key[id=831174302000508] name "Hmm... listen carefully to what I say from now on!\nDo you remember what I said \
    when I got the search permit for the Barota Company?\nI said that as $map:02000100$ develops rapidly, \
    organizations and powers of all kinds\nare tangled together in a complex web."
set key[id=831174302000509] name "The Blackstar Society is one of the organizations caught in that web.\nWithout \
    solid proof, Dark Wind can't officially investigate the Blackstar Society\nrecklessly. So here's the thing... \
    "
set key[id=831174302000510] name "I'd like you, $MyPCName$, to infiltrate the Blackstar Society as a spy, quietly \
    find out whether\nthey are really connected to $npc:11000526[gender:0]$, and slip back out.\nNo one must \
    know."
set key[id=831174302000511] name "(Ask how to infiltrate the Blackstar Society.)"
set key[id=831174302000512] name "First, find your way to their base and win their trust as a member.\nHead to \
    $map:02000138$.\nThere's a rumor that the Blackstar boss's hideout is somewhere there, so ask\naround \
    $map:02000138$ to find it."
set key[id=831174302000513] name "Head to $map:02000138$.\nThere's a rumor that the Blackstar boss's hideout is \
    somewhere there, so ask\naround $map:02000138$ to find it."
set key[id=831174302000514] name "Who are you?\nWhat are you hanging around here for?"
set key[id=831174302000515] name "(Say you're looking for the Blackstar boss's hideout.)"
set key[id=831174302000516] name "Ha, seriously. The Blackstar boss's hideout?\nWhat would a small fry like you \
    want there?"
set key[id=831174302000517] name "(Say you want to become a Blackstar member.)"
set key[id=831174302000518] name "Huh? A Blackstar member?\nHa ha ha ha! This guy's dream is ridiculous, ha ha ha \
    ha ha. "
set key[id=831174302000519] name "Since I got something from you... it's my turn to give back, right?\nYou said \
    you want to become a Blackstar member?"
set key[id=831174302000520] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302000521] name "Then go find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000212[gender:0]$</font>, who runs \
    the arcade called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000149$</font>\nowned by the Blackstar Society, and ask him \
    to recommend you as a member.\nTo become a member, you absolutely need another member's recommendation."
set key[id=831174302000522] name "He probably won't easily recommend someone he's never met.\nWhether you beg or \
    threaten, it's up to you, so figure it out."
set key[id=831174302000523] name "(Ask where $map:02000149$ is.)"
set key[id=831174302000524] name "Keep going down the alley market below here, and you'll find a small, run-down \
    building with its shutter down.\nIt looks like an empty old building from outside, but inside... heh heh \
    heh.\nGo there and ask $npc:11000212[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302000525] name "Keep going down the alley market below here, and you'll find a small, run-down \
    building with its shutter down.\nIt looks like an empty old building from outside, but inside... heh heh \
    heh.\nGo there and ask $npc:11000212[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302000526] name "I've never seen you before.\nHow did you find this place?"
set key[id=831174302000527] name "(Ask him to recommend you as a Blackstar member.)"
set key[id=831174302000528] name "What? What kind of nonsense is this?\nIf you're not here to play games, get out, \
    out!"
set key[id=831174302000529] name "Why are you still standing there?\nYou're ruining my business!"
set key[id=831174302000530] name "(Say you won't leave him alone unless he recommends you.)"
set key[id=831174302000531] name "This guy is totally unreasonable!\nGo ahead and try something! "
set key[id=831174302000532] name "This guy is totally unreasonable!\nGo ahead and try something! "
set key[id=831174302000533] name "Stop, stop it! You'll wreck my business for the whole day!\nWhat on earth is \
    your reason for wanting to join the Blackstar Society?"
set key[id=831174302000534] name "(Say you have nothing better to do.)"
set key[id=831174302000535] name "(Say it looks cool.)"
set key[id=831174302000536] name "(Say you feel instinctively drawn to it.)"
set key[id=831174302000537] name "This is ridiculous.\nYou seem to think the Blackstar Society is some kind of \
    pastime...\nYou'll only come to your senses once you taste what the real Blackstar is like."
set key[id=831174302000538] name "Fine, I'll recommend you as a Blackstar member as you wish.\nBut that's only the \
    beginning.\nTo become a real member, you must pass the test of the godfather $npc:11000251[gender:0]$.\nIf you \
    fail that test... heh heh... then there's only death."
set key[id=831174302000539] name "A hot-headed fool like you passing that test... heh.\nAnyway, this is the path \
    you chose, so don't blame me."
set key[id=831174302000540] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Code Black 365</font>\nMemorize it. It's the password by \
    which I recommend you as a Blackstar member."
set key[id=831174302000541] name "When you leave here, <font color=\"#ffd200\">move ten squares \
    southeast</font>.\nThen <font color=\"#ffd200\">move eleven squares northeast</font>, and you'll be standing \
    in front of a small iron door.\nThat door is the entrance leading to\nthe $map:02000156$ of the Blackstar \
    godfather $npc:11000251[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302000542] name "Say the password I gave you, <font color=\"#ffd200\">Code Black 365</font>, to \
    $npc:11000251[gender:0]$.\nThen... you'll take the test to become a Blackstar member... "
set key[id=831174302000543] name "Say the password I gave you, <font color=\"#ffd200\">Code Black 365</font>, to \
    $npc:11000251[gender:0]$.\nThen... you'll take the test to become a Blackstar member... "
set key[id=831174302000544] name "Who goes there."
set key[id=831174302000545] name "(Say <font color=\"#ffd200\">Code Black 365</font>.)"
set key[id=831174302000546] name "Hmm...\nSomeone recommended by $npc:11000212[gender:0]$...?"
set key[id=831174302000547] name "Ah, ahem.\nAnyway, you're saying you're looking for the Blackstar base to become \
    a member?"
set key[id=831174302000548] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302000549] name "Fine! I'll tell you how to get to the Blackstar base...\nBut... ! By this \
    alley's rule of giving back what you receive, there's a condition."
set key[id=831174302000550] name "(Ask what the condition is.)"
set key[id=831174302000551] name "You're more straightforward than you look.\nSome time ago, my $item:20000015$ \
    that I hid in a place only I know\nwent missing."
set key[id=831174302000552] name "Those <font color=\"#ffd200\">monsters in this alley</font> must have swiped \
    it!\nShake them down and find my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000015$</font>."
set key[id=831174302000553] name "Shake down those <font color=\"#ffd200\">monsters in this alley</font> and find \
    my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000015$</font>."
set key[id=831174302000554] name "I knew it! It was them! Now I just need to sneak-sell this, and with the \
    money\nI can go back to the arcade. "
set key[id=831174302000555] name "If what Eve says is true, Lennon is slipping in and out\nof Dark Wind's wanted \
    net as if it were his own home...\nSetting aside my worry for Eve, my pride simply won't allow this."
set key[id=831174302000556] name "Would you go to $npc:11000215[gender:0]$ outside and carry out the mission to \
    strengthen the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted order together?\nEven the reserve agents have been dispatched \
    to clean up after the Kerning City raid.\nRight now you're the only one I can ask."
set key[id=831174302000557] name "Go to $npc:11000215[gender:0]$ and tell him to strengthen\nthe \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted order."
set key[id=831174302000558] name "The captain told you to strengthen the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted order?\nI \
    thought as much."
set key[id=831174302000559] name "How did you know?"
set key[id=831174302000560] name "Whenever news of Miss $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ reaches him, his resentment and \
    anger toward $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ grow even stronger.\nWell... still, like the captain said,\nwe can't let \
    our pride stand for Lennon\nexploiting the gaps in Dark Wind's wanted net."
set key[id=831174302000561] name "Hmm... First I'll review what gaps there were in the wanted net.\n$MyPCName$, \
    please post <font color=\"#ffd200\">wanted flyers</font> on the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dark Wind \
    Bulletin</font> in each district.\n"
set key[id=831174302000562] name "Did you forget something?"
set key[id=831174302000563] name "I left $item:30000038$ behind."
set key[id=831174302000564] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302000565] name "Ah, I see. Here you go.\nPlease be careful not to lose it again."
set key[id=831174302000566] name "You definitely took it with you a moment ago...\nPlease check your bag again."
set key[id=831174302000567] name "Your bag looks too heavy...\nWhy don't you tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=831174302000568] name "Ah... yes, it happens to me sometimes too."
set key[id=831174302000569] name "Found the $npc:11000343$ in $map:02000138$."
set key[id=831174302000570] name "Let's post the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted flyer on the bulletin board."
set key[id=831174302000571] name "Posted the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted flyer on the bulletin board. Let's \
    find the next bulletin board."
set key[id=831174302000572] name "Hm? What are you trying to post on the wanted board?"
set key[id=831174302000573] name "(Show the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted flyer.)"
set key[id=831174302000574] name "Ah... it's the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted flyer."
set key[id=831174302000575] name "I really hate that I was in Dark Wind with $npc:11000064[gender:0]$.\nHow could \
    he cause such a huge incident... Honestly... "
set key[id=831174302000576] name "I really hate that I was in Dark Wind with $npc:11000064[gender:0]$.\nHow could \
    he cause such a huge incident... Honestly... "
set key[id=831174302000577] name "Found the $npc:11000343$ in $map:02000135$."
set key[id=831174302000578] name "Let's post the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted flyer on the bulletin board."
set key[id=831174302000579] name "Posted the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted flyer on the bulletin board. Let's \
    find the next bulletin board."
set key[id=831174302000580] name "Found the $npc:11000343$ in $map:02000146$."
set key[id=831174302000581] name "Let's post the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted flyer on the bulletin board."
set key[id=831174302000582] name "Posted the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted flyer on the bulletin board. Let's \
    find the next bulletin board."
set key[id=831174302000583] name "This is the most dangerous place in all of Maple World...\nHow did you get all \
    the way here?"
set key[id=831174302000584] name "I came to post the $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ wanted flyer."
set key[id=831174302000585] name "I see.\nYou must have had a hard time searching for the $npc:11000343$."
set key[id=831174302000626] name "Stop bothering me!\nBecause of you I can't do any business right now!\nIf I told \
    you what I saw, you'd have to make up for the goods I could have sold in that time...\nthen maybe. "
set key[id=831174302000627] name "I'll do anything."
set key[id=831174302000628] name "Is that so?\nThen go to $map:02000136$ and get a bulk order from \
    $npc:11000220[gender:0]$ for the materials\nneeded to build the Rockefeller Tower."
set key[id=831174302000629] name "Go to $map:02000136$ and get a bulk order from $npc:11000220[gender:0]$ for the \
    materials\nneeded to build the Rockefeller Tower."
set key[id=831174302000630] name "Hm? Wh-what is it?\nIf it's not urgent, come back later. I'm way too busy right \
    now."
set key[id=831174302000631] name "Oh, but you said you came looking for me earlier, right?\nWhat brings you here?"
set key[id=831174302000632] name "I came to sell construction materials."
set key[id=831174302000633] name "Hm? You don't look like a merchant... but it is about time to buy \
    materials.\nSo, what do I get if I order materials from you?"
set key[id=831174302000634] name "I'll give you the materials at half price."
set key[id=831174302000635] name "I'll add half more on top of the order as a bonus."
set key[id=831174302000636] name "I'll provide good quality materials to match a reasonable price."
set key[id=831174302000637] name "No, no, that's not a benefit.\nHow could I trust the quality of materials sold \
    at half price?"
set key[id=831174302000638] name "I'll add half more on top of the order as a bonus."
set key[id=831174302000639] name "I'll provide good quality materials to match a reasonable price."
set key[id=831174302000640] name "No, no, that's not a benefit.\nStoring construction materials properly matters, \
    and if I take in too much at once,\nI'll just have more to worry about."
set key[id=831174302000641] name "I'll give you the materials at half price."
set key[id=831174302000642] name "I'll provide good quality materials to match a reasonable price."
set key[id=831174302000643] name "Hmm... You're a very honest fellow.\nYou helped me out earlier, so as thanks \
    I'll order construction materials from you.\nHere, I'll give you an order form listing the materials I need. \
    Please deliver it."
set key[id=831174302000644] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302000645] name "I left $item:30000175$ behind."
set key[id=831174302000646] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302000647] name "What's wrong with you, young one?\nTake better care of it this time."
set key[id=831174302000648] name "I definitely saw you put it in your bag a moment ago.\nTake another look in your \
    bag."
set key[id=831174302000649] name "Don't your shoulders hurt? Your bag looks heavy...\nWhy not tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=831174302000650] name "A young fellow like you already... tsk tsk tsk... "
set key[id=831174302000651] name "Really? You got an order?"
set key[id=831174302000652] name "(Hand over $item:30000175$.)"
set key[id=831174302000653] name "Oho. This is an unexpected harvest.\nHm hm. Thank you!"
set key[id=831174302000778] name "If <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font> hadn't shattered the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Blue Rappenta</font> here back then,\nthat <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Gate</font> \
    would never have opened,\nand we wouldn't be giving our lives every day to this endless war. "
set key[id=831174302000779] name "But... what's done is done...\nEvery day hundreds of monsters break through the \
    barrier with the power of darkness\nand cross over from the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=831174302000780] name "Lately the shadow energy crossing over from the Land of Darkness has grown so \
    strong\nthat the Guardians stationed here can barely hold them all back.\nIf you don't mind, $MyPCName$, would \
    you lend us a hand for a while? "
set key[id=831174302000781] name "Lately the shadow energy crossing over from the Land of Darkness has grown so \
    strong\nthat the Guardians stationed here can barely hold them all back.\nIf you don't mind, $MyPCName$, would \
    you lend us a hand for a while? "
set key[id=831174302000782] name "You really are skilled.\nThe sight of you, $MyPCName$, rampaging among those \
    ferocious monsters\nleft all the Guardians spellbound."
set key[id=831174302000783] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, the Guardians' morale has risen and you've been\na \
    great help. Thank you so much."
set key[id=831174302000784] name "You there! Over here!\nThere's no time for long talk! First, I need your help!"
set key[id=831174302000785] name "Go straight to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000026$</font> right now and\nget \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000016$</font> from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000122[gender:0]$</font>!\nIf you don't hurry, all the wounded soldiers lying here \
    will die!"
set key[id=831174302000786] name "Go straight to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000026$</font> right now and\nget \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000016$</font> from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000122[gender:0]$</font>!\nIf you don't hurry, all the wounded soldiers lying here \
    will die!"
set key[id=831174302000787] name "What's going on that you came running in such a hurry?\nHas something terrible \
    happened outside?"
set key[id=831174302000788] name "I need $item:20000016$."
set key[id=831174302000789] name "The $item:20000016$ that $npc:11000261[gender:0]$ took not long ago\nwas \
    everything I had made!\nHas the medicine already run out?"
set key[id=831174302000790] name "I did sense the shadow energy growing stronger...\nIt seems the potency of the \
    shadow poison is affected along with it."
set key[id=831174302000791] name "To make more medicine in a hurry, I need <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000045$</font>,\nbut the mushroom field in front of the lab is contaminated with \
    shadow poison and can't be approached.\n$item:20000045$ is still growing here and there in \
    $map:02000146$,\nbut there are so many monsters that came through the Shadow Gate..."
set key[id=831174302000792] name "If you can just bring me <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000045$</font>,\nI can \
    make the medicine with the mixer in the back.\nCan you gather <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000045$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000793] name "If you can just bring me <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000045$</font>,\nI can \
    make the medicine with the mixer in the back.\nCan you gather <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000045$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000794] name "Ah, you're back.\nLet me check the condition of the $item:20000045$ first."
set key[id=831174302000795] name "Hmm... This should be enough to make the medicine we need.\nHere, take it."
set key[id=831174302000796] name "Now, there's no time, so put what you've sorted into the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">mixer</font> and start it.\nThe amount of medicine made will depend on the condition of the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000045$</font>."
set key[id=831174302000797] name "Now, there's no time, so put what you've sorted into the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">mixer</font> and start it.\nThe amount of medicine made will depend on the condition of the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000045$</font>."
set key[id=831174302000798] name "Why are you so late? Where's the medicine?"
set key[id=831174302000799] name "(Hand over $item:20000016$.)"
set key[id=831174302000800] name "Oh, you brought it.\nIf you'd been any later, all the wounded soldiers here \
    would have lost their lives."
set key[id=831174302000801] name "$MyPCName$, you should watch out for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">shadow \
    poison</font> too.\nIf you stand on the <font color=\"#ffd200\">ground around that Shadow Gate</font>, the \
    effects of the shadow poison slowly\nspread through your whole body and you could lose your strength to fight, \
    even your life."
set key[id=831174302000802] name "But if you take this <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000016$</font>, you'll be \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">immune</font> to the shadow poison for a while.\nYou may need it too, so take one with \
    you."
set key[id=831174302000803] name "The shadow energy crossing over from the Land of Darkness keeps getting \
    stronger.\nMages, alchemists, and even the latest science researchers put their heads together\nand built a \
    barrier, but..."
set key[id=831174302000804] name "As the days pass, more and more monsters keep coming from the Land of \
    Darkness.\nThe most urgent matter is finding where they get the power\nto break through the barrier like \
    this."
set key[id=831174302000805] name "The specialist researchers gathered at $map:02000026$ are each looking for a \
    way\nto uncover that source in their own manner.\n$npc:11000122[gender:0]$ and I decided to analyze the DNA of \
    those monsters."
set key[id=831174302000806] name "I asked the Guardians to collect DNA from the\nmonsters that came over from the \
    Land of Darkness...\nbut with the shadow energy growing stronger, it seems just holding them back\nis already \
    more than they can handle. "
set key[id=831174302000807] name "So, here's the thing...\n$MyPCName$,\n could you collect the DNA of the monsters \
    around that Shadow Gate for us?"
set key[id=831174302000808] name "$MyPCName$,\ncould you collect the DNA of the monsters around that Shadow Gate \
    for us?"
set key[id=831174302000809] name "Oh! If only I'd met you sooner, the research would have gone so much \
    faster...\nThank you so much!"
set key[id=831174302000810] name "$MyPCName$. Come over here for a moment."
set key[id=831174302000812] name "Hm. Just as I expected.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">You look weak...</font> but \
    your eyes show promise.\nIt's like looking at myself back when I was a squire."
set key[id=831174302000813] name "(It feels strange being stared at like that... I start to say it, but stop.)"
set key[id=831174302000814] name "Well, I'll keep quiet about a past you needn't know.\nI've heard your story from \
    the Guardians and the researchers here.\nThey say your fighting skills are outstanding."
set key[id=831174302000815] name "Let me get to the point.\nAs the commander in charge of $map:02000146$, I want \
    to entrust a greater mission\nto someone with your potential. To that end, I'd like to run a few tests first."
set key[id=831174302000820] name "Outwardly I command the Guardians here,\nbut in truth I'm carrying out the \
    mission to <font color=\"#ffd200\">recover the shattered $item:30000058$</font>."
set key[id=831174302000821] name "Do you mean the Blue Rappenta that $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ destroyed?"
set key[id=831174302000822] name "Correct. You're quicker than you look.\nWhen the Blue Rappenta was destroyed, it \
    is presumed to have shattered into tens of millions of fragments\nand scattered all over Maple World, even to \
    the sealed Land of Darkness."
set key[id=831174302000823] name "If we recover all the fragments of the Blue Rappenta, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000075[gender:1]$ $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$</font>'s\nsacred power can <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">restore the shattered Blue Rappenta</font>.\nThen the order of space will be set right, the \
    Land of Darkness will be sealed again,\nand all those forces of darkness that flooded into this world can be \
    swept away."
set key[id=831174302000824] name "But not long ago, a <font color=\"#ffd200\">spy disguised as a Dark Wind \
    agent</font> infiltrated all the way\ninto the command post and stole the $item:30000058$ and fled.\nThey must \
    have headed for the area around the Shadow Gate that connects to\nthe Land of Darkness, to get back there."
set key[id=831174302000825] name "Every Dark Wind agent has a secret code name that begins with <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Steelton</font>.\nEven if they're perfectly\ndisguised as Dark Wind on the outside,\nasking \
    for their secret code name will expose them right away. "
set key[id=831174302000830] name "You did great work this time.\nThanks to you, the Guardians and the Lumina \
    Liberation Army, who could have clashed from their different positions,\ngot a chance to understand each other \
    and rebuild trust."
set key[id=831174302000831] name "Not only this time, but all the effort you've put in as a member of the \
    Guardians...\nI reported everything in detail to $npcName:11000075[gender:1]$ \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$,\nand the Empress herself says she wants to meet you in person."
set key[id=831174302000832] name "Go to $map:02000001$ right now and have an audience with \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$.\nI've already told $npcName:11000119[gender:0]$, so you'll get a warm welcome."
set key[id=831174302000833] name "Go to $map:02000001$ right now and have an audience with \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$.\nI've already told $npcName:11000119[gender:0]$, so you'll get a warm welcome."
set key[id=831174302000834] name "$MyPCName$! It's been a while.\nOr should I say, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Hero of Pekadiv</font> now?"
set key[id=831174302000836] name "I'd love to catch up properly, but $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ is waiting for \
    you, so \nhead to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000025$</font> and greet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000075[gender:1]$ $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$</font>\nwith proper respect."
set key[id=831174302000837] name "I'd love to catch up properly, but $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ is waiting for \
    you, so \nhead to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000025$</font> and greet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000075[gender:1]$ $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$</font>\nwith proper respect."
set key[id=831174302000838] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$.\nI've heard plenty about your deeds in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Pekadiv</font>. Even among the Guardians,\n$MyPCName$, your fame is remarkable. \nThat's why \
    I so wanted to meet you. I wanted to thank in person the\nhero who has worked for the peace of Maple World."
set key[id=831174302000841] name "$MyPCName$, please lend even greater strength to the Guardians from now on.\nFor \
    this world, I ask you <font color=\"#ffd200\">in the name of the Empress</font>."
set key[id=831174302000842] name "$MyPCName$, please lend even greater strength from now on.\nFor this world, I \
    ask you <font color=\"#ffd200\">in the name of the Empress</font>."
set key[id=831174302000843] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nI am $npc:11000601[gender:1]$, attendant to \
    $npcName:11000075[gender:1]$ $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302000844] name "You've already seen the truth of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of \
    Darkness</font> and the Shadow Legion's tyranny firsthand, but\nwith the <font color=\"#ffd200\">destruction \
    of the Blue Lapenta</font>, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">barrier of space has collapsed</font>.\nThe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">barriers of life and time are being held</font> by the power of the other two Lapentas, \
    yet\nthe <font color=\"#ffd200\">shadow energy blowing from the Land of Darkness grows ever stronger</font>."
set key[id=831174302000845] name "For Maple World to return to a peaceful and stable world, it's important to \
    weaken the shadow energy\nand keep the Demon Lord's power from fully recovering, but even more than \
    that...\nwe must <font color=\"#ffd200\">recover all the scattered Blue Lapenta fragments, restore their \
    power, and \nrestore the barrier of space</font>."
set key[id=831174302000846] name "As a Guardian whom $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ trusts, $MyPCName$, please help \
    with\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">collecting the fragments so the Blue Lapenta can be restored</font>."
set key[id=831174302000847] name "$MyPCName$!\nIf you're not busy, go to $map:02000065$ and \
    see\n$npcTitle:11000074[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302000848] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302000849] name "Well... All I was told was to recommend a trustworthy friend who won't draw \
    attention... \nIt seems it's not yet a matter I can share the details of.\nI don't know what's going on,\nbut \
    I'd like you to go and help $npcTitle:11000074[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302000850] name "Go to $map:02000065$, see $npcTitle:11000074[gender:0]$ and\nfollow his \
    instructions.\nI don't know the details yet, but it seems to be quite important."
set key[id=831174302000851] name "Are you the friend $npcTitle:11000119[gender:0]$ sent?"
set key[id=831174302000852] name "Yes."
set key[id=831174302000853] name "What's your name?"
set key[id=831174302000854] name "I tell him my name."
set key[id=831174302000855] name "$MyPCName$... A fine name.\nI am <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcTitle:11000074[gender:0]$, Karl Bidblaim</font>. I expect we'll see each other often."
set key[id=831174302000856] name "$npc:11000119[gender:0]$ talks about you now and then. \nHe says you're a friend \
    worth keeping an eye on.\nI hear you were the one who found the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000174$</font> \
    in the last <font color=\"#ffd200\">Cliff Cave battle</font>, too? "
set key[id=831174302000857] name "I ask whether the $item:30000174$ is a royal item."
set key[id=831174302000858] name "That... I'll tell you later... when the time comes.\nFirst, though, will you do \
    me a favor?"
set key[id=831174302000859] name "Go ahead, I'm listening."
set key[id=831174302000860] name "There is a painting I privately asked the portraitist $npc:11000530[gender:0]$ \
    to make.\nWould you go to $map:02000218$ and pick it up for me...?"
set key[id=831174302000861] name "There is a painting I privately asked the portraitist $npc:11000530[gender:0]$ \
    to make.\nWould you go to $map:02000218$ and pick it up for me...?"
set key[id=831174302000862] name "Welcome.\nWhat brings you here?"
set key[id=831174302000863] name "I'm here to pick up the painting $npc:11000074[gender:0]$ asked for."
set key[id=831174302000864] name "Ah... I remember already delivering that..."
set key[id=831174302000865] name "Ah... $npc:11000074[gender:0]$ asked me to work on it in secret, so as soon as I \
    finished the painting\nI sent it straight to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000190$</font>."
set key[id=831174302000866] name "Where is $map:02000190$?"
set key[id=831174302000867] name "It's in $map:02000119$.\nThere was a time when everyone knew <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000190$</font>.\nThe Royal Chancellor, and all his family, were respected and loved \
    by everyone.\nIf only that incident hadn't happened..."
set key[id=831174302000868] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302000869] name "Sigh... Never mind.\nIt's nothing pleasant, and what good is dredging up the \
    past?\nAnyway, the painting the Chancellor asked for should be at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000190$</font>."
set key[id=831174302000870] name "The painting the Chancellor asked for should be at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000190$</font>."
set key[id=831174302000871] name "What... brings you here?"
set key[id=831174302000872] name "I'm here to pick up the painting delivered from $map:02000218$."
set key[id=831174302000873] name "Why do you want that painting, $MyPCName$..."
set key[id=831174302000874] name "$npc:11000074[gender:0]$ told me to pick up the painting."
set key[id=831174302000875] name "Father did...?\nHow strange... I thought he'd sent my portrait as a birthday \
    present again\ninstead of coming in person... Maybe it wasn't a gift...\nBut... why my face...? Could it \
    be...?"
set key[id=831174302000876] name "Stop muttering to yourself and explain it so I can understand."
set key[id=831174302000877] name "Ah, it can't be. It can't possibly be.\nIt's nothing."
set key[id=831174302000878] name "I don't know why Father asked for this portrait... but I'm sure he has his \
    reasons... \nHere, this is the painting delivered from $map:02000218$. Please give it to Father.\nAnd...  "
set key[id=831174302000879] name "I ask whether there's anything else she wants me to do."
set key[id=831174302000880] name "No, never mind.\nThen... take care on your way."
set key[id=831174302000881] name "Back already? Or... is there something you forgot to say...?"
set key[id=831174302000882] name "I say I left the $item:30000182$ behind."
set key[id=831174302000883] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302000884] name "Ah... I see... \nI should have looked after it better, but I'm so distracted... \
    Here you are."
set key[id=831174302000885] name "Ah... I'm sure you took it with you... \nCould it be in your bag?"
set key[id=831174302000886] name "Your bag looks too heavy...\nWhy don't you tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=831174302000887] name "Just give the $item:30000182$ to my father.\nThere's nothing else I need... "
set key[id=831174302000888] name "Ah... it's you... "
set key[id=831174302000889] name "I hand over the $item:30000182$."
set key[id=831174302000890] name "Haa... \nSo it really was... that child... "
set key[id=831174302000891] name "I ask who that child is."
set key[id=831174302000892] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ Bidblaim</font>... \nMy \
    daughter, whom I failed to protect long ago..."
set key[id=831174302000893] name "The $item:30000174$ you found in $map:02000238$ is the crest of the Bidblaim \
    family...\nOn a hunch, I listened to a soldier's account of the red cloak and had \
    $npc:11000530[gender:0]$\nsketch it... and it looked exactly like <font color=\"#ffd200\">Elmin</font>... "
set key[id=831174302000894] name "Without a doubt... it was <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000057[gender:1]$</font>... After all this time... to come back like this...\nMust I \
    become a cruel father once again... "
set key[id=831174302000895] name "It's all... my fault... \nThe only way left is to end this tragedy... with my \
    own hands... "
set key[id=831174302000896] name "Please deliver this letter to $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302000897] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302000898] name "I say I left the $item:30000033$ behind."
set key[id=831174302000899] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302000900] name "Haa... I see... Here, take it."
set key[id=831174302000901] name "Hmm... Have you checked your bag properly?"
set key[id=831174302000902] name "Your bag is full.\nHow about tidying it up first?"
set key[id=831174302000903] name "Deliver the $item:30000033$ to $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302000904] name "$MyPCName$! \nYou look gloomy. Has something happened?"
set key[id=831174302000905] name "I deliver $npc:11000074[gender:0]$'s letter."
set key[id=831174302000906] name "Oh no... how could this... \nIf it weren't for me that day, the Chancellor could \
    have protected <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000057[gender:1]$</font>..."
set key[id=831174302000907] name "I ask what day that was."
set key[id=831174302000908] name "Not long after the Blue Lapenta shattered... the Demon Lord's minions from the \
    Land of Darkness\nraided the palace.\nThe Chancellor protected me then. All the while he watched little \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$\nscreaming as the Demon Lord's minions dragged her away... "
set key[id=831174302000909] name "I owe a great debt to the Chancellor, and to the whole Bidblaim family.\nA debt \
    I can neither repay nor erase...\nIt feels as if a huge, heavy stone is pressing on my heart. And yet\nit \
    surely is nothing compared with the Chancellor's pain. "
set key[id=831174302000910] name "And now the Chancellor is about to drive a knife into a wound that hasn't even \
    healed.\nFor this world... and for me... he has resolved to sacrifice himself and \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$\nonce again...\nNo, I can't allow it. I can't let that happen."
set key[id=831174302000911] name "Even though $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ is under the control of the shadow energy \
    now,\nthere must be a way to bring her back to us. We have to find it!"
set key[id=831174302001363] name "I've got nothing more to say. Is there something else you want to know?"
set key[id=831174302001364] name "(Ask where $npc:11000170[gender:0]$ got the iron ore.)"
set key[id=831174302001365] name "I don't know that either.\nIron ore is scarce these days, so when I heard \
    someone was selling it cheap,\nI just bought it up in a rush."
set key[id=831174302001366] name "Come to think of it, it is strange.\nUnless it was <font color=\"#ffd200\">made \
    by melting down finished weapons</font>...\nIt shouldn't have been easy to get that much iron ore these \
    days..."
set key[id=831174302001367] name "Go ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000170[gender:0]$</font> in person."
set key[id=831174302001368] name "(Ask where you can find $npc:11000170[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302001369] name "I don't know that either.\nWhen he left, he said he was going to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000140$</font>."
set key[id=831174302001370] name "Go ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000170[gender:0]$</font> in person."
set key[id=831174302001371] name "Ah, it's $MyPCName$.\nIs there something I can help you with?"
set key[id=831174302001372] name "(Ask if $npc:11000170[gender:0]$ has been here.)"
set key[id=831174302001373] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000170[gender:0]$</font>...\nAh, you mean that \
    blond young peddler!\nI was keeping a peddler's notebook he'd lost, and he came to pick it up."
set key[id=831174302001374] name "(Ask where $npc:11000170[gender:0]$ went.)"
set key[id=831174302001375] name "Ah... I'm not sure about that, but I remember there was the address of \
    the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000092$ management residence</font> written on the back of the notebook. "
set key[id=831174302001376] name "Hey~ yo~!\nDon't get hurt chasing empty swagger~\nJust turn around and go home \
    in one step~"
set key[id=831174302001377] name "(Say you just want to know the entrance of $map:02000141$.)"
set key[id=831174302001378] name "Ah~ this guy's hopeless. Can't he understand what I say?\nI'll say it slowly. \
    Listen up.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">It's.dan.ger.ous.so.just.go.home!</font>"
set key[id=831174302001379] name "(Say there's something you absolutely must find out in $map:02000141$.)"
set key[id=831174302001380] name "Wow~ yo~ man~! You're seriously stubborn~\nLook at this swagger that won't learn \
    till it gets beaten~ head northeast~\nSay bye-bye to this world full of hip-hop freedom~ say farewell~ yeah~"
set key[id=831174302001383] name "Wow~ yo~ man~! You're seriously stubborn~\nLook at this swagger that won't learn \
    till it gets beaten~ head northeast~\nSay bye-bye to this world full of hip-hop freedom~ say farewell~ yeah~"
set key[id=831174302001384] name "Hey~ fearless youngster.\nNobody's welcoming you, so what on earth brings you \
    all the way here?"
set key[id=831174302001385] name "(Ask where the iron ore traded recently came from.)"
set key[id=831174302001386] name "Why would a reckless youngster like you be curious about that...?\nAre you \
    trying to make a deal with me? Is your dream to become a broker? Heh heh..."
set key[id=831174302001387] name "Hey, young man!\nI'd like to end this uninvited visit here...\nHeh heh~ why \
    don't you vanish from my sight while I'm still smiling?"
set key[id=831174302001388] name "(Say you won't leave until he reveals where the iron ore came from.)"
set key[id=831174302001389] name "Heh heh heh. Is that so?\nI can hear a young man's bravado shortening his \
    lifeline.\nThen go ahead and search every corner of this place, $map:02000141$, and find out what you want to \
    know\n... heh heh."
set key[id=831174302001390] name "I don't know if you'll still be alive by the time you find out what you want to \
    know...\nheh heh heh."
set key[id=831174302001391] name "I can hear a young man's bravado shortening his lifeline.\nThen go ahead and \
    search every corner of this place, $map:02000141$, and find out what you want to know\n... heh heh."
set key[id=831174302001392] name "Over here, hey, over here~"
set key[id=831174302001393] name "(Ask who he is.)"
set key[id=831174302001394] name "Shh~!\nFirst of all... who are you, and what are you looking for?"
set key[id=831174302001395] name "(Tell him why you came to $map:02000141$.)"
set key[id=831174302001396] name "You're looking for the source of the iron ore $npc:11000173[gender:0]$ \
    traded?\nWhat luck! I think we can help each other!"
set key[id=831174302001397] name "My name is <font color=\"#ffd200\">Luchen</font>.\nI worked under \
    $npc:11000173[gender:0]$, but over a minor misunderstanding I was branded a traitor\nand I'm being hunted."
set key[id=831174302001398] name "If I'm going to be hunted for life anyway, I figured I'd bring \
    $npc:11000173[gender:0]$'s stolen-goods\nrecords to the guard or Dark Wind and find a way to survive, so I \
    sneaked in\nthrough the sewer pipes."
set key[id=831174302001399] name "(Ask if he knows where the stolen goods records are.)"
set key[id=831174302001400] name "Have you seen the <font color=\"#ffd200\">safes installed in the walls of each \
    room in $map:02000141$</font>?\n$npc:11000173[gender:0]$ keeps the trade documents in those safes.\nThe iron \
    ore trade record you want should be among those documents."
set key[id=831174302001401] name "Could you find all the documents in the safes and bring them to me?\nThen I'll \
    hand over the iron ore trade document to you."
set key[id=831174302001402] name "Have you seen the <font color=\"#ffd200\">safes installed in the walls of each \
    room in $map:02000141$</font>?\n$npc:11000173[gender:0]$ keeps the trade documents in those safes.\nThe iron \
    ore trade record you want should be among those documents."
set key[id=831174302001403] name "Oh, you made it back safely.\nDid you find all the documents? Throw them all \
    down here."
set key[id=831174302001404] name "(Throw the documents into the sewer gap.)"
set key[id=831174302001405] name "Hmm... yes, yes.\nYou've brought them just right! "
set key[id=831174302001805] name "Why not go to $map:02000092$\nand look for $npc:11000170[gender:0]$'s \
    whereabouts?\nSince the address was written in the notebook, someone there must know him.\nWith luck, you may \
    even meet $npc:11000170[gender:0]$ himself. "
set key[id=831174302001806] name "Why not go to $map:02000092$\nand look for $npc:11000170[gender:0]$'s \
    whereabouts?\nSince the address was written in the notebook, someone there must know him.\nWith luck, you may \
    even meet $npc:11000170[gender:0]$ himself. "
set key[id=831174302001807] name "Y-you came looking for me?\nWhat for...?"
set key[id=831174302001808] name "(Ask about the source of the iron ore traded with $npc:11000004[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302001809] name "Th-that... I just went around here and there, bit by bit...\nI h-have no \
    obligation to answer someone I've just met, do I?"
set key[id=831174302001810] name "I-I'm in the middle of talking with a friend, so excuse me... "
set key[id=831174302001811] name "Hmm... there are so many shipping records that this will take a while to \
    find.\nIf you help me with something, $MyPCName$, I can find it faster...\nWould you help?"
set key[id=831174302001812] name "(Ask how you can help.)"
set key[id=831174302001813] name "It's not difficult.\nPlease deliver these <font color=\"#ffd200\">letters</font> \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000492[gender:0]$</font> at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000140$</font>.\nThere's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">letter $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ \
    has been anxiously waiting for</font>, so they need to be\ndelivered quickly. "
set key[id=831174302001814] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302001815] name "(Ask for the $item:30000164$.)"
set key[id=831174302001816] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302001817] name "You left the $item:30000164$ behind~\nHere you go."
set key[id=831174302001818] name "Hm? I gave them to you a moment ago.\nTake a look in your bag."
set key[id=831174302001819] name "Oh... you're carrying too many other things right now...\nCould you empty your \
    bag a bit?"
set key[id=831174302001820] name "Please deliver the <font color=\"#ffd200\">letters</font> to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000492[gender:0]$</font> at <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000140$</font>.\nThere's a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">letter $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ has been anxiously waiting for</font>, so they need to \
    be\ndelivered quickly. "
set key[id=831174302001821] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nDid you meet $npc:11000170[gender:0]$, the one you were \
    looking for back then?\nI hadn't heard from you since and was wondering... "
set key[id=831174302001822] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302001823] name "I don't know what it was about, but I'm glad you met him.\nWhat brings you here \
    today?"
set key[id=831174302001824] name "(Hand over the letters.)"
set key[id=831174302001825] name "Ah! You delivered the letters in person...\nLet me see... "
set key[id=831174302001826] name "As expected, there's a letter from my mother.\nKindly, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000012[gender:0]$</font> takes special care so that I get my mother's \
    letters\nespecially quickly.\nAnyway, I should show some appreciation for your trouble..."
set key[id=831174302001827] name "This is all I can give you right now. It's bread that $npc:11000055[gender:0]$ \
    made at home\nand shared around, and it's very good."
set key[id=831174302001828] name "Please tell $npc:11000012[gender:0]$ that I always appreciate\nthe extra \
    effort."
set key[id=831174302001829] name "Please tell $npc:11000012[gender:0]$ that I always appreciate\nthe extra \
    effort."
set key[id=831174302001830] name "You're back.\nDid $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ like them a lot?"
set key[id=831174302001831] name "(Pass on $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s words.)"
set key[id=831174302001832] name "Aw... it's nothing... I do it from the bottom of my \
    heart.\n$npc:11000492[gender:0]$ only recently reunited with his mother.\nThe two of them are so affectionate, \
    as if to make up for the time apart... "
set key[id=831174302001833] name "(Ask why they were apart.)"
set key[id=831174302001834] name "Well... it's a complicated story.\nIt'd be better to hear it from \
    $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ himself next time."
set key[id=831174302001835] name "This has gotten out of hand.\nI think I'd better take the ledger you found, \
    $MyPCName$, to $npc:11000119[gender:0]$\nand report everything."
set key[id=831174302001836] name "While I make the report, please go to $map:02000140$,\n$MyPCName$, and keep an \
    eye on $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s movements.\nHe may notice and flee in advance... "
set key[id=831174302001837] name "While I make the report, please go to $map:02000140$,\n$MyPCName$, and keep an \
    eye on $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s movements.\nHe may notice and flee in advance... "
set key[id=831174302001838] name "The door of the office is firmly locked.\nThere's no sign of anyone, so nobody \
    seems to be inside."
set key[id=831174302001839] name "Someone may have seen $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ lock the office door and \
    leave.\nLet's ask the residents around the office."
set key[id=831174302001840] name "Someone may have seen $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ lock the office door and \
    leave.\nLet's ask the residents around the office."
set key[id=831174302001841] name "Welcome. Want a flyer?\nNo? Suit yourself~"
set key[id=831174302001842] name "Aw, why not?"
set key[id=831174302001843] name "(Ask if he saw $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ leave the office.)"
set key[id=831174302001844] name "Hm? $npc:11000492[gender:0]$?\nI think he said he had a quick errand and was \
    going home."
set key[id=831174302001845] name "(Ask where $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s house is.)"
set key[id=831174302001846] name "I don't know that~\n$npc:11000492[gender:0]$ practically lives at \
    $map:02000140$,\nso hardly anyone knows where his house is, I bet.\nOh~ $npc:11000012[gender:0]$ might know. \
    Go ask him~"
set key[id=831174302001847] name "$npc:11000492[gender:0]$ practically lives at $map:02000140$,\nso hardly anyone \
    knows where his house is, I bet.\nOh~ $npc:11000012[gender:0]$ might know. Go ask him~"
set key[id=831174302001848] name "Sigh... as busy as ever today.\nWhat brings you this time?"
set key[id=831174302001849] name "(Ask where $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s house is.)"
set key[id=831174302001850] name "$npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s house?\nWhy? Did something happen to \
    $npc:11000492[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302001851] name "(Say you'll explain the details later.)"
set key[id=831174302001852] name "Judging from your expression, $MyPCName$, it must be quite serious.\nPlease wait \
    a moment. I'll look up $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s house in the address book."
set key[id=831174302001853] name "We have to hurry the search of the Barota Company before the evidence of \
    illegal\ndistribution disappears. While I put together and prepare the search team, would you tell \
    $npc:11000065[gender:0]$ about\n$npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s corruption charges and get permission to search \
    $map:02000226$?"
set key[id=831174302001854] name "We have to hurry the search of the Barota Company before the evidence of \
    illegal\ndistribution disappears. While I put together and prepare the search team, would you tell \
    $npc:11000065[gender:0]$ about\n$npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s corruption charges and get permission to search \
    $map:02000226$?"
set key[id=831174302001855] name "Hm? Did you come looking for me?\nWhat brings you here?"
set key[id=831174302001856] name "(Relay $npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s words.)"
set key[id=831174302001857] name "$npc:11000526[gender:0]$...?\nDo you have solid proof?"
set key[id=831174302001858] name "(Say $item:20000046$ was found in the Barota Company warehouse.)"
set key[id=831174302001859] name "Well, if it's come to that... it can't be helped.\nWait a moment."
set key[id=831174302001860] name "Still, the Barota Company is the organization that has contributed the most \
    to\n$map:02000100$'s development, after the Goldus Group.\nI hope this doesn't bring the whole Barota Company \
    down... I'd like it to end with\nexposing the personal corruption of its head, $npc:11000526[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302001861] name "Now, please take this $item:30000165$ to $npc:11000044[gender:0]$.\nAnd... be \
    sure to pass along what I said as well."
set key[id=831174302001862] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302001863] name "(Say you left $item:30000165$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302001864] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302001865] name "Goodness... you're more scatterbrained than you look.\nHere, make sure you take \
    it this time."
set key[id=831174302001866] name "What are you talking about?\nI clearly saw you put it in your bag earlier... \
    Search again!"
set key[id=831174302001867] name "Your bag is full.\nHow about tidying it up first?"
set key[id=831174302001868] name "Please deliver the $item:30000165$ to $npc:11000044[gender:0]$.\nAnd... be sure \
    to pass along what I said as well."
set key[id=831174302001869] name "Did you get the $item:30000165$?"
set key[id=831174302001870] name "(Hand over the $item:30000165$ and relay $npc:11000065[gender:0]$'s words.)"
set key[id=831174302001871] name "Hmm...\nLet's proceed with the search first."
set key[id=831174302001872] name "While the Dark Wind agents search the Barota Company, there's another\nmission I \
    need you to take on."
set key[id=831174302001873] name "(Ask what it is.)"
set key[id=831174302001874] name "While you were meeting $npc:11000065[gender:0]$, we got a tip that \
    $item:20000015$ is being\nsold at $map:02000209$.\n$item:20000015$ is one of the banned junk foods, along \
    with\n$item:20000046$."
set key[id=831174302001875] name "My instinct tells me the $item:20000015$ sold at $map:02000209$ very likely went \
    through\n$npc:11000526[gender:0]$ together with\nthe $item:20000046$. "
set key[id=831174302001876] name "While the search team searches $map:02000226$ for documentary evidence,\ngo to \
    $map:02000209$, find physical evidence, and confirm the distribution\nroute with Cashmart's owner, \
    $npc:11000491[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302001877] name "If my guess is right, confirming the distribution route with \
    $npc:11000491[gender:1]$ may give you\na decisive clue to $npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s whereabouts."
set key[id=831174302001878] name "If my guess is right, confirming the distribution route with \
    $npc:11000491[gender:1]$ may give you\na decisive clue to $npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s whereabouts."
set key[id=831174302001879] name "Hmm. If you've come all the way to my room, you're clearly not a customer.\nWhat \
    is it?"
set key[id=831174302001880] name "(Say you found $item:20000015$ at $map:02000209$.)"
set key[id=831174302001881] name "And?"
set key[id=831174302001882] name "(Tell her to state the distribution route of $item:20000015$ exactly.)"
set key[id=831174302001883] name "Well, am I obliged to tell you that?\nThe price for selling banned junk food is \
    just a few coins in fines.\nIt'll all be over simply."
set key[id=831174302001884] name "(Ask why she is so confident after breaking the law.)"
set key[id=831174302001885] name "You still don't know much, do you...\nIn $map:02000100$, which grew up under the \
    logic of thorough capitalism, money is\nlaw and order.\nIt's a place where lawbreaking for money can be \
    covered up with more money."
set key[id=831174302001886] name "That is the reason I can be this confident.\nWell? Is your curiosity satisfied? \
    Heh."
set key[id=831174302001887] name "Alright, it's my turn to keep my promise.\nYou may have guessed already, but the \
    one who supplied <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000015$</font> to our\nmarket is $npc:11000526[gender:0]$, \
    the head of the Barota Company."
set key[id=831174302001888] name "I heard there's a place that makes banned, unsafe foods like $item:20000015$ and \
    $item:20000046$\nthat aren't allowed to be made or sold in Maple World."
set key[id=831174302001889] name "The Blackstar bring that secretly made junk food into Maple World and sell it \
    for profit,\nand $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ secretly distributed the stuff he bought\nthrough the Blackstar \
    organization."
set key[id=831174302001890] name "I figured that if a big-time Blackstar group that has a quiet understanding with \
    $map:02000100$\nstood behind the goods, there'd be some way out even if things blew up,\nso I made a deal with \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ too... "
set key[id=831174302001891] name "Do you know anything about where $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ went? "
set key[id=831174302001892] name "Well... All I can say is...\nif $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ vanished without a \
    trace in such a short time,\nthe Blackstar probably helped him."
set key[id=831174302001893] name "If $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ vanished without a trace in such a short time,\nthe \
    Blackstar probably helped him."
set key[id=831174302001894] name "You were gone so long that I was about to send an agent to look for you.\nSo, \
    did you learn anything from $npc:11000491[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302001895] name "(Tell him what $npc:11000491[gender:1]$ said.)"
set key[id=831174302001896] name "I knew my guess was right... But the Blackstar? Hmm...\nIf the Blackstar really \
    are involved, this gets a lot more complicated. Hmm... "
set key[id=831174302001897] name "I make it a rule never to give anything away unless I get something in \
    return.\nBut... you're quite lucky. You came looking for my information\njust when I happen to want something. \
    \nDidn't you say earlier that you wanted to know how $item:20000015$ gets distributed?"
set key[id=831174302001898] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302001899] name "I'm willing to give you that information if you pay me what it's worth...\nSo? \
    Would you like to hear my terms?"
set key[id=831174302001900] name "Let's hear them."
set key[id=831174302001901] name "Have you ever heard of $map:02000148$?\nIt's an oil field next to \
    $map:02000100$, and Goldus Development, which won the\nrights from the $map:02000100$ city hall, is running \
    it.\nBut that development contract is about to expire."
set key[id=831174302001902] name "The moment Goldus Development's contract ends, I plan to take over the rights \
    myself.\nTo do that, I need the support of $npc:11000245[gender:0]$ at $map:02000148$.\nIf you bring me this \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000166$ with $npc:11000245[gender:0]$'s signature as a referrer</font>,\nI'll \
    give you what you want."
set key[id=831174302001903] name "What? Did you give up?"
set key[id=831174302001904] name "I left $item:30000166$ behind."
set key[id=831174302001905] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302001906] name "Hmm... At least you remembered on your way.\nHere you go."
set key[id=831174302001907] name "You put it in your bag a moment ago.\nTake another good look."
set key[id=831174302001908] name "Hmm... Your bag looks ready to burst.\nWhy not tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=831174302001909] name "Hmm... I wonder if it was wise to ask this of someone who can't even find the \
    way...\nI really don't know."
set key[id=831174302001910] name "You came to see me?\nWhy?"
set key[id=831174302001911] name "(Show $item:30000166$.) $npc:11000491[gender:1]$ sent me."
set key[id=831174302001912] name "Sigh... I've lost count of how many times this has been.\nI turned them down \
    dozens of times and they still keep coming... "
set key[id=831174302001913] name "I don't know what they brought this time to persuade me, but take it back.\nAnd \
    tell $npc:11000491[gender:1]$ loud and clear:\nif they want to win my heart, show some sincerity."
set key[id=831174302001914] name "Do they have any idea what the sweat of those people\nworking under the blazing \
    sun all day is worth?\nThe ones $npc:11000491[gender:1]$ has to win over aren't me,\nbut those folks working \
    out there on the site."
set key[id=831174302001915] name "Do they have any idea what the sweat of those people\nworking under the blazing \
    sun all day is worth?\nThe ones $npc:11000491[gender:1]$ has to win over aren't me,\nbut those folks working \
    out there on the site."
set key[id=831174302001916] name "This time $npc:11000491[gender:1]$ sent a proper person."
set key[id=831174302001917] name "As promised, I'll give you the $item:30000167$ with my signature in the referrer \
    column.\nTell $npc:11000491[gender:1]$ that my support only raises the odds of getting the rights,\nand that \
    it's never a guarantee."
set key[id=831174302001918] name "Did you forget something?"
set key[id=831174302001919] name "I left $item:30000167$ behind."
set key[id=831174302001920] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302001921] name "Ahh, you dropped it here.\nDon't be so careless, and keep a good hold of it."
set key[id=831174302001922] name "I thought I saw you put it in your bag... Isn't it there?\nLook again."
set key[id=831174302001923] name "Your bag looks awfully heavy.\nWhy not tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=831174302001924] name "The development work is in full swing, so it's pretty messy here...\nIt's easy \
    to lose your way.\nFind your way carefully so you don't have to come back."
set key[id=831174302001925] name "How did it go?"
set key[id=831174302001926] name "(Hand over $item:30000167$.)"
set key[id=831174302001927] name "Wow! Bravo!\nHow did you manage to win over $npc:11000245[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302001928] name "(Tell her what happened at $map:02000148$.)"
set key[id=831174302001929] name "You really went through a lot.\n$MyPCName$, thanks to you, I'm one step closer \
    to winning the oil development rights."
set key[id=831174302001930] name "It never ends, it never ends.\nArgh! Those wretched creatures!"
set key[id=831174302001931] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302001932] name "Enough. It hurts just to talk about it, so don't ask and go back down.\nIt's \
    dangerous up here for anyone but the workers!"
set key[id=831174302001933] name "I'd like to help."
set key[id=831174302001934] name "Ah, well... there's nothing you can... Oh!! Those, those things \
    again...!!\nEvery single day they break open the oil pipes and set them on fire to get in the way of the \
    work.\nIt's enough to drive a man mad."
set key[id=831174302001935] name "Who is breaking the pipes open and setting them on fire?"
set key[id=831174302001936] name "Who else would it be!\nThose monsters running wild all over \
    $map:02000148$...\nIf only their numbers would go down a bit, the work would be so much easier... "
set key[id=831174302001937] name "Ah, well... there's nothing you can... Oh!! Those, those things \
    again...!!\nEvery single day they break open the oil pipes and set them on fire to get in the way of the \
    work.\nIt's enough to drive a man mad."
set key[id=831174302001938] name "Oh my... Are you hurt anywhere?"
set key[id=831174302001939] name "I'm fine."
set key[id=831174302001940] name "I was just muttering to myself... I never thought you'd run straight over\nand \
    fight the monsters yourself.\nI'm sorry I was so curt with you before. I didn't see what kind of person you \
    were."
set key[id=831174302001941] name "Is there anything else I can help with?"
set key[id=831174302001942] name "No. Just stepping up to help like this is more than enough.\nThank you so much."
set key[id=831174302001943] name "You want to join the Blackstar...?"
set key[id=831174302001944] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302001945] name "Can you do anything you're told...?"
set key[id=831174302001946] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302001947] name "Is that so?\nThen go find all the gold bars that the traitor who ran away from \
    our organization made off with."
set key[id=831174302001948] name "If any other Blackstar member brings back the gold bars before you do...\nyou'll \
    pay the price for failing the task I gave you."
set key[id=831174302001949] name "Go find all the gold bars that the traitor who ran away from our organization \
    made off with.\nIf any other Blackstar member brings them back before you do...\nyou'll pay the price for \
    failing the task I gave you."
set key[id=831174302001950] name "Not bad. I'll accept you."
set key[id=831174302001951] name "From now on, gather every scrap of information about the whereabouts of a man \
    named $npc:11000526[gender:0]$\nand report it to me."
set key[id=831174302001952] name "Why are you looking for $npc:11000526[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302001953] name "Just do as you're told.\nI never gave you permission to ask questions."
set key[id=831174302001954] name "Looks like something happened in $map:02000144$.\nGo and find out."
set key[id=831174302001955] name "Looks like something happened in $map:02000144$.\nGo and find out."
set key[id=831174302001956] name "Uhhh~~ Oh my~~ I'm scared!"
set key[id=831174302001957] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302001958] name "Over there, over there, someone died...\nOh my~~ How horrible... "
set key[id=831174302001959] name "I always knew something terrible like this would happen in this alley...\nOh \
    my~~ I'd better get out of this frightening neighborhood soon... "
set key[id=831174302001960] name "Who is the dead person?"
set key[id=831174302001961] name "W... Well...\nI was too scared to go near...\nGo ask $npc:11000534[gender:0]$ \
    over there."
set key[id=831174302001962] name "Go ask $npc:11000534[gender:0]$ over there."
set key[id=831174302001963] name "Whoa, don't come any closer."
set key[id=831174302001964] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=831174302001965] name "A report came in to Dark Wind. They said someone was dead here...\nIt's such a \
    secluded alley that the body went unnoticed for quite a long time after death,\nso it's hard to identify from \
    the body alone...  "
set key[id=831174302001966] name "Anyway... we'll need to investigate further, but\nwe have to work out the \
    identity from the clothes and belongings."
set key[id=831174302001967] name "The agent who was searching the belongings in the bag found next to the \
    body\nsays he found an ID card. The name was $npc:11000526[gender:0]$, I think...?"
set key[id=831174302001968] name "Sigh... Anyway, dying on the street like this is such a pity.\nI hope nothing \
    like this happens again."
set key[id=831174302001969] name "The agent who was searching the belongings in the bag found next to the \
    body\nsays he found an ID card. The name was $npc:11000526[gender:0]$, I think...?"
set key[id=831174302001970] name "Speak."
set key[id=831174302001971] name "(Tell him about the incident in $map:02000144$.)"
set key[id=831174302001972] name "A body...?\nYou say $npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s ID card was found...?"
set key[id=831174302001973] name "You mean $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ is dead...?\nThat man...? So easily...?"
set key[id=831174302001974] name "$MyPCName$...?\nTo think we'd meet again here...\nFunny how you always show up \
    right when I'm making a name for myself. Heh heh."
set key[id=831174302001975] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=831174302001976] name "Thanks to your report, Captain $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ put together a search \
    party and sent it to the Barota Company\nheadquarters. Because of that, I uncovered more of \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s corruption, and while tracking\nwhere he'd vanished to, I found that body in this \
    alley.\nMe! The very first!"
set key[id=831174302001977] name "Is heaven on my side? Heh heh...\nTo think the dead man here was the \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ we've been hunting for all this time... Heh heh."
set key[id=831174302001978] name "Is there any proof that the dead man is $npc:11000526[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302001979] name "Of course there is!\n$npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s ID card was in the dead man's \
    coat pocket.\nAnd $npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s belongings were in the bag by the body too.\nHe was lying dead \
    here, so no one has seen him all this time."
set key[id=831174302001980] name "Hmm... Anyway, I have to get the news to Captain $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ as \
    soon as possible,\nso you go ahead and report $npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s ID card first.\nI'll finish sorting \
    things out here and head back to headquarters. Heh heh.\nThe star of the show always arrives last, after all."
set key[id=831174302001981] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302001982] name "I left $item:30000036$ behind."
set key[id=831174302001983] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302001984] name "Honestly... What if you go around so absent-minded?\nTake better care of it."
set key[id=831174302001985] name "You put it in your bag a moment ago.\nTake another good look."
set key[id=831174302001986] name "What kind of bag is that... You're carrying it around so heavy.\nWhy not tidy it \
    up a bit?"
set key[id=831174302001987] name "Hmm... I wonder if it was wise to ask this of someone who can't even find the \
    way...\nI really don't know."
set key[id=831174302001988] name "$MyPCName$!\nHow did it go? Did you find out any news of \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ from the Blackstar?"
set key[id=831174302001989] name "(Report everything that happened at $map:02000138$.)"
set key[id=831174302001990] name "What?\nThen... the body found in $map:02000144$ that \
    $npcName:11000524[gender:0]$ reported the other day\nwas $npc:11000526[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302001991] name "Sigh... This is quite baffling. It feels like I sent you on a wild goose chase \
    for nothing...\nI think I need a moment to collect my thoughts."
set key[id=831174302001992] name "But... what comes next is important. According to the report I just \
    received,\nthe Dark Wind headquarters took quite heavy damage in the attack too.\n\nThe biggest loss seems to \
    be that <font color=\"#ffd200\">the server holding every investigation record related to Raymon was completely \
    smashed</font>.\n"
set key[id=831174302001993] name "On top of that, fighting with scattered remnants is still going on at the outer \
    defense line of Kerning City...\nIt can't be helped,\nbut it looks like Dark Wind won't be able to continue \
    investigating the Raymon case for a while."
set key[id=831174302001995] name "Go back to $map:02000001$ right now and tell $npc:11000119[gender:0]$\nhow \
    things stand and that I'm ending the investigation."
set key[id=831174302001996] name "$MyPCName$!\nI heard the news. Kerning City was attacked by unidentified \
    monsters!"
set key[id=831174302001997] name "I sent you for the armory investigation... but I feel uneasy, as if I pushed you \
    into the jaws of death.\nAre you alright? How was the investigation going?"
set key[id=831174302001998] name "I'm fine, but Dark Wind won't be able to resume the investigation for a while."
set key[id=831174302001999] name "I see... Given the situation in Kerning City, it can't be helped..."
set key[id=831174302002000] name "An urgent request for support came from the $map:02000076$ Green Hoods.\nThis \
    has never happened before, so something serious must have occurred.\nIt will take a while for the Royal Guard \
    reinforcements to get ready, so I'd like you to go\nahead and help them first... Can you?"
set key[id=831174302002001] name "An urgent request for support came from the $map:02000076$ Green Hoods.\nThis \
    has never happened before, so something serious must have occurred.\nIt will take a while for the Royal Guard \
    reinforcements to get ready, so I'd like you to go\nahead and help them first... Can you?"
set key[id=831174302002002] name "At $npc:11000119[gender:0]$'s request from $map:02000001$...?\nBut where are the \
    other reinforcements?"
set key[id=831174302002003] name "They'll be here soon."
set key[id=831174302002004] name "Ah, I see.\nThere's no time, so it's better to move first."
set key[id=831174302002005] name "Some creatures attacked the Green Hoods' northeast outpost in \
    $map:02000054$.\nAt a glance they look like bats, but up close they have the shape of demons...\nWhere they \
    came from and what they are, nothing is known yet."
set key[id=831174302002006] name "For now, the priority is defending the northeast outpost in $map:02000054$.\nGo \
    to $map:02000054$ with the Green Hoods, defeat them,\nand lend your strength to hold the outpost!"
set key[id=831174302002007] name "For now, the priority is defending the northeast outpost in $map:02000054$.\nGo \
    to $map:02000054$ with the Green Hoods, defeat them,\nand lend your strength to hold the outpost!"
set key[id=831174302002008] name "Ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002009] name "This... I took it from the one... who led them here...\nIt should be... a clue \
    to uncover... what they are... "
set key[id=831174302002010] name "Leave this place to the Green Hoods...\nand please take this to \
    $npc:11000015[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302002011] name "Ugh... Why... again... "
set key[id=831174302002012] name "I left $item:30000172$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002013] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302002014] name "Here it is... "
set key[id=831174302002015] name "In your bag... please check... your bag... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002016] name "Please tidy up... your bag and lighten the weight...\nThat way... you'll reach \
    $npc:11000015[gender:1]$... faster... "
set key[id=831174302002017] name "Ah... ugh... There's no time for this... "
set key[id=831174302002018] name "Th-this is... hmm... I've never seen anything like it.\nIt looks like an \
    ordinary weapon... but I've never seen a material so light and springy."
set key[id=831174302002019] name "Perhaps... the blacksmiths of the Nerman Forge might know something about \
    it.\nWould you\nshow this to $npc:11000508[gender:1]$ in $map:02000203$\nand ask her to look into it?"
set key[id=831174302002020] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302002021] name "I left $item:30000172$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002022] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302002023] name "Ah... yes, I see.\nHere you go. It's an important item, so please be careful."
set key[id=831174302002024] name "Hmm... It's not here...\nWhy not search your bag once more?"
set key[id=831174302002025] name "There doesn't seem to be room in your bag for $item:30000172$."
set key[id=831174302002026] name "Could you hand $item:30000172$ to $npc:11000508[gender:1]$ in \
    $map:02000203$\nand ask her to look into it?"
set key[id=831174302002027] name "What brings you here?"
set key[id=831174302002028] name "(Show $item:30000172$.)"
set key[id=831174302002029] name "Hmm...? This is... way lighter than it looks, and incredibly springy...\nI've \
    never seen anything like it... Where did you get this?"
set key[id=831174302002030] name "(Explain the situation.)"
set key[id=831174302002031] name "Ah... if $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ is asking, I'll look into this first!\nI'll \
    comb through the Nerman Forge's old technical records until I find out!"
set key[id=831174302002032] name "While I look into that $item:30000172$, could you do me a favor?"
set key[id=831174302002033] name "Let's hear them."
set key[id=831174302002034] name "The parts the Green Hoods ordered are finished.\nThey complete the large \
    crossbow that the Green Hoods specially ordered when they were sent to $map:02000001$\nfor the court audience, \
    but the work ran a little late."
set key[id=831174302002035] name "I left the finished parts on the workbench behind me.\nCould you take them to \
    $npc:11000015[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302002036] name "I left the finished parts on the workbench behind me.\nCould you take them to \
    $npc:11000015[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302002037] name "The item $npc:11000508[gender:1]$ sent?"
set key[id=831174302002038] name "(Hand over $item:30000173$.)"
set key[id=831174302002039] name "Ah... these are parts for repairing crossbows.\nI asked the Nerman Forge for \
    them a while back. They must have finally finished."
set key[id=831174302002040] name "Back when we prepared for the court audience, the Green Hoods also dispatched \
    members to $map:02000001$\nas guards.\nThe large crossbows specially made by the Nerman Forge were moved to \
    $map:02000001$ too,\nto prepare for the worst."
set key[id=831174302002041] name "But... some time later, an earthquake struck around $map:02000001$, and the \
    outposts where the Green Hoods were posted\nwere cut off, and we lost contact with the members.\nThinking \
    about it makes me miss them even more. As their captain... I can only say I'm sorry."
set key[id=831174302002042] name "All the large crossbows that fit these parts are in $map:02000001$,\nso it would \
    be right to hand them to $npc:11000119[gender:0]$.\n$MyPCName$, would you do us one more favor?"
set key[id=831174302002043] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302002044] name "I left $item:30000173$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002045] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302002046] name "Ah... yes, I see.\nHere you go. It's an important item, so please be careful."
set key[id=831174302002047] name "Hmm... It's not here...\nWhy not search your bag once more?"
set key[id=831174302002048] name "There doesn't seem to be room in your bag for $item:30000173$."
set key[id=831174302002049] name " I would be grateful\nif you could hand $item:30000173$ to \
    $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ in $map:02000001$."
set key[id=831174302002050] name "$MyPCName$! Back already?\nHow are things at $map:02000076$?"
set key[id=831174302002051] name "(Report the situation.)"
set key[id=831174302002052] name "I see... The Royal Guard reinforcements should have reached $map:02000076$ by \
    now,\nso those creatures won't be able\nto attack the town.\nI hope we can use that $item:30000172$ to uncover \
    the identity of the attackers. "
set key[id=831174302002053] name "But $map:02000076$ must be in a critical state. Is there a reason\nyou came back \
    so quickly?"
set key[id=831174302002054] name "(Hand over $item:30000173$.)"
set key[id=831174302002055] name "Ah... parts for a large crossbow.\nHow strange. That you'd bring these parts at \
    just this moment... "
set key[id=831174302002056] name "Just before you arrived, we made contact with the guard outpost on the land that \
    was cut off by the earthquake.\nWhether it's gravity or magnetism, I don't know exactly, but the broken-off \
    land is drifting\na tiny bit closer, so close that one can fly across."
set key[id=831174302002057] name "Fortunately, the Green Hoods guarding the $map:02000115$ outpost are all \
    safe.\nBut... they refuse to return."
set key[id=831174302002058] name "Why?"
set key[id=831174302002059] name "A ruthless creature called $npc:23000001[gender:0]$ appears there.\nIt seems to \
    have come from the Land of Darkness... but I've received no exact report yet.\nThe Green Hoods fear that if \
    they leave the outpost and return, $npc:23000001[gender:0]$ will\nattack all the way to $map:02000001$, so \
    they say they'll fight to the end."
set key[id=831174302002060] name "The large crossbows the Green Hoods brought from $map:02000076$ are all deployed \
    there too,\nso please\ndeliver this $item:30000173$ to the Green Hoods there."
set key[id=831174302002061] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302002062] name "I left $item:30000173$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002063] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302002064] name "Ah... I see. Here you go.\nTake good care of it."
set key[id=831174302002065] name "I definitely saw you put it in your bag a moment ago...\nTake another look in \
    your bag."
set key[id=831174302002066] name "How can you fly with such a heavy bag?\nTidy up your bag first!"
set key[id=831174302002067] name "Please deliver $item:30000173$ to the Green Hoods guarding the broken land\nat \
    $map:02000115$."
set key[id=831174302002068] name "You brought $item:30000173$... Thank you so much.\nSome of the crossbows we set \
    up were broken, and we were at a loss."
set key[id=831174302002069] name "Um... I'm sorry, but could you also help repair the broken crossbows?\nThe \
    crossbows are a great help when holding off $npc:23000001[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302002070] name "Is there something else you wanted to say...?"
set key[id=831174302002071] name "I left $item:30000173$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002072] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302002073] name "Ah, I see. Here you go!"
set key[id=831174302002074] name "Please take a look in your bag!"
set key[id=831174302002075] name "Your bag looks too heavy.\nYou should tidy it up first."
set key[id=831174302002076] name "Ah... there never was a road here.\nThe ground has split apart... so don't look \
    for a path, just find the crossbows and repair them."
set key[id=831174302002077] name "You're back?\nHow were the Green Hoods at the $map:02000115$ outpost?"
set key[id=831174302002078] name "(Report the situation.)"
set key[id=831174302002079] name "I never expected crossbows to be that useful. At least that's a relief...\nI \
    also told $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ the news about the Green Hoods.\nShe's someone who rarely shows her \
    feelings...\nbut they say this time she couldn't hide her joy."
set key[id=831174302002080] name "Seeing the Green Hoods do their best to the very end of their mission, I have a \
    feeling that\npeace will surely return to this land someday. "
set key[id=831174302002081] name "When you fight <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000001[gender:0]$</font> and it \
    falls,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">a figure hiding their face under a red cloak appears with \
    $npc:23000008[gender:0]$ and strikes back</font>,\nI hear. Have you ever seen that?"
set key[id=831174302002082] name "I have."
set key[id=831174302002083] name "I haven't."
set key[id=831174302002084] name "You have? Good!\nWe received a report that <font color=\"#ffd200\">the one in \
    the red cloak appeared at $map:02000117$</font>.\nI sent our elite guards to search right away, but strangely \
    there's still\nno word. Can you go and find out what happened?"
set key[id=831174302002085] name "No? Well... they vanish in an instant, leaving $npc:23000008[gender:0]$ \
    behind,\nso nobody has ever fought them directly.\nBut we received a report that\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">the \
    one in the red cloak appeared at $map:02000117$</font>."
set key[id=831174302002086] name "I sent our elite guards to search right away, but strangely there's still\nno \
    word. \nCan you go and find out what happened?"
set key[id=831174302002087] name "We received a report that <font color=\"#ffd200\">the one in the red cloak \
    appeared at $map:02000117$</font>.\nI sent our elite guards to search right away, but strangely there's \
    still\nno word. Can you go and find out what happened?"
set key[id=831174302002088] name "Shh!"
set key[id=831174302002089] name "I ask what he's doing."
set key[id=831174302002090] name "Shh! Be quiet, I said."
set key[id=831174302002091] name "Is it over...? "
set key[id=831174302002092] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302002093] name "There was such a racket inside this $map:02000238$ that I peeked in\njust a \
    little... \nThe guards were tumbling around brawling with horned demons.  "
set key[id=831174302002094] name "But after a red hood zipped out of $map:02000238$ a moment ago and vanished \
    like\nsmoke, it's gone quiet... No sound at... Whoa!!\nThey're fighting again! The racket's started up again!"
set key[id=831174302002095] name "There was such a racket inside this $map:02000238$ that I peeked in\njust a \
    little... \nThe guards were tumbling around brawling with horned demons.  "
set key[id=831174302002096] name "Ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002097] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=831174302002098] name "I followed the one in the red cloak all the way here... \nIt... it was a trap... \
    Ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002099] name "Please... help the guards... \nAt this rate... they may all be wiped out... \
    Ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002100] name "Please... help the guards... \nAt this rate... they may all be wiped out... \
    Ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002101] name "The royal crest is carved on part of the broken wagon, so this is probably the \
    wreckage\nof the royal wagon that vanished in the large-scale theft of court goods\nbefore the audience was \
    cancelled."
set key[id=831174302002102] name "It seems worth a closer look."
set key[id=831174302002103] name "You spot something glittering among the wreckage."
set key[id=831174302002104] name "Something keeps glittering in the wreckage of the court goods."
set key[id=831174302002105] name "(Search for the $item:30000174$.)"
set key[id=831174302002106] name "Just leave."
set key[id=831174302002107] name "You found the $item:30000174$."
set key[id=831174302002108] name "You can't find the $item:30000174$.\nYou should check your bag once more."
set key[id=831174302002109] name "Your bag is full and you can't fit anything else.\nYou should tidy up your bag."
set key[id=831174302002110] name "The glittering among the wreckage is gone.\nDid you imagine it...?"
set key[id=831174302002111] name "The wagon... had the royal crest...?\nUgh... "
set key[id=831174302002112] name "I show him that I found the $item:30000174$, too."
set key[id=831174302002113] name "This... I think I've seen this somewhere... \nIt may be a royal item they didn't \
    get around to taking out of the wagon... "
set key[id=831174302002114] name "Ugh... At this rate... it's no good... \nPlease go back to $map:02000001$ and \
    ask $npc:11000119[gender:0]$...\nto send reinforcements..."
set key[id=831174302002115] name "Please take this $item:30000174$ with you, too...\nIt may be proof that they're \
    connected to the court goods theft..."
set key[id=831174302002116] name "Why... did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302002117] name "I say I left the $item:30000174$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002118] name "I say I took a wrong turn."
set key[id=831174302002119] name "It may be important evidence, so please... take good care of it."
set key[id=831174302002120] name "I'm sure you took it earlier... \nHave you... checked your bag?"
set key[id=831174302002121] name "Your bag seems... full... \nTidy it first... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002122] name "There's no... time... \nPlease hurry... "
set key[id=831174302002123] name "How did the search party fare?"
set key[id=831174302002124] name "(Report the situation.)"
set key[id=831174302002125] name "That's terrible!\nWe must send reinforcements right now!"
set key[id=831174302002126] name "I hand over the $item:30000174$."
set key[id=831174302002127] name "What... this is what you found in $map:02000238$...?\nWhy was this there...!!!"
set key[id=831174302002128] name "I ask whether it's a royal item."
set key[id=831174302002129] name "Hmm... I'm not sure... \nI can't say for certain right now."
set key[id=831174302002130] name "A message came from $npc:11000044[gender:0]$.\nHe says he's caught wind of \
    circumstances linking a man named $npc:11000529[gender:0]$ from $map:02000100$\nto the theft of the Court \
    Goods."
set key[id=831174302002131] name "Go to $map:02000153$ in $map:02000100$, hear the details from \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$,\nand help him."
set key[id=831174302002132] name "Go to $map:02000153$ in $map:02000100$, hear the details from \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$,\nand help him."
set key[id=831174302002133] name "Ah, it's been a while.\nDid $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ send you?"
set key[id=831174302002134] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302002135] name "$npc:11000119[gender:0]$ seems to trust you deeply.\nWell, it's not every day \
    you find someone as quick and sharp as you."
set key[id=831174302002136] name "Lately in the $map:02000100$ area, there are more and more thugs who harass \
    residents and defy Dark Wind agents,\nand after investigating, the one leading that gang turned out to \
    be\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000529[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302002137] name "Who is <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000529[gender:0]$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302002138] name "He used to be a special agent of our Dark Wind.\nAfter Captain <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Win Steelton</font> was wrongly killed at the hands of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font>,\nI succeeded him as captain, and he stormed out of Dark \
    Wind in resentment."
set key[id=831174302002139] name "He wasn't seen for a while after that, but meanwhile it seems he quietly \
    gathered back-alley thugs\nand now leads a rough organization called the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>.\nNot long ago, there was an anonymous tip that they were the culprits of the \
    Court Goods theft\nand that evidence could be found at their hideout. "
set key[id=831174302002140] name "We need to find out exactly where their hideout is.\nSurvey the residents of \
    $map:02000100$ and see whether anyone has seen the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>\nor knows anything \
    about them. "
set key[id=831174302002141] name "Survey the residents of $map:02000100$ and see whether anyone has seen the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>\nor knows anything about them. "
set key[id=831174302002142] name "Huh? The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>?\nAh... you mean those thugs? \
    I've heard of them, yes, I have!"
set key[id=831174302002143] name "(Tell me more.)"
set key[id=831174302002144] name "They say those guys beat up and threaten little students and take their \
    money.\nWhy does Dark Wind leave such guys alone... Sigh... "
set key[id=831174302002145] name "$npc:11000233[gender:1]$ over there can tell you more about the\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>.\nI only heard a little bit from $npc:11000233[gender:1]$, that's all... "
set key[id=831174302002146] name "$npc:11000233[gender:1]$ over there can tell you more about the\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>.\nI only heard a little bit from $npc:11000233[gender:1]$, that's all... "
set key[id=831174302002147] name "You have something to ask?\nWhat is it?"
set key[id=831174302002148] name "Have you ever seen the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>?"
set key[id=831174302002149] name "I haven't seen them myself, but I heard it from someone really reliable.\nMy \
    twin sister\ngot a job a while ago as a maid in a rich household in $map:02000137$. "
set key[id=831174302002150] name "She said that while walking the master's son's pet cat near the railroad \
    tracks,\nshe saw the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font> bullying students in school uniforms."
set key[id=831174302002151] name "Things have been getting scarier ever since the previous Dark Wind captain \
    died,\nand now thugs like that are making trouble too...\nHow can anyone live here without being afraid?"
set key[id=831174302002152] name "And they say the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>' boss used to be a Dark \
    Wind agent?\nSigh... To think there's a traitor among the Guardians we trust and depend on...\nIt's just \
    terrifying."
set key[id=831174302002153] name "They say the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>' boss used to be a Dark Wind \
    agent?\nSigh... To think there's a traitor among the Guardians we trust and depend on...\nIt's just \
    terrifying."
set key[id=831174302002154] name "I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I said I'm sorry."
set key[id=831174302002155] name "Who are you talking to?"
set key[id=831174302002156] name "Hm...? What... It's someone else...?\nIs he... gone...?"
set key[id=831174302002157] name "Who are you looking for?"
set key[id=831174302002158] name "That scary man... or is he a big brother...?\nAnyway... there is one. Tsk... "
set key[id=831174302002159] name "Ah... my arms hurt...\nand my legs are cramping... "
set key[id=831174302002160] name "Why are you being punished?"
set key[id=831174302002161] name "Th-that... Ah, I don't know.\nWe were just playing here when some big brother \
    suddenly showed up and punished us\nlike this and took all our things."
set key[id=831174302002162] name "Was it the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>?"
set key[id=831174302002163] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>...?\nAh... was it? Now that you say \
    it, maybe...\nThat brother was handsome and pretty-faced, but his temper... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002164] name "It's okay now, you don't have to stand there as punishment anymore."
set key[id=831174302002165] name "Ah... no, I can't...\nHe told us to keep standing here until he comes back. Or \
    he'll punish us again... "
set key[id=831174302002166] name "We were just playing here when some big brother suddenly showed up and punished \
    us\nlike this and took all our things.\nThat brother was handsome and pretty-faced, but his temper... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002167] name "Tsk... Serves you right... You should've been nice!"
set key[id=831174302002168] name "What are you doing here?"
set key[id=831174302002169] name "I'm watching the kids being punished down there.\nI used to be the one punished \
    like that in front of them every day... hee hee. "
set key[id=831174302002170] name "(Tell me what happened.)"
set key[id=831174302002171] name "A cool older brother came earlier and taught those friends who bullied me a \
    lesson like that,\nand he got back my bag, clothes, and shoes too.\nHe told me to watch from here and, when \
    the sun sets, go down and tell them\nthey can stop being punished."
set key[id=831174302002172] name "Isn't he a really cool brother? Hee hee.\nI'll watch a little longer and then go \
    down..."
set key[id=831174302002173] name "What is it?\nDo you have something else to say to me...?"
set key[id=831174302002174] name "Do you know who helped you?"
set key[id=831174302002175] name "$npc:11000565[gender:0]$! He said his name is $npc:11000565[gender:0]$.\nHe told \
    me to come find him anytime if my friends bully me again!"
set key[id=831174302002176] name "Where did he tell you to find him?"
set key[id=831174302002177] name "He said to come to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">abandoned building in \
    $map:02000166$</font>... Gah!\nIt was supposed to be a secret...!!"
set key[id=831174302002178] name "$npc:11000565[gender:0]$! He said his name is $npc:11000565[gender:0]$.\nHe told \
    me to come find him anytime if my friends bully me again!\nHe said to come to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">abandoned building in $map:02000166$</font>... "
set key[id=831174302002179] name "Who's there?\nHow did you know to come in here?"
set key[id=831174302002180] name "I heard from $npc:11000218[gender:0]$ in $map:02000137$ and came looking."
set key[id=831174302002181] name "I told him it was a secret... Did you threaten $npc:11000218[gender:0]$?\nAre \
    you on the side of those delinquent students?"
set key[id=831174302002182] name "I just came because I want to know the real face of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>."
set key[id=831174302002183] name "The real face?\nWhat does that mean?"
set key[id=831174302002184] name "(Tell him the rumors about the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>.)"
set key[id=831174302002185] name "Hmph! Whatever.\nWe're not idle enough to react to worthless rumors one by one!"
set key[id=831174302002186] name "I don't know yet who tried to frame us... but\nthey clearly have quite a lot of \
    influence in this $map:02000100$ area.\nWhether it's money or power... the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>' enemies are mostly people who have something."
set key[id=831174302002187] name "Is Dark Wind included among your enemies?"
set key[id=831174302002188] name "More than half of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font> left Dark Wind with \
    me, sharing my convictions,\nafter $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ became captain.\nDark Wind still has people who \
    spent time with us like family, like brothers.\nHow could Dark Wind possibly be an enemy of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font>?"
set key[id=831174302002189] name "Why did you leave Dark Wind?"
set key[id=831174302002190] name "$npc:11000044[gender:0]$ and I differed in what we believed in, what we wanted \
    to believe,\nand what we didn't want to believe."
set key[id=831174302002191] name "What do you mean?"
set key[id=831174302002192] name "I don't know whether you already know,\nbut where the Blue Rappenta, one of the \
    three Rappentas said to protect this world, shattered into pieces...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Win \
    Steelton</font>, who led Dark Wind at the time, died.\nAnd the one named as the culprit of that crime... was \
    none other than $npc:11000064[gender:0]$...!"
set key[id=831174302002193] name "He was a friend and comrade who shared good and bad times with me for a long \
    time.\nI couldn't believe that $npc:11000064[gender:0]$, who followed <font color=\"#ffd200\">Win \
    Steelton</font> like a father,\ncould have done such a thing.\nI cried out countless times that we had to \
    examine every fact again, thoroughly."
set key[id=831174302002194] name "But... in the face of an enormous event that shook not only Dark Wind but the \
    whole world,\npeople wanted someone to resent and blame more than they wanted the truth.\nAnd \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ became that person. "
set key[id=831174302002195] name "In an instant, $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ became a shameless man who put the whole \
    world in danger,\nand those who defended him were branded traitors.\nI became one of those traitors."
set key[id=831174302002196] name "Is there a reason you trust $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ so firmly?"
set key[id=831174302002197] name "Because I know him better than anyone.\nAnd... there's no proof that he isn't \
    the culprit, but there's also no hard evidence\nthat he really did it.\nThere's only the testimony of \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$, who says he watched everything. "
set key[id=831174302002198] name "I've said too much.\nAnyway, go back to $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ and tell him \
    everything you saw and heard here.\nTell him to drop the needless suspicion and that I demand a thorough \
    reinvestigation."
set key[id=831174302002199] name "Anyway, go back to $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ and tell him everything you saw and \
    heard here.\nTell him to drop the needless... suspicion."
set key[id=831174302002200] name "That took quite a while.\nSo, how did it go?"
set key[id=831174302002201] name "(Tell him everything.)"
set key[id=831174302002202] name "...Hmm...\nYou met $npc:11000529[gender:0]$... so now I see\nhis feelings toward \
    me aren't exactly warm.\nBut Blackeye... demanding a thorough reinvestigation?"
set key[id=831174302002203] name "I hope they understand clearly that a traitor and the forces who defend \
    him...\ndeserve to be suspected again and again."
set key[id=831174302002204] name "$npc:11000565[gender:0]$! Calm down.\n$MyPCName$, don't dodge the \
    question.\nTell us honestly why you tracked us all the way here!"
set key[id=831174302002205] name "Dark Wind tracked the Humples as suspects in the Court Goods theft."
set key[id=831174302002206] name "I knew it... Otherwise you'd never\nhave come all this way just out of \
    curiosity.\nWhat did $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ say about the Humples, or about me?"
set key[id=831174302002207] name "(Tell him what $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ told me.)"
set key[id=831174302002208] name "Well... that's not wrong. Except for one thing.\nWe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font> are not a back-alley gang.\nYou may not know yet, but... $map:02000100$ isn't \
    as wealthy and happy\nas it looks."
set key[id=831174302002209] name "We <font color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font> are just people who banded together to \
    stand with, protect, and shield the weak and powerless\nthat those with money and power turn away from and \
    trample.\nEvery rumor about us is a lie made up by someone afraid\nthat we'll grow stronger and take what they \
    have. "
set key[id=831174302002210] name "This box in front of us is also a trap set by someone trying to frame us."
set key[id=831174302002211] name "What is that box?"
set key[id=831174302002212] name "Seeing that this box is full of Court Goods...\nsomeone must have sneaked in and \
    left it here\nto brand us as Court Goods thieves. "
set key[id=831174302002213] name "How am I supposed to believe that?"
set key[id=831174302002214] name "Whether you believe it or not is up to you.\nBut if you want to know\nthe real \
    truth beneath the surface, why not check whether someone really\nsneaked in and left this box here, and then \
    report to $npc:11000044[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302002215] name "If you want to know\nthe real truth beneath the surface, why not check whether \
    someone really\nsneaked in and left this box here, and then report to $npc:11000044[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302002216] name "Hmm... I don't have time to sit around chatting when I should be selling\none \
    more item... What do you want to know?\nHurry up and say it."
set key[id=831174302002217] name "Have you seen anyone suspicious nearby lately?"
set key[id=831174302002218] name "Someone suspicious? What kind of suspicious person?\nAh... do you mean that \
    bunch with their faces wrapped in black cloth?"
set key[id=831174302002219] name "(Tell me more.)"
set key[id=831174302002220] name "Ah, forget it. I don't know, I don't know.\nIt's a bother, so go ask somewhere \
    else."
set key[id=831174302002221] name "As promised, I just tell you exactly what I saw, right?\nIt was a few days \
    ago.\nThere were a lot of customers that day, so I did business past midnight and was tidying up near \
    dawn...\nwhen something black was darting around in front of that abandoned building."
set key[id=831174302002222] name "This is a redevelopment area about to be demolished, so there's nothing to steal \
    even if thieves came,\nso I wondered what it was and crept over there.\nThere were <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">three or four burly men wrapped from head to toe in black cloth</font>...!\nIf I hadn't \
    heard their whispering voices, I'd have been sure they were ghosts! "
set key[id=831174302002223] name "What were they whispering?"
set key[id=831174302002224] name "What was it... Hmm...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Is it all arranged perfectly, did \
    you leave no traces... We have to wipe them\nall out this time...</font>\nSomething like that, I think."
set key[id=831174302002225] name "It was a few days ago.\nIn front of the abandoned building, there were <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">three or four burly men wrapped from head to toe in black cloth</font>...!\nIf I hadn't \
    heard their whispering voices, I'd have been sure they were ghosts! "
set key[id=831174302002226] name "What was it... Hmm...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Is it all arranged perfectly, did \
    you leave no traces... We have to wipe them\nall out this time...</font>\nSomething like that, I think."
set key[id=831174302002227] name "I thought you'd gone straight back to $npc:11000044[gender:0]$. Didn't you?"
set key[id=831174302002228] name "(Tell him what $npc:11000311[gender:0]$ told me.)"
set key[id=831174302002229] name "One step too late. I already know that.\nThe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humples</font> are already tracking those unidentified men."
set key[id=831174302002230] name "Still...\nat least you're not a fool who gets manipulated by \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ without thinking."
set key[id=831174302002231] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Lennon</font>... Just hearing about that guy makes my \
    blood boil..."
set key[id=831174302002232] name "I feel it's my duty to look after and protect $npc:11000069[gender:1]$\nin place \
    of our late captain. \nThat's why I had the Dark Wind agents take turns guarding her side.\nI can't shake the \
    thought that $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ might try to hurt her..."
set key[id=831174302002233] name "Why do you think that?"
set key[id=831174302002234] name "$npc:11000064[gender:0]$ brutally murdered Captain <font color=\"#ffd200\">Win \
    Steelton</font>,\nand smashed the Blue Lapenta to pieces. I saw it with my own two eyes!\nTo be honest... I'm \
    afraid I'll lose $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ to that guy's hands, too."
set key[id=831174302002235] name "Head to $map:02000147$. Near $map:02000205$ there should be a\nDark Wind agent \
    on guard.\nCan you give him this $item:30000176$ and check that $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ is doing\nokay, then \
    come back to me?"
set key[id=831174302002236] name "Why are you back already?"
set key[id=831174302002237] name "I left the $item:30000176$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002238] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302002239] name "One mistake is enough. \nBe more careful from now on!"
set key[id=831174302002240] name "How am I supposed to trust you with anything important like this?\nDid you even \
    check your bag properly?"
set key[id=831174302002241] name "Your bag is a mess. Who carries around that much junk...? \nClean it up first!"
set key[id=831174302002242] name "Head to $map:02000147$. Near $map:02000205$ there should be a\nDark Wind agent \
    on guard.\nGive him this $item:30000176$, check that $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ is doing okay,\nand come back."
set key[id=831174302002243] name "Who are you?"
set key[id=831174302002244] name "(Hand over the $item:30000176$.)"
set key[id=831174302002245] name "Oh, so $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ sent this. \nThank you."
set key[id=831174302002246] name "Is $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ doing well?"
set key[id=831174302002247] name "(Nod and ask how $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ is doing.)"
set key[id=831174302002248] name "Other than the occasional trip to $map:02000221$, she hardly ever\nleaves the \
    house. \nBut this time she's stayed inside longer than usual.\nI wonder if something happened in there... "
set key[id=831174302002249] name "Could you pretend to be a passerby and check that she's all right in \
    there?\nPlease do.\nMiss $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ really hates meeting Dark Wind agents... "
set key[id=831174302002250] name "Could you pretend to be a passerby and check that she's all right in \
    there?\nPlease do.\nMiss $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ really hates meeting Dark Wind agents... "
set key[id=831174302002251] name "...Lennon?! \nOh... No, it's not him... Who are you...\n...Never mind. You must \
    have been sent by Katvan."
set key[id=831174302002252] name "(...) Anyway, I tell her it seems like she was waiting for Lennon."
set key[id=831174302002253] name "Of course I was. If it weren't for that fool Katvan and his Dark Wind lot, I'd \
    go out and look for him myself..."
set key[id=831174302002254] name "Why are you waiting for Lennon when he killed your father?"
set key[id=831174302002256] name "Anyway, please leave now."
set key[id=831174302002257] name "Could you please leave now?"
set key[id=831174302002258] name "Is $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ doing all right?"
set key[id=831174302002259] name "To be honest, it looks like Lennon came by Eve's house."
set key[id=831174302002260] name "...!!\nHmm... If that's true, it's a little scary...\nIs Dark Wind's watch \
    really this sloppy...!"
set key[id=831174302002261] name "Father... I think something has happened to Father!"
set key[id=831174302002262] name "What do you mean?"
set key[id=831174302002263] name "I don't really... know either. A member of the Royal Guard just came by.\nHe \
    asked if everything was all right and said he'd come to check that I was safe.\nBut the mood about him... felt \
    off. "
set key[id=831174302002264] name "I have an uneasy feeling...\n$MyPCName$, could you go to $map:02000001$ and see \
    what's happening, and whether\nanything has happened to Father?"
set key[id=831174302002265] name "$MyPCName$, could you go to $map:02000001$ and see what's happening, and \
    whether\nanything has happened to Father?"
set key[id=831174302002266] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!\nYou came just in time."
set key[id=831174302002267] name "I ask what's going on at $map:02000001$."
set key[id=831174302002268] name "$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ and her gang raided $map:02000065$!\nAnd the \
    Chancellor... has been kidnapped by them!"
set key[id=831174302002269] name "We're urgently assembling the elite guards, but... \nif we waste any more \
    time...!!"
set key[id=831174302002270] name "This time we must catch $npc:11000057[gender:1]$!\nAnd alive, at that... "
set key[id=831174302002271] name "It's the Empress's order... Giving up on $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ now would be \
    like pouring salt on the Empress's\nwound, and on $npc:11000074[gender:0]$'s wound that hasn't even \
    healed...\nThat's why she wants all the more to bring $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ back where she belongs."
set key[id=831174302002272] name "But this is extremely dangerous.\nIf we think only of Maple World, the safe \
    thing is to eliminate $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ at once.\nIf we keep her alive and keep failing to catch her... \
    sigh... What do you think?"
set key[id=831174302002273] name "I say we should keep $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ alive."
set key[id=831174302002274] name "I say we should kill $npc:11000057[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302002275] name "Well... Considering the heartbreaking circumstances of $npc:11000074[gender:0]$ \
    and the Bidblaim family,\njudging as $npc:11000075[gender:1]$ and you do may be the right thing... \nbut \
    another sacrifice might be needed to bring $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ back."
set key[id=831174302002276] name "Nearly everything in this world has its contradictions, and everyone has their \
    own standards...\nbut I do believe there are situations where sacrificing a few for the many is \
    unavoidable.\nWhen we don't even have a way to restore $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ to her true self,\nkeeping her \
    alive may be a reckless decision."
set key[id=831174302002277] name "Of course, $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ must have considered all of that before \
    deciding, so for now\nthe Royal Guard's duty is to trust and follow $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$'s \
    decision.\nAnd please keep it secret for the time being that the red cloak is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000057[gender:1]$</font>.\nThere are sure to be people who oppose \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$'s wishes.\nNeedless controversy would only leave everyone hurt."
set key[id=831174302002278] name "$MyPCName$, set out right now and follow the pursuit team.\nThey headed toward \
    $map:02000023$, so you should catch up if you follow that road. "
set key[id=831174302002279] name "I also think there are cases where sacrificing a few for the many is \
    unavoidable.\nWhen we don't even have a way to restore $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ to her true self,\nkeeping her \
    alive may be a reckless decision, too."
set key[id=831174302002280] name "Of course, $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ must have considered all of that before \
    deciding, so for now\nthe Royal Guard's duty is to trust and follow $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$'s \
    decision.\nAnd please keep it secret for the time being that the red cloak is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000057[gender:1]$</font>.\nThere are sure to be people who oppose \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$'s wishes.\nNeedless controversy would only leave everyone hurt."
set key[id=831174302002281] name "$MyPCName$, set out right now and follow the pursuit team.\nThey headed toward \
    $map:02000023$, so you should catch up if you follow that road. "
set key[id=831174302002282] name "$MyPCName$, set out right now and follow the pursuit team.\nThey headed toward \
    $map:02000023$, so you should catch up if you follow that road. "
set key[id=831174302002283] name "Ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002284] name "I ask if he's all right."
set key[id=831174302002285] name "Ugh... I can... bear it... "
set key[id=831174302002286] name "Never mind me... hurry to $map:02000090$...!!"
set key[id=831174302002287] name "Never mind me... hurry to $map:02000090$...!!"
set key[id=831174302002288] name "Uuugh... "
set key[id=831174302002289] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=831174302002290] name "That... that is... we were ambushed... \nWe were chasing the red cloak when \
    suddenly $npc:23000025[gender:1]$ appeared here in $map:02000206$,\nattacked the squad, and vanished into \
    $map:02000206$\nwith the red cloak."
set key[id=831174302002291] name "It was truly... in an instant... \nI thought... we'd almost caught the red \
    cloak... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002292] name "Right now... please go back to $map:02000001$ and report the situation here\nto \
    $npc:11000119[gender:0]$..."
set key[id=831174302002293] name "We must gather reinforcements... and go to $map:02000206$, where the red cloak \
    vanished..."
set key[id=831174302002294] name "Right now... please go back to $map:02000001$ and report the situation here\nto \
    $npc:11000119[gender:0]$..."
set key[id=831174302002295] name "$MyPCName$!\nSo, how did it go?"
set key[id=831174302002296] name "I report on the situation at $map:02000090$."
set key[id=831174302002297] name "$map:02000206$...? \nHmm... <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000057[gender:1]$</font>... commanding <font color=\"#ffd200\">Devlins</font>... and \
    now <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000025[gender:1]$</font> too...?"
set key[id=831174302002298] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000057[gender:1]$</font> seems to have \
    considerable influence in the Land of Darkness... \nIf the pursuit team was beaten that badly, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000025[gender:1]$</font> is no pushover either.\nWe'll need solid preparation to \
    subdue $npc:23000025[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302002299] name "$MyPCName$!\nGo to $map:02000025$ and tell $npc:11000075[gender:1]$ the news \
    about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$.\nShe must be very anxious to hear it."
set key[id=831174302002300] name "$MyPCName$!\nGo to $map:02000025$ and tell $npc:11000075[gender:1]$ the news \
    about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$.\nShe must be very anxious to hear it."
set key[id=831174302002301] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=831174302002302] name "I deliver the news about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302002303] name "I see... \nOh... $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... I hope she can come back safe and \
    sound...  "
set key[id=831174302002304] name "Please tell the Chancellor the news about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$, too.\nHe \
    doesn't show it, but he must be more eager to hear about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ than anyone."
set key[id=831174302002305] name "Torn between his duty as Royal Chancellor and his tender love for his \
    daughter... \nhe has suffered greatly, yet if the same situation came again, he would choose to protect me\nas \
    the Royal Chancellor, not as a father.\nI don't want to give him the same pain again."
set key[id=831174302002306] name "Go and tell him. \nWe will surely bring $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ back to \
    us.\nAnd that he must not give up on $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ by making the same choice as before."
set key[id=831174302002307] name "Please tell the Chancellor the news about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$, too.\nHe \
    doesn't show it, but he must be more eager to hear about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ than anyone."
set key[id=831174302002308] name "You look like you have something to tell me."
set key[id=831174302002309] name "I deliver the news about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ and the Empress's words."
set key[id=831174302002310] name "Haa... I'm ashamed... \nAs Royal Chancellor, I should put the safety of this \
    world before all else... \nyet I'm making the world even more dangerous... "
set key[id=831174302002311] name "When $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... that child attacked me... \nI had a chance... \
    to end her life with these hands... \nBut I couldn't bring myself to... \nThat moment of hesitation is \
    endangering the Empress, and the world."
set key[id=831174302002312] name "Even now, as I speak to you, I am hesitating... \nEven though I know what must \
    be done... I can't bring myself to move... "
set key[id=831174302002386] name "$MyPCName$! \nI have a favor to ask."
set key[id=831174302002387] name "I ask what it is."
set key[id=831174302002388] name "Please deliver this $item:30000183$ to $npc:11000031[gender:0]$ of \
    $map:02000023$.\nHe may be able to find a way to save $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ from the pit of evil\nand bring \
    her back to us."
set key[id=831174302002389] name "Did you forget something?"
set key[id=831174302002390] name "I say I left the $item:30000183$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002391] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302002392] name "Ah, I see. Here you go.\nPlease be careful not to lose it again."
set key[id=831174302002393] name "Please check your bag once more."
set key[id=831174302002394] name "Your bag looks too heavy... You should tidy it up."
set key[id=831174302002395] name "Please deliver the $item:30000183$ to $npc:11000031[gender:0]$ of \
    $map:02000023$.\nHe may be able to find a way to save $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ from the pit of evil\nand bring \
    her back to us."
set key[id=831174302002396] name "Young adventurer, have you come to see me?"
set key[id=831174302002397] name "I hand over the $item:30000183$."
set key[id=831174302002398] name "Oho... So you were the messenger $npc:11000075[gender:1]$ sent...?\nForgive me \
    for not recognizing you. Hohoho.\nNow then... let's see why the Empress wrote to me..."
set key[id=831174302002399] name "Hmm... This is no easy problem... "
set key[id=831174302002400] name "Find any way at all to save $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... Hmm... \nRestoring that \
    child's soul from the Demon Lord's control is impossible\nwith us fairies' magic."
set key[id=831174302002401] name "But... if we turn the witches' soul curse around, it may be possible.\nLet's try \
    to find a way, at least.\nGo straight to $map:02000215$, find $map:02000019$, and\nmeet \
    $npc:11000282[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302002402] name "$npc:11000282[gender:0]$ must be keeping the book left by the ancient witch \
    Akabonari,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000191$</font>. We absolutely need that book to understand\nthe \
    true witches' soul curse!"
set key[id=831174302002403] name "Of course, $npc:11000282[gender:0]$ won't hand it over easily without \
    conditions.\nBut somehow, persuade him and bring back the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000191$</font>."
set key[id=831174302002404] name "Of course, $npc:11000282[gender:0]$ won't hand it over easily without \
    conditions.\nBut somehow, persuade him and bring back the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000191$</font>."
set key[id=831174302002405] name "What's this? How did you get in here?"
set key[id=831174302002406] name "I say I'm looking for the $item:30000191$."
set key[id=831174302002407] name "Do you think it's like an ant lying by the roadside?\nNot a chance~!"
set key[id=831174302002408] name "Well... anyway, as promised you brought the $item:30000184$, so I'll let \
    you\ntake the $item:30000191$."
set key[id=831174302002409] name "I ask him to give me the $item:30000191$."
set key[id=831174302002410] name "I said I'd permit you to take it, not that I'd find it for you?\nFind it \
    yourself~"
set key[id=831174302002411] name "I ask for at least a hint."
set key[id=831174302002412] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Don't blindly believe what you see.</font>\nThe books I \
    truly treasure, I keep in a secret space only I know about.\nFind the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000219$ \
    hidden behind the bookshelves</font> of this library.\nThe $item:30000191$ is inside."
set key[id=831174302002413] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Don't blindly believe what you see.</font>\nThe books I \
    truly treasure, I keep in a secret space only I know about.\nFind the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000219$ \
    hidden behind the bookshelves</font> of this library.\nThe $item:30000191$ is inside."
set key[id=831174302002414] name "Ah, you're back. \nI'm sure $npc:11000282[gender:0]$ was quite fussy... Good \
    work."
set key[id=831174302002415] name "I won't allow a single book from my library to leave it.\nDo you know how I \
    collected them? How dare you eye them?"
set key[id=831174302002416] name "I say we really need the $item:30000191$."
set key[id=831174302002417] name "Fine! Then go and get that for me."
set key[id=831174302002418] name "I ask what it is."
set key[id=831174302002419] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000184$</font>!!\nThere's a travelogue compiled \
    from the adventure journals of an ancient adventurer\ncalled <font color=\"#ffd200\">Hephaisto</font>.\nA vast \
    record of adventures in 65,365 volumes. And in one of them... "
set key[id=831174302002420] name "there's a story about the legendary beast <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Stonyconda</font>, said to have fallen into the lava\nat the top of the Perion cliffs and \
    died... In the scorching lava its body melted away without\na trace, but its heart alone kept thumping and \
    drifting along with the lava, they say."
set key[id=831174302002421] name "The record says <font color=\"#ffd200\">Hephaisto</font> did find that heart in \
    the end and hid it in a place\nonly he knew. \nBut which of those 65,365 volumes holds that record, even I \
    don't know."
set key[id=831174302002422] name "If you find the travelogue marking that place and bring back the \
    $item:30000184$,\nI'll tell you what you want to know. "
set key[id=831174302002423] name "There's a travelogue compiled from the adventure journals of an ancient \
    adventurer\ncalled <font color=\"#ffd200\">Hephaisto</font>.\nSearch through that vast record of 65,365 \
    volumes and bring back the $item:30000184$."
set key[id=831174302002424] name "Hmm...? \nCould it be... you really found the $item:30000184$...?"
set key[id=831174302002425] name "I hand over the $item:30000184$."
set key[id=831174302002426] name "Wh... what a ruthless one you are!\nYou really dug through the lava pit and \
    brought this back?"
set key[id=831174302002427] name "I ask how he knows I dug it out of a lava pit."
set key[id=831174302002428] name "Ah, th... that's... \nBecause this drifted along with the lava, so... well... "
set key[id=831174302002429] name "I ask if he knew where the $item:30000184$ was hidden from the start."
set key[id=831174302002430] name "Y... yes! I knew. So what? What are you going to do about it?\nDid you think \
    there'd be a book in my library that I don't know about? Ahem!"
set key[id=831174302002431] name "$MyPCName$! \nI'm deciphering the $item:30000191$ you brought me last time.\nThe \
    witches' language... it's taking me quite a while, even me... "
set key[id=831174302002432] name "Sigh... Anyway, I finally found the pages on the soul curse and finished \
    deciphering up to the\nmiddle. It says the witches' soul curse requires something called the $item:30000187$."
set key[id=831174302002433] name "The $item:30000187$ is passed down only to witches, one each, like a part of \
    themselves, so\nthey won't lend it to just anyone... \nWhile I decipher the rest, can you get the \
    $item:30000187$?"
set key[id=831174302002434] name "I'll give it a try."
set key[id=831174302002435] name "Then somewhere in $map:02000006$, they say $npc:11000304[gender:1]$ runs the \
    $map:02000073$.\nGo find her and borrow the $item:30000187$."
set key[id=831174302002436] name "Then somewhere in $map:02000006$, they say $npc:11000304[gender:1]$ runs the \
    $map:02000073$.\nGo find her and borrow the $item:30000187$."
set key[id=831174302002437] name "If you're not buying, get out~"
set key[id=831174302002438] name "I ask to borrow the $item:30000187$."
set key[id=831174302002439] name "What are you on about~\nDo you even know what it is, asking to borrow it? \
    Unbelievable... "
set key[id=831174302002440] name "You may not know yet what you've done, but anyway, it helped me a lot.\nI'll \
    lend you the $item:30000187$.\nBut... you... $npc:11000031[gender:0]$ sent you, didn't he?"
set key[id=831174302002441] name "How did you know?"
set key[id=831174302002442] name "Because I'm a witch. Heh heh.\nWell... I don't particularly like fairies, but \
    what I'm doing with my $item:30000187$ might\nactually help the witches... "
set key[id=831174302002443] name "I ask how it will help the witches."
set key[id=831174302002444] name "Well, you'll see in time.\nAnyway, I hid the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000187$</font> <font color=\"#ffd200\">under the big lake in the middle of \
    $map:02000006$</font>.\nIt's hidden down there."
set key[id=831174302002445] name "A silly fairy called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000284[gender:1]$</font> \
    wanders around there. Look near her and\nyou'll find a <font color=\"#ffd200\">pink-leaf tree</font>.\nNext to \
    that tree there's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">secret path down into the lake</font>."
set key[id=831174302002446] name "Follow that path down and look carefully at the <font color=\"#ffd200\">lake \
    bottom</font>, and you'll see a <font color=\"#ffd200\">small jar</font>.\nThe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000187$</font> is inside that jar, so take it out and go."
set key[id=831174302002447] name "Anyway, I hid the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000187$</font> <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">under the big lake in the middle of $map:02000006$</font>.\nLook carefully at the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">lake bottom</font> and you'll see a <font color=\"#ffd200\">small jar</font>.\nThe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000187$</font> is inside that jar,\nso take it out and go."
set key[id=831174302002448] name "Ahh... you look far more worn out than when you came back from meeting \
    $npc:11000282[gender:0]$\nlast time... $npc:11000304[gender:1]$ must have given you a hard time."
set key[id=831174302002449] name "I hand over the $item:30000187$."
set key[id=831174302002450] name "So this is... the $item:30000187$...\nI've finished deciphering the \
    $item:30000191$ too, and unraveled the secret of the soul curse...  "
set key[id=831174302002451] name "The soul curse the witches originally used worked by keeping a cursed dark soul \
    in this\n$item:30000187$, casting the spell on the target, drawing out the pure soul, and\ninjecting the dark \
    soul held in the $item:30000187$."
set key[id=831174302002452] name "To save $npc:11000057[gender:1]$, we have to use this method in reverse: we must \
    fill\nthe $item:30000187$ with a soul pure enough to cleanse $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s memories and \
    soul...\nFor that, it seems we'll have to enter\nthe <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dimension of Souls</font>."
set key[id=831174302002453] name "I ask what the Dimension of Souls is."
set key[id=831174302002454] name "It's where pure, clear souls in their original state gather.\nA supreme world \
    completely separate from the world we live in now...\nTo get there, you must not miss the moment when the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Green Lapenta of Life</font>\nreaches perfect resonance."
set key[id=831174302002455] name "Only at that moment are the boundaries between the Dimension of Souls and \
    reality briefly erased,\nlinking them into a single dimension.\nIt is the only moment a living person can \
    enter the world of souls,\nand also a moment that defies the order of life, which divides life from death."
set key[id=831174302002456] name "Return to $map:02000025$ and tell $npc:11000075[gender:1]$ the news.\nThis \
    matter calls for the utmost caution... "
set key[id=831174302002457] name "Return to $map:02000025$ and tell $npc:11000075[gender:1]$ the news.\nThis \
    matter calls for the utmost caution... "
set key[id=831174302002458] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nHow did it go?"
set key[id=831174302002459] name "I pass on $npc:11000031[gender:0]$'s words."
set key[id=831174302002460] name "I see... The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Green Lapenta</font>... hmm...\nThis has \
    truly become something that demands deep deliberation...  "
set key[id=831174302002461] name "What do you want to do with the $item:30000187$ you're borrowing?\nDo you even \
    know how to use it?"
set key[id=831174302002462] name "I say she'll find out soon."
set key[id=831174302002463] name "Confident, aren't you... \nIf I lend it to you, what will you do for me?"
set key[id=831174302002464] name "I say she can tell me what she wants."
set key[id=831174302002465] name "Oh? \nThen find all of my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000072$</font> that \
    those <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000266$</font> swallowed.\nBring back every one of them.\nWhile you're \
    gone, I'll think about whether to help you."
set key[id=831174302002466] name "I ask how I'm supposed to get back swallowed $item:30000072$."
set key[id=831174302002467] name "The $npc:21000266$ stuff their bellies with the waterfall at $map:02000113$, \
    so\nmy <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000072$</font> must still be swimming around in their stomachs.\nHurry \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000113$</font> and bring back my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000072$</font>\nthat the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000266$</font> swallowed~ "
set key[id=831174302002468] name "The $npc:21000266$ stuff their bellies with the waterfall at $map:02000113$, \
    so\nmy <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000072$</font> must still be swimming around in their stomachs.\nHurry \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000113$</font> and bring back my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000072$</font>\nthat the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000266$</font> swallowed~ "
set key[id=831174302002469] name "Are you sure you really got the $item:30000072$?\nCome on, take them out and \
    show me."
set key[id=831174302002470] name "I hand over the $item:30000072$."
set key[id=831174302002471] name "Oooh~ my precious little darlings... how scared you must have been~ in that \
    pitch-black belly... \nIt's all right, it's all right, you're home again, so relax~"
set key[id=831174302002480] name "$MyPCName$!\nYou told me that in order for $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ to be able \
    to come back to us,\nwe must go to $map:02000220$, didn't you?"
set key[id=831174302002481] name "Since then I have deliberated again and again.\nAs $npc:11000031[gender:0]$ \
    said... in a way, a living person entering $map:02000220$\nmay defy and disturb the order of life.\nBut \
    bringing $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ back whole is also the first step toward setting the world right\nfrom the \
    chaos engulfing it now."
set key[id=831174302002482] name "Of course it won't be easy, but not only for $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ but to \
    save this crumbling world,\nsomeone must do it.\nI understand that a living person must risk their life to \
    enter $map:02000220$.\nBridging the gap between this life and the soul is never easy... "
set key[id=831174302002483] name "Only with an extremely strong mind and will can one bridge that gap and return \
    safely\nto life."
set key[id=831174302002484] name "$MyPCName$.\nSo now I am about to ask you for something very difficult and \
    shameless.\nWould you risk your life for this world\nand enter $map:02000220$?"
set key[id=831174302002485] name "Got it."
set key[id=831174302002486] name "Thank you. Your firm resolve and composed spirit will become a light for the \
    world.\nGo straight to $map:02000023$, meet $npc:11000031[gender:0]$,\ntell him what I said, and follow his \
    guidance."
set key[id=831174302002487] name "Go straight to $map:02000023$, meet $npc:11000031[gender:0]$,\ntell him what I \
    said, and follow his guidance."
set key[id=831174302002488] name "Oh, $MyPCName$!\nAre you coming from $map:02000025$?"
set key[id=831174302002489] name "I pass on $npc:11000075[gender:1]$'s message."
set key[id=831174302002490] name "If that is the Empress's wish... then following it is the right thing to do... "
set key[id=831174302002675] name "The truth is, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Green Lapenta</font> standing in \
    $map:02000023$ now is not the real one.\nIt is like an illusion, a projection of the real Lapenta's \
    energy.\nAlso, many think I am the guardian of the Green Lapenta, but...\nthe one who actually guards it is \
    $npc:11000032[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302002676] name "All of this was to deceive the eyes of the enemies who covet the Lapenta and to \
    keep\nthe Green Lapenta and its guardian $npc:11000032[gender:0]$ safe. "
set key[id=831174302002677] name "Now and then $npc:11000068[gender:0]$, $npc:11000032[gender:0]$'s doppelganger, \
    goes after the Lapenta and\nattacks the barrier of life... \nbut with the help of righteous \
    heroes,\n$npc:11000032[gender:0]$ protects the Lapenta well."
set key[id=831174302002678] name "I ask for details about the doppelganger."
set key[id=831174302002679] name "In this world, <font color=\"#ffd200\">good and evil are kept in the same \
    balance</font>.\nJust as good and evil coexist in a person's heart, the power and amount of good and evil in \
    the world\nare held in a precarious balance, which is an absolute, unchanging truth\nof the world we live in."
set key[id=831174302002680] name "Amid all that, there's a truth that circulates as if it were a mere rumor.\nThe \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">doppelganger</font>!!\nA single being, yet divided into <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">absolute good</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">absolute evil</font>...\nUnlike ordinary \
    people in whom good and evil coexist, one side is <font color=\"#ffd200\">absolute good</font> and the \
    other\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">absolute evil</font>."
set key[id=831174302002681] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000685[gender:0]$</font> is that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">absolute good</font>, and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000068[gender:0]$</font> is\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">absolute evil</font>. They are separate, but share one fate.\nIn other words, when one \
    side's life ends,\nthe other's naturally ends too."
set key[id=831174302002682] name "The reason <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000068[gender:0]$</font> was able to \
    assault the dimensional gate leading to $map:02000179$,\nwhere the real Lapenta exists, is that as a Lapenta \
    guardian he too shares\na fate with $npc:11000685[gender:0]$.\nHe indirectly felt the Lapenta's power and was \
    drawn here by its energy."
set key[id=831174302002683] name "For now... the only way is to seal $npc:11000068[gender:0]$ away in the Shadow \
    World... \nThere is no other way.\nIf we kill $npc:11000068[gender:0]$, $npc:11000685[gender:0]$ would lose \
    his life too... \nWe can't let that happen, can we... "
set key[id=831174302002684] name "Now is the time to do everything we can for those we must protect...\nFollowing \
    $npc:11000075[gender:1]$'s wishes, go to $map:02000220$ and bring back\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s pure soul \
    in this $item:30000107$."
set key[id=831174302002685] name "I ask how to get to $map:02000220$."
set key[id=831174302002686] name "As I said before, $map:02000220$ is a world of a completely different dimension \
    from life.\nThere are moments when the life energy of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">real Green Lapenta</font> \
    you saw in\n$map:02000179$ is at its peak. \nAt those times, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000227$</font> \
    linking the Dimension of Souls and the living world opens.\n"
set key[id=831174302002687] name "And right now, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000227$</font> is open.\nDo \
    you remember I said the one at the bottom of $map:02000023$ is an illusion\nprojected from the real Green \
    Lapenta's energy?\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000227$</font> should be open on the shaded forest path \
    behind it.\n "
set key[id=831174302002688] name "$npc:11000685[gender:0]$ will help you at the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000227$</font>,\nso go on, hurry. "
set key[id=831174302002689] name "Why are you back already?"
set key[id=831174302002690] name "I say I left the $item:30000107$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002691] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302002692] name "Heh heh... leaving such an important item behind... Take better care of it.\nYou \
    do understand how important a task you're on, don't you?"
set key[id=831174302002693] name "I saw you put it in your bag earlier... \nHave you checked your bag properly? \
    Look once more."
set key[id=831174302002694] name "Your bag looks quite heavy... \nWhy not tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=831174302002695] name "Go to $map:02000220$ and bring back $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s pure soul\nin \
    this $item:30000107$."
set key[id=831174302002696] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$.\nI've been waiting for you. "
set key[id=831174302002697] name "You probably know already, but $map:02000220$ is a place you can't enter while \
    living your\nlife in the living world.\nSo I prepared a <font color=\"#ffd200\">Soul Lantern</font> that \
    temporarily strengthens your soul's energy\nto narrow the gap between dimensions.\n"
set key[id=831174302002698] name "Do you see the log behind me, brightly lit with a <font color=\"#ffd200\">Soul \
    Lantern</font>?\nAbsorb the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Soul Lantern</font> completely there, and then\nenter \
    $map:02000220$.\nIf you don't absorb the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Soul Lantern</font>, you'll collapse in an \
    instant in $map:02000220$. "
set key[id=831174302002699] name "$MyPCName$, you were chosen by $npc:11000075[gender:1]$, so you're someone \
    special...\nI believe you'll endure it and come back safely."
set key[id=831174302002700] name "What's the matter?"
set key[id=831174302002701] name "I say I left the $item:30000107$ behind."
set key[id=831174302002702] name "I say I took a wrong turn."
set key[id=831174302002703] name "Ah!! It's useless without this.\nHere you go. "
set key[id=831174302002704] name "I think you put it in your bag earlier... \nDid you look inside your bag?"
set key[id=831174302002705] name "Carrying such a heavy bag could make things harder for you in \
    $map:02000220$.\nYou should tidy your bag before you go."
set key[id=831174302002706] name "Ah... are you feeling dizzy, perhaps? Once you enter $map:02000220$, \nyou may \
    get even more lost than now... Rest a moment before you go."
set key[id=831174302002707] name "You found $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul, hardened stiff."
set key[id=831174302002708] name "Even in front of $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul, hardened into solid stone, the \
    $item:30000107$ doesn't seem\nto react at all.\nReturn to $map:02000227$."
set key[id=831174302002709] name "Even in front of $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul, hardened into solid stone, the \
    $item:30000107$ doesn't seem\nto react at all.\nReturn to $map:02000227$."
set key[id=831174302002710] name "$MyPCName$.\nYour face... what is it... did something happen in $map:02000220$?"
set key[id=831174302002711] name "I say $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul was hardened stiff."
set key[id=831174302002712] name "Her soul... was hardened...?\nTh... that's... "
set key[id=831174302002713] name "I ask if she knows why $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul hardened."
set key[id=831174302002714] name "$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ must have struggled for a long time to avoid being \
    tainted by evil... \nBefore the Demon Lord's overwhelming power, $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ seems to have buried \
    and hidden her true self\ndeep inside without even realizing it.\nPerhaps... we may not be able to bring \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ back."
set key[id=831174302002715] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Self Seal</font>... unless $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ \
    breaks it herself... \nno one... can help her... "
set key[id=831174302002716] name "In this state... even the $item:30000107$ is useless.\nThere's no way to find \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s pure soul to put into it... "
set key[id=831174302002717] name "In this state... even the $item:30000107$ is useless.\nThere's no way to find \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s pure soul to put into it... "
set key[id=831174302002718] name "Your face is dark... \nWhat... happened? "
set key[id=831174302002719] name "I tell him what happened in $map:02000220$."
set key[id=831174302002720] name "Hmm... oh dear... $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... how painful it must have been for \
    her to do this herself... \nHaa... is this the end... "
set key[id=831174302002721] name "After all this, it feels like we've come right back to where we started... \
    \nYou've worked so hard to come this far with us, too...\nAnd now, how are we to break this news to \
    $npc:11000075[gender:1]$... sigh... "
set key[id=831174302002722] name "$MyPCName$, \nplease break it to the Empress gently so she isn't shocked."
set key[id=831174302002723] name "$MyPCName$, \nplease break it to the Empress gently so she isn't shocked."
set key[id=831174302002724] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nI've been waiting. How did it go?"
set key[id=831174302002725] name "I carefully tell her exactly what happened."
set key[id=831174302002726] name "Then... the plan to bring $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ back to us... \nhas come to \
    nothing?"
set key[id=831174302002727] name "I say it seems so."
set key[id=831174302002728] name "Haa... I see... \nI expected it wouldn't be easy... but now that it has come to \
    this... \nI can't think of anything more to do... or how... "
set key[id=831174302002729] name "Must we truly... give up on $npc:11000057[gender:1]$, that child...?"
set key[id=831174302002730] name "How can I tell the Chancellor this news... I don't have the nerve to look him in \
    the face.\nIt will be hard, but... could you, $MyPCName$, bring him the news along with some comfort?\nAnd \
    please tell him not to give up yet."
set key[id=831174302002731] name "Could you, $MyPCName$, bring the Chancellor the news along with some \
    comfort?\nAnd please tell him not to give up yet."
set key[id=831174302002732] name "Your face is very dark... \nYou don't need to say it... I understand... My \
    daughter... can't be saved, can she?"
set key[id=831174302002733] name "I offer words of comfort."
set key[id=831174302002734] name "...... ...... Yes...... I see...... "
set key[id=831174302002735] name "Listen... $MyPCName$... \nI have a favor to ask... Elmin is also waiting \
    for\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ to come back... "
set key[id=831174302002736] name "So that she doesn't wait in vain hope for a sister who can't return... \nplease \
    bring her the news of $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... \nTell her that now we, too, must let \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ go from our hearts... "
set key[id=831174302002737] name "So that Elmin doesn't wait in vain hope for a sister who can't return... \
    \nplease bring her the news of $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... \nTell her that now we, too, must let \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ go from our hearts... "
set key[id=831174302002738] name "Ah, welcome, $MyPCName$. \nI heard you set out on the Empress's orders to find a \
    way to save our\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$!"
set key[id=831174302002739] name "How did it... go?\nCan our $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ be saved?"
set key[id=831174302002740] name "I tell her everything as it is."
set key[id=831174302002741] name "Oh no... no... it can't be... it can't be... \nSob sob sob... "
set key[id=831174302002742] name "$MyPCName$! You came just in time!"
set key[id=831174302002743] name "I ask what happened."
set key[id=831174302002744] name "The red cloak... or should I call her <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000057[gender:1]$</font> now... \nAnyway, the Shadow Legion came down on us like a \
    storm.\n$npc:11000119[gender:0]$ and $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ happened to arrive leading reinforcements,\nso \
    the damage wasn't great... but otherwise it would have been truly terrible."
set key[id=831174302002745] name "Enough about the past... $MyPCName$!\nI'd like you to join the reinforcements \
    led by $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ and $npc:11000015[gender:1]$\nright now and lend them your strength."
set key[id=831174302002746] name "I ask where the reinforcements went."
set key[id=831174302002747] name "They say there was a deep tunnel by the road leading to $map:02000145$.\nThe \
    entrance was too narrow for all the reinforcements, so $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ and \
    $npc:11000015[gender:1]$\npicked only elite members and went in after $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... "
set key[id=831174302002748] name "They haven't come back yet, and I'm getting more worried.\nHurry after \
    $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ and $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ and\nhelp them."
set key[id=831174302002749] name "They haven't come back yet, and I'm getting more worried.\nHurry after \
    $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ and $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ and\nhelp them."
set key[id=831174302002750] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=831174302002751] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=831174302002752] name "It's a trap! This place is practically a den of Land of Darkness monsters. \
    \n$npc:11000119[gender:0]$ blocked $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s attack in my place... and then...!"
set key[id=831174302002753] name "We don't have time for this.\nI'll take care of $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ and \
    bring him to Guardian HQ.\nPlease chase after $npc:11000057[gender:1]$, $MyPCName$. "
set key[id=831174302002754] name "If we lose $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ again... \nthe chance to bring her back to \
    us may be gone forever!"
set key[id=831174302002755] name "I'll take care of $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ and bring him to Guardian HQ.\nPlease \
    chase after $npc:11000057[gender:1]$, $MyPCName$. "
set key[id=831174302002756] name "Ugh... We almost... had her... but we lost... her.\nWith a vigilante arrow... \
    lodged in $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s leg... she... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002757] name "She hasn't... gotten out of $map:02000146$ yet... ugh... \nPlease request... \
    reinforcements from Guardian HQ... quickly... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002758] name "She hasn't... gotten out of $map:02000146$ yet... ugh... \nPlease request... \
    reinforcements from Guardian HQ... quickly... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002759] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!\n$npc:11000015[gender:1]$, who returned first, told me \
    everything."
set key[id=831174302002760] name "I pass on $npc:11000703[gender:1]$'s message."
set key[id=831174302002761] name "Even now the Guardians are combing every corner of $map:02000146$\nfor traces of \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$.\nIf she's wounded, she can't have gone far...  "
set key[id=831174302002762] name "I ask what happened to $npc:11000119[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302002763] name "The wound was deeper than expected, so after first aid here we moved him\nto \
    $map:02000001$. He's a tough one... I believe he'll recover soon... "
set key[id=831174302002990] name "As expected... I do have an eye for people.\nEverything I say and every order I \
    give you from now on is classified.\nKeep that in mind."
set key[id=831174302002991] name "For a while now, the Secret Knights have been selecting a few skilled former \
    spies\nand trying to infiltrate the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=831174302002992] name "Isn't going to the Land of Darkness forbidden?"
set key[id=831174302002993] name "Of course. That's to keep ordinary residents safe and to minimize the energy the \
    Land of Darkness gives off.\n\nBut just guarding this place without knowing anything about the Land of \
    Darkness\nisn't much help."
set key[id=831174302002994] name "Know your enemy and know yourself, and you'll win a hundred battles!\nTo catch a \
    tiger, you have to enter the tiger's den!\nIf you understand what that means, you'll see the point of this \
    operation.\nIt's better to experience it yourself than just hear about it, right...?"
set key[id=831174302002995] name "Your first assignment is <font color=\"#ffd200\">to deliver this $item:30000217$ \
    to $npc:11000804[gender:0]$,\nthe special agent who infiltrated the Land of Darkness</font>.\nThink you can do \
    it?"
set key[id=831174302002996] name "I'll give it a try."
set key[id=831174302002997] name "Good! They say $npc:11000804[gender:0]$ is staying at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:03009001$</font>.\nPass through the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Gate</font> you see \
    over there and you can reach the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>."
set key[id=831174302002998] name "I'll say it again... the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font> is \
    nothing like here.\nNever forget that it's hard to predict when and where danger will appear before \
    you.\nAlways be careful. Understood?"
set key[id=831174302002999] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302003000] name "Could I have the $item:30000217$?"
set key[id=831174302003001] name "I forgot where I'm supposed to go."
set key[id=831174302003002] name "Where is your head at?\nBe careful not to make this mistake again! Understood?"
set key[id=831174302003003] name "Hey, $MyPCName$!\nAre you nervous? You're already holding the $item:30000217$!"
set key[id=831174302003004] name "Your bag is full.\nWhy not throw away the useless stuff and tidy up?"
set key[id=831174302003005] name "Good! They say $npc:11000804[gender:0]$ is staying at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:03009001$</font>.\nPass through the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Gate</font> you see \
    over there and you can reach the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>."
set key[id=831174302003006] name "Hmm... I don't recognize you. Where did you come from?"
set key[id=831174302003007] name "I brought the $item:30000217$."
set key[id=831174302003008] name "Did $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$ send you?\nShh...! Give me the $item:30000217$ \
    before anyone sees."
set key[id=831174302003010] name "Hmm... You're tougher than you look.\nThe road here couldn't have been easy."
set key[id=831174302003011] name "Did you see any $npc:40000024$ on the way?"
set key[id=831174302003012] name "I did."
set key[id=831174302003013] name "I didn't."
set key[id=831174302003014] name "Is that so? How was it? \nDid you think you could stand up to them?"
set key[id=831174302003015] name "No problem."
set key[id=831174302003016] name "I'm not confident."
set key[id=831174302003017] name "You were lucky.\nIf they'd caught you, you might not have made it here in one \
    piece.\nBut to survive in the Land of Darkness, you'll face far stronger foes than that."
set key[id=831174302003018] name "Go outside right now and face the $npc:40000024$ head on.\nStake your own honor \
    on it."
set key[id=831174302003019] name "Confident, aren't you! Then prove your skill.\nIt won't be as easy as you \
    think."
set key[id=831174302003020] name "That's not something I'd expect from someone $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$ sent \
    all this way.\nWith a spirit that weak, you can't last here!"
set key[id=831174302003021] name "If you won't go out and face the $npc:40000024$ head on right now,\nthen run \
    straight back to Maple World and live with the shame for the rest of your life!"
set key[id=831174302003022] name "Go outside right now and face the $npc:40000024$ head on.\nStake your own honor \
    on it."
set key[id=831174302003023] name "You came back... I'll give you that.\nI thought you'd have fled straight back to \
    Victoria Island."
set key[id=831174302003024] name "Not running away at all earns you credit for persistence.\nYour skill... well... \
    it still isn't perfect, but... "
set key[id=831174302003025] name "Now, go back the way you came and give this to \
    $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$.\nIt's the report on the secret orders you brought.\nDon't let your guard down on \
    the way back!"
set key[id=831174302003026] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302003027] name "Could I have the $item:30000218$?"
set key[id=831174302003028] name "I forgot where I'm supposed to go."
set key[id=831174302003029] name "Wandering around with your head in the clouds, you'll get a tour of the \
    afterlife before you ever reach Maple World.\nBe careful not to make this mistake again! Understood?"
set key[id=831174302003030] name "Hey, $MyPCName$!\nYou're already holding the $item:30000218$!"
set key[id=831174302003031] name "Your bag is full.\nWhy not throw away the useless stuff and tidy up?"
set key[id=831174302003032] name "Did you forget the way back already?\nHead to the southern edge of \
    $map:03000014$. That should jog your memory."
set key[id=831174302003033] name "$MyPCName$! You made it back safely.\nDid you deliver the secret orders to \
    $npcName:11000804[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302003034] name "(Hand over the $item:30000218$.)"
set key[id=831174302003035] name "Heh heh... Well done. You've completed your first assignment safely!\nStand by \
    until the next order."
set key[id=831174302003036] name "$MyPCName$.\nThere's another mission waiting for you in the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=831174302003037] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302003038] name "$npcName:11000804[gender:0]$ will give you the details.\nFor now, head to \
    $map:03009001$. "
set key[id=831174302003039] name "Did you forget how to get to $map:03009001$?\nJust pass through the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Gate</font> in the center there.\nRemember it next time."
set key[id=831174302003040] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$.\nI've been expecting you."
set key[id=831174302003041] name "What happened?"
set key[id=831174302003042] name "Do you remember <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000046$</font>?\nThe one the \
    head of the Barota Company secretly circulated along with $item:20000015$... "
set key[id=831174302003043] name "(Say you remember.)"
set key[id=831174302003044] name "I don't remember."
set key[id=831174302003045] name "A while ago I caught $npcName:11000070[gender:0]$ over there selling \
    $item:20000046$ to patients\nat a steep price."
set key[id=831174302003046] name "This might be our chance to uproot the illegally circulating $item:20000046$\nin \
    Victoria Island!"
set key[id=831174302003047] name "I heard it was you who found the $item:20000046$ among the Barota Company' \
    warehouse goods...?\nIs it too long ago for you to remember?\nOr is your memory... ahem. Anyway... "
set key[id=831174302003048] name "A while ago I caught $npc:11000070[gender:0]$ over there selling $item:20000046$ \
    to patients\nat a steep price."
set key[id=831174302003049] name "This might be our chance to uproot the illegally circulating $item:20000046$\nin \
    Victoria Island!"
set key[id=831174302003050] name "We need to use $npcName:11000070[gender:0]$ to find out <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">where $item:20000046$ is made\nand how it's distributed</font>."
set key[id=831174302003051] name "$MyPCName$, approach $npc:11000070[gender:0]$ as if you've come to buy \
    $item:20000046$\nand find out its source and distribution route."
set key[id=831174302003052] name "$npc:11000070[gender:0]$ is extremely sharp, so be especially careful\nnot to \
    blow your cover."
set key[id=831174302003053] name "Hmm... You don't look sick. What did you come here for?"
set key[id=831174302003054] name "I want to buy $item:20000046$."
set key[id=831174302003055] name "$item:20000046$, huh... Hmm... Hmm... \nWho told you that you could get it from \
    me?"
set key[id=831174302003056] name "I heard about it by chance while wandering around."
set key[id=831174302003057] name "Hmm... Have you ever taken $item:20000046$?\nDo you know what happens when you \
    do, and you're still looking for it?"
set key[id=831174302003058] name "It makes you sleepy."
set key[id=831174302003059] name "It makes you giggle and pass out."
set key[id=831174302003060] name "It makes your body grow big."
set key[id=831174302003061] name "Hmph, a rookie who knows nothing about $item:20000046$...!"
set key[id=831174302003062] name "So you do know a bit about $item:20000046$...!"
set key[id=831174302003063] name "So... how high a price did you come prepared to pay?"
set key[id=831174302003064] name "You name a price first."
set key[id=831174302003065] name "I haven't looked into it."
set key[id=831174302003066] name "Heh... So you want to haggle over the price...?\nYou've done some dealing, I \
    see."
set key[id=831174302003067] name "Well... fine! \nI'm not the kind who deals in mesos and the like. \
    \n$item:30000194$... Bring me that and I'll give you what you want."
set key[id=831174302003068] name "What do you need the $item:30000194$ for?"
set key[id=831174302003069] name "Heh... You're really the kind who gets ripped off everywhere you go.\nAnyway, I \
    don't deal in mesos. \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000194$</font>... Bring me that and I'll give you what \
    you want."
set key[id=831174302003070] name "What do you need the $item:30000194$ for?"
set key[id=831174302003071] name "Heh. Even a worthless stone fragment has its uses.\nDon't ask more. This world \
    gets more dangerous the more you try to know needlessly.\nJust go get some <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000194$</font>."
set key[id=831174302003072] name "You can get $item:30000194$ by hunting the monsters roaming around this Land of \
    Darkness.\nIt's not easy,\nbut in a way it's simple too... Anyway, figure it out yourself."
set key[id=831174302003073] name "Heh heh. You were gone so long I thought you'd given up... \nYou actually got \
    it. Impressive."
set key[id=831174302003074] name "But what do we do now? Heh heh.\nThe $item:20000046$ is all sold out."
set key[id=831174302003075] name "(Keep your promise!)"
set key[id=831174302003076] name "(Give me back the $item:30000194$.)"
set key[id=831174302003077] name "Ehh~ Hold on, hold on. Don't get worked up~.\nWho said I'm breaking my \
    promise?\nAs long as you can get your hands on $item:20000046$, that's fine, isn't it?"
set key[id=831174302003078] name "There's <font color=\"#ffd200\">someone who supplies $item:20000046$ to \
    me</font>.\nHe's called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000610[gender:0]$</font>... Go outside the shelter \
    and you should find him."
set key[id=831174302003079] name "Tell him I introduced you and he'll hand over the $item:20000046$.\nConsider the \
    $item:30000194$ my introduction fee~. Now, off you go."
set key[id=831174302003080] name "There's someone who supplies $item:20000046$ to me.\nHe's called \
    $npcName:11000610[gender:0]$... Go outside the shelter and you should find him.\nTell him I introduced you and \
    he'll hand over the $item:20000046$."
set key[id=831174302003081] name "$npcName:11000070[gender:0]$ said you could get $item:20000046$\nby coming to \
    me?"
set key[id=831174302003082] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003083] name "Ugh... Seriously... Do I look like an easy mark...?\nHe pockets the money and \
    dumps the burden on me...? Tsk... "
set key[id=831174302003084] name "$MyPCName$, you've been properly played by $npcName:11000070[gender:0]$.\nI only \
    pull exactly as much as $npcName:11000070[gender:0]$ orders\nfrom the factory.\nStanding in front of me won't \
    get you any $item:20000046$."
set key[id=831174302003085] name "I really want to buy $item:20000046$."
set key[id=831174302003086] name "Sigh... If you're that desperate, stop standing around and go to the factory \
    yourself.\nHead to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:03000134$</font> and you should find\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000806[gender:0]$, who first developed $item:20000046$</font>.\nGo beg him."
set key[id=831174302003087] name "Head to $map:03000134$ and you should find\n$npc:11000806[gender:0]$, who first \
    developed $item:20000046$.\nGo beg him."
set key[id=831174302003088] name "What do you want...?"
set key[id=831174302003089] name "Could I have some $item:20000046$?"
set key[id=831174302003090] name "Unbelievable.\nYou act like I was holding it for you... Don't bother me. Get \
    lost."
set key[id=831174302003091] name "Can't you understand me? Is the shadow energy clogging your ears?\nI said go. \
    Why are you still standing there?"
set key[id=831174302003092] name "Could you sell me a little of the $item:20000046$ made at the factory?"
set key[id=831174302003093] name "Do you think I've got the factory piled high with $item:20000046$ with nowhere \
    to sell it?\nThe $npc:40000023$ sweep up every last bit\nthe moment it's made.\nGreedy things who won't even \
    pay a fair price... Ugh, ptooey."
set key[id=831174302003094] name "I'll take care of the $npc:40000023$."
set key[id=831174302003095] name "Wh-what...? The $npc:40000023$...?\nThey're tougher than they look... Can you do \
    it?"
set key[id=831174302003096] name "Leave it to me."
set key[id=831174302003097] name "Ah, well, if you do that...!!\nBut even if things go wrong, I have nothing to do \
    with this.\nThis is absolutely, absolutely not on my orders. You're doing it of your own free will...!! Got \
    it?"
set key[id=831174302003098] name "I'll say it again: even if the $npc:40000023$ get you, it has nothing to do with \
    me.\nDon't drag an innocent man into trouble for no reason."
set key[id=831174302003099] name "Wahahahahahaha!!!\nSeeing those $npc:40000023$ tumble over backwards... \
    Pwahahaha~\nIt feels like a ten-year clog just got flushed out. So refreshing~"
set key[id=831174302003100] name "Now, as promised, here's the $item:20000046$.\nWell... I'm taking a bit of a \
    loss, but just this once it's free."
set key[id=831174302003101] name "Honestly, with the $npc:40000023$ throwing their weight around, I felt like my \
    feet were on fire.\nI researched and developed it, so why are the $npc:40000023$ the ones running around? \
    Honestly.\nAnd the workers at the factory are so slow... Sigh... I should swap out my slaves."
set key[id=831174302003102] name "Where is the factory?"
set key[id=831174302003103] name "I used to make it in small batches in corners of the lab storeroom, but once the \
    $npc:40000023$ teamed up with\nthe Black Star Society to distribute it all over Maple World, supply ran \
    short.\nSo not long ago I built a big one in the basement of this lab.\nI hauled in a whole bunch of slaves to \
    work it, too."
set key[id=831174302003104] name "If I'd stayed in a corner of the Goldus Pharmaceuticals factory making \
    digestives forever, I'd never have\nachieved something this great... Heh.\nComing over to the Land of Darkness \
    was the right call, absolutely right."
set key[id=831174302003105] name "I'll make a big haul, leave this place, and build a pharmaceutical company so \
    huge\nthat Goldus Pharmaceuticals can't even show its face next to it.\nAnd then... I'll make it so everyone \
    can't live properly without my medicine.\nHeh heh heh heh. How about it? Exciting, right?"
set key[id=831174302003106] name "Consider it lucky that you've made a connection with me today~"
set key[id=831174302003107] name "Keep it a secret that I gave you $item:20000046$ for free~\nAnd that there's a \
    $map:03009021$ in our lab's basement, too."
set key[id=831174302003108] name "Was the investigation rough?\nSo, did you find anything out?"
set key[id=831174302003109] name "(Report the information I found.)"
set key[id=831174302003110] name "$map:03009021$, huh... Most of the $item:20000046$ circulating in Maple \
    World\nmust be made there."
set key[id=831174302003111] name "$MyPCName$. We have to pull up the roots before the branches.\nBefore we stop \
    $item:20000046$ from spreading, we have to wipe out $map:03009021$ first!"
set key[id=831174302003112] name "This is the Land of Darkness.\nThat means we are strangers here, and everyone \
    except you and me\nis an enemy."
set key[id=831174302003113] name "If our secret agents move together, we'll be easily spotted and every mission \
    we've been given will fail.\nWe can't move together\nto $map:03009021$ either."
set key[id=831174302003114] name "$MyPCName$! Can you do this alone?"
set key[id=831174302003115] name "I can."
set key[id=831174302003116] name "Good...! Best of luck.\nRemember. Even if things go wrong, until the very moment \
    your life ends...\nyou must never let them find out we're secret agents dispatched by the Guardians."
set key[id=831174302003117] name "Remember. Even if things go wrong, until the very moment your life ends...\nyou \
    must never let them find out we're secret agents dispatched by the Guardians."
set key[id=831174302003118] name "Wh-what is it?\nWho... who are you?"
set key[id=831174302003119] name "Could you be... the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font>?"
set key[id=831174302003120] name "What is the Lumina Liberation Army?"
set key[id=831174302003121] name "Guess not... I hoped maybe... \nYou just came to steal the $item:20000046$ \
    because you want it... \nIf you're done, please leave."
set key[id=831174302003122] name "Who are you?"
set key[id=831174302003123] name "None of your business! \nWe trust no one but the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina \
    Liberation Army</font>!"
set key[id=831174302003124] name "Just get out already... \nIf the overseers come while you're here, I don't want \
    to be unfairly lumped in\nas your accomplice!"
set key[id=831174302003125] name "Oh! You made it back safely!\nThe mission...? Did you complete it?"
set key[id=831174302003126] name "(Hand over the $item:30000216$ and report that the mission is complete.)"
set key[id=831174302003127] name "Good work!\nWas there anything unusual?"
set key[id=831174302003128] name "(Tell him about what happened with $npc:11000805[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302003129] name "Hmm... So there were slaves under the overseers' control, forced to manufacture \
    $item:20000046$...\nI'd heard rumors of slaves, but I don't know anything specific yet.\nEspecially the... \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font>. \nThat's the first I've heard of it... "
set key[id=831174302003130] name "Hmm... We'll have to look into it. \nI'll report to $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$ \
    and wrap this up. Rest and stand by!"
set key[id=831174302003131] name "Orders have come down from $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$ to properly investigate \
    that <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font>\nyou mentioned last time.\nI looked around, but \
    there's hardly any information, so it's likely a new organization\nthat isn't well known even within the Land \
    of Darkness."
set key[id=831174302003132] name "We need to find out exactly whether they're a civilian group on the Guardians' \
    side\nor a new illegal organization expanding its power in the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=831174302003133] name "First, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000564[gender:0]$</font>, who has \
    the most contact with people, and \nfind out if he knows anything about the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina \
    Liberation Army</font>.\nHe's known as a pretty reliable source of news in the Land of Darkness... "
set key[id=831174302003134] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000564[gender:0]$</font>, who has the most \
    contact with people, and \nfind out if he knows anything about the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation \
    Army</font>.\nHe's known as a pretty reliable source of news in the Land of Darkness... "
set key[id=831174302003135] name "Hm? What did you just say?"
set key[id=831174302003136] name "Do you know anything about the Lumina Liberation Army?"
set key[id=831174302003137] name "Ah... the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font>... \nNot many \
    people know about them... You're pretty quick on the news, huh?\nHow much do you know?"
set key[id=831174302003138] name "I've only heard the name."
set key[id=831174302003139] name "Heh. Is that so?\nLooks like I know a bit more than you."
set key[id=831174302003140] name "Ahem. A customer who came to buy poison herbs told me this a while ago... \nThey \
    say there's a place called the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Tower of Slaves</font> somewhere in the Land of \
    Darkness.\nThe Shadow Legion locks up people kidnapped from Maple World and those who rebelled against\nthe \
    Demon Lord in the Shadow World inside a <font color=\"#ffd200\">tall tower with no exit</font> and works them \
    as slaves... "
set key[id=831174302003141] name "And then... some people escaped from that Tower of Slaves not long ago.\nThey \
    formed the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font> to save the other people held as \
    slaves!\nRumor has it they even rescued a few slaves who were being transferred elsewhere."
set key[id=831174302003142] name "So among the slaves, the rumor is spreading everywhere that the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font> will come to save them\nsomeday."
set key[id=831174302003143] name "They say the Shadow Legion's commander is on edge because of the Lumina \
    Liberation Army.\nSo security at the Tower of Slaves, and for the slave transport units, is much tighter\nthan \
    before."
set key[id=831174302003144] name "Is there a way to meet the Lumina Liberation Army?"
set key[id=831174302003145] name "Hmm...? I wouldn't know.\nUnless I were the Lumina Liberation Army myself... If \
    the Shadow Legion catches them, they're wiped out in one go.\nWould anyone but a fool leave traces so easily?"
set key[id=831174302003146] name "That customer who came for poison herbs and told me about the Lumina Liberation \
    Army was chasing them for the bounty.\nThey said after finding the Army's last gathering place in \
    $map:03000134$,\nthey couldn't find any more trace of them."
set key[id=831174302003147] name "Well... maybe the Lumina Liberation Army left traces in a code only they can \
    read... \nI can't say, though."
set key[id=831174302003148] name "Where is the Lumina Liberation Army's last gathering place in $map:03000134$?"
set key[id=831174302003149] name "What was it called... the Solar Energy Experiment Center in $map:03000134$, I \
    think?\nI heard they used the rooftop of that building as their gathering place."
set key[id=831174302003150] name "You can't find the Solar Energy Experiment Center in $map:03000134$?\nEveryone \
    who's anyone knows that place... You must still be new to the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=831174302003151] name "On the road from $map:03000134$ to $map:03000092$, there's a building \
    with\nsolar panels on top.\nThat's the Solar Energy Experiment Center."
set key[id=831174302003152] name "Who are you? \nHow did you know to find your way in here?"
set key[id=831174302003153] name "(Show the $item:30000212$.)"
set key[id=831174302003154] name "Damn... Where did you get that... Has our information leaked? \nWho on earth are \
    you? Are you alone?"
set key[id=831174302003155] name "I came alone because I wanted to know about the Lumina Liberation Army."
set key[id=831174302003156] name "How did you hear about us, and from where?"
set key[id=831174302003157] name "(Briefly pass on what I heard from $npc:11000564[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302003158] name "Already there are people on our trail... We'll have to be more careful.\nYou're \
    not one of them, are you?"
set key[id=831174302003159] name "If I were, I wouldn't have come alone like this."
set key[id=831174302003160] name "Hmm... That sounds plausible... "
set key[id=831174302003161] name "If you want to know about the Lumina Liberation Army, tell me first who you are \
    and where you came from.\nYou probably know already, but in the Land of Darkness there's no such thing as \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">unconditional trust</font>."
set key[id=831174302003162] name "I'm carrying out a secret mission for the Guardians, and that's the truth."
set key[id=831174302003163] name "A secret mission for the Guardians, huh... \nDoes it include saving the people \
    held as slaves in the Land of Darkness?"
set key[id=831174302003164] name "There's no such order yet."
set key[id=831174302003165] name "I thought so... They're not even paying attention... \nOr maybe they just don't \
    know yet... Hmm... "
set key[id=831174302003166] name "Myself and the rest of the Lumina Liberation Army were slaves locked in the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Tower of Slaves</font>.\nMost of the slaves are people kidnapped from Maple World by \
    the Shadow Legion.\nAt first... we waited, believing the Guardians would come to rescue us... \nBut as time \
    passed, we realized for certain."
set key[id=831174302003167] name "That we'd simply been <font color=\"#ffd200\">abandoned and forgotten</font>... \
    \nSo we decided to escape on our own and make our way back.\nWe planned and prepared for a long time... \nAnd \
    before we succeeded... we lost many comrades."
set key[id=831174302003168] name "As we saw our comrades leave us one by one, we made a vow.\nThat we would rescue \
    everyone locked in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Tower of Slaves</font> with our own hands!\nThat's how the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font> began."
set key[id=831174302003169] name "I'd like to lend a hand to the Lumina Liberation Army's activities."
set key[id=831174302003170] name "Hmm... I don't fully trust you yet.\nBut... I think I can give you a chance, \
    just once.\nGo see $npc:11000615[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302003171] name "Hmm... I don't fully trust you yet.\nBut... I think I can give you a chance, \
    just once.\nGo see $npc:11000615[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302003172] name "You want to help us?\nWith no conditions?"
set key[id=831174302003173] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003174] name "Fine, then... Whether it's your duty as a Guardian or just curiosity... \nAs \
    long as you don't side with the Shadow Legion and betray us... "
set key[id=831174302003175] name "Head to $map:03000135$ and help $npc:11000614[gender:0]$.\nThat guy... was \
    kidnapped along with his younger sister from Victoria Island, and he's\nbeen searching day and night for her \
    whereabouts... \nI don't know if he's made progress. Go lend him a hand."
set key[id=831174302003176] name "Head to $map:03000135$ and help $npc:11000614[gender:0]$.\nThat guy... was \
    kidnapped along with his younger sister from Victoria Island, and he's\nbeen searching day and night for her \
    whereabouts... \nI don't know if he's made progress. Go lend him a hand."
set key[id=831174302003177] name "Do you need something from me...?"
set key[id=831174302003178] name "I'm a Guardian. $npc:11000615[gender:0]$ asked me to come help you."
set key[id=831174302003179] name "Oh... $npc:11000615[gender:0]$... He's not someone who asks just anyone for \
    something like that... \nHe must think highly of you, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=831174302003180] name "We can get to know how you ended up here some other time.\nThough it's not a \
    place I want to stay for long... "
set key[id=831174302003181] name "Have you found any clues to track down your sister?"
set key[id=831174302003182] name "I haven't found a clue, but I think I've figured out a way to find one.\nIt \
    might be a bit reckless, though... "
set key[id=831174302003183] name "How can we find a clue?"
set key[id=831174302003184] name "See those clock rabbits rolling clocks around over there?\nThey're called \
    $npc:40000022$... At the Shadow Legion's bidding, they lure\nordinary people to the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=831174302003185] name "My sister and I were also tricked by their lie that they'd <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">take us somewhere fun</font>\nand ended up here, and we were separated just before we were \
    locked in the Tower of Slaves.\nMaybe... those guys know what happened to my sister\nand where she is."
set key[id=831174302003186] name "The $npc:40000022$ are suspicious and hate having their identities revealed, so \
    I hear\nthey carry everything on them, not even throwing away a scrap of paper.\nIf we get hold of their \
    belongings and search through them, we might find\na clue to my sister's whereabouts."
set key[id=831174302003187] name "The $npc:40000022$ are suspicious and hate having their identities revealed, so \
    I hear\nthey carry everything on them, not even throwing away a scrap of paper.\nIf we get hold of their \
    belongings and search through them, we might find\na clue to my sister's whereabouts."
set key[id=831174302003188] name "$item:30000211$!\nPlease... let there be a clue to my sister's whereabouts in \
    here... "
set key[id=831174302003189] name "If only I could find my sister... "
set key[id=831174302003190] name "Will you go back home?"
set key[id=831174302003191] name "I'll send my sister back.\nIt's probably safer there than here... \nI'll stay \
    and finish what I have to do before going back."
set key[id=831174302003192] name "What do you have left to do?"
set key[id=831174302003193] name "There's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">friend I have to find</font>. <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font>... \nWe planned our escape together in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Tower of Slaves</font>, but right before we escaped, the Shadow Legion's\ncommander dragged \
    him out and he never came back."
set key[id=831174302003194] name "Some rumors say he resisted the Shadow Legion and lost his life in the \
    end,\nothers say he gave in to their persuasion and became one of them... "
set key[id=831174302003195] name "How did you become friends with $npc:11000064[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302003196] name "Right after I was separated from my sister, I went wild trying to find her and \
    nearly got killed by Shadow Legion troops.\nThat friend saved me.\nHe always listened to me and comforted \
    me... \nThinking about it now, he never once talked about himself."
set key[id=831174302003197] name "If he really did lose his life, I want to at least find his body\nand let him \
    rest in peace... "
set key[id=831174302003198] name "What will you do if he gave in to the Shadow Legion?"
set key[id=831174302003199] name "I can't believe it, but... if it's really true...\nI'll take his life with my \
    own hands...  "
set key[id=831174302003200] name "I've gone on and on. Anyway, thank you for helping.\nWill you keep helping our \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font> from now on?\nAs a Guardian... that is. "
set key[id=831174302003201] name "I'll report on the Lumina Liberation Army and request support."
set key[id=831174302003202] name "If the Guardians stepped up to help the Liberation Army, we could rescue the \
    people\nwrongly locked in the Tower of Slaves much faster... \nI hope you'll hurry."
set key[id=831174302003203] name "If the Guardians stepped up to help the Liberation Army, we could rescue the \
    people\nwrongly locked in the Tower of Slaves much faster... \nIf time keeps dragging on like this... distrust \
    and resentment toward the Guardians\nand toward $npcName:11000075[gender:1]$ $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ \
    will only grow."
set key[id=831174302003204] name "$MyPCName$! \nYou showed no sign of coming back, so I was worried something had \
    happened!\nWhy on earth are you so late?"
set key[id=831174302003205] name "(Tell him everything about the Lumina Liberation Army.)"
set key[id=831174302003206] name "Ah... So the missing people were living as slaves here... \nRight now, as a \
    Guardian, I'm so ashamed I can barely lift my head.\nThey were the people I should have saved first... "
set key[id=831174302003207] name "(Also report the news about $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ that I heard from \
    $npc:11000614[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302003208] name "What?\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font> was in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Tower of Slaves</font>...? "
set key[id=831174302003209] name "$npc:11000064[gender:0]$, who destroyed the Blue Lapenta and killed the former \
    Dark Wind captain before fleeing,\nwas locked in the Tower of Slaves...?\nWhat in the world happened here in \
    the meantime... Maybe he too was\ndeceived by the Demon Lord, used, and discarded?"
set key[id=831174302003210] name "Sigh... It's only getting murkier... "
set key[id=831174302003211] name "Go to $map:02000146$ right now and report to \
    $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$\neverything about the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font> and \
    the news of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font> too."
set key[id=831174302003212] name "Go to $map:02000146$ right now and report to \
    $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$\neverything about the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font> and \
    the news of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font> too."
set key[id=831174302003213] name "It's been a while, $MyPCName$!\nHave you come to report on the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation Army</font>?"
set key[id=831174302003214] name "(Report everything about the Lumina Liberation Army, the Tower of Slaves, and \
    the news of $npc:11000064[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302003215] name "Slaves... To only learn of such a thing now... I'm ashamed... \nWhat on earth \
    did $npc:11000064[gender:0]$, practically the root of all this, do there\nto end up locked in the Tower of \
    Slaves...  "
set key[id=831174302003216] name "We can't just ignore $npc:11000064[gender:0]$, let alone the residents wrongly \
    held as slaves.\nI'll sort out the situation,\nreport to the higher-ups, and issue operation orders soon."
set key[id=831174302003217] name "Even before that, if a situation arises where the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina \
    Liberation Army</font> needs support,\nI'll permit you to help them unofficially."
set key[id=831174302003218] name "Thanks to you helping $npc:11000614[gender:0]$ before, we found out \
    where\n$npc:11000614[gender:0]$'s sister is."
set key[id=831174302003219] name "Where is $npc:11000614[gender:0]$'s sister?"
set key[id=831174302003220] name "$map:03009023$... \nIt's a temporary holding camp for slaves being transferred \
    from the top floor of the Tower of Slaves.\nFrom now on, our Lumina Liberation Army begins the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:03009023$ rescue operation</font>.\n$MyPCName$, will you join us?"
set key[id=831174302003221] name "I will."
set key[id=831174302003222] name "Success in this operation requires thorough preparation.\nKeep in mind that \
    every member must fully understand the plan and follow it.\nFirst, deliver this $item:30000213$ to \
    $npc:11000614[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302003223] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302003224] name "Could I have the $item:30000213$?"
set key[id=831174302003225] name "I forgot where I'm supposed to go."
set key[id=831174302003226] name "$MyPCName$! One mistake is enough.\nDon't forget dozens of lives depend on this \
    operation."
set key[id=831174302003227] name "You're already holding the $item:30000213$... Hmm... \nDon't lose your head, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=831174302003228] name "Your bag is full.\nYou'd better tidy up first."
set key[id=831174302003229] name "$npc:11000614[gender:0]$ is at $map:03000135$."
set key[id=831174302003230] name "Ah, $MyPCName$! Did you hear the news?\nThanks to you, I found out where my \
    sister is."
set key[id=831174302003231] name "(Hand over the $item:30000213$.)"
set key[id=831174302003232] name "This is... \nThe operation is finally starting!"
set key[id=831174302003233] name "Hmm... I've confirmed the orders I've been given.\nCould you take this \
    $item:30000213$ on to $npcName:11000616[gender:0]$\nat $map:03000136$?"
set key[id=831174302003234] name "Why have you come back?"
set key[id=831174302003235] name "Could I have the $item:30000213$?"
set key[id=831174302003236] name "I forgot where I'm supposed to go."
set key[id=831174302003237] name "Ah, you left this behind.\nHere it is. It's important, so don't lose it and be \
    sure to deliver it."
set key[id=831174302003238] name "Check your bag once more.\nThe $item:30000213$ should be in there."
set key[id=831174302003239] name "Your bag seems too heavy.\nYou'd better tidy up first."
set key[id=831174302003240] name "$npc:11000616[gender:0]$ is at $map:03000136$."
set key[id=831174302003241] name "Did you come looking for me?"
set key[id=831174302003242] name "(Hand over the $item:30000213$.)"
set key[id=831174302003243] name "Ah... The orders for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:03009023$ rescue \
    operation</font> must have come in.\nLet's see... "
set key[id=831174302003244] name "Hmm. I think we're a bit tight on time to carry this out...\nWould you help me?"
set key[id=831174302003245] name "Sure."
set key[id=831174302003246] name "My orders are to block $map:03000146$ off from other areas and prepare in \
    advance to stop\nany Shadow Legion\nreinforcements... \nFirst, could you go fetch some <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000214$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000215$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302003247] name "Take the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000214$</font> from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000020$</font> roaming around here,\nand the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000215$</font> is in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">yellow drums</font>.\nI'll keep \
    making other preparations in the meantime... "
set key[id=831174302003248] name "Take the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000214$</font> from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000020$</font> roaming around here,\nand the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000215$</font> is in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">yellow drums</font>."
set key[id=831174302003249] name "Good work!\nThis much $item:30000215$ should be plenty to make\nthe grenades the \
    operation needs."
set key[id=831174302003250] name "And for the $item:30000214$, we only need to set them on the paths connected to \
    $map:03000146$,\nso that's no problem... "
set key[id=831174302003251] name "$MyPCName$, take the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000214$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">set them on the paths\nleading from $map:03000146$ to other areas</font>.\nI'll set them on \
    the paths leading into $map:03000146$ from other areas."
set key[id=831174302003252] name "Why have you come back?"
set key[id=831174302003253] name "Could I have the $item:30000214$?"
set key[id=831174302003254] name "I forgot where I'm supposed to go."
set key[id=831174302003255] name "$MyPCName$! \nIf you lost the $item:30000214$, you'll have to take as many as \
    you need\nfrom the $npc:40000020$ again."
set key[id=831174302003256] name "You must be mistaken.\nYou're already holding the $item:30000214$, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=831174302003257] name "Your bag is full.\nYou'd better tidy up first."
set key[id=831174302003258] name "$MyPCName$, take the $item:30000214$ and set them on the paths\nfrom \
    $map:03000146$ to $map:03000136$ and $map:03000145$\nand that's all."
set key[id=831174302003259] name "Oh, you're back sooner than I expected. Did you set them all properly?"
set key[id=831174302003260] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003261] name "Good. It's not a perfect solution, but...  \nit should at least delay the enemy \
    from calling for reinforcements or moving!"
set key[id=831174302003262] name "Now, head back to $map:03009022$ and tell $npcName:11000613[gender:0]$\nthat the \
    preparations here are complete."
set key[id=831174302003263] name "Head back to $map:03009022$ and tell $npcName:11000613[gender:0]$\nthat the \
    preparations here are complete."
set key[id=831174302003264] name "$MyPCName$, I was just waiting for you.\nDid you deliver all the $item:30000213$ \
    to the members? \nNow I only need the ready report from $npc:11000616[gender:0]$... "
set key[id=831174302003265] name "I tell him everything $npc:11000616[gender:0]$ was tasked with has been \
    completed."
set key[id=831174302003266] name "Is that so? \nGood news indeed!"
set key[id=831174302003267] name "Then it's time to begin the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:03009023$ rescue \
    operation</font>.\n$MyPCName$! Are you ready?"
set key[id=831174302003268] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003269] name "Good. Then head to $map:03009023$ and, together with the Lumina Liberation \
    Army,\nsave the people wrongly locked up there!"
set key[id=831174302003270] name "Head to $map:03009023$ and, together with the Lumina Liberation Army,\nsave the \
    people wrongly locked up there!"
set key[id=831174302003271] name "$MyPCName$!! I found her... My sister <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000807[gender:1]$</font>... \nI was so worried I'd never see her again...!"
set key[id=831174302003272] name "She looks thinner and weaker than when we first parted... \nBut thankfully she \
    isn't badly sick or hurt. \nOnce she recovers, I plan to send her back to Maple World."
set key[id=831174302003273] name "Where is $npcName:11000807[gender:1]$ recovering?"
set key[id=831174302003274] name "She's at the $map:03009024$ at the top of the northeast tower in \
    $map:03000135$,\nwhich the Lumina Liberation Army set up as temporary shelter for the rescued.\nI told her \
    about you, $MyPCName$, and she said she really wanted to meet you before\nheading home... Would you like to \
    meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000807[gender:1]$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302003275] name "I told my sister about you, $MyPCName$, and she said she really wanted to meet \
    you before heading home... \nWould you like to meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000807[gender:1]$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302003276] name "Oh... Hello, $MyPCName$... \nMy brother said you're someone we owe so much to... \
    Thank you for saving me... "
set key[id=831174302003277] name "Since I was separated from my brother... I was so scared... and it was so \
    hard... \nThere were so many awful things on the top floor of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Tower of \
    Slaves</font>... \nEspecially the Shadow Legion's commander... He was... so... so... "
set key[id=831174302003278] name "Even now, whenever I see red... I think of that commander and my heart feels \
    like it freezes... "
set key[id=831174302003279] name "What does red have to do with it?"
set key[id=831174302003280] name "That commander... always wore a red cloak... \nOne day he dragged a person up \
    from the lower floors of the Tower of Slaves,\nand in front of all of us... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302003281] name "That person... was in so much pain... I feel like I can still hear the \
    screams... \nThe Shadow Legion troops said if we resisted or didn't listen... we'd suffer\nlike that person."
set key[id=831174302003282] name "What did that person look like?"
set key[id=831174302003283] name "I don't remember exactly, but... \nI think they had yellow hair... old \
    goggles... and a torn red cloak... "
set key[id=831174302003284] name "What happened to that person?"
set key[id=831174302003285] name "The Shadow Legion's commander told his subordinates to take them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000213$</font>.\nHe said they'd be useful to the shadow mage.\nI never saw that \
    person again after that."
set key[id=831174302003286] name "I was dragged around here and there with the other people locked on the top \
    floor... \nand then rescued at $map:03009023$... \nMy brother said the Lumina Liberation Army are our great \
    benefactors.\nPlease tell the other members of the Liberation Army that I'm truly grateful..."
set key[id=831174302003287] name "My brother said the Lumina Liberation Army are our great benefactors.\nPlease \
    tell the other members of the Liberation Army that I'm truly grateful..."
set key[id=831174302003288] name "$MyPCName$, thank you so much for risking your life to help make the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:03009023$ rescue operation</font>\na success.\nI hear $npcName:11000614[gender:0]$'s \
    sister made it back safely too? "
set key[id=831174302003289] name "(Tell him about my visit with $npcName:11000807[gender:1]$.)"
set key[id=831174302003290] name "Sigh... To think someone so young went through something so terrible... \nI'm \
    sorry we couldn't save her sooner... "
set key[id=831174302003291] name "We have to find a way for people to leave this awful place and return safely to \
    Maple World\nas soon as possible."
set key[id=831174302003292] name "Come to think of it, the person $npcName:11000807[gender:1]$ saw on the top \
    floor... \nI wonder if it could be $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$,\nthe one the Guardians are looking for."
set key[id=831174302003293] name "Official or not, thanks to your help, a member of the Guardians, our Lumina \
    Liberation Army\nhas formed a bond with you... \nIf Guardians operating in the Land of Darkness need our help, \
    we'll give it."
set key[id=831174302003294] name "But only if the task truly serves the kind, ordinary residents of Maple \
    World\nand doesn't demand anyone's sacrifice\nwill the Lumina Liberation Army give support."
set key[id=831174302003295] name "The Lumina Liberation Army has decided to help and support the Guardians' \
    activities only when\nthe task is for the kind, ordinary residents of Maple World\nand doesn't demand anyone's \
    sacrifice."
set key[id=831174302003296] name "$MyPCName$!\nWhere are you coming from?"
set key[id=831174302003297] name "(Tell him about the $map:03009023$ rescue operation.)"
set key[id=831174302003298] name "Such a thing...!!\nI'm glad the residents were rescued safely, but if something \
    like that was happening, you should have reported to me first\nand moved on my orders!\nWhat would you have \
    done if things had gone wrong?"
set key[id=831174302003299] name "(Say that $npc:11000076[gender:0]$ gave unofficial permission to support the \
    Liberation Army.)"
set key[id=831174302003300] name "Even so... you should have reported before the operation began.\nThe most basic \
    duty of a secret agent in the Land of Darkness is to report on\neverything that happens in the Land of \
    Darkness."
set key[id=831174302003301] name "$MyPCName$!\nDon't forget the duty you've been given. "
set key[id=831174302003302] name "What did the Lumina Liberation Army say they planned to do with the \
    survivors\nrescued in the $map:03009023$ rescue operation?"
set key[id=831174302003303] name "They're looking for a way to send them safely back to Victoria Island."
set key[id=831174302003304] name "I see...\nWe'll have to find a way for them to get home safely,\nout of the \
    watchers' sight. "
set key[id=831174302003305] name "Go to $map:02000146$ right now and report everything \
    to\n$npcName:11000076[gender:0]$.\nTell them we need the Guardians' support so the survivors can go back."
set key[id=831174302003306] name "I'll stay here and look into whether there's any way to wipe out the Shadow \
    Legion\nthat kidnapped the townsfolk and made them slaves."
set key[id=831174302003307] name "Go to $map:02000146$ right now and report everything \
    to\n$npcName:11000076[gender:0]$.\nTell them we need the Guardians' support so the survivors can go back."
set key[id=831174302003308] name "Ah, it's you.\nYou came running in a hurry... Something must have happened in \
    the Land of Darkness!"
set key[id=831174302003309] name "I report everything that happened."
set key[id=831174302003310] name "I see... If only this decision had come a little sooner...\nJust before you \
    arrived, the Empress ordered the Guardians to support the Lumina Liberation\nArmy fully."
set key[id=831174302003311] name "Thanks to you, the Lumina Liberation Army seems to hold a little less of a \
    grudge against\nthe Guardians. That's a relief.\nBut keep $npcName:11000804[gender:0]$'s advice in mind, \
    always."
set key[id=831174302003312] name "We'll find a way to bring the $map:03009023$ survivors back safely!\nGood work."
set key[id=831174302003340] name "Um... $MyPCName$! \nRight now the only one I can trust and lean on is... you, \
    $MyPCName$.\nThere's something I need to ask of you, in secret."
set key[id=831174302003341] name "Go ahead, I'm listening."
set key[id=831174302003342] name "I heard that far beyond $map:02000100$, in a region called $map:02000270$, \
    there's a time engineering\nlab called the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Center</font>.\nThey recently \
    sent a survey team to $map:02000008$, and I'm told\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. \
    $npc:11000869[gender:0]$</font> came along as one of its members. "
set key[id=831174302003343] name "Could you ask him whether, if he has the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Time Red \
    Lapenta</font>... its power could take us\nback to the past?"
set key[id=831174302003344] name "Could you go to $map:02000008$ and ask Dr. $npc:11000869[gender:0]$ whether, if \
    he has the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Time Red Lapenta</font>... its power could take us back to the past?"
set key[id=831174302003345] name "Ugh... this is so annoying!! Why am I the one stuck guarding this place? \nI \
    want to investigate the clock tower too!!"
set key[id=831174302003346] name "I ask if she's part of the survey team sent from the Chaos Time Center."
set key[id=831174302003347] name "What if I am? Why?"
set key[id=831174302003348] name "I say I came to see $npc:11000869[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302003349] name "Ah, no idea. \nHe's not here~!"
set key[id=831175903000012] name "Oh dear... I can't continue the work anymore..."
set key[id=831175903000013] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903000014] name "See that <font color=\"#ffd200\">hole</font> in front of me? I dug it new\nto \
    expand the oil work."
set key[id=831175903000015] name "But I accidentally disturbed a <font color=\"#ffd200\">Cobra nest</font> along \
    the way!\nWhen <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:99000038$</font> came out, I panicked and plugged up the hole."
set key[id=831175903000016] name "Could you help me out?\nAll you have to do is <font color=\"#ffd200\">pull the \
    lever in front of the hole</font> and defeat the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:99000038$</font> inside."
set key[id=831175903000017] name "Ugh... I hate <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:99000038$</font>.\nSnakes are among \
    the animals least like humans, you know.\nI was so startled that I covered the hole with sheet metal."
set key[id=831175903000018] name "There should be levers around here.\nPull those <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">levers</font> and defeat the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:99000038$</font> inside."
set key[id=831175903000019] name "Thank you! Now I can keep working!"
set key[id=1024224802005827] name "We have no time for this. If we don't hurry, the Chancellor's \
    safety...!!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, go ahead to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000252$</font> and protect the Chancellor.\nI'll follow soon with the elite Royal \
    Guard!"
set key[id=1024224802005828] name "We have no time for this. If we don't hurry, the Chancellor's \
    safety...!!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, go ahead to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000252$</font> and protect the Chancellor.\nI'll follow soon with the elite Royal \
    Guard!"
set key[id=1024224802005829] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>. Well done.\nIt was a tense \
    situation, but thanks to you getting there first and handling it well,\nthe Chancellor was able to return \
    safely without serious injury."
set key[id=1110140403002465] name "By the way, $MyPCName$, I'd like to hear what you think.\nAfter \
    $npcName:11000492[gender:0]$, now $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ too...\n\n"
set key[id=1110140403002466] name "From the ledger of $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ found in the search of the Barota \
    Company, we uncovered\nall of his illegal activities and wrapped them up at a suitable point.\nI thought that \
    once we found $npc:11000526[gender:0]$, all that was left was\nto unravel the secrets tied to \
    $npc:11000492[gender:0]$... "
set key[id=1110140403002467] name "I think so too."
set key[id=1110140403002468] name "But now that things have turned out like this... I don't know where to\nstart \
    again."
set key[id=1110140403002469] name "Hm? Wait... Isn't it suddenly noisy in the situation room?"
set key[id=1110140403002470] name "It seems something has happened."
set key[id=1110140403002471] name "Let's go see right away. The agents' movements aren't normal."
set key[id=1110140403002472] name "Kerning City is in danger! Follow me, quickly!"
set key[id=1110140403002473] name "Well... before we talk, shall we catch our breath first? You've worked very \
    hard.\nIf it weren't for you, Kerning City would have been in real danger."
set key[id=1110140403002474] name "That's thanks to how great Mark-52 is."
set key[id=1110140403002475] name "Don't say such disappointing things.\nMany agents have gone through boarding \
    training, but none of them even\nreached a passing score on the manual. Myself included."
set key[id=1110140403002476] name "But how was I able to pilot it?"
set key[id=1110140403002477] name "Perhaps you have some special power.\nMaybe I sensed that\nwithout realizing \
    it, and that's why I told you to ride Mark-52... heh heh."
set key[id=1113125802005862] name "(Ask if $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ has returned to his old self.)"
set key[id=1113125802005863] name "Yes.\nSince $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ received my report, he seems to have \
    realized how\nserious the situation is."
set key[id=1113125802005864] name "Well... I probably can't avoid disciplinary action.\nI tried to handle it on my \
    own without reporting that the weapons had gone missing.\nI acted corruptly too...\n"
set key[id=1113125802005865] name "But $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ said he was moved by my effort to restore \
    justice.\nIf my report was what <font color=\"#ffd200\">brought Frey back</font>,\nthen a little discipline is \
    nothing!"
set key[id=1113125802005867] name "(Say $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ is quite likely to ignore Mark's report.)"
set key[id=1113125802005868] name "...Of course I've heard the rumors. That $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ has been \
    acting differently\nfrom usual in the recent incidents.\nAnd there was speculation that the orders are coming \
    down from the top of the royal family."
set key[id=1113125802005869] name "But... this time it'll be different.\n$npc:11000119[gender:0]$ is a righteous \
    and loyal knight, so much so that he's called\nthe <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shield of Tria</font>."
set key[id=1113125802005870] name "The ledger you found, $MyPCName$, is clear evidence the royal family is \
    corrupt...\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shield of Tria</font> didn't become captain of the guard to protect \
    corruption,\nand he knows that better than anyone.\nLet's believe in him and report once more, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1113133502005871] name "...I sincerely apologize for coldly brushing off your report before.\nAfter \
    hearing $npc:11000169[gender:0]$'s honest account, I was made to rethink my true\nduty as captain of the \
    guard."
set key[id=1113133502005872] name "The gag order handed down to the guard... I can't tell why or where it came \
    from,\nbut from now on the guard will devote itself only to <font color=\"#ffd200\">protecting Tria</font>, \
    regardless of orders. "
set key[id=1113133502005873] name "(Say that's a resolve worthy of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shield of \
    Tria</font>.)"
set key[id=1113133502005874] name "Well... it's just that I was late making the resolve I should have made all \
    along.\nBut more importantly, won't you tell me the results of your investigation?"
set key[id=1113143202005878] name "There was a killer...?\nWhat did he look like? "
set key[id=1113143202005880] name "A glowing red mask... exceptional martial skill...\n...sounds like <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\"> those guys</font> who've been reported from time to time...\nWas there anything else \
    unusual?"
set key[id=1113143202005881] name "(Hand over the notebook the person dropped.)"
set key[id=1113143202005882] name "Hm? Wait... this looks like the notebook the peddlers of the Barota Company \
    use... "
set key[id=1113143202005883] name "There was no sign at all of $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ gathering his belongings \
    from home or the office.\nEverything was left as it was.\nBut this notebook, which the killer of \
    $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ seems to have dropped by mistake... "
set key[id=1113143202005884] name "Perhaps... Nelph wasn't the only one in that cave.\nI think it's very likely \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">someone from the Barota Company</font> was there with him."
set key[id=1113143202005885] name "Oh... no... this is bad."
set key[id=1113143202005886] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=1113143202005887] name "This notebook... Raymon's notebook... why on earth did it end up here..."
set key[id=1113143202005888] name "...Ah! Then you're that $MyPCName$?\nI know all about you thanks to the armory \
    incident in Tria.\nI never thought Nelph, of all people, would..."
set key[id=1113143202005889] name "(Ask how he already knows so much.)"
set key[id=1113143202005890] name "Well... <font color=\"#ffd200\">my eyes are everywhere and nowhere.</font>\nAs \
    captain of Dark Wind, making information come to me instead of\nseeking it out is nothing special. "
set key[id=1113143702005891] name "Could you go back to $map:02000001$ right now and tell \
    $npc:11000119[gender:0]$\nhow things stand and that I'm ending the investigation?"
set key[id=1113144802005892] name "$MyPCName$, it looks like the Royal Guard won't be able to continue the \
    investigation either."
set key[id=1113144802005893] name "(...!) Why is that?"
set key[id=1113144802005894] name "...It's the same as in Kerning City.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Unidentified \
    monsters</font> are swarming around Henesys.\nThe Royal Guard will have to put everything into defending the \
    surrounding area for now.\nTroubles never come singly, as they say..."
set key[id=1113145702005895] name "Captain <font color=\"#ffd200\">Win Steelton</font> had an only daughter, his \
    one remaining family. <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000069[gender:1]$</font>...\nSince the captain died, \
    she's kept her distance from me and from all of Dark Wind.\nI suppose seeing us reminds her of him, and it \
    hurts."
set key[id=1113151102005897] name "But... we lost $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ again!"
set key[id=1113151102005915] name "(Tell him about the investigation results.)"
set key[id=1113163202005915] name "So you're a fool too? \nWell, anyone who works with those fools must believe \
    whatever Katvan says."
set key[id=1113163202005916] name "Get this through your head.\nLennon would never do such a terrible thing!\nIf \
    he were that kind of person, I never would have given him my heart!"
set key[id=1113163202005917] name "Lennon must have come all the way here to meet me.\n...You just couldn't meet \
    because of those foolish Dark Wind agents...\nSo please tell Katvan. Tell him to stop his foolish suspicions."
set key[id=1113163802005918] name "But it seems Eve believes Lennon is innocent."
set key[id=1113163802005919] name "...That's natural, I suppose.\nNobody can turn cold on a lover as easily as \
    flipping a card."
set key[id=1113165402005920] name "Well... you were never one of ours to begin with, so it's funny for me to say \
    this,\nbut once this is over, feel free to move about on your own for a while.\nI'll contact you again when \
    the investigation into the armory case and Raymon begins.\nWhen that time comes, I'd like to give you at least \
    temporary agent status.\nA new agent is always welcome.\n"
set key[id=1113165402005921] name "...Lennon... I will catch you, at least, without fail..."
set key[id=1113181802005922] name "First off, I refuse your refusal.\nIn this age, anyone born with a hero's \
    destiny has a duty to fulfill it.\nAnd if there's no destiny, we'll have to forge one, like tempering steel."
set key[id=1113181902005922] name "This age needs heroes.\nNow, will you take the chance at the test I'm \
    offering?"
set key[id=1113181902005923] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(But you said you refuse refusals...)</font> I'll take \
    it."
set key[id=1113181902005924] name "Good. Then what I'm about to tell you is strictly secret,\nso be especially \
    careful."
set key[id=1113182002005922] name "Right now, <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigate the secret code names</font> of \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dark Wind agents</font>\nfighting the enemy <font color=\"#ffd200\">around the \
    Shadow Gate</font>, find the disguised spies,\nand bring back the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000058$</font> they stole."
set key[id=1113182002005923] name "Right now, <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigate the secret code names</font> of \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dark Wind agents</font>\nfighting the enemy <font color=\"#ffd200\">around the \
    Shadow Gate</font>, find the disguised spies,\nand bring back the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000058$</font> they stole."
set key[id=1113182002005924] name "You found the right one. $MyPCName$!\nYour reputation was not just groundless \
    rumor. You pass the test."
set key[id=1113182002005925] name "Good... I think we can start soon.\n$MyPCName$, I'll soon give you a mission \
    that stakes your destiny.\nAfter a final review... I'll tell you."
set key[id=1113182002005926] name "$MyPCName$! \nEveryone who survived the $map:03009023$ rescue operation made it \
    back to Maple World safely.\nThe first joint operation between the Lumina Liberation Army and the Guardians \
    was a great success."
set key[id=1113182002005927] name "I don't know what you mean."
set key[id=1113182102005922] name "Haha! No wonder you don't know.\nWord of your deeds has spread all over Maple \
    World. \nIt's been a long while since we had such heroic news, so everyone is buzzing and delighted."
set key[id=1113182102005923] name "It feels like only yesterday you arrived at $map:02000001$ to watch the \
    audience ceremony... \nAnd now you've grown so much that the Empress herself wants to see you. Impressive. "
set key[id=1113182202005923] name "Have you heard of the Secret Knights?"
set key[id=1113182202005924] name "This is the first I've heard of them."
set key[id=1113182202005925] name "The Secret Knights are a military organization that works for the peace of \
    Maple World\nalongside various friendly forces, regardless of affiliation.\nRank and background mean nothing \
    here. Only skill and a heroic spirit count."
set key[id=1113182202005926] name "For Maple World to regain its old peace, it needs heroes\nlike you, \
    $MyPCName$.\nWould you like to work as a member of our Secret Knights?"
set key[id=1113182202005927] name "It would be an honor."
set key[id=1122210102005928] name "Long ago... there were seven heroes who,\njust like you, $MyPCName$, strove to \
    protect Maple World."
set key[id=1122210102005929] name "Wolf Heart, the Guardian Rock.\nAsimov of Wisdom,\nManovich of the Sure Shot, \
    Baon of the Soul,\nWin Steelton of the Flash,\nand Ten of the Demon-Slaying Blade..."
set key[id=1122210102005930] name "And... Kilian, the Mage of Light."
set key[id=1122210102005931] name "In the war between light and darkness long ago... without those seven \
    heroes,\nMaple World as it is now could not exist. \nBut despite the sacrifices and efforts of so many, the \
    darkness was never fully destroyed. \nI believe you know that better than anyone, $MyPCName$.\n"
set key[id=1122210102005932] name "Now Maple World needs the help of heroes once again.\nI have no doubt that you \
    are one of those heroes, $MyPCName$."

# Quest dialogue of the no-feature chapters 6-184 quests that no pack has in English (no feature tag): our own
# English for the 1479 scriptquest rows of locale KR (or no locale) whose quest a player can get (152 quests), with
# each row's own format fields, font tags and line breaks; the player's lines are first-person choices.
file Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml kms:Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml 032f90f7273bbe7d
set key[id=316160602004976] name "The Empress is looking for you.\nGo into the palace and see her!"
set key[id=316160602004977] name "The Empress is looking for you.\nGo into the palace and see her!"
set key[id=316160602004978] name "Ah! You've come."
set key[id=316160602004979] name "Welcome.\nThe Empress has been waiting for you."
set key[id=316160602004980] name "Welcome.\nThe Empress has been waiting for you."
set key[id=316160602004981] name "Welcome."
set key[id=316160602004988] name "It seems the person you were waiting for has returned.\nGo to $map:02000051$."
set key[id=316160602004989] name "It seems the person you were waiting for has returned.\nGo to $map:02000051$."
set key[id=316160602004990] name "Ah! You've come!"
set key[id=316160602004991] name "Well... my first impression of you wasn't great, but...\nsince our boss \
    acknowledges you, from now on I'll count you as a friend too."
set key[id=316160602004992] name "Well... my first impression of you wasn't great, but...\nsince our boss \
    acknowledges you, from now on I'll count you as a friend too."
set key[id=316160602004993] name "From now on, the rest of us Humblis agents will treat you differently.\nAfter \
    all, I've acknowledged you."
set key[id=316160602004994] name "Over there by the headquarters, you know.\nI saw someone new show up. Go take a \
    look."
set key[id=316160602004995] name "Over there by the headquarters, you know.\nI saw someone new show up. Go take a \
    look."
set key[id=316160602004996] name "Ah, it's been a while!"
set key[id=316160602004997] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!\nCould you go to $map:02000190$ in \
    $map:02000119$?\n$npcName:11000058[gender:1]$ said she has something to hand over and asked for you to come, \
    but I'm just too busy... "
set key[id=316160602004998] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!\nCould you go to $map:02000190$ in \
    $map:02000119$?\n$npcName:11000058[gender:1]$ said she has something to hand over and asked for you to come, \
    but I'm just too busy... "
set key[id=316160602004999] name "Hmm... "
set key[id=316160602005000] name "Hm? What's going on?\nI heard Director $npc:11000843[gender:0]$ of \
    $map:02000309$ is looking for someone... I wonder who...?"
set key[id=316160602005001] name "Hm? What's going on?\nI heard Director $npc:11000843[gender:0]$ of \
    $map:02000309$ is looking for someone... I wonder who...?"
set key[id=316160602005002] name "Oh, you came at just the right time!"
set key[id=316160602005009] name "Hey, there's a Guardsman from across the sea looking for you."
set key[id=316160602005010] name "Hey, there's a Guardsman from across the sea looking for you."
set key[id=316160602005011] name "Hm...? Ah... um... !!"
set key[id=316160602005012] name "Hey. Head over to $map:02010053$.\nLooks like your friends are looking for you."
set key[id=316160602005013] name "Hey. Head over to $map:02010053$.\nLooks like your friends are looking for you."
set key[id=316160602005014] name "You made it?"
set key[id=316160602005015] name "Oh, $MyPCName$!\nGrandpa is looking for you. Hurry over to his hut."
set key[id=316160602005016] name "Oh, $MyPCName$!\nGrandpa is looking for you. Hurry over to his hut."
set key[id=316160602005017] name "Ah, you're here."
set key[id=525214102006027] name "Sigh...\nI can't get this thought out of my head."
set key[id=525214102006028] name "What are you thinking about?"
set key[id=525214102006029] name "What would happen if the order of time were broken?\nWould happy people become \
    unhappy, and would unhappy people become even more unhappy?"
set key[id=525214102006030] name "What would happen if the order of time were broken?"
set key[id=525214102006031] name "I must have been thinking about nothing useful.\nLet's talk again later... some \
    other time."
set key[id=831174302000064] name "I was looking for someone to help us... and you've come just in time."
set key[id=831174302000065] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302000066] name "We're porters, delivering the supplies for the Levee.\nThe Royal Road that \
    linked $map:02000062$ and $map:02000001$ was cut off by the quake,\nso we grabbed only the most important \
    goods and rushed into the forest,\nbut we took a wrong turn and..."
set key[id=831174302000067] name "Ah, no... never mind that pointless talk.\nIf you see any porters stuck in the \
    thorn bushes in the forest,\nplease help them. I'm begging you."
set key[id=831174302000068] name "If you see any porters stuck in the thorn bushes in the forest,\nplease help \
    them. I'm begging you."
set key[id=831174302000069] name "Um, did you happen to see any porters like me on your way here?\nI walk a bit \
    fast, so I set out first... but I've waited here a good while\nand nobody has shown up."
set key[id=831174302000070] name "(Tell him what happened to the porters.)"
set key[id=831174302000071] name "Oh no, how did that happen... Was anyone hurt?"
set key[id=831174302000072] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302000073] name "That's a relief.\nYou must be busy yourself, and yet you helped us. Thank you so \
    much..."
set key[id=831174302000074] name "Um, are you by any chance headed to $map:02000117$?"
set key[id=831174302000075] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302000076] name "Then could I ask you one favor?\nThere's already a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">porter who left for $map:02000117$</font>.\nCould you tell him what happened and ask him to \
    wait a while?"
set key[id=831174302000077] name "There's already a <font color=\"#ffd200\">porter who left for \
    $map:02000117$</font>.\nCould you tell him what happened and ask him to wait a while?"
set key[id=831174302000078] name "What?\nSo that's why they were taking so long... Tsk.\nAre they all safe, at \
    least?"
set key[id=831174302000079] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302000080] name "Fine, then.\nThey could move a bit faster, tsk... Looks like I'll be waiting a \
    good while."
set key[id=831174302000232] name "Sigh... Oh dear... "
set key[id=831174302000233] name "(Ask what's troubling him.)"
set key[id=831174302000234] name "Oh, it's you, $MyPCName$.\nIt's because of this letter that \
    $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ left behind... Sigh...\nIt was mixed in with the mail I collected from the mailbox a \
    while ago."
set key[id=831174302000235] name "He must have dropped it in the mailbox just before leaving \
    $map:02000001$...\nSigh...\nHonestly, I still can't believe it.\nThat $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ would do such a \
    thing, with his mother still waiting... "
set key[id=831174302000236] name "(Ask if there's some special story behind $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ and his \
    mother.)"
set key[id=831174302000237] name "Well... Nelph secretly resented his mother all his life, because she \
    remarried\nand never contacted him again after leaving him as a child.\nBut the truth is, his grandmother \
    destroyed every letter his mother sent,\nand that's how the misunderstanding started."
set key[id=831174302000238] name "Sadly, Nelph's mother lost her sight to illness and can't see at all,\nand Nelph \
    ran around everywhere to find a cure for her.\nIf he really did commit that corruption... \nit must have been \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">a choice he had no way out of, for his mother</font>."
set key[id=831174302000239] name "Anyway... it hurts so much that I don't think I can bring myself to \
    deliver\nthis letter...\nCould you deliver it to Nelph's mother\nfor me, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=831174302000240] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302000241] name "(Ask for the $item:30000164$.)"
set key[id=831174302000242] name "I forgot where I'm supposed to go."
set key[id=831174302000243] name "You left $item:30000025$ behind~\nHere you go."
set key[id=831174302000244] name "Hm? I gave them to you a moment ago.\nTake a look in your bag."
set key[id=831174302000245] name "Hmm... your bag looks awfully heavy.\nYou should tidy it up."
set key[id=831174302000246] name "Nelph's mother lives all alone in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000076$</font>.\nShe must be waiting so eagerly for him...\nIt's not exactly close, \
    but I'd appreciate it."
set key[id=831174302000247] name "Who is it...?"
set key[id=831174302000248] name "(Say you came to deliver her son's letter.)"
set key[id=831174302000249] name "Oh my, what a joy to see you...\nHe said he was busy with the Levee \
    preparations, and somehow he still found time to write a letter...\nAh... um, you see, I can't see \
    anymore...\nWould you mind reading my son's letter to me?"
set key[id=831174302000250] name "(Read the letter to her.)"
set key[id=831174302000251] name "Thank you, Nelph... my precious son...\nUm... <font color=\"#ffd200\">could you \
    pass a message on to my son for me</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000252] name "Got it."
set key[id=831174302000253] name "(Say that Nelph is dead.)"
set key[id=831174302000254] name "Tell him this useless mother is happy enough with just one kind letter like \
    this.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Tell him not to worry about me, and just to stay healthy and well</font>... "
set key[id=831174302000255] name "Tell him his mother will always be waiting right here, so he mustn't worry."
set key[id=831174302000256] name "N-no... my son would never... he couldn't...\nMy precious son wouldn't leave me \
    behind and go first.\nIt's a lie... a lie... "
set key[id=831174302000257] name "He wrote in his letter that I should wait just a little longer...!!\nStop \
    spouting nonsense and go away."
set key[id=831174302000258] name "Where did he go...? He was holding my hand a moment ago...\nDon't tell me... did \
    that rascal go to the Royal Road... "
set key[id=831174302000259] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302000260] name "My little brother... he's disappeared again...\nIf we couldn't even go to \
    $map:02000001$ because of <font color=\"#ffd200\">the quake</font>, I should've just stayed\nhome quietly... \
    Ugh... really... Even out here I'm stuck cleaning up\nafter that kid... Sigh...  "
set key[id=831174302000261] name "If you happen to run into a little boy named <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000114[gender:0]$</font>,\nplease tell him his big sister is waiting at \
    $map:02000114$ and he\nshould hurry to her."
set key[id=831174302000262] name "If you happen to run into a little boy named <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000114[gender:0]$</font>,\nplease tell him his big sister is waiting at \
    $map:02000114$ and he\nshould hurry to her."
set key[id=831174302000263] name "Ahh... this is so scary...\nDid you look down there? It feels like a monster \
    could jump up any second."
set key[id=831174302000264] name "(Ask if he is $npc:11000107[gender:1]$'s little brother.)"
set key[id=831174302000265] name "Yeah, that's me.\nWhy do you ask?"
set key[id=831174302000266] name "(Say his big sister is looking for him.)"
set key[id=831174302000267] name "Ah... right! I promised I'd stay close to my sister... I forgot...\nI'll just \
    look around a little more, then I'll go to her."
set key[id=831174302000268] name "Ugh... I'm exhausted...\nI've been hauling tires all day, and now my arms and \
    legs are shaking so\nmuch I can barely stand."
set key[id=831174302000269] name "I have to haul these old tires to the junkyard and sell them, or I won't \
    have\nmoney for water and bread today...\nIf it's not too much trouble... could you help me carry the tires? "
set key[id=831174302000270] name "I have to haul these old tires to the junkyard and sell them, or I won't \
    have\nmoney for water and bread today...\nIf it's not too much trouble... could you help me carry the tires? "
set key[id=831174302000271] name "$npc:11000395[gender:0]$ has made a good friend.\nThanks to you, \
    $npc:11000395[gender:0]$ will get a nice fat day's pay today."
set key[id=831174302000272] name "Buzz buzz. That big lug of a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000022$</font> took \
    all the honey\nour buzzing friends worked so hard to gather."
set key[id=831174302000273] name "Under the rock roof over there, $npc:22000022$ poured our honey\ninto a honey \
    pot. We must get our honey back. Buzz buzz buzz!! "
set key[id=831174302000274] name "Under the rock roof over there, $npc:22000022$ poured our honey\ninto a honey \
    pot. We must get our honey back. Buzz buzz buzz!! "
set key[id=831174302000275] name "Thank you. Buzz!\nYou are a friend of the bees now. Buzz!"
set key[id=831174302000276] name "Help me! \nPlease save my big sister!"
set key[id=831174302000277] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302000278] name "My grandma said so.\nShe said my sister is somewhere among the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">ice people</font> down there...\nBut there are scary bats swarming next to the ice people, \
    so I can't go."
set key[id=831174302000279] name "(Ask him to tell you more.)"
set key[id=831174302000280] name "A long time ago, a door to a terrifying world opened down there,\nand a huge \
    monster came out and took my mom and dad away.\nAnd then... "
set key[id=831174302000281] name "Right before the door shut, the ice spirits arrived with the Guardians and \
    froze\neverything. The door, the monster, and even the people next to it...\nThey say my big sister <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000188[gender:1]$</font> got frozen along with them..."
set key[id=831174302000282] name "(Ask how to save his sister.)"
set key[id=831174302000283] name "See the little <font color=\"#ffd200\">red maple tree</font> right here?\nThe \
    warm energy of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">red maple branch</font> can thaw people who were frozen\nby the ice \
    spirits' curse.\nGrandma asked the peddlers, and they asked the Ellinia mages,\nand then they told us!"
set key[id=831174302000284] name "So Grandma and I planted red maple seeds and grew it this big.\nPlease, \
    $MyPCName$, take a <font color=\"#ffd200\">red maple branch</font> and find my big sister\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000188[gender:1]$</font> among the <font color=\"#ffd200\">ice people</font> \
    and\nsave her. Please?"
set key[id=831174302000285] name "Please, $MyPCName$, take a <font color=\"#ffd200\">red maple branch</font> and \
    find my big sister\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000188[gender:1]$</font> among the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">ice people</font> and\nsave her. Please?"
set key[id=831174302000286] name "I was just a baby, so I grew up not knowing my sister's face,\nbut thanks to \
    you, $MyPCName$, I got to meet her! Thank you so much."
set key[id=831174302000287] name "Go inside the house.\nMy sister really wants to meet you, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=831174302000288] name "Go inside the house.\nMy sister really wants to meet you, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=831174302000289] name "$MyPCName$...?\nYou're the one who saved me, right? $npc:11000186[gender:0]$ \
    told me about you."
set key[id=831174302000290] name "Grandma's white hair and my little brother's chatter still feel strange to \
    me...\nBut I'm glad to be back like this. It's all thanks to you, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=831174302000401] name "Before the merchant leaves the island, I have to hurry and gather <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000008$</font>\nand sell them... but I hurt my hand and can't dig for clams... "
set key[id=831174302000402] name "$MyPCName$... I'm really, really sorry to ask, but...\nCould you dig up clams \
    along the shore and gather some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000008$</font>\nfor me?"
set key[id=831174302000403] name "$MyPCName$... I'm really, really sorry to ask, but...\nCould you dig up clams \
    along the shore and gather some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000008$</font>\nfor me?"
set key[id=831174302000404] name "You've already collected them all?"
set key[id=831174302000405] name "(Hand over $item:30000008$.)"
set key[id=831174302000406] name "Wow~ Look at this color... You only brought the really pretty ones.\nThey get \
    scratched or cracked so easily if you're careless... Amazing.\nYou seem to have a real talent for digging \
    clams. "
set key[id=831174302000407] name "Anyway, thanks to you I've collected as many <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000008$</font> as I need.\nAdd what I get for these to the money I've saved so far, \
    and I should have enough for the boat fare."
set key[id=831174302000408] name "Have you ever seen a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22300149$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000409] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302000410] name "(Say no.)"
set key[id=831174302000411] name "(Say you don't know what that is.)"
set key[id=831174302000412] name "No way! Really?\nYou've already been over to Turtle Hill and back?\nYou're \
    really brave!"
set key[id=831174302000413] name "Since you've already been to Turtle Hill, can I ask you something...\nCould you \
    bring me a few <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000013$</font>?\nIf I sell them, I think I could get on a boat \
    and go see the Levee... "
set key[id=831174302000414] name "You can find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000013$</font> if you search every \
    nook of\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Turtle Hill, where the $npc:22300149$ appear</font>.\nYou'll get them for me, \
    right?"
set key[id=831174302000415] name "Oh... is that so?\nTurtle Hill is right past this stone wall.\nOver there... \
    you'll find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22300149$</font> with big broccoli growing\non their shells."
set key[id=831174302000416] name "If you have time, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turtle Hill, where the \
    $npc:22300149$ appear</font>,\nand bring me a few <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000013$</font>, okay?\nIf I \
    sell them, I can save up enough to take a boat to the Levee!"
set key[id=831174302000417] name "If you have time, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turtle Hill, where the \
    $npc:22300149$ appear</font>,\nand bring me a few <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000013$</font>, okay?\nIf I \
    sell them, I can save up enough to take a boat to the Levee!"
set key[id=831174302000418] name "Wow! You really brought <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000013$</font>! \
    Amazing!\nBut these... they look so delicious...\nShould I try just one before I sell them to the peddler...?"
set key[id=831174302000419] name "Nom nom... mmmmmm... Yum, yum... \nSoft and tender... Mmm~ Now I get why <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000013$</font> cost so much!"
set key[id=831174302000427] name "Ugh... I'm starving...\nIf I could just collect the scrap metal lying around \
    down there and sell it at the\njunkyard, I could eat my fill and rest in a warm house for days... "
set key[id=831174302000428] name "Sorry to ask, but... if you've still got some strength in those legs...\ncould \
    you collect a few <font color=\"#ffd200\">scrap metal chunks</font> lying around and bring them to me?\nIf you \
    don't help me... I'll either starve to death or become monster food...\nOne or the other. Please, I'm begging \
    you."
set key[id=831174302000429] name "Sorry to ask, but... if you've still got some strength in those legs...\ncould \
    you collect a few <font color=\"#ffd200\">scrap metal chunks</font> lying around and bring them to me?"
set key[id=831174302000430] name "Haaah... thank you so much.\nYou really seem like a good person."
set key[id=831174302000431] name "Hey. Why are you just standing there?\nHurry up, pick up the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000120$</font> and put them in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">furnace</font> and run \
    it.\nIf you stand around spaced out, when will you ever make <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000121$</font>!\nMove it!"
set key[id=831174302000432] name "Hey. Why are you just standing there?\nHurry up, pick up the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000120$</font> and put them in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">furnace</font> and run \
    it."
set key[id=831174302000433] name "Heh heh. Doesn't it look alive, all that bubbling and boiling over?\nScrap metal \
    that's no better than trash someone threw away gets a new life.\nYou're a new hand, so this is the first time \
    you've seen something so marvelous, right?"
set key[id=831174302000434] name "(Say you're not a worker.)"
set key[id=831174302000435] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302000436] name "Huh? You're not a worker who came here for the job?\nThen why were you working?"
set key[id=831174302000437] name "(Say you did it because you were told to.)"
set key[id=831174302000438] name "(Say you wanted to try running the furnace.)"
set key[id=831174302000439] name "Geez... you must have nothing better to do. Off you go~\nBut then where did the \
    new hand who was supposed to come go..."
set key[id=831174302000440] name "Other people look at this $map:02000084$ and think it's just a place full \
    of\ndiscarded trash, but I don't. Even the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Guard weapons that were shoved in the \
    warehouse\nwhen the Levee was cancelled melted in that furnace,\npassed through molten iron and were reborn as \
    solid iron ore</font>."
set key[id=831174302000441] name "Every time I see that, I find meaning even in this humble junkyard worker \
    job.\nHeh heh heh."
set key[id=831174302000497] name "Sigh... "
set key[id=831174302000498] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302000499] name "I threw out my back moving this container box... ugh...\nAs you can see, I can't \
    budge.\nI've got to finish this job quickly, though..."
set key[id=831174302000500] name "Sorry, but could you help me out?\nSee that <font color=\"#ffd200\">red \
    container</font> here?\nCould you move it over to <font color=\"#ffd200\">the pier over there</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000501] name "Sorry, but could you help me out?\nSee that <font color=\"#ffd200\">red \
    container</font> here?\nCould you move it over to <font color=\"#ffd200\">the pier over there</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000502] name "$MyPCName$! Thank you so much.\nI'll pay you back for today's favor someday, I \
    swear!"
set key[id=831174302000586] name "What a pickle...\nThat kind of behavior won't solve anything..."
set key[id=831174302000587] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302000588] name "Haven't you seen the <font color=\"#ffd200\">person shouting and \
    protesting</font> in front of City Hall?\nThey're <font color=\"#ffd200\">family of someone who claims they \
    suffered side effects from medicine made by Goldus Pharmaceuticals</font>."
set key[id=831174302000589] name "They protested in front of Goldus Pharmaceuticals for days, and when the \
    company\ngave no answer, they told me to mediate and settle it.\nI asked for some time to find a solution, but \
    they couldn't wait,\nso now they're out there protesting like that."
set key[id=831174302000590] name "I'm doing my best, but with that going on it looks bad to the citizens...\nand \
    my reputation is in tatters... What a mess.\nWould you go and tell them what I mean, and persuade them to pull \
    out?"
set key[id=831174302000591] name "I'm doing my best, but with that going on it looks bad to the citizens...\nand \
    my reputation is in tatters... What a mess.\nWould you go and tell them what I mean, and persuade the \
    protesters to pull out?"
set key[id=831174302000592] name "You came out of City Hall... did the mayor send you?"
set key[id=831174302000593] name "(Pass on $npc:11000065[gender:0]$'s message.)"
set key[id=831174302000594] name "He wants more time?\nHah! How many months has it been since I earnestly begged \
    the $npcTitle:11000065[gender:0]$?\nAll that time, $npcName:11000065[gender:0]$ the \
    $npcTitle:11000065[gender:0]$ has done no investigation, just let time slip by."
set key[id=831174302000595] name "Not just me, but the other victims protesting in front of the Goldus head \
    office\ncan't trust the mayor anymore."
set key[id=831174302000596] name "Plenty of people got worse after taking Goldus's medicine.\nAnd still Goldus \
    just plays innocent, saying there's no proof that their\nmedicine made anyone sicker."
set key[id=831174302000597] name "If I could just see some data that settles for sure whether it's the \
    medicine\nor not, I wouldn't be this frustrated.\nBut all the data about the medicine is held by Goldus \
    Pharmaceuticals..."
set key[id=831174302000598] name "I wish at least one of the researchers or pharmacists who actually work \
    at\nGoldus Pharmaceuticals making the medicine would help us...\nCould you look for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">someone at the Goldus Pharmaceuticals factory who would\nstand on our side and help \
    us</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000599] name "I wish at least one of the researchers or pharmacists who actually work \
    at\nGoldus Pharmaceuticals making the medicine would help us...\nCould you look for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">someone at the Goldus Pharmaceuticals factory who would\nstand on our side and help \
    us</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000600] name "A person... a normal person... \nAh... I'm saved... \nI thought I was going to \
    die trapped in here... "
set key[id=831174302000601] name "Once the safety tests on this new drug sample are complete, I'll \
    personally\nstand before the victims, apologize, and do my best to treat them.\nBefore that, please deliver \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">the data that proves the drug's side effects</font>\nthat the victims want."
set key[id=831174302000602] name "If you go down to the factory basement, there's a drug ingredient mixing \
    room.\nPrint out a <font color=\"#ffd200\">pharmaceutical analysis chart</font> from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">component analyzer</font> there,\nand take a <font color=\"#ffd200\">raw material \
    sample</font> from the <font color=\"#ffd200\">ingredient dispenser</font>."
set key[id=831174302000603] name "If you go down to the factory basement, there's a drug ingredient mixing \
    room.\nPrint out a <font color=\"#ffd200\">pharmaceutical analysis chart</font> from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">component analyzer</font> there,\nand take a <font color=\"#ffd200\">raw material \
    sample</font> from the <font color=\"#ffd200\">ingredient dispenser</font>."
set key[id=831174302000604] name "$MyPCName$!\nHow did it go?"
set key[id=831174302000605] name "(Hand over the evidence found at the pharmaceutical factory.)"
set key[id=831174302000606] name "Thank you! Thank you so much!\nThis will be a big help. "
set key[id=831174302000607] name "(Also pass on $npc:11000124[gender:0]$'s story.)"
set key[id=831174302000608] name "Is that really true?\nThey distributed an unverified drug and now they're \
    playing innocent...\nThose scoundrels...!"
set key[id=831174302000609] name "I resent that doctor too, but... he says he'll help us even now,\nso I'll wait \
    until he comes. Anyway, thank you so much."
set key[id=831174302000610] name "I don't know how this happened... Suddenly monsters\nswarmed into the factory \
    and took over the place...\nThe whole factory fell into chaos from the sudden attack, and the staff\nscattered \
    and fled."
set key[id=831174302000611] name "There's something important I have to get back, so I returned,\nand as you can \
    see, I got beaten by them...\nListen, I have a difficult favor to ask."
set key[id=831174302000612] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Those monsters ambushed me and took the new drug \
    sample\nI devoted my whole life to developing.</font>\nPlease find it for me. I beg you."
set key[id=831174302000613] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Those monsters ambushed me and took the new drug \
    sample\nI devoted my whole life to developing.</font>\nPlease find it for me. I beg you."
set key[id=831174302000614] name "Ah... I don't know how to thank you...\nThis is the only hope I have of \
    regaining my pride and honor as a\npharmaceutical researcher."
set key[id=831174302000615] name "Once, because of my wrong judgment... and pressure from above, I made an\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">unverified drug</font>, and this new drug is the one that can\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">solve \
    the problems it would cause</font>."
set key[id=831174302000616] name "Once I finished the safety tests with this new drug sample, I meant to \
    mass\nproduce it and hand it out to people... "
set key[id=831174302000617] name "(Tell him what the protester Humphrey said.)"
set key[id=831174302000618] name "The side effects have already appeared? Oh no... It's all my fault...\nStuck in \
    here, I knew nothing about that situation. "
set key[id=831174302000662] name "Um... excuse me... "
set key[id=831174302000663] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302000664] name "This lunch box...\nCould you take it to my dad, who's working at that \
    construction site... "
set key[id=831174302000665] name "(Ask if she wants you to deliver it.)"
set key[id=831174302000666] name "Yes... yes...\nDad must be hungry... I told him the construction site is \
    dangerous...\nand not to come... but... he's hungry... so please... "
set key[id=831174302000667] name "Have you... already been?"
set key[id=831174302000668] name "(Say you left $item:30000044$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302000669] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302000670] name "Oh... right...\nHere it is... Please take good care of it."
set key[id=831174302000671] name "Um... in your bag...\nI think it's... in there... "
set key[id=831174302000672] name "Your bag looks like it's about to burst...\nPlease tidy it... "
set key[id=831174302000673] name "Oh... okay... "
set key[id=831174302000674] name "What is it?"
set key[id=831174302000675] name "(Hand over the lunch box.)"
set key[id=831174302000676] name "A lunch box? Oh...!!\nDid <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000221[gender:1]$</font> ask you to bring it?"
set key[id=831174302000677] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302000678] name "I told her it was dangerous and not to come...\nAnd now she's troubled you, \
    $MyPCName$."
set key[id=831174302000679] name "To think she'd grow up enough to pack lunch for me... \nIf <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font> hadn't helped me back then,\nI'd never have a day like \
    today."
set key[id=831174302000680] name "(Ask what help $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ gave.)"
set key[id=831174302000681] name "A long time ago... before Rockefeller Tower was built here,\nthere was a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">protest against the development</font> over compensation.\nI got caught up among the crowd, \
    and was about to be grabbed by the\nDark Wind sent to suppress the protesters."
set key[id=831174302000682] name "The one who saved me then, even breaking Dark Wind rules, was\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font>.\nTo think such a person committed such a grave wrong... I \
    still can't believe it."
set key[id=831174302000683] name "Anyway, because $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ helped me then, I believe I can be \
    happy now,\neating the lunch my sweet daughter packed for me."
set key[id=831174302000726] name "Um, $MyPCName$?\nCould I ask you a favor?"
set key[id=831174302000727] name "I ask what the favor is."
set key[id=831174302000728] name "I can't leave my desk right now, so could you take\nthis <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">real estate information brochure</font> to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000246[gender:0]$</font>,\nwho lives in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000002$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000729] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302000730] name "(Say you left $item:30000059$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302000731] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302000732] name "Oh... you should take better care of your things.\nHere you go. Don't leave it \
    behind this time."
set key[id=831174302000733] name "I thought I saw you put it in your bag just now... Isn't it there?\nTake another \
    look."
set key[id=831174302000734] name "Phew... Isn't it heavy? Your bag is stuffed with junk...\nTidy it up, would \
    you?"
set key[id=831174302000735] name "Hohoho~ What were you thinking about to take a wrong turn and end up back \
    here?\nWere you thinking about your secret crush?"
set key[id=831174302000736] name "Are you looking for someone?"
set key[id=831174302000737] name "(Hand over the real estate brochure and say $npc:11000185[gender:1]$ sent you.)"
set key[id=831174302000738] name "Ah~! I asked her to send it specially.\nI've lived here so long that I'm sick of \
    it, so I'm going to <font color=\"#ffd200\">move into a luxury villa</font>."
set key[id=831174302000739] name "Now then, let's see...?\nHmm... "
set key[id=831174302000740] name "Mm~ There are some pretty nice places here.\nI'll go see them myself, and if \
    they're good, I'll cancel this lease right away\nand move to a new home."
set key[id=831174302000741] name "Ah... suddenly I'm busy.\nI have to go look at houses and pack up for the \
    move...\n$npc:11000401[gender:0]$ will have a hard time packing all by himself..."
set key[id=831174302000742] name "$MyPCName$! I'll pay you a generous day's wage, so\nwhile I'm out looking at \
    houses, could you <font color=\"#ffd200\">pack up my moving boxes for me?</font>"
set key[id=831174302000743] name "$MyPCName$! I'll pay you a generous day's wage, so\nwhile I'm out looking at \
    houses, could you <font color=\"#ffd200\">pack up my moving boxes for me?</font>"
set key[id=831174302000744] name "Huh? Who are you?"
set key[id=831174302000745] name "(Say $npc:11000246[gender:0]$ asked you to help pack for the move.)"
set key[id=831174302000746] name "Ah... I see... \nI was so busy packing my comics that I didn't even notice you \
    come in..."
set key[id=831174302000747] name "Ugh... when did I pack so much stuff...?\nSince you're helping anyway, could you \
    carry these bundles out to the yard?"
set key[id=831174302000748] name "Could you carry these bundles out to the yard?"
set key[id=831174302000749] name "Right on time!\nHave you finished packing the moving boxes already?"
set key[id=831174302000750] name "(Say you packed everything that was in sight.)"
set key[id=831174302000751] name "I looked at the new apartment too, and I signed the contract for the new \
    place.\nI got you to work and didn't even buy you a bowl of noodles. I'll make it up with a generous day's \
    wage. "
set key[id=831174302000752] name "Oh... you're $MyPCName$, right?\nDon't you remember me? I ran the warehouse at \
    $map:63000001$... "
set key[id=831174302000753] name "(Say you remember.)"
set key[id=831174302000754] name "(Say you don't remember.)"
set key[id=831174302000755] name "Right~ You even helped me carry the straw piles.\nWhen I heard \
    $npc:11000113[gender:0]$ would take over the warehouse,\nI hopped on a boat to Lith Harbor right away."
set key[id=831174302000756] name "But... on the way to see the Levee, I was watching the monsters down \
    there...\nand I accidentally spilled the sack of $item:30000054$ I brought from\n$map:63000001$."
set key[id=831174302000757] name "If I sold them to the $map:02000001$ merchants I could make a decent \
    sum...\nIt's fate that we met again here... $MyPCName$!\nCould you go find the $item:30000054$ the monsters \
    picked up\nfor me?"
set key[id=831174302000758] name "Oh, I see... You even moved the straw piles in front of the village warehouse \
    for me...\nWell... everyone was frantically busy getting ready to come to the continent\nfor the Levee... so \
    it can happen."
set key[id=831174302000759] name "Anyway, it's fate that we met like this...\n$MyPCName$! Could you help me \
    out?\nI've got myself in a bit of a bind... "
set key[id=831174302000760] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302000761] name "On the way to see the Levee, I was watching the monsters down there...\nand I \
    accidentally spilled the sack of $item:30000054$ I brought from\n$map:63000001$."
set key[id=831174302000762] name "If I sold them to the $map:02000001$ merchants I could make a decent \
    sum...\nIt's fate that we met again here... $MyPCName$!\nCould you go find the $item:30000054$ the monsters \
    picked up\nfor me?"
set key[id=831174302000763] name "If I sold them to the $map:02000001$ merchants I could make a decent \
    sum...\nIt's fate that we met again here... $MyPCName$!\nCould you go find the $item:30000054$ the monsters \
    picked up\nfor me?"
set key[id=831174302000764] name "Thank you, really!\nI feel like I'm always in your debt."
set key[id=831174302000765] name "Goodness... I don't know what's going on all of a sudden.\nThe Levee is right \
    around the corner and now there's an earthquake... "
set key[id=831174302000766] name "(Ask what caused the earthquake.)"
set key[id=831174302000767] name "We don't know yet.\nAs it happens, <font color=\"#ffd200\">the equipment to find \
    the cause of the quake just arrived</font>."
set key[id=831174302000768] name "I stacked the equipment next to this spot for now, but it needs to be moved \
    somewhere roomier.\nCould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">move the equipment crates stacked next to you down \
    below</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000769] name "I stacked the equipment next to this spot for now, but it needs to be moved \
    somewhere roomier.\nCould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">move the equipment crates stacked next to you down \
    below</font>?"
set key[id=831174302000770] name "We were short-handed after the sudden accident,\nso thank you for helping like \
    this."
set key[id=831174302000771] name "Border duty is really too hard."
set key[id=831174302000772] name "Why?"
set key[id=831174302000773] name "Dealing with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">rampaging monsters</font> and holding \
    them off every single day is work enough,\nbut those brutes keep raiding Guard supplies too.\nThis time they \
    raided the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Guard emergency combat ration crate</font>."
set key[id=831174302000774] name "To fight hard every day you need to at least eat properly,\nbut they took our \
    emergency rations and we're having a terrible time.\nWe don't even have the strength to fight anymore."
set key[id=831174302000775] name "So... \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">would you find the $item:20000014$ the monsters \
    took?</font>\nIt would be a huge help to our Guardsmen."
set key[id=831174302000776] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Would you find the $item:20000014$ the monsters \
    took?</font>\nIt would be a huge help to our Guardsmen."
set key[id=831174302000777] name "Thank you!\nIn wartime, these $item:20000014$ are worth more than weapons."
set key[id=831174302000912] name "The Dark Wind Agents are searching everywhere for $npc:11000069[gender:1]$,\nbut \
    time is short, so we need every pair of hands we can get.\n$MyPCName$, I'd like you to help us find \
    $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ too.\nWhat do you say?"
set key[id=831174302000913] name "Got it."
set key[id=831174302000914] name "Thank you!\nThe Dark Wind Agents may have missed a clue along the way, so I'd \
    like you to go back over everything\nfrom the beginning, carefully.\nFor starters, head to $map:02000147$ and \
    meet $npc:11000258[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302000915] name "The Dark Wind Agents may have missed a clue along the way, so I'd like you to go \
    back over everything\nfrom the beginning, carefully.\nFor starters, head to $map:02000147$ and meet \
    $npc:11000258[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302000916] name "Ah, you're the one who came to deliver $npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s letter \
    before.\nHave you come to deliver a letter again this time?"
set key[id=831174302000917] name "(Say I came to look into $npc:11000069[gender:1]$'s disappearance.)"
set key[id=831174302000918] name "Sigh... It's really... I can't make any sense of it myself.\nThat day was just \
    like any other. She was carrying a bundle of books she'd borrowed from $map:02000221$\nlast time and went into \
    $map:02000221$... and\nshe never came out."
set key[id=831174302000919] name "I had an odd feeling, so I rushed into $map:02000221$.\nBut... \
    $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ wasn't there.\nShe had vanished, just like that... like the wind. There wasn't a \
    trace."
set key[id=831174302000920] name "(Ask if no one was in the bookshop.)"
set key[id=831174302000921] name "The bookshop owner, $npc:11000531[gender:0]$, was there, so I asked him... He \
    said he dozed off for a moment.\nSo he saw nothing... Sigh... Isn't that downright bewildering?"
set key[id=831174302000922] name "Even if I wanted to track her down, I'd need at least one clue...\nIt's a real \
    predicament. If anything happens to $npc:11000069[gender:1]$,\nthe blame will land on all of us agents...  "
set key[id=831174302000923] name "Even with a search this large, we still haven't found a single clue...\nI wonder \
    if we have to start over from the beginning.\nWould you meet $npc:11000531[gender:0]$ once more, \
    $MyPCName$?\nI've visited him every day, so he treats me like a ghost by now."
set key[id=831174302000924] name "Even with a search this large, we still haven't found a single clue...\nI wonder \
    if we have to start over from the beginning.\nWould you meet $npc:11000531[gender:0]$ once more, \
    $MyPCName$?\nI've visited him every day, so he treats me like a ghost by now."
set key[id=831174302000925] name "Hmm... A young stranger. Did you just move in around here...?\nWe have plenty of \
    books, so browse as you like."
set key[id=831174302000926] name "(Say I have something to ask about $npc:11000069[gender:1]$.)"
set key[id=831174302000927] name "Have you come to pry into $npc:11000069[gender:1]$'s disappearance too?\nSigh... \
    I could be asked a hundred times and my answer would be the same.\n$npc:11000069[gender:1]$ stopped by once a \
    week to return the books she'd borrowed\nand to borrow new ones."
set key[id=831174302000928] name "That day was no different. As always, she came in to return last week's books, \
    and she was\nchoosing new ones over there, past the shelves.\nMeanwhile I dozed off, and when I woke \
    up,\n$npc:11000069[gender:1]$ was gone."
set key[id=831174302000929] name "That's all I know.\nGood grief... I'm not a parrot, making me repeat the same \
    thing dozens of times... Tch."
set key[id=831174302000930] name "I've told you I have nothing more to say. Why are you still standing \
    there?\nAren't you leaving?"
set key[id=831174302000931] name "(Ask if anyone else was in the bookshop the day $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ \
    vanished.)"
set key[id=831174302000932] name "I told you, nobody was there!\nThe only customer that morning was \
    $npc:11000532[gender:0]$, the son of the inn in $map:02000111$.\nAnd even he left before \
    $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ arrived."
set key[id=831174302000933] name "(Ask which books $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ mostly read.)"
set key[id=831174302000934] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000012$</font> series and the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000013$</font> series, I think...\nWhy do you ask all of a sudden?"
set key[id=831174302000935] name "(Say I want to look at the books and ask where they are.)"
set key[id=831174302000936] name "They should be on the shelf by the wall where the owl clock hangs.\nYou think \
    there's a clue in them...? Look if you like, or don't... "
set key[id=831174302000937] name "They should be on the shelf by the wall where the owl clock hangs.\nYou think \
    there's a clue in them...? Look if you like, or don't... "
set key[id=831174302000938] name "Welcome.\nAre you looking for a room?"
set key[id=831174302000939] name "(Hand over the books I brought.)"
set key[id=831174302000940] name "Hm? These are the ones I borrowed from $map:02000221$ not long ago and \
    returned...\nWhy... do you have them...?"
set key[id=831174302000941] name "(Ask if he knows $npc:11000069[gender:1]$.)"
set key[id=831174302000942] name "W-well... I'm... not sure... "
set key[id=831174302000943] name "(Press him with the book lending records.)"
set key[id=831174302000944] name "Ah... w-well... I just took money to borrow books for someone, and return \
    them...\nIt was just a part-time job, that's all... I've never even opened one of those books...  "
set key[id=831174302000945] name "Why... are you asking...? Did something happen because of these books?\nDid I do \
    something terribly wrong...?"
set key[id=831174302000946] name "(Say $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ has gone missing.)"
set key[id=831174302000947] name "W-what does that have to do with the books...\nAh! Come to think of it, the last \
    time I went to $map:02000221$, I also ran an errand with a bag."
set key[id=831174302000948] name "(Ask him to explain in detail.)"
set key[id=831174302000949] name "When I returned the books, I left a bag under the table at $map:02000221$ \
    too.\nIt had a lock on it, so I don't know what was inside...\nHasn't it been found? Did it disappear?"
set key[id=831174302000950] name "(Nod and ask who gave him the job.)"
set key[id=831174302000951] name "Well... I've never met them...\nI don't know their name... or what they look \
    like.\nI got my instructions on notes, and the books and money were left in a hidden box\ninside a small lava \
    pit on the way from $map:02000039$ to $map:02000045$... "
set key[id=831174302000952] name "I just vaguely assumed it was someone living somewhere in \
    $map:02000045$...\nBut... they could hardly come all the way here from $map:02000051$ to borrow books...\nGo \
    to $map:02000045$ and ask around... maybe someone there knows them...\nI've told you everything I know... so \
    I'm okay... right? Right?"
set key[id=831174302000953] name "I just vaguely assumed it was someone living somewhere in \
    $map:02000045$...\nBut... they could hardly come all the way here from $map:02000051$ to borrow books...\nGo \
    to $map:02000045$ and ask around... maybe someone there knows them...\nI've told you everything I know... so \
    I'm okay... right? Right?"
set key[id=831174302000954] name "You want to ask something?\nWhat is it?"
set key[id=831174302000955] name "(Ask if he has seen anyone regularly passing by with books.)"
set key[id=831174302000956] name "Ha, books on a construction site? Never seen any, at least not while I'm \
    working.\nI couldn't say about nights, when everyone's resting... "
set key[id=831174302000957] name "(Describe $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ and ask if he has seen her.)"
set key[id=831174302000958] name "Why would a pretty young lady come to a rough place like this? Haven't seen \
    her.\nI couldn't say about nights, when everyone's resting...\nBut why do you ask? Are you looking for \
    someone?"
set key[id=831174302000959] name "(Explain the whole situation.)"
set key[id=831174302000960] name "Hmm... I haven't seen the people you're looking for, but...\nthere are a few \
    places where someone could hide out of sight...  "
set key[id=831174302000961] name "Go a little way down from here and you'll find a rattling bone bridge.\nWe built \
    it while working on the construction.\nBut the area below that bone bridge is somewhere we haven't even \
    started work yet."
set key[id=831174302000962] name "It's a place where people never go and nobody sees, so if someone made up their \
    mind to hide,\nit would surely be there.\nNo matter how careful you are not to leave traces, a place where \
    someone has lived always shows it,\nso why not take a look below the bone bridge?"
set key[id=831174302000963] name "No matter how careful you are not to leave traces, a place where someone has \
    lived always shows it,\nso why not take a look below the bone bridge?"
set key[id=831174302000964] name "On the wall of a shabby hut with clear signs that someone lived here... \
    something is carved\namong the flakes of dust."
set key[id=831174302000965] name "Brushing off the dust flakes on the hut wall and\nlooking closely at what is \
    carved there... "
set key[id=831174302000966] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000051$...</font>--------Valley-------- <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha...</font>--------world-----find----"
set key[id=831174302000967] name "It seems to be some kind of record connected to $map:02000051$."
set key[id=831174302000968] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000051$...</font>--------Valley-------- <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha...</font>--------world-----find----"
set key[id=831174302000969] name "What do you want to know, ya?"
set key[id=831174302000970] name "(Ask if he knows what <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> means.)"
set key[id=831174302000971] name "Uhh... That's too hard a question for me, ya~\nSorry, ya~"
set key[id=831174302000972] name "Maybe $npc:11000136[gender:1]$ knows, ya~\nGo ask, ya~\nOh, and the wolf \
    $npcName:11000136[gender:1]$ rides is fierce with strangers, so be careful, ya~"
set key[id=831174302000973] name "Maybe $npc:11000136[gender:1]$ knows, ya~\nGo ask, ya~\nOh, and the wolf \
    $npcName:11000136[gender:1]$ rides is fierce with strangers, so be careful, ya~"
set key[id=831174302000974] name "Whoa~ Buka.\nI told you not to growl at other people. Stop! Stop!"
set key[id=831174302000975] name "Ah, sorry. Our Buka is a bit edgy right now...\n$MyPCName$... did you want to \
    tell me something? You look... "
set key[id=831174302000976] name "(Say I came to learn the meaning of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>.)"
set key[id=831174302000977] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>...?\nI've never heard that word \
    either... Is it some kind of spell...?\nThe Great Chief could tell you right away, if you asked... "
set key[id=831174302000978] name "(Ask where the Great Chief is.)"
set key[id=831174302000979] name "He's on his <font color=\"#ffd200\">warrior training</font> right now... a \
    pilgrimage through the Vayar Mountains, away from the village.\nIt'll be a while before he's back... Would you \
    wait for him?"
set key[id=831174302000980] name "Got it."
set key[id=831174302000981] name "Yes, then I'll let you know as soon as the Great Chief returns."
set key[id=831174302000982] name "WANTED: $npc:22000002[gender:0]$\nCrime: Vicious thug who torments innocent \
    residents\nLarge bounty paid for capture"
set key[id=831174302000983] name "WANTED: $npc:22000002[gender:0]$\nCrime: Vicious thug who torments innocent \
    residents\nLarge bounty paid for capture"
set key[id=831174302000984] name "You caught $npc:22000002[gender:0]$? \nThat one's been nothing but trouble, so \
    thank you so much!"
set key[id=831174302000994] name "An urgent request for reinforcements just came from $npc:11000076[gender:0]$ at \
    $map:02000146$.\nApparently Dark Wind suddenly stopped\nsending extra troops.\nGo to $map:02000100$ and find \
    out what problem Dark Wind has run into."
set key[id=831174302000995] name "An urgent request for reinforcements just came from $npc:11000076[gender:0]$ at \
    $map:02000146$.\nApparently Dark Wind suddenly stopped\nsending extra troops.\nGo to $map:02000100$ and find \
    out what problem Dark Wind has run into."
set key[id=831174302000996] name "$MyPCName$, what is it?\nI'm not really in the mood to talk right now...\nIs it \
    urgent?"
set key[id=831174302000997] name "(Ask why troop support to $map:02000146$ was halted.)"
set key[id=831174302000998] name "...Something has happened... $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ suddenly disappeared.\nFor \
    Dark Wind right now, finding $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ matters more than protecting $map:02000146$.\nSo I \
    redirected the troops elsewhere.\n"
set key[id=831174302000999] name "What on earth is going on... $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ vanishing overnight \
    without a trace..."
set key[id=831174302001028] name "$MyPCName$...\nDo you have someone you love?"
set key[id=831174302001029] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302001030] name "(Say no.)"
set key[id=831174302001031] name "Then you can understand how I feel.\nI had a lover too. A love more precious \
    than my own life.\nBut..."
set key[id=831174302001032] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">On the day the Shadow Gate opened</font>... \nthe deep \
    lake where my love and I lay sleeping churned like a stormy sea,\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">\nshe breathed \
    her last in it</font>."
set key[id=831174302001033] name "I carried her, no longer breathing, on my back and wept without end,\nand when I \
    came to, <font color=\"#ffd200\">my tears had pooled to form this spring</font>.\nAs if to comfort me, she \
    bloomed <font color=\"#ffd200\">\nas a single flower on my back</font>."
set key[id=831174302001034] name "Whenever seeds fell from the flower blooming on my back, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">\nI thought of her and planted them\nwherever I could see</font>, and soon beautiful flowers \
    bloomed.\nBut... the monsters trample those flowers and kill them."
set key[id=831174302001035] name "$MyPCName$... \nWill you <font color=\"#ffd200\">bring the dying flowers back to \
    life</font>?"
set key[id=831174302001036] name "Then it may be hard for you to fully understand my heart...\nI had a lover. A \
    love more precious than my own life.\nBut..."
set key[id=831174302001037] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">On the day the Shadow World opened</font>... \nthe deep \
    lake where my love and I lay sleeping churned like a stormy sea,\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">\nshe breathed \
    her last in it</font>."
set key[id=831174302001038] name "I carried her, no longer breathing, on my back and wept without end,\nand when I \
    came to, <font color=\"#ffd200\">my tears had pooled to form this spring</font>.\nAs if to comfort me, she \
    bloomed <font color=\"#ffd200\">\nas a single flower on my back</font>."
set key[id=831174302001039] name "Whenever seeds fell from the flower blooming on my back, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">\nI thought of her and planted them\nwherever I could see</font>, and soon beautiful flowers \
    bloomed.\nBut... the monsters trample those flowers and kill them."
set key[id=831174302001040] name "$MyPCName$... \nWill you <font color=\"#ffd200\">bring the dying flowers back to \
    life</font>?"
set key[id=831174302001041] name "$MyPCName$... \nWill you <font color=\"#ffd200\">bring the dying flowers back to \
    life</font>?"
set key[id=831174302001042] name "Thank you, $MyPCName$...!\nMay you be happy forever with the one you love... "
set key[id=831174302001043] name "I can't take any more...\nMy cozy Vinti tree nest, ruined like this... "
set key[id=831174302001044] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302001045] name "When the <font color=\"#ffd200\">land of darkness</font>, or the shadow world, \
    or whatever it was, opened again, the ground shook\nand my <font color=\"#ffd200\">Vinti tree fell</font> and \
    split apart...\nSince then, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">monsters in the forest have been gnawing through the \
    Vinti bark and burrowing in</font>,\nand in the end they took the place over, as you can see."
set key[id=831174302001046] name "So I was just about to leave, but I can't tear myself away because of the\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000052$</font> I stored in the barrel...\nI want to take them with me, but... <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">if sticky spider webs</font> cling to my fur... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302001047] name "$item:20000052$ are my favorite thing...\nCould you go and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fetch some $item:20000052$ from my barrel</font>?\nThe spiders might have gnawed them all up \
    already, though... "
set key[id=831174302001048] name "$item:20000052$ are my favorite thing...\nCould you go and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fetch some $item:20000052$ from my barrel</font>?\nThe spiders might have gnawed them all up \
    already, though... "
set key[id=831174302001049] name "Yahoo! $MyPCName$!!\nThank you so much. I'll repay this favor someday, I \
    promise!!"
set key[id=831174302001056] name "Oh... it's you, $MyPCName$.\nThere's still no word from Commander \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$, and Dark Wind turned our\ntrading company office upside down."
set key[id=831174302001057] name "Even so, times like these are when we have to keep our heads and protect the \
    Barota\nTrading Company ourselves.\nIt's time to show the strength of the peddlers."
set key[id=831174302001058] name "(Say you'll help any time she needs it.)"
set key[id=831174302001059] name "Really?\nThen sorry to ask, but could you go find a friend named \
    $npc:11000426[gender:0]$\nat $map:02000085$ and get back the $item:30000256$ that\n$npc:11000609[gender:0]$ \
    left with him?"
set key[id=831174302001060] name "That $npc:11000609[gender:0]$ is a newbie, and he has a bad habit of leaving \
    items that\nshould be returned to the company with whoever's nearby while he wanders off.\nWhen he gets back \
    I'm going to straighten him out... This can't go on."
set key[id=831174302001061] name "Anyway, I'm counting on you.\n$item:30000256$ are so valuable that it's a big \
    loss if one goes missing."
set key[id=831174302001062] name "Could you go find a friend named $npc:11000426[gender:0]$ at $map:02000085$\nand \
    get back the $item:30000256$ that\n$npc:11000609[gender:0]$ left with him?"
set key[id=831174302001063] name "$npc:11000609[gender:0]$ left $item:30000256$ with me?\nWell... I do have it, \
    but I'm not sure I should just hand it over... "
set key[id=831174302001064] name "I didn't know $item:30000256$ were that valuable, you know?\nIt's not mine, but \
    I did put in the effort of keeping it safe all this time,\nso do me one favor and I'll give it right back."
set key[id=831174302001065] name "(Ask what the favor is.)"
set key[id=831174302001066] name "The thing is... I'm not only afraid of heights, I also have a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fear of wolves</font>.\nI really want to go home, but as you can see, there are wolves \
    swarming\ndown below... I just can't go down there."
set key[id=831174302001067] name "If you take care of those fierce wolves prowling around here,\nI'll give back \
    the $item:30000256$. How about it?"
set key[id=831174302001068] name "If you take care of those fierce wolves prowling around here,\nI'll give back \
    the $item:30000256$. How about it?"
set key[id=831174302001069] name "Wow... you're really something...\nIf I ever did anything wrong to you, forget \
    it, okay? "
set key[id=831174302001070] name "Here, as I promised, I'll hand over the $item:30000256$.\nThey're supposedly \
    valuable, so be careful not to lose them."
set key[id=831174302001071] name "Why are you back?"
set key[id=831174302001072] name "(Say you left $item:30000256$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302001073] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302001074] name "Oh come on~! How could you leave it behind?"
set key[id=831174302001075] name "I thought I saw you put it in your bag... isn't it there?\nSearch well."
set key[id=831174302001076] name "How can you carry around such a heavy bag?\nIt'd be lighter if you tidied it \
    up... "
set key[id=831174302001077] name "Ah... well, it happens.\nMy sense of direction isn't great either."
set key[id=831174302001078] name "Oh, $MyPCName$! You're back.\nAh~ So these are the valuable $item:30000256$!"
set key[id=831174302001079] name "Thank you so much.\nYou've helped me this much, $MyPCName$, so I'll do my best \
    from now on too!"
set key[id=831174302001101] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000054$</font> makes great bait for hunting \
    eagles!\nSo as soon as I stock it, it sells out right away."
set key[id=831174302001102] name "I brought in new stock yesterday and it's all sold out again!\nCould you get me \
    some more <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000054$</font>?\nI'll pay you well for your trouble!"
set key[id=831174302001103] name "Could you get me some more <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000054$</font>?\nI'll \
    pay you well for your trouble!"
set key[id=831174302001104] name "Oh! Thank you so much!\nYou gathered this many! You're quite good at this~ "
set key[id=831174302001131] name "It seems $npc:11000303[gender:0]$'s cursing prayer is starting again.\nThe lava \
    is beginning to boil hot..."
set key[id=831174302001132] name "(Ask who $npc:11000303[gender:0]$ is.)"
set key[id=831174302001133] name "Ah, you're curious who $npc:11000303[gender:0]$ is. \nHe was originally an \
    apprentice priest like me.\nA brilliant colleague, more than anyone...\nThe tragedy began when he fell in love \
    with <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000039[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302001134] name "When $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ rejected his love, $npc:11000303[gender:0]$ held a \
    grudge against\n$npc:11000039[gender:1]$, put on the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Tumba tribe mask</font> filled \
    with a vicious curse,\nclimbed to the altar at the top of this hourglass, and began praying\nto curse \
    $npc:11000039[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302001135] name "That was already years ago...\nPerhaps because of that, \
    $npc:11000039[gender:1]$'s health isn't what it used to be.\nWe can't let this cursing prayer go on!"
set key[id=831174302001136] name "Use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000079$</font> at the edge of the altar \
    to light the <font color=\"#ffd200\">4 torches</font>\naround the altar. Then <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000303[gender:0]$</font> will reveal himself.\nDefeat him, and bring me the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000080$</font> that carries\nthe curse."
set key[id=831174302001137] name "Use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000079$</font> at the edge of the altar \
    to light the <font color=\"#ffd200\">4 torches</font>\naround the altar. Then <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000303[gender:0]$</font> will reveal himself.\nDefeat him, and bring me the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000080$</font> that carries\nthe curse."
set key[id=831174302001138] name "$npc:11000303[gender:0]$ was no easy opponent, and yet you brought him \
    down.\nAmazing! "
set key[id=831174302001139] name "Now I must return to $npc:11000039[gender:1]$.\nThe curse on this mask... can \
    only be lifted by $npc:11000039[gender:1]$'s own prayer."
set key[id=831174302001140] name "Hmm... she's taking a long time to come... "
set key[id=831174302001141] name "(Ask who she is waiting for.)"
set key[id=831174302001142] name "$npc:11000302[gender:1]$.\nShe said she was going to $map:02000046$ to offer a \
    prayer for $npc:11000039[gender:1]$,\nbut it's been a long time and she hasn't come back... "
set key[id=831174302001143] name "She asked me to get the items for offering a prayer at the temple, and I have \
    them all ready...\nI wonder if something happened. Could you go to $map:02000046$\nand look for \
    $npc:11000302[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302001144] name "She asked me to get the items for offering a prayer at the temple, and I have \
    them all ready...\nI wonder if something happened. Could you go to $map:02000046$\nand look for \
    $npc:11000302[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302001145] name "$npc:11000272[gender:1]$ is looking for me?\nAh... but I can't go back like \
    this."
set key[id=831174302001206] name "Hmm... The Great Chief should have been back by now... This pilgrimage must be a \
    rough one.\nHis return is later than I expected.\nWe still have to prepare for the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Pigming Tribal Rite</font>... "
set key[id=831174302001207] name "(Ask what the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Pigming Tribal Rite</font> is.)"
set key[id=831174302001208] name "It's a ritual to pray to the ancestors of the Pigming tribe for Perion's \
    well-being and peace.\n$npc:11000039[gender:1]$, a descendant of the Pigming tribe and Perion's priest, holds \
    it every year,\nburning and scattering <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000086$</font> at regular times, and \
    that time\nis drawing near."
set key[id=831174302001209] name "Normally the Great Chief returns from his pilgrimage and joins the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Pigming Tribal Rite</font> too...\nBut this time $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ may have to \
    perform the rite alone.\nOh... come to think of it...\n$npc:11000039[gender:1]$ might know about <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>!"
set key[id=831174302001210] name "We just happen to need to bring $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ the $item:30000086$ for \
    the rite,\nso would you help us, $MyPCName$?\nYou could ask $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ about <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> at the same time."
set key[id=831174302001211] name "Sure."
set key[id=831174302001212] name "Thank you. The Great Chief left strict orders not to step outside the village \
    even for a moment\nwhile he's away...\nYou can gather the $item:30000086$ at $map:02000077$."
set key[id=831174302001213] name "Thank you. The Great Chief left strict orders not to step outside the village \
    even for a moment\nwhile he's away...\nYou can gather the $item:30000086$ at $map:02000077$."
set key[id=831174302001214] name "Bandayabu!\nWhat brings you here?"
set key[id=831174302001215] name "(Say I brought the $item:30000086$ at $npc:11000136[gender:1]$'s request.)"
set key[id=831174302001216] name "The Great Chief always brought the $item:30000086$ himself every time...\nSince \
    someone else has come in his place, he must still be on his pilgrimage."
set key[id=831174302001217] name "The Murpagoth pilgrimage road must be especially harsh this year. I hope nothing \
    has happened to him...\nAnyway, thank you for bringing the $item:30000086$.\n"
set key[id=831174302001218] name "(Ask if he knows about <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>.)"
set key[id=831174302001219] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>...?\nHow do you know that word?"
set key[id=831174302001220] name "(Explain that I'm searching for the missing $npc:11000069[gender:1]$.)"
set key[id=831174302001221] name "I see.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>... It was one of the tribes that \
    existed in ancient Perion... "
set key[id=831174302001222] name "In ancient Perion there were well over a hundred tribes, each making its \
    home\nand living its own life.\nAmong them were the Great Chief's own <font color=\"#ffd200\">Murpagoth</font> \
    tribe, my ancestors the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Pigming</font>, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Kaka</font> tribe \
    of the legendary hero Ten, and... Oh!!"
set key[id=831174302001223] name "Those people again...!!!"
set key[id=831174302001224] name "(Ask why he stopped talking so suddenly.)"
set key[id=831174302001225] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Inakimo</font> are up to no good.\nEver since they \
    fought a war with our Pigming tribe long ago, they have kept circling our tribe's altar\nand trying to disrupt \
    every rite by any means they can."
set key[id=831174302001226] name "When the Murpagoth warriors attended the tribal rite, they only watched from \
    afar...\nBut it seems they've noticed that the Great Chief and the Murpagoth warriors\nwon't be coming to this \
    rite!"
set key[id=831174302001227] name "The time for the rite is almost here...\nPlease stop the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Inakimo</font> so they can't disrupt the tribal rite.\nWe can talk about <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> after that. "
set key[id=831174302001228] name "The time for the rite is almost here...\nPlease stop the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Inakimo</font> so they can't disrupt the tribal rite.\nWe can talk about <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> after that. "
set key[id=831174302001229] name "Thank you.\nTrying to ruin the tribal rite while the Murpagoth warriors are \
    away...\nWhen will the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Inakimo</font> ever stop being so vicious... "
set key[id=831174302001230] name "(Ask why the Inakimo try to disrupt the tribal rite.)"
set key[id=831174302001231] name "In ancient times, $map:02000051$ had a voodoo queen who worshipped demons.\nHer \
    name was <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mutecca Rabo</font>! Though no trace of her remains today...\nthere are still \
    those who carry on <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mutecca Rabo</font>'s will and worship evil...\nThey are the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Inakimo</font>."
set key[id=831174302001232] name "Our Pigming tribe is not physically strong, but we are born with the spiritual \
    strength\nto sense sacred spiritual beings and absorb their power.\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">Inakimo</font> \
    kept waiting for a chance to steal our tribe's sacred power,\nand in the end a great war broke out between our \
    tribe and the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Inakimo</font>."
set key[id=831174302001233] name "In that war, it was <font color=\"#ffd200\">the Murpagoth tribe, led by the \
    Great Chief, that protected the Pigming tribe\nfrom the Inakimo</font>.\nAfter losing that war and falling \
    into ruin, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Inakimo</font> have never repented,\nand keep taking out their anger on \
    us."
set key[id=831174302001234] name "Then as now, our Pigming tribe and our ancestors alike want no needless \
    fighting...\nbut if they keep acting this way... another wind of blood may blow."
set key[id=831174302001235] name "How far had I gotten with <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> earlier?"
set key[id=831174302001236] name "(Say he was talking about the tribes of Perion.)"
set key[id=831174302001237] name "Yes, to continue... Perion's hundreds of tribes kept uniting and \
    scattering,\nand now only the Murpagoth, Pigming, Kunkun, Koropu and Tumba tribes remain.\nThere are rumors \
    that descendants of the Rganda, Foremagasi and Kaka tribes still live\nsomewhere in the Vayar Mountains... but \
    no one has ever confirmed it."
set key[id=831174302001238] name "As far as I know, <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> was one of Perion's \
    vanished tribes.\nThe story goes that the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> tribe, greedy to rule \
    Perion, joined hands with a demon,\nand was horribly destroyed by that very demon."
set key[id=831174302001239] name "But... I don't know what connection it could have to\nthis \
    $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ you're looking for, $MyPCName$.\nThe Great Chief knows more about <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> than I do, so he may be able to\nguess at the connection."
set key[id=831174302001240] name "Instead of waiting endlessly like this, why not send a Murpagoth Vulture to the \
    Great Chief on his pilgrimage\nto ask him to return quickly?\nMurpagoth Vultures can be found all along the \
    edge of the $map:02000049$ cliffs."
set key[id=831174302001241] name "Instead of waiting endlessly like this, why not send a Murpagoth Vulture to the \
    Great Chief on his pilgrimage\nto ask him to return quickly?\nMurpagoth Vultures can be found all along the \
    edge of the $map:02000049$ cliffs."
set key[id=831174302001242] name "I've sent the Murpagoth Vulture, so word should come soon.\nPlease wait just a \
    little longer."
set key[id=831174302001272] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nHave you visited our hotel before, back when it was \
    in\n$map:02000087$?"
set key[id=831174302001273] name "(Say no.)"
set key[id=831174302001274] name "What a shame...\nThis <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000178$</font> that was in \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000087$</font> was always\nbustling with people and full of life."
set key[id=831174302001275] name "When the Andrea family collapsed, all that was left was the family mansion,\nand \
    I decided to cast off the name <font color=\"#ffd200\">heiress of the wealthy Andrea family</font>.\nI \
    remodeled the mansion into $map:02000178$, and\npeople started calling me <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000341[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302001276] name "$npc:11000340[gender:0]$ served as the Andrea family butler for many \
    years.\nEven when the family fell and everyone left, he stayed by my side to the end,\nand now he works as our \
    hotel manager... I'm so grateful to him."
set key[id=831174302001277] name "This <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000178$</font> is practically me.\nThat is \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">why I won't give up on $map:02000178$</font>,\neven here at the edge of this cliff."
set key[id=831174302001278] name "I believe our hotel can return to what it once was.\nThe lobby full of people, \
    lively and vibrant.\nTo make that happen, $npc:11000340[gender:0]$ and I have worked hard all this time, \
    and\nwe've made progress."
set key[id=831174302001279] name "But... there's one thing I still haven't fully resolved.\nIt's winning over the \
    hearts of the natives who originally settled in $map:02000171$,\nthe <font color=\"#ffd200\">Koropu \
    tribe</font>.\nThey still see me and this hotel as outsiders."
set key[id=831174302001280] name "Only if we win their hearts and their help can our $map:02000178$ truly settle \
    in\nhere and return to its former glory.\nSo... could you get rid of the monsters tormenting the natives\nin \
    $map:02000171$?"
set key[id=831174302001281] name "If they feel that our hotel and I are a help to their lives, \nthe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Koropu tribe</font> will open their hearts and accept us too."
set key[id=831174302001282] name "Could you get rid of the monsters tormenting the natives in $map:02000171$?"
set key[id=831174302001283] name "Ah. Thank you... truly.\nPlease watch over the future of $map:02000178$!"
set key[id=831174302001284] name "Oh... how could this happen...\nIt's all my fault... "
set key[id=831174302001285] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302001286] name "This place, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000053$</font>, was the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">domain of us white unicorns</font>.\nIt overflowed with the cleanest <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">purifying energy</font> in Ellinia Forest...\nBut because of my momentary mistake, all my \
    friends were tainted by evil spirits."
set key[id=831174302001287] name "A <font color=\"#ffd200\">small child who looked just like</font> <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000032[gender:0]$</font> cried out to me for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">help</font>,\nsaying an evil spirit was gnawing at their soul...\nI brought the child here \
    to purify their soul.\nBut at that moment...!!"
set key[id=831174302001288] name "A wicked darkness swept in from <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000172$</font>, \
    wrapped around the child, and carried them off.\nAnd then... <font color=\"#ffd200\">that wicked darkness \
    devoured even my friends' souls</font>."
set key[id=831174302001289] name "After that... this place, $map:02000053$, lost all its purifying energy\nand \
    became a forest of darkness-tainted unicorns.\nI hear the mournful cries of my friends\nsuffering in the dark \
    energy."
set key[id=831174302001290] name "Brave one...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Will you lift the dark energy that rules \
    my friends' souls and set their souls free</font>\nfor me?"
set key[id=831174302001291] name "Brave one...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Will you lift the dark energy that rules \
    my friends' souls and set their souls free</font>\nfor me?"
set key[id=831174302001292] name "Thank you... Though they lost their lives, my friends have regained pure, clean \
    souls,\nand on their behalf I offer you my thanks.\nI will never be able to repay the sin I committed against \
    them, though... "
set key[id=831174302001293] name "But even if I could turn back time... could I have turned away from the \
    desperate eyes\nof the child the dark energy carried off...?"
set key[id=831174302001304] name "Hm... what a mess... "
set key[id=831174302001305] name "I ask what happened."
set key[id=831174302001306] name "My axes keep going missing.\nThe $npc:21000041$ must have stolen them.\nThe same \
    thing happened a few months ago."
set key[id=831174302001307] name "(Ask why the $npc:21000041$ would steal axes.)"
set key[id=831174302001308] name "That's what I wonder too.\nWhat's stranger is that those brutes steal \
    lumberjacks' axes and stick them\ninto their own bodies.\nAnyway, this has been going on for quite a while..."
set key[id=831174302001309] name "We started calling the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Stumps who walk around with axes \
    stuck in them $npc:21000045$</font>, and\nthe lumberjacks who lost axes joined forces and managed to drive \
    them far\nto the north.\nAfter that, no axes went missing for a while, but..."
set key[id=831174302001310] name "It's happened again.\nI hear <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000045$</font> have \
    been showing up a lot in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map: 02000058$</font> lately...\nWould you find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">my axes they stole</font>?"
set key[id=831174302001311] name "I hear <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000045$</font> have been showing up a lot \
    in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map: 02000058$</font> lately...\nWould you find <font color=\"#ffd200\">my axes \
    they stole</font>?"
set key[id=831174302001312] name "Let's see... Yes, yes, these are mine. My name is carved right into the \
    handles.\nYou went through a lot of trouble because of me. Thank you so much."
set key[id=831174302001313] name "But what if these guys steal my axes again... Sigh...\nI want to know why they \
    do this, at least, before I get robbed again."
set key[id=831174302001314] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000328[gender:0]$</font> knows everything about \
    what's going on in the world,\nso he might know something.\nCould you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000076$</font> and ask him about it?"
set key[id=831174302001315] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000328[gender:0]$</font> knows everything about \
    what's going on in the world,\nso he might know something.\nCould you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000076$</font> and ask him about it?"
set key[id=831174302001316] name "You have something to ask me?\nAll right, what is it?"
set key[id=831174302001317] name "(Ask why the $npc:21000045$ walk around with axes stuck in them.)"
set key[id=831174302001318] name "Hmm... to be honest, I've never thought about it seriously.\nTrees being chopped \
    isn't exactly news, is it?\nHmm... Ah!! Come to think of it... I may have heard a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">strange story from\n$npc:11000001[gender:0]$</font> once."
set key[id=831174302001319] name "The High Chief of $map:02000051$, $npc:11000134[gender:0]$, ran into a group of \
    $npc:21000041$ by chance\nlong ago and was about to chop them all into firewood,\nbut a little girl ran up and \
    begged him not to, in tears."
set key[id=831174302001320] name "Normally people back away in fear of $npc:21000041$,\nbut she was quite a \
    remarkable child, they say.\nWell, it's not an answer to your question, but it's so strange it came to mind."
set key[id=831174302001321] name "Come to think of it, I don't think there were any $npc:21000045$\nuntil that \
    time... "
set key[id=831174302001322] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000134[gender:0]$</font>... if anyone, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">the girl who saved the $npc:21000041$</font>...\nmight know something about the \
    $npc:21000045$ too?"
set key[id=831174302001323] name "Go find $npc:11000001[gender:0]$ and ask whether $npc:11000134[gender:0]$ ever \
    said\nwho that girl was."
set key[id=831174302001324] name "Go find $npc:11000001[gender:0]$ and ask whether $npc:11000134[gender:0]$ ever \
    said\nwho that girl was."
set key[id=831174302001325] name "From the look in your eyes, you want to ask me something. What is it?"
set key[id=831174302001326] name "(Ask about $npc:11000134[gender:0]$ and the girl who saved the Stumps.)"
set key[id=831174302001327] name "Ah! You must mean that strange event my old friend $npc:11000134[gender:0]$ went \
    through.\nOnce, $npc:11000134[gender:0]$ ran into some $npc:21000041$ and was about to chop them down,\nwhen a \
    young girl ran up\nand stopped him.\nTears filled her big eyes, they say. "
set key[id=831174302001328] name "Softened by her tears, he let the $npc:21000041$ go,\nand asked her how she came \
    to protect\nthe $npc:21000041$ instead of fearing them...\nAnd what she said was..."
set key[id=831174302001329] name "She once saw a Stump with <font color=\"#ffd200\">a lumberjack's axe stuck in \
    its head and pulled\nthe axe out and treated it</font>.\nAnd after that, she became special friends with the \
    $npc:21000041$... "
set key[id=831174302001330] name "Her name was... <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000188[gender:1]$</font>, I \
    think... a remarkable child, they say.\nHer warm heart even made friends of the cantankerous $npc:21000041$."
set key[id=831174302001331] name "Then, several years later, he said he went through something very <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">strange</font>.\nHe was deep in training, and when he opened his eyes, he saw a lone Stump \
    far\naway, just standing there for a long while...\nHe didn't think much of it at first, but days later it was \
    still standing in the same spot."
set key[id=831174302001332] name "He wondered if it was dead and took a closer look, and it was staring hard down \
    the mountain, <font color=\"#ffd200\">as if\nit were desperately waiting for someone</font>.\nThen suddenly it \
    came toward $npc:11000134[gender:0]$ with an axe on its head,\nset the axe down in front of him, and bowed its \
    head."
set key[id=831174302001333] name "They couldn't speak the same language, but he understood...\nHe didn't know why, \
    but he drove the axe into the creature's head.\nIt must have hurt terribly, but the creature <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">went back to its spot with the axe\nstuck in it and kept staring into the distance</font>."
set key[id=831174302001334] name "Thinking back, maybe that creature was <font color=\"#ffd200\">waiting for \
    $npc:11000188[gender:1]$</font>\nthen... "
set key[id=831174302001335] name "If I remember right,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000188[gender:1]$ lives in \
    $map:02000085$</font>.\nGo and find her."
set key[id=831174302001336] name "If I remember right,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000188[gender:1]$ lives in \
    $map:02000085$</font>.\nGo and find her."
set key[id=831174302001337] name "$MyPCName$... *cough cough*... "
set key[id=831174302001338] name "(Ask how she's feeling.)"
set key[id=831174302001339] name "Thanks to Grandma's care, I'm getting better little by little.\nBut what brings \
    you here...?"
set key[id=831174302001340] name "(Tell her about the $npc:21000045$.)"
set key[id=831174302001341] name "Oh... so that happened...\nYes... before I froze, I used to look after the \
    $npc:21000041$.\nI couldn't go to them because I turned to ice... and the $npc:21000041$\nwere waiting for me \
    even though it hurt so much... "
set key[id=831174302001342] name "Thinking of the $npc:21000045$ stabbing axes into themselves... my heart\nhurts \
    even more than my body... "
set key[id=831174302001343] name "I don't want any more $npc:21000045$ stabbing axes into themselves...\nHow much \
    it must have hurt... "
set key[id=831174302001344] name "I can't move yet, so please, $MyPCName$, go to the lumberjacks for me and\ntell \
    them.\nTell them not to hate the $npc:21000045$ too much. *cough cough*"
set key[id=831174302001345] name "I can't move yet, so please, $MyPCName$, go to the lumberjacks for me and\ntell \
    them.\nTell them not to hate the $npc:21000045$ too much. *cough cough*"
set key[id=831174302001346] name "Ah, you're back.\nYou took so long that I'd started to think you forgot my \
    request.\nSo, how did it go?"
set key[id=831174302001347] name "(Tell him the whole story about the $npc:21000045$.)"
set key[id=831174302001348] name "Hah... so there was a story behind it...\nNow that I know the $npc:21000045$'s \
    circumstances, I almost feel sorry for them..."
set key[id=831174302001349] name "Oh, $MyPCName$! Long time no see."
set key[id=831174302001350] name "(Ask if he hurt his back again.)"
set key[id=831174302001351] name "No... I'm just taking a short break.\nSigh... lately the monsters around this \
    trade port have been rampaging without\nthinking, so I barely get a moment to catch my breath."
set key[id=831174302001352] name "They throw cargo around and even hurl bombs, so my nerves are on edge and\nI'm \
    under a terrible amount of stress.\nI feel bad asking you for this after such a long time, but... "
set key[id=831174302001353] name "$MyPCName$, could you take out all the monsters here in $map:02000139$?"
set key[id=831174302001354] name "$MyPCName$, could you take out all the monsters here in $map:02000139$?"
set key[id=831174302001355] name "Wow... $MyPCName$!! You really are something! \nThanks so much for helping \
    again! If I need a favor again, I'll look you up~! Heh. "
set key[id=831174302001356] name "Sigh... what a mess... "
set key[id=831174302001357] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302001358] name "A huge Ludibrium meteorite fell in the forest on the hill behind.\nLuckily it's \
    a place where few people go, so no one was hurt...\nAbout that meteorite... "
set key[id=831174302001359] name "It hit me that if I shaped it well, it could make wonderful interior \
    material.\nBut I can't just close up shop\nand run there... "
set key[id=831174302001360] name "Could you go to $map:02000014$ and pick up a meteorite fragment\nand bring it to \
    me? I won't be stingy with the reward."
set key[id=831174302001361] name "Could you go to $map:02000014$ and pick up a meteorite fragment\nand bring it to \
    me? I won't be stingy with the reward."
set key[id=831174302001362] name "Oh my, what a unique material.\nThanks for your trouble."
set key[id=831174302001426] name "I've got a nice little side gig for some pocket money...\nBut it's not something \
    just anyone can do, so maybe I shouldn't talk about it so freely..."
set key[id=831174302001427] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302001428] name "I'd hate to have someone up in heaven resenting me and crying over it...\nAh, \
    whatever.\nStarting something and then dropping it halfway isn't my style, so I'll tell you."
set key[id=831174302001429] name "Someone named <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000546[gender:0]$</font> is looking \
    for wolf pelts.\nI've already got a pile of requests, but they kept pestering me,\nso I couldn't say no."
set key[id=831174302001430] name "If you're confident, take the job in my place.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000062$ pelts</font> are the finest of all wolf pelts, so it'll earn you some pocket \
    money."
set key[id=831174302001431] name "Someone named <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000546[gender:0]$</font> is looking \
    for wolf pelts.\nIf you're confident, take the job in my place.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000062$ \
    pelts</font> are the finest of all wolf pelts, so it'll earn you some pocket money."
set key[id=831174302001432] name "So these are the pelts I asked <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000374$</font> \
    for!\nHe's a skilled one, that friend of mine. Getting them this fast!"
set key[id=831174302001433] name "I'm the one who got the pelts."
set key[id=831174302001434] name "Oh, come on~ You're quite the joker.\nHaha, all right. We'll say you got them."
set key[id=831174302001435] name "It must have been a lot of trouble bringing them all the way here, so I'll thank \
    you properly."
set key[id=831174302001436] name "Hey, you.\n$MyPCName$, want to make a deal with me? "
set key[id=831174302001437] name "What kind of deal?"
set key[id=831174302001438] name "From what I've seen here, not many people come through this canyon, so there are \
    lots of rare\nherbs. One of them is called the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Golpaeng Mushroom</font>...\nIt only \
    grows in pristine places untouched by people."
set key[id=831174302001439] name "If you pick some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000058$</font> here and bring \
    it to me, I'll pay a good price.\nHow about it?"
set key[id=831174302001440] name "If you pick some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000058$</font> here and bring \
    it to me, I'll pay a good price.\nHow about it?"
set key[id=831174302001441] name "When it's fully ripe, this Golpaeng Mushroom makes such a potent tonic\nthat it \
    could get a fallen cow back on its feet."
set key[id=831174302001442] name "As promised, I'll pay you generously.\nAnd as a bonus, I'll throw in a \
    $item:13000013$ made specially for the royal porters."
set key[id=831174302001443] name "Go ask any other merchant and you'll see this is a fair price."
set key[id=831174302001444] name "Hah.\nHah."
set key[id=831174302001445] name "What are you doing?"
set key[id=831174302001446] name "Hah.\nI'm taking deep breaths. Hah. "
set key[id=831174302001447] name "Why are you taking deep breaths?"
set key[id=831174302001448] name "Ah, well... I'm in charge of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">water tank \
    maintenance</font> in this district,\nand when I came out for the regular inspection, look at this... see \
    them?\nThose monsters are roaming all over the neighborhood!"
set key[id=831174302001449] name "But if I go back without inspecting, I'll be <font color=\"#ffd200\">reported \
    for neglecting my duty</font>,\nthe manager will have it in for me, and I'll get fired. What can I do?\nSo I'm \
    taking deep breaths to steel myself, and when those guys look away,\nI'll dash over and do the inspection."
set key[id=831174302001450] name "Hah. And that's already my two hundred and fifty-first deep breath...\nMy legs \
    are shaking and I can't take a step...\nAll I have to do is <font color=\"#ffd200\">replace the corroded old \
    bolts</font>..."
set key[id=831174302001451] name "Could you help me out?\nJust collect the $item:30000117$ from the water tanks \
    around the buildings in this neighborhood\nand bring them to me."
set key[id=831174302001452] name "Could you help me out?\nJust collect the $item:30000117$ from the water tanks \
    around the buildings in this neighborhood\nand bring them to me."
set key[id=831174302001453] name "Oh no... looking at the condition of these bolts you collected...\nif you hadn't \
    helped, $MyPCName$, and the inspection had been delayed any longer,\nthe residents here might all be drinking \
    rusty water, or a tank might have burst\nwith its screws loose."
set key[id=831174302001454] name "I owe you big time.\nThank you so much."
set key[id=831174302001455] name "H-help me... please!!!"
set key[id=831174302001456] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302001457] name "Rob... robbers hit the store.\nI ran out in such a hurry that I left all\nthe \
    cash at the register... "
set key[id=831174302001458] name "If I lose all the c-cash, the boss will suspect me of being in cahoots\nwith \
    those robbers.\nPlease help me.\nFind it all before they clean out the cash!"
set key[id=831174302001459] name "Please help me.\nFind all the cash before they clean it out!"
set key[id=831174302001460] name "Thank you so much. Thank you.\nIf it weren't for you, $MyPCName$, I might have \
    ended up working as a store slave for life."
set key[id=831174302001475] name "Ahh~ the smell~"
set key[id=831174302001476] name "(Ask what the smell is.)"
set key[id=831174302001477] name "Don't you see the water rotting here?\nWastewater must be flowing in from \
    $map:02000084$.\nThat's why these smelly <font color=\"#ffd200\">giant vine moss</font> plants are\ngrowing \
    everywhere."
set key[id=831174302001478] name "And that's not all!\nThere are swarms of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000387$</font> that live on gnawing the roots of that <font color=\"#ffd200\">giant \
    vine moss</font>...\nI came to investigate why the water in the dam is hardening, and now I'm\nabout to \
    suffocate. A person has to breathe to do their job, right?"
set key[id=831174302001479] name "While you're here, could you pull up that <font color=\"#ffd200\">giant vine \
    moss</font> and take care of the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000387$</font> before you go on your way?"
set key[id=831174302001480] name "I came to investigate why the water in the dam is hardening, and now I'm\nabout \
    to suffocate. A person has to breathe to do their job, right?\nWhile you're here, could you pull up that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">giant vine moss</font> and take care of the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000387$</font> \
    before you go on your way?"
set key[id=831174302001481] name "Whew... now I can breathe a little.\nBut still, the water hardening, wastewater \
    flowing in... \nWhat on earth is going on with this dam?"
set key[id=831174302001482] name "I was finally going to take a vacation, and now it's totally ruined.\nTsk... "
set key[id=831174302001483] name "Um, if you're passing by the top of that dam,\ncould you tell my dad to come \
    home?"
set key[id=831174302001484] name "(Ask who her dad is.)"
set key[id=831174302001485] name "My dad is the manager of Revoldic Dam.\nThere must be a problem with the dam, \
    because he hasn't come home for days.\nHe says it's dangerous and never lets me come. Please, I'm asking you."
set key[id=831174302001486] name "My dad is the manager of Revoldic Dam.\nThere must be a problem with the dam, \
    because he hasn't come home for days.\nHe says it's dangerous and never lets me come. Please, I'm asking you."
set key[id=831174302001487] name "Who are you? Why are you here?"
set key[id=831174302001488] name "(Pass on $npc:11000174[gender:1]$'s message.)"
set key[id=831174302001489] name "Ah... how many days has it been since I last went home...\nDid my daughter seem \
    to be doing all right?"
set key[id=831174302001490] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302001491] name "Phew... that's a relief at least.\nIt looks like I won't be able to go home for \
    a while yet... "
set key[id=831174302001492] name "Look over there.\nCan you see the water hardening from the upstream side of the \
    dam?"
set key[id=831174302001493] name "At first it was so small you couldn't even see it... but it kept growing,\nand \
    before I knew it, the whole middle of the dam's water had hardened.\nIf all the water in the dam hardens like \
    this... not just $map:02000001$,\nbut the entire surrounding region will fall into chaos."
set key[id=831174302001494] name "Before that, we need to find out why the water is hardening like that,\nbut the \
    monsters rampaging on the hardened water won't let us anywhere\nnear it... Sigh... "
set key[id=831174302001495] name "I wish someone brave would step up and wipe them all out...\nWould you... \
    consider giving it a try?"
set key[id=831174302001496] name "Before that, we need to find out why the water is hardening like that,\nbut the \
    monsters rampaging on the hardened water won't let us anywhere\nnear it... Sigh... "
set key[id=831174302001497] name "Oh no... no matter how many I drive off, more keep appearing... and \
    appearing...\nThey're so persistent...\nSigh...\nI don't think charging at them blindly is the answer."
set key[id=831174302001498] name "I'll have to find another way!\nI won't forget how you rolled up your sleeves to \
    help. Thank you for your effort!"
set key[id=831174302001499] name "H-help me... "
set key[id=831174302001500] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302001501] name "My friend is down there...\nHe fell into the poison that leaked out from inside \
    this rocky mountain...\nI barely pulled him out and made it up here away from the monsters, but... "
set key[id=831174302001502] name "Ever since, I can't move either...\nI think I've been poisoned too... I need an \
    antidote... "
set key[id=831174302001503] name "Where can I get an antidote?"
set key[id=831174302001504] name "I'm not sure, but... I think I heard that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000078$</font> carry around\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000060$</font> with a \
    special effect\nthat can neutralize most poisons... "
set key[id=831174302001505] name "I'm not sure, but... I think I heard that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000078$</font> carry around\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000060$</font> with a \
    special effect\nthat can neutralize most poisons... "
set key[id=831174302001506] name "Th-thank you... I thought I was going to die here for sure...\nDrink this \
    $item:20000060$ and you'll recover soon... "
set key[id=831174302001585] name "Ah, um, I can't leave the hospital right now, so could you check on\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000424[gender:1]$</font>, who lives in the red-roofed house on the block just \
    below?\nPlease see if she's all right."
set key[id=831174302001586] name "Not long ago, her only granddaughter <font color=\"#ffd200\">Maggie</font> left \
    after being treated at our hospital\nand then <font color=\"#ffd200\">went missing</font>.\nEver since, she's \
    come by every day to pace in front of the hospital with her granddaughter's photo,\nbut I haven't seen her \
    these past few days... I'm worried something might have happened."
set key[id=831174302001587] name "Ah, um, I can't leave the hospital right now, so could you check on\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000424[gender:1]$</font>, who lives in the red-roofed house on the block just \
    below?\nPlease see if she's all right."
set key[id=831174302001588] name "Oh... the doctor asked you to look in on me?\nThat's very kind of him."
set key[id=831174302001589] name "Where is she, what is she doing now... sigh...\nTo think I can only see my \
    granddaughter's face in a photo now, after seeing it every day...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Maggie</font>... \
    where on earth are you... "
set key[id=831174302001590] name "Have you heard anything about your granddaughter?"
set key[id=831174302001591] name "No, nothing... Only...\nsomeone recently saw a doll at $map:02000147$ that \
    looked just like the one\nmy granddaughter always carried around.\nBut..."
set key[id=831174302001592] name "It looks exactly like my granddaughter's doll... but it's a huge \
    monster\nswinging a giant axe, they say.\nMy granddaughter's doll was such a pretty little thing..."
set key[id=831174302001593] name "Several times a day I tell myself that monster has nothing to do with my \
    granddaughter...\nbut what if something happened to her and her doll turned into that monster?\nI'm so \
    anxious."
set key[id=831174302001594] name "My granddaughter made every bit of that doll's clothes, shoes, even the \
    headband, with her own hands,\nand named it after herself, <font color=\"#ffd200\">Maddiel</font>.\nCould you \
    go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000147$</font> and bring me just one thing from that monster, \
    whether\nit's the clothes, the headband, anything?"
set key[id=831174302001595] name "If it was made by my <font color=\"#ffd200\">Maggie</font>, I'll recognize it \
    right away.\nI'd rather see for myself than keep worrying like this, so please help me."
set key[id=831174302001596] name "Could you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000147$</font> and bring me just \
    one thing from that monster, whether\nit's the clothes, the headband, anything?\nIf it was made by my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Maggie</font>, I'll recognize it right away.\nI'd rather see for myself than keep worrying \
    like this, so please help me."
set key[id=831174302001597] name "Th-this... is this really what that monster was carrying?"
set key[id=831174302001598] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302001599] name "Oh... sob... <font color=\"#ffd200\">Maggie</font>...\nwhat on earth happened to \
    you... sob... "
set key[id=831174302001600] name "Please calm down."
set key[id=831174302001601] name "This is the first thing my granddaughter made after learning to sew...\nShe \
    loved it so dearly that she never once\ntook it off the doll's head...  "
set key[id=831174302001602] name "I can't believe it... I don't want to believe it... but if that monster really \
    is my granddaughter's doll...\nOh... what on earth happened to my granddaughter... sob... "
set key[id=831174302001627] name "Sigh... so they were right that $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ came back alive...\nThe \
    rumors were true... "
set key[id=831174302001628] name "I hear he was deeply involved in $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s death, too...\nWhen \
    I think of $npc:11000492[gender:0]$, I can't stand the sight of that man.\nBut I can't just not deliver the \
    letter, either... "
set key[id=831174302001629] name "I ask what kind of letter it is."
set key[id=831174302001630] name "This is a letter that $npc:11000097[gender:0]$ at $map:02000139$ sent \
    to\n$npc:11000526[gender:0]$, who's locked up in $map:02000310$.\nWould you deliver it for me, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=831174302001631] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302001632] name "I left $item:30000341$ behind."
set key[id=831174302001633] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302001634] name "Ah, I see. Here you go."
set key[id=831174302001635] name "I thought I saw you put it in your bag... isn't it there?\nTake a good look."
set key[id=831174302001636] name "How do you carry around a bag that heavy?\nIt'd be lighter if you tidied it \
    up... "
set key[id=831174302001637] name "Ah... it's hardly even a road, really...\n$map:02000310$ is in the castle wall \
    at the western edge of $map:02000001$."
set key[id=831174302001638] name "Ah... you're... the one who found me in $map:02000307$...\nWe meet again here... \
    did you come to see me?"
set key[id=831174302001639] name "Here's $item:30000341$."
set key[id=831174302001640] name "Ah... well, well... a letter from $npc:11000097[gender:0]$...\nI'm afraid to \
    even open it... I can't face the peddlers in our company... "
set key[id=831174302001641] name "That aside... I'm locked up and can't get out myself, so...\ncould you do me a \
    favor?"
set key[id=831174302001642] name "Let's hear them."
set key[id=831174302001643] name "This... $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ entrusted it to me at $map:52000037$ just \
    before\nhe breathed his last... He said he should have enclosed it with the letter he sent to his \
    mother\nbefore leaving, but couldn't, and made me promise to deliver it for him... "
set key[id=831174302001644] name "(Ask what it is.)"
set key[id=831174302001645] name "I don't know if you're aware, but... $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s mother can't \
    see...\nso $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ always prepared a recorded letter along with the handwritten one,\nso she \
    could listen anytime...\nThis is the last recorded letter he left... He made it without knowing it'd be the \
    last... "
set key[id=831174302001646] name "Please take this $item:30000342$ to $npc:11000178[gender:1]$ at $map:02000076$."
set key[id=831174302001647] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302001648] name "I left $item:30000342$ behind."
set key[id=831174302001649] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174302001650] name "Ah... take good care of it...\nThis is all I can do for $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ \
    now... "
set key[id=831174302001651] name "You put it in your bag... take another good look."
set key[id=831174302001652] name "Sigh... tidy up that bag a bit.\nEven when I was sleeping rough in the back \
    alleys, I never carried a bag like that."
set key[id=831174302001653] name "Hm? Are my eyes failing me...?\nThis isn't a place big enough to get lost in... \
    how strange."
set key[id=831174302001654] name "Hmm? Who's there?"
set key[id=831174302001655] name "Here's $item:30000342$."
set key[id=831174302001656] name "Oh my... how wonderful...\nOf course... my son is perfectly fine, sending me a \
    letter like this... "
set key[id=831174302001657] name "Why, once a stranger barged right into my house and flatly told me my son had \
    died...\nI scolded him fiercely for saying such ill-omened things and drove him out...\nThen for a while no \
    letters came from my son again... no news at all...\nThat's not like him."
set key[id=831174302001658] name "So I was secretly anxious that something had happened...\nBut how delighted I am \
    to receive a recorded letter from my son like this... hohoho... "
set key[id=831174302001659] name "Ah, by the way... since you're here, could you play this tape for me before you \
    go?\nAs you can see, I can't see... "
set key[id=831174302001660] name "What is it?"
set key[id=831174302001661] name "Could I have $item:30000342$ again?"
set key[id=831174302001662] name "Where's the audio player?"
set key[id=831174302001663] name "Oh, right... where are my wits... hohoho... I got so happy over news of my \
    son.\nHere you go."
set key[id=831174302001664] name "I gave it back to you just now... look for it carefully."
set key[id=831174302001665] name "Goodness...\nEven if you're young, carrying a bag that heavy must be hard... "
set key[id=831174302001666] name "It's somewhere beside the bed over there. Have a good look."
set key[id=831174302001667] name "It's so nice to hear my dear $npc:11000492[gender:0]$'s voice after so \
    long...\nBut he's talking about the audience ceremony, so this must have been recorded long ago... Why\nhas it \
    only arrived now...? Do you happen to know what happened?"
set key[id=831174302001668] name "It's something my son asked a friend to deliver long ago, and it's only reached \
    you now."
set key[id=831174302001669] name "Ah~ I see... Anyway, my son must be really busy these days. I hope he's \
    healthy...\nIf you ever happen to stop by $map:02000001$, tell him not to skip his meals, no matter how busy \
    he is."
set key[id=831174302002313] name "Ah, $MyPCName$! It's been a long time!\nI've heard the rumors about you, popping \
    up here, there, and everywhere...\nUm... so... by any chance... "
set key[id=831174302002314] name "Do you need a favor?"
set key[id=831174302002315] name "Ah... um... well, you see.\n$npcTitle:11000119[gender:0]$ has given me a special \
    chance to make up for my mistake\nof failing to guard the armory properly."
set key[id=831174302002316] name "What kind of chance?"
set key[id=831174302002317] name "Gathering all the known information about $npc:23000025[gender:1]$.\nUm... you \
    may already know this, but...\nnot long ago the Red Cape gang attacked the royal palace and caused an \
    uproar.\nWe nearly caught the Red Cape then, but $npc:23000025[gender:1]$ let them slip away... "
set key[id=831174302002318] name "Anyway, since then the royal guard has been investigating \
    $npc:23000025[gender:1]$.\nWe were lucky enough to learn that among the information about that creature, \
    there's an old book\ncalled the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Book of Shadow Tactics</font>... but they say only one \
    copy remains at $map:02000031$... "
set key[id=831174302002319] name "What's the problem with that?"
set key[id=831174302002320] name "Well... $npc:11000005[gender:1]$ is a close friend of \
    $npc:11000160[gender:1]$,\nand I... I can't talk well in front of women... if I stammer\nin front of \
    $npc:11000005[gender:1]$, it'll get back to $npcName:11000160[gender:1]$, and then... "
set key[id=831174302002321] name "Do you want me to get the Book of Shadow Tactics for you?"
set key[id=831174302002322] name "Yes, yes! $MyPCName$. Could you please help me out?\nI have to make up for my \
    past mistake... and win $npcName:11000160[gender:1]$'s heart, too... "
set key[id=831174302002323] name "Yes, yes! $MyPCName$. Could you please help me out?\nI have to make up for my \
    past mistake... and win $npcName:11000160[gender:1]$'s heart, too... "
set key[id=831174302002324] name "Hm? What did you just say?"
set key[id=831174302002325] name "Do you know anything about a book called the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Book of \
    Shadow Tactics</font>?"
set key[id=831174302002326] name "Hmm... I've never actually seen it, but I did hear about it\nfrom old \
    $npc:11000033[gender:0]$ at $map:02000023$."
set key[id=831174302002327] name "I think he said it's a book where the legendary swordsmen known to be from \
    Perion recorded information\non the Demon King's minions they fought here and there when the Demon King \
    appeared long ago."
set key[id=831174302002328] name "For the details, go find old <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000033[gender:0]$</font> at $map:02000023$ and ask him.\nHe's a bit <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">talkative, which is his flaw</font>... but he knows a lot, so he'll tell you everything in \
    detail."
set key[id=831174302002329] name "For the details, go find old <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000033[gender:0]$</font> at $map:02000023$ and ask him.\nHe's a bit <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">talkative, which is his flaw</font>... but he knows a lot, so he'll tell you everything in \
    detail."
set key[id=831174302002330] name "Ah~ $MyPCName$!\nWhat brings you to see me this time?"
set key[id=831174302002331] name "$npc:11000005[gender:1]$ suggested I come see you."
set key[id=831174302002332] name "$npcName:11000005[gender:1]$? The director of $map:02000031$, \
    $npcName:11000005[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302002333] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302002334] name "Oh ho~ She was a girl I truly cherished. I hadn't heard from her for a while and \
    figured she was busy~\nIs she doing well? She was so clever and bright, you know.\nIf only the Blue Lapenta \
    hadn't been shattered, the $map:02000023$ magic library would still be standing\nsafe and sound, and \
    $npc:11000005[gender:1]$ would still be living in $map:02000023$\ninstead of $map:02000001$... "
set key[id=831174302002335] name "When she first came to $map:02000023$, the fairies hated humans so much\nthat \
    she basically lived as an outcast.\nWhat could $npc:11000005[gender:1]$ do then? She shut herself up in the \
    library\nall day long... "
set key[id=831174302002336] name "(Cover $npc:11000033[gender:0]$'s mouth and ask about the Book of Shadow \
    Tactics.)"
set key[id=831174302002337] name "Mmph! What...? What did you say? The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Book of Shadow \
    Tactics</font>?\nWhat do you want with that?"
set key[id=831174302002338] name "The royal guard is gathering information about $npc:23000025[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302002339] name "Aha~ I see... the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Book of Shadow Tactics</font> does go \
    into great detail about\ncreatures that carry the force of darkness...\nBut... what a pity... that book can't \
    be read anymore... "
set key[id=831174302002340] name "Why?"
set key[id=831174302002341] name "Long ago, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000604[gender:0]$</font> was reading it \
    atop the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Burning Tree of Peronia</font>\nand accidentally dropped it, and it burned up \
    without a trace."
set key[id=831174302002342] name "Is there any other way to learn what the book said?"
set key[id=831174302002343] name "Of course not. The book burned to ashes!!"
set key[id=831174302002344] name "Ahhhhh, wait, wait!\nIf it's the <font color=\"#ffd200\">contents</font> of the \
    Book of Shadow Tactics you want, not the book itself, there might be a way."
set key[id=831174302002345] name "How?"
set key[id=831174302002346] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000604[gender:0]$</font>! That fellow has a \
    surprisingly odd talent.\nHe <font color=\"#ffd200\">remembers everything he sees or hears even once</font>. \
    He never forgets.\nMaybe that's why he's always buried in books. He remembers every person he meets,\nevery \
    conversation, everything they do together, and not all of those memories are good ones;\nhe must get hurt a \
    lot..."
set key[id=831174302002347] name "That's why he lived holed up with his books in a place where no one else \
    comes.\nMost fairies are afraid of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Burning Tree of Peronia</font> and avoid \
    it.\nThat's why $npc:11000604[gender:0]$ liked it so much, and then he burned that book...\nand it was one of \
    the few old books he'd rescued just before the magic library vanished..."
set key[id=831174302002348] name "Where can I find $npc:11000604[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302002349] name "Ah, that fellow... he's probably still tucked away in some corner of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000109$</font>.\nOnce he settles into a spot, he never thinks of moving."
set key[id=831174302002350] name "Ah, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000604[gender:0]$</font> is probably still \
    tucked away in some corner of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000109$</font>.\nOnce he settles into a spot, he \
    never thinks of moving."
set key[id=831174302002352] name "(Knock on the firefly jar.)"
set key[id=831174302002353] name "Haah... what... you're bothering me..."
set key[id=831174302002354] name "Do you remember what the Book of Shadow Tactics said?"
set key[id=831174302002355] name "Dunno~ don't remember~"
set key[id=831174302002356] name "I heard everything from $npc:11000033[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302002357] name "Ugh... that chatterbox old man... why does he blab about other people so \
    much?\nSo if I remember? What? Why?"
set key[id=831174302002358] name "Was there anything about $npc:23000025[gender:1]$ and $map:02000206$?"
set key[id=831174302002359] name "Page 547.\n$npc:23000025[gender:1]$, that guy belongs to the Shadow Legion too. \
    If you carelessly mess with him,\nthe Shadow Legion might swarm you in droves."
set key[id=831174302002360] name "Was there any other information about the Shadow Legion?"
set key[id=831174302002361] name "The Demon King's army. No other notable records beyond that.\nThere were a few \
    more lines about $npc:23000025[gender:1]$, but, well... "
set key[id=831174302002362] name "Ah, my mouth hurts.\nI don't want to talk anymore, so go away."
set key[id=831174302002363] name "What was recorded about $npc:23000025[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302002364] name "Ugh... you're really bothering me...\nIf I talk myself hoarse, what are you \
    going to do for me?"
set key[id=831174302002365] name "What do you want?"
set key[id=831174302002366] name "Hmm... let me think... <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000179$</font>?\nBring me \
    that, and I might be willing to give you a bit more of my time for the effort."
set key[id=831174302002367] name "If you go out just a little from $map:02000023$, you'll find a place called \
    $map:02000112$.\nBeing by the water, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22090107$</font> often show up there, they \
    say... "
set key[id=831174302002369] name "(Knock on the firefly jar.)"
set key[id=831174302002370] name "What, again!"
set key[id=831174302002371] name "I got <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000179$</font>."
set key[id=831174302002372] name "Ahh~ it's you?\nJust drop what you brought into the jar."
set key[id=831174302002373] name "(Put <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000179$</font> into the firefly jar.)"
set key[id=831174302002374] name "Hmm... they won't be going out hungry for a while...\nOne less chore for me... "
set key[id=831174302002375] name "So... what was it you wanted to know?"
set key[id=831174302002376] name "I ask about the record of $npc:23000025[gender:1]$ in the Book of Shadow \
    Tactics."
set key[id=831174302002377] name "Ah~ right, that... \nHere's what was written in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Book \
    of Shadow Tactics</font>... "
set key[id=831174302002378] name "There were beasts that awoke in the Demon King's darkness, named the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Baphomet Brothers</font>.\nThe eldest, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000026[gender:1]$</font>, is beyond words in cruelty;\nthe second, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000025[gender:1]$</font>, overflows with wickedness;\nand the third, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000024[gender:1]$</font>, is consumed by madness and tramples everything."
set key[id=831174302002379] name "Of those, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000025[gender:1]$</font> sweeps through \
    the deep forest of $map:02000023$\nwith darkness and chaos, and is called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000206$</font>.\nThe source of the chaos enveloping the forest lies in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000190$</font>, so if <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000025[gender:1]$</font>\nloses \
    it, the shadow of chaos will thin out. "
set key[id=831174302002380] name "That's all of it I could actually make out in the Book of Shadow Tactics.\nThere \
    were probably a few more lines below, but the ink had smeared and I couldn't read them.\nThat's all I know. \
    Now stop bothering me and get out, would you?\n"
set key[id=831174302002381] name "Ugh... hey~\nI told you to stop bothering me, didn't I? I'm about to get really \
    angry, you know?\nPlease just go away, go!"
set key[id=831174302002382] name "Ah, you're back?\nDid you get the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Book of Shadow \
    Tactics</font>?"
set key[id=831174302002383] name "I explain the situation and pass on what $npc:11000604[gender:0]$ said."
set key[id=831174302002384] name "Ah... oh dear... the Book of Shadow Tactics can't be read anymore... what a \
    shame.\nBut more than that... the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Baphomet</font> are three brothers?\nIf they ever \
    showed up all at once... ugh... that would be horrifying."
set key[id=831174302002385] name "Surely... they're not all gathered inside <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000206$</font>... are they? "
set key[id=831174302002472] name "I just can't beat it... \nHow do I get my hands on that... "
set key[id=831174302002473] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302002474] name "$item:30000186$!!\nI need it. I absolutely need it."
set key[id=831174302002475] name "Why do you need it?"
set key[id=831174302002476] name "The new magic I'm learning now requires being able to control the wind \
    freely...\nand that is no easy feat!\nIf I just had the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000186$</font> that a \
    creature called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000007$</font> carries...\nI could learn it far more easily \
    than I expected... "
set key[id=831174302002477] name "One good turn deserves another... how about it?\nBring me $item:30000186$ and \
    I'll give you a present, too.\nThey say $npc:22000007$ often appears at $map:02000180$~"
set key[id=831174302002478] name "Bring me $item:30000186$ and I'll give you a present, too.\nThey say \
    $npc:22000007$ often appears at $map:02000180$~"
set key[id=831174302002479] name "Ooh... so this is $item:30000186$...!!\nGood... good... now everything's ready. \
    I can do this... "
set key[id=831174302002491] name "$MyPCName$!\nThe Great Chief has finally returned.\nGo to $map:02000078$!"
set key[id=831174302002492] name "$MyPCName$!\nThe Great Chief has finally returned.\nGo to $map:02000078$!"
set key[id=831174302002493] name "Ah, are you $MyPCName$, the one who sent the Murpagoth Vulture?\nI hear you \
    waited for me a long while. So, what is it?"
set key[id=831174302002494] name "(Say I want to know about <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>.)"
set key[id=831174302002495] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>?\nHmm... Why do you ask?"
set key[id=831174302002496] name "(Explain how I learned of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000069[gender:1]$'s \
    disappearance</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>.)"
set key[id=831174302002497] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000522[gender:0]$</font>?\nDo you mean the one \
    who killed Win Stilton and shattered the Blue Rappenta?\nAre you saying he has reappeared and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">kidnapped $npc:11000069[gender:1]$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302002498] name "(Say that is what the circumstances suggest.)"
set key[id=831174302002499] name "Sigh... $npc:11000522[gender:0]$...\nCould he be looking for $map:02000229$...?\ \
    \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \
    \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \
    \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ "
set key[id=831174302002500] name "(Ask what kind of place $map:02000229$ is.)"
set key[id=831174302002501] name "It is the temple of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> tribe, who were \
    lured by a demon, sold their souls and became slaves of darkness.\nIt is also where the bloody <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">War of the Wolves</font> took place...  \n"
set key[id=831174302002502] name "Go to $map:02000170$ and meet $npc:11000078$.\nThe fall of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> tribe cannot be discussed without the War of the Wolves...\nTell him I sent \
    you, and $npc:11000078$ will explain in more detail... "
set key[id=831174302002503] name "Go to $map:02000170$ and meet $npc:11000078$.\nThe fall of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> tribe cannot be discussed without the War of the Wolves...\nTell him I sent \
    you, and $npc:11000078$ will explain in more detail..."
set key[id=831174302002504] name "Who goes there...?"
set key[id=831174302002505] name "(Say the Great Chief sent me.)"
set key[id=831174302002506] name "Oh... my eternal friend, $npc:11000134[gender:0]$...?\nI see. What brings you \
    here?"
set key[id=831174302002507] name "(Ask him to tell me about $map:02000229$.)"
set key[id=831174302002508] name "$map:02000229$...?\nIt is a place already forgotten, and one that should stay \
    forgotten.\nDo not seek to learn more."
set key[id=831174302002509] name "(Explain how I learned of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000069[gender:1]$'s \
    disappearance</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font>.)"
set key[id=831174302002510] name "...... This man, $npc:11000522[gender:0]$...\nYou say he may be after \
    $map:02000229$...? "
set key[id=831174302002511] name "$map:02000229$...\nThe scent of wolves' blood... still lingers there... "
set key[id=831174302002512] name "The wolves of the Vayar Mountains... protect the tribes that worship the wolf \
    god.\nWe white wolves... the Murpagoth tribe. The red wolves... the Yamarcha tribe."
set key[id=831174302002513] name "It happened in an instant... <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font> taking command \
    of the Yamarcha tribe...\nAnd so we... had to fight the red wolves that guarded Yamarcha...\nto protect \
    Murpagoth and Perion...\nAnd here in $map:02000170$, that war has still not ended... "
set key[id=831174302002514] name "(Ask who Turka is.)"
set key[id=831174302002515] name "A demon...\nOne that steals the good hearts of ordinary people, nurtures their \
    evil, and turns them into slaves\nof darkness... a being that can command and rule the heart of every living \
    thing... "
set key[id=831174302002516] name "The Shadow World... a descendant of the demon king sealed there...\nIf \
    $npc:11000522[gender:0]$ is searching for $map:02000229$,\nthen he is surely searching for traces of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font>... "
set key[id=831174302002517] name "Even after the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yamarcha</font> tribe vanished, a few \
    greed-stained humans have sought out traces of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font>,\nwanting to gain the \
    power of darkness even by selling their souls to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font>.\nFor a while there were \
    no such fools... and now again... Hmm... "
set key[id=831174302002518] name "A man who would destroy the Blue Rappenta knowing it puts the whole world in \
    danger...\nSelling his soul would mean nothing to $npc:11000522[gender:0]$.\nIf such a man were to make a \
    contract with <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font> and gain the power of darkness... it would be terrible... "
set key[id=831174302002519] name "(Ask for details about the contract with Turka.)"
set key[id=831174302002520] name "You swear obedience to Turka and receive the power of darkness.\nIn exchange for \
    immense power no ordinary human could possess, you become a slave of the demon king.\nAnd... in the end, you \
    are destroyed. Once you are no longer needed... "
set key[id=831174302002521] name "(Say I will go to $map:02000229$ myself and look for $npc:11000522[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302002522] name "You mean to go... now?\n$map:02000229$ has its entrance in the red earth beneath \
    the center of $map:02000170$."
set key[id=831174302002523] name "A mysterious bag lies behind the altar.\nWhose could it be...? Could it be a \
    trace left by $npc:11000522[gender:0]$?\nLet's see what's inside the bag."
set key[id=831174302002524] name "A mysterious bag lies behind the altar.\nWhose could it be...? Could it be a \
    trace left by $npc:11000522[gender:0]$?\nLet's see what's inside the bag."
set key[id=831174302002525] name "Wh-what? You... $MyPCName$!!\nT-to think I'd meet you again like this... "
set key[id=831174302002526] name "$MyPCName$... Do you remember me?"
set key[id=831174302002527] name "(Say of course I remember.)"
set key[id=831174302002528] name "(Say I don't remember.)"
set key[id=831174302002529] name "I see... It has been quite a while... I'm grateful you remember an old man like \
    me.\nYou've grown so much more composed since I last saw you.\nI heard you left for Victoria Island. So, how \
    have you been?"
set key[id=831174302002530] name "(Tell him what I've been through.)"
set key[id=831174302002531] name "Heh heh... To have gone through all that and grown like this... I'm truly proud \
    of you.\nNow then... how did you find your way here?"
set key[id=831174302002532] name "(Say I'm chasing $npc:11000064[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302002533] name "$npc:11000064[gender:0]$?\nYou, after $npc:11000064[gender:0]$...? Why...?"
set key[id=831174302002534] name "(Tell him everything $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ is suspected of.)"
set key[id=831174302002535] name "Oh dear... kidnapping...\nSo that's why $npc:11000064[gender:0]$, in a body that \
    isn't even healed, went to rescue\n$npc:11000069[gender:1]$ who was dragged off to the Land of Darkness...!!"
set key[id=831174302002536] name "(Ask him to explain what happened.)"
set key[id=831174302002537] name "I first crossed paths with $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ near the $map:02000238$\nat \
    the end of the cliff in $map:02000117$.\nHe lay there covered in blood, unconscious, looking as though he \
    would die any moment.\nI couldn't just leave him like that. "
set key[id=831174302002538] name "For days on end... $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ did not wake.\nI don't know how much \
    time passed... but when he finally came to... heh heh...\nthe first words that boy spoke, I still cannot \
    forget."
set key[id=831174302002539] name "(Ask what he said.)"
set key[id=831174302002540] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">I can't die like this... I won't die...</font>\nI could \
    tell right away that he was someone who had to survive,\nsomeone with something he had to do while alive."
set key[id=831174302002541] name "(Ask what $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ had to do.)"
set key[id=831174302002542] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">To clear my name and bring out the truth...!</font>\nHe \
    would say nothing more than that.\nHe said that if I knew the whole truth, even I could be put in danger... "
set key[id=831174302002543] name "(Ask what happened to $npc:11000069[gender:1]$.)"
set key[id=831174302002544] name "$npc:11000064[gender:0]$ said he had to let $npc:11000069[gender:1]$, at least, \
    know that he was innocent.\nBut as a hunted man he couldn't just go find $npc:11000069[gender:1]$...\nThe idea \
    he came up with... was to hide notes inside the books of $map:02000221$,\nwhere the two had gone together \
    since childhood, and pass them back and forth."
set key[id=831174302002545] name "Then $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ sent word that she wanted to help at \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$'s side directly...\nAnd so the two met again after many twists and turns, but while \
    searching $map:02000229$\nfor evidence that could clear his name...\nthose who had chased \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ all the way from the Land of Darkness... sigh...\nHe survived, thankfully... but it \
    seems those men took $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ away."
set key[id=831174302002546] name "Last night, $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ left this one letter, asking me to pass \
    it\nto a friend called $npc:11000529[gender:0]$, and then he was gone.\nI never thought he would go off alone, \
    recklessly like that...\nHe needs people who believe in him and will lend him strength."
set key[id=831174302002547] name "I'll look for other ways to help him, so could you deliver\nthis $item:30000340$ \
    to the friend called $npc:11000529[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302002548] name "Ah... you look so much like someone I know that I mistook you.\nSo, how did you \
    get all the way here?"
set key[id=831174302002549] name "(Say I'm chasing $npc:11000064[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302002550] name "Hm?\nWhy did you turn back halfway? Have you changed your mind?"
set key[id=831174302002551] name "(Say I left the $item:30000340$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302002552] name "(Say I took a wrong turn for a moment.)"
set key[id=831174302002553] name "Ah... is that so?\nHere, take good care of it this time."
set key[id=831174302002554] name "Heh heh... How can you be so careless?\nTake another look in your bag."
set key[id=831174302002555] name "Carrying a bag that heavy must make your shoulders ache...\nYou've grown so much \
    stronger and more composed than before, yet your height is still the same as then.\nNow I understand why... \
    Why not empty your bag a little and travel light?"
set key[id=831174302002556] name "No wonder...\nThe $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ you've known until now and the \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ I told you about\nmust seem like completely different people... It's natural the \
    shock hasn't worn off yet.\n"
set key[id=831174302002557] name "Hm? $MyPCName$. It's been a while.\nI heard you've been searching for \
    $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ at $npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s request.\nSo what brings you here?"
set key[id=831174302002558] name "(Hand over the $item:30000340$.)"
set key[id=831174302002559] name "This is... \nYou met $npc:11000064[gender:0]$? Did you?"
set key[id=831174302002560] name "(Say I didn't meet him in person.)"
set key[id=831174302002561] name "I knew it... that guy... he was alive!! I knew it!!\nBut... why did he disappear \
    again after leaving only a letter?"
set key[id=831174302002562] name "(Tell him to read the letter.)"
set key[id=831174302002563] name "Ugh... that fool...\nHe's going alone to look for $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ at \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>, known in the Land of Darkness\nas the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Tower \
    of Slaves</font>...\nReckless idiot!! No matter how urgent it is, going back to that dangerous place \
    alone...!!!"
set key[id=831174302002564] name "(Ask what <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> is.)"
set key[id=831174302002565] name "Hmm...! $MyPCName$, I'm sorry. I don't have time to explain at length right \
    now.\nI have to go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> and help $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ first!"
set key[id=831174302002566] name "Ah, wait.\nAre you going to report everything to $npc:11000044[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302002567] name "Well... the judgment is yours to make, but personally, I'd like you to hold \
    off\non telling him that $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ is alive and well.\nIt wouldn't be too late to decide after \
    you've met $npc:11000064[gender:0]$\nand heard his side of the story first."
set key[id=831174302002568] name "Anyway, I hope you judge wisely.\nNow, I'll be going."
set key[id=831174302002569] name "What is it? Do you want to help $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ too?"
set key[id=831174302002570] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302002571] name "(Say no.)"
set key[id=831174302002572] name "Is that so? Then meet me at <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>.\nThey say \
    the entrance is at a place called $map:03000057$ in the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=831174302002573] name "You asked me earlier what <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> is, didn't \
    you?\nGo there yourself... see it, hear it, live it... and you'll understand. "
set key[id=831174302002574] name "Hmm... in that case, I have nothing more to say."
set key[id=831174302002575] name "What on earth happened to you?\nWhat about $npc:11000069[gender:1]$? Did you \
    find her?"
set key[id=831174302002576] name "(Say I couldn't find any trace.)"
set key[id=831174302002577] name "(Leave out $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ and say $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ seems to be \
    in the Land of Darkness.)"
set key[id=831174302002578] name "(Tell him everything I've learned about $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ and \
    $npc:11000069[gender:1]$.)"
set key[id=831174302002579] name "Damn it!! What on earth have you been doing all this time?!!!!\nSigh... \
    $npc:11000069[gender:1]$... where in the world are you..."
set key[id=831174302002580] name "What? The Land of Darkness?\nWhy? Why would Eve be there? How did you find out?"
set key[id=831174302002581] name "(Say I heard it from an anonymous witness.)"
set key[id=831174302002582] name "An anonymous witness? Who is that?"
set key[id=831174302002583] name "(Say I can't tell because they're anonymous.)"
set key[id=831174302002584] name "$MyPCName$... how disappointing.\nMaking a speculative report like this, with no \
    basis and no evidence, just on someone's word... "
set key[id=831174302002585] name "What? $npc:11000064[gender:0]$?\nSo that fellow... he stubbornly stayed alive \
    after all!!!\n$MyPCName$, you may go now. From here on, I'll handle it my own way."
set key[id=831174302002586] name "<font color=\"#909090\">...The Land of Darkness... I don't know who it is, \
    but...\nthis is surely bait aimed at me... bait using Eve...</font>"
set key[id=831174302002587] name "Wait! $MyPCName$!\nI have a favor to ask of you."
set key[id=831174302002588] name "Go ahead, I'm listening."
set key[id=831174302002589] name "$map:02000229$... foolish beings still remain there, craving the power of evil \
    like a sweet poison\nand waiting for <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font>.\nEven the faintest trace of evil \
    grows beyond control once it begins to gather, one by one!\nPlease eliminate all the fools in $map:02000229$ \
    who crave the power of evil."
set key[id=831174302002590] name "And... one more thing...\nDeep in $map:02000229$ lies <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Machar</font>, king of the red wolves...\nHis soul, which followed Yamarcha, has also become \
    a slave of darkness, bound...\nstill like that... his form hardened like stone... "
set key[id=831174302002591] name "We had no choice but to go to war... but before that, he and I were the closest \
    of friends...\nPlease free his soul, which must be suffering, bound in darkness\ninside his body hardened by \
    this $item:30000076$."
set key[id=831174302002592] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302002593] name "(Say I left the $item:30000076$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302002594] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302002595] name "I see. Here, take it.\nI'm counting on you... "
set key[id=831174302002596] name "I saw you put it in your bag earlier...\nDid you look through your bag \
    carefully? Search once more."
set key[id=831174302002597] name "Your bag looks quite heavy... \nWhy not tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=831174302002598] name "Burn the body of Machar, preserved by the $item:30000076$, and free his \
    soul,\nwhich must be suffering, bound in darkness."
set key[id=831174302002599] name "Behind the altar, where the purifying fire rose, something that had been hidden \
    in the darkness\nseems to have come into view."
set key[id=831174302002600] name "Now... if you have any questions for me, feel free to ask.\nI'll answer \
    honestly."
set key[id=831174302002601] name "(Ask how he ended up going all the way to Katramus.)"
set key[id=831174302002602] name "After getting the $item:30000340$ from you last time, I went straight to the \
    Land of Darkness.\nWell... I can't go into detail, but some Humblis agents are also active in the Land of \
    Darkness,\nso finding <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> wasn't all that hard."
set key[id=831174302002603] name "As it happened, the Lumina Liberation Army was also running a large-scale \
    operation\nto rescue the people held as slaves in <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>.\nSo I joined them \
    and combed through <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> from top to bottom."
set key[id=831174302002604] name "And then... right in front of $map:02000296$... I met \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$!!\nWe hadn't seen each other for a long time... but I recognized him at a glance."
set key[id=831174302002605] name "(Ask how he felt.)"
set key[id=831174302002606] name "Ahem!! Felt? Nothing special... we just met, that's all. Guys will be guys...\nI \
    don't know what he was thinking, but he didn't say a word.\nWell... we don't need words between us.\nAnyway... \
    after a lot of twists and turns, we rescued $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ too and all three of us came back \
    together."
set key[id=831174302002607] name "(Ask where $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ is now.)"
set key[id=831174302002608] name "He was injured trying to rescue $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ at Katramus...\nso he's \
    recovering quietly somewhere Dark Wind won't spot him.\n$npc:11000069[gender:1]$ is sticking right by his side \
    and looking after him... he'll be better soon.\nMore importantly... there's something we need to check right \
    now!"
set key[id=831174302002609] name "(Ask what it is.)"
set key[id=831174302002610] name "Not long ago... I secretly received an <font color=\"#ffd200\">anonymous request \
    for rescue</font>.\nThe sender said Dark Wind was chasing them, and that if we protected them, they would tell \
    us\nall of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s secrets</font>."
set key[id=831174302002611] name "I sent Humblis agents to the origin of the message, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000279$</font>,\nbut I'd like you to go and help them find whoever sent the \
    request.\nWe must find them before Dark Wind does!\nWe'll know whether that message is true once we meet \
    them...!"
set key[id=831174302002612] name "Not long ago... I secretly received an anonymous request for rescue.\nThe sender \
    said Dark Wind was chasing them, and that if we protected them, they would tell us\nall of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s secrets</font>.\nGo to the origin of the message, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000279$</font>, and find whoever sent it!"
set key[id=831174302002613] name "Hm? It's been a while! $MyPCName$."
set key[id=831174302002614] name "(Say I came to help at $npc:11000529[gender:0]$'s request.)"
set key[id=831174302002615] name "Perfect timing.\nThe railway station is bigger than I expected, and I was at a \
    loss... "
set key[id=831174302002616] name "The Humblis agents are splitting up to search separate areas.\nYou take the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">closed-off zone</font> you see behind me.\nDon't forget. We have to find that person \
    before Dark Wind does! Without fail... "
set key[id=831174302002617] name "The Humblis agents are splitting up to search separate areas.\nYou take the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">closed-off zone</font> you see behind me.\nDon't forget. We have to find that person \
    before Dark Wind does! Without fail... "
set key[id=831174302002618] name "Uuugh... w-who's there... "
set key[id=831174302002619] name "(Ask if he is the one who sent the anonymous request for rescue to Humblis.)"
set key[id=831174302002620] name "Ah...! Humblis...!!\nDid $npc:11000529[gender:0]$ send you? Sigh... I'm saved... \
    I'm saved!!!"
set key[id=831174302002621] name "Haa... I really thought I'd be caught by $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ and die \
    without anyone ever knowing.\nThose thugs who chased me all the way here were hired by \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ too."
set key[id=831174302002622] name "(Ask why $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ is chasing him.)"
set key[id=831174302002623] name "W-well... because if I'm alive... the whole truth comes out...\nMy name is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000526[gender:0]$</font>! I'm the head of the Barota Company."
set key[id=831174302002624] name "(Say $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ is dead.)"
set key[id=831174302002625] name "After $npc:11000492[gender:0]$ died, I tried to stow away to escape \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$,\nbut a pickpocket got me and I ended up penniless. That's when I became a back-alley \
    vagrant.\nSome time later... one of the pickpocket gang who stole my wallet was found dead\nat $map:02000138$, \
    and thanks to the ID in the wallet, I was reported dead.\n"
set key[id=831174302002626] name "It's a shame for that pickpocket who lost his life, but...\nfor me it was \
    fortunate, since I could escape\n$npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s pursuit for a while...\nBut... I underestimated \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ too badly...\nHe knew from the start that the dead man wasn't me, and he kept \
    tracking my movements."
set key[id=831174302002627] name "Chased and chased until I had nowhere left to run... I figured I'd really die \
    soon like this,\nso I resigned myself to a lifetime in prison and asked Humblis for help."
set key[id=831174302002628] name "(Ask what $npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s secret is.)"
set key[id=831174302002629] name "That man... has joined hands with <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font>, who \
    leads the shadow legion in the Land of Darkness,\nand he's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">traitor</font> who \
    follows Turka's orders!!\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">royal armory theft</font>, and even killing <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000492[gender:0]$</font>... it was all\nhim...!!"
set key[id=831174302002630] name "Anyway, I'll reveal the whole truth of everything that's happened, so please \
    help me get away from\n$npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s grasp!"
set key[id=831174302002631] name "(Say I'll go gather the Humblis agents outside the closed-off zone.)"
set key[id=831174302002632] name "Come back quickly!! Before anything happens in the meantime...\nOh, and there's \
    a ledger recording every dealing I had with $npc:11000044[gender:0]$.\nI hid it behind the wall clock at \
    $map:02000226$...\nin the Barota Company headquarters."
set key[id=831174302002633] name "I doubt anyone has found it yet... Go find it quickly before someone destroys \
    it.\nIt's the decisive evidence that will prove $npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s true face!"
set key[id=831174302002634] name "Oh, and there's a ledger recording every dealing I had with \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$.\nGo to our company headquarters in $map:02000139$ and you'll find $map:02000226$.\nI \
    hid the ledger behind the wall clock there."
set key[id=831174302002635] name "What about that person? Did you find them?"
set key[id=831174302002636] name "(Tell him what $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ said.)"
set key[id=831174302002637] name "What...? The one who sent the request for rescue was \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$...\nI can hardly believe it without seeing it with my own eyes!!"
set key[id=831174302002638] name "Leave $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ to me, and you go to $map:02000139$ and \
    check\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">the wall clock in $map:02000226$</font>.\nIf that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">ledger</font> really exists... and if you actually find it, take it straight to \
    $npc:11000529[gender:0]$\nand show him!"
set key[id=831174302002639] name "Leave $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ to me, and you go to $map:02000139$ and \
    check\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">the wall clock in $map:02000226$</font>.\nIf that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">ledger</font> really exists... and if you actually find it, take it straight to \
    $npc:11000529[gender:0]$\nand show him!"
set key[id=831174302002640] name "$MyPCName$! I've been waiting for you.\nI heard everything from \
    $npc:11000565[gender:0]$. How did it go?"
set key[id=831174302002641] name "(Hand over the $item:30000075$.)"
set key[id=831174302002642] name "This is... Unbelievable...\nEverything $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ said was true!"
set key[id=831174302002643] name "With $npc:11000526[gender:0]$'s testimony and this $item:30000075$...\nwe can \
    prove $npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s crimes beyond doubt!\nAnd then... everyone will believe what \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ said too! "
set key[id=831174302002644] name "$MyPCName$!\nGo to $map:02000152$ right now and keep watch so \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ doesn't catch on\nand run."
set key[id=831174302002645] name "$MyPCName$!\nGo to $map:02000152$ right now and keep watch so \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ doesn't catch on\nand run."
set key[id=831174302002646] name "Why are you out of breath... in such a hurry?\nIs something wrong?"
set key[id=831174302002647] name "(Ask where $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ is.)"
set key[id=831174302002648] name "He went out a while ago, saying he had urgent business... "
set key[id=831174302002649] name "He looked uneasy and anxious, not like Captain $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ at \
    all...\nIs something really wrong?"
set key[id=831174302002650] name "(Reveal $npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s true nature.)"
set key[id=831174302002651] name "W-what did you say...?\nCaptain $npc:11000044[gender:0]$... can't be... it \
    can't... "
set key[id=831174302002652] name "Sigh... I just can't believe it...\nWhat's going to happen to our Dark Wind \
    now...?"
set key[id=831174302002653] name "Why that face?\nDon't tell me $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ has already...?"
set key[id=831174302002654] name "(Say $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ has vanished.)"
set key[id=831174302002655] name "Damn...!! We're one step too late... "
set key[id=831174302002656] name "Sigh... Go to $map:02000001$ and show this $item:30000075$ to the \
    $npcTitle:11000119[gender:0]$,\nand tell him a warrant must be issued for $npc:11000044[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302002657] name "Why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174302002658] name "(Say I left the $item:30000075$ behind.)"
set key[id=831174302002659] name "(Say you forgot what he asked.)"
set key[id=831174302002660] name "It's important. Take good care of it!"
set key[id=831174302002661] name "I saw you put it in your bag earlier...\nDid you look through your bag \
    carefully?"
set key[id=831174302002662] name "Why not tidy up your bag a little?"
set key[id=831174302002663] name "Go to $map:02000001$ and show this $item:30000075$ to the \
    $npcTitle:11000119[gender:0]$,\nand tell him a warrant must be issued for $npc:11000044[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302002664] name "Oh, $MyPCName$! It's been a while.\nI heard $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ was caught \
    and is being transferred here.\nThey say you were the one who found him... What on earth is all this about?"
set key[id=831174302002665] name "(Show the $item:30000075$ and tell him everything that has happened.)"
set key[id=831174302002666] name "...... This... I'm speechless!!"
set key[id=831174302002667] name "First, I'll issue the warrant for $npc:11000044[gender:0]$.\nOnce \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ is transferred, we'll learn all the circumstances in detail."
set key[id=831174302002668] name "The $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ is also bewildered by the news of \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$.\nGo and report the situation to the $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ in person."
set key[id=831174302002669] name "The $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ is also bewildered by the news of \
    $npc:11000526[gender:0]$.\nGo and report the situation to the $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ in person."
set key[id=831174302002670] name "The head of the Barota Company has appeared... What happened?"
set key[id=831174302002671] name "(Tell her everything from $npc:11000064[gender:0]$'s return up to now.)"
set key[id=831174302002672] name "$npc:11000044[gender:0]$... it was all him...\nWhere is \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$? "
set key[id=831174302002673] name "(Say he is injured and resting somewhere.)"
set key[id=831174302002674] name "Everything we had known as truth was a lie, and the things we thought were \
    lies\nhave become truth. We must set it all right, even now!"
set key[id=831174302002764] name "$MyPCName$!\nWe've received fresh news about the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow \
    Legion</font>, known as the Demon King's army."
set key[id=831174302002765] name "What news?"
set key[id=831174302002766] name "We suspected the Devlins belonged to the Shadow Legion, but...\nthere's one even \
    stronger."
set key[id=831174302002767] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000213$</font>! And a fellow called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000007[gender:0]$</font>...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000213$</font> seems to \
    be a kind of 'summoning ground' where <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000007[gender:0]$</font>\nendlessly calls \
    forth Shadow Legion soldiers and strengthens them with the power of darkness. "
set key[id=831174302002768] name "The reason monsters never stop appearing at $map:02000146$...\nmust be that \
    $map:02000213$ exists, linking $map:03000146$ and $map:02000146$\nand summoning legion soldiers."
set key[id=831174302002769] name "A Guardians scouting party is searching for places suspected to be that \
    'summoning ground' right now.\nWe should hear from them soon... "
set key[id=831174302002770] name "A Guardians scouting party is searching for places suspected to be that \
    'summoning ground' right now.\nWe should hear from them soon... "
set key[id=831174302002771] name "Ah, a report just came in.\nThe Guardians scouts found a suspicious door in a \
    remote spot at the end of the cliff just below here!"
set key[id=831174302002774] name "If... that door is the entrance to $map:02000213$, we'll have to move more \
    carefully.\nWe need to gather as much information on the Shadow Legion as we can and plan the battle \
    thoroughly."
set key[id=831174302002775] name "$MyPCName$!\nI'll assemble an elite force and follow soon. Would you go ahead \
    and scout the situation?"
set key[id=831174302002778] name "$MyPCName$!\nI'll assemble an elite force and follow soon. Would you go ahead \
    and scout the situation?"
set key[id=831174302002779] name "I knew it... that place was the Shadow Legion's summoning ground...\nAnd <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font>... what was he doing there?"
set key[id=831174302002780] name "Strange... time's passed already... "
set key[id=831174302002781] name "(Ask who she is waiting for.)"
set key[id=831174302002782] name "Ah... never mind, it's nothing.\nAh... I really don't have time... this is \
    bad... "
set key[id=831174302002783] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302002785] name "I don't have time to explain in detail...\nYou look like you've been through a \
    lot, though... will you help me out?"
set key[id=831174302002786] name "Let's hear them."
set key[id=831174302002787] name "It's not hard and it's nothing bad, so don't worry!\nYou just have to pass along \
    a single message.\nThere's someone I absolutely have to meet here before I go... but they just won't show up."
set key[id=831174302002790] name "If you meet someone called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000841[gender:1]$</font> at the shelter at $map:03000143$ or around it,\ncould \
    you tell her <font color=\"#ffd200\">there's no time, so we have to proceed as planned right \
    away</font>...\nJust that message?"
set key[id=831174302002793] name "If you meet someone called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000841[gender:1]$</font> at the shelter at $map:03000143$ or around it,\ncould \
    you tell her <font color=\"#ffd200\">there's no time, so we have to proceed as planned right \
    away</font>...\nJust that message?"
set key[id=831174302002794] name "Ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002795] name "Are you $npcName:11000841[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302002796] name "Ugh... how do you know me?"
set key[id=831174302002797] name "I pass on $npcName:11000842[gender:1]$'s message."
set key[id=831174302002798] name "Ugh... I know there's no time... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002799] name "Ugh... I can't get up at all... "
set key[id=831174302002800] name "How did you get hurt?"
set key[id=831174302002801] name "What other reason would there be for getting hurt around here? Ugh...\nI should \
    have found a decent doctor... that quack made it worse\nwhile supposedly treating me! Ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002802] name "Haah... this won't do... $MyPCName$.\nSince you've come this far, help us out... \
    there's something far more important\nthan fighting monsters out there... "
set key[id=831174302002803] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302002804] name "Have you heard of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumina Liberation \
    Army</font>...?\nAh, well... it doesn't matter whether you know about us or not... ugh...\nAnyway, we're \
    preparing to rescue the people imprisoned in <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>, known as the\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Tower of Slaves</font> in the Land of Darkness... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002805] name "My mission was to... remove the poisoned traps set around <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> and take out the guards\nin advance... but as you can see, I'm in no \
    shape... ugh...\nCould you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> in $map:03000057$ and carry out my \
    mission in my place?"
set key[id=831174302002806] name "What about $npcName:11000842[gender:1]$, who's waiting for you?"
set key[id=831174302002807] name "I'll... ugh... handle that myself...\nRight now it's not \
    $npcName:11000842[gender:1]$ that matters, it's the people suffering as slaves\nheld in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>...!! "
set key[id=831174302002808] name "My mission was to... remove the poisoned traps set around <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> and take out the guards\nin advance... but as you can see, I'm in no \
    shape... ugh...\nCould you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> in $map:03000057$ and carry out my \
    mission in my\nplace?"
set key[id=831174302002809] name "Hm? Are you a new member of our Lumina Liberation Army?"
set key[id=831174302002810] name "(Say no.)"
set key[id=831174302002811] name "But why are you here...\nand $npcName:11000841[gender:1]$? What on earth \
    happened?"
set key[id=831174302002812] name "I explain what happened."
set key[id=831174302002813] name "Ah... I see.\nSorry for mistaking you for a suspicious person."
set key[id=831174302002814] name "I've been keeping an eye on <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> all this \
    time.\nTo rescue the villagers held as slaves against the large Shadow Legion force with our numbers,\nI think \
    it's better to sneak in by the side path leading to the underground mine\nin the lower left than through the \
    main gate."
set key[id=831174302002815] name "I quietly went in a moment ago... The path is narrow and dark, so we can't send \
    many people in at once,\nbut it has the advantage of not being easily spotted by the enemy."
set key[id=831174302002816] name "How far in did you get?"
set key[id=831174302002817] name "The entrance to the underground mine... I couldn't go any farther.\nThe sight \
    before my eyes was so shocking... "
set key[id=831174302002818] name "What did you see?"
set key[id=831174302002819] name "Adults, children, no distinction... among vicious miners, they were digging for \
    ore with bare hands\nin the rough gaps of the rocks.\nGrimy faces, exhausted expressions... it hurt just to \
    look at them."
set key[id=831174302002820] name "It'll take a little longer for the Lumina Liberation Army's full operation to \
    get underway...\nand in the meantime, innocent people will keep suffering in that dreadful place.\nWith just a \
    few skilled allies joining forces,\nwe could save the people of $map:02000292$... "
set key[id=831174302002821] name "Could you rescue at least the people held at $map:02000292$\nfirst, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=831174302002822] name "Could you rescue at least the people held at $map:02000292$\nfirst, \
    $MyPCName$?\nWith allies as skilled as you, $MyPCName$, I'm sure you can\neasily do it... "
set key[id=831174302002823] name "Ahh~ you've done so well.\nThanks to you, those people got out of their \
    suffering that much sooner."
set key[id=831174302002848] name "Haiku!\nWhat is it, what is it... what did I just see-yo... "
set key[id=831174302002849] name "What did you see?"
set key[id=831174302002850] name "I was looking at the forest through my telescope just now-yo.\nAnd over on the \
    other side, down below, there's a strange door open and\na blue whirlpool swirling around-yo.\nTake a look \
    through the telescope yourself-yo. You'll see the blue whirlpool."
set key[id=831174302002851] name "There's hardly anything in our forest I don't know, but I have no idea what that \
    is-yo.\nIt's scary... and also curious...\nI'd like you to go check it out-yo."
set key[id=831174302002852] name "I was looking at the forest through my telescope just now-yo.\nAnd over on the \
    other side, down below, there's a strange door open and\na blue whirlpool swirling around-yo!\nI'd like you to \
    go check it out-yo."
set key[id=831174302002853] name "Did you go inside the whirlpool-yo?"
set key[id=831174302002854] name "I tell what happened at $map:02000066$."
set key[id=831174302002855] name "Huh? Monsters from the Shadow World are trying to destroy the Green \
    Lapenta-yo?\nAnd $npc:11000032[gender:0]$ is guarding it...-yo?\nThat's strange-yo... "
set key[id=831174302002856] name "What's strange?"
set key[id=831174302002857] name "As far as I know, the Green Lapenta is at $map:02000023$-yo...\nAnd I heard it's \
    $npc:11000031[gender:0]$ who guards the Green Lapenta-yo... "
set key[id=831174302002858] name "I can't tell what's going on-yo... I'm dizzy-yo...\nAnyway, thanks for checking \
    it out-yo!"
set key[id=831174302002859] name "Why is there still no word... "
set key[id=831174302002860] name "What word are you waiting for?"
set key[id=831174302002861] name "Auntie <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000242[gender:1]$</font>... she said \
    she'd find out\nwhether my mom might be\nin the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>."
set key[id=831174302002862] name "Auntie $npcName:11000242[gender:1]$ runs a cafe at $map:02000135$,\nand a \
    customer who came in said...\npeople who suddenly disappeared like my mom were taken to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>... "
set key[id=831174302002863] name "But... a long time has passed and there's no word from her...\nCould you go to \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000135$</font>, $MyPCName$, and ask Auntie <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000242[gender:1]$</font>\nwhether my mom was really taken to the Land of \
    Darkness?"
set key[id=831174302002864] name "Could you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000135$</font>, $MyPCName$, and \
    ask Auntie <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000242[gender:1]$</font>\nwhether my mom was really taken to the \
    Land of Darkness?"
set key[id=831174302002865] name "Oh dear... so busy, so busy... \nPlease wait just a moment. A big group just \
    left and I'm all in a flurry."
set key[id=831174302002866] name "Phew... did I keep you waiting? Sorry about that.\nMust be the nicer weather... \
    there are so many more tourists. Hohoho.\nWhat would you like to order?"
set key[id=831174302002867] name "I pass on $npc:11000221[gender:1]$'s message."
set key[id=831174302002868] name "Oh my... I've been meaning to go see $npc:11000221[gender:1]$, I really \
    have...\nbut it suddenly got so busy... sigh... "
set key[id=831174302002869] name "Is $npcName:11000221[gender:1]$'s mom really in the Land of Darkness?"
set key[id=831174302002870] name "It's not certain yet.\nActually, our regular customer \
    $npcName:11000384[gender:0]$ quietly told me he got hold of something\ncalled <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000010$</font>.\nSomeone seems to have lost it while secretly investigating the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow World</font> behind the Guardians' backs."
set key[id=831174302002871] name "It was written in quite some detail, and when I looked it over... apparently \
    quite a few people\nslip past the Guardians through the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font> into \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow World</font>.\nSome eyewitnesses even said they saw Maple World people \
    living like slaves in the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>, having lost their memories...  "
set key[id=831174302002872] name "So I started to think that\n$npcName:11000221[gender:1]$'s mom might be among \
    those people. "
set key[id=831174302002873] name "I'd like to see <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000010$</font>."
set key[id=831174302002874] name "Ah, then go meet $npcName:11000384[gender:0]$.\nHe ate here a moment ago and \
    went downstairs, so he should still be somewhere in\n$map:02000135$."
set key[id=831174302002875] name "Go meet $npcName:11000384[gender:0]$.\nHe ate here a moment ago and went \
    downstairs, so he should still be somewhere in\n$map:02000135$."
set key[id=831174302002876] name "Ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002877] name "Wh-what do you want...  "
set key[id=831174302002878] name "I'd like to see <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000010$</font>."
set key[id=831174302002879] name "How did you kn... know that... ugh...\nI don't... I don't have it... I sold it \
    to $npc:11000609[gender:0]$... "
set key[id=831174302002880] name "Where is $npc:11000609[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302002881] name "I... I don't know... he probably went to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of \
    Darkness</font>...\nTry finding the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Door</font> at the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Gate</font>."
set key[id=831174302002882] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Gate</font>... they said there's a huge \
    Shadow Door there...\n$npc:11000609[gender:0]$ went that way too, so go if you want... ugh... "
set key[id=831174302002883] name "Y-you came looking for me...?\nWh-who sent you...?"
set key[id=831174302002884] name "I came looking for you because I want to see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000010$</font>."
set key[id=831174302002885] name "Ah... that... I lost it...\nIt's lucky enough I made it here alive... if you're \
    thinking of going to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>...\nthen... if you can... you'd \
    better not set foot in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>... "
set key[id=831174302002886] name "Why?"
set key[id=831174302002887] name "There's a cold-blooded place out there where if you don't trample others first, \
    you get trampled...\nSomewhere in there, I tell you...\nI was fine, at least... because I had the protection \
    of the Black Star Society... "
set key[id=831174302002889] name "But hey... are you even listening to me...?\nYou've been staring at the entrance \
    to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font> this whole time...!!\nYou... you're planning to go to \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>, aren't you? "
set key[id=831174302002890] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302002891] name "Sigh... well... at first I was more curious than scared, too...\nAnd that's how \
    I ended up like this... Anyway, even if I try to stop you, you probably won't listen... "
set key[id=831174302002935] name "Ah! $MyPCName$!\nI have news you'll be glad to hear."
set key[id=831174302002936] name "(Ask what it is.)"
set key[id=831174302002937] name "$npc:11000064[gender:0]$ has joined the Guardians.\nYou must already know the \
    news about $npc:11000044[gender:0]$...\nAfter meeting $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ in person, the \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ gave him the mission of finding\n$npc:11000044[gender:0]$, who has covered his \
    tracks and vanished."
set key[id=831174302002938] name "Now that I know all the circumstances, I feel terrible for once hunting\nand \
    chasing $npc:11000064[gender:0]$... Hmm...\nAnyway, $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ also really wants to see you. \
    He's in $map:02000228$ now,\nso go in and meet him."
set key[id=831174302002939] name "$npc:11000064[gender:0]$ also really wants to see you. He's in $map:02000228$ \
    now,\nso go in and meet him."
set key[id=831174302002940] name "Hm? Who...? Ah~!! $MyPCName$!!!\nWelcome. I've really wanted to see you. This is \
    the first time we've met face to face, isn't it?"
set key[id=831174302002941] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302002942] name "I've heard so much about you from $npc:11000529[gender:0]$.\nHe said you helped \
    us a lot... and praised you as a really good kid.\nThat's rare for $npc:11000529[gender:0]$ to say, given his \
    personality. Heh heh.\nHe must have taken a liking to you!"
set key[id=831174302002943] name "Anyway... thank you so much for helping me clear the name \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ pinned on me\nand return to where I belong."
set key[id=831174302002944] name "(Ask about what happened with $npc:11000044[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302002945] name "When Captain <font color=\"#ffd200\">Win Stilton</font> was still alive...\none \
    day he told me there was a place we had to go together, and we set out.\nThe place he took me was right \
    here... a small, shabby building in the ruined city\nonce called Kerning Dome, before today's \
    $map:02000146$.\nWe opened a rusty door and found a huge, sturdy vault inside."
set key[id=831174302002946] name "The Captain opened that vault with his own hands... and inside it... was the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Blue Rappenta</font>.\nIt was shining... so beautifully...\nBut then, suddenly, \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ burst in along with people\nconsumed by greed and madness... "
set key[id=831174302002947] name "They were all fools who had sold their souls to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font> and borrowed the power of evil\nto fulfill the desires that had bloomed in \
    their hearts.\n$npc:11000044[gender:0]$ too could not overcome his greed to become Dark Wind's captain\nand \
    made a contract with <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font>."
set key[id=831174302002948] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font> found out that Captain <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Win Stilton</font> was the <font color=\"#ffd200\">guardian of the Blue \
    Rappenta</font>,\nand approached <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000044[gender:0]$</font> to exploit his \
    greed...\nThe Captain tried to protect the Blue Rappenta to the very end... But... the combined force of black \
    desires\nfrom fools, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000044[gender:0]$</font> among them, was overwhelming... "
set key[id=831174302002949] name "In the end, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Blue Rappenta</font> was shattered by \
    the desire of a giant demon,\nformed from small greeds gathering one after another.\nAnd... Captain Win \
    Stilton fell at the hands of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000044[gender:0]$</font>... "
set key[id=831174302002950] name "I don't remember what happened after that.\nWhen I opened my eyes and came to, I \
    was already in the Land of Darkness... deep in that darkness."
set key[id=831174302002951] name "We can go over the details later!\nRight now, finding the missing \
    $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ is more urgent."
set key[id=831174302002952] name "The truth is, this place, $map:02000146$, is where the rifts in space got\nworst \
    when the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Blue Lapenta</font> shattered.\nThere are quite a few invisible paths linking \
    it to the Land of Darkness,\nand those paths all connect to each other like a maze."
set key[id=831174302002953] name "$npc:11000044[gender:0]$ will surely use these passages to slip into the Land of \
    Darkness and ask the Shadow Legion\nfor help.\nTo find $npc:11000044[gender:0]$, we have to split up into \
    zones and search every inch of these passages.\nWith the Guardians backing us, our squads have already started \
    searching some zones."
set key[id=831174302002954] name "I'm going to head out and search with $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ too.\n$MyPCName$, \
    will you help us find $npc:11000044[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302002955] name "I'll help."
set key[id=831174302002956] name "Good! Then start your search at $map:02000308$.\nI don't know where exactly, but \
    somewhere in the passages there should be\na spot where they join up with another passage."
set key[id=831174302002957] name "Start your search at $map:02000308$.\nOn the way to $map:02000145$ there should \
    be an entrance leading into\n$map:02000237$."
set key[id=831174302002958] name "Haa! You're here!"
set key[id=831174302002959] name "Why are you here by yourself?"
set key[id=831174302002960] name "$npc:11000064[gender:0]$ spotted $npc:11000044[gender:0]$, said it was \
    dangerous,\nand told me to wait here... but he hasn't come out... \n"
set key[id=831174302002961] name "I should have just gone in with him. Who knows what's happening in \
    $map:52000003$...\nPlease help $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ make it out safely!"
set key[id=831174302002962] name "Who knows what's happening in $map:52000003$...\nPlease help \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ make it out safely!"
set key[id=831174302002963] name "$npc:11000044[gender:0]$...\nIn the end, I let him get away... "
set key[id=831174302002964] name "$npc:11000044[gender:0]$ will come back.\nMaybe... even stronger than he is \
    now... "
set key[id=831174302002965] name "Someday... the moment will come when my bad blood with $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ \
    starts up again.\nNo matter what form he returns in... I won't lose.\nFor now... let's go back and tell the \
    Guardians the news about $npc:11000044[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302002966] name "Someday... the moment will come when my bad blood with $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ \
    starts up again.\nNo matter what form he returns in... I won't lose. "
set key[id=831174302002967] name "$npc:11000044[gender:0]$ fled to the Land of Darkness?\nHmm... so we lost him \
    right in front of our eyes... "
set key[id=831174302002968] name "Just as $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ said, $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ will show up \
    again someday.\nPeople who have tasted the sweetness of desire once can't pull themselves out of it...\nGo and \
    tell $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ the news about $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ too."
set key[id=831174302002969] name "Just as $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ said, $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ will show up \
    again someday.\nPeople who have tasted the sweetness of desire once can't pull themselves out of it...\nGo and \
    tell $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ the news about $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ too."
set key[id=831174302002970] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nHave you met $npc:11000064[gender:0]$?\nNow that I've met \
    him in person, I understand why the previous Blue Lapenta guardian\nfavored him so much."
set key[id=831174302002971] name "Why?"
set key[id=831174302002972] name "Sincerity... There was warmth and sincerity in $npc:11000064[gender:0]$'s \
    eyes.\nThe strength to stay true to yourself and not waver under any temptation comes\nfrom exactly that \
    sincerity.\nIt's a virtue any guardian who must protect the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lapenta</font> has to \
    have."
set key[id=831174302002973] name "I'm sure... Win Steelton meant to pass the post of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Blue \
    Lapenta guardian</font>\non to $npc:11000064[gender:0]$.\nIf the day ever comes when the shattered <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Blue Lapenta</font> can be restored...\nI intend to carry on that wish and entrust \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">guardianship of the Blue Lapenta</font>."
set key[id=831174302002974] name "How fortunate that the truth has come out, even if only now...\nHas there been \
    any new word about $npc:11000044[gender:0]$? "
set key[id=831174302002975] name "I tell her we lost $npc:11000044[gender:0]$ right in front of us."
set key[id=831174302002976] name "Oh dear... \nIf he's vanished into the Land of Darkness... then as \
    $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ said, he may return\nwith an even stronger evil power.\nThe world could be thrown \
    into great danger once again before that power... "
set key[id=831174302002977] name "Perhaps what's scarier than the Demon King... is the human desire born of greed \
    too big\nto overcome.\nWhen small, everyday desires gather and clump together, one after another, they \
    grow\ninto an unstoppable evil force.\n"
set key[id=831174302002978] name "The Demon King can only... control and wield the evil power gathered this \
    way...\nWhat really feeds the Demon King's strength may be the selfish greed stirring in our own hearts... "
set key[id=831174302003313] name "Oh, and just in case: don't think you can just walk into that cave\nrelying on \
    $item:20000060$ alone."
set key[id=831174302003314] name "Why?"
set key[id=831174302003315] name "It's not only poison flowing through <font color=\"#ffd200\">Poison \
    Cave</font>.\nStrange creatures that absorbed all the toxicity of the poison are writhing around in \
    there...\nNo matter how skilled you are, you can't take them all on alone."
set key[id=831174302003316] name "Still, we can't just pass by without investigating <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Poison Cave</font>.\nIf we follow this stream of poison and investigate it, we might be able \
    to gauge how far\nthe influence of the Land of Darkness has spread across Maple World.\nWe might even find \
    some unexpected clues."
set key[id=831174302003317] name "For example... there was an incident at $map:52000037$ in $map:02000043$...\nbut \
    almost no clues turned up to explain what really happened.\nIt was definitely a cave whose end was blocked by \
    solid rock...\nI wonder if those clues might be drifting around in the poison."
set key[id=831174302003318] name "Anyway... to find out what's really at the end of this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Poison Cave</font>,\nand whether it connects to somewhere else in Maple World rather than \
    the Land of Darkness...\nwe need thorough preparation."
set key[id=831174302003319] name "I'll go in and take a look right now."
set key[id=831174302003320] name "What...? I'd rather you didn't act rashly out of bravado...\nAre you sure you'll \
    make it back alive?"
set key[id=831174302003321] name "Well... if you're that confident, I won't stop you.\nBut we don't know what's in \
    there, so don't let your guard down for even a second."
set key[id=831174302003322] name "You explored all the way to the end of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Poison \
    Cave</font>?\nReally? Did you see what was at the end?"
set key[id=831174302003323] name "I tell him what I saw, heard, and experienced in Poison Cave."
set key[id=831174302003324] name "Is that... true?\nSigh... then I need to report to $npc:11000804[gender:0]$ \
    right away! Thanks!"
set key[id=831174302003325] name "Why hasn't he come back yet... \nI hope nothing's happened to him... "
set key[id=831174302003326] name "Who do you mean?"
set key[id=831174302003327] name "$npc:11000872[gender:0]$.\nAn agent carrying out a secret mission here with \
    me.\nIt's been a long while since he went to investigate the source of the poison seeping into Maple \
    World...\nand he hasn't returned."
set key[id=831174302003328] name "He should be somewhere around here...\nWould you look for him and see if he's \
    all right?"
set key[id=831174302003329] name "$npc:11000872[gender:0]$ has excellent fundamentals, but he's not yet used to \
    the Land of Darkness...\nI'm worried something might have happened to him. "
set key[id=831174302003330] name "You... aren't from around here."
set key[id=831174302003331] name "How did you know?"
set key[id=831174302003332] name "It's a feeling... pure instinct!"
set key[id=831174302003333] name "$npc:11000804[gender:0]$ is looking for you."
set key[id=831174302003334] name "Ah... $npc:11000804[gender:0]$ is? Hah... so much time has passed already.\nI've \
    only just gotten my hands on $item:20000060$... hmm... "
set key[id=831174302003335] name "Why did you get $item:20000060$?"
set key[id=831174302003336] name "I don't know if you've been, but in $map:02000043$ in Maple World, \
    there's\n$map:52000037$.\nUntil now nobody knew where that poison started...\nbut when I came to the Land of \
    Darkness, I realized the poison flows all around this world."
set key[id=831174302003337] name "Poison flows through the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Poison Cave</font> just ahead, \
    too.\nI need to find out what's really at the end of this cave, and whether it connects to\nsomewhere in Maple \
    World... "
set key[id=831174302003338] name "The poison flowing in the cave is so toxic I couldn't go any deeper.\nSo I \
    prepared this $item:20000060$, which can purify strong toxins.\nIt was fairly easy to get in $map:02000043$... \
    but here it's quite rare."
set key[id=831174302003339] name "Anyway, since $npc:11000804[gender:0]$ is looking for me... I'd better stop by \
    the shelter first and then come back.\nI'll give you some $item:20000060$, so use it if you ever get \
    poisoned."
set key[id=831174302003350] name "Sigh... Are you just going to stand there?"
set key[id=831174302003351] name "Where is $npc:11000869[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831174302003352] name "Go to $map:02000142$.\nEveryone said the whole Ludibrium region stopped in time \
    because of the clock tower, so they\nall rushed over there and left me with the chore of\nwatching whether the \
    rift in time here gets any wider."
set key[id=831174302003353] name "Go to $map:02000142$.\nEveryone said the whole Ludibrium region stopped in time \
    because of the clock tower, so they\nall rushed over there and left me with the chore of\nwatching whether the \
    rift in time here gets any wider."
set key[id=831174302003354] name "Ah, who...?\nAh, wait... just a moment... Is it moving...? Or not...?"
set key[id=831174302003355] name "Ah!! It's so noisy I can't concentrate!!\nYou there! Sorry to ask before we've \
    even introduced ourselves, but could you do something about those\nrascals making all that clanging and \
    banging racket?"
set key[id=831174302003356] name "Please help me make sure those fellows banging away at cymbals, horns\nand drums \
    can't make any more noise!"
set key[id=831174302003357] name "Please help me make sure those fellows banging away at cymbals, horns\nand drums \
    can't make any more noise!"
set key[id=831174302003358] name "Whew~ Finally, some peace.\nWhere did those wretched things even come from... \
    tsk tsk tsk... "
set key[id=831174302003359] name "So, who are you?\nWhy have you come here?"
set key[id=831174302003360] name "(Explain why I came.)"
set key[id=831174302003361] name "You want to go back to the past with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Red Rappenta of \
    Time</font>?\nHmm... Well... I suppose it might be possible.\nBut!! It must not be done!"
set key[id=831174302003362] name "Going back to the past disturbs the order of time.\nAnd to think you'd use the \
    Red Rappenta for it... Do you know how dangerous that is?\nIf it goes wrong, the barrier of time could \
    collapse completely, just like the barrier of space did,\nand a world even more terrifying than the Land of \
    Darkness might open up."
set key[id=831174302003363] name "Don't forget that the best thing is to accept the order of the universe as it \
    has been set right and live on.\nNow, I'm busy, so good day."
set key[id=831174302003364] name "Don't forget that the best thing is to accept the order of the universe as it \
    has been set right and live on.\nNow, I'm busy, so good day."
set key[id=831174302003365] name "Ah, did you meet Dr. $npcName:11000869[gender:0]$?\nWhat did he say?"
set key[id=831174302003366] name "(Tell what I heard.)"
set key[id=831174302003367] name "I see... Using the Red Rappenta... It must not be done... and can't be done, \
    either...\nBut... it is... possible... right...? Possible... "
set key[id=831174302003368] name "What are you thinking about?"
set key[id=831174302003369] name "I can't say yet...\nI'll tell you once I've sorted out my thoughts."
set key[id=831174302003395] name "Hmm... what on earth is that sound... "
set key[id=831174302003396] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302003397] name "For a while now I've been hearing faint sobbing from over by the pink cherry \
    blossom forest.\nAt first I thought it was some animal in the forest crying...\nbut the more I listen, the \
    more it sounds like a person... or a ghost... "
set key[id=831174302003398] name "They say that sometimes unidentified ghosts pop out from deep in the cherry \
    blossom forest...\nWould you go see what's going on?\nMy heart is weak, you see... "
set key[id=831174302003399] name "For a while now I've been hearing faint sobbing from over by the pink cherry \
    blossom forest.\nWould you go see what's going on?\nMy heart is weak, you see... "
set key[id=831174302003400] name "Sob...\nW-who's there?!!!"
set key[id=831174302003401] name "Why are you crying?"
set key[id=831174302003402] name "Well... sob...\nMy friends... inside the cherry blossom forest... sob... "
set key[id=831174302003403] name "Sob... h-help! Please!\nI'm begging you... "
set key[id=831174302003404] name "What on earth happened?"
set key[id=831174302003405] name "I'll explain the details once my friends make it out of the cherry blossom \
    forest safely.\nRight now... there's no time...\nIf I lose all my friends like this... then I... "
set key[id=831174302003406] name "(Ask how you can help.)"
set key[id=831174302003407] name "See the path leading into $map:02000290$?\nMy friends are trapped in the prickly \
    thorn bushes in that forest...\nBut there are monsters bigger than me swarming everywhere..."
set key[id=831174302003408] name "Please... \nwould you rescue my Boroboro friends trapped in the thorns... even \
    just one of them?"
set key[id=831174302003409] name "Got it."
set key[id=831174302003410] name "R-really? Really? Thank you!!\nIt won't be easy for you alone, either... it'd be \
    best to go with other friends\nas strong and brave as you! Be careful not to get hurt, okay?"
set key[id=831174302003411] name "Please rescue my Boroboro friends trapped in the thorns of $map:02000290$.\nEven \
    just one is fine... please.\nIf you join forces with other friends as strong and brave as you,\nit won't be \
    hard."
set key[id=831174302003412] name "Thank you, thank you so much!!\nThanks to you, I got to see my Boroboro friend \
    again."
set key[id=831174302003413] name "We Boroboro have lived protecting the forest of $map:02000023$ since long \
    ago.\nNo... rather than protecting it, it'd be more accurate to say we were simply part of the forest... "
set key[id=831174302003414] name "People of the world point fingers and say we Boroboro are cowards who hid in the \
    forest to avoid the Demon King,\nbut that's a misunderstanding... "
set key[id=831174302003415] name "What was the reason?"
set key[id=831174302003416] name "It was... to protect our princess.\nWe thought that if we went deep into \
    $map:02000290$... to a place deeper still where no one\nin the world could find us... the princess and all of \
    us could live safely and peacefully."
set key[id=831174302003417] name "I never imagined the touch of evil spirits would reach all the way into the \
    depths of our $map:02000290$."
set key[id=831174302003418] name "$MyPCName$!\nThe Boroboro friends you freed from the thorns told me.\nIn the \
    end... $npc:24000409$ even shut our $npc:11000751[gender:1]$\naway inside a huge thorn bush... "
set key[id=831174302003419] name "Could you go back into $map:02000290$, defeat $npc:24000409$,\nand rescue our \
    $npc:11000751[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302003420] name "Could you go back into $map:02000290$, defeat $npc:24000409$,\nand rescue our \
    $npc:11000751[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302003421] name "Ah, so it was you... the one who rescued our $npc:11000751[gender:1]$ \
    safely...\nThank you so much."
set key[id=831174302003422] name "If it weren't for you, we'd have lost $npc:11000751[gender:1]$, and all those \
    long years the Boroboro spent\nliving in hushed silence deep in the forest would have been for nothing... "
set key[id=831174302003423] name "Why did you have to hide in the forest?"
set key[id=831174302003424] name "Our $npc:11000751[gender:1]$ is a very special person.\nI can't tell you the \
    details yet... but if the Demon King or the forces of darkness learned of\n$npc:11000751[gender:1]$'s \
    existence and harmed her, this world could become even more dangerous."
set key[id=831174302003425] name "To keep the princess's existence from being revealed to the world, we Boroboro \
    moved our home to the deeper\nforest and lived quietly...\nBut as the princess grew, her power grew stronger, \
    and the Demon King's evil spirits\nfound us and invaded all the way to $map:02000290$... "
set key[id=831174302003426] name "What will you do from now on?"
set key[id=831174302003427] name "Well... now that they know of the princess's existence, hiding again would be \
    pointless...\nI suppose... hmm... we must make a decision. Somehow... "
set key[id=831174302003428] name "Hey there~, mister! Long time no see?\nI heard you helped \
    $npc:11000502[gender:0]$ get back home?"
set key[id=831174302003429] name "Heh~ Surprised? Even if you don't tell me, I know everything~\nHeh~ Why act new \
    about it? It's not the first time~\nIn this business, the moment anything happens, the news spreads nationwide \
    in no time~"
set key[id=831174302003430] name "Anyway, that fool $npc:11000502[gender:0]$ must still be fuming about getting \
    stabbed in the back\nand tricked by the Golden Tower brokers~\nSo we bros decided to cheer him up a bit~ "
set key[id=831174302003431] name "At <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000251$</font>, there's a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Four Sovereigns' Treasure Chest</font> holding only the priciest goods\nthe brokers trade \
    in~ If you rob that chest and bring it to $npc:11000502[gender:0]$,\nit'll be our <font color=\"#ffd200\">true \
    bros' perfect revenge</font>, paying back exactly what he suffered~\nAll right, mister~! Go~!"
set key[id=831174302003432] name "Aren't you coming along?"
set key[id=831174302003433] name "Heh~ I drew up the whole plan~ You carry it out~\nThat's what we bros call \
    teamwork~ Get what I'm saying?"
set key[id=831174302003434] name "At <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000251$</font>, there's a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Four Sovereigns' Treasure Chest</font> holding only the priciest goods\nthe brokers trade \
    in~ If you rob that chest and bring it to $npc:11000502[gender:0]$,\nit'll be our <font color=\"#ffd200\">true \
    bros' perfect revenge</font>, paying back exactly what he suffered~\nAll right, mister~! Go~!"
set key[id=831174302003435] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!! It's been a while!\nI've been bothered that I never properly \
    thanked you\nfor getting me home like this... "
set key[id=831174302003436] name "I robbed the Golden Tower brokers' chest to get revenge for you."
set key[id=831174302003437] name "Huh? You went back to that dangerous place because of me?\nWhy did you suddenly \
    think of doing that?"
set key[id=831174302003438] name "I tell him $npc:11000101[gender:0]$'s plan."
set key[id=831174302003439] name "$npc:11000101[gender:0]$? That guy... he must have used me as an excuse to make \
    a fool of you.\nWhen we first met, too, he acted all friendly and then always used me and teased me behind my \
    back.\nWhat a rotten guy...!!\nStill, I'm glad... that you came back safe like this."
set key[id=831174302003440] name "I don't know what you found in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">golden treasure \
    chest</font> the brokers hid, but I don't need it.\nUse it where it's needed. And come visit often from now \
    on, friend!"
set key[id=831174302003441] name "I got a report from $npc:11000872[gender:0]$.\nHe said you explored all the way \
    to the end of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Poison Cave</font>. Is that true?"
set key[id=831174302003442] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003443] name "Then let me ask you one thing.\nDid you happen to see $npc:22000047$ there?"
set key[id=831174302003444] name "I did."
set key[id=831174302003445] name "No, I didn't."
set key[id=831174302003446] name "Is that so? Really?\nHmm... so the rumor was true... "
set key[id=831174302003447] name "What rumor?"
set key[id=831174302003448] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Raul de Carlo</font>, who led the Secret Knights before \
    $npc:11000076[gender:0]$...\nHe had an illness of unknown cause that held multiple personalities inside \
    him.\nBecause of that illness, the Empress was once put in grave danger... and afterward he resigned \
    as\nknight commander and disappeared."
set key[id=831174302003449] name "And lately, a rumor has been circulating that within the Land of Darkness, \
    inside <font color=\"#ffd200\">Poison Cave</font>,\nthere's an unidentified ghost that calls itself <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000047$</font>.\nI can't help thinking that perhaps <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Raul</font>... his original personality has vanished or fallen dormant,\nand the other \
    personalities that existed only inside him are wandering around as apparitions."
set key[id=831174302003450] name "If you don't mind... could you go into <font color=\"#ffd200\">Poison \
    Cave</font> once more\nand defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000047$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302003451] name "Ah... I see...\nThen the rumor wasn't true after all... "
set key[id=831174302003452] name "What rumor?"
set key[id=831174302003453] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Raul de Carlo</font>, who led the Secret Knights before \
    $npc:11000076[gender:0]$...\nHe had an illness of unknown cause that held multiple personalities inside \
    him.\nBecause of that illness, the Empress was once put in grave danger... and afterward he resigned \
    as\nknight commander and disappeared."
set key[id=831174302003454] name "And lately, a rumor has been circulating that within the Land of Darkness, \
    inside <font color=\"#ffd200\">Poison Cave</font>,\nthere's an unidentified ghost that calls itself <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000047$</font>.\nIf the rumor is true... I can't help thinking that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Raul</font>... his original personality has vanished or fallen dormant,\nand the other \
    personalities inside him are wandering around like apparitions."
set key[id=831174302003455] name "If you don't mind... could you go into <font color=\"#ffd200\">Poison \
    Cave</font> once more and see whether the rumor is true,\nand if it is... defeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000047$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302003456] name "If you don't mind... could you go into <font color=\"#ffd200\">Poison \
    Cave</font> once more\nand defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000047$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302003457] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!\n$npc:11000804[gender:0]$ was here until just now, but went back \
    to the shelter.\nWhat happened with $npc:22000047$?"
set key[id=831174302003458] name "I defeated it."
set key[id=831174302003459] name "Is that so? Sigh... so such a being really existed...\nI don't know whether \
    that's unfortunate or fortunate... "
set key[id=831174302003460] name "What do you mean?"
set key[id=831174302003461] name "Hm! <font color=\"#ffd200\">Raul de Carlo</font>... if by any chance he still \
    exists somewhere...\nthen either another personality is wandering around somewhere like this apparition...\nor \
    he'll recover his original personality and be able to return...\n$npc:11000804[gender:0]$ said it'd be one of \
    those two."
set key[id=831174302003462] name "If he recovers his original personality, that would be wonderful... but if \
    another being like $npc:22000047$\nis wandering somewhere... sigh... that would be terrible."
set key[id=907181902003814] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$.\nMay I ask you a favor?"
set key[id=907181902003815] name "You're back. Is something the matter...?"
set key[id=907181902003816] name "Ah, $MyPCName$, you're here?\nWhat brings you? Is something wrong...?"
set key[id=907181902003817] name "Dear me... that girl...!!"
set key[id=907181902003818] name "First, we need to look into every detail of $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$'s \
    recent doings.\nOnly then can we start tracking where she's gone...\nCould you go find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000012[gender:0]$</font> and find out whether there's anyone who\nrecently <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">corresponded with $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$</font>?"
set key[id=907181902003819] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!\nWhat's the rush? Why did you come running here?"
set key[id=907181902003820] name "Oh! Right, of course!\nIt's not exactly unusual, but... recently a pretty thick \
    package came for $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$ from\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000309$</font>.\nI remember \
    it because it came from a place $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$ has no connection to at all."
set key[id=907181902003821] name "When I went to deliver it earlier, it looked like $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$ \
    wasn't home either... \nSurely she didn't go all the way to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000270$</font>... \
    right...? "
set key[id=907181902003822] name "Hm? And who are you? No, no... no need to answer.\nI don't know what you want, \
    but come back later!"
set key[id=907181902003823] name "Hah... I told you I'm swamped right now, come back later!\nWhy are you still \
    standing there?"
set key[id=907181902003824] name "Hm? Why did you come back?"
set key[id=907181902003825] name "Haa... gone out again, gone out again!!\nNot a single day when things run \
    smoothly... Honestly, how frustrating... tsk, tsk... "
set key[id=907181902003826] name "Hm? Who are you?\nYou don't look like a repairman...?"
set key[id=907181902003827] name "First, find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">self-powered current generator</font> \
    installed at the edge of the factory and start it up.\nOnly then can we run the recovery device and try <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">restoring the data</font>."
set key[id=907181902003828] name "Oh, the power's coming on.\nNow let's run the recovery device and restore the \
    data. Wait a moment."
set key[id=907181902003829] name "Hm? Ah... no... what is this?"
set key[id=907181902003830] name "Why did you turn back halfway?"
set key[id=907181902003831] name "Ah, you're back!\nDid you restore the video?"
set key[id=907181902003832] name "Hmm!! Could I ask you one more favor?"
set key[id=907181902003833] name "Word came from <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000276$</font>.\nThey're picking up \
    an abnormal signal in the time energy flowing along the barrier of time.\nCould you go check on the \
    situation?"
set key[id=907181902003834] name "Oh, honestly... I told you it's dangerous here.\nStop loitering around when you \
    don't know what you're doing, and move aside."
set key[id=907181902003835] name "Hey, can't you hear me?\nI said move, so why do you keep standing there?"
set key[id=907181902003836] name "First, we have to <font color=\"#ffd200\">collect all the codes being recorded \
    in the dynamics detectors</font> and examine them.\nTo retrieve the detectors we also have to take down the \
    monsters running wild around here...\nWill you help?"
set key[id=907181902003837] name "Ah, thank you.\nIt would have taken forever alone... thanks to you I gathered \
    the data faster than expected!"
set key[id=907181902003838] name "Hmm... this is... far more serious than I expected.\nThe energy waves are very \
    unstable... and... "
set key[id=907181902003839] name "Hm? You're back already?"
set key[id=907181902003840] name "Ah, you're back.\nHow are things at $map:2000276$?"
set key[id=907181902003841] name "Hm? How can this... be... "
set key[id=907181902003842] name "Look there, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">entrance to $map:52000011$ has \
    opened</font>.\nSomething... must have gone wrong in $map:52000011$!\nCould you go find out?"
set key[id=907181902003843] name "Oh... $MyPCName$, how did you end up here... "
set key[id=907181902003844] name "If this $map:52000011$, held together by the Red Lapenta's power, is \
    destroyed...\nthe order of time will collapse and the chaos will deepen.\nIf that happens... the Red Lapenta's \
    safety can't be guaranteed either... and the Demon King\nand the forces of darkness will force their way \
    through that gap and grow even stronger.\n"
set key[id=907181902003845] name "I still don't know what this unidentified force threatening $map:52000011$ \
    is,\nbut until we uncover its source and cut it off at the root, whenever the barrier\nshakes and grows \
    unstable, all I can do is rush in here and protect it myself.\nWill you help me?"
set key[id=907181902003846] name "Thank you.\nThanks to you, we got past a dangerous moment."
set key[id=907181902003847] name "We got past the immediate crisis, but...\nwe have to find out as soon as \
    possible what's making $map:52000011$ shake so unstably.\nOtherwise this crisis will just happen again...  "
set key[id=907181902003848] name "Please tell $npc:11000843[gender:0]$ of $map:2000309$ about the situation here, \
    and ask him to help us find\nwhat's making $map:52000011$ shake.\nBut you must keep it a secret that I am the \
    guardian of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Red Lapenta</font>."
set key[id=907181902003849] name "Oh, you made it back safely!\nDid you see what happened there? What's going on \
    in there?"
set key[id=907181902003850] name "I suppose I'll have to go to $map:2000298$ myself."
set key[id=907181902003851] name "I'll follow the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Key</font> logs at \
    $map:2000298$ and track that guy's movements.\nThen we'll naturally learn where Miss <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000058[gender:1]$</font> is, too.\nYou go back to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000001$</font> and report on <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000011$</font> and the \
    situation here. "
set key[id=907181902003852] name "$MyPCName$!!\nWhere are you coming from? Any news of $npc:11000058[gender:1]$? "
set key[id=907181902003853] name "If everything you've told me is true... this could be the greatest crisis \
    threatening our\nMaple World since the Blue Lapenta shattered.\nGiven the situation, report everything to \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ in detail, leaving nothing out."
set key[id=907181902003854] name "If everything you've told me is true... this could be the greatest crisis \
    threatening our\nMaple World since the Blue Lapenta shattered.\nGiven the situation, report everything to \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ in detail, leaving nothing out."
set key[id=907181902003855] name "$MyPCName$!\nDid you hear that $npc:11000058[gender:1]$ suddenly disappeared and \
    people went to look for her?\nHow did it go? You look gloomy...\nNothing has happened to \
    $npc:11000058[gender:1]$... has it?"
set key[id=907181902003856] name "Did you meet someone in $map:52000011$?"
set key[id=907181902003857] name "Until the root of the force threatening $map:52000011$ is torn out completely, \
    please stay by $npc:11000015[gender:1]$'s\nside as a reliable strength.\nI'm counting on you."
set key[id=907181902003858] name "Ah, you came.\nThank you once again for helping to protect $map:52000011$."
set key[id=907181902003859] name "Ah, $MyPCName$.\nI was just about to send word asking you to come to the \
    palace.\nI heard that $npc:11000058[gender:1]$ has returned safely.\nThey say she was being held by a person \
    called $npc:22400062$ in a place called $map:2000298$."
set key[id=907181902003860] name "I heard that $npc:11000058[gender:1]$ has returned safely.\nThey say she was \
    being held by a person called $npc:22400062$ in a place called $map:2000298$.\nPlease go to $map:2000190$ and \
    see whether $npc:11000058[gender:1]$ is all right."
set key[id=907181902003861] name "Ah... you came... "
set key[id=907181902003862] name "$map:2000304$... I saw young $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ there.\nThat terrified \
    look... I can't forget it.\nThe moment the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Time Floor</font> stopped... there was \
    surely a <font color=\"#ffd200\">clear, pure\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul</font> there, not yet stained by \
    darkness."
set key[id=907181902003863] name "$MyPCName$! Please.\nAs my helper, would you find the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">guardian of the Red Lapenta</font> and look for a way to\nsave the young \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ I saw in that moment at $map:2000304$?"
set key[id=907181902003864] name "$MyPCName$. You came. I heard the news from $map:2000298$.\nThat $map:52000011$ \
    became so unstable because $npc:22400062$ used the Chaos Time Key\nto operate the Time Floor...\nWithout \
    $npcTitle:11000843[gender:0]$ and the brave heroes, we couldn't have stopped that vicious atrocity."
set key[id=907181902003865] name "I hear Miss $npc:11000058[gender:1]$ was also at $map:2000304$, held by \
    $npc:22400062$...\nIs she all right?"
set key[id=907181902003866] name "Do you see the small, modest clock tower in the middle of the $map:2000076$ \
    village?\nRight now, the time inside that clock tower is... the past, when <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Clarke</font> was alive.\nIf you meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">Clarke</font>, I think you may \
    learn how to protect young Miss $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s pure\nsoul, but... "
set key[id=907181902003867] name "Ah, welcome. You're a person from the future, aren't you? Oh... no... should I \
    say a person of the present?\nHeh... whatever. I'm glad to meet you like this."
set key[id=907181902003868] name "You've come here... because $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$ told you, right?\nDo \
    you have something to say to me?"
set key[id=907181902003869] name "The order of time is still slowly returning to its place even now.\nTo meet that \
    girl, you have to find that space before the order of time is fully restored.\nAs I remember it, behind that \
    little girl there was a huge orb with an evil aura swirling around it.\nHmm... as the guardian of the Red \
    Lapenta, who must protect the order of time, that's all\nI can tell you... "
set key[id=907181902003870] name "Did you meet $npcName:11000845[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=907181902003871] name "A frightened young $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ and a huge demonic orb... \nMy \
    feeling is that the place is full of dark energy...\nsomewhere in the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=907181902003872] name "Cross over to the Land of Darkness and go to $map:3009017$."
set key[id=907181902003873] name "Huh? $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=907181902003874] name "I don't know much, but the rescued people here who stayed in the Land of \
    Darkness for a long\ntime might know something.\nTry asking them."
set key[id=907181902003875] name "I don't know much, but the rescued people here who stayed in the Land of \
    Darkness for a long\ntime might know something.\nTry asking them."
set key[id=907181902003876] name "Hello... "
set key[id=907181902003877] name "A huge... demonic orb...\nThey say it absorbs the souls of captured slaves... to \
    strengthen the Demon King's power...\nHere we call it the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Soul Orb</font>...   "
set key[id=907181902003878] name "Shadow World... the dark shamans... woke the souls sleeping in the ancient \
    shamans' tombs\nand locked them up... that's what the Soul Orb is, they say...\nOf all the Soul Orbs... the \
    oldest one with the strongest aura... I heard that Soul Orb\nis in a place called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000012$</font>... \n"
set key[id=907181902003879] name "Hm? Big brother $npc:11001106[gender:0]$ has gotten much better...\nTalking at \
    such length now... hehe. "
set key[id=907181902003880] name "What did you talk about with big brother $npc:11001106[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=907181902003881] name "That <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000012$</font> or whatever is in a place \
    called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:3000007$</font>...\nThe cold wind blowing between the ridges stings and \
    hurts when it touches your skin,\nlike being cut by a blade, so even people from here say they don't go there \
    much."
set key[id=907181902003882] name "Did you find out anything about the orb?"
set key[id=907181902003883] name "By the way, did you just say $map:3000007$?"
set key[id=907181902003884] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font> knows a lot about the \
    Shadow World, so he should be able to help."
set key[id=907181902003885] name "Oh! $MyPCName$!!\nHow did you get all the way here? Did something happen?"
set key[id=907181902003886] name "All right! $MyPCName$! I'll help too!\nI'll go to $map:52000012$ with you and do \
    my best to help you save $npc:11000057[gender:1]$!"
set key[id=907181902003887] name "All right! $MyPCName$! I'll help too!\nI'll go to $map:52000012$ with you and do \
    my best to help you save $npc:11000057[gender:1]$!"
set key[id=907181902003888] name "$map:52000012$?\nAre you going there with big brother $npc:11000064[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=907181902003889] name "Thanks to $npc:11000807[gender:1]$, we gained some time we'd have spent \
    wandering to find the entrance of $map:52000012$.\nWe have to hurry before the order of time is fully \
    restored.\nThere's no time to wait for anyone else now.\nYou rely on me, I rely on you, the two of us, \
    trusting each other, let's go together!"
set key[id=907181902003890] name "Thanks to $npc:11000807[gender:1]$, we gained some time we'd have spent \
    wandering to find the entrance of $map:52000012$.\nWe have to hurry before the order of time is fully \
    restored.\nThere's no time to wait for anyone else now.\nYou rely on me, I rely on you, the two of us, \
    trusting each other, let's go together!"
set key[id=907181902003891] name "Huff... huff... are you okay?"
set key[id=907181902003892] name "It hasn't been long since $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul was sucked into the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Soul Orb</font>, so maybe...\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul is still in \
    there.\nThere are countless paths of souls drifting around inside this orb, and I can't tell which \
    one\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ is on... but we can't just turn back like this.\nLet's go into <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000013$</font> and look for $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul!"
set key[id=907181902003893] name "There are countless paths of souls drifting around inside this orb, and I can't \
    tell which one\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ is on... but let's go into <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000013$</font> and look for $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul!"
set key[id=907181902003894] name "Ah... "
set key[id=907181902003895] name "You're awake? How are you feeling?"
set key[id=907181902003896] name "Poor $npc:11000057[gender:1]$...\nHow painful and hard it must be... and how \
    much more to come... haa...\nPlease hurry and take word of $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ to House Vidblame. They \
    must be waiting so... much... "
set key[id=907181902003897] name "$MyPCName$!!\nWhat do we do...? The order of time has fully recovered, and they \
    say all the doors to the\nfrozen past have closed... "
set key[id=907181902003898] name "The strange thing is... ever since I heard the order of time returned to its \
    place...\nI can feel $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... it's like the knot tied tight around my heart is coming \
    loose... a warm glow...\nsadness... longing... I can feel that child's heart... as if $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ \
    had come back alive... "
set key[id=907181902003899] name "Even if she could come back... $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ wouldn't... \nThe guilt \
    over what's passed... is holding that child... back.\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ can feel me too, surely... just \
    as I do... I love you, $npc:11000057[gender:1]$...\nPlease tell Father about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s \
    feelings... He must be waiting more than anyone... "
set key[id=907181902003900] name "Ah... where are you coming from?"
set key[id=907181902003901] name "Since her pure soul that had hardened has awakened again... hasn't a way opened \
    for me to bring\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ back to my side?"
set key[id=907181902003902] name "Ah... $npc:11000057[gender:1]$!!\nHow could you... this foolish father... \
    ah...  "
set key[id=907181902003903] name "$MyPCName$!!\nI heard from $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ that all the past times \
    frozen by the Time Floor have returned to their places\nand that $map:52000011$ has stabilized again.\nAnd... \
    "
set key[id=912114302003938] name "I tell him to go ahead and say it.\n"
set key[id=912114302003939] name "Um... could you deliver this letter to my father?"
set key[id=912114302003940] name "I ask what kind of letter it is."
set key[id=912114302003941] name "It's just... a letter to say hello... that's all.\nPlease, I'm asking you. "
set key[id=912114302003942] name "I forgot the letter and left without it."
set key[id=912114302003943] name "Somehow my feet won't carry me away."
set key[id=912114302003944] name "Oh... I see. Here it is.\nI know you're busy, but... please make sure my father \
    gets it."
set key[id=912114302003945] name "Hmm... it's not here...\nIs it in your bag, maybe? Could you look again?"
set key[id=912114302003946] name "Oh dear... your bag looks far too heavy.\nWhy don't you tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=912114302003947] name "Oh... I see... \nIf the gods don't forsake my wish, we'll stand face to face and \
    smile again\nsomeday.\nI... believe that."
set key[id=912114302003948] name "(Hand over $item:30000379$.)"
set key[id=912114302003949] name "Hm? From $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$?\nHmm... well, thanks anyway."
set key[id=912114302003950] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=912114302003951] name "$npcName:11000058[gender:1]$ went off saying she'd bring \
    $npcName:11000057[gender:1]$ back!\nThat girl... what was she thinking... haa... \nI have to find \
    $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$ before she falls into danger she can't come back from.\nOne <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">child buried in my heart, $npcName:11000057[gender:1]$</font>, is more than enough for me. "
set key[id=912114302003952] name "There's no time. We have to hurry.\nFirst, we need to look into every detail of \
    $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$'s recent doings.\nOnly then can we start tracking where she's gone...\nCould you \
    go find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000012[gender:0]$</font> and find out whether there's anyone \
    who\nrecently <font color=\"#ffd200\">corresponded with $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$</font>?"
set key[id=912114302003953] name "I ask about the mail that came and went at the Vidblame manor."
set key[id=912114302003954] name "I bring the Prime Minister's mail to the Prime Minister's office myself, so \
    almost everything\nI deliver to the Vidblame manor is addressed to $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$.\nWhy do you \
    ask all of a sudden?"
set key[id=912114302003955] name "I ask whether any unusual mail came lately.\n"
set key[id=912114302003956] name "Hmm... nothing in particular... that I remember... "
set key[id=912114302003957] name "I ask what kind of place $map:2000309$ is."
set key[id=912114302003958] name "Well, what did they call it... it was...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Time... \
    Engineering Lab</font>? Something like that, I don't know the details.\nThat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000309$</font> isn't anywhere near here, it's in... where was it...\nAh, right! It's \
    in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000270$</font>."
set key[id=912114302003959] name "It's not exactly close to here, so I don't know much.\nBut what could <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000309$</font> have sent to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000058[gender:1]$</font>?\nWhen I went to deliver it earlier, it looked like \
    $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$ wasn't home either... \nSurely she didn't go all the way to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000270$</font>... right...? "
set key[id=912114302003960] name "I ask what happened."
set key[id=912114302003961] name "Hah... I don't know either. What is going on...\nWhile I stepped out of the lab \
    for a moment, somebody sneaked in and wrecked all\nthe research equipment!"
set key[id=912114302003962] name "I say it looks fine on the outside."
set key[id=912114302003963] name "Fine, you say? This?\nWell... to an ordinary person it might look that \
    way...\nThese research devices are like a human being... arms and legs are fine, but the head is\na mess, \
    memory in and out, not in their right mind."
set key[id=912114302003964] name "Whoever it was even broke the recording device that watches over the lab around \
    the clock!\nI have to find out who did it and catch them... or else...\nthe <font color=\"#ffd200\">order of \
    time</font> that the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Red Lapenta</font>'s power maintains could collapse!"
set key[id=912114302003965] name "I ask him to explain in detail."
set key[id=912114302003966] name "Well... the device storing the time code that can unlock the secrets of the time \
    dimension was stolen.\nIf that time key combination is set wrong... the barrier of time disappears and \
    every\ntime dimension gets mixed together in great chaos... "
set key[id=912114302003969] name "Hm? $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$? You mean... the Royal Prime Minister's \
    daughter?\nHmm... she did ask for some research materials, saying she was curious about time travel,\nand I \
    sent them... but we never arranged to meet or anything like that...\nWhy bring her up all of a sudden...?"
set key[id=912114302003970] name "I tell him that $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$ vanished after leaving a letter."
set key[id=912114302003971] name "Vanished... suddenly...? Hmm...\nSurely... surely she didn't wreck the lab like \
    this...? No... no way... \nHah... if only I could recover the video data inside the recording device... I'd \
    know everything..."
set key[id=912114302003972] name "I ask if there is any way to restore the video data."
set key[id=912114302003973] name "Hmm... well... <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001097[gender:0]$</font>, who \
    built and developed this device himself, might be able to...\nCould you take this $item:30000380$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001097[gender:0]$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000324$</font> and see \
    whether the data\ncan be restored?\n"
set key[id=912114302003974] name "(Hand over $item:30000380$.)"
set key[id=912114302003975] name "Hm? This is a product from our factory... but it's completely broken?\nWhat \
    happened?"
set key[id=912114302003976] name "I explain what the situation at $map:2000309$ was like."
set key[id=912114302003977] name "Hmm... let me see... \nWith some effort I might be able to recover the original \
    video... but there's a problem."
set key[id=912114302003978] name "I ask what the problem is."
set key[id=912114302003979] name "Robots that started malfunctioning and attacking people a while ago have taken \
    over every corner of our\nfactory and cut the power, blocking production.\nFirst, find the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">self-powered current generator</font> installed at the edge of the factory and start it \
    up.\nOnly then can we run the recovery device and try <font color=\"#ffd200\">restoring the data</font>."
set key[id=912114302003980] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=912114302003981] name "That recording device you brought, you know. By luck I restored the video \
    data... \nbut it shows a scene that's hard to make sense of."
set key[id=912114302003982] name "I ask what kind of scene it is."
set key[id=912114302003983] name "No, never mind.\nI'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000381$</font>, \
    so go check it together with Director $npcName:11000843[gender:0]$."
set key[id=912114302003984] name "I forgot $item:30000381$ and left without it."
set key[id=912114302003985] name "(Say I took a wrong turn for a moment.)"
set key[id=912114302003986] name "Wait... let me see...\nAh, here it is. Take good care of it this time."
set key[id=912114302003987] name "I clearly saw you put it in your bag a moment ago...\nLook again, carefully."
set key[id=912114302003988] name "Good heavens... how did you carry such a heavy bag around?\nTidy it up first."
set key[id=912114302003989] name "Ah... if you're not used to the roads yet, that can happen.\nIf you follow the \
    main road, the way you came will naturally come into view."
set key[id=912114302003990] name "(Hand over $item:30000381$.)"
set key[id=912114302003991] name "What...!! Hmm... this guy... "
set key[id=912114302003992] name "I ask whether it caught the culprit who stole the Chaos Time Key."
set key[id=912114302003993] name "Looks like it. Hmm...\nThere are still things I need to look into. Once \
    everything is certain, I'll tell you too."
set key[id=914175002003994] name "I ask if he knows $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$."
set key[id=914175002003995] name "I ask what the favor is."
set key[id=914175002003996] name "Word came from <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000276$</font> too that an abnormal \
    signal\nis showing up in the time energy flowing along the barrier of time.\nCould you go check on the \
    situation?"
set key[id=914175002003997] name "I say Director $npc:11000843[gender:0]$ asked me to come find out what's wrong \
    with the energy."
set key[id=914175002003998] name "Oh... so the lab director sent you...?\nYou don't look like an engineer, so I \
    didn't recognize you. Lately the energy dynamics detectors\nkeep picking up abnormal signals. It's \
    definitely... not normal."
set key[id=914175002003999] name "First, we have to <font color=\"#ffd200\">collect all the codes being recorded \
    in the dynamics detectors</font> and examine them.\nTo retrieve the detectors we also have to take down the \
    monsters running wild around here...\nWill you help?"
set key[id=914175002004001] name "I forgot $item:30000383$ and left without it."
set key[id=914175002004002] name "(Say I took a wrong turn for a moment.)"
set key[id=914175002004003] name "Oh... I see.\nHere you go. It's important, so take good care of it when you \
    deliver it."
set key[id=914175002004004] name "Not in your bag?\nI clearly saw you put it in... look once more."
set key[id=914175002004005] name "Your bag is packed full.\nHow about tidying it up first?"
set key[id=914175002004006] name "Ah... heh heh... you're a bit of a klutz, aren't you."
set key[id=914175002004007] name "(Hand over $item:30000383$.)"
set key[id=914175002004008] name "Hmm... this is... a code even I've never seen.\nI think we'll have to enter it \
    into the Time Matrix and analyze it."
set key[id=914175002004009] name "I ask what's wrong."
set key[id=914175002004010] name "The Time Matrix is... running at full power...!!"
set key[id=914175002004011] name "I ask what that means."
set key[id=914175002004012] name "$map:52000011$ is being connected to the Time Matrix... no!! It has been \
    connected.\nLook there, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">entrance to $map:52000011$ has \
    opened</font>.\nSomething... must have gone wrong in $map:52000011$!\nCould you go find out?"
set key[id=914175002004013] name "I explain the situation."
set key[id=914175002004014] name "I see. So it's unstable enough to be felt as energy waves in the outside \
    world...\nMaybe the power of the Red Lapenta, which seeks to protect the order of time, led\nyou all the way \
    here, $MyPCName$... "
set key[id=914175002004015] name "I ask why $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$ is here."
set key[id=914175002004016] name "I don't think I need to hide it from someone the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Red \
    Lapenta</font> itself has led here.\nThe truth is, I am the <font color=\"#ffd200\">guardian of the Red \
    Lapenta</font>.\nBefore <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000845[gender:1]$</font>, the previous guardian of \
    the Red Lapenta, passed away,\nshe asked me to take over this post."
set key[id=914175002004017] name "I ask who $npcName:11000845[gender:1]$ is."
set key[id=914175002004018] name "She was the <font color=\"#ffd200\">wife of $npc:11000001[gender:0]$ of \
    $map:2000076$</font>... and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000502[gender:0]$'s mother</font>.\nUntil she \
    left this world from an unexpected illness, she lived <font color=\"#ffd200\">guarding the Red \
    Lapenta</font>\nwithout $npcName:11000502[gender:0]$ or $npcTitle:11000001[gender:0]$ ever knowing."
set key[id=914175002004019] name "I have to keep the last wish <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000845[gender:1]$</font> left me...\nHah... for the first time... I'm afraid I might \
    fail to keep it...   "
set key[id=914175002004020] name "I can't just leave it like this.\nI still don't know what this unidentified \
    force threatening $map:52000011$ is,\nbut until we uncover its source and cut it off at the root, whenever the \
    barrier\nshakes and grows unstable, all I can do is rush in here and protect it myself.\nWill you help me?"
set key[id=914175002004021] name "You said $npc:11000843[gender:0]$ of $map:2000309$ found the entrance leading in \
    here, \ndidn't you? \nPlease go back and tell him about the situation here, and ask him to help us find what's \
    making\n$map:52000011$ shake."
set key[id=914175002004022] name "But please keep it a secret that I am the guardian of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Red Lapenta</font>.\nThe only people who know I'm the guardian of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Red Lapenta</font> are... me, Empress $npcName:11000075[gender:1]$,\nand you, \
    $MyPCName$.\nWell then... I'll see you again in $map:2000076$."
set key[id=914175002004023] name "I tell him what happened in $map:52000011$."
set key[id=914175002004024] name "$map:52000011$ is shaking...?\nHmm...  "
set key[id=914175002004025] name "I ask why he's going to $map:2000298$."
set key[id=914175002004026] name "That guy will surely use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Key</font> to \
    look for $map:2000304$ and try to get in,\nto rule over time. The shaking of $map:52000011$ must be an effect \
    of that too."
set key[id=914175002004027] name "I ask who that guy is."
set key[id=914175002004028] name "Once I go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000298$</font> and confirm it myself, \
    I'll tell you everything\nwhen I know it all.\nFor now, I'll follow the Chaos Time Key logs and track his \
    movements.\nOnce we find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22400062$</font>, we'll naturally learn where Miss <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000058[gender:1]$</font> is, too.\nYou go back to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000001$</font> and report on <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000011$</font> and the \
    situation here. "
set key[id=914175002004029] name "I report the situation."
set key[id=914175002004030] name "Oh... $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$!\nPlease, let her be safe... "
set key[id=914175002004031] name "I tell her what happened at $map:2000309$."
set key[id=914175002004032] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000011$</font>!!\nOh no... what should never have \
    happened has happened."
set key[id=914175002004033] name "I say I met $npc:11000015[gender:1]$."
set key[id=914175002004034] name "I see... then you already know.\nThat $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ is the guardian \
    of the Red Lapenta...\nIt all seems to have happened by chance, but that you protected $map:52000011$ together \
    with\n$npcName:11000015[gender:1]$, $MyPCName$... must have been the Red Lapenta's will, as \
    $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$ said."
set key[id=914175002004035] name "The Lapenta the Sages left behind also has the power to protect \
    itself.\nChoosing the one to succeed as the next guardian is also the current guardian reading and\nconveying \
    the Lapenta's will. The guardian chosen that way protects the Lapenta,\nand the Lapenta has the will to \
    protect its guardian too."
set key[id=914175002004036] name "The reason $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ could survive even the moment the Blue \
    Lapenta shattered was probably...\nthe will of the Blue Lapenta that had accepted him as its guardian.\nIn the \
    same way, what led you, $MyPCName$, to $map:52000011$ was surely the Red Lapenta's will, asking you \
    to\nprotect its guardian $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$ as well as itself."
set key[id=914175002004037] name "Until the root of the force threatening $map:52000011$ is torn out completely, \
    please stay by $npc:11000015[gender:1]$'s\nside as a reliable strength.\nI'm counting on you."
set key[id=914175002004038] name "I tell her about meeting $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$."
set key[id=914175002004039] name "Just thinking that you'll be with me, $MyPCName$, is reassuring.\nThankfully, \
    the Red Lapenta is still being kept safe and sound."
set key[id=914175002004040] name "I ask where the Red Lapenta is."
set key[id=914175002004041] name "It doesn't exist in this world we live in.\nFor its safety, it's in another \
    dimension of time.\nTo protect the Red Lapenta, $map:52000011$ must not fall.\nThe moment $map:52000011$ \
    collapses, the Demon King will learn where the Red Lapenta is."
set key[id=914175002004042] name "I hope Director $npcName:11000843[gender:0]$ of $map:2000309$ can find\neven a \
    small clue before that happens... "
set key[id=914210702004043] name "If you put the collected codes together... something strange shows up.\nI've \
    never seen anything like it... I think Director $npcName:11000843[gender:0]$ will have to see it himself."
set key[id=915130202004044] name "With her gentle heart, I worry she may have been hurt all over again...\nPlease \
    go to $map:2000190$ and see whether $npc:11000058[gender:1]$ is all right."
set key[id=915130202004045] name "I ask whether she's sick or hurt anywhere."
set key[id=915130202004046] name "Yes... I'm fine... "
set key[id=915130202004047] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=915130202004048] name "It's just... I couldn't give up on $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ like that.\nIf \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul has hardened and can't be restored... then I thought, couldn't we turn back \
    time\nto before her soul hardened?\nSo... I began searching for a way to turn back time... and requested \
    research materials from\n$map:2000309$ too."
set key[id=915130202004049] name "And... I thought that maybe Director $npcName:11000843[gender:0]$ could find a \
    way,\nso I went all the way to $map:2000309$."
set key[id=915130202004050] name "I ask what happened at $map:2000309$."
set key[id=915130202004051] name "When I stepped into $map:2000309$ there was no one there.\nAfter a while... \
    someone came in. The figure looked strange and unfamiliar, but... I remembered hearing once\nthat \
    $npcTitle:11000843[gender:0]$ looks different from ordinary people...\nSo, cautiously... I asked if he was \
    $npcTitle:11000843[gender:0]$, and he said yes."
set key[id=915130202004052] name "He said he'd help me... that there was a way.\nI followed him, and... that's how \
    I ended up all the way at $map:2000298$.\nI think my judgment was clouded by the thought that I could save \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$.\nBy the time I realized something was wrong, it was already..."
set key[id=915130202004053] name "If $npcTitle:11000843[gender:0]$ and the brave heroes hadn't come all the way to \
    $map:2000304$ to stop $npc:22400062$...\nall of time would have been mixed into a mess at the tips of \
    $npc:22400062$'s fingers."
set key[id=915130202004054] name "If that had happened... the way to save $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ would have been \
    lost forever, too... "
set key[id=915130202004055] name "Before I came home, Director $npcName:11000843[gender:0]$ told me something.\nHe \
    told me to find a trustworthy helper instead of rushing out recklessly alone like this time.\nHe said the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">guardian of the Red Lapenta</font>, who maintains the order of time, would have a way \
    to\nsave $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ as she was in that moment at $map:2000304$...\n"
set key[id=915130202004056] name "And he said that you, $MyPCName$, who met the <font color=\"#ffd200\">guardian \
    of the Red Lapenta</font> in $map:52000011$...\nwould surely be able to help."
set key[id=915130202004057] name "$MyPCName$! Please.\nAs my helper, would you find the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">guardian of the Red Lapenta</font> and look for a way to\nsave the young \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ I saw in that moment at $map:2000304$?"
set key[id=915130202004058] name "It will take time for the time stopped by the Time Floor to return to its \
    place...\nbut it seems that everyone pooling their strength got us through the worst."
set key[id=915130202004059] name "I'm fine."
set key[id=915130202004060] name "What a relief.\nThe order of time that was briefly thrown off by \
    $npc:22400062$'s atrocity is slowly,\nbit by bit, returning to its place."
set key[id=915130202004061] name "I pass on $npc:11000058[gender:1]$'s wishes."
set key[id=915130202004062] name "Oh... if you saw young Miss $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ at $map:2000304$... \
    hmm...\nit must have been that moment in the past, among the times flowing along the Time Floor.\nIf that \
    moment was there at the point when the Time Floor stopped... maybe there's\na way."
set key[id=915130202004063] name "Since the order of time that was briefly thrown off is gradually recovering its \
    original state,\nthe moment the Time Floor stopped at $map:2000304$ and the present time now coexist.\nAmong \
    the frozen moments of the past was also the time when <font color=\"#ffd200\">Clarke</font>\nguarded the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Red Lapenta</font>.\n"
set key[id=915130202004064] name "Do you see the small, modest clock tower in the middle of the $map:2000076$ \
    village?\nRight now, the time inside that clock tower is... the past, when <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Clarke</font> was alive.\nIf you meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">Clarke</font>, I think you may \
    learn how to protect young Miss $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s pure\nsoul, but... "
set key[id=915130202004065] name "I explain the circumstances of $npcName:11000057[gender:1]$ and \
    $npcName:11000058[gender:1]$."
set key[id=915130202004066] name "Ah... yes, I remember.\nA little child crying, terrified, beyond the wall of \
    time in $map:2000304$...\nand on the other side, that young woman watching the child and shedding tears...\nSo \
    that's the story behind them."
set key[id=915130202004067] name "If my memory is right, in the moment the Time Floor stopped, there was surely... \
    a time when that little\nchild was crying, too.\nThe problem is... you have to find that place. The space that \
    went back to the past...\nOnly by finding that space can you meet that little girl.\nJust as you can meet me \
    now inside this clock tower."
set key[id=915130202004068] name "The order of time is still slowly returning to its place even now.\nTo meet that \
    girl, you have to find that space before the order of time is fully restored.\nAs I remember it, behind that \
    little girl there was a huge orb with an evil aura swirling around it.\nHmm... as the guardian of the Red \
    Lapenta, who must protect the order of time, that's all\nI can tell you... "
set key[id=915130202004069] name "If you find that girl and save her soul... that may well change the present \
    situation.\nFrom the viewpoint of the present, it might be going against the order of time, but...\nfrom the \
    viewpoint of the past, it might instead be setting right the order of time that\nwent astray."
set key[id=915130202004070] name "Anyway... right now, as the order of time that went astray is \
    recovering...\nthat you came to find me, and that you're searching for that little girl... may be the will\nof \
    the Red Lapenta, trying to set the twisted past right.\nFate... whatever result your actions now bring \
    about... remember that it's a fate\nyou can only accept."
set key[id=915130202004071] name "I tell her what I heard from her."
set key[id=915130202004072] name "I see... then we must find the space where young Miss \
    $npcName:11000057[gender:1]$ was before the present and past\ntimes that now coexist are fully separated!"
set key[id=915130202004073] name "As it happens, in the Land of Darkness at $map:3000143$ there's a temporary \
    shelter where the Guardians and\nthe Lumina Liberation soldiers are treating and protecting residents rescued \
    from Katramus\nand various slave camps.\nIf you ask the rescued people whether they know anything about a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">huge orb full of evil\nenergy</font>, you might get a lead."
set key[id=915130202004074] name "Cross over to the Land of Darkness and go to $map:3009017$."
set key[id=915130202004075] name "I ask $npc:11000069[gender:1]$ why she's here."
set key[id=915130202004076] name "Ah... they said there weren't enough hands to care for the people rescued from \
    Katramus, so\nI've been staying here for a while with $npc:11000064[gender:0]$.\nWhat about you, $MyPCName$? \
    What brings you all the way here...?"
set key[id=915130202004077] name "I ask about a huge orb full of evil energy."
set key[id=915130202004078] name "A huge orb?\nHmm... I'm not sure... "
set key[id=915130202004079] name "I ask about a huge orb full of evil energy."
set key[id=915130202004080] name "Hmm... something like that... I saw it in $map:2000296$...   "
set key[id=915130202004081] name "There are <font color=\"#ffd200\">Soul Orbs</font> in $map:2000296$ too... and \
    here and there in the Land of Darkness...\nbut the real one is said to be... in a place called \
    $map:52000012$... "
set key[id=915130202004082] name "I ask which one is the real Soul Orb."
set key[id=915130202004083] name "Shadow World... the dark shamans... woke the souls sleeping in the ancient \
    shamans' tombs\nand locked them up... that's what the Soul Orb is, they say...\nOf all the Soul Orbs... the \
    oldest one with the strongest aura... I heard that Soul Orb\nis in a place called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000012$</font>... \n"
set key[id=915130202004084] name "I ask where $map:52000012$ is. "
set key[id=915130202004085] name "That I... don't know...\nPlease ask the others... "
set key[id=915130202004086] name "I ask if she knows about $map:52000012$."
set key[id=915130202004087] name "$map:52000012$??\nAh... I've heard that somewhere... oh, what was it... "
set key[id=915130202004088] name "Oh! Right! I remember!\nWhen I was in Katramus I once eavesdropped on the \
    overseers talking, and I heard it then!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000012$</font>!!\nThey say the souls \
    of dead ancient shamans have come back as evil spirits and roam there.\nThe terrifying demonic aura is so \
    strong that even the overseers can't easily go near."
set key[id=915130202004089] name "That <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000012$</font> or whatever is in a place \
    called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:3000007$</font>...\nThe cold wind blowing between the ridges stings and \
    hurts when it touches your skin,\nlike being cut by a blade, so even people from here say they don't go there \
    much."
set key[id=915130202004090] name "I pass on the information I got from the rescued people."
set key[id=915130202004091] name "Phew~ You found out quite a lot.\nI'm so glad there were people who knew!"
set key[id=915130202004092] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=915130202004093] name "Oh my! So I didn't mishear.\nHow lucky. $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ should be at \
    $map:3000007$ right now, too.\nHe heard that a friend he faced life and death with when they were held in \
    Katramus is\nnow active in the Lumina Liberation, and went to meet that friend. "
set key[id=915130202004094] name "Was it called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:3009018$</font>...?\nHe said he was \
    going there, so try going.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font> knows a lot about the Land \
    of Darkness, so he should be able to help."
set key[id=915130202004095] name "I explain the circumstances."
set key[id=915130202004096] name "Really?\nIf we just find $map:52000012$, we can really save \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=915130202004097] name "I tell him about the fate $npc:11000845[gender:1]$ spoke of."
set key[id=915130202004098] name "Hmm... when the order of time returns to its place, the wrong past can be set \
    right too?\nIf only that could happen... "
set key[id=915130202004099] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=915130202004100] name "Hmm... it's hard to find... do you know the way?"
set key[id=915130202004101] name "I ask her to show me the way if she knows it."
set key[id=915130202004102] name "Heh heh. Okay.\nWhen I was moved to another camp once, we passed through here, \
    and the overseer pointed and said\nthat's $map:52000012$ and told us to avoid it and take another road. I \
    remember that.\nIt's in a remote spot near the path out to $map:3000021$."
set key[id=915130202004103] name "It's especially dangerous around there, so be careful.\nAnd please keep our big \
    brother $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ from getting hurt, too."
set key[id=915130202004104] name "I'm fine."
set key[id=915130202004105] name "Thank goodness. You're safe...\nBut... $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... if only we'd \
    moved just a little faster... ugh... "
set key[id=915130202004106] name "I call out $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s name."
set key[id=915130202004107] name "Is it... you?\nThe one who came looking for me... "
set key[id=915130202004108] name "I believed that someday... someone would save me...\nThank you for not giving up \
    and finding me... even now...\nEven though too much time has passed to turn it back... "
set key[id=915172602004109] name "I ask what she means by it can't be turned back."
set key[id=915172602004110] name "What's already happened... that time can't be turned back as if it never \
    was...\nIt wasn't my will, but... everything I did in those days... ah... "
set key[id=915172602004111] name "I think it's time to go back to reality... to where I'm supposed to be now...\nI \
    can't undo what these hands did all this time... but if I can wash away even a little\nof that sin... I'll do \
    anything...\nAnd... "
set key[id=915172602004112] name "Father... I vaguely remember... in the palace...\nPlease tell him that I miss \
    him more than I resent him... and that he shouldn't feel sorry to me anymore."
set key[id=915172602004113] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=915172602004114] name "You came back on $npc:11000064[gender:0]$'s back, unconscious.\nYou went into \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000013$</font>, didn't you? That was close.\nWhile you were in there, the order \
    of time was returning to normal, and you nearly got trapped\nin a huge time hole. "
set key[id=915172602004115] name "It's a miracle that both $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ and you, $MyPCName$, came back \
    alive and safe.\nPlease... both of you, take care of yourselves.\nI don't want to lose anyone anymore... "
set key[id=915172602004116] name "I ask where $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ is."
set key[id=915172602004117] name "He went right back to $map:52000012$ the moment he woke up.\nHe said that while \
    looking for $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ there, he saw his father's soul with $npc:11000044[gender:0]$...\nI'm so \
    anxious and worried that something else is happening... "
set key[id=915172602004118] name "What happened to you, $MyPCName$?\nDid you meet $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul \
    inside $map:52000013$?"
set key[id=915172602004119] name "I tell her about my talk with $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul."
set key[id=915172602004120] name "Poor $npc:11000057[gender:1]$...\nHow painful and hard it must be... and how \
    much more to come... haa...\nPlease hurry and take word of $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ to House Vidblame. They \
    must be waiting so... much... "
set key[id=915172602004121] name "It was the last way to save our $npc:11000057[gender:1]$... "
set key[id=915172602004122] name "I say I met $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul."
set key[id=915172602004123] name "What? Is that true?\nAh... so that's why... that's why I can feel that child \
    like this... \nExactly the feeling I had when we were together in her childhood... ah... that's what it \
    was.\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$... what about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$? Can she come back now?"
set key[id=915172602004124] name "I pass on $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s words."
set key[id=915172602004125] name "Ah... $npc:11000057[gender:1]$...\nThis sadness now... the tears running down my \
    eyes now... you, somewhere, must be... like this too... "
set key[id=915172602004126] name "I comfort the sobbing $npc:11000058[gender:1]$."
set key[id=915172602004127] name "Even if she could come back... $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ wouldn't... \nThe guilt \
    over what's passed... is holding that child... back.\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ can feel me too, surely... just \
    as I do... I love you, $npc:11000057[gender:1]$...\nPlease tell Father about $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s \
    feelings... He must be waiting more than anyone... "
set key[id=915172602004128] name "I say I'm coming from $map:2000190$."
set key[id=915172602004129] name "Was $npc:11000058[gender:1]$ doing all right?\nShe isn't crying again, pining \
    only for $npc:11000057[gender:1]$, is she...? "
set key[id=915172602004130] name "I pass on news of $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ and $npc:11000058[gender:1]$."
set key[id=915172602004131] name "Our $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s soul, which had hardened so firmly... has \
    awakened again?\nOh... dear gods!! "
set key[id=915172602004132] name "I pass on $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s wishes."
set key[id=915172602004133] name "She can't come back... she won't come back!!\nHow can she carry that burden \
    alone!! It's all my fault...\nI'm the one who should carry every burden... "
set key[id=915172602004134] name "I tell him what $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ asked me to pass on to her father."
set key[id=915172602004135] name "Ah... $npc:11000057[gender:1]$!!\nHow could you... this foolish father... \
    ah...  "
set key[id=915172602004136] name "I also heard you met $npc:11000845[gender:1]$ in the past $map:2000016$...\nHow \
    did the mission to save $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ go?"
set key[id=915172602004137] name "I tell her everything that has happened so far."
set key[id=915172602004138] name "$npc:11000057[gender:1]$... that child...\nIt seems she means to carry every \
    burden alone... "
set key[id=915172602004139] name "I see... from $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s side, even if she came back here \
    holding every memory of what she did in the past,\nshe couldn't be happy as she once was...\nThat choice of \
    $npc:11000057[gender:1]$'s now may have been fated since long ago, since she sealed away\nher own pure soul to \
    protect it... "
set key[id=915172602004140] name "Our wish to save $npc:11000057[gender:1]$, whose soul has awakened, and bring \
    her back to us may have been less for\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$ than for ourselves, to lighten our guilt over \
    failing to protect that child...\nFor now, watching over her as she wishes seems to be the way to truly care \
    for\n$npc:11000057[gender:1]$."
set key[id=915172602004141] name "Let's trust $npc:11000057[gender:1]$ and wait.\nSurely... she'll come to us in a \
    new form that can be an even greater strength for us."
set key[id=917175002004142] name "I forgot $item:30000380$ and left without it."
set key[id=917175002004143] name "I took a wrong turn."
set key[id=917175002004144] name "Ah... I see. Here it is.\nTake good care of it this time."
set key[id=917175002004145] name "Hmm... it's not here...\nIs it in your bag, maybe?"
set key[id=917175002004146] name "Dear me... your bag looks far too heavy.\nWhy don't you tidy it up a bit?"
set key[id=917175002004147] name "Hm? What are you thinking about, wandering around like that?\nGetting lost in \
    such a small place... "
set key[id=1024110602005815] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000064[gender:0]$</font>... I don't know what \
    scheme he's plotting,\nbut one thing is certain: we have to find him as soon as possible and make him pay for \
    his crimes.\nFor everyone's safety...!!"
set key[id=1024110602005816] name "Don't worry about it."
set key[id=1024110602005817] name "Well... if you're that confident, I won't stop you.\nBut we don't know what's \
    in there, so don't let your guard down for even a second."
set key[id=1024224802005830] name "Hmm... I don't like this feeling... "
set key[id=1024224802005831] name "The aura of the Shade seems to be growing thicker in the eastern forest.\nI \
    think something is wrong with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Barrier of Life</font>...\nWould you go and take a \
    look?"
set key[id=1024224802005832] name "Thank you.\nThanks to you, we were able to protect the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Barrier of Life</font> safely."
set key[id=1113151102005898] name "What happened? "
set key[id=1113151102005899] name "The aura of the Shade seems to be growing thicker in the eastern forest.\nI \
    think something is wrong with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Barrier of Life</font>...\nWould you go and take a \
    look?"
set key[id=1113151102005900] name "You may not feel yet just how great a deed <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font> has done,\nbut you will soon.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font> \
    has protected this world once again today.  "
set key[id=1113151102005901] name "The Archmage will reveal the whole truth when the time comes.\nAnd we will \
    surely meet again soon. "
set key[id=1113182102005924] name "<font color=\"#909090\">...I don't know who it is, but...\nthis is surely bait \
    aimed at me... bait using Eve...</font>"
set key[id=1113182102005925] name "<font color=\"#909090\">...Of course I have to make a move before Eve and \
    Lennon meet...\nBut then my own position will be in danger... What should I do...?</font>"
set key[id=1113182102005926] name "<font color=\"#909090\">...I'll have to ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">that \
    person</font> for support...</font>"
set key[id=1113182102005927] name "<font color=\"#909090\">...The Land of Darkness... I don't know who it is, \
    but...\nthis is surely bait aimed at me... bait using Eve...</font>"
set key[id=1113182102005928] name "<font color=\"#909090\">...Of course I have to make a move before Eve and \
    Lennon meet...\nBut then my own position will be in danger... What should I do...?</font>"
set key[id=1113182102005929] name "<font color=\"#909090\">...I'll have to ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">that \
    person</font> for support...</font>"
set key[id=1113182102005930] name "<font color=\"#909090\">...Of course I have to make a move before Eve and \
    Lennon meet...\nBut then my own position will be in danger... What should I do...?</font>"
set key[id=1113182102005931] name "<font color=\"#909090\">...I'll have to ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">that \
    person</font> for support...</font>"

# Quest dialogue of the no-feature chapters 185-1074 quests that no pack has in English (no feature tag): our own
# English for the 1321 scriptquest rows of locale KR (or no locale) whose quest a player can get (150 quests), with
# each row's own format fields, font tags and line breaks; the player's lines are first-person choices.
file Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml kms:Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml 032f90f7273bbe7d
set key[id=421010902005073] name "Until the captain gives the next mission, I think it'd be good to at least keep \
    an eye on\nwhat the Barota Company is up to. What do you think?"
set key[id=421010902005074] name "Until the captain gives the next mission, I think it'd be good to at least keep \
    an eye on\nwhat the Barota Company is up to. What do you think?"
set key[id=421010902005075] name "Sigh... It's not trading hours now.\nCome back later... "
set key[id=421010902005076] name "A message came saying to hurry back from $map:02000153$.\nGo on, quickly."
set key[id=421010902005077] name "A message came saying to hurry back from $map:02000153$.\nGo on, quickly."
set key[id=421010902005078] name "You're here.\nThe captain seems about to hand out a new mission. Get ready."
set key[id=519140202005314] name "I can't be sure yet, but I've conveyed our wish for harmony from everyone in \
    this situation,\nso I believe good news will arrive soon.\nAnd in the end, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000075[gender:1]$</font> will lead us to become one in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">harmony</font>."
set key[id=519140202005315] name "In the meantime, in preparation for expeditions being supported by each \
    faction,\nI've set up <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000028$</font> in one corner of Ellinia and\nprepared to \
    welcome them."
set key[id=519140202005316] name "Oh, and I succeeded in deciphering one ancient book that I brought from Kalib \
    Island.\nFrom the deciphered book, I found out the region where a clue to the true nature of the\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Ultimate Secret Art</font> is kept."
set key[id=519140202005317] name "(Ask where that place is.)"
set key[id=519140202005318] name "It isn't exact, but I presume it's somewhere...\nnear <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005319] name "If you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font> and look around, \
    there may be clues\nleft by the ancient Runeblade ancestors.\nGo look for anything that could be a clue and \
    return to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000028$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005320] name "If you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font> and look around, \
    there may be clues left by the ancient Runeblade ancestors,\nso go look for anything that could be a clue \
    and\nreturn to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000028$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005321] name "You're back. So, did you find anything that could be a clue?"
set key[id=519140202005322] name "(Hand over $item:30000538$.)"
set key[id=519140202005323] name "Hm, these are... pieces of $item:30000538$.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000538$</font> carries the background and history of how the ancient Runeblade \
    ancestors gathered the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Ultimate Secret Art</font>, and the way to regain its power."
set key[id=519140202005324] name "Part of it is damaged, so it may be hard to restore perfectly,\nbut if we piece \
    it together well, we might be able to find some important clues."
set key[id=519140202005325] name "Now, hand over the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000538$</font> you \
    brought.\nLet's see... let me take a look... "
set key[id=519140202005326] name "Now, hand over the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000538$</font> you \
    brought.\nLet's see... let me take a look... "
set key[id=519140202005327] name "$npcName:11001231[gender:0]$... so that's what you were after in the \
    end...\n$npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ must have gone to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000029$</font> to get \
    his hands on <font color=\"#ffd200\">Runicta</font>."
set key[id=519140202005328] name "We must find <font color=\"#ffd200\">Runicta</font> before \
    $npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ does. "
set key[id=519140202005329] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>.\nPlease set out first toward <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000029$</font> as the advance party with $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$!\nI'll organize \
    the rear party and follow soon."
set key[id=519140202005332] name "Please look after $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ well\nuntil I come and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">join</font> you with the rear party."
set key[id=519140202005333] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>.\nPlease set out first toward <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000029$</font>\nas the advance party with $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$!\nI'll \
    organize the rear party and follow soon."
set key[id=519140202005334] name "$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$..."
set key[id=519140202005335] name "(Ask in a hurry what will happen to $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ now.)"
set key[id=519140202005336] name "We barely saved <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font>'s \
    life with the power of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lapenta of Life</font>, but... \
    \n$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ has fallen into a deep <font color=\"#ffd200\">sleep</font>. There's nothing \
    more we can do. \nAs things stand... we can't tell when or how he will wake... "
set key[id=519140202005337] name "It all depends on $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$'s inner will.\nHe is strong in \
    both body and spirit, so surely $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ will wake."
set key[id=519140202005338] name "$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$'s absence will work against us in many ways, \
    though..."
set key[id=519140202005339] name "That person was the spiritual <font color=\"#ffd200\">pillar</font> for the \
    Runeblades, so\neveryone could trust him and find courage even in hard times.\nI have no doubt that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font> will wake,\nbut I worry about the Runeblades, who must \
    be disheartened in the meantime."
set key[id=519140202005340] name "For now, I'll focus on finding things that could help \
    $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ recover.\n$MyPCName$, I think it would be good for you to talk with <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>\nabout the next move. "
set key[id=519140202005341] name "For now, I'll focus on finding things that could help \
    $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ recover.\n$MyPCName$, I think it would be good for you to talk with <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>\nabout the next move. "
set key[id=519140202005342] name "$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ needs to get better soon... this is serious.\nI \
    think it's best to give the Runeblades some time to collect themselves for now."
set key[id=519140202005343] name "They're probably in a far deeper sense of loss than we are.\nIf they come to \
    know that all of us together can fill the void left by $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$,\nthey will surely \
    overcome this crisis."
set key[id=519140202005344] name "You've worked hard, too.\nFor now, just stop and rest for a while."
set key[id=519140202005345] name "Wait a moment!\n$MyPCName$, are you on your way to \
    $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=519140202005346] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=519140202005347] name "Ah, you haven't heard yet.\n$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ has been looking for \
    you urgently.\nSomething urgent seems to have come up, so hurry and go see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005348] name "$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ has been looking for you urgently.\nSomething \
    urgent seems to have come up, so hurry and go see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005349] name "I've been waiting, $MyPCName$.\nI called you here because there's a matter that \
    needs urgent support."
set key[id=519140202005350] name "Ah, I recently received word that the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Runeblade</font> \
    expedition is coming through $map:02000063$\ninto $map:02000023$."
set key[id=519140202005351] name "I understand they're carrying important goods, but pirates have been running \
    rampant in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font>\nlately, so I'm worried... "
set key[id=519140202005352] name "Could you go there and check on the situation?\nGo to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000025$</font> in $map:02000063$ and see how the\nRuneblades are doing."
set key[id=519140202005354] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000025$</font> in $map:02000063$ and see \
    how the\nRuneblades are doing."
set key[id=519140202005355] name "I... can hardly... breathe."
set key[id=519140202005356] name "Ugh... Who... are you...? "
set key[id=519140202005357] name "The archmage sent me."
set key[id=519140202005358] name "Ah... From $map:02000023$... ugh... "
set key[id=519140202005359] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=519140202005360] name "The pirates... ambushed us... Forget me... \nPlease... help... my comrades... \
    over there... "
set key[id=519140202005361] name "The pirates... ambushed us... Forget me... \nPlease... help... my comrades... \
    over there... "
set key[id=519140202005362] name "Phew, any later and things could have gotten much worse...\nThank you for your \
    help."
set key[id=519140202005363] name "But how did you know to come here...? "
set key[id=519140202005364] name "$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ sent me."
set key[id=519140202005365] name "Ah...! I see.\nThanks to you, we got through the crisis safely. Thank you so \
    much."
set key[id=519140202005366] name "Then...\ncould you go back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and \
    ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>\nto send support, so our injured agents and \
    the ancient books\nwe brought from Kalib can be moved there safely?"
set key[id=519140202005368] name "Then...\ncould you go back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and \
    ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>\nto send support, so our injured agents and \
    the ancient books\nwe brought from Kalib can be moved there safely?"
set key[id=519140202005369] name "I was worried sick because we'd heard nothing since you left,\nso I'm glad you \
    got back safe. Well, what happened?"
set key[id=519140202005370] name "(Tell him what happened in $map:02000063$.)"
set key[id=519140202005371] name "Hmm... So what we feared has come to pass after all.\nWe must hurry and prepare \
    a place for them to rest and recover."
set key[id=519140202005372] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> and give my order to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Wizard Master $npcName:11000042[gender:1]$</font>:\nsend over a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Wizard</font> who is skilled at deciphering ancient books."
set key[id=519140202005373] name "And one more thing.\nGet permission to enter the palace from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> in $map:02000001$,\nthen pay a visit to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000075[gender:1]$</font>. "
set key[id=519140202005374] name "The Rune Bladers carried their ancestors' ancient books all the way here,\nso \
    something serious must be going on.\nTo find a way to help them, wounded and weakened as they are, ask her to \
    issue a summons\nfor the Guardians to send support."
set key[id=519140202005376] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> and give my order to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Wizard Master $npcName:11000042[gender:1]$</font>:\nsend over a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Wizard</font> who is skilled at deciphering ancient books."
set key[id=519140202005377] name "If that's what $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ wants, we can't waste a moment. \
    \nI'll pick Wizards who can decipher ancient books and send them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> right now~!"
set key[id=519140202005378] name "Go find $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ and get <font color=\"#ffd200\">permission to \
    enter the palace</font>,\nthen tell the Empress what $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ wants."
set key[id=519140202005380] name "Go find $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ and get <font color=\"#ffd200\">permission to \
    enter the palace</font>,\nthen tell the Empress what $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ wants."
set key[id=519140202005381] name "$MyPCName$. It's been a while.\nSo, what brings you here? "
set key[id=519140202005382] name "An order from $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$...\nSomething urgent must have \
    happened.  "
set key[id=519140202005383] name "We'll hear the details later. For now, go to the palace and see the Empress. "
set key[id=519140202005384] name "We'll hear the details later.\nFor now, go to the palace and see the Empress. \
    You have permission to enter."
set key[id=519140202005385] name "It's been a while, $MyPCName$.\nYou look braver and stronger than ever. It's \
    good to see."
set key[id=519140202005386] name "What brings you here?"
set key[id=519140202005387] name "(Hand over $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$'s written order.)"
set key[id=519140202005388] name "Hmm... $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ has never called for a summons this \
    urgently...\nFrom what it says, this must be a time when an important decision is needed."
set key[id=519140202005389] name "Very well. As $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ requested, I will send an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">emergency summons</font>\nto the leaders of every guardian force. It may be good to go \
    over\nthe current situation once more when everyone is gathered."
set key[id=519140202005391] name "Very well. As $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ requested, I will send an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">emergency summons</font>\nto the leaders of every guardian force. It may be good to go \
    over\nthe current situation once more when everyone is gathered."
set key[id=519140202005392] name "Ah, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>!\nI heard what happened in the \
    banquet hall. It's certainly not easy."
set key[id=519140202005393] name "Everyone has their own position, so it will be hard to unite them all at \
    once.\nBut if it's for the peace of us all...\nI'm sure they'll all make wise decisions."
set key[id=519140202005394] name "The royal family will also persuade each guardian force in person and help \
    however we can.\n$MyPCName$, for now please go back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and\ntell \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font> <font color=\"#ffd200\">the will of the \
    palace</font>."
set key[id=519140202005395] name "The royal family will also persuade each guardian force in person and help \
    however we can.\n$MyPCName$, for now please go back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and\ntell \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font> <font color=\"#ffd200\">the will of the \
    palace</font>."
set key[id=519140202005396] name "I've been waiting for you. So, how did it go?"
set key[id=519140202005397] name "(Pass on the Empress's wishes.)"
set key[id=519140202005398] name "I never expected every guardian force to agree from the start.\nIf the royal \
    family steps up actively... that could be a great help."
set key[id=519140202005399] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>. Welcome.\nToday a message came from \
    an adventurer saying they need our <font color=\"#ffd200\">help</font>,\nso I called $MyPCName$ here in a \
    hurry."
set key[id=519140202005400] name "What's the news?"
set key[id=519140202005401] name "It seems an unwelcome guest has appeared in $map:02000063$.\nPirates suddenly \
    showed up, and many people sailing the sea lanes\nare being harmed."
set key[id=519140202005402] name "Above all, many people hurt by the pirates' rampage are injured and\nin danger. \
    Could you hurry to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> and help them? "
set key[id=519140202005403] name "Many people hurt by the pirates' rampage are injured and\nin danger. Could you \
    hurry to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> and help them? "
set key[id=519140202005404] name "I... can hardly... breathe."
set key[id=519140202005405] name "Ah... Y... you are... who...? "
set key[id=519140202005406] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=519140202005407] name "Ugh... The pirates' surprise attack caught us off guard,\nand things are bad. \
    With so many wounded, we can't fight the pirates any longer... *huff*..."
set key[id=519140202005408] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=519140202005409] name "Never mind me... please... help my comrades... "
set key[id=519140202005410] name "Never mind me... please... help my comrades... "
set key[id=519140202005411] name "Phew, any later and things could have gotten much worse...\nThank you for your \
    help."
set key[id=519140202005412] name "I promise I will never forget this kindness, and I will repay it someday."
set key[id=519140202005413] name "Is there anything else I can help with?"
set key[id=519140202005414] name "No, I can't impose on you any more than this.\nIf fate allows, we will meet \
    again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=519140202005416] name "If fate allows, we will meet again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=519140202005417] name "You're here. I've been waiting.\nHow are things in $map:02000063$?"
set key[id=519140202005418] name "Rune Blader?\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font>? I \
    know of him well.\nBut why would $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ go all the way there and run into trouble...?"
set key[id=519140202005419] name "Actually, I heard that at $npc:11000031[gender:0]$'s sudden request, all the \
    forces have\ngathered in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font>... I have a feeling it's connected to \
    this."
set key[id=519140202005420] name "Since $MyPCName$ met <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font> \
    in person,\nlet's go to $map:52000026$ together."
set key[id=519140202005421] name "Since $MyPCName$ met <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font> \
    in person,\nlet's go to $map:52000026$ together."
set key[id=519140202005422] name "In keeping the peace, I believe politics must not come first.\nThat is also the \
    creed of us Priests."
set key[id=519140202005423] name "So it's only natural that we help the Rune Blader and join the expedition. "
set key[id=519140202005424] name "Since $MyPCName$ was the first to see the Rune Blader's situation,\nI think you \
    should join the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight Expedition</font> with $npc:11001578[gender:1]$\nas our \
    representative of the Priests."
set key[id=519140202005425] name "Please let the courage of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font> be a \
    strength to the Rune Blader\nin distress.\nWhile you are with them, we will give all the support we can from \
    here. "
set key[id=519140202005426] name "Finish your preparations quickly and go to $map:02000035$ in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>,\nthen meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005427] name "Finish your preparations quickly and go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>,\nthen meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005428] name "A brave member of the Priests is the first to arrive.\nWelcome. "
set key[id=519140202005429] name "Even if the road we must walk together grows hard,\nthe gods' protection will \
    watch over you."
set key[id=519140202005430] name "Ugh, a pesky unwelcome guest shows up again after all this time."
set key[id=519140202005431] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=519140202005432] name "Not long ago, our comrades ran into those rampaging pirates\nin $map:02000063$ \
    and got a rough beating."
set key[id=519140202005433] name "There's no limit to how fearless a fool can be... to dare touch our \
    Berserkers!\nPirates may be dumb, but this time they picked the wrong door."
set key[id=519140202005434] name "What are you doing? After hearing that, your body should be itching already!\nGo \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> and give those pirates a taste of Berserker pride!"
set key[id=519140202005435] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> and give those pirates a \
    taste of Berserker pride!"
set key[id=519140202005436] name "I... can hardly... breathe."
set key[id=519140202005452] name "What? Rune Blader? If it's $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$..."
set key[id=519140202005453] name "Actually, at $npc:11000031[gender:0]$'s sudden request, the Empress\nhas issued \
    a summons for everyone to gather in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font>... "
set key[id=519140202005454] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001581[gender:0]$</font> is coming to the \
    banquet hall too, so it's a chance to see a familiar face.\nGo to $map:52000026$ yourself.\nHear what's going \
    on and what the circumstances are."
set key[id=519140202005455] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001581[gender:0]$</font> is coming to the \
    banquet hall too, so it's a chance to see a familiar face.\nGo to $map:52000026$ yourself.\nHear what's going \
    on and what the circumstances are."
set key[id=519140202005456] name "You're here!\nI've already heard the gist through <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000009[gender:0]$</font>, though."
set key[id=519140202005457] name "A Berserker without loyalty is as good as dead!\nWe can't just sit still after \
    hearing this."
set key[id=519140202005458] name "You know the situation in $map:02000063$ best,\nso you can join the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight Expedition</font> with $npcName:11000009[gender:0]$ on behalf of us Berserkers."
set key[id=519140202005459] name "Go show off the might of the Berserkers to your heart's content, then come \
    back!\nOnce you're ready, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005460] name "Once you're ready, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and meet \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005461] name "Welcome, <font color=\"#ffd200\">Berserker</font> Guardians, heirs of brave \
    warriors.\nSeeing your majestic selves as ever gives me strength."
set key[id=519140202005462] name "Even if the road we must walk together grows hard, the gods' protection \
    will\nwatch over you."
set key[id=519140202005463] name "Have you heard?\nThe Green Hood Eagle Scouts went to scout $map:02000063$ and \
    word came that\nthey were attacked by pirates."
set key[id=519140202005464] name "$map:02000063$ is a sea lane busy with merchants from every country.\nIf we \
    leave those guys alone, all of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> sea lanes\nwill be taken over \
    by pirates."
set key[id=519140202005465] name "Right now, find the pirate base in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> \
    and wipe them out.\nEveryone is under threat, so hurry!"
set key[id=519140202005466] name "Right now, find the pirate base in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> \
    and wipe them out.\nEveryone is under threat, so hurry!"
set key[id=519140202005467] name "I... can hardly... breathe."
set key[id=519140202005478] name "I promise I will never forget this kindness, and I will repay it someday."
set key[id=519140202005479] name "No, I can't impose on you any more than this.\nIf fate allows, we will meet \
    again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=519140202005480] name "What? Rune Blader $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$...\nSomething must be going on."
set key[id=519140202005481] name "Oh right, an urgent <font color=\"#ffd200\">summons</font> came down.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000075[gender:1]$</font> must have an urgent matter, because the guardian \
    representatives of every nation were\nsummoned. $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$ is coming in person, too."
set key[id=519140202005482] name "I'm not sure exactly, but it might have something to do with the Rune \
    Bladers...\n$MyPCName$, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> too and\nhear what they have to \
    say."
set key[id=519140202005483] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000075[gender:1]$</font> must have an urgent \
    matter, because the guardian representatives of every nation were\nsummoned. You go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> too and\nhear what they have to say."
set key[id=519140202005484] name "Hmm... I understand what $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ wants,\nbut this isn't a \
    decision that can be made easily."
set key[id=519140202005485] name "On the other hand, as the leading force guarding Victoria Island,\npassing by an \
    ally's hardship would weigh on my heart\nfor the rest of my life."
set key[id=519140202005486] name "We Green Hood will join the other guardian forces and\nlend our strength to \
    overcome the Rune Blader crisis."
set key[id=519140202005487] name "$MyPCName$, you saw the whole situation in $map:02000063$,\nso I think you \
    should join the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight Expedition</font> with me as a representative of us \
    Archers."
set key[id=519140202005488] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> once you're ready.\nWe'll \
    meet again there."
set key[id=519140202005489] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> once you're ready.\nWe'll \
    meet again there."
set key[id=519140202005490] name "Welcome. I never doubted the Archers would stand with us.\nSeeing your majestic \
    selves as ever gives me strength."
set key[id=519140202005491] name "Even if the road we must walk together grows hard,\nthe gods' protection will \
    watch over you."
set key[id=519140202005492] name "Hmm... Something unexpected happened.\nWord came that the knights who went \
    scouting in $map:02000063$ were beaten\nby the pirates occupying the area."
set key[id=519140202005493] name "More pirates than we thought are occupying $map:02000063$, so the damage seems \
    heavy.\nGo to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> right now and look into things there.\nWhere <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000025$</font> is must be their base."
set key[id=519140202005494] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> right now and see what's \
    going on.\nWhere <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000025$</font> is must be their base."
set key[id=519140202005495] name "I... can hardly... breathe."
set key[id=519140202005496] name "Ah... Y... you are..."
set key[id=519140202005497] name "(Tell him to stay still and speak slowly.)"
set key[id=519140202005498] name "Ugh... The pirates' surprise attack caught us off guard,\nand things are bad. \
    With so many wounded, we can't fight the pirates any longer... *huff*..."
set key[id=519140202005499] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=519140202005500] name "Never mind me... please... help my comrades... "
set key[id=519140202005501] name "Never mind me... please... help my comrades... "
set key[id=519140202005502] name "Phew, any later and things could have gotten much worse...\nThank you for your \
    help."
set key[id=519140202005506] name "I promise I will never forget this kindness, and I will repay it someday."
set key[id=519140202005507] name "No, I can't impose on you any more than this.\nIf fate allows, we will meet \
    again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=519140202005508] name "What? The Rune Blader?\nHmm... Looks like something strange is going on."
set key[id=519140202005509] name "Oh right, one more urgent thing just came up.\n$npcName:11000075[gender:1]$ must \
    have an urgent matter, because an <font color=\"#ffd200\">emergency summons</font>\nwas sent to the \
    representatives of each guardian force. "
set key[id=519140202005510] name "I haven't heard the exact reason yet, so go to\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> and hear the details."
set key[id=519140202005511] name "I haven't heard the exact reason yet, so go to\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> and hear the details.\nI've already told the Knight Commander that I'm \
    sending you in my place,\nso mind your manners."
set key[id=519140202005512] name "I heard from $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$ why the emergency summons was \
    issued.\nOpinions were divided within the Royal Guard too, but after talking with Allon,\nwe agreed to \
    volunteer for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight Expedition</font>."
set key[id=519140202005513] name "I heard from $npcName:11000040[gender:0]$ that before you came to the banquet \
    hall,\nyou helped $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ and the Rune Blader expedition in $map:02000063$."
set key[id=519140202005514] name "You know their situation best, having seen it yourself,\nso join the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight Expedition</font>."
set key[id=519140202005515] name "Hurry and get ready to leave, then go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>.\nIf you ever have trouble, ask for support."
set key[id=519140202005516] name "Hurry and get ready to leave, then go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>.\nIf you ever have trouble, ask for support."
set key[id=519140202005517] name "Welcome, heir of the Light.\nI never doubted that you would lead the way in \
    doing righteous deeds."
set key[id=519140202005518] name "Even if the road we must walk together grows hard,\nthe gods' protection will \
    watch over you."
set key[id=519140202005519] name "Ugh, I'm so mad I could scream!"
set key[id=519140202005520] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=519140202005521] name "My comrades went to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> and got beaten \
    up by those rampaging pirates!\nA pup who doesn't fear the tiger, daring to mess with us!"
set key[id=519140202005522] name "Go right now to $map:52000025$ in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> \
    and\nshow those guys what's what.\nBlast their pirate hideout in one shot so they can never pirate again!"
set key[id=519140202005523] name "Go right now to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> and show those \
    guys what's what.\nBlast their pirate hideout in one shot so they can never pirate again!"
set key[id=519140202005524] name "I... can hardly... breathe."
set key[id=519140202005525] name "Ah... Y... you are..."
set key[id=519140202005526] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=519140202005527] name "Ugh... The pirates' surprise attack caught us off guard,\nand things are bad. \
    With so many wounded, we can't fight the pirates any longer... *huff*..."
set key[id=519140202005528] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=519140202005529] name "Never mind me... please... help my comrades... "
set key[id=519140202005530] name "Never mind me... please... help my comrades... "
set key[id=519140202005531] name "Phew, any later and things could have gotten much worse...\nThank you for your \
    help."
set key[id=519140202005532] name "Piece of cake. Nothing to it."
set key[id=519140202005533] name "The more urgent the moment when help arrives, the more the gratitude grows.\nHow \
    could I not thank you?"
set key[id=519140202005534] name "I promise I will never forget this kindness, and I will repay it someday."
set key[id=519140202005535] name "No, I can't impose on you any more than this.\nIf fate allows, we will meet \
    again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=519140202005536] name "If fate allows, we will meet again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=519140202005537] name "So how'd it go? You showed them the power of the cannon, right?"
set key[id=519140202005538] name "(Tell about what happened in $map:02000063$.)"
set key[id=519140202005539] name "What? Rune Blader?\nThe Rune Blader from far-off Terunkalib came all the way to \
    $map:02000063$..."
set key[id=519140202005540] name "Oh! Does that have something to do with $npcName:11000075[gender:1]$'s emergency \
    summons too?"
set key[id=519140202005541] name "Why was the emergency summons suddenly called? Tell me more."
set key[id=519140202005542] name "I haven't gotten the details either.\nThey just said to gather. I guess they'll \
    tell us everything once we're there."
set key[id=519140202005543] name "Ugh... honestly it's kind of a pain, but I'm curious, so let's go and \
    listen.\nCome on, let's go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> together."
set key[id=519140202005544] name "Ugh... honestly it's kind of a pain, but I'm curious, so let's go and \
    listen.\nCome on, let's go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> together."
set key[id=519140202005545] name "Aaah, this is making me use my head for the first time in a while?!\nIt might be \
    fun! But it might be a hassle too..."
set key[id=519140202005546] name "Wait, let me think about it for a sec..."
set key[id=519140202005547] name "Ah, forget it! I've decided! "
set key[id=519140202005548] name "What did you decide?"
set key[id=519140202005549] name "Fine, it's a pain, but let's go help them~\nAnd I just got a new Super Cannon, \
    so I can test its performance, too.\nThey'll probably be amazed by the great Jenna's stylish Super Cannon, and \
    then amazed again by my awesome shooting!"
set key[id=519140202005550] name "Haha, falling for me is exhausting, you know. Hahaha\nSuddenly I'm full of \
    energy?! I'm heading to $map:02000023$ right now,\nso $MyPCName$, follow when you're ready! See you in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>!"
set key[id=519140202005552] name "A welcome guest, I see.\nIn fact, $npcName:11000046[gender:1]$ came by a moment \
    ago.\nStill as bright and cheerful as ever~"
set key[id=519140202005553] name "In a heavy mood like this, everyone gets tired and edgy, but now that \
    you've\njoined the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight Expedition</font>, it finally feels lively and full of \
    energy."
set key[id=519140202005554] name "Arrogant punks. How dare they!"
set key[id=519140202005555] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=519140202005556] name "My comrades went to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> and got beaten \
    by those rampaging pirates!\nThey say ignorant fools fear nothing... that's not even funny."
set key[id=519140202005557] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> right now and show them how \
    scary Thieves are.\nToday is the pirates' death day!!"
set key[id=519140202005558] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> right now and show them how \
    scary Thieves are.\nToday is the pirates' death day!!"
set key[id=519140202005559] name "I... can hardly... breathe."
set key[id=519140202005567] name "I promise I will never forget this kindness, and I will repay it someday."
set key[id=519140202005568] name "Ah... of course. I don't say empty words.\nIf fate allows, we'll meet again \
    someday. Thank you."
set key[id=519140202005571] name "I promise I will never forget this kindness, and I will repay it someday."
set key[id=519140202005572] name "So? Did you take care of all the pirates?"
set key[id=519140202005573] name "(Tell about what happened in $map:02000063$.)"
set key[id=519140202005574] name "Hm? Rune Blader?\nWhy'd they come there... tsk~ They should've stayed where they \
    lived... "
set key[id=519140202005575] name "Oh right, besides that, one more annoying thing just came up.\nAn emergency \
    summons or something... anyway, they said to gather at the banquet hall or wherever."
set key[id=519140202005576] name "I hate gatherings full of chatty people.\nStill, it's an official thing, so I \
    can't dodge it... "
set key[id=519140202005577] name "Okay, come with me to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> for now.\nI \
    already hate chatter, and I'm not sure I could survive that stretch of patience alone."
set key[id=519140202005578] name "Okay, come with me to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> for now.\nI \
    already hate chatter, and I'm not sure I could survive that stretch of patience alone."
set key[id=519140202005579] name "Ugh... I can't understand this at all!"
set key[id=519140202005580] name "Why did you come back first?"
set key[id=519140202005581] name "There's no end in sight.\nAnd why on earth should we butt into someone else's \
    family business that won't even help us?"
set key[id=519140202005582] name "I still can't understand it at all... but anyway, to start with the \
    conclusion,\nour Thieves decided to join the Starlight Expedition too."
set key[id=519140202005583] name "Why did you make that decision?"
set key[id=519140202005584] name "What reason? Please~\nWhile you were in the banquet hall, I went back to the \
    Grand Hall first and got an order from Jonathan Button\nto support the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight \
    Expedition</font>."
set key[id=519140202005585] name "Geez, do I look that free...\nAnyway, orders are orders, so we're going to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> to join the Starlight Expedition. "
set key[id=519140202005586] name "I'll leave right now and meet $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$, so as soon as you're \
    ready,\ncome to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>. That's all!"
set key[id=519140202005587] name "I'll leave right now and meet $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$, so as soon as you're \
    ready,\ncome to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>. That's all!"
set key[id=519140202005588] name "I've been waiting for you.\nIn fact, $npcName:11000050[gender:0]$ just came by \
    and said they'd join the Starlight Expedition."
set key[id=519140202005591] name "Thank you so much for joining the Starlight Expedition and lending your \
    strength.\nSeeing everyone gather one by one fills my heart. Hehe"
set key[id=519140202005592] name "What on earth is going on... "
set key[id=519140202005593] name "I ask what's wrong."
set key[id=519140202005594] name "The royal family called an emergency summons.\nI hope it won't be a waste of \
    time. Let's go to the banquet hall for now."
set key[id=519140202005597] name "The royal family called an emergency summons.\nI hope it won't be a waste of \
    time. Let's go to the banquet hall for now."
set key[id=519140202005598] name "I expected it, but this really isn't something we need to hear.\nIt looks like a \
    matter the Assassins don't have to get involved in, so let's not bother."
set key[id=519140202005600] name "Don't worry about it.\nJust say that and they'll understand."
set key[id=519140202005601] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000208$</font> and tell <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000006[gender:0]$</font>\nit was nothing.\nOh! And tell them I'm heading straight \
    to the sewers."
set key[id=519140202005602] name "Hmm... As $npcName:11000051[gender:1]$ said, there's no need for us to get \
    involved in the Rune Blader business.\nWe just do what we have to do."
set key[id=519140202005603] name "$npc:11000051[gender:1]$ said they'd go straight to the sewers?\nHmm... Will \
    they be OK alone... Their skill is beyond doubt, but... "
set key[id=519140202005604] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=519140202005605] name "Not long ago, a Humblis agent infiltrated the Black Star Society in secret\nto \
    expose the collusion between $npc:11000065[gender:0]$ and $npcName:11000251[gender:0]$. "
set key[id=519140202005606] name "But after getting the evidence and escaping the Black Star Society, the agent's \
    cover was blown.\nThey dodged pursuit and are now <font color=\"#ffd200\">trapped</font> in the city's <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">underground sewers</font>, and if\nthey're found like that, it's \
    over.\n$npc:11000051[gender:1]$ went to rescue that agent."
set key[id=519140202005607] name "Just in case... you go to $map:52000027$ and help $npc:11000051[gender:1]$ \
    too.\nOh, and be sure to bring back the evidence they secured."
set key[id=519140202005608] name "Oh, and some Rune Blader showed up and went off saying he'd rescue the Humblis \
    agent himself,\nbut there's still no word. If you meet that Rune Blader when you arrive,\nrescue that pesky \
    Rune Blader too."
set key[id=519140202005609] name "Just in case... you go to $map:52000027$ and help $npc:11000051[gender:1]$ \
    too.\nOh, and be sure to bring back the evidence they secured."
set key[id=519140202005610] name "You're here. You did bring the evidence, right?"
set key[id=519140202005611] name "You brought the evidence safely.\n$npcName:11000051[gender:1]$ escorted the \
    Humblis agent and the Rune Blader out."
set key[id=519140202005612] name "Still, it seems that pesky Rune Blader protected the Humblis agent until Ruki \
    joined,\nand that's the only reason the agent survived."
set key[id=519140202005613] name "The Rune Blader risked his life to ask us to join the Starlight Expedition,\nand \
    carried out the mission here in our place. We owe that guy one, so\nafter talking with \
    $npcName:11000051[gender:1]$ we decided to join the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight Expedition</font>."
set key[id=519140202005614] name "$npcName:11000051[gender:1]$ already went ahead to $map:02000023$ as the advance \
    party of the Assassin guardians,\nso <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, hurry to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005615] name "$npcName:11000051[gender:1]$ already went ahead to $map:02000023$ as the advance \
    party of the Assassin guardians,\nso <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, hurry to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=519140202005616] name "I've been waiting for you.\nIn fact, $npcName:11000051[gender:1]$ just came by \
    and said they'd join the Starlight Expedition."
set key[id=519140202005619] name "Thank you so much for joining the Starlight Expedition and lending your \
    strength.\nSeeing everyone gather one by one fills my heart. Hehe"
set key[id=519140402005620] name "I'm heading to $map:02000023$ right now, so $MyPCName$, follow\nwhen you're \
    ready! See you in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>!"
set key[id=520001402005621] name "Is there anything else I can help with?"
set key[id=520001402005622] name "No, I can't impose on you any more than this.\nIf fate allows, we will meet \
    again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=520002702005623] name "Is there anything else I can help with?"
set key[id=520021502005626] name "Is there anything else I can help with?"
set key[id=520021502005627] name "No, I can't impose on you any more than this.\nIf fate allows, we will meet \
    again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=520021502005628] name "Is there anything else I can help with?"
set key[id=520021502005629] name "You'd better keep your promise."
set key[id=520021602005626] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000208$</font> and tell <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000006[gender:0]$</font>\nit was nothing.\nOh! And tell them I'm heading straight \
    to the sewers."
set key[id=520021602005627] name "Where are the sewers?"
set key[id=520152702005626] name "I've told the Knight Commander I'm sending you in my place,\nso mind your \
    manners."
set key[id=831174302001740] name "What on earth is going on...\nWho would do such a thing... "
set key[id=831174302001741] name "I ask what happened."
set key[id=831174302001742] name "While I was away for a moment, someone snuck in and stole all the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font>\nand ran off. \nSigh... If they use them carelessly... the order of \
    time might completely collapse... "
set key[id=831174302001743] name "(Ask what the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font> are.)"
set key[id=831174302001744] name "Well... I wanted to scientifically uncover how the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Red \
    Lapenta</font>,\nwhich maintains the order of time, works. So I started researching the time system... and \
    the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font> are the result. "
set key[id=831174302001745] name "I haven't verified it yet, but... \nwith them you could even create a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">time mixture</font> where various times coexist.\nThat's why if anything happens to the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Red Lapenta</font>... sigh... "
set key[id=831174302001746] name "(Ask why they did such dangerous research.)"
set key[id=831174302001747] name "That... that's... sigh... \nAnyway, if whoever took the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font> knows even a little about them,\nthey'll surely go after the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000298$</font> in $map:02000259$.\nIt's the only place with a device that can control \
    time using the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font>... "
set key[id=831174302001748] name "$MyPCName$! \nPlease go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000259$</font> and \
    check whether anything is wrong at the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000298$</font>.  "
set key[id=831174302001749] name "(Say $map:02000259$ is too far.)"
set key[id=831174302001750] name "Ah, don't worry about that!\nYou can go straight there using the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001056$</font> behind me.\nIt's still on trial runs... but I happened to set the test \
    destination\nto <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000259$</font>."
set key[id=831174302001751] name "There might be some errors, but... every minute counts right now...\nYou're in \
    good shape, hands and feet all working, so please help me out. I'm begging you."
set key[id=831174302001752] name "If you use that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001056$</font> behind me,\nyou \
    can go straight to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000259$</font>."
set key[id=831174302001753] name "What is all this... \nGood grief... What am I going to do now... I can't clean \
    this up!!!"
set key[id=831174302001754] name "(Ask what's happening at the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000298$</font>.)"
set key[id=831174302001755] name "Huh? Well... something did happen, but... \nWho are you??"
set key[id=831174302001756] name "(Say I came at $npc:11001028[gender:0]$'s request.)"
set key[id=831174302001757] name "What?\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font> are gone? Ugh... Then \
    all this... Sigh... "
set key[id=831174302001758] name "A huge horde of hackers has descended on the $map:02000298$.\nThey swarmed in so \
    fast we had no time to stop them, and took over the $map:02000298$\nin an instant. I barely escaped with my \
    life... "
set key[id=831174302001759] name "If... that hacker horde went all the way to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000299$</font> with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font>...\nthe \
    situation would become truly serious.\nListen! Take care of the hackers in the $map:02000298$ and check\non \
    the situation in $map:02000299$. Please!"
set key[id=831174302001760] name "Listen! Take care of the hackers in the $map:02000298$ and check\non the \
    situation in $map:02000299$. Please!"
set key[id=831174302001761] name "Ah, how did it go?\nWhat about $map:02000299$?"
set key[id=831174302001762] name "(Tell what the situation is.)"
set key[id=831174302001763] name "Oh no... Even $map:02000299$... \nIf they go on and find the \
    $map:02000304$...!!"
set key[id=831174302001764] name "The $map:02000304$!! We absolutely must protect the $map:02000304$!!"
set key[id=831174302001765] name "(Ask what the $map:02000304$ is.)"
set key[id=831174302001766] name "The $map:02000304$ is a higher-dimensional world where many times are mixed \
    together...\nThe central axis of the universe's time!\nNo one has ever discovered it or been there.\nBecause \
    that would go beyond the order of time maintained by the power of the Red Lapenta."
set key[id=831174302001767] name "But you see... the time machine we're researching in the $map:02000298$...\nIt's \
    still unstable, but it has succeeded in experiments traveling to set points in space-time.\nIf... someone \
    controls the time machine with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font> and manages to enter\nthe \
    gap that shifts the axis of time... "
set key[id=831174302001768] name "If whoever has the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font> enters the \
    $map:02000304$ and takes control of all\ntime, there's no telling what will happen!!\nThe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">time barrier</font> maintained by the power of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Red \
    Lapenta</font> might even collapse entirely,\nand great chaos could follow."
set key[id=831174302001769] name "Listen, $MyPCName$!\nYou have to go to $map:02000299$ again and\nfind the one \
    with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font>.\nThey must be searching for the $map:02000304$ and \
    traveling through unstable time."
set key[id=831174302001770] name "The past... the future... or somewhere else entirely... \nI don't know where \
    they are, but we have to find them and take them out!!"
set key[id=831174302001771] name "Go to $map:02000299$ and\nfind the one with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos \
    Time Keys</font>.\nThey must be searching for the $map:02000304$ and traveling through unstable time.\nThe \
    past... the future... or somewhere else entirely... \nI don't know where they are, but we have to find them \
    and take them out!!"
set key[id=831174302001772] name "Phew... If it weren't for you... something truly terrible would have happened."
set key[id=831174302001773] name "(Ask how they ended up in the $map:02000304$.)"
set key[id=831174302001774] name "Not long after I asked you to check on the $map:02000298$... \nthe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Intertimer</font> suddenly started acting strangely... \nthen there was a flash of light and \
    I lost consciousness."
set key[id=831174302001775] name "When I opened my eyes, I was in the $map:02000304$... It was all \
    $npc:24000615$'s scheme.\nStealing the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font> from here, leading the \
    hackers into the $map:02000298$...\nThat guy was trying to rule the time of this world.\nTaking over \
    $map:02000194$ must have been just the start... "
set key[id=831174302001776] name "When that guy activated the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Time Floor</font> in the \
    $map:02000304$ with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Keys</font>,\nthe flow of time began to reverse and \
    mix, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Intertimer</font> was affected, and I got\nteleported to the $map:02000304$ \
    in an instant."
set key[id=831174302001777] name "(Ask what will happen from now on.)"
set key[id=831174302001778] name "For now, since the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Time Floor</font> has been stopped, \
    no more anomalies of mixed time\nshould occur.\nHowever... it seems it'll take some time\nfor the tangled flow \
    of time to settle back into place. "
set key[id=831174302001779] name "Until the flow of time is completely back in place, the space-time that was \
    circling the $map:02000304$\nat the moment the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Time Floor</font> stopped will stay \
    frozen.\nToo hard to follow...? Put simply... until the flow of time recovers its original order,\nsome spaces \
    will exist with the past and present coexisting."
set key[id=831174302001780] name "For now... \nall we can do is trust in the self-purifying power of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Red Lapenta</font>, wherever it is... "
set key[id=831174302002824] name "The people rescued from $map:02000292$ told us more about what's going on \
    inside.\nThey were terrified, saying that in Katramus, the higher you climb, floor by floor, the more \
    severe\nthe pain the captured slaves feel."
set key[id=831174302002825] name "That means many people are still living in painful slavery under the\nShadow \
    Legion's watch and control...\nAnd they said the peak of that pain is... the moment you face the Slave \
    Overseer\n$npc:24000516[gender:1]$ on the top floor... $map:02000297$."
set key[id=831174302002826] name "To prevent further sacrifice, the Lumina Liberation Army has decided to speed up \
    the operation a bit.\nWill you, $MyPCName$, join us in conquering <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>, \
    rescuing all the residents,\nand defeating the axis of evil,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Slave Overseer \
    $npc:24000516[gender:1]$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302002827] name "To prevent further sacrifice, the Lumina Liberation Army has decided to speed up \
    the operation a bit.\nWill you, $MyPCName$, join us in conquering <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>, \
    rescuing all the residents,\nand defeating the axis of evil,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Slave Overseer \
    $npc:24000516[gender:1]$</font>?"
set key[id=831174302002828] name "Ugh... $MyPCName$.\nI heard the news... They said you did an amazing job... \
    Thank you so much."
set key[id=831174302002829] name "My comrades are running around risking their lives, and I'm stuck here like a \
    fool, which made me feel so\nsorry and frustrated... But hearing the operation succeeded thanks to you... I \
    feel a little lighter...  "
set key[id=831174302002830] name "Ah... $MyPCName$!!\nIt's been a while. How have you been?"
set key[id=831174302002831] name "(Greet them and ask how $npc:11000188[gender:1]$ is doing.)"
set key[id=831174302002832] name "My sister? She's getting a lot better. \nThat's good, right? But... "
set key[id=831174302002833] name "I ask what happened."
set key[id=831174302002834] name "My sister keeps having nightmares lately... \nIn her dream, she saw Mom and Dad \
    crying in that Shadow World.\nAnd horrible goblins were tormenting them...\nGranny says it's all because she \
    heard that story... "
set key[id=831174302002835] name "(Ask what story.)"
set key[id=831174302002836] name "Well... when Granny's friend came to check on my sister...\nthey said there's a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Tower of Slaves</font> called <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> in the Shadow \
    World...\nand asked whether our Mom and Dad might be locked up there, unable to come back... "
set key[id=831174302002837] name "They thought my sister was asleep... so they spoke very softly... \nbut she \
    heard it, and that's why she keeps having those nightmares.\nBut... what if it's really true? What if our Mom \
    and Dad... are really\nstuck in <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>, unable to come back... what do I do?"
set key[id=831174302002838] name "Could you, $MyPCName$, go and find out whether our Mom and Dad are really being \
    held in <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>? \nFind out if they are... \nGranny says that even if they've \
    changed a lot, Dad gave Mom a bracelet,\nso we'd be able to recognize Mom by it."
set key[id=831174302002839] name "A silver bracelet engraved with our family's names... The one wearing that \
    bracelet is my Mom.\nPlease. Find out whether my Mom and Dad are really in a place called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>."
set key[id=831174302002840] name "A silver bracelet engraved with our family's names... The one wearing that \
    bracelet is my Mom.\nPlease. Find out whether my Mom and Dad are really in a place called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font>."
set key[id=831174302002841] name "What... This is... my son gave it to my daughter-in-law as a birthday present... \
    \nWhere did you find this?"
set key[id=831174302002842] name "(Say the Katramus Slave Overseer had it.)"
set key[id=831174302002843] name "Hush! Shh! Stop... stop! If $npc:11000188[gender:1]$ hears...!!\nSigh... I \
    prayed it wasn't true... that they were somewhere in that terrible place... \nAmong the people rescued from \
    there... were my son and daughter-in-law really not there?"
set key[id=831174302002844] name "(Say I'll look into it more.)"
set key[id=831174302002845] name "Oh, please... Sob. .. \nThat... Slave Overseer must have taken the bracelet from \
    my daughter-in-law... \nSurely... she hasn't already lost her life... or else... Sob. "
set key[id=831174302002846] name "No... No, it can't be... \nShe loved her children so dearly... For their sake, \
    she'll cling to life to the very\nend and come back, I'm sure... "
set key[id=831174302002847] name "That's what I want to believe... and I hope my grandchildren believe it too... \
    \nPlease keep it a secret from $npc:11000186[gender:0]$ that you found this bracelet."
set key[id=831174302003463] name "Oh dear... Looks like they dropped by and left again while I was out... "
set key[id=831174302003464] name "(Ask who stopped by.)"
set key[id=831174302003465] name "Ah... $npcName:11000607[gender:0]$ is a peddler who delivers groceries and daily \
    necessities to the palace.\nEvery time they come to $map:02000001$, they kindly stop by my house, eat my \
    cookies with gusto,\nand leave a whole bundle of gifts behind."
set key[id=831174302003466] name "But this time they must have come while I was out for a moment.\nThere's only \
    the gift $npcName:11000607[gender:0]$ left behind... \nMaybe they went on to the palace... "
set key[id=831174302003467] name "If you happen to run into $npcName:11000607[gender:0]$ near the palace, could \
    you tell them to come back to my house\nbefore they leave?\nTell them I'll bake some really tasty cookies."
set key[id=831174302003468] name "If you happen to run into $npcName:11000607[gender:0]$ near the palace, could \
    you tell them to come back to my house\nbefore they leave?\nTell them I'll bake some really tasty cookies."
set key[id=831174302003469] name "Hm? What did you just say?\nSorry, I was lost in thought for a moment... "
set key[id=831174302003470] name "(Pass on $npc:11000002[gender:1]$'s message.)"
set key[id=831174302003471] name "Oh... I see.\nI was feeling so sorry that I'd miss out on the cookies this \
    time... "
set key[id=831174302003472] name "Phew... But the mood in the palace is strange today... "
set key[id=831174302003473] name "What's strange?"
set key[id=831174302003474] name "Merchants like me and the palace workers are only allowed into the palace \
    basement.\nUsually the entrance should be bustling with people coming and going, full of life,\nbut now \
    it's... so... quiet... and still. There are no guards, either... "
set key[id=831174302003475] name "The air feels totally different from usual... Something's off. \nI think \
    something has happened inside the palace... Could you go and find out?\nIt might be dangerous, so it'd be \
    better to go with other people."
set key[id=831174302003476] name "I think something has happened inside the palace... Could you go and find \
    out?\nIt might be dangerous, so it'd be better to go with other people."
set key[id=831174302003477] name "Oh... So, what happened?\nNothing at all? Or... "
set key[id=831174302003478] name "(Tell what's going on in $map:02000252$.)"
set key[id=831174302003479] name "Wh... what?!\nAh... ah... This is no time to just stand here. I have to tell the \
    Guard right away!!"
set key[id=831174302003480] name "$MyPCName$!\nI'll go tell the Guard right now! Until then, could you stop the \
    ones who attacked the palace\nfrom reaching the Empress?"
set key[id=831174302003481] name "$MyPCName$!\nI'll go tell the Guard right now! Until then, could you stop the \
    ones who attacked the palace\nfrom reaching the Empress?"
set key[id=831174302003482] name "Oh, are you coming from $map:02000252$?\nWhen the news came, the Captain of the \
    Guard and everyone else were so shocked... Phew... "
set key[id=831174302003483] name "Anyway, the order is for everyone to go on emergency alert duty for the time \
    being."
set key[id=831174302003484] name "What do I do... What do I do... \nWill they be okay... "
set key[id=831174302003485] name "I ask what happened."
set key[id=831174302003486] name "I think $npc:11000032[gender:0]$ is in danger...  "
set key[id=831174302003487] name "(Ask him to explain in detail.)"
set key[id=831174302003488] name "Um... Can you see that whirlpool over there...? $npc:11000032[gender:0]$ is \
    inside it. \nI heard someone is trying to destroy the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Green \
    Lapenta</font>.\n$npc:11000032[gender:0]$ is trying to protect the Green Lapenta... Sniff...   "
set key[id=831174302003489] name "Please. \n$npc:11000032[gender:0]$ is my one and only precious friend.\nPlease \
    help <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000032[gender:0]$ and the Green Lapenta stay safe</font>."
set key[id=831174302003490] name "Please. \n$npc:11000032[gender:0]$ is my one and only precious friend.\nPlease \
    help <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000032[gender:0]$ and the Green Lapenta stay safe</font>."
set key[id=831174302003491] name "I saw everything that came out of that whirlpool just now, I \
    did~\n$npc:11000693[gender:1]$ told me all about it too, I did~"
set key[id=831174302003492] name "The guardian protecting the Green Lapenta isn't $npc:11000031[gender:0]$, it's \
    actually...!\n$npc:11000032[gender:0]$! $npc:11000032[gender:0]$ is amazing, I say!"
set key[id=831174302003493] name "$MyPCName$!\nI think you've truly got the look of a hero now.\nEven at a glance, \
    I can feel a strength that's nothing like before."
set key[id=831174302003494] name "But... you must never become arrogant.\nAs you've grown stronger, so have the \
    Demon King and the forces of darkness\nthreatening this world. Don't forget that."
set key[id=831174302003495] name "I'd like you to lend even more strength to protecting the world together with \
    the Guardians\nfighting hard on the front lines of $map:02000146$."
set key[id=831174302003496] name "I'd like you to lend even more strength to protecting the world together with \
    the Guardians\nfighting hard on the front lines of $map:02000146$."
set key[id=831174302003497] name "Ah, $MyPCName$! Glad you came.\nThere happen to be some matters where I could \
    use your help."
set key[id=831174302003498] name "I know you've done your best to help the Guardians\nkeep this world safe from \
    the forces of darkness.\nHmm... I've rarely said so out loud... but if you were observant...\nI think you must \
    have felt that I've respected you as a hero for some time now."
set key[id=831174302003499] name "Being respected as a hero brings honor, but it also means\nan obligation to lend \
    even more strength to this world.\nAs you know, danger big and small still fills every corner of this \
    world,\nand those of us who must protect it can't afford to let our guard down for a moment."
set key[id=831174302003500] name "Now that you've grown stronger, I'd like you to <font color=\"#ffd200\">take on \
    some tasks that are a little harder and tougher than before and\nhelp out</font>.\nMeet \
    $npc:11000266[gender:0]$ and $npc:11000009[gender:0]$ here, hear them out,\nand help them."
set key[id=831174302003501] name "Now that you've grown stronger, I'd like you to <font color=\"#ffd200\">take on \
    some tasks that are a little harder and tougher than before and\nhelp out</font>.\nMeet \
    $npc:11000266[gender:0]$ and $npc:11000009[gender:0]$ here, hear them out,\nand help them."
set key[id=831174302003502] name "It must have been exhausting and overwhelming...\nAs expected of you, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>. You handled it splendidly."
set key[id=831174302003503] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Green Hood</font> vigilantes of Henesys say they \
    need your strength, too.\nJust as you helped $npc:11000266[gender:0]$ and $npc:11000009[gender:0]$, go meet \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000007[gender:1]$</font>,\nhear the details, and lend them a hand."
set key[id=831174302003504] name "Just as you helped $npc:11000266[gender:0]$ and $npc:11000009[gender:0]$, go \
    meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000007[gender:1]$</font>,\nhear the details, and lend them a hand."
set key[id=831174302003505] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>... You never let anyone down.\nIn the \
    distant future... you might become a <font color=\"#ffd200\">legendary hero</font> of this Maple World."
set key[id=831174302003539] name "Bandayabu!"
set key[id=831174302003540] name "What do you mean?"
set key[id=831174302003541] name "That's how $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ greets people.\nThey say they're preparing a \
    ritual to lift the grudge and curse tied to the Vayar Mountains."
set key[id=831174302003542] name "(Ask about the grudge and curse tied to the Vayar Mountains.)"
set key[id=831174302003543] name "It's such a famous story... I don't know whether you already know it, but\nthe \
    Vayar Mountains were originally a place where the sacred energy of the earth surged forth,\nand not only the \
    ancient tribes but also the divine beasts they worshiped took root and lived there."
set key[id=831174302003544] name "But... for reasons that are still unknown, the ancient tribes vanished, and the \
    divine beasts\nguarding the place, enraged by the mistakes and greed of foolish humans, have turned \
    into\nmaddened enemies threatening this world everywhere."
set key[id=831174302003545] name "$npc:11000039[gender:1]$ has been holding a ritual every year to revive the \
    original sacred energy of the Vayar Mountains\nand soothe the divine beasts' maddened hearts.\nMaybe those \
    efforts still haven't reached the heavens... There's no big change yet... \nBut $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ said \
    they'll keep offering prayers and never give up."
set key[id=831174302003546] name "The Murpagos Tribe has been helping $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ prepare the \
    offerings needed for the ritual.\nIt's about time we got moving... \nThis time, $MyPCName$, could you help out \
    too?"
set key[id=831174302003547] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=831174302003548] name "Great, then I'll leave this one to you.\nGet me a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Griffin feather</font>, from one of the divine beasts awakened in the Vayar Mountains.\nYou \
    should be able to get one from a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000019[gender:0]$</font> or a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000020[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302003549] name "Get me a <font color=\"#ffd200\">Griffin feather</font>, from one of the divine \
    beasts awakened in the Vayar Mountains.\nYou should be able to get one from a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000019[gender:0]$</font> or a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000020[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302003550] name "Oh~ You're back sooner than I expected. Was it rough?\nThis $item:30000281$ is \
    said to hold the sacred energy of the Vayar Mountains\nthat the Griffins were born with, just as it was."
set key[id=831174302003551] name "$npc:11000039[gender:1]$ said that if we gather the sacred energy in it little \
    by little and hold the ritual, the Vayar\nMountains will regain their former power and the raging divine \
    beasts can be calmed."
set key[id=831174302003552] name "Now it's time to find the next offering.\nDo you know about the giant rock \
    golems, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bayars</font>, relics of the ancient tribes\nawakened in the Vayar \
    Mountains?"
set key[id=831174302003553] name "(Say I do.)"
set key[id=831174302003554] name "(Say I don't.)"
set key[id=831174302003555] name "Oh? Then I don't need to explain it all over again. Heh heh.\nI'll just tell you \
    what we need to do this time.\nThe next offering is the $item:30000282$\ncarried by the $npc:21400001$ in \
    $map:02000313$."
set key[id=831174302003556] name "They say the $item:30000282$ of the young Vayar golems, who weren't born as full \
    adults,\nstill holds the sacred energy of the earth, just as it was.\nWith it, we might be able to awaken \
    again the guardian instinct the ancient tribes\ninstilled when they made the Vayar golems. "
set key[id=831174302003557] name "$map:02000313$ is a peak that broke off whole in the crustal shift when the Blue \
    Lapenta shattered,\nand it got stuck in $map:02000148$. You'll find it easily!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Defeat \
    the $npc:23100100[gender:0]$ and its guardian soldiers</font> protecting <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000313$</font>,\nget the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000282$</font>, and take it \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000302[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302003558] name "Oh? To put it simply... the ancient tribes who lived in the Vayar Mountains \
    pooled their wisdom\nand created <font color=\"#ffd200\">guardian golems</font> that could protect them along \
    with the mountains.\nThose beings are the giant rock golems we call the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bayars</font> \
    today.\nEven though they're our enemies now, they were originally nothing less than\ndivine beasts protecting \
    this world."
set key[id=831174302003559] name "If the prayers $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ offers in the ritual ever reach the \
    heavens, the present-day\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Bayars</font> may recover the guardian instinct they were \
    born with.\nAnyway, for that reason... the next offering we need is the $item:30000282$\ncarried by the \
    $npc:21400001$ in $map:02000313$."
set key[id=831174302003560] name "They say the $item:30000282$ of the young Vayar golems, who weren't born as full \
    adults,\nstill holds the sacred energy of the earth, just as it was.\nWith it, we might be able to awaken \
    again the guardian instinct the ancient tribes\ninstilled when they made the Vayar golems. "
set key[id=831174302003561] name "$map:02000313$ is a peak that broke off whole in the crustal shift when the Blue \
    Lapenta shattered,\nand it got stuck in $map:02000148$. You'll find it easily!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Defeat \
    the $npc:23100100[gender:0]$ and its guardian soldiers</font> protecting <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000313$</font>,\nget the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000282$</font>, and take it \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000302[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302003562] name "$map:02000313$ is a peak that broke off whole in the crustal shift when the Blue \
    Lapenta shattered,\nand it got stuck in $map:02000148$. You'll find it easily!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Defeat \
    the $npc:23100100[gender:0]$ and its guardian soldiers</font> protecting <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000313$</font>,\nget the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000282$</font>, and take it \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000302[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302003563] name "Bandayabu! \nYou've brought the $item:30000282$.\nI heard the news from \
    $npc:11000009[gender:0]$ and was waiting for you. "
set key[id=831174302003564] name "I'll make sure $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ gets it.\nThanks to you, it looks like \
    we'll be able to hold the ritual safely again this time."
set key[id=831174302003565] name "Every time, we manage to hold the ritual safely thanks to the help of the \
    Murpagos Tribe.\nEspecially since $npc:11000009[gender:0]$ steps up to help first, I'm always grateful.\nAs \
    $npc:11000039[gender:1]$ says, $npc:11000009[gender:0]$ will surely grow into an outstanding leader\nwho \
    surpasses their father."
set key[id=831174302003566] name "(Ask who $npc:11000009[gender:0]$'s father is.)"
set key[id=831174302003567] name "Ah, you didn't know yet?\n$npc:11000009[gender:0]$ is the son of \
    $npc:11000134[gender:0]$, the Grand Chieftain of the Murpagos\nTribe, who unites and leads the tribes of \
    Perion."
set key[id=831174302003568] name "$npc:11000039[gender:1]$ said that...\nAt such a hot-blooded age, there are \
    still some rough edges, but\nthey're destined to stand tall as a hero of the world, and their name will soon \
    rise high."
set key[id=831174302003569] name "Time for the ritual. I should hurry back to $npc:11000039[gender:1]$.\nPlease \
    give my thanks and regards to $npc:11000009[gender:0]$. Well then... "
set key[id=831174302003570] name "Time for the ritual. I should hurry back to $npc:11000039[gender:1]$.\nPlease \
    give my thanks and regards to $npc:11000009[gender:0]$. Well then... "
set key[id=831174302003571] name "Did you deliver the $item:30000282$ to $npc:11000302[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302003572] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003573] name "Thanks for all your hard work.\nI hope the prayers offered in the ritual are \
    answered this time... "
set key[id=831174302003574] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$.\nWhen $npc:11000076[gender:0]$ said there was someone \
    excellent who'd help with the Green Hood's Devlin extermination operation,\nI had a feeling, but... \nHaving \
    you, $MyPCName$, come in person already makes me feel reassured."
set key[id=831174302003575] name "I'm sure you already know, but at the broken land of $map:02000115$, our Green \
    Hood vigilantes\nare still fighting hard against the Devlins.\n$npc:11000015[gender:1]$ is searching for a way \
    to wipe out the Devlins for good\nso this situation can be settled as soon as possible."
set key[id=831174302003576] name "According to what we've found so far, the powerful dark energy the Devlins give \
    off\noriginates from the huge horns stuck in their heads.\nGo to $map:02000115$ and\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">pull the $item:30000283$ out of the heads</font> of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000001[gender:0]$</font> or the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000008[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302003577] name "Go to $map:02000115$ and <font color=\"#ffd200\">pull the $item:30000283$ \nout \
    of the heads</font> of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000001[gender:0]$</font> or the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000008[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=831174302003578] name "Thanks to your efforts, $MyPCName$, the vigilantes fighting the Devlins on the \
    frontier\nsay they've gained great strength and courage. Thank you once again.\n"
set key[id=831174302003579] name "While you, $MyPCName$, were out in $map:02000115$, we found something new.\nThe \
    source of the darkness in the $item:30000283$ was $npc:23100007[gender:0]$.\n$npc:23100007[gender:0]$ has been \
    awakening vengeful spirits sleeping in deep darkness to create the demon legion,\nand granting the Devlins an \
    even stronger power of darkness."
set key[id=831174302003580] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000356$</font>, defeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100007[gender:0]$</font>, \nand destroy the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Soul \
    Stones</font> it uses to awaken spirits in the darkness.\nWhen you've finished, please report back to \
    $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ in $map:02000076$."
set key[id=831174302003581] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000356$</font>, defeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100007[gender:0]$</font>, \nand destroy the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Soul \
    Stones</font> it uses to awaken spirits in the darkness.\nWhen you've finished, please report back to \
    $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ in $map:02000076$."
set key[id=831174302003582] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nI heard the news from $npc:11000007[gender:1]$.\nYou went \
    to $map:02000356$ to destroy the Shadow Soul Stones... How did it go?"
set key[id=831174302003583] name "(Say I destroyed the Shadow Soul Stones.)"
set key[id=831174302003584] name "Ah... That's a great relief.\nWithout you, $MyPCName$, we'd never have broken \
    the Devlins' momentum."
set key[id=831174302003585] name "Through the Devlins, I feel we've gotten a little closer to the true nature of \
    the Shadow Legion,\nwhich was so unclear until now.\nBut... the Devlins may be nothing more than the tail of \
    the Shadow Legion.\nWe have to uncover the Shadow Legion's body, and even its leader."
set key[id=831174302003586] name "Until then, not only our Green Hood but all the Guardians and heroes across \
    Maple World\nwill have to join forces.\nWith a greater enemy before us, what we need most now is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">trust in one another</font>. "
set key[id=831174302003587] name "Sorry to trouble you, but please go back to $map:02000146$ and\ndeliver my words \
    to $npc:11000007[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302003588] name "Sorry to trouble you, but please go back to $map:02000146$ and\ndeliver my words \
    to $npc:11000007[gender:1]$."
set key[id=831174302003589] name "Did you see $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=831174302003590] name "(Pass on $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$'s message.)"
set key[id=831174302003591] name "Yes, understood. I'll pass the message on to the allied forces gathered here \
    too.\nAs $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$ says... the real start begins now."
set key[id=831174302003639] name "Ah! $MyPCName$!\nI think $npcTitle:11000119[gender:0]$ is looking for you \
    urgently. Hurry over."
set key[id=831174302003640] name "I think $npcTitle:11000119[gender:0]$ is looking for you urgently. Hurry over."
set key[id=831174302003641] name "Ah! Welcome.\nI was just waiting for you to come!"
set key[id=831174302003642] name "I'm sure you know already, but all across Maple World, not only the Guardian \
    Alliance but also\nthe leaders of each region, civic groups, and residents are doing their best in their own \
    places\nto protect this world."
set key[id=831174302003643] name "And when there's a problem they can't solve on their own or they need the \
    Guardians' help,\nthey send a request for support, like now."
set key[id=831174302003644] name "(Ask who made the request for support.)"
set key[id=831174302003645] name "That's $npc:11000031[gender:0]$, the leader of $map:02000023$.\nThey've been \
    keeping the forest of $map:02000023$ from being covered by the Demon King's shadow.\nBut... it seems some \
    trouble has come up recently. "
set key[id=831174302003646] name "You'll learn the details once you meet $npcTitle:11000031[gender:0]$...\nI'd \
    like you to go and help them. What do you say?\nCan you do it?"
set key[id=831174302003647] name "The energy of the $map:02000023$ forest seems off.\nYou'll learn the details \
    once you meet $npcTitle:11000031[gender:0]$...\nFor now, go to $map:02000023$."
set key[id=831174302003648] name "Oh, $MyPCName$!\nDid you help $npc:11000031[gender:0]$ out?"
set key[id=831174302003649] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003650] name "I knew I could trust you with anything.\nGood work!"
set key[id=831174302003651] name "Sorry to keep handing you missions with no time to rest, but...\nthere's \
    something in $map:02000076$ waiting for your help, too.\nGo to $map:02000076$ and meet \
    $npc:11000001[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302003652] name "There's something in $map:02000076$ waiting for your help, too.\nGo to \
    $map:02000076$ and meet $npc:11000001[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302003653] name "Oh, $MyPCName$! Well done.\nYour efforts will surely be rewarded someday!"
set key[id=831174302003654] name "Hmm... $MyPCName$!\nThis time, go to $map:02000062$ and meet the Adventurers' \
    Association president, $npc:11000019[gender:0]$.\nThey say some wreckage, believed to be from a ship that sank \
    on its way from $map:63000001$ to $map:02000062$,\nwas found in $map:02000063$."
set key[id=831174302003655] name "It seems the Adventurers' Association has sent its own survey team to \
    investigate.\nGo check on the situation and see if there's anything you can help with."
set key[id=831174302003656] name "They say some wreckage, believed to be from a ship that sank on its way from \
    $map:63000001$ to $map:02000062$,\nwas found in $map:02000063$.\nGo to $map:02000062$ and meet the \
    Adventurers' Association president, $npc:11000019[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302003657] name "Ah, you're back.\nHow are things on the coast?"
set key[id=831174302003658] name "I report the situation."
set key[id=831174302003659] name "What?! \nYou found where the <font color=\"#ffd200\">missing Victoria</font> \
    sank?\nSo we might finally uncover the truth behind the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Victoria's \
    disappearance</font>,\nwhich I thought would remain an unsolvable mystery forever... "
set key[id=831174302003660] name "I'll have to support the Guardsmen so they can join the coastal survey \
    team.\nWell done! $MyPCName$."
set key[id=831174302003661] name "$MyPCName$!\nThere's one more thing I need you to do."
set key[id=831174302003662] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Center</font> sent researchers to \
    investigate why time has stopped in parts of northern Ludibrium,\nbut it seems they've run into trouble.\nGo \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000142$</font>, meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000869[gender:0]$</font>,\nand support their research."
set key[id=831174302003663] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Time Center</font> sent researchers to \
    investigate why time has stopped in parts of northern Ludibrium,\nbut it seems they've run into trouble.\nGo \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000142$</font>, meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000869[gender:0]$</font>,\nand support their research."
set key[id=831174302003664] name "Did you help out with the time engineers' research?\nWas there any problem?"
set key[id=831174302003665] name "(Report on the situation at the clock tower.)"
set key[id=831174302003666] name "A creature called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000077$</font> was in the clock \
    tower's basement?\nIs that why the clock tower's clock stopped... and time froze in the surrounding area?\nIs \
    it because of that thing?"
set key[id=831174302003667] name "(Say I couldn't pin down the exact cause.)"
set key[id=831174302003668] name "Could something have happened to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Red Lapenta of \
    Time</font>...? \nI'm worried... "
set key[id=831174302003669] name "Anyway, thank you for running around here and there so hard.\nAs a token of my \
    wish that you keep protecting this world, I'll give you a special gift!"
set key[id=831174302003670] name "Congratulations on taking <font color=\"#ffd200\">one more step toward becoming \
    a true hero</font> of Maple World!"
set key[id=831174302003671] name "Hmm... Even with everyone pushing so hard... \nthe darkness in the forest is \
    growing deeper day by day."
set key[id=831174302003672] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000314$</font> that protect and purify our \
    $map:02000023$ forest are fading away, so\nthe power of darkness keeps growing stronger.\nWe have to take back \
    the vanished <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000314$</font> and restore the light of the forest.\nWill you \
    help?"
set key[id=831174302003673] name "(Ask how to get the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000314$</font> back.)"
set key[id=831174302003674] name "There are giant beasts that threaten the fairies and trample the forest.\nThings \
    like <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000035$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000017$</font>, and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000047$</font>.\nThose things\nhave been absorbing the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000314$</font> indiscriminately."
set key[id=831174302003675] name "When you wander the $map:02000023$ forest and run into them, don't back down. \
    Fight!\nThe moment their spirits leave them, you'll be able to get the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000314$</font>\nthey were holding!\n"
set key[id=831174302003676] name "When you wander the $map:02000023$ forest and run into things like <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000035$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000017$</font>, \n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000047$</font>, don't back down. Fight!\nThe moment their spirits leave them, you'll \
    be able to get the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000314$</font>\nthey were holding!\n"
set key[id=831174302003677] name "Ah, you're here?"
set key[id=831174302003678] name "(Hand over the $item:30000314$.)"
set key[id=831174302003679] name "Oh! That must have been hard work.\nThank you."
set key[id=831174302003680] name "Say, $MyPCName$.\nNow that we've recovered the $item:30000314$, it's time to \
    light up the forest.\nThere's a place in the $map:02000023$ forest filled with the darkest, most wicked \
    energy.\nThat's... $map:02000315$! "
set key[id=831174302003681] name "The darkness there is so strong that fairies quickly lose their strength and \
    their senses.\nOnly brave ones like you can light up $map:02000315$ brightly.\nCan you help once again?"
set key[id=831174302003682] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=831174302003683] name "Thank you for agreeing so readily again.\nNow, this is $item:30000315$, made by \
    condensing the $item:30000314$ you gathered earlier.\nTake it to $map:02000315$ and sprinkle it on the \
    lifeless trees,\nand you'll be able to restore the forest's light."
set key[id=831174302003684] name "I'm counting on you again this time.\nPlease be careful out there."
set key[id=831174302003685] name "Why have you come back? Did something happen?"
set key[id=831174302003686] name "(Say I lost the $item:30000315$.)"
set key[id=831174302003687] name "(Say I came to say goodbye before heading to $map:02000206$.)"
set key[id=831174302003688] name "Oh dear... Something so precious... Tsk tsk tsk... You should've kept it \
    safe.\nI happen to have a spare, so I'll give you another... but this time, really keep it safe."
set key[id=831174302003689] name "Really? Did you search every nook and cranny of your bag?\nTake another look."
set key[id=831174302003690] name "Hmm... It seems your bag is full of clutter.\nTidy it up first."
set key[id=831174302003691] name "Ah... I see.\nI'll say it again, please be careful not to get hurt."
set key[id=831174302003692] name "Oh, you made it back safely!\nThanks to you, the darkness covering the forest \
    has weakened a lot. Thank you so much!"
set key[id=831174302003693] name "Hmm... I can't just sit around like this...\nIf we leave it,\nall of \
    $map:02000076$ might turn into a barren land where not a blade of grass grows... "
set key[id=831174302003694] name "(Ask what they're worried about.)"
set key[id=831174302003695] name "As you know, our $map:02000076$ is one of the most vibrant and fertile lands in \
    Maple World.\nThat's all because of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000316$</font> that protect and \
    purify\nthis green land of meadows."
set key[id=831174302003696] name "But... lately the beasts of the meadow have been sucking up the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000316$</font> indiscriminately\nand using their power to trample this world \
    instead.\nBecause of that, the once lively land is growing barren and desolate."
set key[id=831174302003697] name "Before all of $map:02000076$ is ruined, we have to take back the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000316$</font>\nfrom the beasts!\nCan you help us?"
set key[id=831174302003698] name "I'll help."
set key[id=831174302003699] name "Thank you.\nAccording to the vigilantes' investigation, the beasts that have \
    absorbed the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000316$</font> so far\nare the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000322[gender:0]$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000001$</font>, and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000024$</font>.\nIf you meet them, be sure to take back the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000316$</font>! "
set key[id=831174302003700] name "According to the vigilantes' investigation, the beasts that have absorbed the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000316$</font> so far\nare the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000322[gender:0]$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000001$</font>, and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000024$</font>.\nIf you meet them, be sure to take back the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000316$</font>! "
set key[id=831174302003701] name "Oh, you got the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000316$</font> back.\nYou worked \
    so hard!!"
set key[id=831174302003702] name "Hmm... Getting back the $item:30000316$ doesn't mean everything is\nperfectly \
    solved.\nUnless the Shadow World is completely sealed and all the shadow energy disappears... \nbeasts \
    threatening this world will keep appearing... "
set key[id=831174302003703] name "The best fundamental solution we can manage now is... removing the evil \
    energy\nfrom the beasts conceived from it.\nAmong them... the Griffins, ancestors of the Vayar Mountains \
    who've now turned into beasts...\nif they're restored to their true selves with purified life force before \
    evil taints them,\nthey might even gain the power to protect this world."
set key[id=831174302003704] name "Somewhere near <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000009$</font> in the northwest of \
    $map:02000076$, there should be a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000316$</font>.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Cover the eggs hatching inside the $map:02000316$ with this $item:30000317$</font>.\nThe \
    $item:30000317$ infused with $item:30000316$ will warmly cradle the eggs so the young Griffins\ncan come into \
    the world in their true, sacred form. "
set key[id=831174302003705] name "Why have you come back? Did something happen?"
set key[id=831174302003706] name "(Say I lost the $item:30000317$.)"
set key[id=831174302003707] name "(Say I came to say goodbye before heading to $map:02000177$.)"
set key[id=831174302003708] name "Oh dear... Something so precious... Tsk tsk tsk... You should've kept it \
    safe.\nI happen to have a spare, so I'll give you another... but this time, really keep it safe."
set key[id=831174302003709] name "Really? Did you search every nook and cranny of your bag?\nTake another look."
set key[id=831174302003710] name "Hmm... It seems your bag is full of clutter.\nTidy it up first."
set key[id=831174302003711] name "Ah... I see.\nI'll say it again, please be careful not to get hurt."
set key[id=831174302003712] name "You're back?\nSo, were the young Griffins... born in their sacred original \
    form?"
set key[id=831174302003713] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003714] name "That's a relief, a real relief. Even if only bit by bit, we have to restore this \
    world\nto what it once was... Anyway, thank you for all your hard work!"
set key[id=831174302003715] name "Oh, welcome!\nI feel like you've been here before... What brings you here this \
    time?"
set key[id=831174302003716] name "(Say I came on $npc:11000119[gender:0]$'s orders.)"
set key[id=831174302003717] name "Ah... I see!\nI was just told that the $map:02000068$ survey team is having a \
    hard time because\nghost \npirates have taken over $map:02000063$ and $map:02000067$."
set key[id=831174302003718] name "Those pirates have $item:30000318$ with unidentifiable codes written on \
    them,\nand they seem to be clues connected to\nthe ships that suddenly vanished at sea."
set key[id=831174302003719] name "I'd like you to help <font color=\"#ffd200\">wipe out the pirates in \
    $map:02000063$ and $map:02000067$</font>\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">collect the \
    $item:30000318$</font>.\n$map:02000063$ and $map:02000067$ aren't close to here,\nbut you can get there \
    quickly through <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000183$</font>."
set key[id=831174302003720] name "While you're on the $map:02000068$ mission, you can use the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Marcos</font>.\nRight now it's <font color=\"#ffd200\">sailing back and forth between \
    $map:02000062$ and $map:02000183$</font>.\nIf you find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000981[gender:0]$</font> \
    at the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000062$ dock</font>, you can\nboard the ship!\n"
set key[id=831174302003721] name "I'd like you to help <font color=\"#ffd200\">wipe out the pirates in \
    $map:02000063$ and $map:02000067$</font>\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">collect the $item:30000318$</font>.\nIf \
    you meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000981[gender:0]$</font> at the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000062$ \
    dock</font>, you can ride the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Marcos</font> <font color=\"#ffd200\">to \
    $map:02000183$</font>, so use it to get around easily."
set key[id=831174302003722] name "Hm? What did you just say?\nSorry, I was lost in thought for a moment... "
set key[id=831174302003723] name "(Say I collected the $item:30000318$ at $npc:11000019[gender:0]$'s request.)"
set key[id=831174302003724] name "Ah, I was just looking over the $item:30000318$ I've gathered so far...\nI've \
    been racking my brain because the code hidden inside almost seems solvable, but isn't."
set key[id=831174302003725] name "Maybe if I look at what you brought, $MyPCName$, together with these, I might \
    find something...\nI'll examine them further. Thank you."
set key[id=831174302003726] name "Ah...!! This is... "
set key[id=831174302003727] name "I ask what's wrong."
set key[id=831174302003728] name "I found it!\nThe meaning of the code hidden in the $item:30000318$!"
set key[id=831174302003729] name "(Ask what it is.)"
set key[id=831174302003730] name "This is a <font color=\"#ffd200\">message</font> left by <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100015[gender:0]$, the captain of the missing Victoria</font>."
set key[id=831174302003731] name "(Ask how they figured that out.)"
set key[id=831174302003732] name "The captain is like a father to me.\nOften, before setting sail, he would leave \
    me a puzzle code, and when he came back\nhe'd ask if I'd solved it.\nThese $item:30000318$ are combinations of \
    the code only the captain uses. I'm sure of it!"
set key[id=831174302003733] name "(Ask what the code means.)"
set key[id=831174302003734] name "It's a method where you split combined words apart to build the \
    meaning.\nReading the meanings... \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Disassemble</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">lantern</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">record</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">treasure \
    chest</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">device</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">anglerfish</font>... That's all \
    there is."
set key[id=831174302003735] name "Hmm... If I combine the words whose meanings connect...\nDisassembly device? Is \
    there some machine that takes things apart...?\nTreasure chest record? Could there be a treasure \
    map...?\nLantern... anglerfish...? Lantern anglerfish?"
set key[id=831174302003736] name "A lantern anglerfish... I heard something about that from old \
    $npc:11000021[gender:0]$.\nWhen they were held hostage by the ghost pirates... the leader's form...\nlooked \
    like a giant anglerfish with a lantern on its head...\nCome to think of it, they say that thing calls itself \
    $npc:23100015[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831174302003737] name "Ah...! Treasure chests! That's right. Old $npc:11000021[gender:0]$ said the \
    pirates' treasure chests are scattered\nall around inside the pirates' fortress.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Lantern anglerfish</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">treasure chest</font>, and... <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">disassemble</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">record</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">device</font>... \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Recording device</font>...!!!"
set key[id=831174302003738] name "Maybe it means the captain hid a recording device that could serve as a \
    clue\ninside a treasure chest in the pirates' fortress...!!\n$MyPCName$! Please help me!"
set key[id=831174302003739] name "Could you <font color=\"#ffd200\">sneak into the pirates' fortress</font> and \
    look for\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">any device or clue the Victoria's captain might have left in a treasure \
    chest</font>? "
set key[id=831174302003740] name "$MyPCName$! Please help me!\nCould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">sneak into the \
    pirates' fortress</font> and look for\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">any device or clue the Victoria's captain might \
    have left in a treasure chest</font>? "
set key[id=831174302003741] name "I knew it...!! So I did solve the code correctly!\nThe Victoria's voyage \
    recorder... The captain must have hidden it from the pirates...\nHe must have thought the cause of the \
    Victoria's vanishing without a trace\nhad to come to light."
set key[id=831174302003742] name "If I reassemble this disassembled recorder, something should come out of \
    it.\nI'll make sure the captain's earnest wish isn't in vain."
set key[id=831174302003743] name "Hmm... The last course coordinates left in the voyage recorder are... um... \
    \nnot far from here.\nIf a ship as big as the Victoria had sunk in a strait nearby, there should surely be \
    traces...\nbut we haven't found anything so far... "
set key[id=831174302003744] name "There must be something\nwe haven't discovered yet somewhere deep in that \
    sea.\nIf we find out what it is... we might solve the secret of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Victoria \
    disappearance case</font>."
set key[id=831174302003745] name "$MyPCName$!\nCould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">go back to $map:02000068$ and \
    report the situation to $npc:11000019[gender:0]$</font>\nand ask them to prepare a coastal survey team?\nIf \
    you ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000982[gender:0]$</font> at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000183$</font> to launch a <font color=\"#ffd200\">ship bound for \
    $map:02000062$</font>,\nyou can get there fast."
set key[id=831174302003746] name "Could you <font color=\"#ffd200\">go back to $map:02000068$ and report the \
    situation to $npc:11000019[gender:0]$</font>\nand ask them to prepare a coastal survey team?\nIf you ask <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000982[gender:0]$</font> at <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000183$</font> to launch a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">ship bound for $map:02000062$</font>,\nyou can get there fast."
set key[id=831174302003747] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!!\nAre you coming from $map:02000067$? How are things there?"
set key[id=831174302003748] name "(Pass on $npc:11000995[gender:0]$'s message.)"
set key[id=831174302003749] name "Is that true? I'll put together a coastal survey team and send it out right \
    now!\nYou go to $map:02000001$ and report to $npcTitle:11000119[gender:0]$, too!"
set key[id=831174302003750] name "Hmm... This is bad."
set key[id=831174302003751] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174302003752] name "Sigh... Our researcher went into the clock tower to fix that stopped clock a \
    long time ago,\nbut there's no word, and the clock still isn't moving... "
set key[id=831174302003753] name "Could you go into $map:02000357$, find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">stopped \
    gear</font>,\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">repair</font> it?"
set key[id=831174302003754] name "Could you go into $map:02000357$, find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">stopped \
    gear</font>,\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">repair</font> it?"
set key[id=831174302003755] name "What, why are you just coming back like this?\nDid you not manage to fix the \
    gear? The clock tower's clock is still stopped... "
set key[id=831174302003756] name "(Say I repaired all the gears.)"
set key[id=831174302003757] name "What... So it wasn't the gears' problem, either... \nBy the way... did you \
    happen to see $npcName:11000871[gender:0]$ in there?"
set key[id=831174302003758] name "(Tell about the sighting of $npc:23100077$ instead of \
    $npcName:11000871[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=831174302003759] name "An unidentified creature shaped like a clock...?\nUgh... Then... is that why \
    $npcName:11000871[gender:0]$ disappeared... \nand the clock tower's clock stopped, all because of that \
    thing... "
set key[id=831174302003760] name "This... I never expected this... Could something be wrong with the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Red Lapenta</font>...\nAhh~ No, that can't be. It can't be... It shouldn't be... Hmm...  "
set key[id=831174302003782] name "You there, did you know there's an entrance to $map:02000321$ down that way?"
set key[id=831174302003783] name "(Say I do.)"
set key[id=831174302003784] name "Oho? Is that so?\nSo you've already taken a stroll around this town!\nThen you \
    must know that $npc:23100006[gender:0]$ is inside $map:02000321$, too?"
set key[id=831174302003785] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003786] name "Hmm? What a lukewarm reaction...\nA young one who knows that ought to go see it \
    with their own eyes, hear it with their own ears,\nand feel it with their own body! What are you doing \
    standing around blankly?"
set key[id=831174302003787] name "If I were as young as you, mind you,\nI'd head to $map:02000321$ right now and \
    come out after knocking\n$npc:23100006[gender:0]$ flat dozens of times.\nUnless you're scared, go and face \
    $npc:23100006[gender:0]$ boldly yourself!"
set key[id=831174302003788] name "If I were as young as you, mind you,\nI'd head to $map:02000321$ right now and \
    come out after knocking\n$npc:23100006[gender:0]$ flat dozens of times.\nUnless you're scared, go and face \
    $npc:23100006[gender:0]$ boldly yourself!"
set key[id=831174302003789] name "Hahahaha!!\nFrom that triumphant look in your eyes, you've clearly come back \
    knowing everything about $npc:23100006[gender:0]$!"
set key[id=831174302003790] name "Once you can say you've knocked $npc:23100006[gender:0]$ flat dozens of times, \
    everyone, wherever you go,\nwill look at you with admiring eyes."
set key[id=831174302003791] name "Hm? You don't seem to believe me? Hmm... Let me have it confirmed right \
    away!\nThere's an adventurer named $npc:11001064[gender:0]$ down there, sent from the Adventurers' \
    Association.\nGo to that fellow and tell what you went through inside $map:02000191$.\nThe way they look at \
    you will change at once, I tell you."
set key[id=831174302003792] name "There's an adventurer named $npc:11001064[gender:0]$ down there, sent from the \
    Adventurers' Association.\nGo to that fellow and tell what you went through inside $map:02000321$.\nThe way \
    they look at you will change at once, I tell you."
set key[id=831174302003793] name "Hm? You have something to say?\nI'm in the middle of a secret mission and \
    extremely busy... but I'll hear you out.\nWhat is it?"
set key[id=831174302003794] name "(Boast about my adventure facing $npc:23100006[gender:0]$ in $map:02000321$.)"
set key[id=831174302003795] name "Pwahahahaha. You expect me to believe that?\nWho would believe someone who just \
    talks without any proof?"
set key[id=831174302003796] name "People who've beaten $npc:23100006[gender:0]$ a hundred times over would \
    answer\nthe questions I'm about to ask without any trouble... \nbut I wonder whether you can."
set key[id=831174302003797] name "Just from what you've said, I get the feeling you still don't know much about \
    $npc:23100006[gender:0]$.\nHeh. Go on more adventures until you're confident about any question on \
    $npc:23100006[gender:0]$,\nthen come back and brag."
set key[id=831174302003798] name "Just from what you've said, I get the feeling you still don't know much about \
    $npc:23100006[gender:0]$.\nHeh. Go on more adventures until you're confident about any question on \
    $npc:23100006[gender:0]$,\nthen come back and brag."
set key[id=831174302003799] name "Hm? Oh~ So now you're really confident about $npc:23100006[gender:0]$?\nAll \
    right! Then go ahead and prove it~!"
set key[id=831174302003800] name "Got it."
set key[id=831174302003801] name "How does $npc:23100006[gender:0]$ get around the Ice Cave?"
set key[id=831174302003802] name "It flies around."
set key[id=831174302003803] name "It runs around."
set key[id=831174302003804] name "It leaps high, like flying."
set key[id=831174302003805] name "No, no. Wrong.\nI'll give you one more chance. Think carefully.\nI don't want to \
    think of you as a liar and a braggart, after all."
set key[id=831174302003806] name "Could you ask me again?"
set key[id=831174302003807] name "Oh~ Well... it's the first question, so I'll let that one pass.\nNext... does \
    $npc:23100006[gender:0]$ have a spine? Or not?"
set key[id=831174302003808] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174302003809] name "(Say no.)"
set key[id=831174302003810] name "No, no. Wrong.\nI'll give you one more chance. Think carefully.\nI don't want to \
    think of you as a liar and a braggart, after all."
set key[id=831174302003811] name "Could you ask me again?"
set key[id=831174302003812] name "Oh! Did you see it? You really saw it?\nWhen you look from behind \
    $npc:23100006[gender:0]$, the inside of its body is hollow between the pieces of stone.\nOutside it's a hard \
    heap of rock... but inside it's\nfilled with the brilliant energy of $item:30000056$... "
set key[id=831174302003813] name "Well... if you saw even that, there's nothing left to ask.\nI accept it!! I'll \
    acknowledge you as a heroic adventurer who knows no fear before a new adventure!"
set key[id=831175903000020] name "Madel... coming here brings back memories of you.\nBut oh dear... I just <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">can't</font> find it!"
set key[id=831175903000021] name "What are you looking for?"
set key[id=831175903000022] name "Hm? A young person like you talking to an old man like me,\nhow kind of you!"
set key[id=831175903000023] name "Madel is the name of my wife, who has passed on...\nWe made so many memories \
    here at the Cherry Blossom Park!"
set key[id=831175903000024] name "I wanted to come see this place again, but would you believe it,\nthe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">time capsule</font> we buried together is nowhere to be found no matter how I look."
set key[id=831175903000025] name "I'm sure I buried it <font color=\"#ffd200\">under a flower in that Cherry \
    Blossom Park</font>!\nCould you go and check again for me?"
set key[id=831175903000026] name "There's a big cherry blossom tree in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000147$</font>.\nI'm sure I buried the <font color=\"#ffd200\">time capsule</font> \
    somewhere around it!\nPlease... that <font color=\"#ffd200\">time capsule</font> is truly precious to me."
set key[id=831175903000027] name "Hey! What do you think you're doing here!"
set key[id=831175903000028] name "This is the park I look after! I'm already stressed out because of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000055$</font>,\nand you can't go damaging the flowers!"
set key[id=831175903000029] name "What's stressing you out?"
set key[id=831175903000030] name "Ugh... lately the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000055$</font> keep digging up \
    the park.\nThey <font color=\"#ffd200\">run up the trees</font> to escape, so they're hard to catch!"
set key[id=831175903000031] name "You've been caught damaging the park! Before you go, take care of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000055$ up\nin the trees</font>!"
set key[id=831175903000032] name "Climb up that big cherry blossom tree behind me!\nThe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000055$</font> are probably up there!"
set key[id=831175903000033] name "Oh! Seeing this again feels like Madel has come back into my arms!\nThank you so \
    much. I'll keep it safe at home from now on."
set key[id=831175903000034] name "Woof! Woof! Big trouble! Woof!"
set key[id=831175903000035] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903000036] name "My friends! Woof! They're <font color=\"#ffd200\">buried under meteorite \
    fragments, woof!</font>\nPlease save my friends near that meteorite, woof!"
set key[id=831175903000037] name "Woof! Just clear away the <font color=\"#ffd200\">meteorite pieces</font> lying \
    around here! Woof!\nMy friends are buried under them, woof!"
set key[id=831175903000038] name "Thank you, woof!\nI'll repay this kindness someday, woof!"
set key[id=831175903000168] name "Oh my, this looks pretty serious..."
set key[id=831175903000169] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903000170] name "This foolish boy was <font color=\"#ffd200\">messing around</font> on the cable \
    car and\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">fell</font>, and got badly hurt."
set key[id=831175903000171] name "The wounds are severe...\nEven I, a doctor, can't do anything about it!"
set key[id=831175903000172] name "Could you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000134$</font> and bring me some \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000057$</font> from Goldus Pharmaceuticals?"
set key[id=831175903000173] name "It's lucky that I, the doctor, found this boy...\nHurry to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000134$</font> and bring me some of Goldus Pharmaceuticals' <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000057$</font>!"
set key[id=831175903000174] name "Thank you!\nNow I can treat this foolish boy!"
set key[id=831175903000175] name "Why is there so much trash! Ugh, so annoying!"
set key[id=831175903000176] name "Why are you annoyed?"
set key[id=831175903000177] name "Hm? Oh, hello, $MyPCName$! Let me ask you <font color=\"#ffd200\">one \
    question</font>.\nWhy do you visit the forest, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=831175903000178] name "Right! To enjoy beautiful nature, isn't it?\nThen <font color=\"#ffd200\">one \
    more question</font>!\nIs it okay to leave trash in the forest, or not?"
set key[id=831175903000179] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Of course not!</font> But it looks like people have left \
    fruit they didn't finish\nlying around all over the forest!\nI can't stand this forest getting messy!"
set key[id=831175903000180] name "$MyPCName$! Please hurry and clean up the messy forest!\nYou're not thinking of \
    skipping it because you didn't make the mess...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">surely</font>... not?"
set key[id=831175903000181] name "What are you doing! Hurry and clean up the discarded <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fruit baskets</font>!\nThey must be rolling around <font color=\"#ffd200\">right below \
    here</font>!"
set key[id=831175903000182] name "That took a while. Did you finish cleaning?"
set key[id=831175903000183] name "(Tell her about the Wargogs.)"
set key[id=831175903000184] name "Really?? <font color=\"#ffd200\">Traps set by the Wargogs</font>??\nI'm sorry, \
    $MyPCName$... I had no idea.."
set key[id=831175903000210] name "Ugh... I can't make a living like this... "
set key[id=831175903000211] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903000212] name "See that big tree growing above the portal to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000116$</font>?\nA strong wind suddenly blew and the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">balloons</font> I was selling all\nflew up there, whoosh!"
set key[id=831175903000213] name "I'm too old to even think about climbing up to get them,\nso all I can do is \
    stamp my feet here... "
set key[id=831175903000214] name "Could you fetch my balloons for me?\nI recommend using the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$skill:20000011$</font> skill!\n"
set key[id=831175903000215] name "Use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$skill:20000011$</font> skill to\nclimb up the \
    tree behind me!"
set key[id=831175903000216] name "Once you're up the tree, you'll see my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">balloons</font>.\nPlease!"
set key[id=831175903000217] name "Thank you! The biggest problem is solved for now!"
set key[id=831175903000225] name "Hey $MyPCName$, are you heading to $map:02000116$ by any chance?\nThen could you \
    take this lunch box to my uncle on the way?"
set key[id=831175903000226] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903000227] name "My uncle is a royal porter and went into <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000116$</font> carrying goods for the Levee,\nbut he left his lunch box behind."
set key[id=831175903000228] name "Since the earthquake, going to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> \
    means going through <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000116$</font>,\nand... I was too scared to follow him..."
set key[id=831175903000229] name "The road is rough, and being hungry would make it even harder.\nPlease!"
set key[id=831175903000230] name "Why did you come back? Are you scared too, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=831175903000231] name "I lost the $item:30000129$."
set key[id=831175903000232] name "Never mind."
set key[id=831175903000233] name "Of all things to lose... Here, I made another one for myself to eat!"
set key[id=831175903000234] name "You have it?\nDon't tell me... you're lying because you want one too?"
set key[id=831175903000235] name "Your bag is full. Go empty some space."
set key[id=831175903000236] name "Ugh... I really can't go to $map:02000116$."
set key[id=831175903000237] name "Oh, my nephew sent a lunch box...?"
set key[id=831175903000238] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831175903000239] name "That kid... he ran away saying he was scared of entering the Silent Forest,\nbut \
    I guess it was weighing on his mind."
set key[id=831175903000398] name "Um... $MyPCName$!\nMay I ask you for one more favor?"
set key[id=831175903000399] name "What is it this time?"
set key[id=831175903000400] name "In the Book of Shadow Tactics, there's a record...\nthat if \
    $npc:23100025[gender:0]$ loses $item:30000190$,\nthe shadow of chaos will fade, it says."
set key[id=831175903000401] name "If that's true... just supposing... \nif I brought $item:30000190$ to \
    $npcTitle:11000119[gender:0]$,\nI could completely... make up for\nmy mistake of failing to guard the \
    armory... I think. "
set key[id=831175903000402] name "Would you do me this life-saving favor, $MyPCName$...\ngo to $map:02000315$ and \
    take $item:30000190$\nfrom $npc:23100025[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831175903000403] name "If you go to $map:02000315$, take $item:30000190$ from $npc:23100025[gender:0]$ \
    and\nbring it to me... I'll never forget this kindness as long as I live!"
set key[id=831175903000404] name "$MyPCName$! You're back.\nAbout what I asked... how did it... "
set key[id=831175903000405] name "(Hand over $item:30000190$.)"
set key[id=831175903000406] name "Ah... thank you so much.\nFrom the armory robbery until now, I've done nothing \
    but rely on your help, $MyPCName$,\nso I'm ashamed.\nSomeday I'll surely repay this debt."
set key[id=831175903000407] name "Now I must hurry and bring $item:30000190$\nto the Captain of the Royal Guard... \
    Ah!!!\nBy any chance, did you find any trace of the Red Cape in $map:02000315$?"
set key[id=831175903000408] name "No, I didn't."
set key[id=831175903000409] name "Ah... I see... They definitely said they went to $map:02000315$...\nWhere could \
    they have disappeared to in the meantime...?  "
set key[id=831175903000434] name "When will the drought here in Perion ever end... "
set key[id=831175903000435] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903000436] name "The Perion area here is always short of water.\nIt rains only a little, so \
    growing crops is\nextremely hard... "
set key[id=831175903000437] name "I can't just stand by any longer, so I've set up totems\nall over <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000049$</font>."
set key[id=831175903000438] name "But lately, groups of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000333$</font> have been \
    showing up around the totems\nand disrupting the villagers' rain rituals. "
set key[id=831175903000439] name "$MyPCName$, if you find a <font color=\"#ffd200\">totem</font> around <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000049$</font>,\ndon't just pass it by.\nPlease be sure to hold a rain ritual."
set key[id=831175903000440] name "$MyPCName$, you should be able to defeat the interfering <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000333$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000332$</font>\neasily."
set key[id=831175903000441] name "It hasn't rained yet, so nobody must have prayed at the totem.\n$MyPCName$, \
    please be sure to pray at the totem\nin the green area of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000049$</font>."
set key[id=831175903000442] name "Thank you.\nI hope farming becomes possible in this area, even if only like \
    this."
set key[id=831175903000443] name "Finally released! The cutting-edge teleportation machine, TELI!"
set key[id=831175903000444] name "(Keep reading.)"
set key[id=831175903000445] name "Tired of going out to shop right in front of your house?\nToo lazy to go to the \
    hospital when you're sick?"
set key[id=831175903000446] name "Don't worry!\nThe cutting-edge teleportation machine TELI has finally been \
    released!"
set key[id=831175903000447] name "Nothing like part of your body not teleporting\nwill ever happen!"
set key[id=831175903000448] name "Use TELI_A right now!"
set key[id=831175903000449] name "Use TELI_A right now!"
set key[id=831175903000450] name "How was it? TELI, truly trustworthy!"
set key[id=831175903000451] name "Do you trust TELI's performance now?"
set key[id=831175903000452] name "(Keep reading.)"
set key[id=831175903000453] name "Now it's time to go back home!"
set key[id=831175903000454] name "Since TELI makes it easy to get out of the house,\nyou should be able to get \
    back home easily too, right?"
set key[id=831175903000455] name "We'll send you home right away!\nUse TELI_B right now!"
set key[id=831175903000456] name "We'll send you home right away~\nUse TELI_B right now!"
set key[id=831175903000457] name "Beep- Data error. Resetting TELI_TRAP..."
set key[id=831175903000458] name "Hmm... where did it go wrong..."
set key[id=831175903000459] name "What's the problem?"
set key[id=831175903000460] name "Hm? Hello there. I'm the chief researcher of this lab."
set key[id=831175903000461] name "As you've probably seen, the lava that was supposed to flow into the \
    generator\nhas all hardened."
set key[id=831175903000462] name "If you look around here, you'll see a lava path.\nFollow the lava path and find \
    out\nwhy the lava flow stopped, would you?"
set key[id=831175903000463] name "If you look at the ground, you'll see a hardened lava path.\nFollow it and you \
    should find where it's blocked, no?"
set key[id=831175903000464] name "So the path was blocked partway, as I thought...\nThank you! Thanks to you, the \
    generator is running well!"
set key[id=831175903000524] name "Sigh... what on earth is going on... "
set key[id=831175903000525] name "(Greet him cheerfully.)"
set key[id=831175903000526] name "Huh? Who's this?\nIs that $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=831175903000527] name "How have you been?"
set key[id=831175903000528] name "Doing fine.\nBut... something has come up that's bothering me a lot."
set key[id=831175903000529] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903000530] name "Remember my girlfriend, $npc:11000106[gender:1]$?\nShe hasn't been in touch at \
    all lately..."
set key[id=831175903000531] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">'What are you up to.'</font>\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">'Why.'</font>\nShe was a girlfriend who at least sent me texts like these regularly... "
set key[id=831175903000532] name "Do you know I can't even sleep well lately?\nI can't go on like this!"
set key[id=831175903000533] name "$MyPCName$! Go right now to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000162</font>$ \
    and\nget <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000035$</font> from the monsters!"
set key[id=831175903000534] name "With that I'll get into $npc:11000106[gender:1]$'s <font color=\"#ffd200\">text \
    message log</font>\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">hack it!</font>"
set key[id=831175903000535] name "Once you've collected <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000035$</font>, bring them \
    to Dr. <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000594[gender:0]$</font> there,\nand he'll tell you what to do!"
set key[id=831175903000536] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000162$</font> and\nget <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000035$</font> from the monsters, then\nbring it to Dr. <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000594[gender:0]$</font>!"
set key[id=831175903000537] name "Hm? Isn't this <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000035$</font>?\nWhy did you \
    bring this?"
set key[id=831175903000538] name "So, what exactly are you planning to do\nwith <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000035$</font>?"
set key[id=831175903000539] name "(Explain $npc:11000664[gender:0]$'s situation.)"
set key[id=831175903000540] name "What...?\nThat guy... he's trying to\nhack the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000666$</font> here!"
set key[id=831175903000541] name "He must have been too scared to do it himself...\nWell, anyway, I understand!"
set key[id=831175903000542] name "I think I can make a hacking program\nout of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000035$</font> you brought!\nJust wait a moment."
set key[id=831175903000545] name "There! Here you go.\nIf you take this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000040$</font> to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000666$</font>, you can try hacking \
    it!"
set key[id=831175903000546] name "Don't do anything silly,\nonly look through the data $npc:11000664[gender:0]$ \
    asked for!"
set key[id=831175903000547] name "I've done all the hard work, so go on and hack the antenna!"
set key[id=831175903000548] name "I lost the $item:30000040$."
set key[id=831175903000549] name "Never mind."
set key[id=831175903000550] name "What, you lost that cutting-edge device? That's too much... Here!\nGood thing I \
    made a spare... "
set key[id=831175903000551] name "Huh? You've got it!\nIt's small and easy to lose, so be careful!"
set key[id=831175903000552] name "Your bag is full!\nWhy don't you empty it a bit first?"
set key[id=831175903000553] name "$npc:11000664[gender:0]$, that hopeless fool... obsession doesn't help in \
    romance... "
set key[id=831175903000554] name "[Antenna Control System ver 1.62]"
set key[id=831175903000555] name "Connect"
set key[id=831175903000556] name "Connect in admin mode"
set key[id=831175903000557] name "Which task would you like to perform?"
set key[id=831175903000558] name "Check system status"
set key[id=831175903000560] name "Data transmitted through this system.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Texts: \
    320,014</font>\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Calls: 5,401 min</font>"
set key[id=831175903000562] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Admin mode</font>\nEnter the password"
set key[id=831175903000564] name "(Use the hacking USB.)"
set key[id=831175903000565] name "The password does not match.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Would you like to enter it \
    again?</font>"
set key[id=831175903000569] name "Beep- beep- beep!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Admin mode connected</font>"
set key[id=831175903000570] name "Which task would you like to perform?"
set key[id=831175903000571] name "Check text message history"
set key[id=831175903000573] name "Enter the <font color=\"#ffd200\">customer name</font> whose message history you \
    want to check."
set key[id=831175903000575] name "Growlie"
set key[id=831175903000576] name "Cecilia"
set key[id=831175903000578] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">(12/13) To Cecilia</font>\nWhat are you doing?"
set key[id=831175903000579] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">(12/15) To Cecilia</font>\nHm?"
set key[id=831175903000580] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">(12/21) To Cecilia</font>\nBabe~ it's so cold today~"
set key[id=831175903000581] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">(12/25) To Cecilia</font>\nYou're not going to ignore me \
    today too, are you?"
set key[id=831175903000582] name "Enter another person"
set key[id=831175903000583] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">(09/11) To Growlie</font>\nNote to self: You're \
    handsome!"
set key[id=831175903000584] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">(09/16) To Growlie</font>\nNote to self: Do your best \
    today too!"
set key[id=831175903000585] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">(10/09) To Growlie</font>\nNote to self: Don't mind what \
    other people say!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Suspenders are my style</font>, after all!"
set key[id=831175903000586] name "Enter another person"
set key[id=831175903000587] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">(10/09) From: Goldus Telecom</font>\nIf you do not pay \
    your telecom fees by next Monday,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">service</font> will be suspended."
set key[id=831175903000588] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">(10/11) From: Goldus Telecom</font>\nIf you do not pay \
    your telecom fees by Monday the day after tomorrow,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">service</font> will be \
    suspended."
set key[id=831175903000589] name "Send the hacking result to Deke"
set key[id=831175903000590] name "Transmission complete."
set key[id=831175903000620] name "I'm really getting more worried by the day..."
set key[id=831175903000621] name "Is something troubling you?"
set key[id=831175903000622] name "It's my son, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000502[gender:0]$</font>.\nI have no \
    way of knowing where he is or what he's doing."
set key[id=831175903000623] name "I've been worried sick since I lost track of him,\nand then something upsetting \
    happened recently... "
set key[id=831175903000624] name "What happened?"
set key[id=831175903000625] name "A few days ago, some suspicious men in <font color=\"#ffd200\">black \
    suits</font> showed up in our village\nand went around asking after my son, $npc:11000502[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831175903000626] name "I was so angry that he ran away on his own that I never even looked for \
    him...\nbut since then I can't sleep...\nI keep wondering what has happened to that boy... "
set key[id=831175903000627] name "My son used to hang around in $map:02000083$ with a fellow called\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000101[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=831175903000628] name "Would you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000083$</font> and ask <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000101[gender:0]$</font>\nwhere my son is and what he's up to?"
set key[id=831175903000629] name "Please go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000083$</font> and ask <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000101[gender:0]$</font>\nwhere my son is and what he's up to."
set key[id=831175903000630] name "What's up, mister~?\nDon't hang around here. <font color=\"#ffd200\">Go home, \
    yo~!</font>"
set key[id=831175903000631] name "Mister, you still here?\nWhat's the deal, man?"
set key[id=831175903000632] name "I'm asking about $npc:11000502[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831175903000633] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000502[gender:0]$</font>?\nYou've got some nerve, \
    man!"
set key[id=831175903000634] name "Have you ever heard of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black Star Society</font>, \
    mister?\nThey are some seriously <font color=\"#ffd200\">scary</font> folks!"
set key[id=831175903000635] name "Sure, I'm pretty <font color=\"#ffd200\">scary</font> myself, but!\nthose Black \
    Star bros are on a <font color=\"#ffd200\">whole other level</font>, you know?"
set key[id=831175903000636] name "What does the Black Star Society have to do with $npc:11000502[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831175903000637] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Slow down</font>, man!\nDon't rush, just listen to my \
    story!"
set key[id=831175903000638] name "Once upon a time, there <font color=\"#ffd200\">lived</font> a fool named \
    $npc:11000502[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831175903000639] name "$npc:11000502[gender:0]$ <font color=\"#ffd200\">thought</font> he was pretty \
    strong."
set key[id=831175903000640] name "Thinking he was strong, $npc:11000502[gender:0]$\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">joined</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black. Star. Society.</font>"
set key[id=831175903000641] name "But true bros know it.\n$npc:11000502[gender:0]$ is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">not</font> strong."
set key[id=831175903000642] name "In the end, our $npc:11000502[gender:0]$ got chased out by the Black Star \
    Society\nand is <font color=\"#ffd200\">hiding</font> somewhere in $map:02000138$ like a beggar."
set key[id=831175903000643] name "Are you close to $npc:11000502[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=831175903000644] name "Close? No way, man!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000101[gender:0]$</font> \
    here doesn't\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">hang out</font> with losers like that, yo!"
set key[id=831175903000645] name "I told you, didn't I?\n$npc:11000502[gender:0]$ is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">hiding</font> somewhere in $map:02000138$\nlike a beggar!"
set key[id=831175903000646] name "Ugh... Who are you!"
set key[id=831175903000647] name "Who are you! What do you want!"
set key[id=831175903000648] name "(Say that $npc:11000001[gender:0]$ sent me.)"
set key[id=831175903000649] name "What...?\nDad...? Dad is... looking for me...?"
set key[id=831175903000650] name "He wants you to come home."
set key[id=831175903000651] name "I want to go home too... But...\nSob... Please, help me... I'm begging you..."
set key[id=831175903000652] name "(Tell me what happened.)"
set key[id=831175903000653] name "Do you know about <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black Stones</font>?\nThey're rare \
    things you can only get in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>."
set key[id=831175903000654] name "The Black Star Society had a lot of these Black Stones...\nand they were selling \
    such precious things for <font color=\"#ffd200\">next to nothing</font>! "
set key[id=831175903000655] name "I happen to know some skilled <font color=\"#ffd200\">gem cutters</font>.\nSo I \
    secretly sneaked some Black Stones out\nand had them made into far more valuable <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000016$</font>!\nI figured I could sell them for a really high price."
set key[id=831175903000656] name "Who were you planning to sell them to?"
set key[id=831175903000657] name "Who else! The <font color=\"#ffd200\">fences</font>, of course!"
set key[id=831175903000658] name "Haven't you heard the saying,\n'<font color=\"#ffd200\">A seller with a guilty \
    conscience goes to the fence</font>'?"
set key[id=831175903000659] name "Just keep telling your story."
set key[id=831175903000660] name "But that's when everything started to go wrong..."
set key[id=831175903000661] name "The moment I walked into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000141$</font>, where \
    the fences are,\nsome thugs jumped me...\nThey took all the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000016$</font> I \
    brought, and I barely\nescaped with my life... "
set key[id=831175903000662] name "Since then, the Black Star Society has branded me a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">traitor</font>,\nand I've been running and hiding like this..."
set key[id=831175903000663] name "Sob... I miss <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dad</font> now...\nI want to go back <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">home</font>... "
set key[id=831175903000664] name "If I just get my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000016$</font> back, I can go \
    home...\nPlease go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000141$</font> and get my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000016$</font> back for me... "
set key[id=831175903000665] name "Please go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000141$</font>\nand get my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000016$</font> back for me... "
set key[id=831175903000666] name "Shh, shh!\nI feel like we've met before...?"
set key[id=831175903000667] name "I think we've met before."
set key[id=831175903000668] name "I've never seen you before."
set key[id=831175903000669] name "I knew it... Right?\nYou were here about that iron ore document or \
    whatever...\nBut... why are you here again?"
set key[id=831175903000670] name "(Explain $npc:11000502[gender:0]$'s situation.)"
set key[id=831175903000671] name "Is that so...? You look familiar somehow...\nSomeone like you came here once to \
    get some iron ore document.\nSo what brings you here?"
set key[id=831175903000672] name "(Explain $npc:11000502[gender:0]$'s situation.)"
set key[id=831175903000673] name "Fools like that get taken here every now and then...\nIn the fences' world, \
    lawlessness is the only rule...  "
set key[id=831175903000674] name "If they took the $item:30000016$...\nthey won't be here."
set key[id=831175903000675] name "Then where are they?"
set key[id=831175903000676] name "Haven't you noticed anything strange every time you come here?"
set key[id=831175903000677] name "Strange...?"
set key[id=831175903000678] name "This is the 8th floor. The <font color=\"#ffd200\">8th floor</font>!\nDid it \
    never occur to you that Golden Tower might have other floors?"
set key[id=831175903000679] name "Is there an entrance leading to another floor?"
set key[id=831175903000680] name "Go outside this building and you'll see an iron staircase on the right.\nGo down \
    it and you'll find a small door leading to\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000241$</font>."
set key[id=831175903000681] name "If you find the door! If you've got the courage!\nGo down and you might find the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000016$</font>."
set key[id=831175903000682] name "Oh, right. <font color=\"#ffd200\">One more thing</font>."
set key[id=831175903000683] name "The fences always travel in groups of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">four</font>.\nThere are big and small power struggles even in the fences' world...\nso they \
    naturally banded together to survive."
set key[id=831175903000684] name "To face them, don't just charge in alone.\nFind some companions and go down \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">to the 7th floor together</font>,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">four</font> of you."
set key[id=831175903000685] name "Go outside the building and down the iron staircase on the right,\nand you can \
    reach <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000241$</font>.\nFind some companions and go down <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">to the 7th floor together</font>,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">four</font> of you."
set key[id=831175903000686] name "Y-you're back! Did you get my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000016$</font>?"
set key[id=831175903000687] name "(Hand over the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000016$</font>.)"
set key[id=831175903000688] name "Th-thank you!!\nIf I return these to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000251[gender:0]$</font> and beg for forgiveness...  "
set key[id=831175903000689] name "Are you sure you'll be forgiven?"
set key[id=831175903000690] name "I can't keep running and hiding like this forever...\nI'll just have to beg for \
    mercy... Wish me luck!"
set key[id=831175903000727] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Code name: S-NX1390</font>\nDestroy the Shadow Cell \
    virus!"
set key[id=831175903000728] name "(Read the details.)"
set key[id=831175903000729] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Case File</font>\nDark Cell Virus Center, overseen by \
    Dr. Rokel.\nVirus production underway through Shadow Cell cultivation."
set key[id=831175903000730] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Case Location</font>\nInside $map:03000145$\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Investigator in Charge</font>\nGuardians secret agent $npc:11000910[gender:0]$"
set key[id=831175903000731] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Mission</font>\nFind $npc:11000910[gender:0]$, the \
    Guardians secret agent in disguise.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Contact Password</font>\nIf you can't avoid it, \
    you've got to enjoy it, that's life, sir.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">If the contact password is lost, you lose \
    your mission qualification</font>"
set key[id=831175903000732] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Mission</font>\nFind $npc:11000910[gender:0]$, the \
    Guardians secret agent in disguise.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Contact Password</font>\nIf you can't avoid it, \
    you've got to enjoy it, that's life, sir.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Warning:\nIf the contact password is lost, \
    you lose your mission qualification</font>"
set key[id=831175903000733] name "What's this now.\nWhat? Got something to say?"
set key[id=831175903000734] name "(Say the contact password.)"
set key[id=831175903000735] name "Shh! Come closer.\nOh, I'm so sorry for being rude without meaning to."
set key[id=831175903000736] name "That's all right."
set key[id=831175903000737] name "As you can see, I'm in <font color=\"#ffd200\">disguise</font> like this right \
    now...\nBut you actually checked the <font color=\"#ffd200\">secret orders</font>,\nthat's truly impressive."
set key[id=831175903000738] name "This place holds more <font color=\"#ffd200\">danger</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">conspiracy</font>\nthan you'd think."
set key[id=831175903000739] name "What's going on?"
set key[id=831175903000740] name "Dr. Rokel is one of the henchmen of the Demon King, ruler of the Shadow \
    World.\nHe has been cultivating something called <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Cells</font> here\nto develop \
    a <font color=\"#ffd200\">Clone Virus</font>. "
set key[id=831175903000741] name "If the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Clone Virus</font> spreads across the world,\nthe \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">darkest emotions</font> in people will take over their minds.\nThey won't be able to \
    control their own <font color=\"#ffd200\">evil hearts</font>."
set key[id=831175903000742] name "As evil grows stronger, the Demon King will end up\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">absorbing</font> that energy...\nCan you imagine a darker <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">plot</font> than that... "
set key[id=831175903000743] name "Unfortunately and fortunately, the talented <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000911[gender:0]$</font>\nis being held captive here.\nForced against their will to \
    research the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Cells</font>... "
set key[id=831175903000744] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000911[gender:0]$</font> knows this project \
    better than anyone\nelse, so surely they also know how\nto <font color=\"#ffd200\">stop</font> the research. "
set key[id=831175903000745] name "But! All of this must be done very, very <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">carefully</font>.\nIf our <font color=\"#ffd200\">identities</font> are exposed, everyone \
    here\nwill be in <font color=\"#ffd200\">danger</font>."
set key[id=831175903000746] name "There's no time to hesitate.\nHurry to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000911[gender:0]$</font>\nand find a <font color=\"#ffd200\">way to stop</font> this \
    research."
set key[id=831175903000747] name "Are you trying to make a <font color=\"#ffd200\">joke</font> out of me?"
set key[id=831175903000748] name "Never mind me, but with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">lives</font>\nof the people \
    of Ellinia at stake,\nwhy should I <font color=\"#ffd200\">trust</font> you enough to help? "
set key[id=831175903000749] name "Go back. Don't waste my time."
set key[id=831175903000750] name "Hm? <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000910[gender:0]$</font> sent you?\nOh... I'm \
    sorry I didn't recognize you. It's been one bad situation after another. \n"
set key[id=831175903000751] name "I don't trust anyone here except the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Guardians</font>.\nI don't even talk to anyone else."
set key[id=831175903000752] name "How can we stop the research? "
set key[id=831175903000753] name "First, to <font color=\"#ffd200\">stop</font> this terrifying research,\nwe have \
    to shut down the <font color=\"#ffd200\">cell cultivators</font> that produce the Shadow Cells. "
set key[id=831175903000754] name "Fortunately, only a <font color=\"#ffd200\">limited</font> number of Shadow \
    Cells can be extracted per day,\nso if we hurry and <font color=\"#ffd200\">stop</font> the\ncultivators, \
    there's still a little hope."
set key[id=831175903000755] name "Hurry and <font color=\"#ffd200\">shut down</font> the cell \
    cultivators.\nMeanwhile, I'll <font color=\"#ffd200\">destroy</font> the Shadow Cells I've extracted so \
    far\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">delete</font> the related research records."
set key[id=831175903000756] name "Hurry and <font color=\"#ffd200\">shut down</font> the cell \
    cultivators.\nMeanwhile, I'll <font color=\"#ffd200\">destroy</font> the Shadow Cells I've extracted so \
    far\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">delete</font> the related research records."
set key[id=831175903000757] name "You made it back safely.\nSo, how did it go...? "
set key[id=831175903000758] name "I shut down all the cell cultivators. "
set key[id=831175903000759] name "At last, at last! My research has <font color=\"#ffd200\">failed</font>.\nI \
    never knew the first failure of my research career\nwould make me this <font color=\"#ffd200\">happy</font>. \
    Haha."
set key[id=831175903000760] name "But this research had to <font color=\"#ffd200\">fail</font> from the \
    start.\nYes, it had to fail for us to <font color=\"#ffd200\">survive</font>."
set key[id=831175903000761] name "We still can't relax.\nDr. Rokel has already <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">exposed</font> some test subjects to the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Cell virus</font>, \
    an unfinished intermediate result of his research. "
set key[id=831175903000762] name "You've probably seen them already...\nThose terrifying monsters are <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">mutants</font>\nborn from exposure to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">virus</font>. "
set key[id=831175903000763] name "When Dr. Rokel learns the cell cultivators have been <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">shut down</font>,\nhe'll surely <font color=\"#ffd200\">extract</font> cells from those \
    monsters\nand start his research again."
set key[id=831175903000764] name "The cell reaction was incomplete, but even so,\nwe can't leave him an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">opening</font>. \n"
set key[id=831175903000765] name "Go and defeat the monsters <font color=\"#ffd200\">exposed</font> to the Clone \
    Virus.\nThe monsters used in the experiment are <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000019$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000031$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000074$</font>.\nThey've been \
    injected with strong aggression, so be careful."
set key[id=831175903000766] name "Please defeat the mutant monsters <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000019$</font>, \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000031$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000074$</font>."
set key[id=831175903000767] name "Seeing you back, nothing serious must have happened.\nSo, how did it go... Did \
    you get rid of all the mutant monsters?"
set key[id=831175903000768] name "I got rid of all of them."
set key[id=831175903000769] name "What a relief, truly.\nToday you did something <font color=\"#ffd200\">more \
    valuable</font>\nthan you probably realize."
set key[id=831175903000770] name "Your courage may have saved me, and perhaps\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">everyone</font> in Maple World."
set key[id=831175903000771] name "Ah! I heard about you, $MyPCName$, from the Guardian\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000910[gender:0]$</font>.\nIt's <font color=\"#ffd200\">reassuring</font> to have a \
    friend who shares our cause."
set key[id=831175903000772] name "The slaves brought here have been <font color=\"#ffd200\">brainwashed</font> by \
    Dr. Rokel\nand have lost their <font color=\"#ffd200\">judgment</font> about the danger here."
set key[id=831175903000773] name "We have to <font color=\"#ffd200\">rescue</font> the caged slaves quickly\nand \
    get them <font color=\"#ffd200\">evacuated</font> to safety. "
set key[id=831175903000774] name "How do I rescue them?"
set key[id=831175903000775] name "The cage doors have <font color=\"#ffd200\">locks</font> on them,\nso we need a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000264$</font> to open them."
set key[id=831175903000776] name "If you search the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000019$</font> patrolling \
    around the cages,\nyou should be able to get a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000264$</font>. "
set key[id=831175903000777] name "Please get a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000264$</font>\nand <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">rescue</font> the caged slaves. "
set key[id=831175903000778] name "If you search the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:40000019$</font> patrolling \
    around the cages,\nyou can get a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000264$</font>.\nGet a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000264$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">rescue</font> the caged slaves."
set key[id=831175903000779] name "This is bad. Their <font color=\"#ffd200\">health</font> looks worse than I \
    expected.\nWe need to get them to a <font color=\"#ffd200\">safe place</font> quickly. "
set key[id=831175903000780] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, we got through that\ntouch-and-go situation safely. \
    Thank you so much."
set key[id=831175903000781] name "Hey, what do I look like to you? "
set key[id=831175903000782] name "A... a turtle...?"
set key[id=831175903000783] name "Hmph, how deeply unsettling...\nI am Perion's one and only thousand-year turtle, \
    who has personally\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">experienced</font> the long road of Perion's thousand-year <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">history</font>...\nno, the only <font color=\"#ffd200\">living witness</font> in history."
set key[id=831175903000784] name "And the moment I met you!\nRight now, I have given myself a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">new name</font>.\nThat name is <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000929[gender:0]$</font>!!"
set key[id=831175903000785] name "It was about <font color=\"#ffd200\">three. hundred. years</font> ago... hmm... \
    anyway...\nI wrote a <font color=\"#ffd200\">work</font> so magnificent that I was sure\nit would bring me the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">golden age</font> of my life. "
set key[id=831175903000786] name "Back then, $map:02000051$ often had unstable <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">earthquakes</font>,\nso I <font color=\"#ffd200\">hid</font> the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">manuscript</font>, soaked with my creative agony,\nin a safe place in case I lost it. "
set key[id=831175903000787] name "Sigh... Hiding the manuscript alone took me a good <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">hundred and fifty</font> years...\nAnd now what <font color=\"#ffd200\">you'll do</font> \
    is\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">find</font> that original manuscript."
set key[id=831175903000788] name "Where is the manuscript?"
set key[id=831175903000789] name "That's exactly what I'm saying. <font color=\"#ffd200\">Where</font> is it...\nI \
    definitely put it <font color=\"#ffd200\">inside the nest</font> where my egg was,\nbut I simply can't <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">remember</font> where that nest is. "
set key[id=831175903000790] name "A canyon in $map:02000051$ where a tall peak towers... somewhere...\nThat's it! \
    It's in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000267$</font>, in the wind.\nSomewhere in the canyon..."
set key[id=831175903000791] name "So much time has passed that it won't be easy to crack the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">egg</font>.\nUse the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000268$</font> nearby\nto <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">hatch</font> the egg, remember that."
set key[id=831175903000792] name "Can you be more specific?"
set key[id=831175903000793] name "You rascal! If I remembered that, would I be sending you?!\nIf you catch <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000255$</font>, surely a few <font color=\"#ffd200\">embers</font> will drop."
set key[id=831175903000794] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000267$</font> and look for the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">egg nest</font>\nwith five-colored feathers stuck in it. If you hatch the egg using the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000268$</font>,\nyou'll find my pre.cious <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">manuscript</font>. "
set key[id=831175903000795] name "Yes! That's it, that's it!\nThe beautiful handwriting... it's definitely <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">mine</font>."
set key[id=831175903000796] name "Oh, my long-dead heart is <font color=\"#ffd200\">pitter-pattering</font> \
    again.\nKids these days call this a <font color=\"#ffd200\">heart-thump</font>, I hear."
set key[id=831175903000797] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>\nFrom now on, I'm going to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">hire</font> you as my <font color=\"#ffd200\">butler</font>. "
set key[id=831175903000798] name "I'm not really into it... "
set key[id=831175903000799] name "A butler can't <font color=\"#ffd200\">refuse</font> his master's order.\nNow, \
    take this and go to that big <font color=\"#ffd200\">city</font> far, far away, Tr... Tr..."
set key[id=831175903000800] name "Do you mean Tria? "
set key[id=831175903000801] name "That's exactly what I'm saying! <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>!\nTake this <font color=\"#ffd200\">manuscript</font> to \
    $map:02000001$ and find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000327[gender:1]$</font>. "
set key[id=831175903000802] name "$npc:11000327[gender:1]$ has done a lot of research on the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">history</font> of every land,\nand is just as widely learned. Surely they'll recognize my \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">manuscript</font>\nat a glance and <font color=\"#ffd200\">publish</font> it as a \
    book. "
set key[id=831175903000803] name "I'm a slow walker, so going to $map:02000001$ from now would take me\nat least \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">ten years</font> to arrive,\nso you'd better move first, don't you think?"
set key[id=831175903000804] name "Since you're <font color=\"#ffd200\">specially</font> my butler, when the book \
    comes out,\nI'll give you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">limited edition</font> $npc:11000929[gender:0]$ <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">handwritten autograph</font>. Personally!"
set key[id=831175903000805] name "Take this <font color=\"#ffd200\">manuscript</font> to $map:02000001$ and find \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000327[gender:1]$</font>.\nSurely they'll take my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">manuscript</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">publish</font> it as a book. "
set key[id=831175903000806] name "What is this?\nI've never <font color=\"#ffd200\">heard</font> of an author \
    called $npc:11000929[gender:0]$..."
set key[id=831175903000807] name "Hm? A <font color=\"#ffd200\">fire warrior woman</font> of \
    $map:02000051$...\nWait... Ah! I think I've heard of this person."
set key[id=831175903000808] name "First, I think I should read this manuscript a bit more\nand <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">review</font> it carefully. "
set key[id=831175903000809] name "I do <font color=\"#ffd200\">not trust</font> humans.\nHumans are bad. Humans \
    are dangerous. Mocamoca."
set key[id=831175903000810] name "Why do you hate people?"
set key[id=831175903000811] name "At first they say they want to help, but\nyou humans took my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">husband</font> from me,\nand stole the <font color=\"#ffd200\">eggs</font> from my home. "
set key[id=831175903000812] name "I came all the way here to get away from humans,\nand now you've come all this \
    way to <font color=\"#ffd200\">torment</font> me too?"
set key[id=831175903000813] name "I'll help you with anything."
set key[id=831175903000814] name "If you truly want to help me, fine.\nI don't exactly trust you, but my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">situation</font>\nis very bad right now. It's hard."
set key[id=831175903000815] name "Ever since lava springs started appearing here, the prey I could hunt\nhas been \
    wiped out. I need <font color=\"#ffd200\">food</font> to feed my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">children</font>\nright now."
set key[id=831175903000816] name "The only food we can eat here is the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:29000041$</font>\nhiding in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">bushes</font>.\nIf you search \
    the bushes and bring us food,\nI'll try to <font color=\"#ffd200\">trust</font> you."
set key[id=831175903000817] name "If you search the <font color=\"#ffd200\">bushes</font>, the hiding <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:29000041$</font>\nwill come crawling out in fright. Catch the $npc:29000041$ and bring \
    it to me."
set key[id=831175903000818] name "To receive such warm <font color=\"#ffd200\">kindness</font> from a \
    human...\nMocamoca doesn't trust humans. But <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, you\ndid not betray my \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">trust</font>, so from now on you are Mocamoca's <font color=\"#ffd200\">friend</font>. \
    "
set key[id=831175903000819] name "Thanks to $MyPCName$, for a while we won't have to fight\nthe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">lonely</font> fight for survival. Thank you."
set key[id=831175903000849] name "Can you hear that sound?\nThe ominous presence I felt in my dream last night\nis \
    becoming <font color=\"#ffd200\">reality</font>...  "
set key[id=831175903000850] name "(Tell me more about the dream.)"
set key[id=831175903000851] name "On the day of the great <font color=\"#ffd200\">earthquake</font> in \
    Ellinia,\nsome of Ellinia's fairies were swept away by a dark red stream\nas the ground <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">collapsed</font>, and their bodies were <font color=\"#ffd200\">transformed</font>. "
set key[id=831175903000852] name "Even the fairy named <font color=\"#ffd200\">Ariel</font>, famed as the most \
    beautiful in Ellinia,\ncould not escape that <font color=\"#ffd200\">disaster</font>.\nHeartbroken over her \
    appearance, so unlike the other fairies,\nshe became a <font color=\"#ffd200\">fallen dark fairy</font>."
set key[id=831175903000853] name "In the end, with a twisted heart she scattered <font color=\"#ffd200\">seeds of \
    darkness</font>\nand awakened the fierce underworld guard <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100039[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=831175903000854] name "With <font color=\"#ffd200\">teleportation</font> magic I confined \
    $npc:23100039[gender:0]$ in\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000312$</font>, once a resting place for the \
    ancient mages,\nbut absorbing the essence of darkness, $npc:23100039[gender:0]$ grows more and more <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">violent</font>."
set key[id=831175903000855] name "We must stop <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100039[gender:0]$</font> at all \
    costs\nbefore it grows even fiercer.\nOtherwise Ellinia will be <font color=\"#ffd200\">shattered to \
    pieces</font>."
set key[id=831175903000856] name "Please protect Ellinia and the fairies here\nfrom <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100039[gender:0]$</font> without fail."
set key[id=831175903000857] name "Defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100039[gender:0]$</font>. \
    Otherwise\nEllinia will be <font color=\"#ffd200\">shattered to pieces</font>."
set key[id=831175903000858] name "Oh, you're back. Just now I saw a single ray of light\nshining on Ellinia inside \
    the Orb of Life.\nDid you defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100039[gender:0]$</font>?"
set key[id=831175903000859] name "Yes, I did."
set key[id=831175903000860] name "I pay <font color=\"#ffd200\">tribute</font> to your valor. Thank you so \
    much.\nThe ray of hope for Ellinia will brighten your <font color=\"#ffd200\">future</font>."
set key[id=831175903001007] name "Oh my, oh my~ my back, my shoulders, my legs...\nThere's not one place that \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">doesn't hurt</font>.\nSay, young one. Do you happen to know <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">where</font> this is?"
set key[id=831175903001008] name "I was definitely simmering the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Wish Soup</font> that \
    grants wishes,\nand I just took a little nap, and woke up to find myself <font color=\"#ffd200\">here</font>! \
    "
set key[id=831175903001009] name "Oh dear, oh dear. I promised to bring the Wish Soup to the\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Hundred-Year Princess</font>... I can't tell the <font color=\"#ffd200\">time</font>, and I \
    don't even know <font color=\"#ffd200\">where</font> I am... "
set key[id=831175903001010] name "What is Wish Soup?"
set key[id=831175903001011] name "Aha! Wish Soup?! It's a soup that grants <font color=\"#ffd200\">wishes</font>, \
    just like it sounds.\nThink of what you want in your <font color=\"#ffd200\">heart</font> while you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">taste</font> a spoonful and your wish...\nAh! Now I get it, I get it."
set key[id=831175903001012] name "While tasting the Wish Soup, I ran low on <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">sugar</font>\nand thought of a <font color=\"#ffd200\">sweet cake</font>, and that's what \
    sent me here. Oho ho."
set key[id=831175903001013] name "But where are these <font color=\"#ffd200\">sweet smells</font> coming \
    from?\nSay, young one. I'm awfully hungry, so could you <font color=\"#ffd200\">bring</font> me\nthe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">food</font> that holds this sweet smell?"
set key[id=831175903001014] name "When I get old, if I don't get a <font color=\"#ffd200\">sugar boost</font> in \
    time,\nmy hands and feet <font color=\"#ffd200\">tremble</font> and my mind goes <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">foggy</font>, you see~"
set key[id=831175903001015] name "Don't treat me like some old <font color=\"#ffd200\">granny</font>, \
    though.\nIt's not the sugar, it's that my taste is so <font color=\"#ffd200\">young</font>\nthat I just can't \
    resist a sweet dessert. Ahem."
set key[id=831175903001016] name "Could you bring me the food that holds that sweet smell?\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000298$</font>, or <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000300$</font>... Oh, right!\nAnd \
    I'd love some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000299$</font> too, why not~"
set key[id=831175903001017] name "Even from far away I can smell the sweet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">aroma</font>,\nmy mouth is <font color=\"#ffd200\">watering</font> already~"
set key[id=831175903001018] name "Thank you, young one. Next time I'll make you a delicious\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Wish Soup</font>, so be sure to come find me!"
set key[id=831175903001019] name "Oh dear, lately I keep <font color=\"#ffd200\">getting a letter wrong</font> \
    when I chant the spell,\nso every <font color=\"#ffd200\">time trip</font> lands me somewhere new."
set key[id=831175903001020] name "I'm a mage who lives in <font color=\"#ffd200\">Andersen Fairy Tale \
    Village</font>.\nOn my way to find Alicia of the Strange Palace, I chanted the spell <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">wrong</font>... "
set key[id=831175903001021] name "To time travel again I need the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000301$</font>,\nbut the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000278$</font> nearby\nstole \
    my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000301$</font>. "
set key[id=831175903001022] name "Please get my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000301$</font>\nback from the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000278$</font>."
set key[id=831175903001023] name "Please get my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000301$</font>\nback from the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000278$</font>."
set key[id=831175903001024] name "Ah, that's my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000301$</font>! No doubt about \
    it!\nHmm, but what do I do? There's one more <font color=\"#ffd200\">problem</font>."
set key[id=831175903001025] name "Even if I open the way again with the $item:30000301$, I can't send back\nthe \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">monsters</font> that went wild from the time difference. "
set key[id=831175903001026] name "But it's my own <font color=\"#ffd200\">mistake</font>, so I can't just\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">leave</font> the monsters here either... sigh~"
set key[id=831175903001027] name "Since it's come to this, for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">safety</font> of both \
    Andersen Fairy Tale Village\nand this place, it pains me, but I think we must <font color=\"#ffd200\">deal \
    with</font> these <font color=\"#ffd200\">troublemakers</font>."
set key[id=831175903001028] name "Would you <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat</font> the monsters that crossed over \
    from Andersen Fairy Tale Village?\nIt's cold, but right now all we can do is make a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">bold</font> choice."
set key[id=831175903001029] name "Please defeat the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000278$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000173$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000160$</font>.   "
set key[id=831175903001030] name "Ah, I think I'm all <font color=\"#ffd200\">ready to leave</font> now.\nWhen I \
    get back, I'll probably get a huge <font color=\"#ffd200\">scolding</font> from the Archmage... "
set key[id=831175903001031] name "When I get back, I'll look up a spell that improves my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">memory</font> first. Hehe\nThank you for your help, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=831175903001102] name "This is <font color=\"#ffd200\">serious</font>. Serious, I tell you!\nHurry, \
    hurry, hurry!"
set key[id=831175903001103] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903001104] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Toilet paper</font>... there's no toilet paper, none at \
    all!\nWaaah... How can there be no paper in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">bathroom</font>? <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Make sense</font> of that, huh?"
set key[id=831175903001105] name "Go <font color=\"#ffd200\">get</font> some toilet paper right now!\nHurry, \
    hurry, hurry!"
set key[id=831175903001106] name "Where can I get it?"
set key[id=831175903001107] name "How should I know, I'm in the bathroom right now!\nTry searching the scouts' \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">relief supply crates</font> nearby.\nSomething's bound to turn up!"
set key[id=831175903001108] name "Go <font color=\"#ffd200\">get</font> some toilet paper right now! Hurry, hurry, \
    hurry!\nTry searching the scouts' <font color=\"#ffd200\">relief supply crates</font> nearby.\nSomething's \
    bound to turn up!"
set key[id=831175903001109] name "You're here? Where's the <font color=\"#ffd200\">toilet paper</font>?\nDid you \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">bring</font> the paper too?"
set key[id=831175903001110] name "I brought it."
set key[id=831175903001111] name "Whew, thank goodness. Sob\nNow, quickly slip the paper in through the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">gap in the door</font>."
set key[id=831175903001112] name "I've been sitting on that hard toilet so long,\nI think I'm going to get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">hemorrhoids</font>."
set key[id=831175903001113] name "Aaaaagh! I'm going crazy, really...\nI... I can't <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">reach</font>... I can't grab the paper."
set key[id=831175903001114] name "I... I have no choice...\nSorry, but you'll have to come <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">inside</font> the bathroom and hand me the paper."
set key[id=831175903001116] name "Waah, right now, this very moment! I wish it was all a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">dream</font>...\nYes, this is a <font color=\"#ffd200\">nightmare</font>... I'm dreaming \
    right now."
set key[id=831175903001117] name "What happened today is between you and me! Our <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">secret</font>.\nAn <font color=\"#ffd200\">ab.so.lute.secret!!</font> to take to the grave."
set key[id=831175903001118] name "Mm-hm, I mean, everyone has an experience like this <font color=\"#ffd200\">once \
    in a while</font>, right?\nI mean, in <font color=\"#ffd200\">life</font>, this happens, that happens, all \
    kinds of things... "
set key[id=831175903001119] name "Since today, right now, right here, we've become <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">friends</font> who shared a <font color=\"#ffd200\">hardship</font>,\nI'll say this. \
    Actually, I have a <font color=\"#ffd200\">secret</font> I can't tell... "
set key[id=831175903001120] name "What's the secret?"
set key[id=831175903001121] name "Con...sti...pation... a really <font color=\"#ffd200\">bad case</font>... I'm \
    totally <font color=\"#ffd200\">blocked</font>... sob sob\nIf they learned a cute, adorable girl like me was \
    constipated,\nmy image would totally <font color=\"#ffd200\">shatter</font>, right...? "
set key[id=831175903001122] name "I read in a book that if you boil down <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000353$</font> for a long time\nand drink the extract, you can <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">escape</font> constipation in one go. "
set key[id=831175903001123] name "So I came to catch <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000353$</font>,\nbut then a \
    sudden <font color=\"#ffd200\">signal</font> hit me... "
set key[id=831175903001124] name "Did you see any <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000353$</font> outside the \
    bathroom? "
set key[id=831175903001125] name "I did."
set key[id=831175903001126] name "I've poured all my <font color=\"#ffd200\">energy</font> into getting the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">dirty stuff</font>\nout of me, so please go\ncatch <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000353$</font> for me instead. "
set key[id=831175903001127] name "Since we met like this, it must be <font color=\"#ffd200\">fate</font>, so \
    helping a friend\nis no big deal, right?! You'll surely be <font color=\"#ffd200\">blessed</font>!"
set key[id=831175903001128] name "Ugh, can a person even <font color=\"#ffd200\">eat</font> this...\nAnyway, they \
    say this can get me <font color=\"#ffd200\">out of constipation</font>,\nso I'll just endure it and keep \
    eating it."
set key[id=831175903001129] name "Ah, somehow I already feel my belly getting <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">lighter</font>?!\nThanks, friend! "
set key[id=831175903001169] name "Nobody is born evil...\nThis is all the fault of me, their poor master."
set key[id=831175903001170] name "Why do you say that?"
set key[id=831175903001171] name "Those Red Dragon Jawbreaker Gang fellows over there.\nIn fact, I'm the one who \
    taught those kids martial arts."
set key[id=831175903001172] name "It was several years ago. On my training journey I met a flock of mutant \
    pelicans.\nWith long thin necks, wide spread wings and drooping throat pouches,\nthey were being despised for \
    their strange, ugly looks."
set key[id=831175903001173] name "You shouldn't judge others by their appearance,\nand I felt so sorry for them, \
    bullied only for looking odd...\nSigh... "
set key[id=831175903001174] name "I worried they might be harmed by enemies in a remote place,\nso I taught them \
    martial arts so they could build the strength to protect themselves."
set key[id=831175903001175] name "But I never thought it would come back as poison...\nWhat a heavy-hearted \
    matter."
set key[id=831175903001176] name "What happened?"
set key[id=831175903001177] name "Having learned martial arts tailored to their clumsy bodies,\nthey began \
    bullying the weak as soon as they grew strong."
set key[id=831175903001178] name "Not only that, they even ended up forming a pecking order\nthrough contests of \
    strength among themselves. "
set key[id=831175903001179] name "I came all the way here to talk them round... but it's no use, no use.\nYou can \
    tell everything from their eyes. They're already slaves to evil."
set key[id=831175903001180] name "Still, they lived under my roof for a time, like my own children,\nso how could \
    I defeat them with my own hands... "
set key[id=831175903001181] name "Please go and defeat those fellows possessed by evil.\nAh, they've now split \
    into the Jawbreaker Master, trainees and novices of the Red Dragon Jawbreaker Gang. Hmm... "
set key[id=831175903001182] name "Please defeat those fellows possessed by evil.\nAh, they now call \
    themselves\n$npc:21000312$, $npc:21000311$ and $npc:21000310$."
set key[id=831175903001183] name "Through this ordeal I too have gained some insight,\nand today a chilly wind \
    blows especially cold through my chest."
set key[id=831175903001184] name "Judging by your eyes, you don't seem to need my advice,\nbut always stay humble \
    and never become arrogant. "
set key[id=831175903001185] name "Well well~ Look at this~\nWhat a varie~ty of faces gathered here!?"
set key[id=831175903001186] name "But no matter how I look, Croy is nowhere to be seen...\nThat little rat of a \
    brat, where did he disappear to this time!"
set key[id=831175903001187] name "Who is Croy?"
set key[id=831175903001188] name "Huh? I thought you came to catch the little demon too...\nGuess not. Croy is a \
    little demon who fell asleep\nin the Demon King's arms the day the Demon King fell into deep sleep."
set key[id=831175903001189] name "When the Demon King's henchman Turka woke the Demon King,\nthat cheeky little \
    villain Croy woke up too, and would you believe it,\nhe bounced a bouncy ball and escaped to freedom."
set key[id=831175903001190] name "The ones here are toy monsters that Croy\nbrought to life by breathing demon \
    souls into them. "
set key[id=831175903001191] name "They only look cute, but the things they do are so wicked and cruel...\nThey \
    grow stronger by absorbing the innocence of children."
set key[id=831175903001192] name "Actually, I was one of these toys here too.\nLuckily I met \
    $npc:11000146[gender:0]$, and with their help\nI was able to drive the demon soul out of my whole body."
set key[id=831175903001193] name "And now, as you can see, I've become a hunter chasing the little villain \
    Croy,\nwho turned my friends into monsters."
set key[id=831175903001194] name "Hmm... Did I talk too much... Look how late it's gotten!\nAll right~ I've given \
    you top-grade info, so now it's your turn to help me."
set key[id=831175903001195] name "What do you need help with?"
set key[id=831175903001196] name "I have to turn back time and go catch Croy.\nTo track Croy, who could bolt \
    anywhere, I need not what I have,\nbut items from these guys that hold Croy's soul."
set key[id=831175903001197] name "What did I need again...  Oh, right!\nI just need $item:30000359$, \
    $item:30000360$ and $item:30000361$.\nCroy... just you wait!"
set key[id=831175903001198] name "Oh, and getting them is super simple.\nJust hunt the $npc:21000279$, \
    $npc:21000168$ and $npc:21000195$\nnearby, and that's it! It! It!"
set key[id=831175903001199] name "Hunt the $npc:21000279$, $npc:21000168$ and $npc:21000195$\nnearby and bring me \
    $item:30000359$, $item:30000360$ and $item:30000361$."
set key[id=831175903001200] name "Ooh~ you're better than I thought! How about it, want to travel through \
    time\nwith me and go after villains?!"
set key[id=831175903001201] name "(Politely decline.)"
set key[id=831175903001202] name "Tsk, playing hard to get! Anyway, thanks a lot.\nAs long as we're in this time, \
    we can meet again anytime."
set key[id=831175903001203] name "Sigh, I knew all the researchers were exhausted...\nbut I never imagined \
    something like this would happen."
set key[id=831175903001204] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903001205] name "While I stepped out to meet the lab director,\nsome of the researchers ran off \
    with the\nresearch technology developed here."
set key[id=831175903001206] name "What's even more shocking is that, to steal the data, they released\nthe \
    sleeping gas they'd meant to mount on weapons\nand put their own teammates to sleep."
set key[id=831175903001207] name "After all the time we spent together...\nTo abandon their colleagues and their \
    conscience for a few coins... "
set key[id=831175903001208] name "First, I think we need to wake the researchers who fell asleep\nand help them \
    calm down."
set key[id=831175903001209] name "Please wake our researchers who are lying asleep\nall over the bunker and \
    evacuate them to safety."
set key[id=831175903001210] name "Please wake our researchers who are lying asleep all over the bunker\nand \
    evacuate them to safety."
set key[id=831175903001211] name "At least they used sleeping gas that doesn't threaten their lives,\nwhich is a \
    relief."
set key[id=831175903001212] name "I think we should go to the awakened researchers\nand hear the full story. "
set key[id=831175903001213] name "Hop hop hop, this is bad hop. This is bad hop.\nAll my friends turned into \
    monsters hop. Sob sob"
set key[id=831175903001214] name "What happened?"
set key[id=831175903001215] name "My friends and I were traveling on the Moon following the direction\nthe moon \
    halo pointed, but we got lost...\nWe were scared, so we walked along singing, and ended up here, hop hop."
set key[id=831175903001216] name "But hop hop, my friends were hungry, so they pulled up\ncarrots in \
    $map:02000280$ and ate them... and they all became monster bunnies, hop."
set key[id=831175903001217] name "It seems someone put a curse on the carrots\nto stop anyone from pulling them \
    up, hop hop. "
set key[id=831175903001218] name "Hop hop, please help me get back to the beautiful Moon, hop hop.\nBecause of the \
    terrifying monster bunnies, I can't take a single step, hop.\nPlease get rid of the cursed monster bunnies \
    quickly, hop hop."
set key[id=831175903001219] name "Because of the terrifying monster bunnies, I can't take a single step, \
    hop.\nPlease get rid of the cursed $npc:21090189$, $npc:21090187$ and $npc:21090188$\nquickly, hop hop."
set key[id=831175903001220] name "Ooh... I was so scared I'd turn into a monster bunny too...\nWithout my friends, \
    I don't know how I'll get back to the Moon..."
set key[id=831175903001221] name "When I arrive safely on the Moon, I'll scatter moon shards\nand invite \
    $MyPCName$, who helped me, hop hop hop~"
set key[id=831175903001225] name "In this freezing cold, there's no way to contact headquarters...\nWe're \
    completely cut off."
set key[id=831175903001226] name "Ever since our Ocean Exploration Headquarters was founded, many members\nwho \
    went out to explore have gone missing or been attacked by monsters,\nso there's talk of dissolving the \
    headquarters and so on... Tsk."
set key[id=831175903001227] name "Hmph, I hate asking others for help...\nbut would you help me out?"
set key[id=831175903001228] name "What do you need help with?"
set key[id=831175903001229] name "If you just take care of the monsters on the ridge, I think I can\nsomehow get \
    out of here."
set key[id=831175903001230] name "I'll have you know I'm a master rock climber, so once the path the monsters\nare \
    blocking is cleared, I can easily get down $map:02000260$."
set key[id=831175903001231] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=831175903001232] name "Ha ha, you're a bolder young one than you look!\nYou remind me of myself in my \
    prime~ Haha~"
set key[id=831175903001233] name "Then please take care of the $npc:21000002$, $npc:21000199$ and \
    $npc:21000089$\nswarming around here. "
set key[id=831175903001234] name "There are more monsters than you'd expect, so be careful.\nThe ones in cold \
    regions are tougher and fiercer."
set key[id=831175903001235] name "Then please take care of the $npc:21000002$, $npc:21000199$ and \
    $npc:21000089$\nswarming around here. "
set key[id=831175903001236] name "Thanks to you, I can get back to headquarters safely.\nIf you ever come to our \
    Ocean Headquarters and ask for me, I'll treat you right. Haha"
set key[id=831175903001266] name "They say it's darkest under the lamp... I never dreamed\nthere'd be an enemy \
    inside our own team."
set key[id=831175903001267] name "I was dispatched from $map:02000100$ and am carrying out\nan important mission \
    here. "
set key[id=831175903001268] name "Please don't compare us to the security companies full of drifters\nthat are so \
    common these days. The Alpha-K team I lead is made up solely\nof professional agents with systematic training. \
    "
set key[id=831175903001269] name "Sigh, what good is it to say this now...\nA member of our team was involved in \
    the very incident behind today's events... "
set key[id=831175903001270] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903001271] name "$map:02000277$ handles top-grade weapons that even the government keeps quiet \
    about.\nI was dispatched\nhere to maintain ironclad security."
set key[id=831175903001272] name "But one of my team members was bought off with money from \
    $npc:11000251[gender:0]$,\nthe boss of a huge mafia group in $map:02000100$, and leaked this \
    place's\ntechnology in a shady backroom deal."
set key[id=831175903001273] name "Who can I blame? This is all the fault of me, the team leader,\nand it came from \
    my carelessness. "
set key[id=831175903001274] name "One way or another, I will recover the leaked research data of \
    $map:02000277$\nand clean up this mess."
set key[id=831175903001275] name "The most urgent matter is to escape from here while tampering\nwith the system \
    to destroy the robot weapons that pose a risk of killing."
set key[id=831175903001276] name "There's no time, so please help me.\nWe must destroy all \
    of\n$npc:21000245[gender:1]$, $npc:21000247[gender:1]$ and $npc:21000242[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831175903001277] name "We must destroy all of the dangerous $npc:21000245[gender:1]$, \
    $npc:21000247[gender:1]$\nand $npc:21000242[gender:0]$."
set key[id=831175903001278] name "Fortunately, thanks to you, $MyPCName$, their numbers seem to have dropped a \
    lot.\nBut there is still something important left to do."
set key[id=910163602003904] name "Hmm... Did this kid really go into <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000325$</font>?"
set key[id=910163602003905] name "If you'd like to know more about $map:02000325$, go \
    meet\n$npc:11000289[gender:0]$ in $map:02000217$."
set key[id=910163602003906] name "Oh, for goodness' sake... I said get out of the way~!"
set key[id=910163602003907] name "What, what? Why do you keep talking to me?"
set key[id=910163602003908] name "The phantoms that $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ possesses seem a lot stronger than \
    the real monsters.\nThey say you can see $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ once the phantom falls... but I've never \
    seen them... \nI'll train harder and I will see $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ someday.\nWant to bet on which of us \
    sees $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ first?"
set key[id=910163602003909] name "Huh? What? \nYou defeated a phantom in $map:02000325$ and saw \
    $npc:21800006[gender:0]$?\nUgh... that you saw $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ before me... I can't believe it...!!"
set key[id=910163602003910] name "Hmm... I saw you coming out of $map:02000325$... \nDid you pass the trials?"
set key[id=910163602003911] name "Facing the phantoms that $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ possesses in $map:02000325$ is \
    hard and grueling,\nbut you could call it the best training method for building skill in a short time\nand \
    earning others' recognition."
set key[id=910163602003912] name "Hmm... I smell a master beneath those green steps...\nHave you come back after \
    passing all the trials in $map:02000325$?"
set key[id=910222902003913] name "What is $map:02000325$?"
set key[id=910222902003914] name "Ah~ $MyPCName$!!\nYou don't know about $map:02000325$ yet?"
set key[id=910222902003915] name "$map:02000325$ is a training ground that $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ built at the \
    request of $npc:11000134[gender:0]$\nso the warriors of the Murpagos tribe could grow stronger.\nI don't know \
    the details, but they say that long ago $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ owed $npc:11000134[gender:0]$\na great debt, \
    and that special bond made the two lifelong friends. "
set key[id=910222902003916] name "Anyway, when you go to $map:02000325$, $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ uses an ancient \
    spirit spell\nto possess the spirits of the monsters threatening this world, and faces challengers in \
    person\nto judge their skill.\nIn the past only Murpagos warriors could enter $map:02000325$,\nbut now any \
    adventurer with both skill and courage can take the challenge."
set key[id=910222902003917] name "$npc:11000289[gender:0]$ also boasted loudly that he'd pass every trial in \
    $map:02000325$\nand headed off to $map:02000217$... heh.\nIf you'd like to know more about $map:02000325$, go \
    meet $npc:11000289[gender:0]$."
set key[id=910222902003918] name "Did you take on $map:02000325$?"
set key[id=910222902003919] name "Uh... huh?\nW-who said that? That I took on $map:02000325$... "
set key[id=910222902003920] name "I heard it from $npc:11000136[gender:1]$."
set key[id=910222902003921] name "Oh, for goodness' sake... why is spreading rumors all over the place?\nAhem!\nI \
    took the challenge... yes!! I did, but... "
set key[id=910222902003922] name "The thing is... it's not as easy as I thought... \nThe phantoms that \
    $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ possesses seem a lot stronger than the real monsters.\nThey say you can see \
    $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ once the phantom falls... but I've never seen them... "
set key[id=910222902003923] name "Still, I won't give up.\nI'll train harder and I will see \
    $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ someday.\nWant to bet on which of us sees $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ first?"
set key[id=910222902003924] name "What did $npc:21800006[gender:0]$ say to you?"
set key[id=910222902003925] name "They praised my skill as excellent."
set key[id=910222902003926] name "They admitted I'm pretty good."
set key[id=910222902003927] name "They said I did very well."
set key[id=910222902003928] name "They said they look forward to my skill growing even more."
set key[id=910222902003929] name "R-really? Hmph, I don't say this often, but... \nI'm jealous! $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=910222902003930] name "I only passed the first trial."
set key[id=910222902003931] name "I passed up to the second trial."
set key[id=910222902003932] name "I passed all the trials."
set key[id=910222902003933] name "Heh heh. Is that so?\nYou must be better than $npc:11000289[gender:0]$, at \
    least.\nI hope you'll pass all the way to the last trial\nand prove your brave spirit, which hasn't shown \
    itself yet."
set key[id=910222902003934] name "Oh, really?\nWith a little more effort you might even face me in a duel in \
    $map:65000001$!\nI hope you'll pass all the way to the last trial, awaken the brave spirit sleeping within \
    you,\nand be reborn as a true hero."
set key[id=910222902003935] name "Oho... if that's true... you're someone of truly great skill!\nBut don't let \
    your guard down! As you grow stronger, so do your enemies...\nKeep proving your brave spirit in \
    $map:02000325$.\nSo that anyone, whoever it is, has no choice but to acknowledge you!"
set key[id=910222902003936] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=910222902003937] name "What a spirited young one.\nIf you don't sink into the swamp of conceit... you \
    could become a hero who lives on as a legend."
set key[id=1005151102005806] name "Maybe it's my age... or maybe I just miss my granddaughter...\nFrom far... very \
    far away, I can faintly hear a child crying...\nWhat on earth is going on... "
set key[id=1005151102005807] name "Maybe it's my age... or maybe I just miss my granddaughter...\nFrom far... very \
    far away, I can faintly hear a child crying...\nWhat on earth is going on... "
set key[id=1005151102005808] name "Ah... Thank you so much.\nIf it weren't for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, the Boroboro people might have vanished from this \
    world\nforever.\nPerhaps an unseen force of fate led <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font> here?\n"
set key[id=1005151102005809] name "Ugh... how nasty... Don't you smell something funny?\nIt's all coming from the \
    garden in $map:02000167$.\nThey say that beautiful garden is being filthied into a mess...\nbut nobody steps \
    up to fix it... sigh... "
set key[id=1005151102005810] name "Ugh... how nasty... Don't you smell something funny?\nIt's all coming from the \
    garden in $map:02000167$.\nThey say that beautiful garden is being filthied into a mess...\nbut nobody steps \
    up to fix it... sigh... "
set key[id=1005151102005811] name "If it weren't for <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, the roots of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:24001103$</font> would have spread all the way to $map:02000100$\nand caused a real \
    disaster. Thank you."
set key[id=1013232602004148] name "Well, this is... hahaha.\nI'm truly moved. To think $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ \
    visited our guard post in person..."
set key[id=1013232602004149] name "(Ask what brought him here.)"
set key[id=1013232602004150] name "Ah~ Well, not long ago $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ granted special supplies \
    to the whole Guardians\nas encouragement. So each Guardians leader has been touring the local posts\nwith the \
    supply troops, listening to the troops' hardships and encouraging them\nwhile handing out the supplies."
set key[id=1013232602004151] name "$npcName:11000015[gender:1]$ held my hand tight and thanked me for my hard \
    work... and that hand was so warm...\nI just felt I must take responsibility for guarding $map:2000057$ from \
    now on.\nAh... but... "
set key[id=1013232602004152] name "I ask what's wrong."
set key[id=1013232602004153] name "The supply troops left in a hurry, and maybe they forgot, because they left a \
    $item:30000412$ behind.\nTheir next destination was <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000091$</font>. It isn't far \
    from here, but\nI can't leave my post to go... I'm sorry to ask, but could you follow the supply\ncorps and \
    deliver this <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000412$</font> for me, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=1013232602004154] name "Hm? You're back already?"
set key[id=1013232602004155] name "They forgot and left the $item:30000412$ behind."
set key[id=1013232602004156] name "(Say I took a wrong turn for a moment.)"
set key[id=1013232602004157] name "Oh... I see.\nHere you go. It's important, so take good care of it when you \
    deliver it."
set key[id=1013232602004158] name "Not in your bag?\nI clearly saw you put it in... look once more."
set key[id=1013232602004159] name "Your bag is packed full.\nHow about tidying it up first?"
set key[id=1013232602004160] name "Ah... heh heh... you're a bit of a klutz, aren't you."
set key[id=1013232602004161] name "Ah, did you call for me?\nI'm busy right now because I have to request urgent \
    reinforcements... Is it urgent?"
set key[id=1013232602004162] name "I came to deliver the $item:30000412$."
set key[id=1013232602004163] name "Ah... come to think of it, the supply trooper was moping that he'd lost \
    this...\nThank you. I'll hand it over. Now, if you'll excuse me... "
set key[id=1013232602004164] name "I told you I'm in a hurry... why are you calling me again?"
set key[id=1013232602004165] name "(Ask what the urgent matter is.)"
set key[id=1013232602004166] name "A horrifying <font color=\"#ffd200\">herd of wild pigs has come from beyond \
    $map:2000334$ and is attacking the wall</font>!\n$npcName:11000015[gender:1]$ and the supply troops are all \
    busy beating back the pigs\nbeyond the wall. It's $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$'s order to ask the Guardians \
    for urgent reinforcements\nbefore the watchtower falls to the pigs. "
set key[id=1013232602004167] name "$MyPCName$, don't just stand around here. Go to $map:2000334$ and help \
    $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$\nhold the wall.\nEspecially that boss who led the pigs here!! We have to drive \
    that one far away!"
set key[id=1013232602004168] name "$MyPCName$, don't just stand around here. Go to $map:2000334$ and help \
    $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$\nhold the wall.\nEspecially that boss who led the pigs here!! We have to drive \
    that one far away!"
set key[id=1013232602004169] name "Oh! The Guardians reinforcements haven't arrived yet... and you're already \
    out?\nWhat happened? Did you defeat them all?"
set key[id=1013232602004170] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1013232602004171] name "Phew... what a relief. They aren't even the Demon King's minions... and I \
    thought we were\nlosing the watchtower to a bunch of pigs. My heart nearly shrank to nothing. Thank you for \
    helping!"
set key[id=1013232602004172] name "Hey~ hey! You there!\nYou looked like you came out of $map:2000334$ just now... \
    What happened?"
set key[id=1013232602004173] name "(Tell about the herd of pigs that came rushing.)"
set key[id=1013232602004174] name "Hehe... so I guessed right... The way they were swarming this way was not \
    normal... \nThe one leading those pigs is called <font color=\"#ffd200\">Tabo</font>...\nHe was originally \
    raised on my pig farm!! \nA few years ago, he was one of the young\npigs that escaped when <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Baraha</font> wrecked our pig farm!"
set key[id=1013232602004175] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Baraha</font> was also lucky enough to escape and save \
    his life ten years or so ago on the way to the slaughterhouse,\nbut once those pigs escape, they ought to just \
    live on their own...\nThey always come back and cause trouble, the blasted things! "
set key[id=1013232602004176] name "What do you mean?"
set key[id=1013232602004177] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Tabo</font>, like Baraha before him, came back to the \
    pig farm not long ago and\nwrecked it. He's nastier than Baraha: whenever I tried to rebuild the farm,\nhe'd \
    come back and cause trouble again, and in the end I shut down the pig farm I'd built my whole life! "
set key[id=1013232602004178] name "I couldn't take it lying down, so I tracked the wild pig herd and ended up \
    here...\nHmm... <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:24001205$</font>! That vicious one never gives up a target \
    once he's set it.\nHe'll lead the herd back and attack the wall again! Maybe he's already back...\nIf you \
    don't believe me, go to $map:2000334$ and see for yourself.\nIf <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:24001205$</font> has returned... be sure to!! take him down!"
set key[id=1013232602004179] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:24001205$</font>! That vicious one never gives \
    up a target once he's set it.\nHe'll lead the herd back and attack the wall again! Maybe he's already \
    back...\nIf you don't believe me, go to $map:2000334$ and see for yourself.\nIf <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:24001205$</font> has returned... be sure to!! take him down!"
set key[id=1013232602004180] name "From that worn-out look, you've seen it with your own eyes, haven't you?\nHow \
    vicious $npcName:24001205$ really is..."
set key[id=1020163002004181] name "Hmm... They look somewhat like us, and yet somehow not...\nTheir clothes, their \
    air... I've never seen these people before... "
set key[id=1020163002004182] name "(Ask who he means.)"
set key[id=1020163002004183] name "Those strange people standing right in the middle of the residential area, \
    looking all around.\nI heard a big ship that had been drifting at sea recently came into \
    $map:2000062$...\nMight they be the people who came on that ship? Aren't you curious, $MyPCName$?\nGo say \
    hello and ask them casually where they're from."
set key[id=1020163002004184] name "Those strange people standing right in the middle of the residential area, \
    looking all around.\nI heard a big ship that had been drifting at sea recently came into \
    $map:2000062$...\nMight they be the people who came on that ship? Aren't you curious, $MyPCName$?\nGo say \
    hello and ask them casually where they're from."
set key[id=1020163002004185] name "Alalariyo~ You have a good face! Nice to meet you!\nThe people here all look \
    quite decent. I've got a good feeling~ "
set key[id=1020163002004186] name "(Ask where he's from and who he is.)"
set key[id=1020163002004187] name "Ah... We're the Allicari Merchant Society! We came from far beyond the sea.\nOn \
    the way home we strayed off course and wandered, and somehow found this new land!\nThe moment I spotted \
    $map:2000062$ over the bow, I cried out without thinking!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Horolai! Horolai!</font>\n"
set key[id=1020163002004188] name "(Ask what <font color=\"#ffd200\">Horolai</font> means.)"
set key[id=1020163002004189] name "Oh, that's a word from our homeland. \nYou could call it a cheer of joy when \
    you discover a new place. \nI never thought there'd be a place like this beyond that vast sea... heh heh... "
set key[id=1020163002004190] name "I don't know what led us all the way here, but surely there's something for us \
    to do here, too.\nBefore that, I'd like to get used to the culture and life here first. Please help me out a \
    lot.\n"
set key[id=1024110602005818] name "Hmm... <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>?\nIf you have a moment, could \
    you do me a small but important favor?"
set key[id=1024110602005819] name "It seems some nasty folks stole every chicken from the chicken farm,\nbut I \
    can't drag the vigilantes into a private favor...\nWould you help get Mr. $npcName:11001835[gender:0]$'s \
    chickens back?"
set key[id=1024110602005820] name "Thank you so much. For gladly taking on even my small, personal favor...\nIf \
    you ever need my help someday, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, just say so!"
set key[id=1024110602005821] name "What a commotion all over the place!"
set key[id=1024110602005822] name "That dark energy isn't only spreading here; it seems just as bad over by \
    $map:02000023$.\nI hear a fierce reaper has appeared near $map:02000023$ and is rampaging...\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, can you go and deal with it?"
set key[id=1024110602005823] name "You're back! Word of that guy being a tough opponent reached all the way \
    here...\nAs expected, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, you never let me down! Hahaha. "
set key[id=1024110602005824] name "Oh no... I heard the children who were playing in the $map:02000023$ forest \
    haven't come back in over half a day.\nThey might be lost in the forest, or have met a dangerous \
    beast...\nCould you go find the children and bring them back safely, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1024110602005825] name "Oh no... I heard the children who were playing in the $map:02000023$ forest \
    haven't come back in over half a day.\nThey might be lost in the forest, or have met a dangerous \
    beast...\nCould you go find the children and bring them back safely, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1024110602005826] name "Waaah! Everyone's safe, safe!\nWe were just playing hide and seek... I thought \
    I'd never see my friends again,\nyou have no idea how scared I was!"
set key[id=1024224802005833] name "Oh my... It's not the news I was waiting for...\nbut the eagles brought some \
    strange news."
set key[id=1024224802005834] name "They say there's a diary holding the secret of its true identity.\nThat ghost \
    pirate captain always carries it around... Aren't you curious?"
set key[id=1024224802005835] name "Wow...\nYou really found it?\nHmm... let's see... "
set key[id=1024224802005836] name "Oh... heavens...\nI sense a strange energy in the sky to the northwest. \
    Something ominous...\nIt would be best to look into it before something big happens."
set key[id=1024224802005837] name "Oh... heavens...\nI sense a strange energy in the sky to the northwest. \
    Something ominous...\nIt would be best to look into it before something big happens."
set key[id=1024224802005838] name "Oh... the ominous energy is gone.\nWhenever things like this happen, I receive \
    omens from the heavens.\nIt means someone high up in the sky is still watching over this world..."
set key[id=1024224802005839] name "Ahem...! I lost my composure for a moment... hmm.\nYou, head straight to that \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> or whatever <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000006[gender:0]$</font> \
    mentioned.\nFind everything that could be a clue to $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ or \
    $npc:11000069[gender:1]$.\nUnderstood?"
set key[id=1024224802005840] name "Ahem...! I lost my composure for a moment... hmm.\nYou, head straight to that \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Katramus</font> or whatever <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000006[gender:0]$</font> \
    mentioned.\nFind everything that could be a clue to $npc:11000064[gender:0]$ or \
    $npc:11000069[gender:1]$.\nUnderstood?"
set key[id=1024224802005841] name "Hmm... I don't know whether you came all this way to help because you trust me, \
    or whether you're still\nplaying $npc:11000044[gender:0]$'s lackey, but either way, you helped free the people \
    held here as slaves,\nso thank you."
set key[id=1024224802005842] name "Since we've come this far...\nwon't you lend us a hand in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$dungeonTitle:21017001$</font> too?"
set key[id=1024224802005843] name "Since we've come this far...\nwon't you lend us a hand in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$dungeonTitle:21017001$</font> too?"
set key[id=1024224802005844] name "Thanks, $MyPCName$!\nSomehow I never felt like you were an enemy from the first \
    time I saw you.\nWell... I still don't know whether your heart is with us or with $npc:11000044[gender:0]$... \
    "
set key[id=1024224802005845] name "Hey! <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>! Heard the rumor?\nA thief broke \
    into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000309$</font> and stole all the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Time \
    Keys</font>!\nI don't know who took them, but they must have gone to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$dungeonTitle:21008001$</font>!\nIt's the only place you can play with those. Hahaha."
set key[id=1024224802005846] name "Hey! <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>! Heard the rumor?\nA thief broke \
    into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000309$</font> and stole all the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Time \
    Keys</font>!\nI don't know who took them, but they must have gone to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$dungeonTitle:21008001$</font>!\nIt's the only place you can play with those. Hahaha."
set key[id=1024224802005847] name "Huh! What, how did you...? Where are you coming from?"
set key[id=1110210502005852] name "Someday, the Boroboro people will repay <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>'s kindness.\nUntil the day we meet again... could you keep it a secret \
    that you saw us here?\nWe still... must not let the world learn that we exist. Please."
set key[id=1111170102005856] name "Sure, I'll help."
set key[id=1111170102005857] name "Mr. $npcName:11001835[gender:0]$, who looked after me close by since I was \
    little, runs a small chicken farm\nin $map:02000087$. But a while ago the chickens started disappearing little \
    by little,\nand one day the chicken farm was totally empty. "
set key[id=1111170102005858] name "It seems some nasty folks stole every chicken from the chicken farm,\nbut I \
    can't drag the vigilantes into a private favor...\nWould you help get Mr. $npcName:11001835[gender:0]$'s \
    chickens back?"
set key[id=1111170102005859] name "What do you mean?"
set key[id=1111170102005860] name "That dark energy isn't only spreading here; it seems just as bad over by \
    $map:02000023$.\nI hear a fierce reaper has appeared near $map:02000023$ and is rampaging...\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, can you go and deal with it?"
set key[id=1111171602005861] name "Thank you so much for saving my friends!\nWhen I grow up, I'll be a cool fairy \
    like <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>!"
set key[id=1113133602005872] name "I promise I will never forget this kindness, and I will repay it someday."
set key[id=1113133602005873] name "Is there anything else I can help with?"
set key[id=1113133602005874] name "No, I can't impose on you any more than this.\nIf fate allows, we will meet \
    again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=1113133602005875] name "No, I can't impose on you any more than this.\nIf fate allows, we will meet \
    again someday. Thank you."
set key[id=1113133602005876] name "You're back? What happened to those pirates?\nYou should have smashed them so \
    they never pirate again. Haha"
set key[id=1113133602005877] name "(Tell about what happened in $map:02000063$.)"
set key[id=1113151102005902] name "What's the news?"
set key[id=1113151102005903] name "Far away on the seashore... um, at the sea, a place I've never \
    been,\nterrifying ghost pirates have appeared and everyone is gripped by fear.\nThey say an anglerfish captain \
    leads the ghost pirates... but nobody knows who he is.\nBut then!!"
set key[id=1113151102005904] name "But then...?"
set key[id=1113151102005905] name "They say there's a diary holding the secret of its true identity.\nThat ghost \
    pirate captain always carries it around... Aren't you curious?"
set key[id=1113151102005906] name "Ah... could this be true?\nThe ghost pirate is... a captain of a missing \
    ship...? "
set key[id=1113151102005907] name "There's no way to know."
set key[id=1113151102005908] name "Yes... I guess so...?\nThere's no such thing as certain truth or lies in this \
    world."
set key[id=1113151102005909] name "Since it's come to this, why don't you see it through with us?\nWe can sort out \
    our relationship afterward."
set key[id=1113151102005910] name "Well, who cares...\nThanks to you my old friends came back safe, so I owe you \
    for that alone...\nLet's hope for the day we can be each other's strength again!"
set key[id=1113151102005911] name "(Tell about what happened in $dungeonTitle:21008001$.)"
set key[id=1113151102005912] name "R-really?\nThe culprit was someone called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:22400062$</font>?"
set key[id=1113151102005913] name "Do you know that guy?"
set key[id=1113151102005914] name "Nah, know him? What do I know... I don't, I don't! Argh, what a waste!\nI \
    should've gone to $dungeonTitle:21008001$ and turned that guy into mush in one hit..."
set key[id=1127002402004415] name "Hmm... heh... this is something... \nI thought we'd stopped it all... but we \
    hadn't... "
set key[id=1127002402004416] name "What do you mean?"
set key[id=1127002402004417] name "Not long after the Blue Lapenta was broken, a huge stalk of darkness grew\nin \
    the middle of the $map:2000023$ forest.\nThat stalk spread through every corner of the forest, and \
    $map:2000023$ slowly lost its light of life\nin the deep darkness... "
set key[id=1127002402004418] name "If the many fairies hadn't bravely risked their lives back then, cut down the \
    stalk of darkness spreading in an instant,\nand purified the forest stained by darkness...\nneither \
    $map:2000023$ nor this world would exist today."
set key[id=1127002402004419] name "But... recently, the same phenomenon as when the stalk of darkness began has \
    been appearing\nall over this world... "
set key[id=1127002402004420] name "(Ask what phenomenon.)"
set key[id=1127002402004421] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Door</font>... they're almost all sealed and \
    gone now, but...\nwhen the Blue Lapenta was destroyed, passages leading to the Land of Darkness opened all \
    over the world.\nThe entrances are closed, but around them there are still monsters that crossed over \
    from\nthe Land of Darkness, carrying <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000435$</font>."
set key[id=1127002402004422] name "(Ask what $item:30000435$ is.)"
set key[id=1127002402004423] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000435$</font> is a flower that blooms on the \
    stalk of darkness, grown from a sprouted seed of darkness...\nAs time passes and more of the power of darkness \
    gathers, the flower bears a dark <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:90000014$</font>...\nand that holds another \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Seed of Darkness</font>... "
set key[id=1127002402004424] name "That's why <font color=\"#ffd200\">the purifying fairies everywhere are \
    gathering the $item:30000435$ dropped by the monsters\naround the Shadow Doors, lifting the darkness and \
    purifying it</font>.\nOnly then can we stop the dark $item:90000014$ from spreading through the \
    world...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000037[gender:1]$</font> is helping with that work too, so if you \
    want to lend a hand, go meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000037[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=1127002402004425] name "That's why <font color=\"#ffd200\">the purifying fairies everywhere are \
    gathering the $item:30000435$ dropped by the monsters\naround the Shadow Doors, lifting the darkness and \
    purifying it</font>.\nOnly then can we stop the dark $item:90000014$ from spreading through the \
    world...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000037[gender:1]$</font> is helping with that work too, so if you \
    want to lend a hand, go meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000037[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=1127002402004426] name "One, two, three, four... "
set key[id=1127002402004427] name "I want to help lift the darkness."
set key[id=1127002402004428] name "Ah!!! I forgot... sigh...\nNow I have to count again... Why did you talk to me \
    now... hmph... "
set key[id=1127002402004429] name "One, two, three... four... "
set key[id=1127002402004430] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Wait until the counting is done.)</font>"
set key[id=1127002402004431] name "Fifty-two!! Phew~ Done counting.\nWhy did you call me?"
set key[id=1127002402004432] name "I'll help gather $item:30000435$ and lift the darkness."
set key[id=1127002402004433] name "It was already hard for the fairies' power alone to stop it all... Thank \
    you!\nThe monsters that carry the energy of darkness and come up through the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow \
    Doors</font> are called <font color=\"#ffd200\">Harvi monsters</font>.\nEven if the host dies, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000435$</font> that's nearly in full bloom stays behind and tries\nto bear fruit. "
set key[id=1127002402004434] name "If you want to help, gather <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000435$</font> \
    that's nearly in full bloom and \nbring it to me, $MyPCName$.\nHmm... anything that can carry <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000435$</font> is probably as strong as you, $MyPCName$, or stronger.\nDon't let \
    your guard down, and be careful!"
set key[id=1127002402004435] name "If you want to help, gather <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000435$</font> \
    that's nearly in full bloom and \nbring it to me, $MyPCName$.\nHmm... anything that can carry <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000435$</font> is probably as strong as you, $MyPCName$, or stronger.\nDon't let \
    your guard down, and be careful!"
set key[id=1127002402004436] name "Oh! $MyPCName$!\nAre you all right? I never told you about the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Harvi Venom</font>...\nHarvi monsters keep spreading the energy of darkness until the very \
    moment they stop breathing.\nWe call that <font color=\"#ffd200\">Harvi Venom</font>... it's deadly if you're \
    infected... I was so worried... "
set key[id=1127002402004437] name "I'm fine."
set key[id=1127002402004438] name "Phew~ What a relief. And you gathered so much $item:30000435$, too... As \
    thanks, I'll give you $map:2000023$'s symbol of life,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:59200182$</font>. It will \
    help you grow into a stronger hero."
set key[id=1127002402004439] name "Hmm... this is something... In the end, it's come to this!\nI found a stalk of \
    darkness growing in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000048$</font>!\nThe energy of darkness is far stronger and \
    fiercer than the one that once grew and coiled around this $map:2000023$...\nThis time, the fairies' power \
    alone surely won't be enough to cut that darkness down.\n "
set key[id=1127002402004440] name "Cutting down that huge stalk of darkness, spreading in every direction in an \
    instant, is not something\nanyone can do alone. Only if we all gather our best strength, each as much as we \
    can,\ncan we stop the tragedy of darkness devouring this world.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, \
    please lend us your strength too.   "
set key[id=1127002402004441] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000048$</font> and meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001228[gender:1]$</font>, the purifying fairy\nguarding the entrance to the huge \
    stalk of darkness, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000350$</font>."
set key[id=1127002402004442] name "Only if we all gather our best strength, each as much as we can,\ncan we stop \
    the tragedy of darkness devouring this world.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, please lend us your \
    strength too.   \nGo to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000048$</font> and meet the purifying fairy <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001228[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=1127002402004443] name "Hm? You were sent by $npc:11000031[gender:0]$?\nHmm... We've never met, but... \
    I think I understand why $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ sent you here."
set key[id=1127002402004444] name "I think you, $MyPCName$... \ncould bear the weight of that deep darkness in \
    $map:2000350$."
set key[id=1127002402004445] name "You've probably already heard from $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$, but..\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000350$</font> is a <font color=\"#ffd200\">huge stalk of\ndarkness</font>, a passage \
    through which the darkness grown from the seed of darkness spreads.\nThe closer you get to its roots, the \
    thicker and stronger the darkness swirling around the Dark Stream is. "
set key[id=1127002402004446] name "Until now, many fairies and brave heroes like you, $MyPCName$, have leapt \
    without hesitation\ninto the deep darkness of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000350$</font>\nto stop that huge \
    stalk of darkness from spreading farther and wider.\nAnd the war against this great darkness is still going \
    on."
set key[id=1127002402004447] name "We don't know where the end of that darkness is, or what lies at its \
    end.\nBecause no one has ever gone all the way to the end.\nBut no one has despaired or given up, either. We \
    can't let the darkness\nswallow this world."
set key[id=1127002402004448] name "If we <font color=\"#ffd200\">keep fighting without giving up</font>, I believe \
    that someday <font color=\"#ffd200\">one of us will light a bright light\nat the end of that \
    darkness</font>.\nMaybe <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font> will be that one...\nWould you take the \
    first step today?"
set key[id=1127002402004449] name "If we <font color=\"#ffd200\">keep fighting without giving up</font>, I believe \
    that someday <font color=\"#ffd200\">one of us will light a bright light\nat the end of that \
    darkness</font>.\nMaybe <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font> will be that one...\nWould you take the \
    first step today?"
set key[id=1127002402004450] name "Oh my... look at all that sweat... Are you all right?\nAren't you hurt \
    anywhere?"
set key[id=1127002402004451] name "I'm fine."
set key[id=1127002402004452] name "I knew it... I knew you could do it, $MyPCName$.\nIt's your first challenge, \
    and picking <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:90000014$</font> in $map:2000350$ is no easy task."
set key[id=1127002402004453] name "(Ask what $item:90000014$ is used for.)"
set key[id=1127002402004454] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:90000014$</font> is the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fruit of darkness</font> that grows on the $item:30000435$ blooming with the energy of \
    darkness.\nInside this fruit grows the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seed</font> of darkness, the source of all this \
    darkness, and when that seed\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">sprouts</font> and puts down dark <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">roots</font>, a dark <font color=\"#ffd200\">stalk</font> spreads out... and along that \
    stalk,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000435$</font> becomes <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:90000014$</font> \
    again and again in a <font color=\"#ffd200\">cycle</font>\nas the power of darkness takes over this world... "
set key[id=1127002402004455] name "We lift the darkness from $item:30000435$ and $item:90000014$ and purify them \
    to stop thicker darkness\nfrom spreading through this world.\nAnd what's more... <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">purified $item:90000014$</font> is also <font color=\"#ffd200\">a medicine that can cure \
    those infected with Harvi Venom</font>.\nThat's exactly <font color=\"#ffd200\">why I collect \
    $item:90000014$</font>."
set key[id=1127002402004456] name "If you give me the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:90000014$</font> you have, \
    $MyPCName$, I'll give you the <font color=\"#ffd200\">treasures\nthe fairies have kept dear</font> in return."
set key[id=1127002402004468] name "$MyPCName$, you're here.\nI was wondering how you were doing... I'm glad you \
    look healthy.\nHave you met $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$ lately...?\nI heard a strange rumor... "
set key[id=1127002402004469] name "What rumor?"
set key[id=1127002402004470] name "Not long ago... I met a wanderer who had been to the Land of Darkness.\nHe said \
    that in $map:3000103$, a young man who looks like $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$ has been going around\nlooking \
    for $npcName:11000044[gender:0]$.\nJust in case, I sent someone to $map:2000228$ to check on how \
    $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$ is doing... "
set key[id=1127002402004471] name "They said $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$ had left, saying there was somewhere to \
    go.\nSomehow I have a bad feeling... \nCould you go to $map:3000103$ in the Land of Darkness and find out \
    whether what the wanderer said is true?"
set key[id=1127002402004472] name "Somehow I have a bad feeling... \nCould you go to $map:3000103$ in the Land of \
    Darkness and find out whether what the wanderer said is true?"
set key[id=1127002402004473] name "Hm? What's this now...\nHeh heh heh... little one... you look delicious~"
set key[id=1127002402004474] name "Wahahahahahaha... It's a joke, so don't look at me with those startled rabbit \
    eyes.\nI'm full right now, so come back when I'm hungry."
set key[id=1127002402004475] name "I said I'm not hungry... why do you keep hanging around?"
set key[id=1127002402004476] name "(Ask whether he has seen $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$ here.)"
set key[id=1127002402004477] name "$npcName:11000064[gender:0]$?\nWho's that? What does he look like? Does he look \
    tasty? "
set key[id=1127002402004478] name "(Describe what $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$ looks like.)"
set key[id=1127002402004479] name "Ah, that yellow-haired kid... I saw him!\nHe jumped fearlessly into <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000349$</font>, you know."
set key[id=1127002402004480] name "(Ask what <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000349$</font> is.)"
set key[id=1127002402004481] name "When the seed of darkness sprouts and puts down roots deep in the endless \
    darkness...\nthey say a new son of the Demon King is born.\nThat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000349$</font> \
    has taken root here. Heh heh heh."
set key[id=1127002402004482] name "That $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$ fellow...\nhe may already be wrapped in the \
    energy of darkness and out of his mind...\nIf you're curious, go into $map:2000349$ yourself... heh heh... "
set key[id=1127002402004483] name "That $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$ fellow...\nhe may already be wrapped in the \
    energy of darkness and out of his mind...\nIf you're curious, go into $map:2000349$ yourself... heh heh... "
set key[id=1127002402004484] name "$MyPCName$!\nWhat happened? Look at you... did something happen?"
set key[id=1127002402004485] name "(Tell about what happened in $map:2000349$.)"
set key[id=1127002402004486] name "Wh-what? \n$npcName:11000044[gender:0]$ was reborn as the Demon King's son... "
set key[id=1127002402004487] name "Is $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$ safe?\nHe must have gone knowing \
    $npcName:11000044[gender:0]$ was there...\nWhy would he go there alone, so recklessly... that's not like \
    him... hmm... "
set key[id=1127002402004488] name "That boy... must have gone back to $map:2000228$ where \
    $npcName:11000069[gender:1]$ is.\nI wonder if he's hurt anywhere...\nGo to $map:2000228$, give this \
    $item:30000434$ to $npcName:11000064[gender:0]$, and find out what made him\nact so recklessly."
set key[id=1127002502004415] name "It doesn't look like you've been already... why have you come back?"
set key[id=1127002502004416] name "I forgot and left the $item:30000434$ behind."
set key[id=1127002502004417] name "(Say I took a wrong turn for a moment.)"
set key[id=1127002502004418] name "Here, I'll give it to you again... Take good care of it this time."
set key[id=1127002502004419] name "Hm? There's the scent of $item:30000434$ coming from your bag...?\nTake another \
    good look."
set key[id=1127002502004420] name "Your bag looks heavy.\nHow can you go a long way like that... You should tidy \
    up your bag first."
set key[id=1127002502004421] name "The terrain here is rugged and complicated... that can happen...\nTravel \
    safely."
set key[id=1127002502004422] name "$MyPCName$!\nThank you so much for helping me in $map:2000349$. I'm always in \
    your debt."
set key[id=1127002502004423] name "(Ask why he went into $map:2000349$ alone.)"
set key[id=1127002502004424] name "It was a trap...\n$npcName:11000044[gender:0]$... that guy sent word that he \
    was holding Grandfather... that if I wanted to save him,\nI should come to that place... $map:2000349$, and \
    tell no one."
set key[id=1127002502004425] name "(Ask whether he means the Hermit.)"
set key[id=1127002502004426] name "Yes, that's right.\nWhen I left $map:2000306$, I left a small token with \
    Grandfather.\nOnly Grandfather and I knew about it... and $npcName:11000044[gender:0]$ sent it to me...\nThe \
    moment I saw it, I had no room to doubt or think."
set key[id=1127002502004427] name "Only after I went into $map:2000349$ did I realize.\nThat everything was a \
    scheme $npcName:11000044[gender:0]$ cooked up to settle the grudge he holds against me...\nOnce the truth came \
    out, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000044[gender:0]$</font> fled, swallowed the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">seed of darkness</font> he got from <font color=\"#ffd200\">Turka</font>,\nand came back as \
    a true demon."
set key[id=1127002502004428] name "If you hadn't come and helped me then... phew... thank you so much.\nBut how \
    did you know to come there?"
set key[id=1127002502004429] name "(Tell him how $npcName:11000407[gender:0]$ sent me.)"
set key[id=1127002502004430] name "Ah... I see...\nI'll go to $map:2000306$ myself and see Grandfather. Thank you, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1127002502004431] name "Sob... sob... \nI ran away alone... all alone... "
set key[id=1127002502004432] name "What do you mean?"
set key[id=1127002502004433] name "Actually... I slipped away without telling the chief, and when the other \
    fairies said they were exploring $map:3000103$,\nI followed... and then we all got scattered in \
    $map:3000103$...\nIt was because of that scary witch... I think she might have eaten them all... "
set key[id=1127002502004434] name "Oh... what if the witch really ate them all... \nOh... what if I'm the only one \
    who survived and ran away... oh... what do I do... \nCould you please go to $map:3000103$ in the Land of \
    Darkness, $MyPCName$, and find\nthe fairies who were with me?"
set key[id=1127002502004435] name "Could you please go to $map:3000103$ in the Land of Darkness, $MyPCName$, and \
    find\nthe fairies who were with me?"
set key[id=1127002502004436] name "Oh, for goodness' sake... noisy again!!!\nWhy are there so many pests around \
    lately! Get lost!"
set key[id=1127002502004437] name "Hm? You don't take my words seriously, do you?\nDo you really have to be taught \
    a lesson? Won't you vanish from my sight right now?"
set key[id=1127002502004438] name "(Ask where the forest fairies are.)"
set key[id=1127002502004439] name "The fairies? Ah~ you mean those noisy little brats?\nHeh heh heh heh... they \
    were so noisy that I sent them into $map:2000349$.\nWhen they trembled in fear at the sight of me, I told them \
    it was a shortcut home, and they went into $map:2000349$\nwithout even looking back! Heh heh heh heh... "
set key[id=1127002502004440] name "By now, they've probably had their souls stolen by the newly born son of the \
    Demon King in $map:2000349$\nand been broken, shackled in darkness... Heh heh heh heh... \nIf you're curious, \
    go into $map:2000349$ and check yourself~ Heh heh heh... "
set key[id=1127002502004441] name "By now, they've probably had their souls stolen by the newly born son of the \
    Demon King in $map:2000349$\nand been broken, shackled in darkness... Heh heh heh heh... \nIf you're curious, \
    go into $map:2000349$ and check yourself~ Heh heh heh... "
set key[id=1127002502004442] name "Hmph! Not bad!\nI thought they'd all been swept up in the whirlpool of darkness \
    and lost their lives... and you saved them all... "
set key[id=1127002502004443] name "Hmm... From the look of you... you have quite a bit of skill and a strong \
    stomach, too...\nWhy don't we make a deal?"
set key[id=1127002502004444] name "What kind of deal?"
set key[id=1127002502004445] name "They said that when the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seed of darkness</font> sprouts \
    and puts down roots, a new son of the Demon King will be born.\nThere must be a new son of the Demon King in \
    that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000349$</font>... who on earth could it be?\nI'm dying of curiosity... "
set key[id=1127002502004446] name "If you go all the way to the end of $map:2000349$, find out who the newly born \
    son of the Demon King is,\nand tell me, I'll hand over my own treasure chest that I especially cherish.\nWell? \
    Tempting, isn't it?"
set key[id=1127002502004447] name "If you go all the way to the end of $map:2000349$, find out who the newly born \
    son of the Demon King is,\nand tell me, I'll hand over my own treasure chest that I especially cherish.\nWell? \
    Tempting, isn't it?"
set key[id=1127002502004448] name "Oh my? Hohohohohoho~ You came back alive...\nHow unexpected! Heh heh heh... So, \
    did you find out who the new son of the Demon King is?"
set key[id=1127002502004449] name "(Say it was $npcName:11000044[gender:0]$ and tell what happened with him.)"
set key[id=1127002502004450] name "Oho... so that's how it was?\nHmm... The seed of darkness... seems to have \
    found the right master... Heh heh heh... "
set key[id=1208001202004451] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font>... doesn't come... why...\nNoisy here... \
    Boom! Thud! Bang! Ba-da-da-bam! Hurts... ears...\nDifferent. <font color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar</font> is...!"
set key[id=1208001202004452] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Allicari Merchant Society</font> friends know. Maybe \
    so.\nThey find <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001274[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=1208001202004453] name "Huh? Who?"
set key[id=1208001202004454] name "Anyway, if you want to know more about <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font>, go \
    ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001181[gender:0]$</font>.\nHe was the closest to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> in our Allicari Merchant Society, after all."
set key[id=1208001202004455] name "Anyway, if you want to know more about <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font>, go \
    ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001181[gender:0]$</font>.\nHe was the closest to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> in our Allicari Merchant Society, after all."
set key[id=1208001202004456] name "Huh? <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001274[gender:0]$</font> is looking for \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font>?\nWhere is $npcName:11001274[gender:0]$ right now?"
set key[id=1208001202004457] name "Actually, a few days ago I got a letter from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font>.\nIt said he thinks he can find a way back to our homeland... that he'd be back \
    soon, so please\nlook after $npcName:11001274[gender:0]$... "
set key[id=1208001202004458] name "It was supposed to be sent by someone named <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000994[gender:0]$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000062$</font>.\nIf \
    anyone, that person might know where <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> went, right?\nWell... if you slip \
    them about <font color=\"#ffd200\">500 mesos</font>, they'd probably tell you right away... "
set key[id=1208001202004459] name "Huh? Who are you looking for?"
set key[id=1209012002004460] name "(Ask who Bomar and Carcar are.)"
set key[id=1209012002004461] name "Who... what...? Don't know...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> didn't \
    teach me. That word!\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> went. Took a taxi... looking for a way. Said he's \
    going back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar</font>.  "
set key[id=1209012002004462] name "But he doesn't come. Don't know. Where he is.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Allicari \
    Merchant Society</font> friends know. Maybe so. \nThey find <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001274[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=1209012002004463] name "(Ask whether he knows <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font>.)"
set key[id=1209012002004464] name "Ah~ <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font>...!\nSure. <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> is an <font color=\"#ffd200\">Allicari Merchant Society member</font> too. He \
    came here with us... \nHe said he had to get back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar</font> fast and vanished, \
    taking $npcName:11001274[gender:0]$ with him. "
set key[id=1209012002004465] name "(Ask where <font color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar</font> is.)"
set key[id=1209012002004466] name "Ah~ the place we used to live...\nIt's our original homeland, before we drifted \
    over the sea and reached here. \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar Island</font>... a desert wider than the sea, \
    and in the middle of it a shiny\ntall building standing high... Hmm~ now that I say it, I kind of want to go \
    back, too... "
set key[id=1209012002004467] name "Nah~ no, no.\nStill, this place is more exciting for me for now. So much to \
    see, so many new things... "
set key[id=1209012002004468] name "He's behind the taxi stop."
set key[id=1209012002004469] name "No, I've been looking for ages... why didn't I see him...\nSigh~ that \
    $npcName:11001274[gender:0]$... "
set key[id=1209012002004470] name "(Ask whether he can tell where the letter came from.)"
set key[id=1209012002004471] name "It was supposed to be sent by someone named <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000994[gender:0]$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000062$</font>.\nThey \
    say that person earns money taking care of all sorts of odd requests in that town, so I\nthink they probably \
    mailed the letter on Bomar's behalf. "
set key[id=1209012002004472] name "(Say I'm looking for Bomar.)"
set key[id=1209012002004473] name "Ah~ right, his name was Bomar, of course.\nWe call him the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar Flower Boy</font>~ Hohoho~\nBut who are you, coming all this way looking for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font>? "
set key[id=1209012002004474] name "(Explain how I came to look for Bomar.)"
set key[id=1209012002004475] name "Heh~ I see.\nWe don't know why <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> is so \
    determined to go back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar Island</font>, either.\nOnly <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001276[gender:0]$</font> knows. After hearing Bomar's story, he dropped \
    everything and came\nall the way here, and now he's clinging to nothing but <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Floaty</font>."
set key[id=1209012002004476] name "(Ask what <font color=\"#ffd200\">Floaty</font> is.)"
set key[id=1209012002004477] name "Ah~ it's an <font color=\"#ffd200\">airship</font> fitted with a route detector \
    for <font color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar Island</font>.\nWe call it that because it puffs up and floats around in a \
    strangely cute way.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> took it just now, too..."
set key[id=1209012002004478] name "(Ask whether he went to Carcar Island.)"
set key[id=1209012002004479] name "Hmm... well... I wonder if it worked and he arrived safely this time...\nIt's \
    kept failing until now. Is it the detector, or Floaty itself...\nor maybe the unknown power of the deep sea \
    that blocked the sea route has blocked the sky route too...\nAnyway, every time, soon after taking off, \
    splash, splash into the sea!"
set key[id=1209012002004480] name "I've lost count of how many times.\nI rode it once myself... phew... I nearly \
    got pickled in seawater like kimchi cabbage.\nStill, <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> never gets tired: \
    rides, falls in, rides again...\nThere must really be something he can't do without going to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar Island</font>."
set key[id=1209012002004481] name "Normally it'd be about time he fell in the sea and came back for another \
    go...\nSomehow today... hmm... could it have worked?"
set key[id=1209215302004482] name "If anyone, that person might know where <font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font> \
    went, right?\nWell... if you slip them about <font color=\"#ffd200\">500 mesos</font>, they'd probably tell \
    you right away... "
set key[id=1209215302004483] name "Hm? What is it?"
set key[id=1209215302004484] name "(Ask whether he knows Bomar.)"
set key[id=1209215302004485] name "Hmm... well... you could say I know him... or I don't...\nWith empty hands and \
    an empty mouth, my head just isn't running well, you know... "
set key[id=1209215302004488] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Bomar</font>... hmm... let me see...\nAh~ I remember! \
    \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001276[gender:0]$</font> and his assistants boarded a ship, saying they'd \
    find that <font color=\"#ffd200\">Carcar</font>, or Carry-carry, or whatever,\nand that's what they called the \
    little young man they brought along!"
set key[id=1209215302004489] name "(Ask where the ship was headed.)"
set key[id=1209215302004490] name "$map:2000183$!!\nThat route is under a navigation ban, so in principle civilian \
    ships can't sail it...\nbut I took special care and arranged a stowaway passage.\nAt a very cheap price~ Heh \
    heh heh. "
set key[id=1209215302004491] name "If you ever think of stowing away to $map:2000183$, tell me.\nI'll arrange it \
    nicely for a cheap price."
set key[id=1209215302004492] name "If you ever think of stowing away to $map:2000183$, tell me.\nI'll arrange it \
    nicely for a cheap price."

# Quest dialogue of the no-feature chapters 1074-3013 quests that no pack has in English (no feature tag): our own
# English for the 959 scriptquest rows of locale KR (or no locale) whose quest a player can get (94 quests), with
# each row's own format fields, font tags and line breaks; the player's lines are first-person choices.
file Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml kms:Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml 032f90f7273bbe7d
set key[id=516131203002254] name "I was waiting because you should have arrived by now."
set key[id=516131203002255] name "I have news for you, $MyPCName$.\nOf course I'm curious how you've been, but \
    I'll ask about that later.\nFirst, let me tell you the urgent news."
set key[id=516131203002256] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001563[gender:0]$</font> sent word that \
    they're coming back.\nBut I thought they'd come straight here, and instead they said they had something to \
    find\nand are heading straight to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000021$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002257] name "I haven't heard the details yet either, but the fact that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001563[gender:0]$</font>,\nafter returning for the first time in so long, went \
    straight to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000021$</font>\nmust mean the situation isn't good at all... \
    Hmm..."
set key[id=516131203002258] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, why don't you go and see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001563[gender:0]$</font>?\nI bet $npcName:11001563[gender:0]$ will be glad to see \
    how dignified you've become.\nOf course, they'd never show it~"
set key[id=516131203002259] name "I think $npcName:11001563[gender:0]$ should have arrived by now.\nCome on~ Go to \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000021$</font> and meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001563[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002260] name "Why are you still here?\nGo to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000021$</font> and \
    meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001563[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002261] name "Ah, you've arrived.\nI'm glad to see a dear family member after so long, but \
    this is a bad time.\nFor now, come this way. "
set key[id=516131203002262] name "So, how have you been?\nIt feels like only yesterday you were full of pointless \
    rivalry,\nand seeing how dignified you've become fills my heart with warmth."
set key[id=516131203002263] name "Oh, right! Have you heard anything from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001567[gender:0]$</font>?\nI sent word to $npcName:11001567[gender:0]$ to put \
    together the <font color=\"#ffd200\">ancient books</font>\nand an <font color=\"#ffd200\">expedition</font> \
    and come to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Victoria Island</font>."
set key[id=516131203002264] name "News from <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001567[gender:0]$</font>?\nI just \
    got word that not long ago <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001567[gender:0]$</font> formed an expedition, \
    loaded up with ancient books,\nand set out from Kalib Island."
set key[id=516131203002265] name "According to the message, the ancient books can't be teleported by the power of \
    runes,\nso they have to travel by sea.\nIt's $npcName:11001567[gender:0]$'s plan to go straight from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002266] name "Why do we have to go to $map:02000023$?"
set key[id=516131203002267] name "He said we need the help of the fairies of $map:02000023$ to decipher the \
    records in the ancient books\nand find the true legacy our ancestors left. He added that they're said to have \
    shared a <font color=\"#ffd200\">special friendship</font>\nwith our ancestors, so we can expect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">positive help</font> from them."
set key[id=516131203002268] name "According to the message from $npcName:11001567[gender:0]$, the ancient books \
    can't be teleported by the power of runes,\nso they have to travel by sea.\nIt's \
    $npcName:11001567[gender:0]$'s plan to go straight from <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002269] name "Ah, then that's a relief.\nI should tell $npcName:11001564[gender:1]$ to hurry \
    and get ready to leave.\nI think it would be best to go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font> in \
    person and welcome $npcName:11001567[gender:0]$ and the expedition."
set key[id=516131203002272] name "No, I have something else to ask of you.\nWhile $npcName:11001564[gender:1]$ and \
    I are away, go and pay a visit to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001304[gender:0]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002273] name "Tell $npcName:11001573[gender:0]$ about the overall situation we've gathered so \
    far regarding <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001231[gender:0]$</font> and the news\nof the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Ultimate Secret Art</font>, and ask whether they can lend us their strength."
set key[id=516131203002274] name "(Ask whether he thinks the fairies of $map:02000023$ will help us.)"
set key[id=516131203002275] name "They say there was a <font color=\"#ffd200\">sacred covenant</font> between the \
    clan of rune sorcerers that <font color=\"#ffd200\">Jibrita</font>, founder of Terunkalib, belonged to,\nand \
    the fairies of $map:02000023$. Of course, nobody knows in detail\nwhen that covenant was made or what it \
    contained."
set key[id=516131203002276] name "What's more, there was no reason for us Runeblades, who have lived cut off from \
    the outside world, to meet the fairies of\n$map:02000023$, so it was forgotten before we knew it."
set key[id=516131203002277] name "(Ask how he knows about that covenant from the past.)"
set key[id=516131203002278] name "I recall <font color=\"#ffd200\">Arazad</font> telling me about it once. My \
    guess is...\nthat covenant was a kind of <font color=\"#ffd200\">alliance</font> ritual between <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Terunkalib</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002279] name "But since it was only handed down by word of mouth...\nI worry that there may be \
    no one left who remembers this covenant."
set key[id=516131203002280] name "Before, I wouldn't even have thought about a covenant that might not even be \
    true.\nBut now that the situation has changed so suddenly, checking whether the covenant is genuine\nis well \
    worth considering."
set key[id=516131203002281] name "So go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and pay a visit to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001304[gender:0]$</font>.\nI trust you'll conduct yourself well, but no rash \
    behavior. Understood?"
set key[id=516131203002282] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> and pay a visit to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000031[gender:0]$</font>. "
set key[id=516131203002283] name "Welcome, descendant of my old friends.\nWhat brings you all the way here?"
set key[id=516131203002284] name "(Convey your master's wishes and tell him about the covenant.)"
set key[id=516131203002285] name "Hmm... So the time has finally come to keep the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">covenant</font> with <font color=\"#ffd200\">Jibrita</font>...\nWhen you asked about the \
    covenant, I saw worry and distrust filling your eyes.\nBut don't worry. The thread of fate has indeed led you \
    down the right path."
set key[id=516131203002286] name "(Say you'd like to hear the covenant in detail.)"
set key[id=516131203002287] name "Long ago, when forces of evil rose up and threw the world into chaos, even the \
    lush forest of\n$map:02000023$ could not escape the <font color=\"#ffd200\">shadow of darkness</font>. We \
    barely got through those hard times,\nbut the sacred forest lost its vitality, and in the end the shadow of \
    darkness was never lifted."
set key[id=516131203002288] name "To repay the hearts of those who devoted themselves to Ellinia expecting nothing \
    in return,\nwe made one <font color=\"#ffd200\">promise</font>: that whenever Ellinia needed help, we would be \
    ready\nto extend a hand. That is our <font color=\"#ffd200\">sacred covenant</font>.\n"
set key[id=516131203002289] name "(Say that now is exactly when help is needed.)"
set key[id=516131203002290] name "Don't worry. The fairies of Ellinia never break what they have sworn.\nBy the \
    way... how is Jibrita? The last I heard, the child had <font color=\"#ffd200\">founded</font>\nan organization \
    called <font color=\"#ffd200\">Terunkalib</font> together with <font color=\"#ffd200\">a swordsman</font>."
set key[id=516131203002291] name "(Briefly explain the history of Terunkalib.)"
set key[id=516131203002292] name "Hmm... I see. So enough years have passed for that child to close their eyes for \
    good.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Jibrita</font> was born with natural talent... What a shame."
set key[id=516131203002293] name "Heh heh, this old man got lost in sentiment and talked too much.\nNow then, \
    where is the one called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001563[gender:0]$</font> at the moment?"
set key[id=516131203002294] name "(Answer that your master and the others went to $map:02000063$.)"
set key[id=516131203002295] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font>...  Why on earth did they end up \
    going there?\nThat sea is plagued by ruthless pirates who treat the rough waters like their own backyard,\nso \
    arriving safely by ship...\nis truly difficult unless you're born sailors."
set key[id=516131203002296] name "Hmm... There's no time to waste.\nHurry to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font>, find your companions and make sure they're safe,\nthen all of you \
    come back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> together."
set key[id=516131203002297] name "Hmm... There's no time to waste.\nHurry to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000063$</font>, find your companions and make sure they're safe,\nthen all of you \
    come back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> together."
set key[id=516131203002298] name "To be beaten like this by mere pirates...  I can't believe it.\nAnd even the \
    books are gone... We must find both the pirates and the books, no matter what!"
set key[id=516131203002300] name "For now, I'll leave this place to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001566[gender:1]$</font>.\nWe must hurry before our brothers suffer something \
    worse!"
set key[id=516131203002301] name "Don't worry, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>.\nI'll guard this place, \
    so go and follow $npcName:11001565[gender:0]$ quickly!"
set key[id=516131203002303] name "Don't worry, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>.\nI'll guard this place, \
    so go and follow $npcName:11001565[gender:0]$ quickly!"
set key[id=516131203002304] name "Ugh... Damn it... "
set key[id=516131203002305] name "$MyPCName$, to think we'd have this reunion with me in such a state...\nUgh... I \
    fell right into their trap."
set key[id=516131203002306] name "(Urge him not to move.) "
set key[id=516131203002307] name "Right now, go to $npcName:11001565[gender:0]$ rather than me...\nThose \
    pirates... are no pushovers...!!"
set key[id=516131203002309] name "Right now, go to $npcName:11001565[gender:0]$ rather than me...\nThose \
    pirates... are no pushovers...!!"
set key[id=516131203002310] name "Hmm... This is troubling."
set key[id=516131203002311] name "(Pass on the favorable answer from $npcName:11001573[gender:0]$, whom you met \
    earlier.)"
set key[id=516131203002312] name "Contrary to what I feared, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">covenant</font> with \
    $map:02000023$ was real.\nA blessing in disguise. Given how urgent things are, there's no time to deliberate \
    over every little thing now. "
set key[id=516131203002313] name "$MyPCName$, go back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>, see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001573[gender:0]$</font>,\nand ask for help."
set key[id=516131203002316] name "I'll stay here with my brothers and deal with the damage... "
set key[id=516131203002317] name "$MyPCName$, go back to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>, see <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001573[gender:0]$</font>,\nand ask for help."
set key[id=516131203002318] name "I was just worrying because we hadn't heard anything since you left...\nI'm so \
    glad you made it back safely."
set key[id=516131203002319] name "So, did everyone come together?"
set key[id=516131203002320] name "(Tell him what happened in $map:02000063$.)"
set key[id=516131203002321] name "Hmm... So what we feared has come to pass. But don't worry too much.\nI'll send \
    fairies there to help your companions."
set key[id=516131203002322] name "$MyPCName$, you look quite exhausted yourself.\nYou should rest and recover \
    first."
set key[id=516131203002323] name "As it happens, there's a fairy who can help you recover quickly.\nGo and find \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcFunction:11000029[gender:1]$ $npcName:11000029[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002324] name "As it happens, there's a fairy who can help you recover quickly.\nGo and find \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcFunction:11000029[gender:1]$ $npcName:11000029[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002325] name "I was waiting for you, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=516131203002326] name "I heard from $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ that the <font color=\"#ffd200\">heirs \
    of the runes</font> came to $map:02000023$ asking for help.\nWe young fairies don't know exactly about the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">covenant</font> from the past,\nbut\nall the fairies here know that they're the kind \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">benefactors</font> who protected $map:02000023$."
set key[id=516131203002327] name "Here, take this.\nIt will surely help you recover your weary body and mind. "
set key[id=516131203002328] name "Oh! W-wait a moment! Shh~"
set key[id=516131203002329] name "Did you see the fireflies that just visited? Hee hee~\nThey must have been \
    fireflies carrying a light of hope, because they brought news\nthat will make <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font> happy."
set key[id=516131203002330] name "(Ask what story.)"
set key[id=516131203002331] name "The news is that your Runeblade companions have just reached the dimensional \
    barrier\nwhere Einos is. Thank goodness. Really, thank goodness!"
set key[id=516131203002332] name "Your companions seem to be hurt worse than expected, so <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000032[gender:0]$</font>\nare healing them at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000179$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002334] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000179$</font> is filled with the sacred energy \
    flowing from the Lapenta of Life,\nso everyone should recover quickly.\nHurry and go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000179$</font>~\n"
set key[id=516131203002335] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000179$</font> is filled with the sacred energy \
    flowing from the Lapenta of Life,\nso everyone should recover quickly.\nHurry and go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000179$</font>~\n"
set key[id=516131203002336] name "You've come, $MyPCName$.\nWe all managed to make it here safely together.\nIt's \
    thanks to the consideration of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001573[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002337] name "$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ says that for our sake, besides deciphering the \
    books, he will send us the Guardians of\n$map:02000023$ to reinforce our forces. "
set key[id=516131203002338] name "$MyPCName$, do you know what this means?\nIt is hope. We are people who cannot \
    stop... and rest.\nEven if our brothers fall, and no matter what trials block the path we must take...\nwe \
    must never forget why we left our homeland and are here."
set key[id=516131203002339] name "Hearing the majestic voices of the Runeblades, I'm relieved that the injuries I \
    feared\nseem to be healing faster than I expected."
set key[id=516131203002342] name "Get permission to enter the palace from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> in $map:02000001$,\nand pay a visit to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000075[gender:1]$</font>. "
set key[id=516131203002343] name "Protecting the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Ultimate Secret Art</font> isn't only the \
    goal of the Runeblades.\nWhen sacred power is unleashed by the wrong hands, it can in turn give rise to\na \
    darker and mightier force in the grip of yet another evil. "
set key[id=516131203002344] name "To prevent such a misfortune, not only the Runeblades and Ellinia but all \
    forces\nmust form an <font color=\"#ffd200\">alliance</font>. For that, we have to tell <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000075[gender:1]$</font> about this\nand $npcName:11000075[gender:1]$ must issue an \
    emergency summons."
set key[id=516131203002345] name "Get permission to enter the palace from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> in $map:02000001$\nand pay a visit to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000075[gender:1]$</font>.\nThere's no more time to waste, so please hurry there and \
    back."
set key[id=516131203002346] name "Get permission to enter the palace from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> in $map:02000001$,\nand pay a visit to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000075[gender:1]$</font>. "
set key[id=516131203002347] name "What is it?\nYou seem restless and urgent somehow."
set key[id=516131203002348] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000031[gender:0]$</font> asked for an \
    emergency summons?\nSomething urgent must have come up. I'll hear the details later, but\nfor now go to the \
    palace and see the Empress. I grant you entry to the palace."
set key[id=516131203002349] name "Something urgent must have come up. I'll hear the details later, but\nfor now go \
    to the palace and see the Empress. I grant you entry to the palace."
set key[id=516131203002350] name "It's been a while, $MyPCName$.\nI'm glad to see you looking more dignified and \
    strong."
set key[id=516131203002351] name "What brings you here?"
set key[id=516131203002352] name "(Convey the wishes of $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=516131203002353] name "Hmm... $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ has never requested a summons this urgently \
    before...\nHearing this, it must be an occasion that calls for an important decision."
set key[id=516131203002354] name "Very well, then. As $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ requested, I will issue an \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">emergency summons</font>\nto the representatives of each guardian force. It may be \
    good to review\nthe current situation once more with everyone gathered."
set key[id=516131203002355] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, please go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> first and hold your place."
set key[id=516131203002356] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, please go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000026$</font> first and hold your place."
set key[id=516131203002357] name "Ah, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>!\nI heard about what happened at \
    the banquet hall."
set key[id=516131203002358] name "The Empress will also step forward and persuade the other forces, so there \
    will\nbe good results soon."
set key[id=516131203002359] name "Would you also try persuading the other forces yourself\nso they can join the \
    expedition, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=516131203002360] name "Please go and meet Blackeye, who leads the Humblis.\nMost Assassins follow him, \
    so if you earn his trust...\nyou'll be able to get the Assassins' help!"
set key[id=516131203002361] name "Please go and find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000208$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002362] name "Please go and meet Blackeye, who leads the Humblis.\nMost Assassins follow him, \
    so if you earn his trust...\nyou'll be able to get the Assassins' help!"
set key[id=516131203002363] name "What's this? Do you think this is a playground anyone can walk into and mess \
    around in?\nGo home."
set key[id=516131203002364] name "What, an expedition?\nI heard <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000051[gender:1]$</font> already came back after laying out the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Assassins' position</font> in full.\nDo you still have something to say? "
set key[id=516131203002365] name "Besides, just as you have something you must protect, we too\nare on an \
    important and urgent mission. To make matters worse, one of our agents on an infiltration mission\nwas pursued \
    while leaving their hideout and is now stranded in the city sewers. "
set key[id=516131203002366] name "(Say you'll help with the mission to rescue the stranded Humblis agent.)"
set key[id=516131203002367] name "It's not something you can say so lightly. The Black Star Society is a \
    cell-based network\nspread across all of Kerning City, far wider than you think, so shaking off\ntheir pursuit \
    is not as easy as it sounds."
set key[id=516131203002368] name "(Say you've succeeded in an infiltration mission against the Black Star Society \
    before.)"
set key[id=516131203002369] name "Hmm... Fine. All right.\nI don't know whether you can really finish this mission \
    safely, but I'll let you try.\nHowever, even if you can't get out of there, the Humblis can't\nguarantee your \
    safety. Can you still do it?"
set key[id=516131203002370] name "(Say you'll complete the mission and bring the Humblis agent back without fail.) \
    "
set key[id=516131203002371] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000027$</font> right now.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000051[gender:1]$</font> should be carrying out a mission there. Help \
    $npcName:11000051[gender:1]$ <font color=\"#ffd200\">rescue</font>\nthe stranded <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humblis agent</font> and come back."
set key[id=516131203002372] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000027$</font> right now.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000051[gender:1]$</font> should be carrying out a mission there. Help \
    $npcName:11000051[gender:1]$ <font color=\"#ffd200\">rescue</font>\nthe stranded <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Humblis agent</font> and come back."
set key[id=516131203002373] name "Not bad.\nTruth is, when I first sent you there, I was counting on \
    $npcName:11000051[gender:1]$ and not you,\nbut that prickly <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000051[gender:1]$</font> didn't hold back in praising you. "
set key[id=516131203002374] name "As you well know, the Assassin Alliance acts more secretively\neven compared to \
    the other guardian forces. The Humblis most of all. "
set key[id=516131203002375] name "By nature, we neither seek help from other forces nor do anything\nespecially \
    beneficial for them. We simply stay devoted to what we can do\nand what we must do, by our own judgment. "
set key[id=516131203002376] name "However, the courage and spirit you showed me today, and the way you tried \
    to\nprotect your fellow Runeblades, left quite an impression on me too."
set key[id=516131203002377] name "As you originally requested, I'll select the <font color=\"#ffd200\">finest \
    Assassins</font> and\nsend them to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> to join the Starlight \
    Expedition. "
set key[id=516131203002378] name "(Politely express your thanks.)"
set key[id=516131203002379] name "No more pleasantries. Now go back to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>\nand tell your master <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font> about this. If there's a path you want to take or \
    something you want to do,\nact quickly without hesitation. Good luck.\n"
set key[id=516131203002380] name "Why are you hesitating?\nHurry to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font>, \
    meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font>, and get ready to welcome the newly <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">joining</font> expedition members."
set key[id=516131203002381] name "You're back. How did it go?"
set key[id=516131203002383] name "While you were away persuading them, I succeeded in persuading the other \
    guardian forces.\nThey've agreed to select their elite agents and send them as the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight Expedition</font>."
set key[id=516131203002385] name "Oh, what a relief.\nYou even persuaded the Assassins, who have the least contact \
    with other forces. Well done!\nGood work. "
set key[id=516131203002386] name "It seems everything is ready to stop $npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ now. "
set key[id=516131203002387] name "Everyone has joined hands to form the Starlight Expedition,\nand how grateful \
    and thankful that makes me!"
set key[id=516131203002388] name "I've set up a temporary <font color=\"#ffd200\">Starlight Expedition HQ</font> \
    in a corner of $map:02000023$.\n$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ and I will prepare to welcome them,\nand there's \
    a place you need to go in the meantime."
set key[id=516131203002389] name "(Ask where you need to go.)"
set key[id=516131203002390] name "While we were persuading everyone to assemble the expedition, we succeeded in \
    deciphering\none of the ancient books brought from Kalib Island.\nThrough it, we found the area where clues to \
    the true nature of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Ultimate Secret Art</font> are hidden."
set key[id=516131203002391] name "(Ask where that place is.)"
set key[id=516131203002392] name "The terrain has changed since then, so it isn't exact...\nbut I suspect it's \
    somewhere near <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002393] name "If you search around <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font>, there may be \
    clues left by the ancient Runeblade ancestors,\nso go look for anything that could be a clue and\nreturn to \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000028$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002394] name "If you search around <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font>, there may be \
    clues left by the ancient Runeblade ancestors,\nso go look for anything that could be a clue and\nreturn to \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000028$</font>."
set key[id=516131203002395] name "You're back. So, did you find anything that could be a clue?"
set key[id=516131203002396] name "(Hand over $item:30000538$.)"
set key[id=516131203002397] name "Hmm, these are... fragments of the Rune Book. It seems you found the right \
    thing.\nI understand <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000538$</font> is a book in which the ancient Runeblade \
    ancestors recorded the background and history of\ngathering the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Ultimate Secret \
    Art</font> and the way to regain its power."
set key[id=516131203002398] name "Parts of it are damaged, so restoring it perfectly may be hard,\nbut if we piece \
    it together well, we might at least make out the important contents that serve as clues."
set key[id=516131203002399] name "Now, hand over the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000538$</font> you \
    brought.\nLet's see... take a look... "
set key[id=516131203002400] name "Now, hand over the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000538$</font> you \
    brought.\nLet's see... take a look... "
set key[id=516131203002401] name "$npcName:11001231[gender:0]$... So this is what you were after all along... "
set key[id=516131203002402] name "$npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ must have gone to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000029$</font>\nto get <font color=\"#ffd200\">Runicta</font> in hand.\nWe must find \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Runicta</font> before $npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ does. "
set key[id=516131203002406] name "I'll put together the rear guard and follow soon, so stay by \
    $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$'s side and support him well.\nThe decisive battle is right around the corner... \
    He won't show it, but he must be having a hard time too.\nAt a time like this, his <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">beloved disciple</font> ought to be right there by his side, don't you think?"
set key[id=516131203002407] name "You want to join the rear guard? Hmm...\nNo, no. <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, rather, you should join the vanguard and move out with \
    $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$."
set key[id=516131203002408] name "Hah... How could this be... S-$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$..."
set key[id=516131203002409] name "(Anxiously ask what will happen to your master.)"
set key[id=516131203002410] name "The power of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lapenta of Life</font> barely saved \
    $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$'s <font color=\"#ffd200\">life</font>...\nbut $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ has \
    fallen into a <font color=\"#ffd200\">deep sleep</font>."
set key[id=516131203002411] name "I won't tell you to give up. However,\n...it is all God's will, and it depends \
    on the inner will of $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$."
set key[id=516131203002412] name "I hope $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ gets better soon... This is \
    serious.\n$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$'s absence will work against us in many ways in this situation..."
set key[id=516131203002413] name "He has been the spiritual <font color=\"#ffd200\">pillar</font> for the \
    Runeblades, so even in hard times you\nwere able to trust him and find courage.\nI have no doubt <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font> will wake up, but I worry about the Runeblades\nwho will \
    be disheartened in the meantime."
set key[id=516131203002414] name "Another thing is what worries me most right now: $npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ \
    has disappeared without a trace.\nOnce $npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ learns that $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ \
    is in bad shape, he will surely try to\npush his plans forward faster. "
set key[id=516131203002415] name "I'll work out some plans for our next move, so for now\nstay by the side of your \
    companions, who are struggling and confused. "
set key[id=516131203002416] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001230[gender:0]$</font> seems to be in a lot \
    of emotional pain,\nso go to him and look after him."
set key[id=516131203002417] name "$npcName:11001231[gender:0]$... $npcName:11001231[gender:0]$... \
    $npcName:11001231[gender:0]$...\nEvery time I repeat that name, <font color=\"#ffd200\">bloodlust</font> boils \
    up in me.\nUgh... That damned traitor... Did he truly have to go this far..."
set key[id=516131203002418] name "(Carefully calm $npcName:11001230[gender:0]$ down.)"
set key[id=516131203002419] name "The great legacy our ancestors left, Ishura... all because of him...\nI will \
    surely judge that cursed <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001231[gender:0]$</font> with my own hands... \
    without fail... "
set key[id=516131203002420] name "It's all... my fault...\nIf only I hadn't stepped up like that...\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font> wouldn't have ended up like that... "
set key[id=516131203002421] name "Then <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font> could have \
    given you the gift\nhe prepared for you himself... I'm sorry... I'm so sorry... "
set key[id=516131203002422] name "Over there... do you see the box under the tree...?\nOpen it... There should be \
    a gift\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font> left for you... "
set key[id=516131203002425] name "Over there... do you see the box under the tree...?\nOpen it... There should be \
    a gift\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font> left for you... "
set key[id=518123103002427] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001230[gender:0]$</font> in particular seems \
    to be in a lot of emotional pain,\nso go to him and look after him."
set key[id=518123203002427] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$</font>...\nSo this is the \
    gift he left for you... "
set key[id=518123203002428] name "Having a master like $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ will be the most \
    precious\nblessing of your life. I too think that getting to know him through this affair\nis a blessing from \
    God and a precious gift of fate."
set key[id=518123203002429] name "Until $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ wakes up, please fill the empty place he has \
    left.\nSoon the air of sorrow will pass, and the Runeblades will gain <font color=\"#ffd200\">light</font> \
    once again."
set key[id=519174403002430] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!\nIt seems $npcName:11001232[gender:1]$ is looking for you."
set key[id=519174403002431] name "Ah, $MyPCName$!\nIt seems $npcName:11001232[gender:1]$ is looking for you."
set key[id=519174403002432] name "Ah! You're back, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>!"
set key[id=519174403002433] name "Each has their own position, so it won't be easy for everyone to become of one \
    mind at once.\nBut if it is for the peace of us all...\nI believe everyone will make a wise decision."
set key[id=519174403002434] name "The royal family will also persuade each guardian force directly and help \
    actively."
set key[id=519183303002436] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>.\nFollow along with \
    $npcName:11001567[gender:0]$ as the rear guard."
set key[id=519183403002436] name "You want to join the rear guard? Hmm...\nNo, no. <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, rather, you should join the vanguard and move out with \
    $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$."
set key[id=519212903002436] name "(Say the Assassins have declared they'll join the Starlight Expedition.)"
set key[id=520140003002436] name "I'll go to $map:02000063$ with you, Master."
set key[id=520140003002437] name "(Say you'll treat Asimov just as you would your master, as you were told.)"
set key[id=520140003002438] name "Ugh... That's exactly what worries me.\nI won't say more. Unlike how you treat \
    this master of yours...\nyou must meet $npcName:11001573[gender:0]$ with courtesy and proper conduct."
set key[id=520140003002439] name "Without the help of Jibrita and the rune sorcerer clan...\nwe might never have \
    seen the life now sprouting in Ellinia."
set key[id=520140003002440] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">energy of hope</font> that \
    $npcName:11000031[gender:0]$ bestowed on us also reminded us of the important mindset\nwe will need to \
    overcome every trial that lies ahead."
set key[id=520140003002441] name "As proud members of Terunkalib, we will all stop \
    $npcName:29000097[gender:0]$\nand, what's more, protect the Ultimate Secret Art. Is that understood!"
set key[id=520140003002442] name "(Say that then you'll wake up your master.)"
set key[id=520140003002443] name "Please stop. I said deep sleep, but...\nto be honest, it's closer to a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">state of suspended animation</font>.\nThere is nothing more that can be done.\nRight now, \
    when or how... no, whether he will even wake up is all <font color=\"#ffd200\">unknown</font>..."
set key[id=520140003002444] name "(Say that if you cause trouble, trouble, your master will surely open his eyes \
    to scold you.)"
set key[id=520140003002445] name "D-don't be unreasonable!\n$MyPCName$, no matter what you do, his closed eyes \
    won't open.\nYou have to... accept reality now..."
set key[id=520140003002446] name "(Say you don't believe in God's will or whatever, but if it's your master's \
    will, you believe it.)"
set key[id=520140003002447] name "$npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ is strong in both body and mind...\nso I believe, \
    as you do, that he will surely wake up."
set key[id=520140003002448] name "A gift from my master...?"
set key[id=520140003002449] name "After what happened in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000025$</font>, \
    $npcName:11001229[gender:0]$ said\nthat you, $MyPCName$, have grown so much that there's nothing left for him \
    to guide you in...\nand that his feelings were complicated."
set key[id=520140003002450] name "He was <font color=\"#ffd200\">happy</font> about your growth, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">wistful</font> at the same time... and then he seemed <font color=\"#ffd200\">worried</font> \
    that he\ntruly had nothing left to teach you. And he said this gift would probably be\nthe <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">last gift</font> he could give you as your master... Sob..."
set key[id=520140003002451] name "(Ask where your master's gift is.)"
set key[id=520142303002452] name "(Say that there's no way your master would say something like that.)"
set key[id=520142303002453] name "Heh, you two really are... a strange master and disciple."
set key[id=520142303002454] name "Ahem... Anyway, you know, don't you?\nVery soon the fate of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:29000097[gender:0]$</font> will be decided. Give it everything you've got!"
set key[id=831174201000001] name "Sob sob sob... What am I going to do now...\nI lost my ship in a sudden storm \
    and got hurt too...\nSob..."
set key[id=831174201000002] name "(Ask what's wrong.)"
set key[id=831174201000003] name "At sixteen, I set sail for the new continent in a little boat, you know...\nIn \
    over 10 years on the rough seas,\nI'd never seen a storm <font color=\"#ffd200\">come out of nowhere</font> \
    like that.\nNo, it wasn't so much a storm as... something like an <font color=\"#ffd200\">earthquake under the \
    sea</font>."
set key[id=831174201000004] name "Just when I was almost at Lith Harbor, the sea suddenly split wide open, the \
    waves\nswirled into a whirlpool, and it swallowed my ship in an instant...\nAnd the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">records of my adventures</font> inside the ship... the records all... sob sob..."
set key[id=831174201000005] name "(Say that at least they survived, so cheer up.)"
set key[id=831174201000006] name "Yeah, I guess I should, huh?\nMy clothes are all torn and my leg is broken, but \
    at least I'm alive.\nBut I can't give up on my <font color=\"#ffd200\">logbook</font>!\nIt holds 10 years of \
    my life!"
set key[id=831174201000007] name "I can't move with my leg hurt, so I'll ask you this...\nPlease fish my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">logbook</font> out of the sea, where it's floating... Please!"
set key[id=831174201000008] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000150$</font> is scattered in loose pages \
    floating in the sea off $map:02000062$...\nI have to watch my journal get soaked before my eyes and can't even \
    fetch it myself... cough cough...\nPlease hurry and fish out my logbook!"
set key[id=831174201000009] name "Ah... Oh no...\nFor a moment like this I paid a lot for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">ink that's supposed not to run in water</font>,\nand it all ran anyway..."
set key[id=831174201000010] name "Ten years of my life, gone just like that... What's the point of living...\nSob \
    sob sob..."
set key[id=831174201000011] name "(Tell him to stop crying and pull himself together.)"
set key[id=831174201000012] name "Yeah, I should.\nThanks for comforting me like this..."
set key[id=831174201000013] name "Could I ask just one more favor?\nTo dock a ship at a harbor in Maple World, you \
    need a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000151$</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000014] name "What is a $item:30000151$?"
set key[id=831174201000015] name "It's hard to imagine in a peaceful harbor like Lith, but out on the open \
    sea,\nrunning into vicious pirates is common. So <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000068$</font>\nissues a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000151$</font> so that only ships with sailing permission can dock at the harbor."
set key[id=831174201000016] name "But when the waves swallowed me up, my <font color=\"#ffd200\">sailing \
    permit</font> got swept away somewhere too.\nI guess I'll have to get a new one."
set key[id=831174201000017] name "Could you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000019[gender:0]$</font> at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000068$</font> and ask\nif they can issue me a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000151$</font>?"
set key[id=831174201000018] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000068$</font> is just a little way up from the \
    waterfront.\nIt's a big building with a helm on it, so it should be easy to... *cough cough*... find..."
set key[id=831174201000019] name "Huh? You there!\nWho are you? What brings you here?"
set key[id=831174201000020] name "Could you issue me a $item:30000151$?"
set key[id=831174201000021] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000151$?</font> Do you think we hand those out \
    to just anyone?\nA $item:30000151$ is only issued to people with a navigator's license!\nAnd in troubled times \
    like these, no way!"
set key[id=831174201000022] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=831174201000023] name "Can't you tell from how empty this harbor is?\nOf course, you only just came \
    over from Maple Island, so you might not know...\nLith Harbor used to be <font color=\"#ffd200\">packed with \
    ships and people coming and going all the time</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000024] name "But ever since that tidal wave came out of nowhere a while ago, the ships have \
    stopped coming...\nThere's even a rumor that the famous <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000444[gender:0]$</font> barely escaped with his life,\nso that tells you \
    everything..."
set key[id=831174201000025] name "I'm telling you, $npc:11000444[gender:0]$ asked me to get a $item:30000151$ \
    issued."
set key[id=831174201000026] name "Why didn't you say so sooner!! I'd have given it to you right away! It was a \
    request from my hero!\nI'll write up the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000151$</font> right now!!!"
set key[id=831174201000027] name "By the way, is <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000444[gender:0]$</font> doing \
    all right?\nIf he has nowhere else to stay, tell him he's welcome to come to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000068$</font>!\nPlease be sure to tell him!"
set key[id=831174201000028] name "Why do you like $npc:11000444[gender:0]$ so much?"
set key[id=831174201000029] name "I don't like him, I respect him!\nI'm a huge fan of his book, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">'Columbo's World Travels'</font>!\nI've read it over 100 times!"
set key[id=831174201000030] name "And if he ever needs a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000151$</font> again, \
    tell him he can take one\nfrom the drawer right next to me, anytime!"
set key[id=831174201000031] name "You didn't lose the $item:30000151$, did you?\nIf you lost the $item:30000151$, \
    take another one from the <font color=\"#ffd200\">cabinet in the corner</font>\nover there.\nYou have to bring \
    it to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000444[gender:0]$</font>, okay? Got it?"
set key[id=831174201000032] name "Oh, thank you! I never thought I'd get a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000151$</font> this easily...\nThanks to you, I can prepare for another voyage!"
set key[id=831174201000033] name "$npc:11000019[gender:0]$ says they're a huge fan of 'Columbo's World Travels'."
set key[id=831174201000034] name "Is that so? That makes me a little shy, hahaha...\nIf my logbook had survived, I \
    could have published <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Columbo's World Travels 2'</font> too...\nOh, the tears are \
    coming again... *sob* *sob*... It's so sad... *sob*..."
set key[id=831174201000035] name "Please, stop crying already."
set key[id=831174201000036] name "*sniff*... Y-yes... I should stop crying now...\nThere are still so many places \
    I haven't been!\nAs soon as my wounds heal, I'll get a ship and head back out to sea!\nI'll go to the far-off \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Pirate Island</font> and find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">ancient treasure</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000037] name "Oh, and...\nIf you meet that fan of mine again, tell him this!\nIf he comes to \
    see me, I'll sign his copy of <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Columbo's World Travels'</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000038] name "Anyway, thank you for helping me!\nIf fate allows, we'll meet again someday!"
set key[id=831174201000039] name "Hup! Hup! Hup!"
set key[id=831174201000040] name "What are you doing?"
set key[id=831174201000041] name "What does it look like? I'm running to warm myself up because it's cold...\nHey, \
    what's with that look! Do you think I'm weird or something?\nIf I don't do this, I might freeze to death, you \
    know!"
set key[id=831174201000042] name "Do fairies get cold too?"
set key[id=831174201000043] name "You dummy! Of course fairies get cold!\nWe're even worse at the c-cold!\nBrr... \
    See! Talking to you is making me c-cold!"
set key[id=831174201000044] name "Why not wear thick clothes?"
set key[id=831174201000045] name "Are you really that dumb?\nIf fairies wear the thick clothes humans wear, \
    they're so heavy we can't even m-move!\nIf only I had some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000177$</font>..."
set key[id=831174201000046] name "What is $item:30000177$?"
set key[id=831174201000047] name "You really are a pest, aren't you?\n$item:30000177$ is a rare fluff that's so \
    light it drifts around on the wind.\nI worked so hard to collect it to make clothes... Brr... and it all \
    disappeared!"
set key[id=831174201000048] name "Do you have any idea where it went?"
set key[id=831174201000049] name "I'm pretty sure those <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000239$</font> around here \
    are suspicious.\nThose guys... they were definitely black all over, but after my fluff went missing,\nthey \
    grew white fur and their bodies turned all blotchy.\nThey know a good thing when they see it... Brr... \
    c-cold... "
set key[id=831174201000050] name "Do you want me to find $item:30000177$ for you?"
set key[id=831174201000051] name "Well... if you really want to, go ahead! I d-don't care!\nI'm n-not asking you, \
    got it!\nSo... are you going to take the $item:30000177$ back from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000239$</font>?"
set key[id=831174201000052] name "I'm n-not asking you, got it!!!\nB-but if you really want to find the \
    $item:30000177$,\nI won't stop you!\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000239$</font> around here are \
    suspicious."
set key[id=831174201000053] name "Those guys... they were definitely black all over, but after my fluff went \
    missing,\nthey grew white fur and their bodies turned all blotchy.\nThey know a good thing when they see it... \
    Brr... c-cold... "
set key[id=831174201000054] name "Oh, this is... I knew it, the $npc:21000239$ did it.\nBut what took you so long? \
    I thought you'd just left!"
set key[id=831174201000055] name "Hmph... I never meant to ask you for anything.\nWell... off with you now! I'm \
    busy!"
set key[id=831174201000146] name "Daddy, please don't be sick~\n*sniff*... "
set key[id=831174201000147] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831174201000148] name "Did you see my daddy next to me? My daddy is sick.\nHe's had no energy for a \
    while and keeps stumbling around... Nobody knows why he's sick...\nHe has to get better so he can play with \
    me... *sniff*... "
set key[id=831174201000149] name "Oh! I know! $MyPCName$! Please get me some <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000205$</font>!\n$item:30000205$ is my daddy's favorite health food!\nDaddy says \
    $item:30000205$ makes your body strong!"
set key[id=831174201000150] name "My daddy gulps down a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21090069$</font> in one bite, \
    but...\nI'm scared of $npc:21090069$... Their stingers hurt so much when they sting you... *sniff*...\nThere \
    are lots of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21090069$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000172$</font>.\nI \
    bet the $npc:21090069$ have <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000205$</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000151] name "$MyPCName$, you're not scared of $npc:21090069$ stingers, right?!\nPlease get me \
    some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000205$</font>!\n$item:30000205$ is my daddy's favorite health food!"
set key[id=831174201000152] name "There are lots of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21090069$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000172$</font>.\nI bet the $npc:21090069$ have <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000205$</font>. "
set key[id=831174201000153] name "Wow! Thank you!\nYay~ I have to give it to Daddy right away~ "
set key[id=831174201000154] name "So you're the friend who brought me the $item:30000205$.\nIt was delicious, \
    thank you... but... I still feel unwell...\nAnd the little one keeps whining beside me to play... I really \
    must get my strength back... "
set key[id=831174201000155] name "(Ask where it hurts.)"
set key[id=831174201000156] name "I have no energy and I'm always tired... My arms and legs go numb, and my whole \
    body aches.\nMy eyes are blurry and I can't see well, and sometimes everything suddenly goes dark.\nI have no \
    appetite, yet my stomach feels bloated even when I haven't eaten...\nMy skin has gone dark and my face looks a \
    bit yellow, doesn't it?"
set key[id=831174201000157] name "So, anyway, in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">old book passed down at my cousin's \
    house</font>,\nit says that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000206$</font> is that good for the body!\nThere's \
    a story that my cousin's ancestor found <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000206$</font> and cured an important \
    person's incurable illness,\nand was rewarded with a high government post."
set key[id=831174201000158] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000172$</font> is home to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:29000001$</font>, you know.\nThose rabbits hide deep in the grass where you can't see \
    them,\nand even when you do spot one, it runs off so fast I can't even call out to it... "
set key[id=831174201000159] name "If you stir up the grass all over $map:02000172$, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:29000001$</font> will get startled and come out.\nWould you get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000206$</font> from the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:29000001$</font> for me?"
set key[id=831174201000160] name "Ohh... my whole body aches...\nPlease get me some <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000206$</font>.\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:29000001$</font> will show up if \
    you stir up the grass all over $map:02000172$... "
set key[id=831174201000161] name "Oh my... so this is the legendary $item:30000206$!\nI'll gratefully eat it."
set key[id=831174201000162] name "Hmm... but this... why does it smell like this? It smells like poop?\nWell... \
    they do say good medicine tastes bitter."
set key[id=831174201000163] name "Have you ever seen a $npc:23000054$ show up in a corner\nof the lab and cause a \
    ruckus now and then? "
set key[id=831174201000164] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=831174201000165] name "(Say no.)"
set key[id=831174201000166] name "I think...\nit must be a product of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. \
    Katronic</font>'s last project. "
set key[id=831174201000167] name "Who is <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. Katronic</font>?"
set key[id=831174201000168] name "The father of AI robots! The scientist who founded <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000187$</font>.\nHe's the reason I went down this path in the first place.\nOf \
    course... as you can see, my field of research is different."
set key[id=831174201000169] name "Anyway, I'm a huge fan of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. Katronic</font>, so I've \
    been clipping newspaper articles about him since I was a kid...\nand I can't shake the feeling that his last \
    project, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mark Project</font>,\nhas something to do with the $npc:23000054$."
set key[id=831174201000170] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001032[gender:0]$</font> at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000187$</font> seems to think the same way I do.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001032[gender:0]$</font> took part in the project at $map:02000187$ in his \
    youth,\nso he must know more!"
set key[id=831174201000171] name "I have research to finish here and can't leave my post,\nso could you go to \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000187$</font>, give this scrapbook to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001032[gender:0]$</font>,\nand help with his investigation?"
set key[id=831174201000172] name "Oh? Well... that happens.\nAnyway, a $npc:23000054$ shows up in a corner of the \
    lab and causes a ruckus now and then,\nand I think... it must be a product of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. \
    Katronic</font>'s\nlast project. "
set key[id=831174201000173] name "Who is <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. Katronic</font>?"
set key[id=831174201000174] name "Why did you turn back halfway?"
set key[id=831174201000175] name "I left the $item:39000005$ behind."
set key[id=831174201000176] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174201000177] name "You should have packed properly in the first place.\nHere, grab it and get \
    going."
set key[id=831174201000178] name "I thought I saw you put it in your bag... isn't it there?\nSearch well."
set key[id=831174201000179] name "How do you even carry such a heavy bag around?\nTidy it up once in a while."
set key[id=831174201000180] name "I don't have time for you to wander around lost.\nHurry up, please!"
set key[id=831174201000181] name "Hm? What brings you all the way here?"
set key[id=831174201000182] name "(Hand over the $item:39000005$.) Can you tell me about the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Mark Project</font>?"
set key[id=831174201000183] name "Ah... these articles bring back memories.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. \
    Katronic</font> started that research aiming to build the finest AI guardian security robot,\nand its official \
    name was the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mark 52 Project</font>.\nIf it weren't for that incident, the project \
    would have ended in success... "
set key[id=831174201000184] name "What incident?"
set key[id=831174201000185] name "The household robots with Dr. Katronic's core semiconductor suddenly started \
    malfunctioning\nand attacking people, and quite a few people were hurt.\nWhen it became known that the cause \
    lay in the core semiconductor, Dr. Katronic took all the responsibility\nand left $map:02000187$."
set key[id=831174201000186] name "And so the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mark 52 Project</font> ended in failure, and \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. Katronic</font>\nvanished without a trace.\nAfter that, everyone refused the post \
    of center director, so I had no choice but to take it."
set key[id=831174201000187] name "After <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. Katronic</font> disappeared, the remaining \
    researchers tried to carry on with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mark 52 Project</font>,\nbut... nobody knew the \
    core technology exactly.\nThere must be a $item:39000006$ that <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. Katronic</font> \
    left behind, though."
set key[id=831174201000188] name "Do you have any idea where it might be?"
set key[id=831174201000189] name "Well... our researchers searched all over $map:02000187$ back then, and \
    still\ncouldn't find it.\nThe only things we hadn't examined were the robots... Ah!!!"
set key[id=831174201000190] name "I ask what's wrong."
set key[id=831174201000191] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Robots</font>!!!\nDr. Katronic had a habit of hiding \
    important materials inside robots!\nHe may have hidden the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000006$</font> \
    inside a robot too!\nWhy didn't I think of that until now!"
set key[id=831174201000192] name "Please take a look at the robots wandering around inside this center!\nSomehow I \
    feel you'll be able to find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000006$</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000193] name "Quickly, please take a look at the robots wandering around inside this \
    center!\nSomehow I feel you'll be able to find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000006$</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000194] name "Did you find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:39000006$</font>?"
set key[id=831174201000195] name "(Hand over the $item:39000006$.)"
set key[id=831174201000196] name "Oh, you really found it!\nWhere did you find it? Was it really inside a robot?"
set key[id=831174201000197] name "I got it while fighting the attack robots."
set key[id=831174201000198] name "So my guess was right...\nI must examine the $item:39000006$ closely right \
    away!"
set key[id=831174201000199] name "$npc:11000372[gender:0]$'s guess was right!\nThere are records about the \
    $npc:23000054$. And the error details too...\nBut... it seems the $npc:23000054$ isn't the end of it... "
set key[id=831174201000200] name "What do you mean?"
set key[id=831174201000201] name "If you look closely at the $item:39000006$, it says that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">the $npc:23000054$'s operating system is linked\nto another system</font>.\nAnd at the \
    center of that system is <font color=\"#ffd200\">a main unit that provides infinite circulating power</font>."
set key[id=831174201000202] name "Since the $npc:23000054$ and the robots of $map:02000187$ are \
    malfunctioning,\nwe can guess that the main unit has suffered an operating error.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000232$</font>...\nPerhaps that place is the source of all of this... "
set key[id=831174201000203] name "Where is $map:02000232$?"
set key[id=831174201000204] name "It's <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. Katronic's secret laboratory</font> somewhere \
    in $map:02000187$.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Dr. Katronic</font> was the only one who could come and go from \
    there.\nThe key to finding the cause of the robot malfunctions must be in <font color=\"#ffd200\">that secret \
    lab</font>..."
set key[id=831174201000205] name "$map:02000232$, the Mark main unit... and the vanished Dr. Katronic...\nWith \
    this information alone, I can't tell how to get into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000232$</font>.\nAh, \
    right! If we look into the <font color=\"#ffd200\">old computers</font> left abandoned inside this \
    center,\nthere might be information that Dr. Katronic left behind."
set key[id=831174201000206] name "I think we should gather a bit more information. Search the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">computers</font>\nall around this center.\nThey're surely password-protected, but with basic \
    hacking skills,\naccessing the files inside shouldn't be hard."
set key[id=831174201000207] name "I've never done any hacking."
set key[id=831174201000208] name "Oh dear, I forgot that you aren't a researcher at our center.\nIf you can't \
    hack, then at least pull out the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000357$</font> from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">computers</font>.\nI'll do the data analysis, understood?"
set key[id=831174201000209] name "Didn't I tell you to at least pull out the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000357$</font> if you can't hack?\nIf you walk around inside the center, you'll find \
    computers that still hold\nold $item:30000357$!"
set key[id=831174201000210] name "Well, how did it go?"
set key[id=831174201000211] name "(Hand over the $item:30000357$.)"
set key[id=831174201000212] name "Good grief! What an enormous amount of $item:30000357$!\nI don't know if I can \
    crack the password...\nWait here a moment."
set key[id=831174201000213] name "Hmm, good! Luckily the internal data wasn't lost... Let's see...\nAh, no, this \
    can't be!"
set key[id=831174201000214] name "Why are you so shocked?"
set key[id=831174201000215] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000054$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000055$</font>, and another robot that maintains the circulating power system,\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000056$</font>!\nThis most powerful and terrifying monster robot is locked up in \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000232$</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000216] name "$npc:23000056$ would have been the finest creation if the Mark Project had \
    succeeded,\nbut the moment the project failed, it became the greatest object of fear!\nIt feels like having a \
    time bomb strapped to my chest... Haah...\nAll I can do is hope the machine monster doesn't burst through the \
    door of $map:02000232$."
set key[id=831174201000217] name "Can't we just destroy $npc:23000056$?"
set key[id=831174201000218] name "I admire your spirit, but it won't be easy. Perhaps with a really \
    reliable\ncompanion at your side. If it were me, I wouldn't go anywhere near the door of $map:02000232$."
set key[id=831174201000219] name "Oh, perfect timing! I've been looking for someone to help me!"
set key[id=831174201000220] name "I overheard some information from folks passing through here,\nand it seems that \
    $item:30000055$ is mixed in with the piles of coal\nthe monsters are scraping together in $map:02000235$!"
set key[id=831174201000221] name "What is $item:30000055$?"
set key[id=831174201000222] name "It's a rock that was commonly found in the ancient Vayar Mountains.\nThey say \
    that just carrying it on you fills you with the energy of the sacred earth!"
set key[id=831174201000223] name "Is that really true?"
set key[id=831174201000224] name "Who knows if it's true or not!\nWhat matters is that the rumor makes it sell for \
    a high price.\nBut after the huge earthquake, the Vayar Mountains scattered all over the continent,\nand now \
    you can hardly find $item:30000055$ no matter how hard you look."
set key[id=831174201000225] name "And yet, those stone fragments have been discovered!\nSelling just a few would \
    fetch a decent sum! Heh heh heh...\nBut I'd have to go into a mine crawling with monsters...\nWith this old \
    body, I just don't have the nerve."
set key[id=831174201000226] name "Could you help me out?\nAll you have to do is go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000235$</font> and pick up a few <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000055$</font>."
set key[id=831174201000227] name "What, you still haven't gone into the mine?\nDidn't I tell you that all you need \
    to do is pick up a few <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000055$</font>\nin <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000235$</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000228] name "Oh! I heard the mine is crawling with monsters, yet you managed to bring them \
    back!\nThank you!"
set key[id=831174201000229] name "W-what? But this... th-this is!\nT-to think you'd bring such a frightening \
    object!\nT-take it away! Hurry!!!"
set key[id=831174201000230] name "What's wrong?"
set key[id=831174201000231] name "You're asking because you don't know?\nMixed in with the $item:30000055$ you \
    brought was this... th-this frightening thing!"
set key[id=831174201000232] name "So what exactly is it?"
set key[id=831174201000233] name "I don't know! I don't know!!\nI can't say! This <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000056$</font> is a <font color=\"#ffd200\">very frightening object</font>!\nJust \
    throw it back in the mine, or take it to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000039[gender:1]$</font> and ask!"
set key[id=831174201000234] name "What, why did you come back?"
set key[id=831174201000235] name "I left the $item:30000056$ behind."
set key[id=831174201000236] name "(Say you got the directions mixed up.)"
set key[id=831174201000237] name "What, you left this frightening thing here?\nTake it away! Quick, grab it and \
    get out!"
set key[id=831174201000238] name "You just put it in your bag earlier!\nQuick, take it and go!"
set key[id=831174201000239] name "How do you carry such a heavy bag around?\nTidy it up as you go!"
set key[id=831174201000240] name "Are you still hanging around me with that frightening object?\nJust throw it \
    back in the mine, or take it to Namid and ask!"
set key[id=831174201000241] name "What brings you all the way to this altar?"
set key[id=831174201000242] name "What on earth is this stone fragment?"
set key[id=831174201000243] name "Oh, no, this is!\nThe Stone of Wisdom that only the ancient sages could make, \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000056$</font>!\nWhere did you get this?"
set key[id=831174201000244] name "I found it by chance in $map:02000235$."
set key[id=831174201000245] name "I see.\n$item:30000056$... To think I'd see this legendary stone again..."
set key[id=831174201000246] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000056$</font>...\nIt's a mystical stone that an \
    ancient tribe, now vanished,\nforged from $item:30000055$."
set key[id=831174201000247] name "The method of making this Stone of Wisdom is not known.\nAs the Vayar Mountains \
    split apart in every direction and the ancient tribe vanished,\nthe way to make the $item:30000056$ became a \
    secret of history. And yet, it turns up like this..."
set key[id=831174201000248] name "Why was $npc:11000135[gender:0]$ afraid of the $item:30000056$?"
set key[id=831174201000249] name "That's because...\nthis $item:30000056$ was a stone the ancients embedded in the \
    chests of stone giants\nto grant them wisdom."
set key[id=831174201000250] name "The stone giants who carried the $item:30000056$ were sacred beings that guarded \
    the ancients.\nBut someone... cast an evil spell on the $item:30000056$...\nand the stone giants became <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">puppets of an evil power</font> and threatened the world.\nThat is why \
    $npc:11000135[gender:0]$ feared the $item:30000056$."
set key[id=831174201000251] name "Since $item:30000056$ stones resonate with each other, if I sense their energy, \
    I can tell\nwhere the stone giants carrying the same $item:30000056$ are.\nI must find out where they are and \
    report to $npc:11000134[gender:0]$.\nOnly then can we learn <font color=\"#ffd200\">who cast the evil spell on \
    this Stone of Wisdom</font>!"
set key[id=831174201000252] name "I can... sense the energy of the $item:30000056$...\nOne is in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000148$</font>... and another is in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000021$</font>...\nAh, no! But there's another one!!"
set key[id=831174201000253] name "What's wrong?"
set key[id=831174201000254] name "I can feel it! A <font color=\"#ffd200\">cold energy</font> sharp as an awl, \
    colder than the eternal snows!\nThe fishy <font color=\"#ffd200\">scent of the sea</font> piercing my \
    lungs!\nAh... where on earth is this place..."
set key[id=831174201000255] name "This must be the <font color=\"#ffd200\">most powerful Vayar</font> among the \
    stone giants that carry the $item:30000056$.\nIt has to be <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100006[gender:0]$</font>, whose traces are\nhardly found even in legend!\nBut I can't \
    read its exact location."
set key[id=831174201000256] name "It would be a disaster if this terrifying Vayar were to awaken.\nWe need to \
    pinpoint its location before that happens...\n$MyPCName$, would you search for the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">traces of $npc:23100006[gender:0]$</font>?"
set key[id=831174201000257] name "It would be a disaster if the terrifying Vayar were to awaken.\nWe need to \
    pinpoint its location before that happens...\n$MyPCName$, would you search for the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">traces of $npc:23100006[gender:0]$</font>?"
set key[id=831174201000258] name "This is a $item:30000055$ steeped in a freezing energy.\nIt's covered in snow, \
    but it clearly bears the same pattern\nas the stone fragments I gathered for Squattush."
set key[id=831174201000259] name "But I can feel a stronger, more evil energy.\nIt seems to have broken off from \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23100006[gender:0]$</font>..."
set key[id=831175903000218] name "There's one more thing I need to ask of you... "
set key[id=831175903000219] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903000220] name "This time the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21090071$</font> are bothering \
    me!\nDo you see those <font color=\"#ffd200\">tall trees</font> around here? "
set key[id=831175903000221] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21090071$</font> hiding there keep throwing \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">apples</font>!\nThey throw those <font color=\"#ffd200\">apples</font> not only at \
    passersby but at my balloons too... "
set key[id=831175903000222] name "I think we have to get rid of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">apples</font> they use \
    as weapons!\nThere should be apple trees here and there among the tall trees!\nLet's strip every last apple \
    from those trees!"
set key[id=831175903000223] name "There are apple trees around those <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21090071$</font>.\nPick all the apples there so they can't throw them!"
set key[id=831175903000224] name "Thank you! Now I can finally get my business started properly!"
set key[id=831175903001279] name "They'll come back here for the information they couldn't smuggle out.\nSoon, \
    mind you."
set key[id=831175903001280] name "We'll use that to track them down, find their hideout,\nand expose their whole \
    scheme."
set key[id=831175903001281] name "Here, take this. It's a driver for the intruder detection sensor,\nbuilt from \
    special parts. Please use it to\nactivate the detection sensor."
set key[id=831175903001282] name "$item:30000347$ not only raises the alarm on intruders, it also\nrecords the \
    route of everyone the body detection system picks up,\nso we can trace them back."
set key[id=831175903001283] name "Please hurry.\nThere must be no mistakes. None at all."
set key[id=831175903001284] name "You have to activate $item:30000347$.\nThere must be no mistakes. None at all."
set key[id=831175903001285] name "I lost $item:30000347$."
set key[id=831175903001286] name "I'm heading out now. "
set key[id=831175903001287] name "What? How long ago did you get it, and you already lost it?!\nPull yourself \
    together and focus. You must not lose it.\nHere, take it again."
set key[id=831175903001288] name "Oh, come on, don't act like an amateur!\n$item:30000347$ is right there in your \
    bag."
set key[id=831175903001289] name "If you lose it while carrying it in your hand, we're in big trouble.\nEmpty your \
    bag, come back, and keep it safely\nin your bag."
set key[id=831175903001290] name "Then I'm counting on you."
set key[id=831175903001291] name "Now all we have to do is wait for them to come back.\nGood work."
set key[id=831175903001292] name "If the chance comes, I'd love to work with you, $MyPCName$.\nI think we'd make \
    good partners."
set key[id=831175903001296] name "Ho ho, what a pickle... The dignity of $npc:11001044[gender:0]$,\nwho gives \
    children dreams and hope, is in tatters.\n"
set key[id=831175903001297] name "Hey you, ah-ah-achoo!\nCome here a moment and help me out, would you? "
set key[id=831175903001298] name "(Ask what's wrong.)"
set key[id=831175903001299] name "Well, I stepped away for a little bath,\nand the monsters took every last thing \
    I own... "
set key[id=831175903001300] name "Fine, the bundle of Christmas presents I can understand,\nbut what on earth do \
    they want with my Santa suit... "
set key[id=831175903001301] name "Of course I don't mean to look down on monsters, but\nthis just isn't right. Old \
    folks who stay out in the cold too\nlong get their mouths twisted... ah-ah-achoo!"
set key[id=831175903001302] name "Brrr... It's so cold I can't move.\nPlease go and find the $item:30000348$ \
    and\n$item:30000349$ the monsters took... ah-ah-achoo!"
set key[id=831175903001303] name "Find the $item:30000348$ and $item:30000349$\nthat $npc:21000257$, \
    $npc:21000227$ and $npc:21000263$\ntook... ah-ah-achoo!"
set key[id=831175903001304] name "You're here, you're here!\nSo, did you bring all my things?"
set key[id=831175903001305] name "(Hand over $npc:11001044[gender:0]$'s things.)"
set key[id=831175903001306] name "Yes, yes, that's right. Every bit of it is mine! Ho ho ho!\nThanks to you, I can \
    deliver the presents to the children safely."
set key[id=831175903001307] name "Whoa, what a jolt!\nI ain't never seen such strong electricity in all my days!"
set key[id=831175903001308] name "Hey there, what're you doin' here, get on in quick now!\nThis place is mighty \
    dangerous, and you're standin' there dazed like a stunned raccoon."
set key[id=831175903001309] name "(Ask what he's doing.)"
set key[id=831175903001310] name "Well, can't you see? I'm workin' on somethin' real shockin' right \
    now.\nGoodness, I dunno what's goin' on, but a whole heap of electricity\nis leakin' down the wires. What're \
    we gonna do?"
set key[id=831175903001311] name "Say, mister. If you ain't leavin', don't just stand there gawkin',\ngive me a \
    hand, would ya?"
set key[id=831175903001312] name "(Ask what he needs help with.)"
set key[id=831175903001313] name "I gotta find all the live wires and cut 'em.\nDo you know what this place is... \
    Well, it's where they pull in electricity\nfor electromagnetic energy research, don't ya know."
set key[id=831175903001314] name "What I'm sayin' is, there's a whole mess of utility poles like this.\nI thought \
    I could do it alone, but that powerful electricity\nmoves so fast the sparks are poppin' everywhere, I tell \
    ya."
set key[id=831175903001315] name "So... what do I need to do?"
set key[id=831175903001316] name "Oh, how frustratin'! What I mean is, cut the wires on the poles\nwhere the \
    sparks are flashin'. Got it?"
set key[id=831175903001317] name "Oh, where's my head. Wait a minute, come see me again before you go.\nYou need \
    gear to cut those, or are you gonna do it with your bare hands?"
set key[id=831175903001318] name "Now, this here is a pair of nippers made from a special metal\nthat can block \
    even super strong electricity. Use these."
set key[id=831175903001319] name "Like I said, find the wires on the poles where the sparks are\nflashin' and cut \
    'em. Got it?"
set key[id=831175903001320] name "I lost $item:30000350$."
set key[id=831175903001321] name "I'm heading out now. "
set key[id=831175903001322] name "What?! Are you serious right now?\nDo you know how much that costs, and you lost \
    it?\nUgh... I'll give you one more, just one. Don't lose it this time."
set key[id=831175903001323] name "Hey mister, where'd you leave your wits, in the outhouse?\nWhat you're holdin' \
    there is the nippers, ain't it? Get goin' quick."
set key[id=831175903001324] name "Goodness, why is your bag stuffed with so much useless junk?\nYou gotta be light \
    when you work. Go empty your bag\nfirst and then head out."
set key[id=831175903001325] name "Still haven't left? Didn't I tell you I'm in a hurry?\nGet goin' quick now."
set key[id=831175903001326] name "Oh my, lovely! You might be a bit slow on the uptake,\nbut you sure do get the \
    job done, I'll say that! "
set key[id=831175903001327] name "Good work, good work! If you ever need electrical repairs,\ncome find me. I'll \
    give you a real good deal, I swear."
set key[id=831175903001328] name "What am I to do? I regret not looking in on the lab\nsooner."
set key[id=831175903001329] name "Not long ago I went to $map:02000276$ and by chance\nfound a research journal... \
    It was simply horrifying."
set key[id=831175903001330] name "(Ask what it said.)"
set key[id=831175903001331] name "A scientist named Dr. Kernel, who worked here before\n$map:02000270$ was divided \
    into zones, discovered that in $map:02000276$\nthere's a magnetic force where matching energies pull on each \
    other."
set key[id=831175903001332] name "He also found that when this energy touches the current in lightning\nor \
    electricity, its power can be amplified enormously."
set key[id=831175903001333] name "I think that discovery was Dr. Kernel's undoing.\nHe wanted to see with his own \
    eyes just how much power\na creature that absorbed this energy could show."
set key[id=831175903001334] name "He captured a live wild bear and experimented on it, and after\nseveral failures \
    he finally created an electronic bear that absorbed\nan enormous amount of electric energy. Its name is \
    $npc:22000023$."
set key[id=831175903001335] name "But $npc:22000023$ couldn't control the overflowing energy,\nand it destroyed \
    the life of Dr. Kernel who created it, along with\neverything he had researched."
set key[id=831175903001336] name "As a fellow researcher, I can understand Dr. Kernel's state of mind,\nbut human \
    greed has no end, and if you keep running until you\ngrasp it, you end up suffering like this someday... "
set key[id=831175903001337] name "Ah, I've talked too much. That's not the problem.\n$npc:22000023$ is still alive \
    in $map:02000276$."
set key[id=831175903001338] name "I thought the fire in $map:02000276$ was from an electrical leak,\nbut it's not. \
    This is surely the work of $npc:22000023$."
set key[id=831175903001339] name "If we leave it like this, not only $map:02000276$,\nbut perhaps all of \
    $map:02000270$ could be in danger."
set key[id=831175903001340] name "Please go to $map:02000276$ and defeat\n$npc:22000023$."
set key[id=831175903001341] name "Please go to $map:02000276$ and defeat\n$npc:22000023$."
set key[id=831175903001342] name "How can I ever repay this kindness...\nThanks to you, $map:02000276$ can be set \
    right, at least a little."
set key[id=831175903001343] name "Reform project, my foot...\nRich folks with time on their hands are always \
    doing\nuseless stuff like this."
set key[id=831175903001344] name "A prisoner is a prisoner for a reason. They couldn't\nadapt in society, tried to \
    live the easy way,\nand ended up as convicts."
set key[id=831175903001345] name "What chance does Goldus Industrial Development think it's giving those \
    prisoners,\ndragging them out to a workplace and making things more tiresome for everyone!"
set key[id=831175903001346] name "See over there? Lying down and slacking off!\nYeah, I knew it."
set key[id=831175903001347] name "Ugh, my chest... I won't live out my natural life.\nMy throat hurts too much to \
    say another word,\nso go tell the prisoners to stop slacking and get to work."
set key[id=831175903001348] name "Of course they won't listen... but what can I do?\nMy job is to watch the \
    prisoners... so they have to work."
set key[id=831175903001349] name "Give those prisoners who won't do their work\na scolding that makes them cry!"
set key[id=831175903001350] name "So, did they listen to you at all? "
set key[id=831175903001351] name "(Say they reluctantly went to work.)"
set key[id=831175903001352] name "Tsk, tsk... Just as I thought, nobody ever reforms.\nAnyway, thanks. If only \
    those guys were half as good as you... tsk tsk"
set key[id=831175903001353] name "Every unicorn has its own unique light.\nAnd that light becomes a protective \
    barrier against danger."
set key[id=831175903001354] name "But I think it's all over now... The light that protected us\nis gone. Only \
    pitch-black darkness remains... "
set key[id=831175903001355] name "What happened?"
set key[id=831175903001356] name "I still remember that day clearly. The day the demon Muzzling's song\nrang \
    through Unicorn Forest, most unicorns were possessed by evil spirits,\nlost their light and scattered in every \
    direction."
set key[id=831175903001357] name "To protect the noble light of the few pure white unicorns left,\nwe came into \
    $map:02000192$ and have been hiding here. "
set key[id=831175903001358] name "But even this place, the unicorns' only refuge, isn't safe anymore.\nThe Kwingko \
    Tomb Raiders found out there's a precious $item:30000352$ here\nand have taken over $map:02000192$."
set key[id=831175903001359] name "$item:30000352$ was the only energy source for the beacon crystal\nthat gives \
    unicorns their light... "
set key[id=831175903001360] name "$MyPCName$, please help the unicorns, who are losing strength.\nHunt \
    $npc:21091023$, $npc:21000110$ and $npc:21091021$ and get back\nthe $item:30000352$ they stole."
set key[id=831175903001361] name "$MyPCName$, please help the unicorns, who are losing strength.\nHunt \
    $npc:21091023$, $npc:21000110$ and $npc:21091021$ and get back\nthe $item:30000352$ they stole."
set key[id=831175903001362] name "Is that really $item:30000352$? They also carry fake\n$item:30000352$, so I \
    think I should check it."
set key[id=831175903001363] name "Yes, it's definitely $item:30000352$!\nWith this, I think I can light up the \
    unlit beacon crystal\nin $map:02000192$ brightly."
set key[id=831175903001364] name "$MyPCName$, will you take $item:30000352$ and\nlight up the unlit beacon \
    crystal?"
set key[id=831175903001365] name "In the meantime, I'll call the hidden unicorns and get them\nready to welcome \
    the light again."
set key[id=831175903001366] name "You don't have $item:30000352$?\nThen you'll have to hunt $npc:21091023$, \
    $npc:21000110$ and\n$npc:21091021$ again to get it."
set key[id=831175903001367] name "Ah, how long has it been since I felt such warm light...\nIt feels like I've \
    gone back to the Unicorn Forest where I used to live. "
set key[id=831175903001368] name "Without your help, $MyPCName$, the unicorns might have gone\nextinct... Thank \
    you so much."
set key[id=831175903001369] name "Ludibrium, where time has stopped, is so boring.\nI've read all of \
    $item:39000028$ and $item:39000004$ already..."
set key[id=831175903001370] name "My girlfriend Corin said it's no fun being a kid forever\nin Ludibrium, and left \
    here to find a $item:30000378$ that makes you an adult."
set key[id=831175903001371] name "Back then I didn't understand what Corin meant.\nThere were so many books to \
    read, toys, and tasty\nfood in the world."
set key[id=831175903001372] name "But these days only fierce toy monsters wander around,\nand eating the same \
    books and the same food for so long,\nI finally understand how Corin felt."
set key[id=831175903001373] name "So here's the thing. Corin said the monsters in Ludibrium eat time\nand condense \
    it inside eggs... Could you get\nthat $item:30000378$ for me too? "
set key[id=831175903001374] name "If I eat a $item:30000378$, maybe I could become an adult too,\nright? Then I \
    could find pretty Corin and marry her~ hehe"
set key[id=831175903001375] name "Could you hunt the time-eating monsters in $map:02000262$\nand get me a \
    $item:30000378$?\nI think hunting $npc:21000163$, $npc:21000171$ and $npc:21000194$ should do it... "
set key[id=831175903001376] name "Oh! I feel excited and nervous for the first time in ages.\nI'll be an adult \
    soon too, right? But where could Corin be...  "
set key[id=831175903001377] name "The doctor who made me is human too,\nbut your human circuits are built in far \
    too complex a structure."
set key[id=831175903001378] name "You cannot accept that each has a different system,\nso you take from each \
    other, get taken from, and destroy it. "
set key[id=831175903001379] name "Today again I saw it. The black shadow that destroyed this place...\nThey cut \
    off the charging circuits of all the robots here\nand swapped in a different main chipset."
set key[id=831175903001380] name "A-and soon... I too will run out of energy and no longer mo... ve...\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">(Beep-bee-beep-)</font>"
set key[id=831175903001381] name "Find the energy storage capsule in $map:02000273$.\nInstall the $item:30000353$ \
    stored inside\nin... me... <font color=\"#909090\">(Beep-beep-)</font>"
set key[id=831175903001382] name "Initializing system -\nThere is 1 last saved record."
set key[id=831175903001383] name "Open the energy storage capsule and equip $item:30000353$\nto \
    $npc:11000850[gender:1]$ <font color=\"#909090\">(Beep-bee-beep-)</font>"
set key[id=831175903001384] name "Execution halted due to insufficient energy.\nReplace $item:30000353$?"
set key[id=831175903001385] name "(Replace the energy crystal.)"
set key[id=831175903001386] name "$item:30000353$ was successfully installed in the\n$npc:11000850[gender:1]$ \
    joint."
set key[id=831175903001388] name "Initializing system information.\n$npc:11000850[gender:1]$ will start operating \
    shortly."
set key[id=831175903001390] name "$MyPCName$, you connected new energy to me.\nRegistering you in my system as an \
    ally. "
set key[id=831175903001391] name "Pant pant, it's so hot, mae.\nThis is definitely the place, so where on earth is \
    it, mae."
set key[id=831175903001392] name "What are you looking for?"
set key[id=831175903001393] name "Have you seen a red rock around here, mae?"
set key[id=831175903001394] name "No, I've never seen one."
set key[id=831175903001395] name "This is bad, mae. I really want to give a red rock\nto big brother \
    $npcName:11000018[gender:0]$... My big brother is the equipment merchant\nwho makes the finest gear in \
    $map:02000051$, mae."
set key[id=831175903001396] name "I'm going to see my brother for the first time in ages,\nand this \
    $npc:11001076[gender:0]$ can't show up empty-handed, mae."
set key[id=831175903001397] name "A peddler I met on the way said there's a $item:30000351$\nin $map:02000011$ \
    that's used to make top-grade weapons,\nbut I can't see it anywhere, mae."
set key[id=831175903001398] name "But we Yeti live in cold places, so I can't stand\nthis hot air at all, mae. I \
    can hardly breathe, mae."
set key[id=831175903001399] name "Please help me, mae. Search $map:02000011$\nfor the red rock and bring me the \
    $item:30000351$, mae."
set key[id=831175903001400] name "Search $map:02000011$ for the red rock and bring me the $item:30000351$, mae."
set key[id=831175903001401] name "Oh wow, so this is the $item:30000351$ I only heard about!\nThanks, friend, mae! \
    "
set key[id=831175903001402] name "Someday I'll be a weapon master like big brother \
    $npcName:11000018[gender:0]$\nand give $MyPCName$ a great weapon, mae!"
set key[id=831175903001403] name "Freeze! Caught you red-handed!\nI knew it. Today is your last day, you lot!"
set key[id=831175903001404] name "Why do you say that?"
set key[id=831175903001405] name "Ah, I'm sorry if I startled you.\nShh, the truth is I'm on an undercover \
    investigation right now."
set key[id=831175903001406] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=831175903001407] name "Well, it's like this.\nI don't know if you've heard of the Kwingko Tomb \
    Raiders,\nbut they're quite famous in Maple World. "
set key[id=831175903001408] name "As long as it brings money, they don't care what it is or whose it is,\nand they \
    dig through everything and carry it off."
set key[id=831175903001409] name "Last night I saw a group of Kwingko Tomb Raiders heading somewhere\nin a pack, \
    thought it was odd and tailed them,\nand sure enough they're looting again."
set key[id=831175903001410] name "$map:02000176$ is one of the ruins that the Ereve royal family\nmanages as \
    ancient relics.\nDid they find that out and come here?!"
set key[id=831175903001411] name "I think we need to arrest the Kwingko Tomb Raiders' leader\nand investigate the \
    details thoroughly."
set key[id=831175903001412] name "If you don't mind, while I interrogate the Kwingko Tomb Raiders' leader,\ncould \
    you stop the raiders from\ndigging?"
set key[id=831175903001413] name "$npc:21091022$ and $npc:21091024$ are the core, so please take care of \
    them.\nOh, and please deal with $npc:21091094$ too,\nwho seems to be in league with the raiders."
set key[id=831175903001414] name "Please take care of $npc:21091022$ and $npc:21091024$ who are looting\nin \
    $map:02000176$ and $npc:21091094$ too,\nwho seems to be in league with them."
set key[id=831175903001415] name "You're back! I couldn't find where the Kwingko Tomb Raiders'\nleader is hiding \
    at all."
set key[id=831175903001416] name "But I will find the Kwingko Tomb Raiders' leader\nand finish the unending war \
    with the raiders for good."
set key[id=831175903001417] name "Wow, jackpot! This is a jackpot incident.\nOh heavens, is this truly paradise?"
set key[id=831175903001418] name "(Ask if something good happened.)"
set key[id=831175903001419] name "Oh, yes indeed. Something amazing happened last night.\nYou see, last night I \
    was fishing\nat $map:02000015$."
set key[id=831175903001420] name "I dozed off for a moment and dreamed I reeled in a huge fish\ncovered in \
    five-colored scales. And then what do you know!!!\nI wake up and I'm in a place I've never seen in my life."
set key[id=831175903001421] name "Do you know what my lifelong wish is? "
set key[id=831175903001422] name "No, I don't."
set key[id=831175903001423] name "Of course, we only just met, how could you know.\nAnyway, my wish is to enjoy \
    ice fishing at ease in a quiet,\nsecluded spot, bothered by nobody."
set key[id=831175903001424] name "Ahh, and look at me now. In this strange place the snow falls\nso elegantly, and \
    right where I'm standing has everything\nyou need for ice fishing. "
set key[id=831175903001425] name "No nagging from my tiresome wife, no landlord with his face red as a \
    radish\nthrusting at me for the overdue shop rent~\nIt's a jackpot. A ja.ck.pot. incident, I tell you."
set key[id=831175903001426] name "But, you know, among all these perfect conditions, there's just\none thing that \
    bothers me... "
set key[id=831175903001427] name "(Ask what it is.)"
set key[id=831175903001428] name "Those things over there, raccoons or moles... whatever those odd-looking\nthings \
    are. Their noise is going to scare off all my beloved fish...\nTsk."
set key[id=831175903001429] name "For this middle-aged man worn out by a hard life, please\nstep up. Drive away \
    the $npc:21091024$ and $npc:21091022$\naround the fishing spot."
set key[id=831175903001430] name "Please drive away the $npc:21091024$ and $npc:21091022$\naround the fishing \
    spot."
set key[id=831175903001431] name "Mm, as expected! Much better.\nNow, shall I show off my skills? "
set key[id=831175903001432] name "Brr... I never thought I'd end up in a place like this, and I'm\nwearing such \
    thin clothes that it's a bit chilly."
set key[id=831175903001433] name "Sorry, but could you do me one more favor?"
set key[id=831175903001434] name "(Ask what the favor is.)"
set key[id=831175903001435] name "From now on I'll be alone for a very long time waiting for\na fish that might \
    bite someday... and it's too cold."
set key[id=831175903001436] name "I should build a campfire, so please fetch a little\n$item:30000354$ from \
    nearby. "
set key[id=831175903001437] name "Oh, and just in case, get some bait too.\nThere's a strange-looking \
    $npc:21091094$ right over there.\nDon't you think it would make pretty good fishing bait?"
set key[id=831175903001438] name "Bring me some $item:30000354$ to make a fire nearby\nand catch $npc:21091094$ to \
    use as fishing bait."
set key[id=831175903001439] name "Mm, perfect. Now everything is truly ready.\nAhh, the dream of a middle-aged \
    family man come true, it's like a dream~ Hooray~"
set key[id=831175903001440] name "Science is advancing fast, and researchers like us\nhave to keep up with it \
    quickly. "
set key[id=831175903001441] name "And one more thing! When a chance comes, you need the wisdom\nto use it as a \
    stepping stone."
set key[id=831175903001442] name "In that sense, I have both. I'd call myself\nan open-minded scientist. "
set key[id=831175903001443] name "Why do you think that?"
set key[id=831175903001444] name "Today I'm going to donate our technology to people who will let our\nstalled \
    research bloom in a better environment."
set key[id=831175903001445] name "People will say I'm selling research I staked my life on for a few coins,\nbut \
    nonsense. In the end they'll gain money and honor thanks to me too."
set key[id=831175903001446] name "(Ask whether the team members agreed.)"
set key[id=831175903001447] name "Agreed? What agreement?! Isn't it obvious?\nThey haven't said it, but they must \
    all be thinking the same as me,\nso you needn't worry about that."
set key[id=831175903001448] name "Wait, there's no time for this. Distinguished guests from $map:02000100$\nwill \
    come soon to buy my technology, so before then I must\nhurry and collect the Ark atomic chipsets."
set key[id=831175903001449] name "There's no time, so help me out.\nDefeat $npc:21000296$, \
    $npc:21000248[gender:1]$ and $npc:21000110$ here,\nand collect the Red $item:30000356$ installed in the main \
    unit."
set key[id=831175903001450] name "You'd better stay on my good side now, since I'm about to\ngain a fortune and \
    fame at once. Heh heh. "
set key[id=831175903001451] name "Defeat $npc:21000296$, $npc:21000248[gender:1]$ and $npc:21000110$ in \
    $map:02000274$\nand collect the Red $item:30000356$ installed\nin the main unit."
set key[id=831175903001452] name "Mm, this is enough. When they see the goods, they'll surely\nbe satisfied. Good \
    work."
set key[id=831175903001453] name "W-w-w-what's with that look?\nAre you blaming me right now? Y-you are?"
set key[id=831175903001454] name "Did the Royal Guard send you... to arrest me?\nOr are you a minion of some \
    d-demon from the abyss? "
set key[id=831175903001455] name "Why do you say that?"
set key[id=831175903001456] name "Ah ha ha ha! I-I'm joking. \nAs if I'd wake some demon... ugh, no, no, no, \
    that's not it."
set key[id=831175903001457] name "(Tell me slowly what happened.)"
set key[id=831175903001458] name "W-well... it was... a mistake.\nNo!! It wasn't even a mistake. I didn't know. \
    How could I have known\nthat song was the one that wakes Cerberus... Waaah... sob..."
set key[id=831175903001459] name "What is the Song of Cerberus?"
set key[id=831175903001460] name "It's... it's the song you sing to wake the dogs of the demons...\nI knew \
    nothing... The moonlight in the night was so enchanting\nthat I only hummed a bit of a tune that sounded \
    familiar. "
set key[id=831175903001461] name "But then... ha ha, ha ha, how funny!\nMy song woke that terrifying demon dog \
    $npc:23000045$...\nsob... Can you believe it?"
set key[id=831175903001462] name "P-p-please. Please... please...\nCould you go and get rid of $npc:23000045$ for \
    me?\nThat's the only way I can be free. I'm begging you."
set key[id=831175903001463] name "Defeat $npc:23000045$ in $map:02000044$.\nThat's the only way I can be free."
set key[id=831175903001464] name "Sob... sob sob... The tears won't stop.\nThis should be when I laugh... why is \
    this happening... sob"
set key[id=831175903001465] name "My dear hometown $map:02000051$ that I had to leave,\nthe Kaka tribe people who \
    were like family...\nI miss them all so, so much. Sob... "
set key[id=831175903001466] name "Thank you so much for helping me. I feel like I can finally\nput down the burden \
    I would have carried all my life. Now I can leave this place."
set key[id=901101205000007] name "$MyPCName$, have you tried the Tropical Juice yet?\nNot yet? Geez, how \
    provincial.\nYou have to drink things like that so you can show off to everyone when you go back to \
    $map:63000001$."
set key[id=901101205000008] name "Oh, and next to the Tropical Juice stand, I saw a vagrant the likes of which I \
    haven't even seen in the countryside.\nI was so startled I just walked past, but now that I think about it, I \
    should have given him a few coins."
set key[id=901101205000009] name "I need to look around $map:02000062$ some more,\nso you go give that vagrant \
    some charity and ask if there's anything he needs help with."
set key[id=901101205000010] name "He looked so pitiful, shivering in the cold.\nHm? You're telling me to go \
    myself? I still have to look around here,\nand I have to hurry to $map:02000001$, so I have no time!"
set key[id=901101205000011] name "Ugh... ugh... uuugh... where am I?\nOh dear, I must have passed out."
set key[id=901101205000012] name "Got it! A balloon that lost its owner floated in from the western sky."
set key[id=901101205000013] name "Judging by the name tag reading <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000389[gender:0]$</font> hanging from the string tied to the balloon,\nthe owner must \
    be someone called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000389[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=901101205000014] name "I wonder if the owner is feeling down?\nI have to get back to my sister, \
    so\nwould you bring this balloon to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000389[gender:0]$</font>, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=901101205000015] name "The owner must be so upset."
set key[id=901101205000016] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Open one hand.)</font> Did you lose a balloon?"
set key[id=901101205000017] name "Don't worry."
set key[id=901101205000018] name "It was floating this way, so I caught it. Here you go."
set key[id=901101205000019] name "Oh, come on, it's in your other hand.\nIt's so light, you must not have even \
    noticed you were holding it."
set key[id=901101205000020] name "What are you carrying in both hands? And your bag looks full too."
set key[id=901101205000021] name "Yes, I trust you'll find the owner quickly."
set key[id=901101205000022] name "During the busy season when crowds flock in, securing supplies is \
    important.\nEven a single balloon is precious. Thank you for finding it."
set key[id=901101205000023] name "Huh? Have you seen the little girl who was here?"
set key[id=901101205000024] name "She ordered juice and then vanished.\nAnd she already paid, too."
set key[id=901101205000025] name "What does she look like?"
set key[id=901101205000026] name "Her hair was in two pigtails. Hmm???\nI think she was wearing a dress with a \
    pocket, too."
set key[id=901101205000027] name "I think I've seen her."
set key[id=901101205000028] name "That's great.\nCould you take this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000195$</font> to her?"
set key[id=901101205000029] name "What's wrong?"
set key[id=901101205000030] name "I slipped and spilled the juice."
set key[id=901101205000031] name "I can't find the girl."
set key[id=901101205000032] name "I made a fresh one, so this time carry it carefully and don't spill it on the \
    road."
set key[id=901101205000033] name "You hardly spilled any. It's practically brand new,\nso you can just deliver it \
    as it is."
set key[id=901101205000034] name "Your load looks heavy! Be bold and get rid of what you don't need!"
set key[id=901101205000035] name "How far could a little kid have gone?\nShe must be somewhere in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000062$</font>."
set key[id=901101205000036] name "Oh, right! I forgot all about the juice!\nThank you for bringing it to me!"
set key[id=901101205000037] name "Heave-ho!!"
set key[id=901101205000038] name "What are you doing?"
set key[id=901101205000039] name "The wheel must have broken in the shaking of the ground, because the cart keeps \
    toppling over.\nI'm trying to set it upright again. Would you help me?\nJust stand one up. I'll handle the \
    rest."
set key[id=901101205000040] name "What's wrong? Not confident?\nShout and put your back into it like I did \
    earlier, and lift with all your might."
set key[id=901101205000041] name "You're stronger than you look."
set key[id=901101205000042] name "If you're planning to walk straight along this bridge,\nplease pass a word to my \
    wife on the way."
set key[id=901101205000043] name "Tell her to stop looking for helpers and come back quickly.\nShe went off to \
    find someone to stand the toppled cart back up,\nand she hasn't shown any sign of coming back."
set key[id=901101205000044] name "If she couldn't find anyone, she should've just come back, but she went all the \
    way to the end."
set key[id=901101205000045] name "I asked you to call my wife, so why did you come instead?\nSee that woman over \
    there at the end of this road? That's my wife."
set key[id=901101205000046] name "Hahaha... I've come all the way out here already. I'd better head back.\nThanks \
    for telling me!"
set key[id=901101205000047] name "With the bridge broken and the roads wrecked,\ncomplaints are going to come \
    pouring in from all over about the inconvenience."
set key[id=901101205000048] name "We're repairing the destroyed ladders first, but we're short on materials.\nThe \
    $npc:21000007$ took all the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000196$</font> we had in the warehouse."
set key[id=901101205000049] name "Since this is for the residents here,\nwould you take back the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000196$</font> from the $npc:21000007$?"
set key[id=901101205000050] name "I know it's not easy to get the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000196$</font>.\nPlease hang in there a little longer."
set key[id=901101205000051] name "You got them quickly. I should have asked you sooner instead of struggling on my \
    own.\nSupport staff should arrive soon too, so now all that's left is to put in the effort."
set key[id=901101205000052] name "Oh, would it be all right if I asked one more favor?"
set key[id=901101205000053] name "What's the favor?"
set key[id=901101205000054] name "One of our team members is already out at the survey site.\nHe must be waiting \
    desperately for the survey equipment to arrive."
set key[id=901101205000055] name "But we're short-handed, so the equipment hasn't been sorted yet,\nand it looks \
    like we can't send it over right away."
set key[id=901101205000056] name "Could you tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000617[gender:0]$</font> at the \
    earthquake survey site\nto survey by eye for now and write up a report?"
set key[id=901101205000057] name "That friend must be pretty frustrated right now.\nI'd appreciate it if you could \
    hurry a little."
set key[id=901101205000058] name "Goodness, I'm at a loss for what to do."
set key[id=901101205000059] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Gulp...)</font>\nGoodness, my feet won't budge, so I \
    can't get any closer, goodness..."
set key[id=901101205000060] name "What happened?"
set key[id=901101205000061] name "Do you see over there?\nMaybe because of the big earthquake, there's still some \
    ground that keeps shaking.\nI'm told to survey that spot, but, goodness..."
set key[id=901101205000062] name "What am I supposed to do if I get close and the ground caves in, goodness..."
set key[id=901101205000063] name "May I go in your place?"
set key[id=901101205000064] name "If you want to go, who am I to say otherwise?\nGoodness, I never asked you to \
    go, understand."
set key[id=901101205000065] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Pretends not to hear and acts oblivious.)</font>"
set key[id=901101205000066] name "Steam sometimes shoots out of the ground.\nIf you touch the steam, a person gets \
    blown away.\nWould writing that in the report do, goodness..."
set key[id=901101205000067] name "I almost got hurt."
set key[id=901101205000068] name "If you go close you may get hurt, so be careful.\nI'll write that down."
set key[id=901101205000069] name "(Shake your head.)"
set key[id=901101205000070] name "I'll finish writing my report before I go."
set key[id=901101205000071] name "$MyPCName$, I have one more favor to ask."
set key[id=901101205000072] name "(Ask what the favor is.)"
set key[id=901101205000073] name "I'd like you to bring this <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000070$</font> to \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000157[gender:0]$</font>.\nIf it's delivered quickly, they should be able to \
    pack the supplies to send to $map:02000001$. "
set key[id=901101205000074] name "I'll look into whether there are any more food ingredients we can get around \
    here."
set key[id=901101205000075] name "You're back."
set key[id=901101205000076] name "I lost the $item:30000070$."
set key[id=901101205000077] name "Where is $npc:11000157[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=901101205000078] name "You dropped the $item:30000070$ on the ground. I picked it up."
set key[id=901101205000079] name "Your bag looks quite heavy... hold on, let me check.\nHaha... you must have been \
    flustered because of the monsters."
set key[id=901101205000080] name "Luckily I picked it up.\nBut your bag is full. There's no room for it."
set key[id=901101205000081] name "If you follow this road straight, you'll reach our camp.\nYou should be able to \
    meet $npc:11000157[gender:0]$ there."
set key[id=901101205000082] name "I was worried we'd lost all the food ingredients, so I'm very glad we at least \
    got this."
set key[id=901101205000083] name "Hey, hey!!"
set key[id=901101205000084] name "(Look around.)"
set key[id=901101205000085] name "Over here!! Yes, the bookshelf you're looking at! I'm in here!"
set key[id=901101205000086] name "(Listen quietly.)"
set key[id=901101205000087] name "Some jerk moved me over here and stuck me on this shelf.\nIt's full of rough, \
    rowdy types in here!\nBeing stuck side by side with guys like these is unbearable, really!"
set key[id=901101205000088] name "What do you want?"
set key[id=901101205000089] name "Get me out of here quickly and move me to the shelf where I originally \
    belong.\nOh, that shelf will be locked. <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000216$</font> has the key."
set key[id=901101205000090] name "What happened?"
set key[id=901101205000091] name "I put the book down for a moment because it was heavy."
set key[id=901101205000092] name "I'm just passing by."
set key[id=901101205000093] name "Put me down, huh...\nYou tossed me on the library floor and left."
set key[id=901101205000094] name "How did you end up back on the shelf?"
set key[id=901101205000095] name "Some cursed monster stuck me back here! Hurry up and take me with you."
set key[id=901101205000096] name "Stop thinking silly things and move me to the shelf I belong on."
set key[id=901101205000097] name "A monster stuck me back here!\nHuh? Your bag is full! Make some room for me!"
set key[id=901101205000098] name "I can't stand being near this shelf, so let's hurry past it."
set key[id=901101205000099] name "Hey, it's great to see you, friends! Hahaha."
set key[id=901101205000100] name "Do you like it here?"
set key[id=901101205000101] name "Of course! I'm back in my own home.\nMy heart's pounding! Hahaha."
set key[id=901101205000122] name "What in the world, where did the ladle go this time?\nThose rascals, they stole \
    it again, again!"
set key[id=901101205000123] name "Do you know who took it?"
set key[id=901101205000124] name "Who else would it be? Those monsters, of course.\nFor fun or whatever, they're \
    always swiping this and that\nand hiding it behind mushrooms or in the grass."
set key[id=901101205000125] name "If this old lady were just one year younger, I'd chase after them and catch \
    them,\nbut now it'd take half a day just to go over there and back."
set key[id=901101205000126] name "I'll find it for you."
set key[id=901101205000127] name "Really?\nGo straight down along the stream down there.\nIf you search the grass \
    near the brook again this time, it should turn up."
set key[id=901101205000128] name "Are your eyes as dim as mine? Why haven't you found it yet?"
set key[id=901101205000129] name "You found it already? Well done, well done."
set key[id=901101205000148] name "If you're heading to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000118$</font>, I have a \
    favor to ask!"
set key[id=901101205000149] name "I got a request to bring food because the Royal Guard base is running low on \
    stored provisions,\nbut who'd stuff a pack full of things that can spoil, like food?"
set key[id=901101205000150] name "Please tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000157[gender:0]$</font> that I need \
    to stop by a nearby village to get food,\nso it'll take me a while."
set key[id=901101205000151] name "Oh, and I hear there are lots of monsters in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000118$</font>...\nWould you chase some monsters off to make my way easier?"
set key[id=901101205000152] name "Are you always this slow? What are you doing?"
set key[id=901101205000153] name "$npc:11000546[gender:0]$ is going to be late? That's unfortunate, but it can't \
    be helped.\nThe base on the other side is taking measures too, so it'll work out somehow."
set key[id=915214503001683] name "Ugh, I'm so upset I could die.\nThese days there are hardly any customers, and \
    the shop is just flies... "
set key[id=915214503001684] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=915214503001685] name "It's because of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001116[gender:1]$</font>... Oh, \
    my daughter, I mean.\nShe hasn't eaten for days and just stays at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000328$</font>\nall day long... "
set key[id=915214503001686] name "Ever since the garden of $map:02000167$ became <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">contaminated</font>,\nI've been uneasy, afraid something will happen, and I've blocked off \
    the entrance... "
set key[id=915214503001687] name "I've scolded her and I've coaxed her, but she won't listen at all.\n$MyPCName$, \
    would you meet my daughter <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001116[gender:1]$</font>?"
set key[id=915214503001688] name "If you go to the entrance of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000328$</font>, you \
    can meet $npc:11001116[gender:1]$.\nPlease talk her gently into going <font color=\"#ffd200\">home</font>."
set key[id=915214503001689] name "Please go to the entrance of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000328$</font>, meet \
    my daughter $npc:11001116[gender:1]$,\nand talk her gently into going back <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">home</font>."
set key[id=915214503001690] name "I know you came to persuade me.\nMy mom sent you again, right...?"
set key[id=915214503001691] name "I know it all. The garden is very, very <font color=\"#ffd200\">dangerous</font> \
    now,\nand because I keep going there, Mom is <font color=\"#ffd200\">worried</font> about me... "
set key[id=915214503001692] name "But I can't go back like this. The beautiful <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">garden</font> got\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">contaminated</font> and it's all <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">my fault</font>... sob sob."
set key[id=915214503001693] name "Why do you say that?"
set key[id=915214503001694] name "Actually, I'm the one who planted the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seeds</font> in \
    the garden...\nAn old lady selling seeds came and gave them to me, saying they were red tulip seeds...\nI only \
    wanted to make a real tulip garden... "
set key[id=915214503001695] name "But then... but then... waaaah~ sob.\nI don't know... sob... "
set key[id=915214503001696] name "Don't cry, tell me slowly."
set key[id=915214503001697] name "What grew from the seeds I planted weren't flowers,\nbut <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">monsters</font> full of <font color=\"#ffd200\">deadly poison</font>... "
set key[id=915214503001698] name "It's all because of me. If only I hadn't hastily accepted\nthose <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">seeds</font> and planted them... sob...  "
set key[id=915214503001699] name "$MyPCName$, please help me. Please help me\nbring the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">beautiful garden</font> <font color=\"#ffd200\">back</font>. Please? Please?"
set key[id=915214503001700] name "If you only defeat the <font color=\"#ffd200\">monsters</font> born from the \
    seeds planted in\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000328$</font>, I'm sure $map:02000328$ will\nbe able to \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">return</font> to how it was. "
set key[id=915214503001701] name "Please defeat the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001101$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001102$</font>\nborn from the seeds planted in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000328$</font>."
set key[id=915214503001702] name "Yay! Really, really? I did it!\n$MyPCName$ saved our <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Oasis Garden</font>!"
set key[id=915214503001703] name "Thank you, thank you, thank you so much!\nNow I won't worry my mom anymore! \
    Thank you."
set key[id=915214503001730] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">No.con.science!</font> People these days have no law, no \
    morals, no conscience!\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">selfish</font> idea that as long as I live comfortably \
    it's fine... "
set key[id=915214503001731] name "If you have eyes, look at this harbor! I can't even tell\nwhether it's a harbor \
    or a landfill, with all kinds of\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">trash</font> floating around!"
set key[id=915214503001732] name "Does sorting recyclables take a month, or a year? Tsk tsk\n$map:02000139$ is \
    about to become Barota's <font color=\"#ffd200\">garbage dump</font>."
set key[id=915214503001733] name "Ugh, forget it. There are people who throw things away and\npeople who clean up, \
    so there's no reason for me alone\nto pick up <font color=\"#ffd200\">trash</font> day after day!"
set key[id=915214503001734] name "If it bothers you so much, go clean up the <font color=\"#ffd200\">trash</font> \
    yourself.\nI don't want to worry about it anymore!"
set key[id=915214503001735] name "All kinds of <font color=\"#ffd200\">trash</font> is floating around, so you \
    can't tell whether\nit's a harbor or a landfill. If it really bothers you, go and\nclean up that trash."
set key[id=915214503001736] name "Oh, what's this?! It was full of trash a moment ago...\nDon't tell me you really \
    went and <font color=\"#ffd200\">cleaned it all up</font>?"
set key[id=915214503001737] name "Wow, I only lost my temper and grumbled a few words...\nI can't thank you \
    enough!"
set key[id=915214503001738] name "Good work, really good work!\nI finally feel like working again. Ha ha."
set key[id=915214503001739] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Fidget, fidget)</font>"
set key[id=915214503001740] name "I ask what happened."
set key[id=915214503001741] name "It... it's like this, you see. I found something so amazing\nthat my heart is \
    pounding."
set key[id=915214503001742] name "Well, what do you call it... In there, I saw the legendary\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000385$</font>. No doubt about it."
set key[id=915214503001743] name "(Ask what $item:30000385$ is.)"
set key[id=915214503001744] name "Goodness, $MyPCName$, you don't know <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000385$</font>?\nIt's perfect for clearing out all the filth in your body.\nI mean \
    the waste, and for <font color=\"#ffd200\">detoxing</font>."
set key[id=915214503001745] name "But I only got as far as the entrance of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000037$</font>... Oh my...\nEyes, nose, mouth, every hole in my face got blocked \
    up\nand stung something awful... "
set key[id=915214503001746] name "I truly came out half <font color=\"#ffd200\">dead</font>.\nBut letting it slip \
    away before my eyes makes my heart ache...\nI can't give up and I can't go in, what am I to do... "
set key[id=915214503001747] name "Looking at you, $MyPCName$, you seem strong, and your arms and legs are\nmuch \
    sturdier than mine... Could you go into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000037$</font> in my place\nand pull \
    out some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000385$</font>?"
set key[id=915214503001748] name "I'll be sure to reward you for it.\nPlease, $MyPCName$, I'm counting on you. "
set key[id=915214503001749] name "Could you go into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000037$</font> in my place, \
    $MyPCName$,\nand pull out some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000385$</font>?"
set key[id=915214503001750] name "I... I... <font color=\"#ffd200\">Eureka!</font> Hooray~\nGoodness, it's \
    dazzling. This is the real <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000385$</font>, isn't it?\nIsn't it? Really?"
set key[id=915214503001751] name "I... I... <font color=\"#ffd200\">Eureka!</font>\n$MyPCName$, you're my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">benefactor</font> for life. Thank you so much."
set key[id=915214503001752] name "Shh, you! Come over here a moment.\nI don't know what business brings you to \
    such a rough place,\nbut you'd better <font color=\"#ffd200\">watch yourself</font>. "
set key[id=915214503001753] name "(Ask what's wrong.)"
set key[id=915214503001754] name "At first I came to explore here just because I heard of\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">ice that never melts</font>... but when I arrived I found that\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">something more dangerous</font> is happening here."
set key[id=915214503001755] name "See those guys down there?\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21099190$</font>. "
set key[id=915214503001756] name "They look like worthless little bats,\nbut they have <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">tremendous power</font>."
set key[id=915214503001757] name "They're the ones breathing out <font color=\"#ffd200\">cold</font> and freezing \
    everything around.\nThey breed fast too, and every time I wake up their numbers\nhave doubled or tripled."
set key[id=915214503001758] name "If this goes on, they may <font color=\"#ffd200\">freeze</font> not just this \
    area\nbut all of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000085$</font>."
set key[id=915214503001759] name "There's no time, so please help. See that giant ice statue down there?\nGo down \
    to the cold-filled place in the middle of\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000085$</font> and defeat the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21099190$</font>."
set key[id=915214503001760] name "There's no time, so please help. See that giant ice statue down there?\nGo down \
    to the cold-filled place in the middle of\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000085$</font> and defeat the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21099190$</font>."
set key[id=915214503001761] name "Phew, even $npcName:11001131[gender:0]$ here can feel the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">cold</font>,\nso those <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21099190$</font> are no ordinary \
    creatures."
set key[id=915214503001762] name "Thanks to you their numbers are down for now, but we'll need to\nkeep a closer \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">eye</font> on their movements for a while."
set key[id=915214503001763] name "Is anybody out there? Here, over here!\nThere are <font color=\"#ffd200\">people \
    trapped in the warehouse!</font>"
set key[id=915214503001764] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=915214503001765] name "We hid in the warehouse to avoid the monsters, but the door\ngot <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">locked</font> from outside and we're stuck."
set key[id=915214503001766] name "Everyone trapped in here hasn't been able to eat anything\nfor days."
set key[id=915214503001767] name "Oh, is <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001133[gender:0]$</font> out there by \
    any chance? "
set key[id=915214503001768] name "(Ask who $npcName:11001133[gender:0]$ is.)"
set key[id=915214503001769] name "Oh, $npcName:11001133[gender:0]$ said they'd go find the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000386$</font>...\nThey may have been <font color=\"#ffd200\">attacked</font> by \
    monsters nearby,\nso could you look for <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001133[gender:0]$</font>?"
set key[id=915214503001770] name "Could you look for <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001133[gender:0]$</font>, who \
    has the $item:30000386$,\nnear the warehouse in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000085$</font>?"
set key[id=915214503001771] name "Ugh, h-help me!\nI hurt my leg and can't walk."
set key[id=915214503001772] name "Thank you. I thought I was done for and would be\nmonster food. Phew."
set key[id=915214503001773] name "(Ask why he's hiding in a place like this.)"
set key[id=915214503001774] name "Don't even ask. I was passing through <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000085$</font>\nwhen I heard a cry <font color=\"#ffd200\">for help</font>, and found \
    the warehouse door <font color=\"#ffd200\">locked</font>\nwith people stuck inside."
set key[id=915214503001775] name "I barely managed to find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000386$</font> and \
    was heading back\nwhen monsters suddenly attacked, and I <font color=\"#ffd200\">lost</font> the key...\nI \
    hurt my leg running away and have been hiding here ever since."
set key[id=915214503001776] name "(Ask if he's all right.)"
set key[id=915214503001777] name "My leg is a little sore, but I can still bear it.\nMore importantly, I have to \
    get the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000386$</font> back from the monsters... "
set key[id=915214503001778] name "I can't handle those things on my own, so $MyPCName$,\nwould you get the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000386$</font> back for me?"
set key[id=915214503001779] name "The attack was so sudden I don't know which one it was,\nbut one of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000063$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000302$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000016$</font>\nor <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21099190$</font> nearby should have \
    it."
set key[id=915214503001780] name "One of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000063$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000302$</font>,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000016$</font> or <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21099190$</font> nearby should have the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000386$</font>."
set key[id=915214503001781] name "You're back?!\nDid you find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000386$</font>?"
set key[id=915214503001782] name "I found it."
set key[id=915214503001783] name "Ah, what a relief. Thank goodness.\nWe can thank each other later, but we should \
    hurry to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">warehouse</font>. "
set key[id=915214503001784] name "First, use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000386$</font> to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">open the warehouse door</font>\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">rescue</font> the people trapped \
    inside. That's the priority."
set key[id=915214503001785] name "I hear everyone trapped there hasn't been able to eat anything\nfor a while, and \
    I'm seriously worried about their <font color=\"#ffd200\">health</font>."
set key[id=915214503001786] name "There's no time. Use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000386$</font> to open \
    the warehouse door,\ngo inside <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000330$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">rescue</font> the people."
set key[id=915214503001787] name "The door... it finally opened! We're saved! We're saved!\nEveryone, we can go \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">home</font> now!"
set key[id=915214503001788] name "I don't know how to thank you. I gritted my teeth and held on\nso the others \
    wouldn't be even more worn out if I weakened,\nbut honestly I was barely hanging on too...  "
set key[id=915214503001789] name "The warm sunlight, the cool breeze and fresh air... I missed it all.\nI must \
    pull everyone together and <font color=\"#ffd200\">escape</font> from here quickly. "
set key[id=915214503001790] name "Here it comes, I can feel it!\nSniff sniff, hey you!! You've got the scent of a \
    tough <font color=\"#ffd200\">hunt</font> on you!"
set key[id=915214503001791] name "I don't know what you mean."
set key[id=915214503001792] name "Oh my, modest too?! I like it, I really do.\nHow about it, want to do some <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">work</font> with me?"
set key[id=915214503001793] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=915214503001794] name "I'm the greatest <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001139[gender:0]$</font> of this \
    age.\nMeeting me today will be the <font color=\"#ffd200\">luckiest</font> moment of your life."
set key[id=915214503001795] name "Why? Because I have a stock of rare <font color=\"#ffd200\">hides</font> that \
    sell at the highest prices in every\ncountry. An adventurer with a light purse like you couldn't even\ndare to \
    ask the price. Ha ha."
set key[id=915214503001796] name "But if you do me a favor, I might make you whatever\nyou need. "
set key[id=915214503001797] name "(Ask what the favor is.)"
set key[id=915214503001798] name "Wait, now that I say it, this isn't a favor. Let me correct that, it's an \
    offer.\nAnyway, not long ago I found a very, very <font color=\"#ffd200\">rare piece of hide</font>\nin this \
    place. "
set key[id=915214503001799] name "What is it, you ask? It's the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000387$</font> of \
    $npc:21000026$ and\nthe <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000388$</font> of $npc:21000067$. "
set key[id=915214503001800] name "I've spent twenty-odd years collecting rare hides in this business,\nbut a hide \
    with such a fine <font color=\"#ffd200\">luster</font>... gasp, I'm getting carried away again... "
set key[id=915214503001801] name "I may look like this, but all I have is money and looks!\nI'll reward you \
    generously, so quickly! Bring me those! Those!"
set key[id=915214503001802] name "Bring me the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000387$</font> of $npc:21000026$ \
    and\nthe <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000388$</font> of $npc:21000067$ from $map:02000054$."
set key[id=915214503001803] name "Ugh... my heart is racing...\nUgh... my head is spinning...\nIs this it! Is this \
    the... "
set key[id=915214503001804] name "Hey hey, easy, easy now. What if you scratch it?\nHeh, wait just a moment. I'm \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">dizzy</font> and need time to calm down."
set key[id=915214503001805] name "Did you see it? Did you see it? "
set key[id=915214503001806] name "(Ask what he means.)"
set key[id=915214503001807] name "Phew, haah, wait a moment, let me take a deep breath...\nWell, on this rough \
    construction site, a <font color=\"#ffd200\">hat</font> that looks like it's pouring out\nblue light suddenly \
    popped up, poof! "
set key[id=915214503001808] name "There was really nothing around here at all, and then it just went <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">poof</font>.\nLike... a <font color=\"#ffd200\">dimensional door</font> to a new \
    world...\nor something like that?"
set key[id=915214503001809] name "Ahh... what should I do? What do I do? Should I go or not?\nI have things to do \
    right now, and loads of homework... and if I roam around\nlate at night, I'll get a bomb of nagging from Mom \
    again... sigh."
set key[id=915214503001810] name "$MyPCName$, why don't you go inside that\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">mysterious \
    hat</font> leaking blue light?! "
set key[id=915214503001811] name "My $npc:11000471[gender:0]$ gut feeling says... hmm...\nthat place must be full \
    of <font color=\"#ffd200\">adventure</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">mystery</font>!"
set key[id=915214503001812] name "Why not go inside the <font color=\"#ffd200\">mysterious hat</font> leaking blue \
    light?!\nI'm sure it's full of adventure and mystery! "
set key[id=915214503001813] name "How did it go? Did you go?\nDid you see the <font color=\"#ffd200\">world inside \
    the hat</font>? Did you?"
set key[id=915214503001814] name "I went."
set key[id=915214503001815] name "Wow! Really? So what was there?\nAhhhhh, no! Stop, that's enough!\nDon't tell me \
    any more."
set key[id=915214503001816] name "I want to go and see it myself.\nAmazing! $MyPCName$, you're amazing! Ha ha, ha \
    ha ha."
set key[id=915214503001817] name "Honestly... they say bad things come all at once...\nThere are so many headaches \
    lately."
set key[id=915214503001818] name "I ask what's wrong."
set key[id=915214503001819] name "As the construction falls behind, $map:02000100$ is less and less\nwilling to \
    give <font color=\"#ffd200\">funding</font>, and the workers are leaving one by one\nso we're short-handed \
    too... sigh... "
set key[id=915214503001820] name "Above all, the biggest problem is those <font color=\"#ffd200\">pest \
    monsters</font>.\nThey look like dog noses, and what they do is\neven worse."
set key[id=915214503001821] name "They throw <font color=\"#ffd200\">bombs</font> everywhere and swing crude <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">tire clubs</font>,\nso all the cement we piled up is falling down."
set key[id=915214503001822] name "It seems they can smell honey once the Rockefeller Tower is finished,\nso \
    they're trying to <font color=\"#ffd200\">take over</font> this area ahead of time... No way!"
set key[id=915214503001823] name "All the years I've given this place...\nI can't just back down, my past years \
    would be\ntoo <font color=\"#ffd200\">wasted</font>. I can't stand it."
set key[id=915214503001824] name "Could you deal with those outlaws for me?\nJust seeing <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000282$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21099049$</font> gives me a splitting \
    headache now."
set key[id=915214503001825] name "Could you deal with those outlaws occupying\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000136$</font>?\nJust seeing <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000282$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21099049$</font> gives me a splitting headache now."
set key[id=915214503001826] name "Mm, you handle things much more cleanly than I expected.\nWould you want to \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">work</font> with me here? "
set key[id=915214503001827] name "Thanks, but I'll pass."
set key[id=915214503001828] name "You turn me down cleanly too, so you really aren't interested, are you?\nWell, \
    it can't be helped. Anyway, thank you. "
set key[id=916002301000347] name "Mmm... I really want some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000395$</font>.\nMommy \
    used to make it for me all the time... but these days she doesn't even make me snacks.\nShe says she's really \
    busy with work... "
set key[id=916002301000348] name "So I decided to try making it myself...\nI secretly took <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcTitle:11001146$ $npcName:11001146$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001147$</font> out when Mommy wasn't looking.\nMommy might scold me, but... I \
    really, really want some <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000395$</font>~ "
set key[id=916002301000349] name "They say all the ingredients for making <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000395$</font>\ncan be found here in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000257$</font>.\nBut... it's too hard for me, so I couldn't even start.\nCould you \
    help me, $MyPCName$...?"
set key[id=916002301000350] name "I'll help."
set key[id=916002301000351] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">ingredients for $item:30000395$</font> are...\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000390$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000392$</font>,\nand... <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000391$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000393$</font>."
set key[id=916002301000352] name "If I'm reading $npc:11001146$ right, it says...\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000390$</font> comes from defeating <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000031$</font>...\nand <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000392$</font> comes from \
    defeating <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000009$</font>."
set key[id=916002301000353] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000391$</font> can be found at the\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">chocolate spring</font> in $map:02000257$...\nand <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000393$</font> can be\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">gathered from the red trees</font> in \
    $map:02000257$. "
set key[id=916002301000354] name "So there are <font color=\"#ffd200\">4 ingredients</font> in all, but...\nMmm... \
    I don't know how many of each we need.\nBut, well... <font color=\"#ffd200\">roughly... a generous 10 of \
    each</font> should be fine, right?"
set key[id=916002301000355] name "Please tell me the <font color=\"#ffd200\">exact number</font>, not a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">rough guess</font>."
set key[id=916002301000356] name "Aww... don't look at me like that...\nWhat can I do if it's not in the \
    recipe~?\nIf you don't believe me... read the $npc:11001146$ next to me... "
set key[id=916002301000357] name "Anyway, that should be plenty.\nMmm... if there's extra, we can use it next \
    time...\nFirst, please gather <font color=\"#ffd200\"> 10 each</font> of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">4 \
    ingredients</font> I told you about... okay?"
set key[id=916002301000358] name "Waaah... that candy my mommy used to make for me...\nI really want some \
    $item:30000395$!\nI need to get the ingredients... won't you help me?"
set key[id=916002301000359] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">ingredients for $item:30000395$</font> are... <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000390$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000392$</font>,\nand... <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000391$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000393$</font>."
set key[id=916002301000360] name "Mmm... the $npc:11001146$ doesn't say how many of each we need, so I'm not \
    sure...\nbut <font color=\"#ffd200\">roughly... a generous 10 of each</font> should do it."
set key[id=916002301000361] name "Wow...\n$MyPCName$, you're so cool...!"
set key[id=916002301000362] name "I'm sure the <font color=\"#ffd200\">4 ingredients</font> you got me, \
    $MyPCName$, are the ones we need, but...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">I still don't know how many of each we \
    need.</font>"
set key[id=916002301000363] name "Mmm... maybe I missed something, so...\nwould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">take \
    another look at the $npc:11001146$, $MyPCName$...?</font>"
set key[id=916002301000364] name "Did you read the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001146$</font>?"
set key[id=916002301000365] name "I read it."
set key[id=916002301000366] name "Mmm... so it really doesn't say how many of each ingredient we need in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001146$</font>...?\nDid my mommy forget to write it down...? Aww... "
set key[id=916002301000367] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001146$</font> is right next to me.\nPlease \
    read it...\nI'm telling you, it really doesn't say how many of each we need~"
set key[id=916002301000368] name "Aww... see~\nI was right, wasn't I~? It doesn't say how many of each ingredient \
    we need, does it?"
set key[id=916002301000369] name "It was written on the back of the recipe. "
set key[id=916002301000370] name "Oh... there was a back side... Aww... \nThen I'll try making <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000395$</font> now!"
set key[id=916002301000371] name "Oh...! $MyPCName$...!\nYou're still here...!"
set key[id=916002301000372] name "Aww... something's strange.\nI'm sure I put in the ingredients just like the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001146$</font> says, but...\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001147$ keeps \
    spitting the ingredients back out...</font>\nMmm... what did I do wrong...?"
set key[id=916002301000373] name "Would you like to try, $MyPCName$...?\nJust make <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000395$</font> with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001147$</font>\nexactly \
    as it says in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001146$</font>...!"
set key[id=916002301000374] name "Mmm... is it not working for you either, $MyPCName$...?\nDoes $npcName:11001147$ \
    keep spitting the ingredients back out for you too, $MyPCName$...?\n$MyPCName$, you're older than me, so I \
    thought you'd do it well... "
set key[id=916002301000375] name "You have to put the ingredients we gathered earlier into the \
    $npcName:11001147$,\nin <font color=\"#ffd200\">the amount needed of each</font>, just as it's written on the \
    back of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001146$</font>...\nMaking <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000395$</font> must be really hard... Aww... "
set key[id=916002301000376] name "Wow...! <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000395$</font>...!\nI knew you'd \
    succeed, $MyPCName$...! "
set key[id=916002301000377] name "Hehe... it's been so long since I've had <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000395$</font>...\nThank you so much~!"
set key[id=917194303001829] name "Sigh, thanks to your help last time, I thought the contaminated\ngarden was \
    fully <font color=\"#ffd200\">purified</font>, $MyPCName$... but it wasn't."
set key[id=917194303001830] name "(Ask what happened to the garden this time.)"
set key[id=917194303001831] name "Well... sob... as time passed the flowers and grass slowly\nlost their life and \
    turned black again and <font color=\"#ffd200\">withered</font>."
set key[id=917194303001832] name "I even wrote a letter to the professor of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000023$</font> far away\nto ask, and they said <font color=\"#ffd200\">spore \
    powder</font> spread through the air and\nprobably bloomed flowers somewhere else again."
set key[id=917194303001833] name "The people of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000167$</font> were so happy when \
    the garden\nreturned to how it used to be... sob sob "
set key[id=917194303001834] name "$MyPCName$, I'm begging you, could you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000328$</font>\none more time and check?"
set key[id=917194303001835] name "The man who went in last, before the garden was <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">closed</font> off again, said\nhe saw an enormously, enormously <font color=\"#ffd200\">huge \
    flower</font> just before he fled... "
set key[id=917194303001836] name "Hmm... what was its name...\nAh! <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001103$</font>... Yes, that's definitely the name.\nPlease get rid of $npc:24001103$. \
    Please?"
set key[id=917194303001837] name "Please go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000328$</font> one more time \
    and\nget rid of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001103$</font>. Please?"
set key[id=917194303001838] name "This time, the garden won't ever be <font color=\"#ffd200\">contaminated</font> \
    again,\nright...? "
set key[id=917194303001839] name "From today I'll <font color=\"#ffd200\">study</font> <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">plants</font> hard. I'm going to\nprotect the garden of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000167$</font> myself!"
set key[id=918142903001841] name "Oh, if you're busy, you don't have to wait for the hat at $map:02000136$.\nI \
    hear it shows up <font color=\"#ffd200\">other places</font> now and then, too."
set key[id=1228034903002063] name "I can't understand why such filthy monsters showed up in Rudelly.\nNot that I \
    intend to understand, and please don't try\nto make me understand."
set key[id=1228034903002064] name "All I want to say is that I need you to help me\nstarting now."
set key[id=1228034903002065] name "I was on my way to buy Mr. Aliba's <font color=\"#ffd200\">limited edition \
    latest sports car</font>,\nbut I simply can't set foot in this filthy, unpleasant place crawling with \
    monsters."
set key[id=1228034903002066] name "So please go in my place to find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001375[gender:0]$</font> and buy the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">limited edition latest \
    sports car</font>. Of course, I'll pay you for your help. "
set key[id=1228034903002067] name "Oh, take this.\nYou can pay for the car with the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000480$</font>. "
set key[id=1228034903002072] name "I wouldn't have thought it, but for a young person you're quite greedy.\nWhat's \
    stored in there if not the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000480$</font>?"
set key[id=1228034903002073] name "Ugh... I can't bear to look at that messy, unorganized bag.\nTidy your bag \
    first, then come back."
set key[id=1228034903002074] name "Why are you just staring blankly?\nDo your work quickly and neatly! Hurry and \
    set off."
set key[id=1228034903002075] name "Just thinking about it makes my heart race and my eyes dazzle, so I can't even \
    get close...\nMy love, your love! You went and saw the <font color=\"#ffd200\">handmade sports car</font>, \
    right?! Ha ha ha~"
set key[id=1228034903002076] name "Whoa, isn't this Mr. Aliba's blank check!\nSigh... Luxurious Mr. Aliba's \
    luxurious taste, as expected! I'm moved. "
set key[id=1228034903002077] name "Oh no, put it away. Why check it, how cold and impersonal...\nMr. Aliba's <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">blank check</font> is a guaranteed OK just from smelling it!"
set key[id=1228034903002078] name "No need to check, it's certain. Ha ha~\nNow, go up on the special booth and \
    assemble\nthe limited edition handmade sports car <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000481$</font> yourself!"
set key[id=1228034903002079] name "Now, go up on the special booth and assemble it yourself.\nOh, be gentle with \
    it. <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000481$</font> is precious!"
set key[id=1228034903002080] name "Honestly, you looked a bit spaced out, so I wasn't sure about you...\nbut you \
    handle things more cleanly than I thought. Good. I like it."
set key[id=1228034903002081] name "Ugh... I feel like my heart is collapsing. "
set key[id=1228034903002082] name "(Ask where it hurts.)"
set key[id=1228034903002083] name "Look over there. My beloved steeds are being mercilessly\ntrampled by monsters, \
    what a dreadful sight... "
set key[id=1228034903002084] name "Trample me instead... I can bear being trampled, but you must not touch\na \
    single hair of my precious steeds... ugh... "
set key[id=1228034903002085] name "H-help me. If we leave it like this, my babies are in real trouble.\nPlease \
    defeat all those wretched toy soldiers."
set key[id=1228034903002086] name "No, wait. I have to name them precisely so none gets away.\nPlease drive <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000525$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000528$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000531$</font>\nout of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010016$</font> completely."
set key[id=1228034903002087] name "H-help me, please drive $npc:21000525$, $npc:21000528$ and\n$npc:21000531$ out \
    of $map:02010016$ completely."
set key[id=1228034903002088] name "How did it go!\nAre you sure they're all gone? Well?"
set key[id=1228034903002089] name "Oh, that's a relief, of course, but this uneasy feeling\npoking at the corner \
    of my heart... what is it?"
set key[id=1228034903002090] name "I just can't relax like this.\nI think we should hide my beloved \
    cars\nsomewhere safe, in case of an emergency. "
set key[id=1228034903002091] name "I know I may look strange right now, but to me, cars are\nthe sky, my loved \
    ones, my precious children, and so on... no, no,\nI mean... yes, exactly. "
set key[id=1228034903002092] name "Quick, please put the cars in the showroom into a sturdy container box.\nIn \
    return, I'll guarantee you a drastic discount on any car you buy."
set key[id=1228034903002093] name "I'm worried about the monsters that could show up any time.\nPlease put the \
    cars in the showroom into a sturdy container box."
set key[id=1228034903002094] name "Phew, I finally feel a bit relieved. Ha ha, ha ha ha~\nWho cares if sales drop \
    a little?"
set key[id=1228034903002095] name "All I care about is the safety of my lovely cars.\nAs I always say, cars are \
    love."
set key[id=1228034903002113] name "H-hey! Could you give me a hand for a moment!"
set key[id=1228034903002114] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=1228034903002115] name "I just finished a match and I was resting because my head hurt so much\nfrom an \
    injury, and then... what was it...? Ugh... I can't think of the words... "
set key[id=1228034903002116] name "Take your time and tell me slowly."
set key[id=1228034903002117] name "Ah... those monsters! The monsters! They stole my gloves\nand ran off. "
set key[id=1228034903002118] name "I don't care about anything else, but those gloves are the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">limited edition glove set</font>\nmade to commemorate the day I won my first title. They \
    have my name and that date engraved on them...\nThey're meaningful, and I can't ever lose them.\n"
set key[id=1228034903002119] name "As you can see, I'm in no state to deal with them,\nso please find my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">gloves</font> for me."
set key[id=1228034903002120] name "Hunt the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010020$</font>'s <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000419$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000420$</font>\nand get back the \
    gloves they took from me."
set key[id=1228034903002121] name "That's them! Wait, how many is that in all?\nOne... two... three... four... "
set key[id=1228034903002122] name "Where on earth did these guys come from!\nAre they trying to join the match \
    too? Just look at them,\nmonsters wearing silly gloves."
set key[id=1228034903002123] name "Phew... Anyway, the match will start soon, and I don't think\nI can handle all \
    of them by myself."
set key[id=1228034903002124] name "I'll guard the entrance here, so could you take care of the ones\naround the \
    arena? Go and show them what a taste of a hot fist is like,\nthen come back!"
set key[id=1228034903002125] name "Go and show the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000419$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000420$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010020$</font>\nwhat a taste of a \
    hot fist is like, then come back! Hup!"
set key[id=1228034903002126] name "Phew... Thank goodness the riffraff were all wiped out\nbefore the match began. \
    Thank you so much for helping."
set key[id=1228034903002127] name "The world keeps sinking deeper into a kaleidoscope, mee.\nThe more we dig, the \
    more we learn, and the deeper the swamp of mystery gets, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002128] name "Can you see that <font color=\"#ffd200\">red pyramid</font> over there, \
    mee?\nIt was only after the red sand storm that struck here not long ago passed\nthat a mysterious pyramid was \
    found there, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002129] name "Who do you think we are, yung! We're the group that gathers information, aren't \
    we, mee.\nThe Squad 24 scouts hurried into the pyramid to investigate, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002130] name "But, yung! Three days, four days... and even after a week, our scouts\nhave not \
    come back, mee. Nobody knows what <font color=\"#ffd200\">became of</font> them, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002131] name "Human! Could you go into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010070$</font> in our \
    place and find out\nwhether our scouts are safe, and let us know? \nMost of all, I want to know whether our \
    scouts are <font color=\"#ffd200\">alive or dead</font>, yung!"
set key[id=1228034903002132] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010070$</font> and find out whether our \
    scouts\nare <font color=\"#ffd200\">alive or dead</font>, mee! I'm counting on you, mee!"
set key[id=1228034903002133] name "What did you say, yung? <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001904$</font>?\nI \
    remember hearing about that mad count once, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002134] name "If all the spaces inside that pyramid are <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">illusions</font> made by Kakalf,\nas you say, then dozens of weak humans could die\nin \
    there, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002135] name "There's no time for this, yung! I'm going straight back to the meerkat scout \
    HQ\nto tell all the scouts about this first, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002136] name "Human! I've been waiting for you, mee!\nThanks to you helping us last time, \
    none of our scouts\ngo anywhere near <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010070$</font> anymore."
set key[id=1228034903002137] name "And I've found some new information, mee.\nAs thanks for helping us last time, \
    human, I'll tell it to you, yung."
set key[id=1228034903002138] name "(Ask what the new information is.)"
set key[id=1228034903002139] name "Even now, they say an echo is being carried on the wind to lure travelers\nto \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">illusory pyramid</font> brimming with gold and treasure, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002140] name "Chieftain Temorro of the Moropapa says that echo of illusion is a kind of \
    curse, mee.\nTo lift the curse, you have to defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001904$</font>, obtain <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000495$</font>,\nand lay it to rest, he says, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002141] name "That's all the information I can give you, mee.\nWhether to go back to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010070$</font> and bring back $npc:24001904$'s <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000495$</font>\nis for you to decide, human!"
set key[id=1228034903002142] name "They say that if you bring back $npc:24001904$'s <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000495$</font>,\nyou can lift the curse of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010070$</font>, mee."
set key[id=1228034903002143] name "Human! You're brave, mee.\nI never knew you had such a sense of justice, \
    mee!\nI, Squad 24 Scout Leader <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001399[gender:0]$</font>, will always help \
    you from now on, mee!"
set key[id=1228034903002144] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, human!\nYou were wonderful, mee. "
set key[id=1228034903002145] name "Ptooey, what on earth is going on? How dare they! How dare anyone\nchallenge \
    our <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black Star Society</font>... Is this even possible?"
set key[id=1228034903002146] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=1228034903002147] name "If I knew that, would I be standing here like this? Sigh...\nI was delivering \
    goods on the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black Knoff</font> when some unidentified thugs\nbarged in and suddenly \
    switched the tracks, just like that."
set key[id=1228034903002148] name "Because of that, I fell off the train. It all happened so fast\nthat I had no \
    time to climb back on."
set key[id=1228034903002149] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001189[gender:0]$</font> is on that \
    train...\nNothing bad will have happened, right? We're the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black Star Society</font>! \
    Black. Star. Society!"
set key[id=1228034903002150] name "Just in case, can you hop onto the moving <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black \
    Knoff</font>\nand find out what's going on inside?"
set key[id=1228034903002151] name "What are you doing? You'll miss the train at this rate! Hurry and board the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black Knoff</font>,\nfind out what's happening inside, and report back to me."
set key[id=1228034903002152] name "What about <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001189[gender:0]$</font>? Our \
    members? Well?"
set key[id=1228034903002153] name "(Tell him they're all safe.)"
set key[id=1228034903002154] name "I knew it, I was worrying for nothing. Of course they are.\nWho do you think we \
    are! The Black Star Society!"
set key[id=1228034903002155] name "Still, I wonder who those bold fools could be.\nHmm... I will find out their \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">identity</font> no matter what. "
set key[id=1228034903002156] name "Grr... I'm so angry, so angry!\nWho are these guys, attacking the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Black Knoff</font>\nnot once, but <font color=\"#ffd200\">twice</font>!"
set key[id=1228034903002157] name "This is clearly a challenge thrown right at the Black Star Society...\nI bet \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001189[gender:0]$</font> won't sit still this time, either."
set key[id=1228034903002158] name "According to recently confirmed information, their gang has\nthree bosses... \
    What were their names again..."
set key[id=1228034903002159] name "All right! The small fry don't matter anyway,\nso go and take down only the \
    bosses of their gang.\nI'll take care of the cleanup!"
set key[id=1228034903002160] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001508$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001507$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001506$</font>.\nRemember them well. \
    Those are the three."
set key[id=1228034903002161] name "Sneak into the Black Knoff and defeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001508$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001507$</font>\nand <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001506$</font>. I'll handle all the rest."
set key[id=1228034903002162] name "Those pups ran wild with no fear of the tiger, and now I feel so much \
    better.\nFrom the looks of it, you're quite good with your fists too, aren't you?"
set key[id=1228034903002163] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001189[gender:0]$</font> has also come to see \
    you in a new light because of this,\nso you'll be rewarded one way or another. Good work."
set key[id=1228174803002166] name "I'll go back to HQ first and bring more members.\nI'll show them the bitter \
    taste of the organization!"
set key[id=1228174803002167] name "Hey, you there. What brings you to such a rough place?\nIf you can, come back \
    with me. "
set key[id=1228174803002168] name "Why do you say that?"
set key[id=1228174803002169] name "I've been touring ruins for over 20 years now,\nbut I've never felt an ominous \
    aura like the one here at <font color=\"#ffd200\">Nazkar</font>."
set key[id=1228174803002170] name "I even seem to smell something rank from somewhere.\nAnyway, why isn't that \
    fellow coming back... "
set key[id=1228174803002171] name "(Ask who he means.)"
set key[id=1228174803002172] name "Ah, a colleague who came with me to investigate the Nazkar relics went\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">inside the Nazkar Temple</font>, and he hasn't come out in half a day."
set key[id=1228174803002173] name "Soon the Floaty bound for <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010063$</font> will \
    arrive...\nSurely nothing has happened to him... "
set key[id=1228174803002174] name "Would you go in and take a look? I simply don't have the courage\nto bear this \
    gloomy aura and go in there."
set key[id=1228174803002175] name "Go into the Nazkar Temple, find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001474[gender:0]$</font>,\nand be sure to tell him we have to leave before it gets \
    darker."
set key[id=1228174803002176] name "W-who are you! \nD-d-don't come any closer."
set key[id=1228174803002177] name "Oh, my heart. \nYou should've said that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001473[gender:0]$</font> sent you. Phew... "
set key[id=1228174803002178] name "Sh-shh! Come closer.\nI was just about to leave, you see. H-here... \nHere, I \
    saw s-s-something strange. Something very, very <font color=\"#ffd200\">huge</font>... "
set key[id=1228174803002179] name "(Ask him in detail what he saw.)"
set key[id=1228174803002180] name "If I knew that, would I be holding on to you and talking like this?\nAnyway. \
    I've never seen a <font color=\"#ffd200\">shadow</font> like that before...\nI saw it with my own two \
    eyes,\nw-walking calmly into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010051$</font>."
set key[id=1228174803002181] name "There must be an enormous <font color=\"#ffd200\">secret</font> here, I tell \
    you.\nI c-can't just go back like this. No way I can go back.\nBut I c-can't go in, either... "
set key[id=1228174803002182] name "Hey, would you go into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010051$</font> and look \
    at what's inside?\nI'm not asking you to go deep inside. Just the entrance, just a peek...\nStand at the \
    entrance and check what that <font color=\"#ffd200\">giant shadow</font> is."
set key[id=1228174803002183] name "Go into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010051$</font> and check what the\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">giant shadow</font> really is."
set key[id=1228174803002184] name "K-<font color=\"#ffd200\">Kabo?</font> Oh, no way...\n$npc:11001224[gender:0]$ \
    is the high priest who runs Nazkar all by himself, isn't he? "
set key[id=1228174803002185] name "I came here to meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001224[gender:0]$</font> and \
    hear about Nazkar,\nbut he doesn't seem to be around today... "
set key[id=1228174803002186] name "W-wait. Th-then that sh-shadow could be...?"
set key[id=1230131703002189] name "Buy the <font color=\"#ffd200\">limited edition latest sports car</font> from \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001375[gender:0]$</font>\nat the special booth in $map:02010016$. You can pay \
    with the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000480$</font>."
set key[id=1230131703002190] name "I lost $item:30000480$."
set key[id=1230131703002191] name "It's nothing."
set key[id=1230131703002192] name "Where on earth do you keep your wits?!\nIf you lose it this time you might have \
    to pay for the car yourself,\nso be extra careful."
set key[id=1230215803002193] name "Yes! That's right! All 15 that I lost are here.\nThey're definitely the gloves \
    with my name on them. Thank you so much. "
set key[id=2950860350520826376] name "I hear MC Kay has prepared lots of exciting events for this Cherry Blossom \
    Festival!"
set key[id=5897140353937854150] name "Phew~ It's quiet at last. We can finally enjoy the Cherry Blossom Festival \
    to the fullest! As thanks, I'll give you a Flower Tree Gift Box Piece!"
set key[id=6213918787901587465] name "Oh, $MyPCName$, you came at just the right time. While preparing for this \
    event, I left behind the documents Ruby gave me."
set key[id=6213918787901587466] name "I asked Ruby, and she said to look among the boxes nearby. Could you help me \
    look for them?"
set key[id=6213918787901587467] name "I'm so glad you're helping me, $MyPCName$.\nIf you check the gift boxes over \
    there, you should be able to find it."
set key[id=6213918787901587468] name "That's it! These are the documents. Thanks to you, I found them quickly.\nBy \
    the way, $MyPCName$, do you know about the newly opened 'Doll Mansion'?"
set key[id=6213918787901587469] name "(Say I do.)"
set key[id=6213918787901587470] name "(Say I don't.)"
set key[id=6213918787901587471] name "Hahaha, the 'Doll Mansion' is a new event that I, MC Kay, took part in \
    myself from the idea stage.\nAfter doing nothing but MC work for so long, a good idea finally came to me!"
set key[id=6213918787901587472] name "Where did you get the idea?"
set key[id=6213918787901587473] name "It's about a certain mansion, but, ahem, it wasn't a happy story, so I'd \
    rather not say. If you get the chance, please join the event.\nIn the darkness, identical mirror dolls will \
    chase away the heat."
set key[id=6213918787901587474] name "Oh, right, with the coins you earn from playing the Doll Mansion, you can \
    exchange for all sorts of prizes, so give it a try."
set key[id=6270037560735563785] name "Um, $MyPCName$?\nSome guy asked me to hand this note to $MyPCName$ if I ever \
    found you."
set key[id=6270037560735563786] name "I want that doll. Is there any way I can get it?"
set key[id=6270037560735563787] name "$MyPCName$? You came right away! I'm Jayton, the one who gave you the \
    note.\nI had trouble leaving my post for long, so thank you for coming just in time."
set key[id=6270037560735563788] name "I hear you helped a great deal with the Shadow Poison research, \
    $MyPCName$.\nActually, while researching the Shadow Poison, I heard talk of the Spring of Darkness."
set key[id=6270037560735563789] name "Ah, of course, I understand that the Spring of Darkness and the Shadow \
    Poison aren't directly related. But I heard there's another dark energy besides the Shadow Poison."
set key[id=6270037560735563790] name "I heard you can't go to the Spring of Darkness just any time, but it seems a \
    way into it has opened up this time."
set key[id=6270037560735563791] name "This investigation might lead to a discovery that turns the tide of the \
    current situation,\nbut the Doctor refuses to give permission.\nIf what you find can serve as a clue, \
    $MyPCName$, I think I can persuade the Doctor."
set key[id=6270037560735563792] name "I hear that the Spring of Darkness's powerful energy makes it hard to use \
    your original strength.\nStill, I trust that you'll make it there and back safely, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=6270037560735563793] name "Ah, so that was the rumor coming from the Spring of Darkness.\nYou know \
    there used to be a big mansion near the Shadow Gate, don't you?\nI'd been suspecting that the cause might \
    actually be the dark energy."
set key[id=6270037560735563794] name "We still lack a lot of clues, but I believe that with a little more \
    investigation we may find some.\nOnce we find them, I'll be able to tell the Doctor as well."
set key[id=6270037560735563795] name "The Doctor has given me plenty of tasks, but I'll investigate in my spare \
    moments.\nYou were a great help, $MyPCName$. This is an event coin you can use at Bobby's shop. I won't be \
    able to use it for a while, so please use it, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=7056756878597630787] name "Could you catch these bugs that are gnawing at the beautiful cherry blossom \
    trees, $MyPCName$? As thanks, I'll give you a Leaf Gift Box Piece!"
set key[id=7688597134616948752] name "How did you like MC Kay's event? If you had fun, I'll give you a Blossom \
    Gift Box Piece as thanks!"
set key[id=8715919847422297882] name "Please sweep away all those nasty bugs!"
set key[id=8883637808954324535] name "Could you take down that machine ruining the Cherry Blossom Festival, \
    $MyPCName$? As thanks, I'll give you a Flower Tree Gift Box Piece!"
set key[id=10003583148356179317] name "Why don't you go and enjoy it too, $MyPCName$? If you have fun, I'll give \
    you a Blossom Gift Box Piece!"
set key[id=10811411668445218198] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! Are you enjoying the Cherry Blossom Festival?"
set key[id=12607389520193703601] name "$MyPCName$, are you enjoying the Cherry Blossom Festival?"
set key[id=12975282513720297453] name "The Cherry Blossom Festival is in full swing, but these bugs keep gnawing \
    on the trees. It's a real problem."
set key[id=14721122388912478165] name "Please enjoy MC Kay's event!"
set key[id=15660590060068206644] name "Please destroy the giant bug-shaped machine that is ruining the Cherry \
    Blossom Festival!"
set key[id=16639016078973790014] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! What a lovely Cherry Blossom Festival!"
set key[id=17246215545660200579] name "Phew, with the bugs gone, the cherry blossom trees have started blooming \
    brightly again! As thanks, I'll give you a Leaf Gift Box Piece!"
set key[id=17619072598218585632] name "I heard that a giant mechanical bug has appeared in Kritias, and the \
    residents are trembling in fear."

# Quest dialogue of the no-feature chapters 3014-5011 quests that no pack has in English (no feature tag): our own
# English for the 1509 scriptquest rows of locale KR (or no locale) whose quest a player can get (139 quests), with
# each row's own format fields, font tags and line breaks; the player's lines are first-person choices.
file Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml kms:Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml 032f90f7273bbe7d
set key[id=105153412001579] name "May I ask how you're related to <font color=\"#ffd200\">the guest</font> you \
    mentioned?\nI can't give out <font color=\"#ffd200\">a guest's information</font> to just anyone..."
set key[id=105153412001580] name "(Say I'm his student.)"
set key[id=105153412001581] name "Ah, I see! Well then... let me take a look. \nOn the guest list, \
    $npc:11001246[gender:0]$... $npc:11001246[gender:0]$..."
set key[id=105153412001582] name "Here he is! $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ is staying in <font color=\"#ffd200\">Room \
    215</font>. \nTake the stairs on the left from where the guests are, and you'll see it right away."
set key[id=105153412001583] name "The $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ you're looking for is staying in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Room 215</font>. \nTake the stairs on the left from where the guests are, and you'll see it \
    right away."
set key[id=105153412001584] name "You've arrived at last? <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$.</font>\nThis was \
    your first time experiencing a <font color=\"#ffd200\">long-distance spatial jump</font> like this. You've had \
    a hard time."
set key[id=105153412001585] name "I've prepared a few things for you, though I don't know if they'll suit you. \
    Here, take them."
set key[id=105153412001586] name "Hmm... by my original plan, \nI should be meeting with <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">officials of the $map:2000001$ royal family</font> by now, but things have gone awry."
set key[id=105153412001587] name "(Ask if the urgent person she needed to meet was the Tria royal family.)"
set key[id=105153412001588] name "Yes. According to the oral tradition handed down in Terunkalib, in the distant \
    past, <font color=\"#ffd200\">knowledge our ancient ancestors\nprepared for later generations</font> lies \
    somewhere on Victoria Island.\nBut when the dark force called the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Shadow Legion</font> \
    covered Victoria Island...\nit is said the ancestors spread a <font color=\"#ffd200\">Veil of Runes</font> to \
    hide it from sight and protect that knowledge."
set key[id=105153412001589] name "According to it, the knowledge our ancestors left remains intact \n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">somewhere on Victoria Island</font>. \nIn Terunkalib, this knowledge is collectively called \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Wisdom of Baz</font>."
set key[id=105153412001590] name "But for us Runeblades, whose home is Kalib Island, finding Wisdom of Baz on \
    Victoria Island \nis no easy task. \nOn top of that, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Veil of Runes</font> the \
    ancestors spread to avoid the threat of evil makes it\neven harder to guess where Wisdom of Baz lies."
set key[id=105153412001591] name "(Ask if that's why we need help.)"
set key[id=105153412001592] name "I thought the $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ who rules Victoria Island could be \
    of great help to us.\nBut when I arrived, <font color=\"#ffd200\">the $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$'s \
    Levee</font> had been cancelled and everything was in an uproar.\nBecause of that, I couldn't meet the \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$, let alone a single high official.\nSince it has come to this, I intend to find \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Wisdom of Baz</font> with our own strength alone."
set key[id=105153412001593] name "(Ask if we aren't chasing $npc:11001231[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=105153412001594] name "$MyPCName$, you're right.\nI'm looking for Wisdom of Baz <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">in order to chase Holstatt</font>.\nJudging by his movements on Kalib Island, what he wants \
    seems to be Wisdom of Baz.\nAnd within it, the legendary knowledge said to hold the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Ultimate Secret Art</font>."
set key[id=105153412001595] name "(Say that means if we search for Wisdom of Baz, we may meet \
    $npc:11001231[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=105153412001596] name "You saw it right. That is your master's plan.\nThat is why we must find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">the place where Wisdom of Baz may lie</font> as quickly as we can.\nWhat we need in this \
    unfamiliar land is <font color=\"#ffd200\">information</font>. According to the oral tradition, Wisdom of \
    Baz\ncan be seen as a kind of ruin."
set key[id=105153412001597] name "From what I've learned, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000031$</font> in \
    $map:2000001$ boasts a long history, unlike how it looks.\nA woman named <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000005[gender:1]$</font> is also known as a quite capable librarian,\nso I think we \
    could find <font color=\"#ffd200\">any information</font> there."
set key[id=105153412001598] name "From what I've learned, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000031$</font> in \
    $map:2000001$ boasts a long history, unlike how it looks.\nA woman named <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000005[gender:1]$</font> is also known as a quite capable librarian,\nso I think we \
    could find <font color=\"#ffd200\">any information</font> there."
set key[id=105153412001599] name "What brings you here?"
set key[id=105153412001600] name "(Say I'm looking for documents recording a ruin called Wisdom of Baz.)"
set key[id=105153412001601] name "Wisdom of Baz? ...How strange.\nSomeone was asking about that name earlier \
    today..."
set key[id=105153412001602] name "(Ask what the person looked like.)"
set key[id=105153412001603] name "He was a man with a very cold look about him.\nI remember him because of his \
    light-blue flowing hair and the unusual mask he wore."
set key[id=105153412001604] name "Hm? You don't look well. Is something the matter?"
set key[id=105153412001605] name "(Say it's nothing.)"
set key[id=105153412001606] name "Anyway, when that man asked, there was some <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">commotion</font> all over $map:2000001$...\nand I couldn't find any related information, so \
    I sent him away.\nBut as time passed, I looked through the old librarian records and found something similar."
set key[id=105153412001607] name "(Ask if we can check it now.)"
set key[id=105153412001608] name "That's not difficult.\nBut all I've done is find the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">document with the closest record</font>...\nI can't tell you whether it's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Wisdom of Baz</font> you're looking for.\nAnd, this is the most important part..."
set key[id=105153412001609] name "(Ask if there's some problem.)"
set key[id=105153412001610] name "It's an old <font color=\"#ffd200\">ancient document</font>, and its condition \
    is poor.\nThe letters are hard to even read, and some parts are <font color=\"#ffd200\">rotted \
    away</font>.\nIn short, getting any information from reading it in its current state is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">impossible</font>."
set key[id=105153412001611] name "(Ask if there's anything we can do.)"
set key[id=105153412001612] name "How many documents do you think are piled up in this library? \nThere are so \
    many to preserve, and so many get damaged every year. \nWe can't just burn precious documents each time, can \
    we?"
set key[id=105153412001613] name "There's always an <font color=\"#ffd200\">expert</font> for this kind of thing, \
    so don't worry too much. \nIf you leave it to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001261[gender:0]$</font>, it \
    should be no big problem."
set key[id=105153412001614] name "(Ask where I can find $npc:11001261[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=105153412001615] name "He travels often in search of special materials, so he has no fixed place.\nI \
    think I heard he's recently going to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000019$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000014$</font>...\nWhy not go there? You might be able to meet him."
set key[id=105153412001616] name "I think I heard $npc:11001261[gender:0]$ recently went to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000019$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000014$</font>. \nWhy not go there? \
    You might be able to meet him."
set key[id=105153412001617] name "Shh, shh! Quiet, quiet!\nBe careful not to wake the $npc:21000074$!"
set key[id=105153412001618] name "(Ask what he's doing here, of all places.)"
set key[id=105153412001619] name "I'm gathering special materials.\nMy work is <font color=\"#ffd200\">restoring \
    things like old documents and worn accessories to look\nlike new</font>, you see. I use the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">secretions</font> of larvae like the $npc:21000074$ as an important material\nfor my work. "
set key[id=105153412001620] name "(Say it sounds like rather dangerous work.)"
set key[id=105153412001621] name "I can't say it's terribly dangerous, but I can't say it's safe either.\nThose \
    $npc:21000074$ <font color=\"#ffd200\">turn violent in no time</font> if you disturb their dwellings.\nHmm~ \
    come to think of it, you've got quite a decent weapon there, haven't you?"
set key[id=105153412001622] name "With you helping at my side, the work should go much more smoothly...\nOh, \
    right! I came across some <font color=\"#ffd200\">items</font> while gathering materials around here!"
set key[id=105153412001623] name "If you're going to help me, you should at least wear these. Here, take them!"
set key[id=105153412001624] name "The work is fairly simple. \nWe walk around this pit and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">collect secretions</font> from the $npc:21000074$ homes.\nI hope it won't happen, but if the \
    Wigglers pop out and <font color=\"#ffd200\">attack</font>...\nall you have to do is swing that fine weapon of \
    yours, swish swish!"
set key[id=105153412001625] name "(Say I have something to ask of him once this is done.)"
set key[id=105153412001626] name "Hm? What kind of favor?"
set key[id=105153412001627] name "(Say there's an ancient document I'd like restored.)"
set key[id=105153412001628] name "An <font color=\"#ffd200\">ancient document</font>? Hmph, you're an impatient \
    one. ...Well, fine, fine!\nMy work comes first, so we'll talk about what you just said later.\nAnyway... shall \
    we <font color=\"#ffd200\">get started</font>?"
set key[id=105153412001629] name "Anyway... shall we <font color=\"#ffd200\">get started</font>?"
set key[id=105153412001630] name "Phew... thanks to you, the gathering went off safely.\nNow, what was it you said \
    earlier...? Something about a document..."
set key[id=105153412001631] name "(Ask him to restore the ancient document.)"
set key[id=105153412001632] name "Ah, right! The ancient document. \nBut say... have we met before? I was only \
    thinking about my work earlier and didn't notice, \nbut thinking about it now, I'm fairly sure I've never seen \
    you before."
set key[id=105153412001633] name "(Say $npc:11000005[gender:1]$ introduced me.)"
set key[id=105153412001634] name "I knew it, I knew it! I could tell the moment you asked me to restore an ancient \
    document. \nI was sure I didn't know you from my memory... "
set key[id=105153412001635] name "I could tell right away when you came all the way out here to ask me."
set key[id=105153412001636] name "Anyway, you helped me, so naturally I should repay you with a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">reward</font>.\nSo, where is that ancient document you want restored?"
set key[id=105153412001637] name "(Say it's in $map:2000031$.)"
set key[id=105153412001638] name "Then I'll go there first and check it myself.\nLeave that to me. I'll take care \
    of it."
set key[id=105153412001639] name "(Ask how long the restoration will take.)"
set key[id=105153412001640] name "The level of restoration varies with the material and age of the \
    document.\nRestoration itself only gets you to about 7 or 8 if the original is a 10.\nOn top of that, the \
    restoration process alone needs special materials. \nWhy do you think I wander the outlands instead of staying \
    in $map:2000001$?"
set key[id=105153412001641] name "It's because I go around collecting the materials needed for restoration. \nIf \
    you want to see a fully restored document, it will take quite a <font color=\"#ffd200\">long \
    time</font>.\nWell, I'm a skilled expert, so I'll do my best to hurry..."
set key[id=105153412001642] name "I'll visit $map:2000031$ soon and begin the work, so don't worry too much.\nWhen \
    the restoration is finished, I'll get in <font color=\"#ffd200\">touch</font>."
set key[id=105153412001643] name "I'll visit $map:2000031$ soon and begin the work, so don't worry too much.\nWhen \
    the restoration is finished, I'll get in touch."
set key[id=105153412001644] name "You took longer than I expected. \nWas there some problem finding information at \
    $map:2000031$?"
set key[id=105153412001645] name "(Tell my master what happened in the meantime.)"
set key[id=105153412001646] name "The restoration will take some time, but... still, it's a relief. Well done. \
    \nBut what bothers me is that $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ visited <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000031$</font> \
    too.\nAnyway, he didn't get any information, did he?"
set key[id=105153412001647] name "(Say $npc:11000005[gender:1]$ told me she gave him no information at all.)"
set key[id=105153412001648] name "Hmm... now that I know $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ is moving in his own way too... \
    \nwe can't stand by and do nothing either."
set key[id=105153412001649] name "From what I've learned, the Barota Company, an organization of peddlers, is so \
    vast that a great number\nof peddlers are spread <font color=\"#ffd200\">all over Victoria \
    Island</font>.\nThey wander from place to place trading, so naturally they <font color=\"#ffd200\">see and \
    hear</font> a great deal..."
set key[id=105153412001650] name "We can't just wait around for the document to be restored. \nIt would be good if \
    we could borrow the <font color=\"#ffd200\">intelligence network</font> the Barota Company has. What do you \
    think?"
set key[id=105153412001651] name "(Ask her to repeat what she just said.)"
set key[id=105153412001652] name "Eagerly agree that my master is always right."
set key[id=105153412001653] name "(Say I agree with my master.)"
set key[id=105153412001654] name "Hmph... were you distracted by something else again?!\nNever mind, never mind. \
    Follow my decision on this. I saw a merchant of the Barota Company\nnamed <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000484[gender:0]$</font> here in $map:2000033$. Go to him and find out whether the \
    Barota Company\nhas an intelligence network worth asking for cooperation."
set key[id=105153412001655] name "I asked what you thought, and you answered half-heartedly... \nNever mind, never \
    mind. Follow my decision on this. I saw a merchant of the Barota Company\nnamed <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000484[gender:0]$</font> here in $map:2000033$. Go to him and find out whether the \
    Barota Company\nhas an <font color=\"#ffd200\">intelligence network</font> worth asking for cooperation."
set key[id=105153412001656] name "Right. If we can get their cooperation, we should find every way to do it.\nI \
    saw a merchant of the Barota Company named <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000484[gender:0]$</font> here in \
    $map:2000033$. \nGo to him and find out whether the Barota Company has an <font color=\"#ffd200\">intelligence \
    network</font> worth asking\nfor cooperation. Your judgment will be important."
set key[id=105153412001657] name "Haven't you gone yet?\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000484[gender:0]$</font> \
    was here in $map:2000033$. \nGo to him and find out whether the Barota Company has an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">intelligence network</font> worth asking\nfor cooperation."
set key[id=105153412001658] name "Is there something you need from me?"
set key[id=105153412001659] name "(Ask about the Barota Company.)"
set key[id=105153412001660] name "The Barota Company is the largest <font color=\"#ffd200\">peddler \
    organization</font> on Victoria Island.\nWe have such a variety of people and goods that you can get \
    whatever\nyou want through a peddler anytime."
set key[id=105153412001661] name "(Say an organization that big must see and hear a lot.)"
set key[id=105153412001662] name "Hmm... we usually divide the customers who deal with the Company into <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">three types</font>.\nThe first type is ordinary people who trade to find the goods they \
    need.\nThe second type buys goods in bulk through the Company to make a profit."
set key[id=105153412001663] name "The third type of customer is a bit special...\nThey're <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">people who want information</font>, just like you."
set key[id=105153412001664] name "(Ask how he knows I want information.)"
set key[id=105153412001665] name "Hahaha!! I don't know how I look to you... \nbut I'm a proper veteran peddler of \
    the Barota Company."
set key[id=105153412001666] name "Just from a customer's expression and way of speaking, I can tell what they \
    want...\nWould you believe me if I said it just comes to me?"
set key[id=105153412001667] name "May I ask what kind of information you want?\nI might be able to give you what I \
    know."
set key[id=105153412001668] name "(Say I'm looking for an ancient ruin.)"
set key[id=105153412001669] name "Hmm~ you're looking for a ruin. \nUnfortunately it's not my specialty, but I can \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">recommend</font> a place where you might find information.\nAs they travel around, all \
    peddlers regularly <font color=\"#ffd200\">report to the Company</font> about the terrain,\nlocal specialties, \
    and so on."
set key[id=105153412001670] name "The place where all that information gathers is the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000020$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000139$</font>.\nIf you go there, you \
    should be able to get just about any information."
set key[id=105153412001671] name "(Thank you for kindly telling me.)"
set key[id=105153412001672] name "Ha ha! Not at all. \nWhen you get to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000020$</font>, just be sure to tell the person in charge, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001262[gender:0]$</font>, \nthat you came with <font color=\"#ffd200\">an \
    introduction from $npcName:11000484[gender:0]$</font>. That's all you need."
set key[id=105153412001673] name "Is there something more you'd like to ask?\nYou can find the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000020$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000139$</font>.\nIf you meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001262[gender:0]$</font>, you should be able to get just about any information."
set key[id=105153412001674] name "What? Can't you see I'm busy? What do you want?"
set key[id=105153412001675] name "(Say $npc:11000484[gender:0]$ introduced me.)"
set key[id=105153412001676] name "Ahh~ so you're the <font color=\"#ffd200\">cus.tom.er</font> \
    $npc:11000484[gender:0]$ sent. \nAhem! Since you came with his introduction, you've probably heard the gist \
    already... \nthe information gathered at the $map:52000020$ is, strictly speaking, one of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">goods the Company deals in</font>."
set key[id=105153412001677] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">fee</font> is set differently depending on what \
    information you want.\nNot all information is classed at the same grade, after all.\nSo, what kind of \
    information is our customer looking for?"
set key[id=105153412001678] name "(Say I'm looking for a ruin called Wisdom of Baz.)"
set key[id=105153412001679] name "Hmm... for ruins, we keep a separate <font color=\"#ffd200\">list</font>, so let \
    me check. \nRuins, ruins... that document was around here somewhere..."
set key[id=105153412001680] name "...Oh no... It's gone again..."
set key[id=105153412001681] name "(Ask what's gone.)"
set key[id=105153412001682] name "The whole document with the information recorded in it is gone. Damn it, how \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">many times</font> is this now..."
set key[id=105153412001683] name "(Ask if it was stolen rather than simply lost.)"
set key[id=105153412001684] name "Hmm.... Yes. Lately there have been more than just one or two <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">stolen documents</font>."
set key[id=105153412001685] name "The list of VIP customers who deal with the Barota Company was stolen recently \
    too... \nEven high-grade information classed as A or even S grade keeps disappearing <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">time and again</font>."
set key[id=105153412001686] name "(Ask if he has any idea who the thief is.)"
set key[id=105153412001687] name "The bigger the Barota Company grew, the more enemies we made, known and \
    unknown.\n...How many suspects are there? \nI can't say I have no idea, but..."
set key[id=105153412001688] name "(Ask who they are.)"
set key[id=105153412001689] name "They are...\nHm?! I just heard some strange noise from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">entrance</font>..."
set key[id=105153412001690] name "(Ask what noise he means.)"
set key[id=105153412001691] name "I just heard something odd...\nMaybe I'm on edge because of all these \
    thefts...\nJust in case, could you take a look <font color=\"#ffd200\">around the entrance</font>?"
set key[id=105153412001692] name "I just heard something odd...\nMaybe I'm on edge because of all these \
    thefts...\nJust in case, could you take a look around the entrance?"
set key[id=105153412001693] name "Assassins... The loss of the customer list and the S-grade information last time \
    must have\nbeen their doing too."
set key[id=105153412001694] name "There was a <font color=\"#ffd200\">face I recognized</font> among those who \
    burst in."
set key[id=105153412001695] name "(Ask who they are.)"
set key[id=105153412001696] name "His name is Giep, and everyone who knows him calls him Mighty Giep.\nI was told \
    he doesn't belong to any group...\nApparently I was wrong."
set key[id=105153412001697] name "(Ask if he thinks someone else is behind them.)"
set key[id=105153412001698] name "Probably... they were just moving on a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">commission</font>.\nThey used someone with no affiliation so as not to reveal their own \
    identity, and...?!\nCould it be... them... hmm..."
set key[id=105153412001699] name "(Ask if he has any idea.)"
set key[id=105153412001700] name "...Yes. There are some who come to mind.\nThose who <font color=\"#ffd200\">rule \
    the city's night</font>... hmm...\nCustomer... no, you... you'd better not get involved in this."
set key[id=105153412001701] name "I survived this time thanks to you, but I think I need to work out my own \
    countermeasures.\nAnyway, I owe you for this, so I should repay you somehow... "
set key[id=105153412001702] name "Did you say earlier you're looking for a ruin called Wisdom of Baz? I'll look \
    into it.\nIs there <font color=\"#ffd200\">anything else</font> you need besides that?"
set key[id=105153412001703] name "(Ask him to find out where a man named Holstatt is.)"
set key[id=105153412001704] name "Holstatt? If you give me a rough description of him, it'll help me find \
    him.\nWhat does he look like?"
set key[id=105153412001705] name "(Describe Holstatt's appearance.)"
set key[id=105153412001706] name "Hmm... long light-blue hair... wearing a mask, you say...\nWell, that's enough. \
    I'll find the rest on my own.\nIf I get any useful information, I'll contact you at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Troy's Inn</font>."
set key[id=105153412001707] name "If I get any useful information, I'll contact you at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Troy's Inn</font>."
set key[id=105153412001708] name "You're very late. \nHow did things go with the Barota Company?"
set key[id=105153412001709] name "(Say they promised the Barota Information Brokerage's cooperation.)"
set key[id=105153412001710] name "Do you think the information they promised can be trusted?"
set key[id=105153412001711] name "(Tell her what happened and answer that there's no reason not to trust them.)"
set key[id=105153412001712] name "In that situation, he could have asked you for help...\nThis <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001262[gender:0]$</font> seems to be, in his own way, <font color=\"#ffd200\">a \
    man who keeps his word</font>."
set key[id=105153412001713] name "Then there's no particular reason to doubt him. Well done. \nNow go and get some \
    rest."
set key[id=105153412001714] name "$MyPCName$, a message came from the $map:52000020$.\nAccording to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">information</font> sent by $npcName:11001262[gender:0]$ of the $map:52000020$, they found \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000021$</font>\nin a place called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000082$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001715] name "(Say it's finally this student's turn to shine.)"
set key[id=105153412001716] name "Don't joke, $MyPCName$! \nDidn't you charge at him boldly at $map:63000006$ and \
    nearly come to grief?\nHave you forgotten already?"
set key[id=105153412001717] name "(Say ...I haven't forgotten.)"
set key[id=105153412001718] name "Do not even think of acting rashly out of pointless <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">competitiveness</font>.\n$npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ is an opponent even I cannot <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">call the outcome against</font>."
set key[id=105153412001719] name "Phew...\nIt seems $npc:11001264[gender:1]$ has crossed over to Victoria \
    Island.\nSo I told her to meet us there. When you're ready, come to the \n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000021$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000082$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001720] name "Before going to $map:2000082$, I need to collect my thoughts.\nThinking that I \
    might meet him, the energy in my body feels as if it's losing its balance.\nWhen you're ready, let's meet at \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000021$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000082$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001721] name "Didn't I always warn you... \nTo cast aside needless <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">competitiveness</font> and learn <font color=\"#ffd200\">patience</font>.\nYour master \
    trusted you..."
set key[id=105153412001722] name "(Say I was sure I could overpower Holstatt.)"
set key[id=105153412001723] name "Enough. Go now... \nWe'll talk about this later."
set key[id=105153412001724] name "Before coming here, the Chase Team and I followed $npc:11001231[gender:0]$'s \
    trail starting from $map:2000062$\nin southern Victoria Island... It seems it was a mistake to rush here in my \
    haste and abandon the\nChase Team. I've caused trouble for Ishura."
set key[id=105153412001725] name "(Say that's not true.)"
set key[id=105153412001726] name "Actually, there was some <font color=\"#ffd200\">information</font> about \
    Holstatt I really wanted to tell Ishura... \nI never imagined I'd see that bastard here. Ugh..."
set key[id=105153412001727] name "(Ask what information she means.)"
set key[id=105153412001728] name "I heard someone resembling $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ was seen in a place called \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000124$</font>...\nIf it really was $npc:11001231[gender:0]$... <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">why</font> would he go to a prison?\nIt bothered me, but I was so intent on following his \
    trail that I never checked."
set key[id=105153412001729] name "Ugh... in my condition now, there's no way I can get there.\nI can't be sure \
    whether the person who appeared at Alikar Prison was Holstatt.\nBut it's definitely a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">worrying rumor</font>..."
set key[id=105153412001730] name "$MyPCName$, could you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000124$</font> and \
    confirm it?\nIf you meet the warden or a prisoner and <font color=\"#ffd200\">ask around about \
    $npc:11001231[gender:0]$</font>, wouldn't you find out?"
set key[id=105153412001731] name "(Say I'll go to $map:2000124$ and find out the truth behind the rumor.)"
set key[id=105153412001732] name "I heard there's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">ship bound for $map:2000124$</font> at \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000062$</font>.\nIf you go there, you should be able to reach $map:2000124$... "
set key[id=105153412001733] name "I heard there's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">ship bound for $map:2000124$</font> at \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000062$</font>.\nIf you go there, you should be able to reach $map:2000124$... \
    \nAsk around there <font color=\"#ffd200\">about $npc:11001231[gender:0]$</font> and you should learn the \
    truth behind the rumor..."
set key[id=105153412001734] name "What? Never seen a prisoner in a prison before?"
set key[id=105153412001735] name "(Say the prison is covered in shadows.)"
set key[id=105153412001736] name "...Isn't it obvious?\nThat's because I'm <font color=\"#ffd200\">right in the \
    middle of the shadows</font>."
set key[id=105153412001737] name "(Say then we just need to light a light to clear them away.)"
set key[id=105153412001738] name "...Hey, keep your voice down.\nThat password changes about once every three \
    days. How did you know it?\nYou don't look like a prisoner here..."
set key[id=105153412001739] name "(Say I got it by asking a few prisoners.)"
set key[id=105153412001740] name "What? Giving the password to just anyone, those idiots!"
set key[id=105153412001741] name "(Say Holstatt sent me.)"
set key[id=105153412001742] name "Huh?! You're one of <font color=\"#ffd200\">them</font>? Then you're not just \
    anybody.\nAnyway, I'll have to change the password again. \nBy the way, who were the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">guys who told you the password</font>?"
set key[id=105153412001743] name "(Say I don't remember.)"
set key[id=105153412001744] name "Well, whatever. I'll take responsibility and pick the crew again, only sharp \
    ones.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Security is everything in this job</font>, and loose-lipped guys won't do."
set key[id=105153412001745] name "So? Did you come to check how far <font color=\"#ffd200\">along</font> things \
    are?\nYou left it to us, so that's that. It's a pain for us when you come all the way here every \
    time.\n...We'll handle it, don't worry."
set key[id=105153412001746] name "(Ask for details about that request.)"
set key[id=105153412001747] name "Hmm... don't tell me you think I forgot? If you're testing me, forget it.\nOur \
    people have already headed to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000146$</font>. \nFrom the latest word I got... \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Phase 1 is nearly complete</font>."
set key[id=105153412001748] name "(Ask who the people at the Shadow Gate are.)"
set key[id=105153412001749] name "Just because we're in this prison doesn't mean we're completely cut off from the \
    outside, right?\nWe have <font color=\"#ffd200\">ways of our own</font>.\nFor example, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">escaped convicts</font>... or the <font color=\"#ffd200\">tourists</font> who come visit \
    this place."
set key[id=105153412001750] name "Anyway, we're steadily working on <font color=\"#ffd200\">what they asked \
    for</font>, so don't worry.\nTell them not to forget to keep the <font color=\"#ffd200\">promise</font> they \
    made."
set key[id=105153412001751] name "(Ask what the promise was.)"
set key[id=105153412001752] name "Ho ho~ so he didn't tell his underlings even that, huh?\nGood, you keep your \
    mouth shut, unlike a certain someone on our side who goes around blabbing the password. \nAnyway, just tell \
    your <font color=\"#ffd200\">boss</font> that and he'll know."
set key[id=105153412001753] name "Stop prying and get going now. \nIt's almost time for the guard to make his \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">rounds</font>."
set key[id=105153412001754] name "Stop prying and get going now. \nIt's almost time for the guard to make his \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">rounds</font>."
set key[id=105153412001755] name "It seems you've confirmed the truth of the rumor $npc:11001265[gender:1]$ \
    mentioned.\nSo, did you learn anything at $map:2000124$?"
set key[id=105153412001756] name "(Explain the information I got from the prisoners there.)"
set key[id=105153412001757] name "Do you think the person they speak of is definitely $npc:11001231[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=105153412001758] name "(Say I'm almost certain.)"
set key[id=105153412001759] name "Putting together information from their talk...\n$npc:11001231[gender:0]$ <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">demanded</font> something from the prisoners of $map:2000124$ in exchange for an unknown \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">promise</font>,\nand they are hatching some <font color=\"#ffd200\">plan</font> at the \
    Shadow Gate.\nIs that how you understood it?"
set key[id=105153412001760] name "(Say that's right.)"
set key[id=105153412001761] name "What do you think $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ is trying to gain by borrowing the \
    prisoners' strength? \nIs <font color=\"#ffd200\">Wisdom of Baz</font> supposed to be there? No, no. \nIf the \
    demand had been to find Wisdom of Baz, locating it would have been enough...\nThere would be no <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">reason to borrow their strength</font>. ...?! Yes, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">strength</font>..."
set key[id=105153412001762] name "(Ask if she has any idea.)"
set key[id=105153412001763] name "I need time to gather my thoughts.\nAnyway, it seems your trip to $map:2000124$ \
    was somewhat <font color=\"#ffd200\">fruitful</font>.\n...And about what happened last time at the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000021$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001764] name "(Say I regret what happened then.)"
set key[id=105153412001765] name "...No. After you left for $map:2000124$, I looked back on my own <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">conduct</font>.\nI began to wonder whether I've been <font color=\"#ffd200\">pressing</font> \
    you too hard all this time."
set key[id=105153412001766] name "Don't take what I said before too much to heart. You are already doing <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">more than well enough</font>."
set key[id=105153412001767] name "Oh? I was just about to contact you at $map:2000033$, so you came at the right \
    time.\nYou asked <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001277[gender:0]$</font> for the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">restoration of the document</font> the other day, didn't you?"
set key[id=105153412001768] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=105153412001769] name "$npcName:11001277[gender:0]$ has finished the work. I only caught a glimpse, \
    but\nhe restored it so cleanly that the title of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcTitle:11001277[gender:0]$</font> \
    is well earned. Would you like to take a look?"
set key[id=105153412001770] name "Read the document $npc:11000005[gender:1]$ handed me."
set key[id=105153412001771] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Opening the first page of the document Anne handed \
    over, these words are written.)</font>\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">'Until sky and earth are called by one name, \
    they will be like stagnant water.'</font>\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">'Until the echo of souls grown wild with a \
    ruined mind blocks the sky from the earth.'</font>"
set key[id=105153412001772] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Turning to the next page, cryptic verses \
    continue.)</font>\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">'Until the feet of the seeker touch the mountain made of heaped \
    stones.'</font>\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">'Only when you climb the bare mountain stripped by false \
    prophets.'</font>"
set key[id=105153412001773] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Turning to the next page, unlike the other verses, only \
    one large line is written.)</font>\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">'At last, the veil of deceit and arrogance that \
    covers the eyes will be lifted.'</font>"
set key[id=105153412001774] name "You look serious... Is there some <font color=\"#ffd200\">problem</font>?"
set key[id=105153412001775] name "(Say I don't understand what the cryptic verses in the document mean.)"
set key[id=105153412001776] name "I took a quick look too after $npcName:11001277[gender:0]$ finished the \
    restoration, but... I couldn't make out any meaning at\nall. I assumed you'd naturally know... but judging by \
    your face, it seems you don't\neither."
set key[id=105153412001777] name "(Ask if she has any idea what this means.)"
set key[id=105153412001778] name "Judging by how it's composed... it seems to be a kind of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">prophecy</font>.\nWhat story it's trying to convey, we won't know until it's <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">interpreted</font>, though."
set key[id=105153412001779] name "(Say thank you for all her advice.)"
set key[id=105153412001780] name "I do wonder what those verses say. \nIf you ever <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">interpret</font> them, please tell me too."
set key[id=105153412001781] name "Hm? Is something the matter?"
set key[id=105153412001782] name "(Say I lost $item:30000442$.)"
set key[id=105153412001783] name "Hmm... it's a good thing I made a copy of the document. Here, take it."
set key[id=105153412001784] name "I already gave you the document... Please check again."
set key[id=105153412001785] name "It seems you have no room for the document...\nYou'd better tidy up your bag."
set key[id=105153412001786] name "I wondered where you'd gone... you've been to $map:2000031$. \nIs that the \
    ancient document you asked to have restored, there in your hand?"
set key[id=105153412001787] name "(Tell her what was written in the document.)"
set key[id=105153412001788] name "Hmm... so it's written in cryptic verses.\nI've heard that in the past, our \
    ancestors replaced important records meant to be conveyed with\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">words of unclear \
    meaning</font> to <font color=\"#ffd200\">share information</font>.\nThe verses in the document you brought \
    probably need separate interpretation, so give it to me."
set key[id=105153412001789] name "(Hand $item:30000442$ to my master.)"
set key[id=105153412001790] name "For now, I'll keep $item:30000442$.\nLet's take our time to study the \
    interpretation of these verses."
set key[id=105153412001791] name "Come to think of it, I received word from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcTitle:11001262[gender:0]$</font> of the $map:52000020$.\nHe said he found the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">information you requested</font> earlier.\nI forgot for a moment while we were talking about \
    $item:30000442$."
set key[id=105153412001792] name "(Ask what information he found.)"
set key[id=105153412001793] name "He said he found a place suspected to be $npc:11001231[gender:0]$'s hideout. \
    \nIt's a place called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000022$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:3000014$</font>. But he said $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ is most likely\nnot there. He has \
    probably moved his <font color=\"#ffd200\">base</font> somewhere else again..."
set key[id=105153412001794] name "But with <font color=\"#ffd200\">what happened at $map:2000124$</font> too...\nI \
    find $npc:11001231[gender:0]$'s present movements <font color=\"#ffd200\">puzzling</font> in many ways."
set key[id=105153412001795] name "On top of that, a place called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000022$</font> \
    troubles me as well. \nI feel I must see for myself whether any traces remain there."
set key[id=105153412001796] name "The $npcTitle:11001262[gender:0]$ says... \n$map:3000014$, where $map:52000022$ \
    is, lies in the Land of Darkness. \nI heard you can get there through the Shadow Door in $map:2000146$."
set key[id=105153412001797] name "I have something to look into for a while, so you go ahead and prepare.\nLet's \
    meet at the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000022$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:3000014$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001798] name "I have something to look into for a while, so you go ahead and prepare.\nLet's \
    meet at the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52000022$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:3000014$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001799] name "Since the standoff with $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ at $map:52000021$, there is \
    something I've been thinking over."
set key[id=105153412001800] name "(Ask what it is.)"
set key[id=105153412001801] name "Until now, I only thought that what $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ was after was the \
    hidden legacy our ancestors left for\ntheir descendants, <font color=\"#ffd200\">Wisdom of Baz</font>. \
    \nSpecifically the Wisdom of Baz said to hold the <font color=\"#ffd200\">most special power</font>. \nBut now \
    I can't tell what his <font color=\"#ffd200\">goal</font> is anymore."
set key[id=105153412001802] name "Judging by what happened at $map:2000124$... \nI began to suspect he may be \
    trying to build a force of his own. \nBut seeing the <font color=\"#ffd200\">created beings</font> here at \
    $map:52000022$... my suspicion has turned to certainty."
set key[id=105153412001803] name "From now on, starting with the clues left here at $map:52000022$... \nI intend \
    to devote myself to tracking $npc:11001231[gender:0]$'s whereabouts. \n$MyPCName$, you and \
    $npc:11001265[gender:1]$ should focus only on finding the Wisdom of Baz \nwe've been investigating."
set key[id=105153412001804] name "(Say I want to chase $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ together with my master.)"
set key[id=105153412001805] name "I cannot allow it. Facing $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ is still far too much for \
    you.\nYou've felt his skill yourself, so you know. "
set key[id=105153412001806] name "$MyPCName$, finding Wisdom of Baz is also very important to us Runeblades.\nFor \
    now, don't think of anything else and follow your master's opinion.\nWill you do that?"
set key[id=105153412001807] name "(Say I'll follow my master's word.)"
set key[id=105153412001808] name "May Baz guide your path.\nIf you run into trouble later, rely on <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001265[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001809] name "So you're $MyPCName$? I've heard a lot about you from \
    $npc:11001265[gender:1]$.\nYou're $npc:11001246[gender:0]$'s one and only disciple, right? \nI saw you move \
    earlier, and you really do deserve to be called <font color=\"#ffd200\">a disciple of the Kalib Eight \
    Swords</font>."
set key[id=105153412001810] name "(Ask if $npc:11001265[gender:1]$ is all right.)"
set key[id=105153412001811] name "Yes, much better. \nBut they aren't well enough to move around freely yet, so I \
    was sent to\nthis place, $map:52000022$, in place of them. What would you like to do? \nWould you like to go \
    and meet $npc:11001265[gender:1]$, as $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ said?"
set key[id=105153412001812] name "Yes, I'll do that."
set key[id=105153412001813] name "$npc:11001265[gender:1]$ is currently in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000361$</font>, in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000076$</font>.\nThey asked \
    $npc:11000001[gender:0]$ there for permission and now use one of <font color=\"#ffd200\">the lodgings \
    the\nvigilantes used to live in</font>. Head over to $map:2000361$ and meet $npc:11001265[gender:1]$."
set key[id=105153412001814] name "$npc:11001265[gender:1]$ is currently in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000361$</font>, in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000076$</font>.\nThey asked \
    $npc:11000001[gender:0]$ there for permission and now use one of <font color=\"#ffd200\">the lodgings \
    the\nvigilantes used to live in</font>. Head over to $map:2000361$ and meet $npc:11001265[gender:1]$."
set key[id=105153412001815] name "$MyPCName$, I heard the situation from $npc:11001268[gender:0]$.\nAnd I got the \
    $item:30000442$ that $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ passed along, too...\nAs $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ said, for now \
    I plan to focus on finding the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Wisdom of Baz</font>."
set key[id=105153412001816] name "Oh, about that $item:30000442$... I heard the verses are cryptic, but \
    $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ \nadded <font color=\"#ffd200\">annotations</font> to every chapter. Thanks to that, \
    I could grasp the contents a bit more easily.\nOf course, it will still take time to interpret it all."
set key[id=105153412001817] name "(Ask how long it will take.)"
set key[id=105153412001818] name "Hard to say... Anyway, I'll call you again once the interpretation is done.\nAnd \
    while $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ is away, feel free to treat this place like <font color=\"#ffd200\">home</font> \
    any time."
set key[id=105153412001819] name "$MyPCName$, you came just in time.\nI'm not sure I interpreted it correctly, \
    but... I just finished <font color=\"#ffd200\">the first verse</font> recorded in the\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000442$</font> that $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ gave us. "
set key[id=105153412001820] name "(Ask if she found where the Wisdom of Baz is.)"
set key[id=105153412001821] name "Some of the verse points in a rather vague direction, which gave me a headache, \
    but...\nAnyway, I used the annotations $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ added to interpret it."
set key[id=105153412001822] name "According to the verse, our ancestors carved their knowledge into a single <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">huge\nstele</font>, which we call the Wisdom of Baz, and kept it in the form of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">ruins</font> all over Victoria\nIsland. Each stele is said to record how to control the \
    powers of <font color=\"#ffd200\">insight, harmony and focus</font>.\nThere's just one thing that bothers me, \
    though..."
set key[id=105153412001823] name "(Ask what bothers her.)"
set key[id=105153412001824] name "From what I heard, what $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ came all the way to Victoria \
    Island to find is a \nmore <font color=\"#ffd200\">special Wisdom of Baz</font>.\nEven \
    $npcName:11001230[gender:0]$ and $npcName:11001246[gender:0]$ wondered why $npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ was \
    seeking the <font color=\"#ffd200\">power of legend</font>."
set key[id=105153412001825] name "(Say I remember $npcName:11001230[gender:0]$ mentioning that before.)"
set key[id=105153412001826] name "You knew about it too?\nRight, that's why I hoped that when I received this \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000442$</font>, it might hold records about the Wisdom of \nBaz that \
    $npcName:11001231[gender:0]$ was looking for. But it doesn't seem to have <font color=\"#ffd200\">any such \
    record</font>.\nMaybe it's <font color=\"#ffd200\">too early to judge</font> from just the verses I've \
    interpreted, though..."
set key[id=105153412001827] name "Oh, that's just my own thought, so don't worry about it.\nLet's just focus on \
    finding the Wisdom of Baz that $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ asked us to find.\nFrom the information the Chase Team \
    gathered, there were <font color=\"#ffd200\">testimonies from local residents</font> who\nfound traces of \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">unidentified ruins</font> long ago. They all say different things, so I'm doubtful, \
    though."
set key[id=105153412001828] name "(Say I'll go look right now.)"
set key[id=105153412001829] name "Right. The interpreted verse also points to a place called $map:2000058$ as \
    where the Wisdom of Baz is, \nso I think going there and searching in person is the best we can do for \
    now.\n$MyPCName$! Head to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000058$</font> and find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000363$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001830] name "You haven't left yet?\nThe interpreted verse also points to a place called \
    $map:2000058$ as where the Wisdom of Baz is, \nso I think going there and searching in person is the best we \
    can do for now.\n$MyPCName$! Head to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000058$</font> and find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000363$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001831] name "So this is... the wisdom <font color=\"#ffd200\">Baz</font> left behind, hoping \
    it would be passed down to descendants...\nIt has a brief introduction to ancient rune sorcery and how to use \
    it..."
set key[id=105153412001832] name "Oh! This is a <font color=\"#ffd200\">technique for raising insight</font> in \
    objects and sorcery, one that has been lost!\nIt describes in great detail how to bring out that energy and \
    how to draw it back in...\nIt's written in full detail, without anything missing!"
set key[id=105153412001833] name "This will surely be a great help to us Runeblades.\nOh, right! Wait a moment. I \
    have something for you."
set key[id=105153412001834] name "I'll wait."
set key[id=105153412001835] name "... ...\n<font color=\"#909090\">(It's best to keep waiting until \
    $npc:11001265[gender:1]$ calls you again.)</font>"
set key[id=105153412001836] name "Wait a little longer."
set key[id=105153412001837] name "Sorry to keep you waiting! Here, take this. It's a faithful copy of the \
    manuscript you brought.\nWithout <font color=\"#ffd200\">you</font>, we couldn't have gotten this knowledge at \
    all... so you more than deserve it."
set key[id=105153412001838] name "$MyPCName$, you came just in time.\nThis time too I'm not sure I interpreted it \
    correctly, but...\nof the verses recorded in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000442$</font> that \
    $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ gave us,\nI just finished <font color=\"#ffd200\">the second verse</font>."
set key[id=105153412001839] name "Don't worry about it, I can just go and check it myself."
set key[id=105153412001840] name "Right, I'll leave the checking to you again, $MyPCName$!\nThis time as well, the \
    Chase Team's advance information included <font color=\"#ffd200\">testimonies about ruins</font>.\nOf course, \
    they all say different things, so I'm doubtful, though."
set key[id=105153412001841] name "Right. The interpreted verse also points to a place called $map:2000090$ as \
    where the Wisdom of Baz is, \nso I think going there and searching in person is the best we can do for \
    now.\n$MyPCName$! Head to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000090$</font> and find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000364$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001842] name "You haven't left yet?\nThe interpreted verse also points to a place called \
    $map:2000090$ as where the Wisdom of Baz is, \nso I think going there and searching in person is the best we \
    can do for now.\n$MyPCName$! Head to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000090$</font> and find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000364$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001843] name "Oh! This is a lost <font color=\"#ffd200\">technique for increasing power by \
    drawing on the surrounding environment</font>!\nIt describes in great detail how to bring out that energy and \
    how to draw it back in...\nIt's written in full detail, without anything missing!"
set key[id=105153412001844] name "This will surely be a great help to us Runeblades.\nI'll copy the manuscript you \
    brought, so wait just a moment, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=105153412001845] name "I'll wait."
set key[id=105153412001846] name "... ...\n<font color=\"#909090\">(It's best to keep waiting until \
    $npc:11001265[gender:1]$ calls you again.)</font>"
set key[id=105153412001847] name "Wait a little longer."
set key[id=105153412001848] name "Sorry to keep you waiting! Here, take this.\nWithout you, we couldn't have \
    gotten this knowledge... so you more than deserve it."
set key[id=105153412001849] name "$MyPCName$, you came just in time.\nThis time too I'm not sure I interpreted it \
    correctly, but...\nof the verses recorded in the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000442$</font> that \
    $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ gave us,\nI just finished <font color=\"#ffd200\">the third verse</font>."
set key[id=105153412001850] name "Right, I'll leave the checking to you again, $MyPCName$!\nThis time as well, the \
    Chase Team's advance information included <font color=\"#ffd200\">testimonies about ruins</font>.\nOf course, \
    they all say different things, so I'm doubtful, though."
set key[id=105153412001851] name "Right. The interpreted verse also points to $map:2000067$ as where the Wisdom of \
    Baz is, \nso going there and searching in person is the best we can do for now.\n$MyPCName$! Head to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000067$</font> and find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000366$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001852] name "You haven't left yet?\nThe interpreted verse also points to a place called \
    $map:2000067$ as where the Wisdom of Baz is, \nso I think going there and searching in person is the best we \
    can do for now.\n$MyPCName$! Head to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000067$</font> and find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:2000366$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001853] name "Oh! This is a lost <font color=\"#ffd200\">technique for using the power of \
    sorcery much more quickly</font>!\nIt describes in great detail how to bring out that energy and how to draw \
    it back in...\nIt's written in full detail, without anything missing!"
set key[id=105153412001854] name "This will surely be a great help to us Runeblades.\nI'll copy the manuscript you \
    brought, so wait just a moment, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=105153412001855] name "I'll wait."
set key[id=105153412001856] name "... ...\n<font color=\"#909090\">(It's best to keep waiting until \
    $npc:11001265[gender:1]$ calls you again.)</font>"
set key[id=105153412001857] name "Wait a little longer."
set key[id=105153412001858] name "Sorry to keep you waiting! Here, take this.\nWithout you, we couldn't have \
    gotten this knowledge... so you more than deserve it."
set key[id=105153412001859] name "$MyPCName$, a few days ago $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ sent a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">letter</font>."
set key[id=105153412001860] name "My master?! What does the letter say?"
set key[id=105153412001861] name "It seems $npc:11001246[gender:0]$ is still chasing $npc:11001231[gender:0]$ in \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Land of Darkness</font>. \nAccording to the letter, there have already been three \
    or four big and small <font color=\"#ffd200\">clashes</font>."
set key[id=105153412001862] name "Though they haven't managed to subdue Holstatt, the letter says that while \
    following his tracks they keep \ndiscovering new things. \nBut it also says that while tracing \
    $npc:11001231[gender:0]$'s movements, it feels like his intentions and \ngoals are lost in a maze..."
set key[id=105153412001863] name "$npc:11001246[gender:0]$ told you to keep a low profile, and then be even more \
    careful, until they send word again.\nThey must be really worried about you.\nOh, and there was one more thing \
    in the letter they sent me... wait a moment."
set key[id=105153412001864] name "$npc:11001246[gender:0]$ told you to keep a low profile, and then be even more \
    careful, until they send word again.\nThey must be really worried about you.\nOh, and there was one more thing \
    in the letter they sent me... wait a moment."
set key[id=105153412001865] name "There was one interesting thing in Ishura's letter.\nYou remember the story that \
    Holstatt is looking for a special Wisdom of Baz, right?"
set key[id=105153412001866] name "(Say I remember.)"
set key[id=105153412001867] name "$npc:11001246[gender:0]$ said they found a <font color=\"#ffd200\">Wisdom of \
    Baz</font> in the Land of Darkness too.\nBut it seems what was recorded in it was somewhat different from what \
    we've found so far.\nAccording to that record, the words <font color=\"#ffd200\">Ultimate Secret Art</font> \
    were mentioned.\nThe Wisdom of Baz we found, sadly, doesn't have anything like that recorded..."
set key[id=105153412001868] name "(Ask if she thinks there's another Wisdom of Baz somewhere with that power \
    recorded.)"
set key[id=105153412001869] name "If that's really true, I think it's quite a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">possibility</font>.\nIf we could obtain that <font color=\"#ffd200\">secret art</font>... \
    Oh! Where are my wits. \n$npc:11001246[gender:0]$ also sent a <font color=\"#ffd200\">relic</font> that was \
    buried near the Wisdom of Baz they found, and\nasked me to be sure to give it to you."
set key[id=105153412001870] name "Here, this is the letter Ishura sent, and the relic. \nThey said to make good \
    use of it, so try equipping it."
set key[id=105153412001871] name "I know you've been rushing about looking for information on the Wisdom of \
    Baz...\nBut you haven't forgotten your training, have you?"
set key[id=105153412001872] name "I've been training my body steadily."
set key[id=105153412001873] name "Good, you've been looking after it on your own. \nBut remember, it's not enough \
    to just <font color=\"#ffd200\">train your body</font>. \nGrowing stronger means polishing your <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">skills</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">taking them up a level</font>."
set key[id=105153412001874] name "Come to think of it, I haven't had <font color=\"#ffd200\">time to instruct \
    you</font> since the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001231[gender:0]$ incident</font>, so this is a good \
    chance. \nI'm about to give you some instruction after a long while. Care to listen?"
set key[id=105153412001875] name "I'm always ready to listen to my master's instruction."
set key[id=105153412001876] name "$MyPCName$, you rascal... saying that without even a change in your \
    expression.\nEnough, enough. You don't have to put on a false act to flatter <font color=\"#ffd200\">your \
    master</font>.\nI can see the boredom on your face just by looking at it..."
set key[id=105153412001877] name "Don't think of it as boring, and listen well. It will surely <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">help</font> you someday. \nWhen you're ready to listen properly, don't think of running off, \
    and speak to me again."
set key[id=105153412001878] name "Hmm... it seems you're finally ready to listen. Good.\nNow, where was I..."
set key[id=105153412001879] name "You said I should polish my skills."
set key[id=105153412001880] name "Right. Skills. Polishing your skills and taking them up a level means you must \
    \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">upgrade</font> the Runeblade skills you've learned. \nThe material called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:40100001$</font> will condense the rune sorcery energy inside your body \nfaster and \
    harder. But just as all things have different natures... \nthe level of the skills each of us Runeblades has \
    learned can't be the same, either."
set key[id=105153412001881] name "In other words, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">type and quantity</font> of upgrade \
    materials each skill needs <font color=\"#ffd200\">vary widely</font>.\nBear that in mind.\nThe basic \
    material, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:40100001$</font>, was hard to find on Kalib Island.\nBut here on \
    Victoria Island, things seem to be a little different."
set key[id=105153412001882] name "I hear you can mostly get it from a <font color=\"#ffd200\">general goods \
    merchant</font> here... so <font color=\"#ffd200\">upgrading your skills</font> should be \nrelatively easier \
    than it was on Kalib Island.\nBut that applies only to $item:40100001$. \nThe other materials are known to \
    drop occasionally from <font color=\"#ffd200\">powerful monsters</font>."
set key[id=105153412001883] name "Leave any monster to your disciple and I'll take it down in one blow."
set key[id=105153412001884] name "You foolish fool! You still haven't fixed that hasty, easily conceited \
    nature!\nSigh... I'd have told you when the time came, so why don't you know how to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">wait</font>?"
set key[id=105153412001885] name "Listen well. I don't want to see you in danger again.\nI'm sure every master \
    feels the <font color=\"#ffd200\">same way</font>. \nAhem! Uh... anyway, just know that for now."
set key[id=105153412001886] name "I'll follow my master's words and keep myself in check."
set key[id=105153412001887] name "Sigh... as I've always warned you, you always lack <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">patience</font>. \nRemember that a truly strong person doesn't carelessly show off their \
    strength.\nFor now I'll give you the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:40100001$</font> I gathered, so <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">open your skill window and upgrade</font>."
set key[id=105153412001888] name "If you're short on materials, you could visit a <font color=\"#ffd200\">general \
    store</font>. \n$MyPCName$, you must always devote yourself to training, and then more."
set key[id=105153412001889] name "Hmm... $MyPCName$. \nYou haven't forgotten to steadily upgrade your skills as I \
    showed you last time, have you?"
set key[id=105153412001890] name "I'm following my master's teachings."
set key[id=105153412001891] name "Hm... listen well. If you ever neglect your training, you'll fall behind in no \
    time.\nYou must cultivate the habit of always guarding against your own laziness."
set key[id=105153412001892] name "To upgrade a skill beyond a certain level, besides the $item:40100001$ I \
    mentioned earlier, \nyou also need special crystals. \nThose are the ones called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:40100002$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:40100003$</font>...\nHm?! You \
    rascal, you're thinking of something else again with that bored look!"
set key[id=105153412001893] name "I was listening to my master with full focus."
set key[id=105153412001894] name "Oh ho~ is that so...?\nThen what were the <font color=\"#ffd200\">special \
    crystals</font> needed to upgrade skills called?"
set key[id=105153412001895] name "It was Rune Crystals, I'm sure of it!"
set key[id=105153412001896] name "Ha ha! I'm sure you said Soul Crystals!"
set key[id=105153412001897] name "I think it was... Red... Crystals?"
set key[id=105153412001898] name "Grr... $MyPCName$, you rascal! \nDidn't I say <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:40100002$ and $item:40100003$</font>?!"
set key[id=105153412001899] name "I-I'll be sure to remember next time."
set key[id=105153412001900] name "You foolish fool! \nWhat do you mean 'I'm sure' it was Soul Crystals?! \nDidn't \
    I say <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:40100002$ and $item:40100003$</font>?! Grr... what a headache you are..."
set key[id=105153412001901] name "I-I'll be sure to remember next time."
set key[id=105153412001902] name "Right... crystals like the Red or Blue ones are highly valuable. \nBut being \
    special, they aren't easy to come by, and it's said you can only get them by defeating \n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">very powerful monsters</font>.\n$MyPCName$, these are foes you must never try to fight <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">a.l.o.n.e</font>."
set key[id=105153412001903] name "I'd never be that reckless."
set key[id=105153412001904] name "...Right. Even someone as reckless as you must have understood by now.\nBy the \
    way, there was something I meant to give you, but I can't remember where I put it...\nWait a moment."
set key[id=105153412001905] name "Here it is. <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:40100002$.</font>\nI got it from \
    Arazad long ago, and I always meant to give it to you.\nIt will be very useful when you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">upgrade active skills</font>, so remember that."
set key[id=105153412001906] name "I'll put it to good use."
set key[id=105153412001907] name "Sigh... $MyPCName$.\nYour master has walked the path of learning too, so I know \
    well it isn't easy.\nBut you must cultivate the <font color=\"#ffd200\">habit of guarding against \
    yourself</font>.\nI can't always be <font color=\"#ffd200\">with</font> you, after all..."
set key[id=105153412001908] name "Even if my master dislikes it, I'll keep asking to learn."
set key[id=105153412001909] name "You rascal... such a mouth on you... Anyway, I'm saying this because I know well \
    the effort you put in,\nfollowing me all the way to this strange land and struggling on, so please take it to \
    heart."
set key[id=105153412001910] name "Wait a second! The detection system... it's reacting differently than \
    before?\n...?! Floaty's latest <font color=\"#ffd200\">flight test results</font> are coming in, so could you \
    wait a moment?"
set key[id=105153412001911] name "I'll wait."
set key[id=105153412001912] name "...Wind direction controller loss rate 11%...\nDirection-tracking guidance unit \
    operating rate 88%... main detection system accuracy... <font color=\"#ffd200\">99</font>%?!"
set key[id=105153412001913] name "Finally! Master Maccan put so much effort into it...\nThe test results look like \
    a <font color=\"#ffd200\">huge success</font>, nothing like before.\nLet's see... the last time Bomar rode \
    Floaty was <font color=\"#ffd200\">data #812</font>,\nand the result that just came out is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">data #815</font>..."
set key[id=105153412001914] name "Heh, if I go by this data...\n$npcName:11001405[gender:0]$ and Floaty both must \
    have arrived safely on Carcar Island."
set key[id=105153412001915] name "(Ask if I can use Floaty right now.)"
set key[id=105153412001916] name "Of course. According to this data, you can any time from now on.\nYou said \
    you're looking for $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$, so tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">Master \
    $npcName:11001276[gender:0]$</font> and you should be able to <font color=\"#ffd200\">use</font> <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Floaty</font>.\n...! Oh, right, right! Wait a moment!"
set key[id=105153412001917] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=105153412001918] name "When $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$ left, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001403[gender:0]$</font>, Master $npcName:11001276[gender:0]$'s other assistant, \
    went along too. \nThe last destination they set is recorded as <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010043$</font>... \nSo you can probably find Racafony there."
set key[id=105153412001919] name "$npcName:11001403[gender:0]$... is careless and willful, but...\nstill, being \
    Master $npcName:11001276[gender:0]$'s assistant, I'm sure he's preparing the settings for\nFloaty's return \
    trip to $map:02000183$."
set key[id=105153412001920] name "When you meet him, please give him this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000486$</font>.\nIt's a manual with the latest data recorded... it should help with \
    fine-tuning Floaty."
set key[id=105153412001921] name "Hm? Is something the matter?"
set key[id=105153412001922] name "I lost the $item:30000486$."
set key[id=105153412001923] name "It's nothing."
set key[id=105153412001924] name "Hmm... you should've looked after it better.\nHere, I'll give you another, so \
    don't lose it this time!"
set key[id=105153412001925] name "No way... Look again. \nYou definitely took it earlier."
set key[id=105153412001926] name "Oh dear... your bag is that full... Sigh... what a pile of junk.\nTidy up \
    first."
set key[id=105153412001927] name "Heh... how dull... \nIf you're interested in me, you can just say so straight \
    out... heh."
set key[id=105153412001928] name "Hey, since you just got off Floaty... \nyou must have come from $map:02000183$, \
    right?"
set key[id=105153412001929] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=105153412001930] name "Oh ho!! If you made it here safely, that means it was another perfect flight, \
    right?\nNow we can stop the flight tests for Floaty. Heh heh..."
set key[id=105153412001931] name "$npcName:11001275[gender:1]$ asked me to deliver the $item:30000486$."
set key[id=105153412001932] name "$item:30000486$? \nHmm~ if that picky $npcName:11001275[gender:1]$ asked you to \
    bring it... \nit must be the manual reflecting all the Floaty flight test results so far."
set key[id=105153412001933] name "I was just in the middle of setting up the return trip to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000183$</font>, so this is perfect. \nIt doesn't seem to have any problems even \
    now... but shall we reinforce the safety a bit more?"
set key[id=105153412001934] name "Oh, right. By the way, why did you come here?"
set key[id=105153412001935] name "Do you know $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=105153412001936] name "$npcName:11001405[gender:0]$? Of course I know him. \
    \n$npcName:11001405[gender:0]$ and I flew so many test flights on Floaty to get to Carcar Island, \nI couldn't \
    forget him if I tried."
set key[id=105153412001937] name "Where is he now?"
set key[id=105153412001938] name "Hmm~ so you came looking for $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$?\nOh dear, what a \
    shame... $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$ has already left here..."
set key[id=105153412001939] name "Did he say where he went?"
set key[id=105153412001940] name "I didn't hear the details either, though.\nHe said he was going to meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">someone</font> who lives in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010084$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001941] name "I'm sure I heard the name... hmm... I can't remember.\nWhat was it... it was a \
    really unusual name..."
set key[id=105153412001942] name "Think hard."
set key[id=105153412001943] name "It was something like Chi... something...\nPuchi... Uchi... no, no, that wasn't \
    it...\nDu... Oh! Oh! I remember! Ttu! The name was <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001404[gender:1]$</font>."
set key[id=105153412001944] name "Anyway, that's all I heard.\nIf you're looking for $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$, \
    go meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001404[gender:1]$</font> in $map:02010084$ first."
set key[id=105153412001945] name "If you're looking for $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$, go meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001404[gender:1]$</font> in $map:02010084$ first."
set key[id=105153412001946] name "You seem to be traveling.\nYou look quite tired, so how about resting at our \
    guest house?"
set key[id=105153412001947] name "I'm looking for $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$."
set key[id=105153412001948] name "Hm? Who are you, and why are you looking for $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=105153412001949] name "A friend of his asked me to find out how he's doing."
set key[id=105153412001950] name "A friend, you say...?"
set key[id=105153412001951] name "$npcName:11001274[gender:0]$ asked me to."
set key[id=105153412001952] name "Ho ho ho~ Sorry for prying into every little thing.\nSince you know \
    $npcName:11001274[gender:0]$, your identity seems certain enough."
set key[id=105153412001953] name "It's true that $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$ came to see me, but sadly he isn't \
    here right now."
set key[id=105153412001954] name "Do you know where he went?"
set key[id=105153412001955] name "All I heard was that something urgent came up and he had to go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010002$</font>.\nBut... it hasn't been long, so if you hurry even now, couldn't you \
    catch him?"
set key[id=105153412001956] name "Do you know what the urgent matter is?"
set key[id=105153412001957] name "Well... while $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$ was staying here, he received a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">letter</font>... \nI don't know what was written in it, but he <font color=\"#ffd200\">went \
    pale</font> and left in a hurry!"
set key[id=105153412001958] name "He left not long ago, so he can't have gotten far...\nWhy not go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010002$</font>?"
set key[id=105153412001959] name "Come to think of it... $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$ looked very anxious.\nI \
    wonder if something <font color=\"#ffd200\">bad</font> has happened? \nHe left not long ago, so he can't have \
    gotten far...\nIf you go to $map:02010002$ and meet $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$, please give him my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">regards</font> and tell him I'm worried."
set key[id=105153412001960] name "?! W-what's going on?"
set key[id=105153412001961] name "(Explain the situation to $npcName:11001405[gender:0]$.) "
set key[id=105153412001962] name "Ah... $npcName:11001274[gender:0]$...\nYou came all this way to do a favor for \
    my friend... thank you.\nBut I don't think I can go back to $npcName:11001274[gender:0]$ yet."
set key[id=105153412001963] name "I heard about the letter from $npcName:11001404[gender:1]$."
set key[id=105153412001964] name "Ugh... I unintentionally made Ms. $npcName:11001404[gender:1]$ worry too.\nBut \
    it's such an <font color=\"#ffd200\">important matter</font> for me that I had no room to explain."
set key[id=105153412001965] name "Can you tell me what it is?"
set key[id=105153412001966] name "Hmm... I'm sorry, but I can't say.\nI can't trouble someone who came this far \
    because of my friend's request..."
set key[id=105153412001967] name "If there's something I can help with, I want to help."
set key[id=105153412001968] name "...I'm waiting for <font color=\"#ffd200\">some news</font> to arrive.\nI'm sure \
    this is the agreed place, but..."
set key[id=105153412001969] name "Please explain in more detail."
set key[id=105153412001970] name "That's... um...\n...N-no. It's better not to say any more.\nI'm grateful you \
    brought news from $npcName:11001274[gender:0]$ and did the favor, but..."
set key[id=105153412001971] name "Please forget what I just said. No, let's say we never met today...\nWhen this \
    is over, I'll surely go and pick up $npcName:11001274[gender:0]$ myself."
set key[id=105153412001972] name "You look like a traveler.\nA <font color=\"#ffd200\">disease warning</font> was \
    recently declared in the village, so please stay away from <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010005$</font>, \
    north of Minar,\nif you can."
set key[id=105153412001973] name "What kind of disease is it?"
set key[id=105153412001974] name "As a doctor, I shouldn't really say this, but...\nit's a strange illness whose \
    cause and cure are both unknown."
set key[id=105153412001975] name "Recently patients have appeared in the village one by one, and the villagers' \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">anxiety</font> grew...\nso they were gathered together and made to stay in \
    $map:02010005$. \nIt's a kind of <font color=\"#ffd200\">quarantine</font>."
set key[id=105153412001976] name "Is it contagious?"
set key[id=105153412001977] name "Contagious? Not at all. We've continued to monitor the patients' symptoms, but \
    we haven't found anything\nsuggesting contagion. It's just that, rather than an ordinary disease, it's as \
    if... \nI could sense an <font color=\"#ffd200\">unease</font> like you feel from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">magic</font> or <font color=\"#ffd200\">sorcery</font>."
set key[id=105153412001978] name "Then was it really necessary to quarantine them?"
set key[id=105153412001979] name "Of course, I have my doubts about whether quarantine is needed, too.\nBut the \
    villagers were so <font color=\"#ffd200\">insistent</font> that it was a measure we had to take.\nEveryone \
    thinks the illness is a <font color=\"#ffd200\">curse</font>."
set key[id=105153412001980] name "Why are people so sure it's a curse?"
set key[id=105153412001981] name "That's because the patients' <font color=\"#ffd200\">appearance</font> has \
    changed.\nYou'll understand if you see for yourself... the patients' skin has changed so strangely that, with \
    neither\ncause nor cure known, a curse may be the only way to explain it."
set key[id=105153412001982] name "I didn't sense such a serious mood in the village."
set key[id=105153412001983] name "They're just hiding it and keeping quiet.\nSome people have even done <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">cruel things</font> to $map:02010005$... but everyone just looks on."
set key[id=105153412001984] name "Hmm... I'd like to see the patients myself."
set key[id=105153412001985] name "I don't think you have any <font color=\"#ffd200\">clever solution</font>, \
    but...\nmeeting the patients isn't a problem in particular. \n$map:02010005$ is north of Minar."
set key[id=105153412001986] name "I don't think you have any <font color=\"#ffd200\">clever solution</font>, \
    but...\nmeeting the patients isn't a problem in particular. \n$map:02010005$ is north of Minar."
set key[id=105153412001987] name "W-what do you want? \nWe're not sick anymore! ...So please don't bully us..."
set key[id=105153412001988] name "I didn't come to bully you."
set key[id=105153412001989] name "T-then...?\nNobody ever wants to come near this place..."
set key[id=105153412001990] name "I heard a strange illness is going around the village, so I came."
set key[id=105153412001991] name "I see...\nI thought you came to bully us again..."
set key[id=105153412001992] name "The villagers hate everyone here..."
set key[id=105153412001993] name "Did the villagers make this place such a mess?"
set key[id=105153412001994] name "People smashed the furniture in this hut, threw trash, and yelled at us...\nThey \
    said we were cursed...\nSo everyone avoided even coming here, but <font color=\"#ffd200\">that big \
    sister</font> was different."
set key[id=105153412001995] name "Who is the big sister?"
set key[id=105153412001996] name "Big sister $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$.\nShe even hooked her little finger with \
    mine and made a <font color=\"#ffd200\">promise</font>. \nShe said she'd definitely find a way to cure the \
    illness!"
set key[id=105153412001997] name "I heard even $npc:11001443[gender:0]$ had no good way to treat it."
set key[id=105153412001998] name "That's not true!\nBig sister $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$ is called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcTitle:11001396[gender:1]$</font> in the village! \nAnd she <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">promised</font>..."
set key[id=105153412001999] name "...Where is $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$ now?"
set key[id=105153412002000] name "I... don't know.\nShe definitely said she'd come back after just two \
    nights...\n...She didn't abandon us, did she...?"
set key[id=105153412002001] name "Is there anyone who might know where she is?"
set key[id=105153412002002] name "Her dad, Mr. <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001390[gender:0]$</font>, lives \
    in <font color=\"#ffd200\">Minar</font>.\nIf you ask him for <font color=\"#ffd200\">news about my \
    sister</font>... maybe he'll know?"
set key[id=105153412002003] name "Her dad, Mr. <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001390[gender:0]$</font>, lives \
    in <font color=\"#ffd200\">Minar</font>.\nIf you ask him for <font color=\"#ffd200\">news about my \
    sister</font>... maybe he'll know?"
set key[id=105153412002004] name "Hm? Did you come looking for me?"
set key[id=105153412002005] name "I'm looking for $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$."
set key[id=105153412002006] name "$npcName:11001396[gender:1]$ is my <font color=\"#ffd200\">daughter</font>... \
    \nDo you need something from her...?"
set key[id=105153412002007] name "(Explain the situation.)"
set key[id=105153412002008] name "That girl, I wondered what she went out for this time... and she made such a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">promise</font>..."
set key[id=105153412002009] name "$npcName:11001396[gender:1]$ has already left $map:02010063$.\nShe's always \
    loved studying and researching ruins, so...\nI thought it was just that again, but she's going to find a cure \
    for the illness?"
set key[id=105153412002010] name "(Ask if there's some problem.)"
set key[id=105153412002011] name "Isn't making such a promise itself the problem?\nSince childhood she's been \
    called a prodigy, and some people call her a genius, so... \nshe's just full of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">drive</font>, saying she'll solve any difficult problem herself."
set key[id=105153412002012] name "Of course, she doesn't have the bad habit of being arrogant, but... \nshe tends \
    to try to shoulder everything. She's never failed to solve a problem so far,\nso it hasn't been an issue, \
    but... I always <font color=\"#ffd200\">worry</font>. \nOne day she may face a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">wall</font> too big for her to overcome..."
set key[id=105153412002013] name "Anyway, since she made the <font color=\"#ffd200\">promise</font>, she has to \
    take <font color=\"#ffd200\">responsibility</font> for her words.\n...I can only hope she'll solve it wisely \
    this time too."
set key[id=105153412002014] name "I want to meet $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$."
set key[id=105153412002015] name "My daughter said she was heading to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010023$</font>, so you should be able to find her there."
set key[id=105153412002016] name "Oh, right! If you meet my daughter, please give her this.\nI always prepared it \
    thinking 'she'll come today, she'll come today'... \nBut hearing your story, I think I should leave it with \
    you."
set key[id=105153412002017] name "What is this?"
set key[id=105153412002018] name "It's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">lunchbox</font> I made. I worry she's going \
    around skipping meals... \nIf I don't at least make this, I can't feel at ease.\nPlease be sure to give it to \
    $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$ when you meet her."
set key[id=105153412002019] name "You haven't gone to meet $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$ yet.\nIs there some \
    problem?"
set key[id=105153412002020] name "I lost the lunchbox you gave me."
set key[id=105153412002021] name "It's nothing."
set key[id=105153412002022] name "Hm... I'm glad I made a spare lunchbox. Here, take it."
set key[id=105153412002023] name "I already gave you the lunchbox... please check again."
set key[id=105153412002024] name "It looks like you have no room for the lunchbox...\nYou'll need to tidy your \
    bag."
set key[id=105153412002025] name "Hm... is that so?\nWhen you meet $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$, please don't \
    forget to give her my lunchbox."
set key[id=105153412002026] name "What brings you here?"
set key[id=105153412002027] name "(Pass on $npcName:11001390[gender:0]$'s request.)"
set key[id=105153412002028] name "Dad, honestly... thank you. I'll be sure to eat this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">lunchbox</font> later.\nI have something I need to do right now, so if you have nothing more \
    to say, may we talk again another time?"
set key[id=105153412002029] name "I didn't come here to deliver a lunchbox."
set key[id=105153412002030] name "Hm? Then why did you come?"
set key[id=105153412002031] name "(Pass on Halan's story.)"
set key[id=105153412002032] name "Hm... I see.\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">date I promised</font> \
    $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ has already passed.\nIt's taking a long time because clues are harder to find \
    than I expected."
set key[id=105153412002033] name "Is there even a cure for the illness?"
set key[id=105153412002034] name "I can't say there's a sure cure... but I can't say there isn't one, either.\nBut \
    I have no intention of giving up. I have my own <font color=\"#ffd200\">method</font>, after all."
set key[id=105153412002035] name "By observing the huge ruins spread across $map:02010023$ steadily, I saw that \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:21000674$</font> that appear around the ruins\nwere carrying a suspicious \
    piece of stone tablet.\nI even <font color=\"#ffd200\">suspect</font> that the <font color=\"#ffd200\">cause \
    of the strange disease</font> that broke out in the village might be the doing of the $npcName:21000674$..."
set key[id=105153412002036] name "If I can get that tablet piece, I think I'll be able to learn the whole \
    story...\nand sort out my hypothesis. Will you help me?"
set key[id=105153412002037] name "What do you need me to do?"
set key[id=105153412002038] name "It's not for me, but... I think it will probably be simple for you.\nRetrieve \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000503$</font> that the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:21000674$</font> \
    carry and bring it to me.\nCan you do it?"
set key[id=105153412002039] name "Retrieve the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000503$</font> from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:21000674$</font> and bring it to me.\nThey show up all over $map:02010023$, so they \
    shouldn't be hard to find."
set key[id=105153412002040] name "So this is the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000503$</font> that the \
    $npcName:21000674$ was carrying.\nI expected as much, but... the language written on this tablet is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">unfamiliar</font>."
set key[id=105153412002041] name "It isn't a language I can read. ...But if it's <font color=\"#ffd200\">that \
    person</font>..."
set key[id=105153412002042] name "Have you heard of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Moropapa Tribe</font> living in \
    this $map:02010023$? \nThe Moropapa Tribe is famous for having many members with outstanding knowledge in many \
    fields. \nI think if I ask them, they should be able to tell us what this tablet says."
set key[id=105153412002043] name "I once met a Moropapa tribe member... \nI'm sure he would do me this favor."
set key[id=105153412002044] name "Who do you mean?"
set key[id=105153412002045] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001397[gender:0]$</font> is a Moropapa tribe \
    member I met while investigating the ruins of $map:02010023$.\nI once talked with him briefly about the \
    illness $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ has... \nAfter hearing the circumstances, he said he'd do some research \
    of his own."
set key[id=105153412002046] name "I don't know how much that research has achieved...\nbut I'm convinced this \
    $item:30000503$ can be a <font color=\"#ffd200\">clue</font>."
set key[id=105153412002047] name "Where can I find $npcName:11001397[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=105153412002048] name "He must be somewhere in this <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010023$</font>... \
    \nHe hates crowded places, so he's probably in some remote spot? "
set key[id=105153412002049] name "When you find him, please find out what's written on the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000503$</font>."
set key[id=105153412002050] name "You haven't left yet? Did you forget something?"
set key[id=105153412002051] name "I lost the $item:30000503$."
set key[id=105153412002052] name "I just wanted to talk."
set key[id=105153412002053] name "Good thing I got a spare tablet piece. Here, take it."
set key[id=105153412002054] name "I'm sure I already gave you the $item:30000503$. Please check again."
set key[id=105153412002055] name "Do you have room for the $item:30000503$?\nHave you tidied your bag?"
set key[id=105153412002056] name "Surely you haven't already forgotten what I asked of \
    you?\n$npcName:11001397[gender:0]$ is definitely somewhere in this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010023$</font>. \nHe'll surely be able to read what's written on the \
    $item:30000503$."
set key[id=105153412002057] name "You're back already!\nDid you meet $npcName:11001397[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=105153412002058] name "(Tell her about the elixir I got from $npcName:11001397[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=105153412002059] name "Really?! That's... a harvest I never imagined!"
set key[id=105153412002060] name "As I thought, that $item:30000503$ was the clue.\nIf \
    $npcName:11001397[gender:0]$ made an elixir based on it, I can trust it.\nI'll finally be able to keep my \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">promise</font> to $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$."
set key[id=105153412002061] name "You look happy."
set key[id=105153412002062] name "Do I?\nWhen I think I can finally keep my promise to \
    $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$... I couldn't help it..."
set key[id=105153412002063] name "I'm sure $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ will be happy to hear this news, too."
set key[id=105153412002064] name "You think so, too?!\nCould you take this <font color=\"#ffd200\">good \
    news</font> and the <font color=\"#ffd200\">elixir</font> to $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ in \
    $map:02010005$?\nI have some records of the ruins to sort out, so I can't move right away."
set key[id=105153412002065] name "I'll go meet $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$."
set key[id=105153412002066] name "Thank you.\nOnce I'm done sorting, I'll go and meet $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ \
    too."
set key[id=105153412002067] name "Did you forget something else?"
set key[id=105153412002068] name "I lost the $item:30000504$."
set key[id=105153412002069] name "It's nothing."
set key[id=105153412002070] name "It's an important elixir, so never lose it again. Here, take it."
set key[id=105153412002071] name "I'm sure I already gave you the $item:30000504$. Please check again."
set key[id=105153412002072] name "Do you have room for the $item:30000504$?\nHave you tidied your bag?"
set key[id=105153412002073] name "Then hurry and take this <font color=\"#ffd200\">good news</font> and the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">elixir</font> to $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ in $map:02010005$.\nOnce I'm done sorting, \
    I'll go and meet $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ too."
set key[id=105153412002074] name "Did you find big sister $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$?"
set key[id=105153412002075] name "I found $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$, and she even sent medicine to cure the \
    illness."
set key[id=105153412002076] name "Really?! Big sister kept her promise after all!\nAnd I didn't know, and I <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">doubted</font> her..."
set key[id=105153412002077] name "Is this the... medicine big sister $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$ gave me? \nIf I \
    drink this, will I feel full of energy like I used to?"
set key[id=105153412002078] name "I'm sure you'll be able to run around and play just like before you got sick."
set key[id=105153412002079] name "Thank you. I'll drink it now."
set key[id=105153412002080] name "Gulp... gulp...."
set key[id=105153412002081] name "(Wait until $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ finishes the medicine.)"
set key[id=105153412002082] name "...Ahh! I drank it all!\nI only drank it, but I feel like I'll be better in no \
    time!"
set key[id=105153412002083] name "You'll need some time to see how you feel."
set key[id=105153412002084] name "No. Big sister said so, so I can trust it...tr...\nMy... my throat..."
set key[id=105153412002085] name "?! What's wrong?"
set key[id=105153412002086] name "... ...\n<font color=\"#909090\">($npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ has a look on \
    their face as if trying to say something urgently, but no sound can be heard.)</font>"
set key[id=105153412002087] name "W-what on earth did you give $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$?!"
set key[id=105153412002088] name "I gave the medicine I got from $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$."
set key[id=105153412002089] name "Liar! You're lying!\nIf it's really medicine to cure the illness, why can't my \
    little sibling speak?!"
set key[id=105153412002090] name "I... don't know."
set key[id=105153412002091] name "I knew it, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">promises</font> people make are all <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">lies</font>! \nWhen we got sick, even Dad and Mom said they'd come back after one night and \
    then <font color=\"#ffd200\">ran away</font>...\nPeople said we were cursed and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">pointed fingers</font> at us."
set key[id=105153412002092] name "And now the one person my sibling trusted gave us some <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">sham medicine</font>... \nand took my sibling's voice away... What on earth did we do so \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">wrong</font>?! Tell me!"
set key[id=105153412002093] name "(Apologize.) I'm sorry."
set key[id=105153412002094] name "I don't need your apology... go away...\nJust tell $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$ \
    that we'll never <font color=\"#ffd200\">forgive</font> her...\nSob... $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$... I'm \
    sorry, it's my fault... say something... sob..."
set key[id=105153412002095] name "Tell $npcName:11001396[gender:1]$ that we'll never <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">forgive</font> her...\nSob... $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$... I'm sorry, it's my fault... \
    say something... sob..."
set key[id=105153412002096] name "How is $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$? Did the illness get better?"
set key[id=105153412002097] name "(Tell her what happened to Halan after taking the medicine.)"
set key[id=105153412002098] name "Wh-what?! That can't be... how..."
set key[id=105153412002099] name "...It's... my mistake. $npcName:11001392[gender:1]$ trusted me...\nI let my joy \
    get ahead of me without checking properly..."
set key[id=105153412002100] name "Could it be that $npcName:11001397[gender:0]$ lied?"
set key[id=105153412002101] name "Impossible!\nIt's true he's a bit eccentric, unlike other Moropapa tribe \
    members, but... \nhe would never do such a thing."
set key[id=105153412002102] name "I'm not doubting $npcName:11001397[gender:0]$, I just asked about the \
    possibility."
set key[id=105153412002103] name "No. If there's blame, it's all mine.\nI should have properly tested the \
    medicine's real effects... \n$npcName:11001391[gender:0]$ has every reason to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">resent</font> me."
set key[id=105153412002104] name "I... I'm sorry. \nI need <font color=\"#ffd200\">time to collect my \
    thoughts</font>. ...Please go now..."
set key[id=105153412002105] name "(Leave so she can collect her thoughts.)"
set key[id=105153412002106] name "It's... all... my <font color=\"#ffd200\">fault</font>..."
set key[id=106232405001224] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Gulp)</font> Honestly, being sent to a place I've never \
    been\nI'm dizzy, and I don't know anyone. Honestly..."
set key[id=106232405001225] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=106232405001226] name "I came here on orders from Her Majesty the Empress,\nbut since it's my first \
    time here, I'm trying to decide where to start my sightseeing."
set key[id=106232405001227] name "(Ask if your mission is sightseeing.)"
set key[id=106232405001228] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Pretending not to hear and fiddling around, then \
    suddenly remembering)</font>\nYou see over there? That tall, thin person?"
set key[id=106232405001229] name "He keeps going on and on about how I look so nice and how exciting it is.\nCould \
    you ask him what he's trying to say?"
set key[id=106232405001230] name "If I go to the mall dressed like this, everyone will stare at me. Honestly..."
set key[id=106232405001231] name "This barren desert I never used to give a second look...\nRoads have been paved \
    and buildings have gone up so much that you can hardly find a grain of sand."
set key[id=106232405001232] name "Yalari-yo~ Good to see you, new friend!"
set key[id=118183405001389] name "Good timing.\n$npc:11001292[gender:0]$ has been looking for you."
set key[id=118183405001390] name "They asked me if I'd seen you,\nbut I couldn't remember when I last saw you, so \
    I couldn't answer.\nHurry over to $map:02010053$."
set key[id=118183405001391] name "Hurry over to $map:02010053$."
set key[id=118183405001392] name "Glad you made it. This place felt empty without you.\nWe're celebrating \
    finishing our mission safely."
set key[id=118183405001393] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Laughing sheepishly)</font> Maybe it's the emptiness \
    after all that commotion, but everyone has gone quiet."
set key[id=118183405001394] name "We succeeded in doing what we had to do.\nSomething even our parents couldn't \
    do."
set key[id=118183405001395] name "We were born with the fate of Dragon Knights, but I never thought we'd really \
    have to do it.\nAnd until this happened, we didn't even know each other.\nWell, you two have known each other \
    for a while, of course."
set key[id=118183405001396] name "I never thought I'd really have to do it."
set key[id=118183405001397] name "I haven't known $npcName:11001294[gender:0]$ for very long either.\nIf not for \
    that incident, we'd still be a restaurant owner who can't remember customers' faces\nand a customer who only \
    has eyes for the food."
set key[id=118183405001398] name "Of course, even without that, fate would have tied the two of us together.\nJust \
    like how we came to meet you, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>."
set key[id=118183405001399] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Gazing into the distance, lost in memories.)</font>"
set key[id=118183405001400] name "What happened?"
set key[id=118183405001401] name "What happened back then was..."
set key[id=118183405001402] name "Honestly, it's not a happy memory. Ha ha."
set key[id=118183405001403] name "I was the only customer that day, and $npcName:11001292[gender:0]$ didn't seem \
    worried at all,\nnever even glancing at the customers' table, just cooking."
set key[id=118183405001404] name "As for me, $npcName:11001292[gender:0]$ was only making my food,\nso I never had \
    to stop eating, which was great."
set key[id=118183405001405] name "But the good time I had with $npcName:11001292[gender:0]$'s cooking all to \
    myself\nlasted only until that guy showed up."
set key[id=118183405001406] name "If it weren't for that guy, I could've eaten my fill!"
set key[id=118183405001407] name "I was too busy handling $npcName:11001294[gender:0]$'s order to think.\nThen \
    suddenly a huge shadow fell across the restaurant entrance."
set key[id=118183405001408] name "All at once my heart shrank and I felt my hair stand on end.\nAnd after that, \
    well..."
set key[id=118183405001409] name "I took heavy losses from my very first day open,\nand I had no choice but to \
    turn away both customers, saying closing time had passed."
set key[id=118183405001410] name "But that day, after one customer left first and the other finished paying,\nthe \
    remaining customer came to find me in the kitchen."
set key[id=118183405001411] name "Then with a bright face, he said it was really delicious.\nIt was such a sweet \
    greeting that the whole day's weariness melted away.\nI watched the customer leave."
set key[id=118183405001412] name "The customer turned around, raised a hand, and greeted me once more.\nJust then, \
    moonlight streaming in through the window fell on him,\nand the mark carved on his wrist glowed brightly."
set key[id=118183405001413] name "It was the same mark as the one carved on my arm.\nHe was a Dragon Knight too."
set key[id=118183405001414] name "I never imagined I'd find a Dragon Knight that way."
set key[id=118183405001415] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Laughing out loud)</font> $npcName:11001294[gender:0]$ \
    has had a huge appetite since way back, hasn't he?"
set key[id=118183405001416] name "(Ask how you met Startz.)"
set key[id=118183405001417] name "$npcName:11001292[gender:0]$ and I met at the hospital.\nThe pain was severe, \
    but we couldn't find the cause, and it was so frustrating."
set key[id=118183405001418] name "Then at the hospital there was a patient with the same symptoms as mine.\nThat \
    was $npcName:11001292[gender:0]$."
set key[id=118183405001419] name "After hearing my symptoms, $npcName:11001292[gender:0]$ suddenly grabbed my arm \
    and dragged me to a lake lit by the moon.\nThen checked the mark carved on my wrist."
set key[id=118183405001420] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Looking at $npcName:11001292[gender:0]$)</font>\nCome \
    to think of it, how did you figure out I was a Dragon Knight?"
set key[id=118183405001421] name "How did you know I was a Dragon Knight..."
set key[id=118183405001422] name "When I found out someone besides me had the same symptoms,\nI suddenly \
    remembered what I'd read in $item:30000515$. "
set key[id=118183405001423] name "That when Lumieragon is in danger, Dragon Knights sense the danger\nthrough \
    intense pain with no known cause..."
set key[id=118183405001424] name "There must be other things in $item:30000515$ that we've forgotten...\nIf you go \
    to $map:52010022$, there should be a guidebook."
set key[id=118183405001425] name "I think it's on a bookshelf...\nCould you find $item:30000515$ and bring it to \
    me?"
set key[id=118183405001426] name "I haven't tidied the bookshelves in so long that I don't know what else is \
    there."
set key[id=118183405001427] name "Looking at $item:30000515$, one line from it comes back to me...\nBefore the \
    path guided by the heir of light, your existence too shall become light...\nIt's my favorite passage."
set key[id=118183405001428] name "But $npc:11001297[gender:1]$... doesn't it feel like the pain is coming \
    back?\nNo, it's different from back then... my heart is shrinking and my hair is standing on end!"
set key[id=316160602005024] name "I think the police officer over there was looking for you... "
set key[id=316160602005025] name "I think the police officer over there was looking for you... "
set key[id=316160602005026] name "Ah, you came?"
set key[id=316194102005027] name "A guest in Room 215 is looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005028] name "A guest in Room 215 is looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005029] name "Welcome."
set key[id=316194102005030] name "A guest in Room 215 is looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005031] name "A guest in Room 215 is looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005032] name "You're late."
set key[id=316194102005033] name "A guest in Room 215 is looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005034] name "A guest in Room 215 is looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005035] name "You're here now."
set key[id=316194102005036] name "A guest in Room 215 is looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005037] name "A guest in Room 215 is looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005038] name "You've finally come!"
set key[id=316194102005039] name "Ah, $MyPCName$.\nIt seems $npc:11000005[gender:1]$ at $map:02000031$ is looking \
    for you, so go see her."
set key[id=316194102005040] name "Ah, $MyPCName$.\nIt seems $npc:11000005[gender:1]$ at $map:02000031$ is looking \
    for you, so go see her."
set key[id=316194102005041] name "Hm?"
set key[id=316194102005042] name "Head to $map:02000361$.\n$npcName:11001232[gender:1]$ was looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005043] name "Head to $map:02000361$.\n$npcName:11001232[gender:1]$ was looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005044] name "Wow... I did it!!"
set key[id=316194102005051] name "Head to $map:02000361$.\n$npcName:11001232[gender:1]$ was looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005052] name "Head to $map:02000361$.\n$npcName:11001232[gender:1]$ was looking for you."
set key[id=316194102005053] name "Oh, you're here?"
set key[id=421142405001478] name "I can't just sit still, wondering why there's still no word.\nIs there anyone \
    who could check for me?"
set key[id=421142405001479] name "Maybe if I just wait like this...?"
set key[id=421142405001480] name "Oh, it's $MyPCName$!\nYou came to help me, right?"
set key[id=421142405001481] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Request to verify orders</font>\nYou've been found \
    qualified to read the orders. Requesting that you read them."
set key[id=421142405001482] name "You've been found qualified to read the orders. Requesting that you read them."
set key[id=421142405001483] name "Analyzing the encrypted contents of the orders...\n......\nAnalysis complete! \
    Details can now be read."
set key[id=421142405001484] name "Everything we needed to do here is finished.\nOur agent at $map:03000135$ is \
    waiting for $MyPCName$,\nso please go there and meet $npcName:11000614[gender:0]$."
set key[id=421142405001485] name "Find $npcName:11000614[gender:0]$ at $map:03000135$."
set key[id=421142405001486] name "Ah, you're here."
set key[id=901101205000154] name "Welcome! Nothing to ring up today?\nThat's fine. Nobody says you have to buy \
    something to come to the market.\nPeople come to look around and chat with their neighbors, too."
set key[id=901101205000155] name "Anyway, we're short on <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000244$</font> \
    again.\nLooks like I'll have to cover it out of my own pocket before the boss finds out."
set key[id=901101205000156] name "(Ask if she knows why it's short.)"
set key[id=901101205000157] name "One of the staff saw $npc:21000013$ swipe some.\nBut he looks so scary that \
    nobody dared stop him, so they pretended not to see."
set key[id=901101205000158] name "The funny part is, he was shaking all over, nervous as anything,\nwhich didn't \
    suit that face at all. Ha ha.\nSigh, I wish someone would get back the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000244$</font> that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000013$</font> took..."
set key[id=901101205000159] name "There's no use telling the boss. He'd just suspect us instead."
set key[id=901101205000160] name "Thank you. We got back every last one that went missing!!"
set key[id=901101205000161] name "Back when I guarded the park, people would often hand me a drink\nand tell me to \
    keep up the good work.\nThese days people have gotten so cold that nobody does that anymore."
set key[id=901101205000162] name "I have to guard the park, so I can't spare the time to go buy a drink.\nNot that \
    I'm asking because I'm thirsty or anything!\nAnd I'm certainly not hoping for a freebie."
set key[id=901101205000163] name "What do you want?"
set key[id=901101205000164] name "I'd like you, $MyPCName$, to go to $map:2000209$\nand bring me just one <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000245$</font>.\nTell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000795[gender:1]$</font> it's \
    an errand for me, and she'll hand it over for free."
set key[id=901101205000165] name "Standing in the sun with my mouth this dry,\nI'm dying for a $item:30000245$."
set key[id=901101205000166] name "Welcome.\nLet me ring that up for you."
set key[id=901101205000167] name "A lot of people are asking for $item:30000245$.\nI'd better stock the fridge a \
    bit more."
set key[id=901101205000168] name "(Say you came on an errand for $npc:11000352[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=901101205000169] name "Oh dear, what do I do?\nThe boss said $npc:11000352[gender:0]$ has run up too \
    big a tab,\nso we're not to give anything on credit anymore."
set key[id=901101205000171] name "$npc:11000352[gender:0]$ always pays the tab on time and is one of our best \
    customers.\nI don't know why the boss suddenly decided this."
set key[id=901101205000172] name "I know it's awkward, but\nplease tell <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000352[gender:0]$</font> that there's no more credit."
set key[id=901101205000173] name "It's the boss's order, so there's nothing I can do."
set key[id=901101205000174] name "The drinks I've bought there must add up to a truckload. And I always settled up \
    on time!\nTo be treated this coldly! When I'm off duty, I'm going to see that boss in person!"
set key[id=901101205000175] name "More and more customers are going to the big supermarket nearby,\nso it keeps \
    getting harder for a small shop like ours to get by."
set key[id=901101205000176] name "On top of that, the neighborhood is getting gloomier by the day,\nand with the \
    swarms of flies, even the customers who do come turn right back around. "
set key[id=901101205000177] name "I chase the flies away from the fruit several times a day,\nbut the moment I \
    look away, they swarm right back."
set key[id=901101205000178] name "I think the flies have made a nest under that sewer over there.\nTo get rid of \
    them, I mixed herbs into an insecticide."
set key[id=901101205000179] name "If you spray <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000246$</font> down the sewer near \
    the shop,\nI won't have to see those pests around my fruit ever again."
set key[id=901101205000180] name "Is something wrong?"
set key[id=901101205000181] name "(Say you lost $item:30000246$.)"
set key[id=901101205000182] name "(Say the sewer smells bad.)"
set key[id=901101205000183] name "You dropped $item:30000246$ on the ground on your way out.\nI picked it up."
set key[id=901101205000184] name "I think you put it in your bag a moment ago... let's take a look?\nHa ha, I was \
    right, wasn't I?"
set key[id=901101205000185] name "I picked up what you dropped on the ground.\nBut your bag is full. There's no \
    room for it."
set key[id=901101205000186] name "Spraying $item:30000246$ will get rid of the smell, too."
set key[id=901101205000187] name "Even if the flies are gone, business won't pick up, I suppose.\nPlease think of \
    it as me taking it out on the wrong thing."
set key[id=901101205000188] name "I'm in a bad mood, so don't mess with me.\nNo, wait! You, run an errand for me."
set key[id=901101205000189] name "Somebody I'd never seen before came to me and asked me to hide a bag.\nHe \
    pressed money into my hand without even counting it,\nand at a glance, it was an amount I couldn't refuse!"
set key[id=901101205000190] name "He hurried off without even checking where I'd hide it,\nso I just tossed the \
    bag somewhere easy to hide and came back.\nBut it's bugging me..."
set key[id=901101205000191] name "The monsters saw me hide that bag.\nWhat if the bag has a real owner,\nand he's \
    out looking for whoever hid it?"
set key[id=901101205000192] name "So here's the thing:\nI want you to shut the monsters up so word doesn't get out \
    that I hid it."
set key[id=901101205000193] name "(Ask how to shut them up.)"
set key[id=901101205000194] name "This is why you shouldn't work with amateurs.\nHow else? You defeat them, that's \
    how!"
set key[id=901101205000195] name "(Say the monsters did nothing wrong.)"
set key[id=901101205000196] name "Monsters are bad news from the start.\nEven without this, they're a waste of \
    space in the world!"
set key[id=901101205000197] name "You don't need to feel guilty.\nWhat's with you? Like you've never hunted a \
    monster before."
set key[id=901101205000198] name "You! What I told you is a secret.\nYou ran my errand, so you're as good as an \
    accomplice."
set key[id=901101205000199] name "Ugh, my whole body aches.\nDamn it, a bad feeling is never wrong."
set key[id=901101205000200] name "(Ask what happened.)"
set key[id=901101205000201] name "The Black Star Society guys showed up and asked where the bag was, out of \
    nowhere.\nI played dumb, and they suddenly started beating me.\nGeez, I think one of my teeth is loose, too."
set key[id=901101205000202] name "(Ask if he told them where the bag is.)"
set key[id=901101205000203] name "Are you crazy?\nIf I'd admitted I hid the bag, I wouldn't be standing \
    here.\nAnyway, somebody must have squealed. Wait, was it you?"
set key[id=901101205000204] name "No, never mind that. Right now I need to put some medicine on this.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000867[gender:0]$</font> should have some good medicine. He's really into herbs.\nI \
    can barely move, so you go for me."
set key[id=901101205000205] name "You're asking if my eyelids are swollen from the beating?\nGrr... my eyes have \
    always been this small!!"
set key[id=901101205000206] name "That $npc:11000211[gender:0]$ gets into trouble all the time.\nYou need medicine \
    for bruises? I don't have any on hand right now..."
set key[id=901101205000207] name "I could make the medicine right away, but I'm short on ingredients.\nI can't \
    leave the shop just now, so would you gather them for me?"
set key[id=901101205000208] name "(Say you will.)"
set key[id=901101205000209] name "Don't worry, they're not ingredients you have to travel far for.\nHave you ever \
    run into <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000161$</font> at $map:02000138$?"
set key[id=901101205000210] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000247$</font> is an essential ingredient for \
    the medicine.\nYou dry it well, then grind it fine... ha ha, never mind.\nI almost went on far too long."
set key[id=901101205000211] name "A nasty job like this should be done by $npc:11000211[gender:0]$..."
set key[id=901101205000212] name "You managed to find it. Ha ha ha."
set key[id=901101205000213] name "Oh, there's one more ingredient I'm missing.\nI need <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000248$</font>."
set key[id=901101205000214] name "I threw out the rotten apples from the shop display not long ago,\nso you should \
    find them easily if you search the trash cans nearby."
set key[id=901101205000215] name "With business so slow, quite a lot of fruit rots and gets thrown out.\nIt's a \
    shame."
set key[id=901101205000216] name "Studying herbs and making medicine to give to people\nis my hobby and my joy."
set key[id=901101205000217] name "If I told people what goes into the medicine, they'd all be reluctant to take \
    it.\nSo please don't tell anyone. Ha ha."
set key[id=901101205000218] name "Oh, and once the medicine is done, I'll take it to $npc:11000211[gender:0]$ \
    myself."
set key[id=901101205000227] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Lets out a big sigh)</font> Haaah..."
set key[id=901101205000228] name "(Ask why he's sighing.)"
set key[id=901101205000229] name "I'm worried the Rockefeller Tower we worked so hard to build will burn down in a \
    fire.\nNeedless to say, I'm worried about the workers' safety, too."
set key[id=901101205000230] name "You must have noticed the welding gas canisters scattered around \
    $map:02000136$\nas you passed through. "
set key[id=901101205000231] name "But at some point, $npc:21000282$ started swarming into $map:02000136$\nand \
    tossing bombs around without a care."
set key[id=901101205000232] name "If the fire ever spreads to those welding gas canisters...\nIt's terrifying just \
    to imagine. Plenty of the workers are on edge."
set key[id=901101205000233] name "If you, $MyPCName$, would drive off the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000282$</font>,\nthe workers here could finally sleep easy."
set key[id=901101205000234] name "What did the $npc:21000282$ come here for, anyway?"
set key[id=901101205000235] name "Did you hear the applause and cheering?\nThe workers here were watching you in \
    action, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=901101205000294] name "I'm going nuts, cluck! That ringing goes off at all hours, cluck.\nTelling those \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000280$</font> to keep it down does no good, cluck."
set key[id=901101205000295] name "And waking everyone up in the morning is our job,\nbut with the racket from \
    their clock alarms, nobody can even hear us, cluck."
set key[id=901101205000296] name "I wonder if everyone's started expecting those guys to wake them up every \
    morning.\nIt hurts my pride, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000297] name "I know!\nIf the clock springs stop winding, there's no way they can ring on \
    time, cluck.\nI want you to take the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000307$</font> they're carrying, cluck."
set key[id=901101205000298] name "Ring ring, ring ring... I swear I'm hearing things, cluck."
set key[id=901101205000299] name "I can't hear the ringing anymore, so I might actually survive, cluck!\nTomorrow \
    morning everyone will wake up to a proper cock-a-doodle-doo, cluck."
set key[id=901101205000300] name "I'm not the only one who can't hear it, right?\nYou can't hear it either, \
    right?"
set key[id=901101205000301] name "(Say you don't know what he's talking about.)"
set key[id=901101205000302] name "I should have wound the spring before the sound of the clock hands stopped.\nI \
    guess the clock isn't running anymore. Hee hee.\nThat was my impression of it just now... did it sound \
    similar?"
set key[id=901101205000303] name "(Ask how he can joke around when something bad has happened.)"
set key[id=901101205000304] name "Oh, right!\nSomeone came and took the key for winding the clock spring, I \
    think...\nIt's not here now, so that must be it. Hee hee."
set key[id=901101205000305] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Flinching)</font> Ask if he shouldn't get the key \
    back."
set key[id=901101205000306] name "You need the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000308$</font> for the clock hands \
    to run again.\nWhen you wander around $map:02000180$,\nif you spot a winding key lying on the ground, bring it \
    to me."
set key[id=901101205000307] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Imitates the clock alarm.)</font>\nRing ring, ring \
    ring~ How was that? Similar?"
set key[id=901101205000308] name "I'll hand the $item:30000308$ out to my friends, tick tock. Hee hee."
set key[id=901101205000309] name "That annoying ringing is back, cluck!\nThis is definitely not my imagination, \
    cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000310] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Hesitating)</font> Tell him what happened earlier."
set key[id=901101205000311] name "I thought of you as our benefactor for helping us, cluck.\nBut now I think of \
    you as a traitor, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000312] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Flustered)</font> Say you'll do whatever he wants."
set key[id=901101205000313] name "In that case, I want you to teach <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000280$</font> \
    a lesson, cluck.\nGive them a good scolding so they never ring their alarms\nat all hours of the morning \
    again."
set key[id=901101205000314] name "Hmph! I don't want to talk to a traitor until you do what I asked, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000315] name "The hallucinations are gone, cluck! I can't hear the ringing anymore!\nYou're \
    our benefactor again, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000316] name "Come to think of it, I don't need to keep $item:30000307$ myself, cluck.\nI \
    should get rid of it right away, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000317] name "I'd like you to help me just once more, cluck.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Climb to \
    the top of the tree beside me and throw the $item:30000307$ you took\nfar away,</font> and they won't be able \
    to find it easily, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000318] name "You came to see me before finishing the job, which makes me nervous, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000319] name "(Say you lost $item:30000330$.)"
set key[id=901101205000320] name "(Say you just came to see him.)"
set key[id=901101205000321] name "$item:30000330$ was lying on the ground, so I picked it up, cluck."
set key[id=901101205000322] name "I saw you put it in your bag a moment ago, cluck.\nI'm sure I remember right, \
    cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000323] name "I picked up what was on the ground, cluck.\nBut your bag is full, so I can't put \
    it in, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000324] name "I'm not interested in humans, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000325] name "Now I can relax, cluck.\nI can finally sleep in peace, cluck!"
set key[id=901101205000326] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Looks over, fidgeting.)</font> What do you want...?"
set key[id=901101205000327] name "(Ask what he's doing alone in the corner.)"
set key[id=901101205000328] name "I'm... just..."
set key[id=901101205000329] name "(Ask if there's anything you can help with.)"
set key[id=901101205000330] name "Can I ask you a favor?\nThen, um..."
set key[id=901101205000331] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Wait for the answer.)</font>"
set key[id=901101205000332] name "Everyone else is black, and I'm the only one with a different color.\nThe color \
    of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000309$</font> at $map:02000042$ looks a lot like my friends' color, \
    so..."
set key[id=901101205000333] name "Maybe if I eat $item:30000309$, I could get\nthe same color as my friends?"
set key[id=901101205000334] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Frustrating, but you wait.)</font>"
set key[id=901101205000335] name "Could you pick a little $item:30000309$ for me?\nBe careful when you pick it. It \
    crushes easily."
set key[id=901101205000336] name "Um... you don't have to grant my request.\nIf you're just making fun of me by \
    getting my hopes up, please stop..."
set key[id=901101205000337] name "You really brought $item:30000309$.\nWow~!"
set key[id=901101205000338] name "I'm going to try it right now!\nNom nom nom..."
set key[id=901101205000340] name "Blegh!"
set key[id=901101205000341] name "My stomach is churning. Cough... blegh..."
set key[id=901101205000342] name "Ugh... my stomach hurts, and my throat feels like it's on fire...\nUgh... if I \
    hold out... just a little longer, maybe I'll change."
set key[id=901101205000343] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Watch nervously.)</font>"
set key[id=901101205000344] name "Aaah... I can't stand it!!\nI have to drink some fairy water."
set key[id=901101205000345] name "(Ask where he left the fairy water.)"
set key[id=901101205000346] name "The flask I carry the fairy water in is green...\nand I can't stand looking at \
    green,\nso I just tossed it deep into the pond while fetching water."
set key[id=901101205000347] name "(Say you'll bring it.)"
set key[id=901101205000348] name "Blegh... hurry. Please hurry and bring me the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000310$</font>.\nThe pond is south of $map:02000042$, under the little waterfall."
set key[id=901101205000349] name "Please bring the $item:30000310$ quickly.\nI think I'm going to die."
set key[id=901101205000350] name "Uhhh...\nPl... please... hurry."
set key[id=901101205000351] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Gulp gulp)</font> Ugh..."
set key[id=901101205000353] name "Phew... I think I'll live now.\nMy stomach isn't churning anymore, and my throat \
    doesn't feel like it's burning."
set key[id=901101205000354] name "I really do feel better."
set key[id=901101205000355] name "Um...\nHave I changed yet?"
set key[id=901101205000356] name "(Tell him it's still the same.)"
set key[id=901101205000357] name "Oh... r-really?\nI'll have to think of another way."
set key[id=901101205000358] name "(Say there are friends with the same color as him at $map:02000043$.)"
set key[id=901101205000359] name "But this is where I live.\nI'll find a way to get used to living here."
set key[id=901101205000360] name "Oh my, come over here.\nIt's cramped, but we should get out of the rain."
set key[id=901101205000361] name "(Say the rain doesn't look like it will stop soon.)"
set key[id=901101205000362] name "You're right. This is trouble.\nThere are umbrellas at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000239$</font>,\nbut if I take my pack, I worry it'll get soaked, and if I leave it, \
    I worry it'll get stolen."
set key[id=901101205000363] name "On top of that, I lost my <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000311$</font>, so I'm \
    in a bind.\nI can't do anything, so I'm just standing here like this."
set key[id=901101205000364] name "(Ask where he lost the $item:30000311$.)"
set key[id=901101205000365] name "I dropped it at $map:02000042$, and a monster snatched it right up.\nI had to \
    keep my pack out of the rain, so I couldn't chase the monster."
set key[id=901101205000366] name "(Say you feel for him and will help.)"
set key[id=901101205000367] name "Then would you find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000311$</font> and bring \
    me some\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000312$</font> from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000239$</font>?\n$map:02000239$ is in the middle of $map:02000042$, so it shouldn't \
    be hard to find."
set key[id=901101205000368] name "You're helping me even in the rain. I don't know how to thank you."
set key[id=901101205000369] name "For now, I'll take shelter at $map:02000239$.\nThank you."
set key[id=901101205000384] name "Hello. The weather's lovely here, isn't it?\nIt's rare to find a place where you \
    can always see a rainbow.\nMaybe because of the weather, the corn in my vegetable patch grows up fast and \
    strong."
set key[id=901101205000385] name "It's not a lot, but it was plenty for me and my daughter to eat.\nBut lately the \
    monsters seem to have developed a taste for corn,\nand they raid it at all hours."
set key[id=901101205000386] name "I don't grow much to begin with, and there's hardly anything else to eat,\nso \
    things are really hard. Could you get back the\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000325$</font> the monsters \
    stole for my daughter and me?"
set key[id=901101205000387] name "What if they've already eaten it all?"
set key[id=901101205000388] name "Thankfully they haven't eaten much.\nThis should hold us over until the corn \
    grows back."
set key[id=901101205000389] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Gazes wide-eyed at the world beyond the \
    rainbow.)</font>"
set key[id=901101205000390] name "(Ask what he's doing.)"
set key[id=901101205000391] name "Oh? Hello.\nI was wondering what's on the other side of that rainbow."
set key[id=901101205000392] name "I keep wondering about it and wanting to go there.\nI think I could get there \
    fast by crossing the pond,\nbut Mom won't even let me near the pond."
set key[id=901101205000393] name "(Ask why he's curious about the other side of the rainbow.)"
set key[id=901101205000394] name "Why I'm curious... I don't know either.\nI think I'm even more curious because \
    Mom won't let me go."
set key[id=901101205000395] name "(Say you'll go in his place.)"
set key[id=901101205000396] name "Really? Would you really do that?\nThen when you get back, you have to tell me \
    what kind of place <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000305$</font> is!"
set key[id=901101205000397] name "Did you go?\nHuh? Not yet?"
set key[id=901101205000398] name "Did you go?\nWhat was there? Are there lots of trees there too? Or is it all \
    flower fields?"
set key[id=901101205000399] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Hesitating)</font> Say there was nothing there."
set key[id=901101205000400] name "Aw... there must be soil or grass... or at least some water."
set key[id=901101205000401] name "(Say there was only sand.)"
set key[id=901101205000402] name "I see... so it's not a pretty place.\nHee hee... thank you for telling me."
set key[id=901101205000403] name "Well, well, it was all lies!"
set key[id=901101205000404] name "(Ask what he means.)"
set key[id=901101205000405] name "Why are you acting like nothing's wrong?\nDidn't you come here because of the \
    rumor too?"
set key[id=901101205000406] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Tilts head.)</font>"
set key[id=901101205000407] name "You came here without knowing anything?\nThen there's no need for you to be \
    disappointed."
set key[id=901101205000408] name "There was a rumor that treasure overflows at the top of the beanstalk.\nEveryone \
    was afraid to climb it, so I came up myself.\nTruth is, I really wanted that treasure."
set key[id=901101205000409] name "But there's not a speck of treasure to be seen.\nIf I go back empty-handed, \
    nobody will believe I came here,\nand I don't much like feeling like I wasted the trip, either..."
set key[id=901101205000410] name "I'd better take something back, at least.\nLooking around, I took a liking to \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">that helmet $npc:21000201$ is wearing</font>.\nI bet it would fetch a decent price if \
    I sold it."
set key[id=901101205000411] name "How about it? Want to help me collect some <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000326$</font>?"
set key[id=901101205000412] name "Come on, put a little more effort into it."
set key[id=901101205000413] name "Yeah, that's plenty.\nToo many would be hard for me to carry alone, anyway."
set key[id=901101205000414] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(On the verge of tears)</font> What am I going to do \
    now?\nI can't go back to the company like this."
set key[id=901101205000415] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=901101205000416] name "I'm an intern at Cash Mart.\nCash Mart is expanding its business, so besides \
    Kerning City,\nwe're sending staff out all over."
set key[id=901101205000417] name "I came here to sell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000327$</font> to the \
    pirates.\nBut before I could even show them the goods, they went through my bag and pockets\nand cleaned me \
    out."
set key[id=901101205000418] name "If I go back to the company like this, I might get fired on the spot.\nAnd I \
    haven't even gotten my first paycheck yet."
set key[id=901101205000419] name "(Say you'll get his stolen goods back.)"
set key[id=901101205000420] name "Huh? Is that even possible?\nI don't think they'll hand it over quietly."
set key[id=901101205000421] name "(Say you plan to defeat the pirates.)"
set key[id=901101205000422] name "Wait a second... wouldn't that shrink our pool of potential customers?\nI don't \
    think that's a good approach."
set key[id=901101205000423] name "How about teaching them a lesson, just enough to hurt, and taking the goods \
    back?\nThen I could sell them medicine that heals wounds fast."
set key[id=901101205000424] name "(Say you'll just handle it your own way.)"
set key[id=901101205000425] name "No, well, as long as you get my stolen goods back...\nBut the pirates don't \
    think they took it on credit, do they?\nI really shouldn't hurt the customers' feelings for nothing."
set key[id=901101205000426] name "You're handling it properly, right?"
set key[id=901101205000427] name "Most of the stolen goods came back. What a relief.\nOf course, I'll have to \
    cover the shortfall out of my own pay. Sob."
set key[id=901101205000428] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Raising his voice)</font>\nHey! Keep it down over \
    there!\nI can't live with this racket!"
set key[id=901101205000429] name "(Ask who he's talking to.)"
set key[id=901101205000430] name "Those bony guys, and the ones around them.\nBecause of them, it's too noisy to \
    live in peace."
set key[id=901101205000431] name "Since we're on the subject, let me vent a little.\nBefore I came to see this \
    house, the real estate agent said\nit's on the beach with a great view and just the quiet sound of gentle \
    waves."
set key[id=901101205000432] name "He said there was no need to even go look, it was a sure thing. He seemed so \
    trustworthy.\nSo I stamped the contract."
set key[id=901101205000433] name "But when I got here, all I could see out the window was cliffs,\nand between \
    those guys yammering and the bombs going off,\nthere hasn't been one quiet day."
set key[id=901101205000434] name "You can only put up with it for so long. I can't take it anymore.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Can you teach those guys a lesson?</font>"
set key[id=901101205000435] name "You rascals! It's too loud!"
set key[id=901101205000436] name "Much better. It's definitely quieter now.\nIf I get someone to put a window \
    facing the sea soon, I could live here just fine."
set key[id=901101205000437] name "Phew, I finally made it.\nI'm out of breath from running all the way here,\nbut \
    seeing the rift with my own eyes makes the trip worthwhile. Ha ha."
set key[id=901101205000438] name "Why are you staring at me like that?\nAren't you thinking the same thing I \
    am?\nDidn't you come after hearing that <font color=\"#ffd200\">time has stopped in the Ludibrium \
    area</font>?"
set key[id=901101205000439] name "Time doesn't flow here,\nso I won't get any older or grow old!\nI can't get \
    younger, but not aging is enough for me."
set key[id=901101205000440] name "It's strange that no crowd has rushed in, though.\nNot just anyone would think \
    of this, would they?\nWell... I have been rather sharp since I was young. Heh heh."
set key[id=901101205000441] name "But there are far too many monsters here.\nThey've flocked here, so I guess \
    they're smarter than people. Heh heh.\nBut I can't stay safe like this. Get rid of them for me."
set key[id=901101205000442] name "Now I don't have to worry about wrinkles anymore, right?"
set key[id=901101205000443] name "It feels a lot more pleasant now.\nPeople might come flooding in, so I'd better \
    pick a spot and build a house quickly."
set key[id=901101205000444] name "Hoy hoy!!\nI'm a magical girl!"
set key[id=901101205000445] name "(Ask what she's doing.)"
set key[id=901101205000446] name "The monsters here were people once, they say.\nA wicked witch put a spell on \
    them. Poor things, right?"
set key[id=901101205000447] name "So I came to break the witch's spell.\nMe? I'm a magician, you know.\nOh, of \
    course I don't have a license or anything. Magicians never do."
set key[id=901101205000448] name "But... to break the spell, I have to gather the souls trapped in the \
    monsters.\nSo I went up close to a monster, and...\nAaah... they just attacked me."
set key[id=901101205000449] name "Maybe they're unhappy souls, so they're wary of strangers...\nthat's what I \
    thought, anyway."
set key[id=901101205000450] name "I think we'll have to overpower them and gather the souls.\nThere's no other way \
    to help them.\nYou look stronger than me, so I'm counting on you."
set key[id=901101205000451] name "I need to buy a magic wand. Where can I get one?\nMaybe at $map:02000209$?"
set key[id=901101205000452] name "Huh?? Huh???\nWhy are your hands empty?"
set key[id=901101205000453] name "(Say there were no trapped souls in the monsters.)"
set key[id=901101205000454] name "No wonder. If human souls were inside, they wouldn't have attacked me like \
    that...\nBut isn't this where the witch cast her spell??"
set key[id=901101205000455] name "I think I found the right place!"
set key[id=901101205000456] name "(Ask what she means.)"
set key[id=901101205000457] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21400746[gender:1]$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000047$</font>!\nThey must be hiding around here."
set key[id=901101205000458] name "(Ask who they are.)"
set key[id=901101205000459] name "$npc:23000047$ is <font color=\"#ffd200\">a beast that the Sages had sealed \
    away</font>.\nBut $npc:21400746[gender:1]$, who was driven out by the fairies for using black magic,\nawakened \
    that beast and made it her loyal hound."
set key[id=901101205000460] name "Many people were worried, but the two of them vanished and kept quiet.\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">(Lowering her voice)</font> The truth is, the reason I came here\nis that I found a clue \
    that the two are here."
set key[id=901101205000461] name "(Ask why she's looking for them.)"
set key[id=901101205000462] name "Isn't it a magician's calling to defeat the dark magician and the legendary \
    beast,\nseal their souls, and contribute to the peace of Maple World?"
set key[id=901101205000463] name "(Ask if she can do it.)"
set key[id=901101205000464] name "Um... well... I don't have my magic wand right now.\nI was in such a rush that I \
    forgot to buy one.\nWithout a magic wand, I can't use magic."
set key[id=901101205000465] name "So how about contributing to the peace of Maple World in my place?\nIf you wait \
    here quietly, $npc:23000047$ will show itself."
set key[id=901101205000466] name "You haven't seen $npc:23000047$ yet?"
set key[id=901101205000467] name "Impressive! You beat the legendary beast..."
set key[id=901101205000468] name "Don't look this way!\nTalk to me while looking somewhere else!"
set key[id=901101205000469] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=901101205000470] name "If my comrades find out I'm hiding here, they won't leave me alone.\nThey're \
    scary guys."
set key[id=901101205000471] name "(Ask who his comrades are.)"
set key[id=901101205000472] name "Ah, I can't even call them comrades anymore.\nThose pirates over there. Truth \
    is, until a moment ago I was a pirate too.\nThey probably still treat me like one."
set key[id=901101205000473] name "I thought being a pirate meant being surrounded by tasty food, pretty \
    women,\nand all kinds of loot.\nInstead I hauled cargo every day, and whenever we went out raiding, there were \
    wounded everywhere."
set key[id=901101205000474] name "It got so hard I just couldn't be a pirate anymore.\nWhen I said I wanted to \
    leave the crew, they said I couldn't go\nunless I paid for the food and bed they'd given me."
set key[id=901101205000475] name "What a swindle! Of all the scams!\nSo now I'm running for my life, trying to get \
    off this island."
set key[id=901101205000476] name "Those pirates over there make it hard to escape.\nIf you took them out, my \
    escape would go a lot smoother."
set key[id=901101205000477] name "That one, that one over there.\nThat guy is especially vicious. He picks a fight \
    if you so much as make eye contact."
set key[id=901101205000478] name "All right! I have to run before the others get here.\nI won't say thanks. \
    They're bad guys anyway, so you just did a good deed."
set key[id=901101205000479] name "Meeting a stranger in a place like this makes me hope\nyou won't get in my way \
    more than it makes me glad to see you."
set key[id=901101205000480] name "(Say you'll get out of his way.)"
set key[id=901101205000481] name "No, there's no need for you to leave right away.\nIt's too much for me to handle \
    alone, and I could use more hands."
set key[id=901101205000482] name "(Ask what he needs help with.)"
set key[id=901101205000483] name "I came here as a member of $map:02000068$.\nI'm carrying out a secret \
    mission.\nSo I can't tell you the details."
set key[id=901101205000484] name "Let me tell you what you have to do.\nI'll give you a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">bag with filming equipment</font>. Take it and\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">set up the filming \
    equipment</font> around $map:02000183$."
set key[id=901101205000485] name "What brings you back?\nI can't answer anything about the secret mission."
set key[id=901101205000486] name "(Say you lost $item:30000364$.)"
set key[id=901101205000487] name "I'm just passing by."
set key[id=901101205000488] name "You left $item:30000364$ behind, so I picked it up."
set key[id=901101205000489] name "Didn't you stuff it in your bag a moment ago?"
set key[id=901101205000490] name "I picked up what fell on the ground,\nbut your bag is full, so I can't put it in \
    for you."
set key[id=901101205000491] name "Ah... yes."
set key[id=901101205000492] name "You finished the mission faster than I expected.\nYou passed the test. Now I can \
    give you other missions."
set key[id=901101205000493] name "(Look bewildered.)"
set key[id=901101205000494] name "Of course you're puzzled.\nThink of it all as part of the process of joining the \
    secret mission."
set key[id=901101205000495] name "Setting up the filming equipment to record what happens here is important,\nbut \
    my real mission is..."
set key[id=901101205000496] name "to collect the planks that washed up and lie scattered on the sand.\nWhy do we \
    need those planks, you ask?"
set key[id=901101205000497] name "Please don't ask for details. Just help me pick up planks.\nWe can't pass up \
    even one plank in a hidden spot."
set key[id=901101205000498] name "My back isn't good, so it's hard for me to pick up planks from the ground."
set key[id=901101205000499] name "I hope the plank I'm looking for is among these.\nPlease remember that what you \
    did today was a secret mission."
set key[id=901101205000500] name "Who's there? Who's talking to me? Are you a monster?\nWait a moment. Let me look \
    through the keyhole."
set key[id=901101205000501] name "I don't recognize you.\nThere must be monsters all around, and you're so \
    relaxed?"
set key[id=901101205000502] name "(Ask what she's doing inside.)"
set key[id=901101205000503] name "Ugh, hey! I'm going crazy cooped up in here too.\nIt's not just a day or two, \
    being locked in here. What a mess.\nAnd there's nobody to wait on me."
set key[id=901101205000504] name "(Tell her to come out if she's so cramped.)"
set key[id=901101205000505] name "Oh my, how could I go out there? The monsters would pounce the moment I stepped \
    out.\nThey've got terrible tempers.\nIf it weren't for that old woman..."
set key[id=901101205000506] name "An old woman came by and proposed a bet.\nAnd when I lost, she cast a spell on \
    everyone in the castle\nand turned everyone but me into monsters."
set key[id=901101205000507] name "(Ask if there's a way to break the spell.)"
set key[id=901101205000508] name "She did tell me on her way out.\nGather fresh roses from the garden, make a \
    wreath, and put it on a monster's head."
set key[id=901101205000509] name "(Ask if she tried it.)"
set key[id=901101205000510] name "Are you crazy? The monsters stop me from even walking in the garden or looking \
    at the roses.\nWhy should I make wreaths for them?\nWhat if I got pricked by a rose thorn... shudder."
set key[id=901101205000511] name "I don't know, I can't stand being cooped up.\nSo I can go outside, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">get rid of those monsters</font>."
set key[id=901101205000512] name "I can still hear the monsters outside."
set key[id=901101205000513] name "Can I go out now?\nThe monsters' noise has died down. Good work."
set key[id=901101205000514] name "Aaargh!!! I want something!\nHow am I supposed to get it!"
set key[id=901101205000515] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=901101205000516] name "This new spell I'm learning... if I master it easily,\nI can summon monsters \
    whenever I like!"
set key[id=901101205000517] name "But that spell is anything but easy to learn.\nIf I just had the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000366$</font> that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22090007$</font> carries,\nI could \
    learn it easily..."
set key[id=901101205000518] name "Have you heard that granting a witch's wish brings nothing but good fortune?\nSo \
    what do you say? Won't you get me the $item:30000366$?"
set key[id=901101205000519] name "I'll burst from frustration before I die of old age waiting!"
set key[id=901101205000520] name "Ooh! You're finally here!\nNow I can finish the summoning spell in no time!"
set key[id=901101205000521] name "It can't be helped.\nWe can't have anyone losing their life."
set key[id=901101205000522] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=901101205000523] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000038$ is thick with trees</font>, so lots of \
    woodcutters go there.\nBut monsters, especially <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000024$</font>, make it \
    dangerous, and accidents are frequent."
set key[id=901101205000524] name "The woodcutters often demanded that we send the vigilantes\nto take out the \
    $npc:22000024$. But public opinion says we have to\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">protect the forest of \
    $map:02000038$</font>, so I couldn't simply give in to their demands."
set key[id=901101205000525] name "Sending the vigilantes after the $npc:22000024$\nwould amount to approving the \
    woodcutters logging there."
set key[id=901101205000526] name "But what can I do when the woodcutters won't stop logging there?\nAnd what if \
    someone loses their life to the $npc:22000024$?"
set key[id=901101205000527] name "So how about you defeat the $npc:22000024$?\nAnd don't tell anyone I put you up \
    to it."
set key[id=901101205000528] name "The $npc:22000024$ doesn't always show itself.\nIf you wait, it's sure to \
    appear."
set key[id=901101205000529] name "Now all that's left is persuading the woodcutters to stop logging there.\nWe got \
    rid of the $npc:22000024$, but we still have to protect the trees and the forest."
set key[id=901101205000530] name "I can't concentrate with all this noise.\nBeautiful music can sharpen your \
    focus.\nBut the sound they make is nothing but noise!"
set key[id=901101205000531] name "This is hopeless. At this rate I can't do my research.\nFrom <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000169$, $npc:21000172$ and $npc:21000174$</font>,\ntake away the instruments they \
    have."
set key[id=901101205000532] name "I wondered whether I'm too sensitive.\nNo matter how I think about it, I'm \
    normal."
set key[id=901101205000533] name "It's quieter now.\nThanks to you, I can throw myself into my research."
set key[id=901101205000534] name "Hmm...\n...\nSigh... "
set key[id=901101205000535] name "(Ask why he's sighing.)"
set key[id=901101205000536] name "I was thinking about the good old days.\nThey can't be experienced again... \
    they're only memories now."
set key[id=901101205000537] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=901101205000538] name "There used to be a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000184$ tour train packed with \
    children</font>\nrunning on the tracks in front of me. All the kids laughing and chattering..."
set key[id=901101205000539] name "Now no children come here, so the train was scrapped, too.\nI don't really know \
    why the children stopped coming.\nI come out here every day out of habit, but it's been a long time since I \
    saw a child."
set key[id=901101205000540] name "Well... it's <font color=\"#ffd200\">crawling with monsters and \
    dangerous</font>, so what child would come smiling?\nCome to think of it... could the monsters be the reason \
    things turned out this way?\nIf the monsters disappear, will the children come back?"
set key[id=901101205000541] name "Let me ask you a favor.\nLet's drive the monsters out of here.\nThen let's watch \
    the children come back."
set key[id=901101205000542] name "Now that I think about it, they're really awful.\nThose monsters practically \
    drove the children away."
set key[id=901101205000543] name "Now I see, the monsters at least kept this place from feeling empty.\nNo, wait. \
    The children will fill that spot now, won't they?"
set key[id=901101205000544] name "Welcome!\nWe welcome everyone who comes here! Ha ha!"
set key[id=901101205000545] name "We've prepared a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift box</font> for everyone who comes \
    here.\nLook for the gift boxes placed all around $map:02000184$.\nDon't fall over backwards when you see the \
    gift. Ha ha."
set key[id=901101205000546] name "We don't give gifts to just a few people by first-come or lottery.\nEveryone who \
    comes here has a chance."
set key[id=901101205000547] name "Did you open a gift box? Ha ha.\nHow did you like the surprise gift?"
set key[id=901101205000548] name "(Ask how that counts as a gift.)"
set key[id=901101205000549] name "Oh, come on, don't be angry with me.\nEven when you're angry, let's calm down \
    with a smile! Ha ha."
set key[id=901101205000550] name "Have you been to $map:02000184$? And $map:02000255$?\nDidn't it feel strange?"
set key[id=901101205000551] name "(Ask what felt strange.)"
set key[id=901101205000552] name "Didn't $map:02000184$ seem to be inside the past?\nWhereas this place is a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">space of the future</font>.\nClearly, the Ludibrium area right now doesn't have just one \
    time period."
set key[id=901101205000553] name "(Ask why she thinks so.)"
set key[id=901101205000554] name "Heh, I'm traveling through time, and this place resembles where I first \
    lived.\nI tried to travel far into the past, but it seems I moved to a nearby time..."
set key[id=901101205000555] name "You can find out by examining the robots here.\nWhether they were made in the \
    time period I meant to travel to,\nthat is, the one you've lived in."
set key[id=901101205000556] name "Could you get me a memory chip from the robots here?\nWith it, I can work out \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">when the robots were made</font>."
set key[id=901101205000557] name "Fascinating. I wonder what time period the other areas have turned into."
set key[id=901101205000558] name "If I analyze the memory chip, I can settle my curiosity.\nI can't analyze it \
    here right now, so I can't tell you the result..."
set key[id=901101205000559] name "When we meet again later, I'll tell you the result.\nHeh heh."
set key[id=901101205000560] name "Are you here to enjoy the show?\nYou can wait in front of the stage."
set key[id=901101205000561] name "(Say you're not interested in the show.)"
set key[id=901101205000562] name "Oh, is that so? Please keep your voice down when you say that.\nThe band members \
    might be offended if they hear."
set key[id=901101205000563] name "Then could you possibly help us?\nThe show starts soon...\nand I'm worried \
    because <font color=\"#ffd200\">the venue isn't ready yet</font>."
set key[id=901101205000564] name "Other things aside, safety is my responsibility,\nso I have to take care of it, \
    but I can't manage it alone."
set key[id=901101205000565] name "(Ask what you can help with.)"
set key[id=901101205000566] name "Monsters stole the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000372$</font> that were to \
    be set up in front of the venue\nto keep the audience from getting onto the stage.\nPlease get them back and \
    set them up in front of the stage."
set key[id=901101205000567] name "At every show, there are one or two audience members\nwho climb onto the stage \
    and disrupt the performance."
set key[id=901101205000568] name "It was hard enough guarding the band members on my own.\nThank you for your \
    help."
set key[id=901101205000569] name "Wow~ I can't breathe, it's so good."
set key[id=901101205000570] name "Why do you say that?"
set key[id=901101205000571] name "It's so good... hee hee hee.\nThis must be the greatest paradise on earth.\nIt's \
    all food. I can eat whatever my hand lands on."
set key[id=901101205000572] name "Oh, it's been a while since I've seen you.\nYou're the one who got me \
    $item:20000013$ last time, right?\nHee hee, would you help me again this time, like before?"
set key[id=901101205000573] name "I want to eat the candy-looking trees here\nand soak in the sweet-smelling \
    pond,\nbut the monsters keep getting in the way."
set key[id=901101205000574] name "It's agony, with all this food right in front of me and I can't eat it.\nPlease \
    defeat the monsters."
set key[id=901101205000575] name "My stomach keeps rumbling..."
set key[id=901101205000576] name "Now I can eat as much as I want with no interruptions.\nThanks for helping me \
    again this time."
set key[id=901101205000577] name "Everything I see right now is exactly like what I saw in my dream.\nAm I still \
    dreaming? Could you pinch me?"
set key[id=901101205000578] name "(Say you'll pinch her.)"
set key[id=901101205000579] name "Oh my! You're really going to do it just because I said so?\nNever mind. It was \
    just a figure of speech."
set key[id=901101205000580] name "There is one thing different from my dream, though.\nThere were no ugly monsters \
    like those in my dream."
set key[id=901101205000581] name "Monsters like that would never show up in the dream of someone who only thinks \
    pretty thoughts like me.\nIf they did, it would be a nightmare."
set key[id=901101205000582] name "Honestly, seeing monsters in such a pretty, lovely place\nis unbearable. Could \
    you drive the monsters away?"
set key[id=901101205000583] name "Should I put a strawberry on the cake?\nOr a cherry?"
set key[id=901101205000584] name "See! With the monsters gone,\nthis place looks so much lovelier."
set key[id=901101205000585] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Clutching her head in distress.)</font>\nWhat do I \
    do..."
set key[id=901101205000586] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=901101205000587] name "You may not believe it, but I came from the future.\nI'm on a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">time trip</font>. But by mistake..."
set key[id=901101205000588] name "I was being chased by monsters where I was before,\nand when I tried to time \
    travel, the monsters chasing me came here too."
set key[id=901101205000589] name "So... those monsters shouldn't be here.\nIt pains me to think I'm going to cause \
    trouble here."
set key[id=901101205000590] name "(Say you'll defeat the monsters before problems arise.)"
set key[id=901101205000591] name "Would you?\nThat would put my mind at ease."
set key[id=901101205000592] name "How did the monsters end up traveling along with me..."
set key[id=901101205000593] name "Wonderful!\nI can finally put this burden down!"
set key[id=901101205000594] name "Tch, are you a new worker at the construction site?"
set key[id=901101205000595] name "(Say no, and ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=901101205000596] name "Since the construction site went up in the $map:02000051$ area,\nthey've cut \
    down trees, smashed rocks, and carved up the cliffs."
set key[id=901101205000597] name "Trees are alive and rocks breathe...\nNature isn't something we can just meddle \
    with however we like."
set key[id=901101205000598] name "So the people of the $map:02000051$ area went to the construction site to \
    protest.\nAnd the site sent the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Jawbreaker Gang</font> to beat them up and drive them \
    off."
set key[id=901101205000599] name "I have a favor to ask.\nI could do it myself once I grow bigger... but I can't \
    wait that long,\nso please drive the Jawbreaker Gang out of the village for me."
set key[id=901101205000600] name "Those Jawbreaker Gang jerks, acting so high and mighty just because they're \
    strong...\nI really can't stand the sight of them."
set key[id=901101205000601] name "Serves you right, Jawbreaker Gang. Hee hee.\nBut even with the Jawbreaker Gang \
    gone, the construction will go on, won't it?"
set key[id=901101205000602] name "They might even send stronger guys.\nStill, I'll keep standing firm and protect \
    $map:02000051$."
set key[id=901101205000603] name "It happened again, something that should never happen! After all the work I put \
    into those petitions...\nI went all around the $map:02000051$ area and even persuaded people of other \
    tribes\nto get them."
set key[id=901101205000604] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=901101205000605] name "Do you know about <font color=\"#ffd200\">Ten, the warrior from the Kaka \
    tribe</font>?\nYou must know what a great hero he is, right?"
set key[id=901101205000606] name "He lost his life fighting the Demon King...\nDo you know how he was treated \
    after death?"
set key[id=901101205000607] name "The other three heroes are honored as guardians of the Lapenta.\nBut Ten? He \
    only got a single monument!"
set key[id=901101205000608] name "I think Ten deserves better than that.\nSo I'm going to ask \
    $npc:11000075[gender:1]$ to build\na memorial park for Ten."
set key[id=901101205000609] name "But I lost every one of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000373$</font>\nI \
    was going to give to $npc:11000075[gender:1]$."
set key[id=901101205000610] name "I set them down on the ground for a moment, and the wind blew them into the \
    monsters' hands.\nWhy did I do that? I should have put a stone on top of the petitions..."
set key[id=901101205000611] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=901101205000612] name "Really? You'll get back what <font color=\"#ffd200\">the monsters \
    took</font>?\nThank you. I'm already tearing up."
set key[id=901101205000613] name "It's fine if the petitions have dirt on them.\nAs long as the writing is \
    legible."
set key[id=901101205000614] name "Yes, those are the $item:30000373$ I lost!\nSee my eyes are watering? I'm so \
    moved. Thank you so much."
set key[id=901101205000615] name "Huh? Wh-what? You were about to sit on me just now, weren't you?\nHey, don't \
    look down on me."
set key[id=901101205000616] name "I'll have you know...\nI'm the rock where <font color=\"#ffd200\">the legendary \
    hero 'Ten'</font> sat down to rest."
set key[id=901101205000617] name "Hmph! Do you think rocks that Ten's backside touched are common?\nDon't compare \
    me to those run-of-the-mill rocks."
set key[id=901101205000618] name "So ever since Ten sat on me,\nthe only one allowed to sit on me and rest is Ten! \
    "
set key[id=901101205000619] name "Ugh, honestly, you said you wouldn't, but\nso many people sit on me or kick me."
set key[id=901101205000620] name "Especially monsters! They kick me every time they pass by.\nWhy don't you teach \
    them a lesson?\nThen I'll let you sit on me once."
set key[id=901101205000621] name "Don't even think about sitting yet!"
set key[id=901101205000622] name "Ha ha ha, I saw. I saw it all! You teaching those monsters a lesson.\nI feel so \
    much better."
set key[id=901101205000623] name "Shh! You were just about to say <font color=\"#ffd200\">Foremagasi</font>, \
    weren't you?\nThat's a word you must never say carelessly."
set key[id=901101205000624] name "(Ask what he's talking about.)"
set key[id=901101205000625] name "Don't you know the Foremagasi tribe vanished after the Mountain Hag cursed \
    them?\nAnd you were going to say Foremagasi, Foremagasi, knowing that?"
set key[id=901101205000626] name "(Say you still don't know what he means.)"
set key[id=901101205000627] name "You see, I'm the only survivor of the Foremagasi tribe.\nTo avoid being found \
    out, I deliberately ate the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yakayama fruit</font>.\nEating it makes you age early."
set key[id=901101205000628] name "Now nobody recognizes me, so eating the Yakayama fruit was a good move.\nBut I \
    didn't know it had side effects. My body itches all the time."
set key[id=901101205000629] name "(Tell him to wash up.)"
set key[id=901101205000630] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Flaring up)</font> Are you trying to say I'm \
    dirty?\nCome now, I'm doing my best to keep clean."
set key[id=901101205000631] name "Anyway, if you rub the itchy spots with <font color=\"#ffd200\">the mane of the \
    $npc:21000111$</font>,\nthe itching vanishes completely.\nSo go and fetch me some <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000374$</font>."
set key[id=901101205000632] name "I can't reach... I want to scratch my back..."
set key[id=901101205000633] name "Hand it over quickly.\nI've suffered a long time holding in this itch."
set key[id=901101205000634] name "I'm in the middle of training.\n$map:02000097$, the place closest to the \
    sky,\nis the ideal spot for it."
set key[id=901101205000635] name "Oh dear, I made a mistake.\nI don't speak with anyone who isn't a martial \
    artist."
set key[id=901101205000636] name "If you want to talk to me, prove your skill.\nIf you can defeat the monsters \
    here, I'll acknowledge you."
set key[id=901101205000637] name "I'll be watching you from right here."
set key[id=901101205000638] name "Impressive! I underestimated you.\nI'll hear you out anytime."
set key[id=901101205000639] name "Ugh, my back.\nThis should be enough."
set key[id=901101205000640] name "(Ask what she did.)"
set key[id=901101205000641] name "You see the paintings on display outside?\nI put the children's paintings in \
    frames\nor set them on easels for the exhibit."
set key[id=901101205000642] name "But monsters keep coming and turning the frames crooked\nor knocking over the \
    easels. Hmph, it's so upsetting."
set key[id=901101205000643] name "At first I put up with the bother, straightening frames and setting easels \
    upright\nwithout a word, but now I'm starting to get irritated."
set key[id=901101205000644] name "Could you teach the monsters a lesson so they stop making mischief?"
set key[id=901101205000645] name "Why do monsters only do such spiteful things?"
set key[id=901101205000646] name "The monsters have come to their senses and won't touch the paintings now, \
    right?\nThank you for helping."
set key[id=901101205000647] name "If I press this...\nIf I press that...\nWhat?!? Nothing's changing at all!"
set key[id=901101205000648] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=901101205000649] name "I was told that if you operate the biggest computer in $map:02000265$,\nthe \
    robots here stop moving."
set key[id=901101205000650] name "(Ask where and from whom he heard that.)"
set key[id=901101205000651] name "Well, you see... I was unloading cargo at $map:2000139$...\nand the porters told \
    me, laughing...\nthat if I wanted to make big money, I should give it a try..."
set key[id=901101205000652] name "(Tell him it sounds like he was tricked.)"
set key[id=901101205000653] name "Ugh, and after all the taxi fare it cost to get here...\nPlus I lost a day's \
    wages..."
set key[id=901101205000654] name "(Ask what he planned to do once the robots stopped.)"
set key[id=901101205000655] name "The robots here are standard maid robots,\nbut because of some virus or other, \
    they've gained an attack instinct.\nAnd being altered like that made them attractive to bad guys."
set key[id=901101205000656] name "That's why the memory chips in the robots apparently sell for a high price on \
    the black market.\nOh, this part is true."
set key[id=901101205000657] name "(Say you'll get the memory chips.)"
set key[id=901101205000658] name "Really? How will you do it?\nDon't tell me, straight from them? Ooh! \
    Exciting!\nI'll just stay here and watch."
set key[id=901101205000659] name "Ah, if I were good at fighting, I'd get the memory chips myself..."
set key[id=901101205000660] name "This is what they call having your cake and eating it too, right?\nHeh heh... \
    now all I have to do is sell this at the black market!"
set key[id=901101205000661] name "Eeeek~~~!!!\nMy wallet! My wallet... it's gone!"
set key[id=901101205000662] name "Those guys... there were robots lurking around me earlier.\nThey must have \
    picked my pocket!"
set key[id=901101205000663] name "(Tell her to report it to the police.)"
set key[id=901101205000664] name "The police? N-no, I can't.\nThey'd grill me about why I came here and what was \
    in the wallet.\nI don't want to go through that hassle!"
set key[id=901101205000665] name "(Say you'll find it for her, then.)"
set key[id=901101205000666] name "Hearing that calms me down a little.\nThere's quite a lot of cash in that \
    wallet. I have a use for it...\nBut don't think I won't notice if you take a few bills."
set key[id=901101205000667] name "Haven't you found it yet?\nWell, there's no telling which of those guys is the \
    culprit..."
set key[id=901101205000668] name "That's it! My wallet!\nLet me check whether anything is missing... hmm..."
set key[id=901101205000669] name "Thankfully nothing is missing.\nThank you."
set key[id=914223505000735] name "What an absurd thing to happen!\nFor decades, every morning I've collected fresh \
    eggs from the hens\nfor my breakfast."
set key[id=914223505000736] name "But this morning I went to the coop and the hens were all gone.\nNaturally there \
    were no eggs either."
set key[id=914223505000737] name "Startled, I searched every corner of $map:02000087$,\nand what do you know, \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Monkey's gang had kidnapped the hens and locked them in a cage.</font>\nAnd there was \
    a huge snail I've never seen or heard of with Monkey's gang."
set key[id=914223505000738] name "I was so startled I stepped back and landed on my backside.\nSitting on the \
    ground watching them,\nMonkey's gang were bowing and scraping to that huge snail..."
set key[id=914223505000739] name "But that snail didn't even look at Monkey's guys. It just stared blankly.\nI've \
    gone on at length after seeing such a strange sight."
set key[id=914223505000740] name "The way Monkey's gang is boiling water in the cauldron, I think they mean to \
    cook the hens.\nI can't bear to imagine my beloved hens ending up as their ingredients.\nPlease teach them a \
    lesson and <font color=\"#ffd200\">rescue the hens.</font>"
set key[id=914223505000741] name "We don't have time to stand around like this.\nWe have to save the hens before \
    the water comes to a boil."
set key[id=914223505000742] name "Now we just wait for the hens to come back and lay eggs every morning.\nThank \
    you. Ha ha."
set key[id=914223505000743] name "Since I turned twenty, I've worked as the keeper of $map:02000087$ without a \
    care,\nand only at this age do I have something to worry about."
set key[id=914223505000744] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=914223505000745] name "Would you believe it, <font color=\"#ffd200\">those Monkey guys stole my hens \
    again!</font>\nI went to the coop to check on the hens that had come back, and they were gone again."
set key[id=914223505000746] name "When I went to where Monkey's gang is, my hens were locked in a cage.\nThose \
    Monkey guys were singing, offering a delicious chicken dish."
set key[id=914223505000747] name "Yet that huge snail doesn't seem interested in the dish at all.\nCould you help \
    the hens get back to me safely this time too?"
set key[id=914223505000748] name "The huge snail may be remarkable, but there's no need to bow and scrape to it."
set key[id=914223505000749] name "All the hens found their way home.\nThank you!"
set key[id=916022405000795] name "Now, look around. Isn't it magnificent?\nLook at the walls around it. They're \
    not just stacked high.\nThey've kept their balance and harmony."
set key[id=916022405000796] name "And it's not just the walls. The town's form has been kept intact too,\nso a \
    place like this must be preserved so it isn't damaged further!"
set key[id=916022405000797] name "I want to run to $map:02000001$ right now and tell my colleagues\nthat a place \
    like this exists!\nThat's it! I'll ask $npc:11000075[gender:1]$ to draw up a preservation policy!"
set key[id=916022405000798] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Looks into the distance)</font> No, those \
    rascals!\nSmashing ruins that should be handled carefully as if it were nothing!"
set key[id=916022405000799] name "This won't do. I have to get rid of them before the ruins are damaged \
    further.\nWon't you help me?"
set key[id=916022405000800] name "Even with damage here and there, it's a miracle it's this well preserved.\nWe \
    have to come up with measures before it's damaged more."
set key[id=916022405000801] name "While you were getting rid of the monsters, I looked around a bit more,\nand \
    there's an entrance leading to the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=916022405000802] name "Oh no, what now? Monsters will keep flooding in from there.\nThis is bad. Very \
    bad!"
set key[id=916022405000867] name "You won't meet veteran weapon collectors like me every day, so you're \
    lucky.\nWhen I collect weapons, I have my own strict standards."
set key[id=916022405000868] name "Take this fortress, for example. It was probably guarded by soldiers once,\nbut \
    now there isn't a trace of soldiers or anyone else."
set key[id=916022405000869] name "Say the soldiers ran away! What about the weapons they used?\nHeh heh heh, \
    they'd still be sitting right here in the fortress."
set key[id=916022405000870] name "What I mean is! I never haggle over goods.\nWhy would I pay good mesos for \
    weapons?"
set key[id=916022405000871] name "Of course, there are some concerns. These are unmaintained weapons,\nso they \
    might not work properly."
set key[id=916022405000872] name "I'll look into where the armory is, so you <font color=\"#ffd200\">find out \
    whether the cannons work\nand bring me a few $item:30000396$.</font>"
set key[id=916022405000873] name "You won't get so startled during the test fire that you fall over backwards, \
    will you? Heh heh heh.\nIt might be loud, so don't be too shocked."
set key[id=916022405000874] name "It's quiet. How did the test fire go?"
set key[id=916022405000875] name "(Say the old cannon doesn't work.)"
set key[id=916022405000876] name "I figured. I'd better check whether this $item:30000396$ goes off properly too."
set key[id=1104231311004474] name "Oh, p-please, help me. Please...! "
set key[id=1104231311004475] name "(Ask what's wrong.)"
set key[id=1104231311004476] name "Please defeat those scary things blocking the road.\nI have to get back to \
    town... but I can't because of them. "
set key[id=1104231311004477] name "(Ask if they mean <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:21000001$</font>.)"
set key[id=1104231311004478] name "Y-yes! That's them!\nThose awful polka-dot tattoos, those leaves waving around \
    so violently...!\nP-please drive those terrifying things away from here! "
set key[id=1104231311004479] name "P-please drive those terrifying $npc:21000001$ away from here! "
set key[id=1104231311004480] name "Oh! You really beat them... You're strong.\nMay I ask your name?"
set key[id=1104231311004481] name "(Tell them your name and job.)"
set key[id=1104231311004482] name "So you're $MyPCName$.\nI thought I was done for and would have to pack my bags \
    this time... You saved me.\nOh, I'm called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001838[gender:0]$</font>. "
set key[id=1104231311004483] name "(Probationary...?)"
set key[id=1104231311004484] name "Oh, yes. I got a failing score on the Royal Guard recruit training camp \
    entrance exam.\nBut they said if I do well escorting the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Amherst transport \
    ship</font>, I'd get a chance to re-enlist,\nso I fought off my seasickness and came all the way here."
set key[id=1104231311004485] name "As soon as I arrived I went to see the village chief, hoping it would help my \
    evaluation.\nI said I'd do anything to help, and he gave me a job.\nWhile doing it, I ran into those scary \
    things. Phew, I nearly died of fright. "
set key[id=1104231311004486] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Can someone afraid of mushrooms really become a Royal \
    Guard soldier...?)</font>"
set key[id=1104231311004487] name "Thanks to you, I think I can complete my mission safely.\nThank you so much, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1104231311004488] name "Um... $MyPCName$. As thanks, I'd like to give you a gift.\nWould you accept it? \
    "
set key[id=1104231311004489] name "(Gladly accept.)"
set key[id=1104231311004490] name "(Say a gift isn't necessary.)"
set key[id=1104231311004491] name "Really?! I'm so happy.\nIt's a pretty hot item in $map:02000001$, if I do say \
    so myself."
set key[id=1104231311004492] name "Please don't refuse, I beg you, take it.\nI'm just so grateful...!"
set key[id=1104231311004493] name "It's a pretty hot item in $map:02000001$, if I do say so myself!"
set key[id=1104231311004494] name "I put my gift in $MyPCName$'s bag.\nWell? Not bad, is it?"
set key[id=1104231311004495] name "(Ask how to check your bag.)"
set key[id=1104231311004496] name "The c-color..."
set key[id=1104231311004497] name "If you press the <font color=\"#ffd200\">I</font> key, you can check your <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">inventory</font>.\nI bought it to use myself, actually... but it's brand new, never worn \
    once.\nThere's a rule that I can only use Royal Guard supplies, you see."
set key[id=1104231311004498] name "Please make good use of it, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1104231311004499] name "Yes! It suits $MyPCName$ really well, doesn't it? Ha ha!\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">(This person... doesn't seem very perceptive...)</font>"
set key[id=1104231311004500] name "Is there anything I can help you with? \nI may not be much of a fighter, but \
    I'm a \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">kind Royal Guardsman</font> who's good at helping people!"
set key[id=1104231311004501] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(I don't quite trust him, but...)</font> Do you know \
    how to get to $map:02000001$?"
set key[id=1104231311004502] name "To get to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>, you first have to take \
    a <font color=\"#ffd200\">ship</font> from $map:63000001$ \nto <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000062$</font>... but I hear the small boats aren't sailing\nbecause of the storms \
    that hit the sea lately."
set key[id=1104231311004503] name "Of course, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">ship for the Levee congratulatory \
    envoy</font> is very large, so no need\nto worry about that.\n...Ah! You can take that ship! It's due to sail \
    very soon, too."
set key[id=1104231311004504] name "(Ask how to get on that ship.)"
set key[id=1104231311004505] name "Why not go meet $npcName:11000052[gender:0]$ and ask? \nHe's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">chief of Amherst</font> and leads the Levee congratulatory envoy.\nThe chief lives in the \
    house with the orange roof in the middle of $map:63000001$."
set key[id=1104231311004506] name "Follow the road behind me and you can reach $map:63000001$."
set key[id=1104231311004507] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Chief $npcName:11000052[gender:0]$</font> lives in the \
    house with the \norange roof in the middle of $map:63000001$."
set key[id=1104231311004508] name "Hm? You look like someone I've never seen before..."
set key[id=1104231311004509] name "(Ask if he is $npcName:11000052[gender:0]$, the \
    $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004510] name "I am. What is it?"
set key[id=1104231311004511] name "(Say you want to take a ship.)"
set key[id=1104231311004512] name "(Compliment him on his good looks.)"
set key[id=1104231311004513] name "The sea is so rough these days with all the storms, and this fellow... \nCould \
    it be that you want to go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>?"
set key[id=1104231311004514] name "Ha ha ha! You have an eye for people!\nDo you need something from me? "
set key[id=1104231311004515] name "(Say you want to take the ship to $map:02000001$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004516] name "So you had an angle when you flattered me, did you...?  \n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">(The $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$'s face stiffened!)</font>"
set key[id=1104231311004517] name "I don't know why you want to go to $map:02000001$, but\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">the Levee congratulatory envoy's ship</font> is no sightseeing cruise.\nIt carries people \
    with a weighty duty: to make our $map:63000001$\nwidely known to the many people attending the Levee!"
set key[id=1104231311004518] name "You can't imagine how much we've prepared for the Levee this time.\nSo that no \
    one will ever call this beautiful village a backwater again...\nBut still, something is missing. It's not \
    enough. It's a shame... "
set key[id=1104231311004519] name "(Say you'll help promote $map:63000001$ in $map:02000001$ if he lets you on the \
    ship.)"
set key[id=1104231311004520] name "...Hmm, but it's a ship that carries quite a lot of people, so there may be no \
    room.\nFirst, go ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000016[gender:0]$</font> over there whether you can \
    board."
set key[id=1104231311004521] name "It's a ship that carries quite a lot of people, so there may be no \
    room.\nFirst, go ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000016[gender:0]$</font> over there whether you can \
    board."
set key[id=1104231311004522] name "Hm, yes. Welcome. "
set key[id=1104231311004523] name "(Ask if there's room on the ship.)"
set key[id=1104231311004524] name "Tsk, what an innocent. That's not what the $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$ \
    meant... \nThe answer's already been decided. You just don't know it. "
set key[id=1104231311004525] name "The ships we send out are big enough that small storms don't bother them. \nDo \
    you really think we'd have no room for one more person? "
set key[id=1104231311004526] name "(Ask why the $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$ said that, then.)"
set key[id=1104231311004527] name "The $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$ doesn't want to take you on the ship. \nBut \
    he has no real reason to refuse, so he just <font color=\"#ffd200\">passed the responsibility</font> to me."
set key[id=1104231311004528] name "(Ask if there's a way to change the $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$'s mind.)"
set key[id=1104231311004529] name "(Ask for help sneaking onto the ship.)"
set key[id=1104231311004530] name "The $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$ wants the Levee congratulatory envoy to stand \
    out in $map:02000001$.\nBut he seems to think <font color=\"#ffd200\">what we've prepared so far isn't \
    enough</font>.\nHe seems to want to prepare more, so try telling him you'll help."
set key[id=1104231311004531] name "Come now! No matter how desperate you are, sneaking aboard?! \nYou have to win \
    people's hearts, not just insist on getting your way.\nThink it over again!"
set key[id=1104231311004532] name "(Ask if there's a way to change the $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$'s mind.)"
set key[id=1104231311004533] name "The $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$ wants the Levee congratulatory envoy to stand \
    out in $map:02000001$.\nBut he seems to think <font color=\"#ffd200\">what we've prepared so far isn't \
    enough</font>.\nHe seems to want to prepare more, so try telling him you'll help."
set key[id=1104231311004534] name "Well, did you meet $npc:11000016[gender:0]$?\nWhat did he say?"
set key[id=1104231311004535] name "(Tell him you'll do whatever he wants if he'll let you on the ship.)"
set key[id=1104231311004536] name "Ahem, honestly. Hm hm...\nWell, if that's really your wish. Very well. Let's do \
    that."
set key[id=1104231311004537] name "Our fine $map:63000001$, with its clean water and air, has many gifts of \
    nature\nyou can't easily find elsewhere. The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Hardbill's egg</font> is one of them. \
    \nIt's extremely hard to get and rare, and its shell is so beautifully colored\nthat countless collectors love \
    it. "
set key[id=1104231311004538] name "If we bring that egg to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>, which \
    has so many collectors, surely\nmany people will take an interest. I feel good just thinking about it!\nBut... \
    there's a problem."
set key[id=1104231311004539] name "(Ask what the problem is.)"
set key[id=1104231311004540] name "Hardbills are extremely sensitive to people approaching. So... \nthere are \
    rumors they live here, but <font color=\"#ffd200\">no one has actually seen one.</font> \nNaturally... no one \
    knows where their nest is, either."
set key[id=1104231311004541] name "(Ask how you're supposed to find it, then.)"
set key[id=1104231311004542] name "Judging by how you look, I'd guess you've gone treasure hunting at least \
    once,\nso use that same instinct again... Hm? \nIf you find it for me, I'll let you board the ship. In the \
    very front seat!"
set key[id=1104231311004543] name "(...Fine, just tell me more about Hardbills.)"
set key[id=1104231311004544] name "Maybe... old <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000021[gender:0]$</font> knows \
    something.\nHis grandson even goes around looking for Hardbills.\nHe should be near the pier, so go look for \
    him."
set key[id=1104231311004545] name "Maybe old <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000021[gender:0]$</font> knows \
    something.\nHe should be near the pier, so go look for him."
set key[id=1104231311004546] name "Hm? I haven't seen your face around here before. \nDo you need something from \
    me?"
set key[id=1104231311004547] name "Don't tell me... you were sent by the $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$ too?\nTo \
    find a Hardbill's egg, I take it?"
set key[id=1104231311004548] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1104231311004549] name "Honestly, that man... Is he going to turn everyone in $map:63000001$ into a \
    Hardbill\nhunter? I've told him over and over it's not easy to get... "
set key[id=1104231311004550] name "(Say you heard his grandson goes looking for Hardbills.)"
set key[id=1104231311004551] name "It's not just my grandson. All the children in this village look for \
    Hardbills.\nBut it's like chasing a rainbow.\nChasing something you can't catch... like a dream. "
set key[id=1104231311004552] name "(Say you still want to find one.)"
set key[id=1104231311004553] name "Well... in that case, I'll tell you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">story I heard \
    when I was young</font>.\nA soldier who came to see me not long ago begged so earnestly\nthat I told him too. \
    Since I haven't heard anything, it must be hard after all.\nThey say only someone with a truly pure heart can \
    see a Hardbill..."
set key[id=1104231311004554] name "They say Hardbills live in <font color=\"#ffd200\">high places with clear \
    water</font>.\nThey hate being seen by people, so they nest in out-of-the-way spots,\nlay their eggs, and fly \
    far away."
set key[id=1104231311004555] name "The high places around the waterfall on the mountain behind the village fit \
    this story best. \nFollow the <font color=\"#ffd200\">path behind $map:63000003$</font> all the way up.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">That soldier</font> may still be wandering around there,\nso if you meet him, it would be \
    good to search together."
set key[id=1104231311004556] name "If you want a bigger view of the village map, press the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Tab</font> key.\nChecking the <font color=\"#ffd200\">minimap</font> carefully makes life \
    much more convenient.\nYou'll be able to find where <font color=\"#ffd200\">that soldier</font> is easily, \
    too."
set key[id=1104231311004557] name "Oh, ah! $MyPCName$! \nWe meet again! It's so good to see you. "
set key[id=1104231311004558] name "What brings you here, $MyPCName$? \nAre you looking for the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Hardbill's egg</font>, by any chance? "
set key[id=1104231311004559] name "(Tell him what happened with the $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004560] name "I was too slow... so the $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$ must have gotten tired \
    of waiting and asked you too, $MyPCName$.\nUgh... I'm really hopeless.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">To be unable \
    to go because I'm scared, with my goal right in front of me...</font>"
set key[id=1104231311004561] name "(Goal...? Don't tell me you found the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Hardbill's \
    egg</font>?)"
set key[id=1104231311004567] name "Please check whether there's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">Hardbill's egg</font> in \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">nest</font> on the rock wall next to me.\nOh, and I hear if you jump toward a \
    wall, you can climb it.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Press the C key and a direction key to jump toward the \
    wall.</font>\nI'm s-s-s-scared... so I'm asking you for this favor. "
set key[id=1104231311004568] name "$MyPCName$! Did you find it?"
set key[id=1104231311004569] name "(Hand over $item:30000598$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004570] name "Oh! Thank you! \nThank you so much!"
set key[id=1104231311004571] name "Now then, all that's left is to show the egg to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000052[gender:0]$, the $npcTitle:11000052[gender:0]$</font>\nand board the ship \
    to $map:02000001$. With me, too!\nOf course, we get off at $map:02000062$ for the ship, but $map:02000001$ is \
    close from there."
set key[id=1104231311004572] name "(Say let's get going.)"
set key[id=1104231311004573] name "Please go down first. I'll head straight to the ship.\nIt's pretty high here \
    too... I need to catch my breath and go slowly.\nOh, and please take this <font color=\"#ffd200\">egg</font> \
    with you, $MyPCName$. "
set key[id=1104231311004574] name "What's wrong?"
set key[id=1104231311004575] name "(Say you lost the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000598$</font>.)"
set key[id=1104231311004576] name "(Say you'll wait and go down together.)"
set key[id=1104231311004577] name "You left it here, you know? \nHere it is. Keep a good hold of it this time."
set key[id=1104231311004578] name "$MyPCName$... please look inside your bag. <font color=\"#ffd200\">I think you \
    have it.</font>\nPlease hurry to $map:63000003$ and see $npc:11000052[gender:0]$."
set key[id=1104231311004579] name "Of course nothing can go in if your bag is full.\nEven I know that much common \
    sense, $MyPCName$... I'm disappointed.\nPlease make some room in your bag."
set key[id=1104231311004580] name "Thank you for your consideration, but... I'll take my time.\nPlease go down \
    first, $MyPCName$. I'll see you on the ship."
set key[id=1104231311004581] name "Oh. You're here?"
set key[id=1104231311004582] name "(Hand over $item:30000598$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004583] name "My goodness! You really got this treasure! \nA Hardbill's egg... it will draw \
    the attention of so many people at once!"
set key[id=1104231311004584] name "(Say you found it together with $npcName:11001839[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004585] name "$npcName:11001839[gender:0]$...? Who's that?\nOh, I think he was one of the \
    volunteer soldiers who came down to escort the envoy. \nI recall he was quite a bumbling fellow. "
set key[id=1104231311004586] name "(Tell him $npcName:11001839[gender:0]$ found the Hardbill's nest.)"
set key[id=1104231311004587] name "Giving credit to someone else, you really are an upright person.\nYou don't see \
    people like that much these days.\nAnyway, sorry for the trouble. Thank you very much."
set key[id=1104231311004588] name "Well then, it's time to raise the sails of the envoy ship.\nWith you aboard, of \
    course."
set key[id=1104231311004589] name "Oh, you're $MyPCName$, right? Nice to meet you. I'm \
    $npcName:11000096[gender:0]$. \nI heard the envoy ship could set sail thanks to you. Thank you.\nUm, a person \
    named <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001839[gender:0]$</font> asked me to pass this on."
set key[id=1104231311004590] name "Dear $MyPCName$, this is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001838[gender:0]$</font>.\nThank you for helping me all this way, and please help me \
    just once more.\nI have to submit my interim evaluation report to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000068$</font>,\nand I need someone to vouch that I've been doing well."
set key[id=1104231311004591] name "Please help me so that I can become a proper Royal Guardsman. \nThen I'll see \
    you at <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000068$</font>!\n...That's what he asked me to tell you. "
set key[id=1104231311004592] name "(Ask where in the world $npcName:11001839[gender:0]$ is.)"
set key[id=1104231311004593] name "Oh, as soon as he finished talking he clamped a hand over his mouth and ran up \
    those stairs.\nHe must be really seasick. His face had gone completely white. "
set key[id=1104231311004594] name "(Ask if he knows the way to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000068$</font>.)"
set key[id=1104231311004595] name "Ah... it's my first time here today, so I don't know either.\nWhy not ask the \
    person over there?"
set key[id=1104231311004596] name "It's my first time here too, so I don't know where $map:02000068$ is.\nWhy not \
    ask the person over there? He looks like he's from around here."
set key[id=1104231311004597] name "Is there something I can help with?"
set key[id=1104231311004598] name "(Ask for directions to $map:02000068$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004599] name "Go up the stairs behind me and you'll see it right away!\nThe sign has a pink \
    octopus on it, so it's easy to find."
set key[id=1104231311004600] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000068$</font> helps adventurers and aspiring \
    adventurers, \nas well as people having trouble in $map:02000062$.\nWhy are you looking for $map:02000068$? \
    I'll help."
set key[id=1104231311004601] name "(Say you were asked a favor by <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001839[gender:0]$</font> on the way to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>.)"
set key[id=1104231311004602] name "$npcName:11001839[gender:0]$...? $npcTitle:11001839[gender:0]$...? \nSounds \
    like someone I know. Is he afraid of mushrooms?"
set key[id=1104231311004603] name "(Answer that he's afraid of heights too.)"
set key[id=1104231311004604] name "That's him, all right. $npcName:11001839[gender:0]$ is my friend. He's looked \
    up to the Royal Guard since we were kids.\nI heard he failed the Royal Guard exam and got an extra evaluation, \
    and it's true.\nBut what now, <font color=\"#ffd200\">he won't be able to reach $map:02000001$ \
    safely...</font>"
set key[id=1104231311004605] name "(Ask if there's some problem.)"
set key[id=1104231311004606] name "Oh, not exactly... it's that there's a problem with the road.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000019[gender:0]$</font> in $map:02000068$ can tell you the details. \nIf \
    $npcName:11001839[gender:0]$ went there too, you can listen together."
set key[id=1104231311004607] name "Hear the details from $npc:11000019[gender:0]$ at \
    $map:02000068$.\n$npcName:11001839[gender:0]$ went there too, they say, so you can listen together."
set key[id=1104231311004608] name "I'm worried, so worried..."
set key[id=1104231311004609] name "With the Levee coming up, lots of people are heading to $map:02000001$... \nI'm \
    really worried. I can't guarantee safety there, either... Oh dear.\n...Oh, sorry. I was muttering for too \
    long. Did you need something from me?"
set key[id=1104231311004610] name "(Ask if he's seen $npcName:11001838[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004611] name "$npcName:11001838[gender:0]$...? Ah. Now that you mention it, the face of that \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Royal Guardsman who ran into the restroom</font>\njust now looked familiar... So it's \
    that guy. Do you know him?"
set key[id=1104231311004612] name "(Say you came together from $map:63000001$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004613] name "I see... I've heard about him from $npcName:11000022[gender:0]$.\nHe's working \
    hard to become a proper Royal Guardsman, they say. Poor guy.\nThe Royal Guard has no time right now to care \
    about extra evaluations."
set key[id=1104231311004614] name "(Ask what happened on the road to $map:02000001$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004615] name "It happened, all right.\nA while ago a huge earthquake split the ground, and \
    the Royal Road was cut off.\nMany people who came by sea to attend the Levee got <font color=\"#ffd200\">stuck \
    here.</font>"
set key[id=1104231311004616] name "Some porters, trying to meet their delivery deadlines, even went into the dark \
    forest road\nconnected to $map:02000115$... Reckless.\nIt's not safe, and they'd hardly make it before the \
    Levee starts. "
set key[id=1104231311004617] name "(Ask if there's no way, then.)"
set key[id=1104231311004618] name "Of course... it's not that there isn't... but... "
set key[id=1104231311004619] name "Of course... it's not that there isn't... but... "
set key[id=1104231311004620] name "You said you came from $map:63000001$, right? Is that procession large?\nAnd \
    can they fight a bit?"
set key[id=1104231311004621] name "(Say $npcName:11001838[gender:0]$ would know.)"
set key[id=1104231311004622] name "What would he know? He's not that reliable.\n...But anyway, he's a Royal \
    Guardsman, and you look like you can pull your weight,\nso getting into <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000041$</font> shouldn't be a problem. "
set key[id=1104231311004624] name "It was closed for safety reasons at first,\nbut right now it may be the only \
    way. Anyway, it's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">shortcut</font>."
set key[id=1104231311004625] name "There's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">hill behind</font> <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">northwest $map:02000062$</font>. It connects to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>.\nIt used to be a peaceful hill, a lovely place to climb and look out \
    over the sea,\nbut a while ago strange poison plants started growing and sleep pollen began to drift \
    around.\nSo the Adventurers' Association had no choice but to <font color=\"#ffd200\">restrict access</font> \
    for safety."
set key[id=1104231311004626] name "But so many people want to get to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">before the Levee starts</font>\nthat for now... we decided\nto to allow in only those \
    who can fight or are healthy. "
set key[id=1104231311004627] name "I think that Royal Guardsman we talked about earlier said he'd go that way \
    too...\nSo, how about it? Want to take that mountain path to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>?"
set key[id=1104231311004628] name "(Of course you'll go.)"
set key[id=1104231311004629] name "(Say you'll never go if it's that dangerous.)"
set key[id=1104231311004630] name "All right, then go to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">mountain path entrance</font> \
    at the <font color=\"#ffd200\">northwest end of $map:02000062$</font>.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000024[gender:1]$</font> guards it,\nand if you say you have my permission, \
    she'll let you through."
set key[id=1104231311004631] name "All right. Considering safety, that may be best. \nBut getting to \
    $map:02000001$ before the Levee will be <font color=\"#ffd200\">impossible</font>.\nThink carefully about what \
    to do."
set key[id=1104231311004632] name "(Say you'll go despite the risk.)"
set key[id=1104231311004633] name "Go to the mountain path entrance at the northwest end of \
    $map:02000062$.\n$npcName:11000024[gender:1]$ guards it,\nand if you say you have my permission, she'll let \
    you through."
set key[id=1104231311004634] name "One moment, please. \nNot just anyone can go in here. "
set key[id=1104231311004635] name "(Say you have $npc:11000019[gender:0]$'s permission.)"
set key[id=1104231311004636] name "Oh, is that so? "
set key[id=1104231311004637] name "Where are you from?"
set key[id=1104231311004638] name "(Say you're from $map:63000001$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004639] name "Ah, $map:63000001$... then you must be with that <font color=\"#ffd200\">Royal \
    Guardsman</font>?\nHe just went in with the porters. His name was..."
set key[id=1104231311004640] name "(Ask if it was $npcName:11001838[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004641] name "Yes, that's right. That was the name. And you're $MyPCName$, right?\nHe asked \
    me to tell you the transport unit will go to $map:02000001$ through $map:63000041$ and will wait for you \
    inside. \nYou can enter $map:63000041$ through that entrance next to me."
set key[id=1104231311004642] name "Yes, that's right. That was the name. And you're $MyPCName$, right?\nHe asked \
    me to tell you the transport unit will go to $map:02000001$ through $map:63000041$ and will wait for you \
    inside. \nYou can enter $map:63000041$ through that entrance next to me."
set key[id=1104231311004643] name "Still, it's a great relief that it wasn't worse, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=1104231311004644] name "(Ask why the Levee was cancelled.)"
set key[id=1104231311004645] name "Well, I only heard that it was cancelled... \nI don't know the reason. I \
    haven't had time to find out, either.\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">patients</font> who have come here matter \
    far more to me. "
set key[id=1104231311004646] name "(Ask if <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001838[gender:0]$</font> is here.)"
set key[id=1104231311004647] name "Ah, you mean the Royal Guardsman who was brought in with you, $MyPCName$. \
    \nHe's <font color=\"#ffd200\">recovering in that bed</font> over there. "
set key[id=1104231311004661] name "I keep imposing on you like this, $MyPCName$. \nI'm ashamed, but... I have a \
    favor to ask.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> is at the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000025$ entrance</font>. "
set key[id=1104231311004662] name "Hm? Did you come to see me? "
set key[id=1104231311004663] name "Sorry, but I'm not that idle.\nI don't know what this is about, so keep it \
    short."
set key[id=1104231311004664] name "(Report what you and $npc:11001838[gender:0]$ went through in $map:63000041$.)"
set key[id=1104231311004719] name "It looks like Senior $npc:11000169[gender:0]$ has something on his mind.\nWhy \
    not go talk to him?"
set key[id=1104231311004720] name "It looks like Senior $npc:11000169[gender:0]$ has something on his mind.\nWhy \
    not go talk to him?"
set key[id=1104231311004721] name "Sigh... what am I going to do..."
set key[id=1108174312002107] name "Welcome~ \nDo you practice your instrument often? There's no good musician who \
    skips practice.\nOnly by practicing steadily and persistently, even for a short time, does your real skill \
    grow."
set key[id=1108174312002108] name "Want to practice but have no instrument or sheet music?\nThat's just an excuse. \
    \nWith a few mesos, you can buy whatever you need at\nthe instrument shop I run."
set key[id=1108174312002109] name "Mm~ your skill is quite excellent.\nI wish more people could hear you play."
set key[id=1108174312002110] name "Go where people gather once in a while and let them hear your music.\nEveryone \
    will enjoy it."
set key[id=1108174312002111] name "Ah, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000002$</font>! \nGo to the fishing spot \
    there. It's close, and not as crowded as here... "
set key[id=1108174312002112] name "Hmm? Did you come to fish?"
set key[id=1110004811004773] name "Ugh... urgh. $MyPCName$..."
set key[id=1110004811004774] name "(Ask if he's all right.)"
set key[id=1110004811004775] name "I'm hanging in there... it still hurts, but I can bear it.\nAre you all right, \
    $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1110004811004776] name "(Ask what happened.)"
set key[id=1110004811004777] name "...To be honest, I don't remember well. It's really embarrassing, but\nall I \
    remember is <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$ running toward me\nwhere I had fallen</font>. When I came to, \
    the rescue team was already here."
set key[id=1110004811004778] name "(Ask if the rescue team came from $map:02000001$.)"
set key[id=1110004811004779] name "Yes. They say people coming from elsewhere to attend the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Levee</font> were also attacked by\nan unknown being <font color=\"#ffd200\">near \
    $map:02000001$</font>.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font>, who was handling the \
    aftermath, ordered a search of the $map:02000062$ side too,\nand that's how we were rescued so quickly."
set key[id=1110004811004780] name "As expected, he's wonderful. <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font>... thorough and careful.\nAh, I want to be like that \
    someday...!"
set key[id=1110004811004781] name "(If it's <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000119[gender:0]$</font>... is he \
    the one $npc:11001842[gender:0]$ asked you to make a <font color=\"#ffd200\">report</font> to?)"
set key[id=1110004811004782] name "(Tease him: not until you're reborn, I'd say.)"
set key[id=1110004811004783] name "Ha ha, you're too much, $MyPCName$. You're <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">joking</font>, right?\nEven someone like me can get better someday.\nThey say if you wish \
    for something hard enough, the universe helps."
set key[id=1110004811004784] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(I wasn't joking...)</font> Anyway, get plenty of rest \
    and get well soon."
set key[id=1110004811004785] name "Yes, that's right. My training camp classmate $npcName:11001842[gender:0]$ \
    asked me to... Oh no!\nAaaah, what do I do?! To forget that, I'm truly hopeless!\nI have to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">report</font> to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> about the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">attack</font> we suffered...!"
set key[id=1110004811004786] name "(Say you'll go in his place, so he can rest.)"
set key[id=1110004811004787] name "Heh heh, okay. The food here is good too... I think I'll recover \
    quickly.\nDon't push yourself too hard either, $MyPCName$. \nSince you're in $map:02000001$, do a little \
    sightseeing, too. "
set key[id=1110004811004788] name "(Encourage him to become a proper Royal Guardsman soon.)"
set key[id=1110004811004789] name "Yes, of course. I want to hurry up and... Oh!\nAaaah, what do I do?! To forget \
    the report, I'm truly hopeless!\nI have to <font color=\"#ffd200\">report</font> to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> about the <font color=\"#ffd200\">attack</font> we \
    suffered...!"
set key[id=1110004811004790] name "(Say you'll go in his place, so he can rest.)"
set key[id=1110004811004791] name "In principle I should make the report myself, but my legs won't move...\nSo I'm \
    sorry, but I have to ask you, $MyPCName$.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> is at the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000025$ entrance</font>. "
set key[id=1110004811004792] name "I already know about that.\nI'll take action afterward."
set key[id=1110004811004793] name "(Ask if <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001820[gender:1]$</font> was behind \
    the attacks elsewhere too.)"
set key[id=1110004811004794] name "I have no obligation to tell you such things.\nI'll take your report into \
    consideration, so be on your way."
set key[id=1110004811004795] name "(Warn him that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001820[gender:1]$</font> seemed \
    to have <font color=\"#ffd200\">tremendous power</font>.)"
set key[id=1110004811004796] name "Do you think I wouldn't know what you know?\nWe're prepared, so there's no need \
    to worry excessively.\n<font color=\"#909090\">(The eyes of $npcName:11000119[gender:0]$ wavered slightly.) \
    </font>"
set key[id=1110004811004797] name "(Say you'll help investigate this incident.)"
set key[id=1110004811004798] name "...This is Royal Guard business.\nDon't rashly try to interfere, and don't defy \
    me."
set key[id=1110004811004799] name "(Ask if he's hiding something.)"
set key[id=1110004811004800] name "That friend of yours? I don't know what a man too hurt to even report in \
    person\nis talking about regarding formal enlistment. \nTell him the Royal Guard admits only <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">those who are qualified</font>."
set key[id=1110004811004801] name "It seems you didn't properly understand what I said, so I'll say it again.\nYou \
    would do well not to dig any deeper into this.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">And pass my words on clearly to your \
    friend as well.</font>"
set key[id=1110004811004802] name "$MyPCName$! You're back.\nWhat did $npcName:11000119[gender:0]$ say?"
set key[id=1110004811004803] name "(Say you didn't get a proper answer.)"
set key[id=1110004811004804] name "What? He didn't react at all to my report?\nThat's strange... <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">that's not like him</font>... "
set key[id=1110004811004805] name "(Say he seemed overbearing and cold.)"
set key[id=1110004811004806] name "...That's very different from the man I know, at least. \nThere must be some \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">reason</font> behind it. "
set key[id=1110004811004807] name "Actually, some of the stories I heard while lying here are a bit... \
    strange.\n$MyPCName$, please listen and tell me what you think.\nThere seem to be a lot of suspicious points."
set key[id=1110004811004808] name "(Tell him to go ahead.)"
set key[id=1110004811004809] name "Two people attacked on the same day in the same place told visitors\nwhat \
    happened on the day they were hit.\nOne said they ran into bandits, another said a landslide.\nAs if they had \
    been in different places."
set key[id=1110004811004810] name "But something stranger is going on. The people telling these stories\ndidn't \
    care at all that their accounts changed or didn't add up,\nand were busy blaming the Empress, saying <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">it's all the royal family's fault</font>. "
set key[id=1110004811004811] name "(Ask what on earth that's supposed to mean.)"
set key[id=1110004811004812] name "Right? What did the Empress do wrong?\nIt's so odd. The victims were busy \
    resenting the Empress\nwhom they've never even seen. As if someone were controlling their thoughts..."
set key[id=1110004811004813] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Does that mean public opinion of the Empress is \
    turning bad...)</font>"
set key[id=1110004811004814] name "Oh, right. Do you recognize my friend next to me?\nMy training camp classmate \
    $npcName:11001843[gender:0]$. We met on the mountain path... "
set key[id=1110004811004815] name "(Say you remember.)"
set key[id=1110004811004816] name "I'm not sure."
set key[id=1110004811004817] name "Yes, he's been waiting because he has <font color=\"#ffd200\">something to \
    say</font> to you, $MyPCName$.\nPlease talk with him."
set key[id=1110004811004818] name "You've forgotten already... You didn't hit your head, did you?\nYou can forget \
    him, but not me, $MyPCName$...!\nAnyway, he's been waiting since earlier because he has <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">something to say</font>\nto you, $MyPCName$. Please talk with him."
set key[id=1110004811004819] name "My training camp classmate $npcName:11001843[gender:0]$ says he has something \
    to say to you, $MyPCName$,\nso please meet him. He's in the bed right next to mine."
set key[id=1110004811004820] name "Oh. You're here.  \nI was in no state to greet you then, but thank you so \
    much."
set key[id=1110004811004821] name "You're $MyPCName$, right? I heard a lot about you from \
    $npcName:11001841[gender:0]$. \nHe said you're big-hearted, brave, and even have a sense of humor. "
set key[id=1110004811004822] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(A sense of humor... I was being serious...)</font> "
set key[id=1110004811004823] name "Thanks to you running ahead and buying time, $MyPCName$,\nmore civilians were \
    able to survive.\nI was evacuating them too when a loud explosion made me lose consciousness...\nI woke up \
    around when the rescue team reached the scene and joined the rescue. "
set key[id=1110004811004824] name "The victims, most of them unconscious, were certainly at the same scene,\nbut \
    gave testimony as if each had been in a different place.\nWe Royal Guardsmen gathered it together and reported \
    it to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font>.\nBut $npcName:11000119[gender:0]$'s attitude \
    while hearing the report was... different from usual."
set key[id=1110004811004825] name "After the report, the first thing $npcName:11000119[gender:0]$ did was <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">silence the Royal Guardsmen</font>\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">who had been at the \
    scene</font>. He used to say the Royal Guard has ranks but no secrets,\nthat it's a place woven from trust... \
    It was like a different person."
set key[id=1110004811004826] name "He's right that we mustn't speak carelessly about a case still under \
    investigation,\nbut that we <font color=\"#ffd200\">must not conduct further investigation</font> either\nis \
    hard to understand. Then who is supposed to investigate?"
set key[id=1110004811004827] name "(Comfort $npcName:11001843[gender:0]$, who looks disheartened.)"
set key[id=1110004811004828] name "It's all right... A Royal Guardsman must follow military orders, after \
    all.\nIt's true I can't quite accept it, but thinking of the character\n$npcName:11000119[gender:0]$ has \
    always shown... there must be some <font color=\"#ffd200\">reason he can't speak of</font>. "
set key[id=1110004811004829] name "(Ask if he has any guesses.)"
set key[id=1110004811004830] name "Maybe it has something to do with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Levee's \
    cancellation</font>.\nThey seem to have announced to the public that it could be dangerous because of the \
    earthquake,\nbut the truth is there was an <font color=\"#ffd200\">attack by unknown assailants</font> around \
    the Levee...\nIt seems the royal family wants to keep people from learning that. "
set key[id=1110004811004831] name "And... for some reason, the victims' <font color=\"#ffd200\">memories of the \
    attack</font> seem to be\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">fading</font> little by little. Mine too, and the other \
    Royal Guardsmen's.\nI don't know what's going on... Ah. I'm so dizzy."
set key[id=1110004811004832] name "(Say he should get some rest now.)"
set key[id=1110004811004833] name "I'm sorry. My body won't keep up with my will. \nThen... I'll rest a while.\nIf \
    I remember anything next time, I'll tell you."
set key[id=1110004811004834] name "I'm sorry. My body won't keep up with my will. \nThen... I'll rest a while.\nIf \
    I remember anything next time, I'll tell you."
set key[id=1110004811004835] name "I heard everything you and $npcName:11001843[gender:0]$ talked about, \
    $MyPCName$,\nright here beside you."
set key[id=1110004811004836] name "$npcName:11001843[gender:0]$ falls asleep often, maybe because his injuries run \
    deep,\nbut he's truly grateful to you, $MyPCName$.\nHa ha, though honestly, I'm the one who owes you far \
    more."
set key[id=1110004811004837] name "At the training camp we were in the same position... but now \
    $npcName:11001842[gender:0]$\nseems like a much bigger person than me, like an adult. Like someone\nI could \
    never catch up to."
set key[id=1110004811004838] name "(Ask what makes him say that.)"
set key[id=1110004811004839] name "What he said earlier, I mean... $npcName:11001842[gender:0]$ said\neven if you \
    can't accept it, <font color=\"#ffd200\">a Royal Guardsman must follow military orders</font>.\nA Royal \
    Guardsman should be just... but are military orders always just?"
set key[id=1110004811004840] name "If he's putting up with it even when they aren't... how hard that must be.\nThe \
    Royal Guard may not be as wonderful a place as I dreamed of.\nI even wonder whether \
    $npcName:11000119[gender:0]$ might have circumstances like that too."
set key[id=1110004811004841] name "(Ask if he knows anyone well-informed about this place.)"
set key[id=1110004811004842] name "I have training camp classmates, but they're all rookies...\nThere is someone I \
    met during training. He guards the <font color=\"#ffd200\">armory</font>,\nso he said he hears a lot of talk. \
    But why...?"
set key[id=1110004811004843] name "(Say you want to find out the <font color=\"#ffd200\">real reason the Levee was \
    cancelled</font>.)"
set key[id=1110004811004844] name "I'm really curious too. About the identity of the one who attacked us, \
    too.\nBut it seems there's someone trying to <font color=\"#ffd200\">hide all of it</font>...\nCan we really \
    find out the truth? "
set key[id=1110004811004845] name "Oh, and on top of that...! Even though I'm a trainee, I'm a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Royal Guardsman</font>.\nI'm bound to follow military orders, so if I go around \
    investigating\nsomething myself, wouldn't I face <font color=\"#ffd200\">discipline</font>? <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Formal enlistment</font> might become difficult too..."
set key[id=1110004811004846] name "(Say you won't mention $npcName:11001838[gender:0]$ and will only sound him \
    out.)"
set key[id=1110004811004847] name "As expected, you're big-hearted and deep, $MyPCName$.\nI'll surely repay this \
    kindness once I become a <font color=\"#ffd200\">full Royal Guardsman</font>. "
set key[id=1110004811004848] name "(Tell him not to worry and give you the name of that well-informed guardsman.)"
set key[id=1110004811004849] name "His name is <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000169[gender:0]$</font>.\nHe's \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">armory guard</font>. Well then... good luck. "
set key[id=1110004811004850] name "His name is $npcName:11000169[gender:0]$. He's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">armory guard</font>. \nIf you meet him, you may be able to get some information."
set key[id=1110004811004851] name "Hello? Is there something I can do for you...?"
set key[id=1110004811004852] name "(Say he must be well-informed since he guards the armory.)"
set key[id=1110004811004853] name "(Praise him for his clear eyes.)"
set key[id=1110004811004854] name "I guard the armory all day without moving, so I do see and hear quite a lot. \
    \nIt's tough but rewarding, and I learn a lot.\nProbably true of anyone protecting <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> here, ha ha."
set key[id=1110004811004855] name "(Ask if he knows the real reason the Levee was cancelled.)"
set key[id=1110004811004856] name "Oh, you flatter me. I'm embarrassed."
set key[id=1110004811004857] name "(Say he must be well-informed since he guards the armory.)"
set key[id=1110004811004858] name "Ah... that... that's...\nWell... "
set key[id=1110014811004859] name "Huh? Ah... yes. I'm not sure, though. Just now a strange bird showed up up \
    there,\ndid something, and flew off high into the sky. \nI wondered whether that bird might be a Hardbill..."
set key[id=1110014811004860] name "(Tell him to hurry up and go check, then.)"
set key[id=1110014811004861] name "...$MyPCName$. I can't go. It's too high. \nI worked up so much courage just to \
    climb this far... \nUp there is hi-i-igh, way too high. I'm scared."
set key[id=1110014811004862] name "(Tell him to wait while you look around up there.)"
set key[id=1110014811004863] name "Yes. It looks like you can climb the wall next to me. Toward that \
    waterfall.\nOh, and I hear if you jump toward a wall, you can climb it.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Press the C \
    key and a direction key to jump toward the wall.</font>"
set key[id=1110154111004864] name "Oh, by the way. If you want a bigger view of the village map, press the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Tab</font> key.\nChecking the <font color=\"#ffd200\">minimap</font> carefully makes life \
    much more convenient."
set key[id=1110154111004865] name "But what business do you have at <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000068$</font>? \
    \nI'm a member there myself, so I might be able to help you right away. "
set key[id=1110154111004866] name "(Ask if $npcName:11001838[gender:0]$ can enlist formally.)"
set key[id=1110154111004867] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(This man's attitude... something about it doesn't feel \
    right.)</font>"
set key[id=1110154111004868] name "It seems you didn't properly understand what I said, so I'll say it again.\nYou \
    would do well not to dig any deeper into this.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">And pass my words on clearly to your \
    friend as well.</font>"
set key[id=1111153011004869] name "Even after what happened at Dark Wind, nothing has changed in this city...\nI \
    want to let more people know about this unreasonable reality.\nHey, don't you think so too?"
set key[id=1111153011004870] name "I heard that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001888[gender:1]$ of the Maple TV \
    Culture Bureau</font> is quite a principled journalist.\nIf you don't mind, could you tell her to cover the \
    protesters\nin front of $map:02000100$ City Hall? \nI can't step forward myself... so I'm asking you."
set key[id=1111153011004871] name "You can probably find her somewhere around <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000164$</font>, \nwhere the broadcasting station is."
set key[id=1111153011004872] name "You can probably find her somewhere around <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000164$</font>, \nwhere the broadcasting station is."
set key[id=1111153011004873] name "Hm? Who are you... Is there something you need from me...?"
set key[id=1111153011004874] name "(Ask if she is <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001888[gender:1]$ of the Maple TV \
    Culture Bureau</font>.)"
set key[id=1111153011004875] name "Hmm... yes. There's no one else with my name, so that's me.\nThough I'm in the \
    Entertainment Bureau now, not the Culture Bureau."
set key[id=1111153011004876] name "(Ask if she'd cover the human rights problems in $map:02000100$.)"
set key[id=1111153011004877] name "Oh. Covering... \nIs there someone who gave you a tip? The current... I \
    mean..."
set key[id=1111153011004878] name "(Tell her about the protesters in front of $map:02000100$ City Hall.)"
set key[id=1111153011004879] name "I'm sorry, but... I don't think there's anything I can do.\nI was suddenly \
    transferred to the Entertainment Bureau for not following the Culture Bureau chief's orders,\nso I can't touch \
    the investigative programs or documentaries anymore."
set key[id=1111153011004880] name "For now... I'll pass the word to $npc:11001192[gender:0]$, who was on my team \
    in the Culture Bureau,\nto cover the protesters in front of $map:02000100$ City Hall.\nI hope we don't miss \
    such a valuable tip... it really is a shame."
set key[id=1111153011004881] name "Thank you for passing that along, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=1111153011004882] name "Um... if it's all right, could I ask you a favor?\nYou have a strong body, a \
    kind heart that doesn't overlook other people's troubles, and\na distinctive look...! I need <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">help from someone like you, $MyPCName$</font>."
set key[id=1111153011004883] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=1111153011004884] name "Do you know <font color=\"#ffd200\">Amazing TV, Surprise!</font>, Maple TV's \
    long-running flagship program?\nIt shows many episodes in a single broadcast, so there's a huge amount of \
    footage to shoot.\nThe studio is hard to book and there's so much to film that we're always short on \
    time,\nand the director is always angry."
set key[id=1111153011004885] name "And then, can you believe it... I can't reach the actor who was supposed to \
    shoot today. \nThe studio reservation time keeps shrinking, the director is waiting...\nAt this rate I'll lose \
    my place in the Entertainment Bureau too... "
set key[id=1111153011004886] name "(Ask if she needs an actor.)"
set key[id=1111153011004887] name "Yes, that's right. You look like you have plenty of stamina, \nso how about \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">appearing</font> on our show? \nOf course I'll pay you an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">appearance fee</font>."
set key[id=1111153011004888] name "(Say I'm not confident about acting.)"
set key[id=1111153011004889] name "Don't worry about that, our director is a veteran.\nJust do what he tells you \
    and editing will take care of the rest. \nI'll be waiting for you at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000380$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000266$</font>!"
set key[id=1111153011004890] name "A simple job where you just do what the veteran director says!\nYou become an \
    actor and get paid. It's a great part-time job, isn't it?\nI'll be waiting for you at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000380$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000266$</font>!"
set key[id=1111153011004891] name "$MyPCName$, you came!\nI just checked the footage at the station,\nand it came \
    out great. The director is happy with it too."
set key[id=1111153011004892] name "If you'd like to join a shoot again sometime, \ncome by $map:02000380$ anytime, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1115193211004893] name "I have something I'd like you to look into for me.\nI know you're busy, but \
    would you help me out?"
set key[id=1115193211004894] name "(Ask what it's about.)"
set key[id=1115193211004895] name "There's a sacred peak called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000055$</font>.\nWe've had reports that shamans tainted by darkness are trying to \
    wake Vayar, the sacred rock\nspirit sleeping there, and twist it into an evil spirit.\nAs you know, the Royal \
    Guard can't spare anyone to look into it right now."
set key[id=1115193211004896] name "I need someone who can see what's going on there and clean up any \ntrouble... \
    I think you, $MyPCName$, are just the person for it.\nWill you take this on?"
set key[id=1115193211004897] name "Got it."
set key[id=1115193211004898] name "Thank you. \nNow, head straight to $map:02000055$."
set key[id=1115193211004899] name "Head straight to $map:02000055$, \nfind out what's going on there, and deal \
    with any trouble you find.\nI'm counting on you."
set key[id=1115193211004900] name "You're back. So, how did it go?"
set key[id=1115193211004901] name "(Say I defeated the corrupted $npc:23100100[gender:0]$.)"
set key[id=1115193211004902] name "I see. So it came to that after all. Well done.\nI worry about what else those \
    shamans might try..."
set key[id=1115193211004903] name "$MyPCName$. I got word that the Guardians posted at $map:02000146$ say\nthe \
    Dark Wind faction is looking for you.\nGo meet $npc:11000266[gender:0]$ at $map:02000146$."
set key[id=1115193211004904] name "$MyPCName$. I got word that the Guardians posted at $map:02000146$ say\nthe \
    Dark Wind faction is looking for you.\nGo meet $npc:11000266[gender:0]$ at $map:02000146$."
set key[id=1115193211004905] name "Ah, you're here!"
set key[id=1115193211004906] name "Some time ago, a few of the engineers at $map:02000100$ tried to leak part of \
    their robot research\nto the outside. What shocked everyone was that the technology was close to\nbuilding \
    killing weapons for war. "
set key[id=1115193211004907] name "There was a theory that the incident happened while the robots under \
    development\nwere malfunctioning for no known reason. There was even a rumor that some of the sample \
    robots\nescaped from the lab at the time...\nBut it looks like that rumor I took for idle talk has become \
    reality."
set key[id=1115193211004908] name "Robots have shown up in a building called $map:02000099$, and one of them is \
    said to look like\na Mark 52 series unit. It's a fearsome war-model killer robot\ncarrying the core \
    semiconductor blamed for the malfunction. "
set key[id=1115193211004909] name "(Ask if that isn't terribly dangerous.)"
set key[id=1115193211004910] name "It is. And if ordinary people learn about this, it's obvious they'll only get \
    more anxious,\nso I'd like it handled quietly if possible. \n$MyPCName$... would you go to $map:02000099$ and \
    clean up what's happening there?\nI'll pay you for it, of course."
set key[id=1115193211004911] name "$MyPCName$... would you go to $map:02000099$ and clean up what's happening \
    there?\nI'll pay you for it, of course."
set key[id=1115193211004912] name "How are things at $map:02000099$? \nWas the rumor true?"
set key[id=1115193211004913] name "(Say I found $npc:23100055$ and defeated it.)"
set key[id=1115193211004914] name "So the rumor was true after all.\nThis could have turned into something very \
    dangerous... Thank you. "
set key[id=1115193211004915] name "$MyPCName$. I have a favor to ask.\nA huge herd of pigs has invaded the area \
    near $map:02000091$, and the farmers\nare suffering badly. The vigilantes of $map:02000076$ tried to stop \
    them\nbut they're overwhelmed, so they sent a request for help."
set key[id=1115193211004916] name "Since the request came in a message from $npc:11000015[gender:1]$... \nI'd like \
    to send someone trustworthy to help. \nSomeone just like you, $MyPCName$. "
set key[id=1115193211004917] name "I know you're busy solving all sorts of problems, \nbut \
    $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ would be very happy to have your help.\nPlease head to $map:02000334$ right away and \
    help $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$."
set key[id=1115193211004918] name "I know you're busy solving all sorts of problems, \nbut \
    $npc:11000015[gender:1]$ would be very happy to have your help.\nPlease head to $map:02000334$ right away and \
    help $npcName:11000015[gender:1]$."
set key[id=1115193211004919] name "$MyPCName$, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000015[gender:1]$</font> sent word \
    of thanks. \nShe was amazed at how well you handle bombs, too. Thank you so much. "
set key[id=1115193211004920] name "$MyPCName$, it seems $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ is looking for you. \nPlease go \
    see him."
set key[id=1115193211004921] name "$MyPCName$, it seems $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ is looking for you. \nPlease go \
    see him."
set key[id=1115193211004922] name "Ah, you came?"
set key[id=1115193211004923] name "$MyPCName$. \nHave you ever heard of the legendary divine beasts?"
set key[id=1115193211004924] name "(Ask if he means the sacred animals.)"
set key[id=1115193211004925] name "Yes. Among them is the legendary bird said to live on the high, steep \
    mountains, the divine beast\n$npc:23100021$, chief of the Griffin race. It has lost all reason\nand is turning \
    the area around its mountain into a sea of fire."
set key[id=1115193211004926] name "Not only that... it's attacking without mercy even the priests of the Pigmingo \
    tribe\nwho went to calm $npc:23100021$ down. "
set key[id=1115193211004927] name "(Ask if he reported this to $npcName:11000075[gender:1]$ \
    $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$.)"
set key[id=1115193211004928] name "Well... $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$ seems to be lost in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">deep thought</font> about something. \nThey say even $npc:11000601[gender:1]$ can't bring \
    themselves to\nspeak to $npcTitle:11000075[gender:1]$. "
set key[id=1115193211004929] name "Reporting these strange signs from all over to the Empress is only natural, \
    but...\nafter seeing her carrying such a heavy worry, I can't bring myself to add to it,\nlet alone fail to \
    lighten it."
set key[id=1115193211004931] name "So, $MyPCName$... could you go to $map:02000316$ \nand subdue the enraged \
    $npc:23100021$?\nThe Royal Guard and I have to be ready in case the Empress gives an order. "
set key[id=1115193211004932] name "Got it."
set key[id=1115193211004933] name "Thank you. \nNow, head straight to $map:02000316$."
set key[id=1115193211004934] name "Thank you. \nNow, head straight to $map:02000316$."
set key[id=1115193211004935] name "You're back. \nThe Empress is still deep in thought.\nSo, did \
    $npc:23100021$..."
set key[id=1115193211004936] name "(Say I defeated it.)"
set key[id=1115193211004937] name "I see... Thank you. You've worked hard. "
set key[id=1115193211004941] name "$MyPCName$. Have you heard the news lately that fires of unknown cause\nare \
    breaking out all over Victoria Island? "
set key[id=1115193211004942] name "(Say I have.)"
set key[id=1115193211004943] name "(Say I haven't.)"
set key[id=1115193211004944] name "Word travels fast. \nFires big and small are breaking out all over Victoria \
    Island,\nand no cause has been found, so a lot of people think it's strange."
set key[id=1115193211004945] name "(Ask if they've found out the cause.)"
set key[id=1115193211004946] name "True, since the cause hasn't been found at all, \nit's mostly people who are \
    simply curious... and in truth\nnot many suspect the incidents are connected."
set key[id=1115193211004947] name "(Ask if they've found out the cause.)"
set key[id=1115193211004948] name "We recently got a tip. There's a lava spring called $map:02000079$,\nand the \
    tip says that's the source of the fires. \nBut nobody knows what's inside. "
set key[id=1115193211004949] name "(Ask if the Royal Guard shouldn't be sent to investigate.)"
set key[id=1115193211004950] name "They should. But investigating that place seems closer to the realm of magic, \
    so \nI thought it best to ask $npc:11000031[gender:0]$ of $map:02000023$.\nSo I was just about to ask\nthe \
    Empress about it when..."
set key[id=1115193211004951] name "Your face came to mind, $MyPCName$.\nSomeone with a good nose for trouble who \
    finds clues when investigating,\nand who can fight, so you can handle whatever happens."
set key[id=1115193211004952] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Sounds like I'm being quietly put to work...)</font>"
set key[id=1115193211004953] name "I'd like you to take on the investigation of $map:02000079$. Is that all \
    right?\nFind out what on earth is going on there \nand whether there's really something that could be causing \
    the fires.\nIf you find any threat, it would be even better if you took it down. I'm counting on you."
set key[id=1115193211004954] name "I'd like you to take on the investigation of $map:02000079$. Is that all \
    right?\nFind out what on earth is going on there \nand whether there's really something that could be causing \
    the fires.\nIf you find any threat, it would be even better if you took it down. I'm counting on you."
set key[id=1115193211004955] name "$MyPCName$, welcome back.\nAre you on your way back from $map:02000079$?"
set key[id=1115193211004956] name "(Tell him about the $npc:23100041[gender:0]$ that was there.)"
set key[id=1115193211004957] name "Is that so...? \nStrange things keep happening, truly.\nWhat did you do with \
    that creature? "
set key[id=1115193211004958] name "(Say I defeated it.)"
set key[id=1115193211004959] name "Lie and say I left it and ran away."
set key[id=1115193211004960] name "As expected, you're a fine warrior, $MyPCName$.\nYou've worked hard. "
set key[id=1115193211004961] name "...You do make idle jokes, $MyPCName$.\nSomeone like you wouldn't leave a \
    creature like that alone if you saw it. \nI suppose I'm starting to know you a little by now."
set key[id=1115193211004962] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(It feels strange to be read so easily.)</font>"
set key[id=1118030012002149] name "My shop has plenty of instruments and sheet music that will help you practice, \
    \nso buy some and practice if you need to."
set key[id=1118030012002150] name "I'm still not comfortable playing in front of other people."
set key[id=1118030012002151] name "With your skill, I don't think you need to worry about that at all... hmm... \
    \nThen start by playing at somewhere like a small fishing spot.\nOnce playing in front of others becomes a \
    habit, the embarrassment will fade quickly... "
set key[id=1118030012002152] name "Ah, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000002$</font>! \nGo to the fishing spot \
    there. It's close, and not as crowded as here... "
set key[id=1118030012002153] name "I'd like to play for the people fishing."
set key[id=1118030012002154] name "Hey now! Look at this fellow... \nYou'll scare all the fish away. Strumming \
    away here is a problem~"
set key[id=1118030012002155] name "I'll play so beautifully that the fish will gather around."
set key[id=1118030012002156] name "Hmm... that's a problem... "
set key[id=1217143605001012] name "Hey! Did you hear the rumor?\nThey say <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000781[gender:0]$ at $map:02000002$</font> is giving away fishing rods for free."
set key[id=1217143605001013] name "That guy was so obsessed with fishing he stayed by the water all day,\nand at \
    some point he started selling fishing gear."
set key[id=1217143605001014] name "He complained that business was bad, so I guess he's just giving them away.\nHe \
    might change his mind, so hurry over and get one."
set key[id=1217143605001015] name "I only heard it as a rumor, too.\nGo see for yourself."
set key[id=1217143605001016] name "Me? You're looking for meee-hee-hee... woooah...\nLost it. Hmph.\nWhat brings \
    you here?"
set key[id=1217143605001017] name "(Say you came to get a fishing rod.)"
set key[id=1217143605001018] name "Have you ever fished? Hmm... one look and I can tell it's your first time.\nGo \
    to the water and <font color=\"#ffd200\">double-click the fishing rod</font> in your inventory window.\nYou \
    can cast your line anywhere you can swim."
set key[id=1217143605001019] name "Once the rod is cast, you can move the float with the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">arrow keys</font>.\nOh! Not infinitely, though... you'll get a feel for it once you try."
set key[id=1217143605001020] name "Hmm... *sniff* Is there more you want to know?\nDrop the line, wait quietly, \
    and the float will start to bob.\nYou have to keep the float at just the right height, or you won't catch a \
    fish."
set key[id=1217143605001021] name "Ah! That only applies to a kind of fish you're catching for the first \
    time.\nOnce you've caught a kind before, you can reel it in without all that effort."
set key[id=1217143605001022] name "Don't just stand there in a daze. Why not try catching one yourself?\nHook any \
    fish at all and feel it in your hands."
set key[id=1217143605001023] name "This is my spot, so if you want to fish, do it from a good way off."
set key[id=1217143605001024] name "So how was the fishing?\nDo you see now why I hold this rod all day long?"
set key[id=1217143605001025] name "If you don't yet, a few more tries and you will.\nIt's a hobby that empties the \
    mind. Ha ha."
set key[id=1217143605001026] name "W-wait just a... Whoa!\nIt got away. *sniff*\nDid I say you could drop your \
    line anywhere there's water to swim in?"
set key[id=1217143605001027] name "(Say that you did.)"
set key[id=1217143605001028] name "Fish, you see, \nsome live in hot places, some can stand venom, some live in \
    plain fresh water,\nand some live in salt water... They all differ by where they live. "
set key[id=1217143605001029] name "If you want to catch all sorts of fish, it pays to know that.\nSince we're on \
    the subject, why not try catching a fish that lives in venom?\nThere happens to be a venom pool right near \
    here."
set key[id=1217143605001030] name "Keep in mind that every fishing spot has different fish to catch."
set key[id=1217143605001031] name "Now do you see the fun of fishing?\nHmm... where did I put it? Here it is. I'll \
    give you some bait, so try it out."
set key[id=1217143605001032] name "You can use it by <font color=\"#ffd200\">double-clicking the bait</font> in \
    your inventory.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Once you use it, for a while</font> fishing will be even more fun."
set key[id=1221153905001033] name "Oh dear, what are we going to do? Our village is doomed."
set key[id=1221153905001034] name "(Ask what's going on.)"
set key[id=1221153905001035] name "To keep our village's water from running dry, we have to make an offering \
    today,\nbut we've run out of livestock, so we have nothing left to offer."
set key[id=1221153905001036] name "If He grows angry, He'll cut off the waterway that rises from underground, the \
    water will dry up to the bottom,\nand we won't be able to go on living in this village."
set key[id=1221153905001037] name "(Ask who He is.)"
set key[id=1221153905001038] name "Rumor has it that just looking at Him turns you to ice.\nHe's so terrifying \
    that all we can do is make offerings\nand try not to rouse His anger."
set key[id=1221153905001039] name "(Ask if there's no way to get an offering.)"
set key[id=1221153905001040] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Glancing around nervously)</font> Well... there's a \
    way: catch monsters and offer them instead of livestock.\nBut hunting those brutes is no easy matter..."
set key[id=1221153905001041] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=1221153905001042] name "You really will? Oh, thank you!\n<font color=\"#909090\">(Grinning)</font> Go \
    in through that gap in the rocks over there and you'll find a big boulder blocking the way.\nBehind that \
    boulder is the beast's den, so if you move the boulder, you'll meet them."
set key[id=1221153905001043] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Avoiding your eyes)</font> Um, we have to make the \
    offering before today is over."
set key[id=1221153905001044] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Startled)</font> What... How could you...\nHow in the \
    world did you come back alive?"
set key[id=1221153905001045] name "(Ask why you were tricked.)"
set key[id=1221153905001046] name "Oh, forgive me, please!\nWe were in such a hurry that we did a terrible \
    thing.\nBut how did you come back alive?"
set key[id=1221153905001047] name "(Say you defeated $npc:24001309$.)"
set key[id=1221153905001048] name "Goodness, I didn't realize I was in the presence of someone so great.\nThen we \
    don't have to worry about the water running dry, do we?"
set key[id=1221153905001049] name "I thought I could finally relax thanks to $MyPCName$, but I was wrong.\nWe got \
    word from underground."
set key[id=1221153905001050] name "Apparently He's so furious that He demands twice the offerings.\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">(Resentfully)</font> If it weren't for $MyPCName$, the demand wouldn't have doubled..."
set key[id=1221153905001051] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Dumbfounded.)</font>"
set key[id=1221153905001052] name "So, would you go back through that gap in the rocks?\nWe'd like you to make it \
    perfectly clear that He should stop threatening us."
set key[id=1221153905001053] name "If things stay like this, the water will dry up to the bottom."
set key[id=1221153905001054] name "Seeing you back, I guess you beat $npc:24001309$ again.\nWe can finally rest \
    easy now, right?"
set key[id=1221153905001055] name "I don't like this at all! Look at them now. They're trembling in front of the \
    bugs.\nWhy on earth did the boss recommend such a clumsy company?"
set key[id=1221153905001056] name "(Ask who he means.)"
set key[id=1221153905001057] name "I'm talking about the pest control crew we hired to get rid of the bugs.\nWe \
    have to deal with the bugs before we can clean the pool behind the building."
set key[id=1221153905001058] name "Before Lydis Waterpia came in, the old pool was where people here went to \
    splash around.\nWhen we took over this place, we built a state-of-the-art water park next to the old pool."
set key[id=1221153905001059] name "There were bugs back then too. We fought a big war against them then as \
    well.\nThe bugs that survived drifted into the old pool and had been quiet until now."
set key[id=1221153905001060] name "We had little interest in the old pool, so we left the bugs alone along with \
    the pool.\nBut the water standing in the pool rotted, and the stench has spread all the way over here."
set key[id=1221153905001061] name "We couldn't leave it any longer, so we tried to drain the pool and clean \
    it,\nbut the bugs living there are putting up fierce resistance."
set key[id=1221153905001062] name "They used to be so naive, but something happened: their looks have changed and \
    they've turned vicious...\nIf we defeat their leader, $npc:23090066$, I think they might calm down...\nWill \
    you help?"
set key[id=1221153905001063] name "Chasing out bugs is this hard? Honestly..."
set key[id=1221153905001064] name "I suppose their spirits are a bit broken...\nI'll send the pest control crew \
    away and call in the cleaners."
set key[id=1221153905001065] name "I hoped that if we defeated $npc:23090066$, the group that followed it would \
    lose heart\nand leave, but instead it only made them band together.\nI hear angry bugs from other areas are \
    swarming in here too."
set key[id=1221153905001066] name "But here's the more serious part.\nI knew how tough bugs are, but \
    still,\n$npc:23090066$ is alive and well."
set key[id=1221153905001067] name "If we leave things like this, $map:02010019$ will be ruined.\nPlease step up \
    once more and take out the bugs."
set key[id=1221153905001068] name "No matter how many we wipe out, more keep coming. Honestly..."
set key[id=1221153905001069] name "I wish the bugs would get scared and never show up here again..."

# Quest dialogue of the no-feature chapters 5011-8128 quests that no pack has in English (no feature tag): our own
# English for the 1488 scriptquest rows of locale KR (or no locale) whose quest a player can get (318 quests), with
# each row's own format fields, font tags and line breaks; the player's lines are first-person choices.
file Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml kms:Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml 032f90f7273bbe7d
set key[id=102162112002202] name "I don't know how to make one."
set key[id=102162112002203] name "Oh... really? \nIf you haven't even made $item:33000063$ yet... make that \
    first.\nOnce you're used to making $item:33000063$, you'll be able to make <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000064$</font> without trouble, too."
set key[id=104223414001868] name "Happy New Year, $MyPCName$!\nNew adventure dungeons were just revealed, weren't \
    they?\nI hear various new dungeons will keep being added, so I, Bobby, am looking forward to it too!"
set key[id=104223414001869] name "Take on <font color=\"#ffd200\">one of the adventure dungeons of level 50 or \
    higher</font>, including the newly added ones.\nAs a reward, I'll give you '$item:30000722$', which is useful \
    in \n$map:63000049$.\nSadly, the 'Guardian of the Ocean' adventure dungeon is excluded, so be careful! Good \
    luck!"
set key[id=104223414001870] name "Take on <font color=\"#ffd200\">one of the adventure dungeons of level 50 or \
    higher</font>, including the newly added ones.\nAs a reward, I'll give you '$item:30000722$', which is useful \
    in \n$map:63000049$.\nSadly, the 'Guardian of the Ocean' adventure dungeon is excluded, so be careful! Good \
    luck!"
set key[id=104223414001871] name "You've already done it!\nThat's you, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=104223414001872] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
set key[id=104223414001873] name "Shall we take a nice, clean bath for the new year?\nEnjoy a half bath with the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400091$</font>!"
set key[id=104223414001874] name "Shall we take a nice, clean bath for the new year?\nEnjoy a half bath with the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400091$</font>!"
set key[id=104223414001875] name "Your skin feels so smooth now!\nI'd better hurry home today and have a half bath \
    too!"
set key[id=104223414001876] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
set key[id=104223414001877] name "A new year calls for a run on the treadmill with a fresh heart and resolve!\nWhy \
    not try running on the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400096$</font>?"
set key[id=104223414001878] name "A new year calls for a run on the treadmill with a fresh heart and resolve!\nWhy \
    not try running on the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400096$</font>?"
set key[id=104223414001879] name "Welcome back!\nHow does it feel to start the year healthy? "
set key[id=104223414001880] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
set key[id=104223414001881] name "Did you know 2017 is the Year of the Rooster?\nRaise chickens at the chicken \
    coop and get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000026$</font>.\nWith all that lucky chicken energy, it's sure to \
    be a happy year!"
set key[id=104223414001882] name "Did you know 2017 is the Year of the Rooster?\nRaise chickens at the chicken \
    coop and get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000026$</font>.\nWith all that lucky chicken energy, it's sure to \
    be a happy year!"
set key[id=104223414001883] name "Welcome back!\nMaybe it's my imagination, but you seem to be glowing, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=104223414001884] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
set key[id=104223414001885] name "Clang clang! Mining just makes all your stress melt away, doesn't it? \nMine \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000001$</font> from a copper vein.\nYou'll feel refreshed in body and mind!"
set key[id=104223414001886] name "Clang clang! Mining just makes all your stress melt away, doesn't it? \nMine \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000001$</font> from a copper vein.\nYou'll feel refreshed in body and mind!"
set key[id=104223414001887] name "Welcome back!\nI can feel how refreshed you look, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=104223414001888] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
