    very happy."
set key[id=104223414001899] name "Welcome back!\nIs $npc:11000076[gender:0]$ doing well?"
set key[id=104223414001900] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
