    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000031[gender:0]$</font> in $map:02000023$!\nThey won't show it much, but \nthey'll \
    be happier than anyone to see you, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=104223414001906] name "For the new year, go talk to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000031[gender:0]$</font> in $map:02000023$!\nThey won't show it much, but \nthey'll \
    be happier than anyone to see you, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=104223414001907] name "Welcome back!\nIs $npc:11000031[gender:0]$ doing well?"
set key[id=104223414001908] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
set key[id=104223414001909] name "For the new year, go talk to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000252[gender:0]$</font> in $map:02000100$!\n$npc:11000252[gender:0]$ is in \
    $map:02000158$.\nThey won't give you a warm welcome, but they are the great elder of Maple World...\nPlease \
    visit for my sake."
set key[id=104223414001910] name "For the new year, go talk to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000252[gender:0]$</font> in $map:02000100$!\n$npc:11000252[gender:0]$ is in \
    $map:02000158$.\nThey won't give you a warm welcome, but they are the great elder of Maple World...\nPlease \
    visit for my sake."
set key[id=104223414001911] name "Welcome back!\nWere they snappy with you again?\nThey're the type to say things \
    like that and then brag about you behind your back, so don't mind it!"
set key[id=104223414001912] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
set key[id=104223414001913] name "I'm preparing gifts for the new year, but I'm short on <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000076$</font>.\nI can't get any more chicken feathers today...\nPlease use \
    $item:33000026$ to make <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000076$</font> for me."
set key[id=104223414001914] name "I'm preparing gifts for the new year, but I'm short on <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000076$</font>.\nI can't get any more chicken feathers today...\nPlease use \
    $item:33000026$ to make <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000076$</font> for me."
set key[id=104223414001915] name "Welcome back!\nI'll give the $item:33000076$ back to you, $MyPCName$.\nI got \
    plenty of $item:33000076$ from other adventurers, so the rush is taken care of.\nThank you."
set key[id=104223414001916] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
set key[id=104223414001917] name "I'm preparing gifts for the new year, but I'm short on <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000063$</font>.\nI can't get any more $item:33000001$ today, either...\nPlease use \
    $item:33000001$ to make <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000063$</font> for me."
set key[id=104223414001918] name "I'm preparing gifts for the new year, but I'm short on <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000063$</font>.\nI can't get any more $item:33000001$ today, either...\nPlease use \
    $item:33000001$ to make <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:33000063$</font> for me."
set key[id=104223414001919] name "Welcome back!\nI'll give the $item:33000063$ back to you, $MyPCName$.\nI got \
    plenty of $item:33000063$ from other adventurers, so the rush is taken care of.\nThank you."
set key[id=104223414001920] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
set key[id=104223414001921] name "Shall we <font color=\"#ffd200\">run</font> around happily for the new \
    year?\nDon't think it's an obvious mission! Running is the basis of everything!"
set key[id=104223414001922] name "Shall we <font color=\"#ffd200\">run</font> around happily for the new \
    year?\nDon't think it's an obvious mission! Running is the basis of everything!"
set key[id=104223414001923] name "How was it? You feel a lot better now, don't you?"
set key[id=104223414001924] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nThe Year of the Rooster has begun! Let's have a great \
    2017!"
set key[id=104223414001925] name "Shall we <font color=\"#ffd200\">jump</font> around happily for the new \
    year?\nDon't think it's an obvious mission! \nJumping feels good, and it makes you taller! How great is that?"
set key[id=104223414001926] name "Shall we <font color=\"#ffd200\">jump</font> around happily for the new \
    year?\nDon't think it's an obvious mission! \nJumping feels good, and it makes you taller! How great is that?"
set key[id=104223414001927] name "How was it? Refreshing, right?"
set key[id=104223414001952] name "Perfect timing, $MyPCName$!\nFor the great holiday of Lunar New Year, I prepared \
    gifts for the adventurers of Maple World,\nbut the field bosses raided me!"
set key[id=104223414001953] name "Luckily I hadn't filled them yet, so only the empty lucky pouches were \
    taken.\nIf you, $MyPCName$, <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat the field bosses of Maple World</font> and \nbring \
    back the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000718$</font>, I'll fill them up and give them to you as gifts!"
set key[id=104223414001954] name "Luckily I hadn't filled them yet, so only the empty lucky pouches were \
    taken.\nIf you, $MyPCName$, <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat the field bosses of Maple World</font> and \nbring \
    back the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000718$</font>, I'll fill them up and give them to you as gifts!"
set key[id=104223414001955] name "Wow! Thank you so much!\nYou're the best, $MyPCName$!!!"
set key[id=106185114000004] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$!\nDid you get the $item:20300133$ and $item:30000512$ given as \
    login rewards?\nIf you have <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000512$</font>, you can open <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20300133$</font>."
set key[id=106185114000005] name "Don't have enough <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000512$</font>?\nThen defeat \
    the <font color=\"#ffd200\">elite monsters</font> that appear in the field!\nYou're sure to get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000512$</font> from them.\nYou might just turn out to be the lucky star!"
set key[id=106185114000007] name "Did you get the $item:20300133$ and $item:30000512$ given as login rewards?\nIf \
    you have <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000512$</font>, you can open <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20300133$</font>."
set key[id=106185114000008] name "Defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">elite monsters</font> in the field and you can \
    get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000512$</font>.\nThen use it to open <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20300133$</font>~!"
set key[id=106185114000009] name "Oh my, have you already opened all the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20300133$</font>?\nYou're so diligent!! I'll give you a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">special gift</font> as a reward!"
set key[id=116174614003088] name "Hello, $MyPCName$... (sniffle)\nI prepared chocolates for the upcoming \
    Valentine's Day, but...\nwhile I was exploring around Tria...\nmonsters ambushed me and I lost every single \
    one!"
set key[id=116174614003089] name "I'm always so clumsy, it's embarrassing...\nI have to hand the chocolate \
    delivery to $npc:11000012[gender:0]$ in $map:02000001$ on time, \nbut there's so little time left~"
set key[id=116174614003090] name "If you don't mind, could you defeat the monsters in $map:02000014$, \
    $map:02000092$, \nand $map:02000017$ and bring 10 $item:30001052$ \nto $npc:11000012[gender:0]$? \nI'll \
    definitely thank you, so please help me~"
set key[id=116174614003091] name "Defeat the monsters in $map:02000014$, $map:02000092$, and $map:02000017$, \nand \
    bring 10 $item:30001052$ to $npc:11000012[gender:0]$~\nPlease~ "
set key[id=116174614003092] name "Ah, you're finally here. Now I can send the delivery on \
    time.\n$npcName:11003850[gender:0]$ asked me to be sure to pass along \na thank-you gift when you came, \
    $MyPCName$. Have a nice day today too!"
set key[id=116174614003093] name "Hi~ $MyPCName$~\nOur cute Nairin is in tears because she lost something~\nShe \
    was searching $map:02000014$ and $map:02000092$... and where else, oh right, $map:02000017$! \nand monsters \
    ambushed her and took all her chocolates, they say?"
set key[id=116174614003094] name "She has to hand the chocolate delivery to $npc:11000012[gender:0]$ in \
    $map:02000001$ on time,\nso it seems she doesn't have much time~\nI want to keep teasing our Nairin to see her \
    teary face, but..."
set key[id=116174614003095] name "before she really starts crying, would you, $MyPCName$, find 10 $item:30001052$ \
    \nand bring them to $npc:11000012[gender:0]$?"
set key[id=116174614003096] name "Defeat the monsters in $map:02000014$, $map:02000092$, and $map:02000017$, \nand \
    bring 10 $item:30001052$ to $npc:11000012[gender:0]$~\nI'll go tease Nairin to my heart's content~"
set key[id=116174614003097] name "Ah, you're finally here. Now I can send the delivery on \
    time.\n$npcName:11003851[gender:1]$ asked me to be sure to pass along \na thank-you gift when you came, \
    $MyPCName$. Have a nice day today too!"
set key[id=116174614003098] name "$MyPCName$! Welcome.\nTactical Adjutant Nairin carelessly lost the goods she was \
    preparing, it seems.\nI regret having to ask you something like this, but it can't be helped..."
set key[id=116174614003099] name "I'd like you to recover the $item:30001052$ that monsters took \nwhile she was \
    exploring $map:02000014$, $map:02000092$, and $map:02000017$.\nShe certainly got around a lot!"
set key[id=116174614003100] name "It shouldn't be hard for you, $MyPCName$... Isn't that so?\nPlease deliver 10 \
    $item:30001052$ to $npc:11000012[gender:0]$ in $map:02000001$.\nI trust you can do it well."
set key[id=116174614003101] name "Defeat the monsters in $map:02000014$, $map:02000092$, and $map:02000017$, \nand \
    deliver 10 $item:30001052$ to $npc:11000012[gender:0]$!"
set key[id=116174614003102] name "Ah, you're finally here. Now I can send the delivery on \
    time.\n$npcName:11003852[gender:0]$ asked me to be sure to pass along \na thank-you gift when you came, \
    $MyPCName$. Have a nice day today too!"
set key[id=117140714003103] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nThe festival cheering on the Infernog Expedition's departure \
    has begun.\nToday, let's cheer in our own way."
set key[id=117140714003104] name "Imagine a ship gliding through that blue sky, and let's try a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">jump</font>!\nJump, jump! "
set key[id=117140714003105] name "Our jumps carry our hearts cheering on the Infernog Expedition.\nIf everyone \
    goes jump, jump, Queenstown might just start shaking!"
set key[id=117140714003106] name "I hope our cheering hearts reach the expedition members.\nHere, a special coin \
    made in honor of the expedition. \nCollect Expedition Commemorative Coins and take them to Bobby to buy \
    special items."
set key[id=117140714003107] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nWith the hopes of everyone in Maple World, we cheer on the \
    Infernog Expedition's departure.\nLet's spend today energetically and cheer together. "
set key[id=117140714003108] name "Shall we <font color=\"#ffd200\">run with all our might</font> until the winter \
    wind runs away?\nAnd shall we shout? Go, Infernog Expedition!\nIt's going to be such an energetic day."
set key[id=117140714003109] name "Let's <font color=\"#ffd200\">run with all our might</font> until our cheers \
    reach the Infernog Expedition members!\nI just came back from a run myself. \nYou know how good running every \
    day is for your health, right?"
set key[id=117140714003110] name "I'll remember how you ran and cheered with all your might, $MyPCName$.\nHere's \
    an Expedition Commemorative Coin. \nYou can buy all sorts of things at the Infernog Expedition Departure \
    Commemorative Shop that Bobby runs."
set key[id=117140714003111] name "Actually, I wanted to join the Infernog Expedition as a member too.\nBut... they \
    told me to go build up my skills first... Well, that's fine!\nI plan to cheer on the Infernog Expedition in my \
    own way. "
set key[id=117140714003112] name "Isn't today's weather perfect for gathering and mining? \nLet's cheer on the \
    Infernog Expedition and heave-ho, <font color=\"#ffd200\">how about some gathering or mining?</font>\nGo, \
    gathering and mining!"
set key[id=117140714003113] name "Anything will do! <font color=\"#ffd200\">Try gathering or mining.</font>\nAnd \
    as you heave-ho mining, wish in your heart for our expedition to win.\nYou get minerals and you cheer, isn't \
    that rewarding?"
set key[id=117140714003114] name "Huh? $MyPCName$, it looks like your arms have gotten muscles.\nGathering and \
    mining really are great strength exercise!\nTo thank you for joining today's cheering event too, here's an \
    Expedition Commemorative Coin."
set key[id=117140714003115] name "Shall we hold our own cheering event again today to cheer on the Infernog \
    Expedition's departure?\nI've picked harvesting for today! "
set key[id=117140714003116] name "Crops in Maple World are strictly pesticide-free and organic. \nFresh produce is \
    really good for our bodies. \nTo show our support today, <font color=\"#ffd200\">shall we harvest livestock or \
    crops?</font>"
set key[id=117140714003117] name "Anything will do! <font color=\"#ffd200\">Harvest livestock or \
    crops.</font>\nHarvesting something is such a joy.\nJust as the harvest bears fruit, I hope victory comes to \
    the expedition's challenge. Heave-ho, heave-ho!"
set key[id=117140714003118] name "What did you harvest, $MyPCName$?\nJust as the harvest bears fruit, I wonder if \
    the expedition members won too?\nI have Expedition Commemorative Coins ready for everyone who cheered. "
set key[id=117140714003119] name "I hear some people stay indoors because the weather is chilly these \
    days.\nAnyone cheering on our brave Infernog Expedition members certainly shouldn't do that!\nHow about \
    cheering on the Infernog Expedition by swimming today?"
set key[id=117140714003120] name "Dip into the clean waters of Maple World and splash about, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">swim!</font>\nAnd shall we shout once? Go, Infernog Expedition!"
set key[id=117140714003121] name "Go, Infernog Expedition! Splash! Splash! <font color=\"#ffd200\">Swim</font> \
    with all your might!\nSwimming is really good exercise. \nLet's cheer on the expedition members' challenge and \
    improve our own health too."
set key[id=117140714003122] name "You're soaked through. Don't worry, in pleasant Maple World you'll dry in no \
    time.\nAs a reward for joining today's cheering event, here's an Expedition Commemorative Coin.\nYou know how \
    to use it, right? Just buy all sorts of things from Bobby."
set key[id=117140714003123] name "People often think of fishing as a quiet hobby. \nBut we know the thrill of \
    fishing, don't we?\nThe thrill of landing a big catch... I wonder if winning the battle against Infernog would \
    feel like that? "
set key[id=117140714003124] name "Praying the expedition wins its battle against Infernog, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">how about doing some fishing?</font>\nI've picked fishing as today's cheering \
    mission.\nLet's try to hook a big one!"
set key[id=117140714003125] name "Just as we pray for the expedition to win its battle against Infernog, let's \
    pray for a big catch and <font color=\"#ffd200\">go fishing.</font>\nYou fish, you cheer, and you even get an \
    Expedition Commemorative Coin as a reward. Isn't that wonderful?"
set key[id=117140714003126] name "Did you enjoy the fishing?\nI wonder whether the brave warriors of Maple World \
    won their battle against Infernog.\nHere's an Expedition Commemorative Coin made to cheer them on. "
set key[id=119184914000010] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$!\n$npc:11000508[gender:1]$ says she prepared delicious \
    chocolate for Valentine's Day.\nGo find $npc:11000508[gender:1]$ in $map:02000203$."
set key[id=119185814000011] name "Welcome~ $MyPCName$!\nIt's Valentine's Day, so I tried making chocolates...\nI \
    can't promise how they taste, but give them a try~"
set key[id=119190314000012] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$!\n$npc:11000508[gender:1]$ says she prepared delicious \
    chocolate for Valentine's Day.\nGo find $npc:11000508[gender:1]$ in $map:02000203$."
set key[id=123170914000013] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$!\nDo you know about Five-Color Pouches? They hold a variety of \
    items.\nYou can only get Five-Color Pouches between 2/4 and 2/25, so don't miss your chance\nand be sure to \
    use some."
set key[id=123170914000014] name "You haven't used 30 Five-Color Pouches yet."
set key[id=123170914000015] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$!\nWow~! You used 30 Five-Color Pouches. $MyPCName$, I'm amazed \
    by your effort."
set key[id=123170914000016] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$!\nGo find $npc:11000001[gender:0]$ in $map:02000076$.\nHe says \
    he's prepared a special gift for the New Year holiday."
set key[id=123170914000017] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$!\nGo find $npc:11000001[gender:0]$ in $map:02000076$.\nHe says \
    he's prepared a special gift for the New Year holiday."
set key[id=123170914000018] name "$MyPCName$, did you come to pay your respects? What a polite young one.\nI can't \
    send you off empty-handed when you came all this way on purpose. Here, take this."
set key[id=202133114003127] name "They say people give candy on White Day to share their feelings.\nBut I've \
    figured out a way to use this candy\nfar more efficiently."
set key[id=202133114003128] name "Of course, the recipe is already perfectly prepared.\n$MyPCName$. If you get me \
    the sugar cane\nfor my candy recipe, the job becomes very easy."
set key[id=202133114003129] name "Candy Balloons have floated up all over Maple World.\nYour task is very \
    simple.\nInvestigate the Candy Balloons and obtain sugar cane."
set key[id=202133114003130] name "Take 10 sugar cane to Natalie in Tria\nand you'll learn about my perfect candy \
    recipe.\nLet me stress that opportunities like this are rare."
set key[id=202133114003131] name "You haven't set off yet?\nYou get the sugar cane from the Candy Balloons.\nI \
    expected it wouldn't be difficult, though..."
set key[id=202133114003132] name "Mr. Mason handed me a crumpled memo and asked me to have the candy made \nfrom \
    the sugar cane you bring, $MyPCName$, evaluated.\nI was able to make a tangy, unique-tasting candy, just like \
    the recipe said.\nHere, you can taste it and judge for yourself, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=202133114003133] name "I hear the day for giving and getting candy is coming up.\nDo you know anything \
    about it? That Mason fellow has been telling the whole town\nhe has the perfect candy recipe..."
set key[id=202133114003134] name "What's so special about candy!\nDoesn't it just need to taste good enough\nto \
    toss one in your mouth when it's bored, right?"
set key[id=202133114003135] name "I hear Candy Balloons have appeared in Maple World.\nIf it were me, I'd take the \
    whole balloon.\nI don't know if you've got that kind of nerve, though..."
set key[id=202133114003136] name "Investigate a Candy Balloon and you'll get sugar cane.\nTake 10 sugar cane to \
    Natalie in Tria.\nI'll prove the candy made my way tastes much better!"
set key[id=202133114003137] name "What are you dawdling for? Find 10 sugar cane\nfrom the Candy Balloons! Natalie \
    will be waiting in Tria."
set key[id=202133114003138] name "Mr. Condor handed me a big memo and asked me to appraise the candy made \nfrom \
    the sugar cane you bring, $MyPCName$.\nWith this, I think the mild flavor really comes through. I'll give you \
    the candy, so\n$MyPCName$, you keep it. Mr. Condor won't remember anyway..."
set key[id=202205914001988] name "Happy Valentine's Day, $MyPCName$!\nI hear Mendel, the best baker in Maple \
    World, has prepared a special event \nfor Valentine's Day!\nIf you just bring the chocolate ingredients, you \
    can get chocolate Mendel made himself!\nWe can't miss that, right?"
set key[id=202205914001989] name "The chocolate ingredients you need are 5 $item:20000452$, 3 $item:30000729$, \n1 \
    $item:30000730$, and 5 $item:20000027$.\nYou can get $item:20000452$ by investigating the choco ball balloons \
    found around the fields,\n$item:30000729$ by defeating field bosses,\nand $item:30000730$ by completing the \
    'Worthy of a Fresh Egg' quest."
set key[id=202205914001990] name "The chocolate ingredients you need are 5 $item:20000452$, 3 $item:30000729$, \n1 \
    $item:30000730$, and 5 $item:20000027$.\nYou can get $item:20000452$ by investigating the choco ball balloons \
    found around the fields,\n$item:30000729$ by defeating field bosses,\nand $item:30000730$ by completing the \
