set key[id=407170214000071] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! I'm $npc:11001002[gender:1]$~ \nThe Queenstown Animal Love \
    Association is running an <font color=\"#ffd200\">Animal Love Campaign</font>.\nWe let adventurers who cherish \
    and love animals\nwelcome a <font color=\"#ffd200\">lovable pet</font>. "
set key[id=407170214000072] name "At the Queenstown Animal Love Association shelter, animals that were abandoned \
    or mistreated by people\nare waiting to meet a <font color=\"#ffd200\">kind-hearted new owner</font>.\nSo they \
    won't be hurt again, we only place them with people who are ready to meet a pet. "
set key[id=407170214000073] name "I'm ready to meet a pet, so I'd like to adopt one."
set key[id=407170214000074] name "Looking at your eyes, $MyPCName$, I can tell you'll really cherish and love \
    animals!\nThen I'll sign you up so you can join the puppy adoption event.\nIf you join, you can take the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">black puppy</font> here home as your <font color=\"#ffd200\">pet</font>. \nThe mother dog \
    had lots of puppies at the shelter, and they're looking for owners. "
set key[id=407170214000075] name "During the event, do the daily <font color=\"#ffd200\">Animal Love \
    Campaign</font> quest I give you, \nand if you bring me <font color=\"#ffd200\">10</font> of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000535$</font> you get as a reward,\nyou can adopt a cute puppy.\nOh, and even if \
    you bring lots of medals, I'll only do the adoption <font color=\"#ffd200\">exactly once</font>!"
set key[id=407170214000076] name "During the event, do the daily <font color=\"#ffd200\">Animal Love \
    Campaign</font> quest I give you, \nand if you bring me <font color=\"#ffd200\">10</font> of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000535$</font> you get as a reward,\nyou can adopt a cute puppy.\nOh, and even if \
    you bring lots of medals, I'll only do the adoption <font color=\"#ffd200\">exactly once</font>!"
set key[id=407170214000077] name "Wow, you gathered <font color=\"#ffd200\">10</font> of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000535$</font>.\nHere~ take this <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20300236$</font>. \
    \nPlease take good care of your cute puppy friend! "
set key[id=407170214000078] name "The weather's so warm. \nA walk with a puppy on a day like this would be \
    wonderful.\nPuppies are lively animals that love walks!"
set key[id=407170214000079] name "To walk with a puppy, strong stamina is a must!\nShall we run happily, breathing \
    with nature? "
set key[id=407170214000080] name "To walk with a puppy, strong stamina is a must!\nShall we run happily, breathing \
    with nature? "
set key[id=407170214000081] name "Wow, you're back fast!\nWith you, who runs so well, $MyPCName$, the puppy will \
    be so happy!"
set key[id=407170214000082] name "When the spring breeze blows gently, you feel like swimming and splashing in the \
    water!\nPuppies love playing in water and are good swimmers.\nOf course, when they're little they're sometimes \
    a bit afraid of water."
set key[id=407170214000083] name "In that case, if their owner swims beautifully in front of them,\nthe puppy will \
    stop fearing water and learn to swim.\nShow them how you <font color=\"#ffd200\">swim</font> in the water!"
set key[id=407170214000084] name "If the owner swims beautifully in front of them,\nthe puppy will stop fearing \
    water and learn to swim.\nShow them how you <font color=\"#ffd200\">swim</font>! "
set key[id=407170214000085] name "Wow, you're back fast!\nI think $MyPCName$'s puppy will learn to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">swim</font> quickly!"
set key[id=407170214000086] name "Did you know? Puppies run around in the snow not because they like snow,\nbut \
    because the skin on their paws is thin and the cold bites. \nMaybe that's why puppies' paw pads are thin and \
    light-colored. \nWhen you see pink paw pads... ooh~ they're jelly-soft and so cute! "
set key[id=407170214000087] name "You can see a puppy's paw pads best when they hop around.\nIf you want to show \
    off your puppy's cute paws to others,\nhopping around together is the best~\nFeel light, like you're wearing \
    new shoes! Hop, hop, <font color=\"#ffd200\">jump</font>!"
set key[id=407170214000088] name "You can see a puppy's paw pads best when they hop around.\nIf you want to show \
    off your puppy's cute paws to others,\nhopping around together is the best~\nFeel light, like you're wearing \
    new shoes! Hop, hop, <font color=\"#ffd200\">jump</font>!"
set key[id=407170214000089] name "$MyPCName$, your jumping skill is impressive!\nI can't wait to see $MyPCName$ \
    adopt a puppy and <font color=\"#ffd200\">jump</font> together~"
set key[id=407170214000090] name "Not sure how to get close to animals, or finding it hard? \nIt helps to meet a \
    well-trained animal that's friendly with people.\nFor example, like Carly the cat who lives in a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400004$</font>."
set key[id=407170214000091] name "Call Carly the cat from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400004$</font>.\nYou'll find one in your home or in other people's homes!\nPlay with \
    her about five times and you'll get close to animals more easily."
set key[id=407170214000092] name "Call Carly the cat from the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400004$</font>.\nYou'll find one in your home or in other people's homes!\nPlay with \
    her about five times and you'll get close to animals more easily."
set key[id=407170214000093] name "How is it? Do you feel closer to cats now? \nJust do the same after you adopt a \
    puppy and play with it! "
set key[id=407170214000094] name "You say you don't know how to play with animals? \nIf you meet an animal that \
    plays well with people, you'll pick it up naturally.\nI hear the monkey sitting on the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400118$</font> is a seesaw master,\nand loves playing with people!"
set key[id=407170214000095] name "You'll find a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400118$</font> in your home or in \
    other people's homes.\nRide the seesaw with the monkey about five times and come back. \nIt'll be a lot of \
    fun."
set key[id=407170214000096] name "You'll find a <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400118$</font> in your home or in \
    other people's homes.\nRide the seesaw with the monkey about five times and come back. \nIt'll be a lot of \
    fun."
set key[id=407170214000097] name "How was it? Did you have fun playing with an animal? \nYou'll feel that same joy \
    after adopting a puppy! "
set key[id=407170214000098] name "Sometimes puppies can't adjust in crowded places and feel afraid. \nBut we have \
    to help them get used to it. "
set key[id=407170214000099] name "I hear lots of people gather at events hosted by the Twingo MC called \
    $npc:11000787[gender:0]$, like <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:61000001$, $map:61000002$, \
    $map:61000007$,\n$map:61000006$, $map:61000004$, $map:61000003$, $map:61000008$</font>.\nThey say it gets \
    quite crowded, which might be too much for a young puppy.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Could you visit one of \
    those</font> and tell me if that's really true?"
set key[id=407170214000100] name "I hear lots of people gather at events hosted by the Twingo MC called \
    $npc:11000787[gender:0]$, like <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:61000001$, $map:61000002$, \
    $map:61000007$,\n$map:61000006$, $map:61000004$, $map:61000003$, $map:61000008$</font>.\nThey say it gets \
    quite crowded, which might be too much for a young puppy.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Could you visit one of \
    those</font> and tell me if that's really true?"
set key[id=407170214000101] name "How was it? Was the event venue really crowded and noisy? "
set key[id=407170214000102] name "It's a bit crowded, but I think the puppy would have fun if we went together."
set key[id=407170214000103] name "It's so crowded, I think a young puppy would have a hard time."
set key[id=407170214000104] name "I see how much you want to be with your puppy everywhere, $MyPCName$. \nGood \
    work! Thank you for telling me~"
set key[id=407170214000105] name "I see~ It's best not to take a very young puppy somewhere it can't handle.\nGood \
    work! Thank you for telling me~"
set key[id=407170214000106] name "I heard there's a place puppies are famous for loving these days. \nA seaside \
    where monkeys throw things around... with waves rolling in...\nWhat was it called..."
set key[id=407170214000107] name "Ah! I remember! It was <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000003$</font>!\n$MyPCName$, could you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000003$</font> yourself and \nfind out why puppies like it there? \nYou can get there \
    with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Maple Arcade'</font> menu at the bottom of the screen! "
set key[id=407170214000108] name "$MyPCName$! Please go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000003$</font> yourself \
    and \nfind out why puppies like it there~\nTo go to $map:51000003$, press the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Maple \
    Arcade'</font> menu at the bottom of the screen!"
set key[id=407170214000109] name "Good work, $MyPCName$!\nDid you find out... why puppies like <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000003$</font>?"
set key[id=407170214000110] name "I think it's because they get to run a lot."
set key[id=407170214000111] name "I have no idea."
set key[id=407170214000112] name "Aha~ that's quite convincing. Puppies love exercise, after all. \n$MyPCName$, \
    you're clever! "
set key[id=407170214000113] name "True... I couldn't figure it out either. \nAfter you adopt a puppy, ask it \
    yourself! It might answer~"
set key[id=407170214000114] name "I heard there's a place puppies are famous for loving these days. \nSomething \
    like a farm... where strong spring vines grow.  \nWhat was it called..."
set key[id=407170214000115] name "Ah! I remember! It was <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font>!\n$MyPCName$, could you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font> yourself and \nfind out why puppies like it there? \nYou can get there \
    with the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Maple Arcade'</font> menu at the bottom of the screen! "
set key[id=407170214000116] name "$MyPCName$! Please go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font> yourself \
    and \nfind out why puppies like it there~\nTo go to $map:51000001$, press the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Maple \
    Arcade'</font> menu at the bottom of the screen!"
set key[id=407170214000117] name "Good work, $MyPCName$!\nDid you find out... why puppies like <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font>?"
set key[id=407170214000118] name "It was fun watching monsters get bounced off the springs."
set key[id=407170214000119] name "I have no idea."
set key[id=407170214000120] name "Is that so? I haven't seen that yet... I'll have to go play there next \
    time.\nThank you for telling me, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=407170214000121] name "True... I couldn't figure it out either. \nAfter you adopt a puppy, ask it \
    yourself! It might answer~"
set key[id=407170214000122] name "I hear the Queenstown Animal Love Association folks do something a lot with \
    their puppies these days. \nIt's <font color=\"#ffd200\">fishing</font>. You can spend time and play \
    together,\nand also collect food for the other animals at the shelter."
set key[id=407170214000123] name "Why not join in on this good cause, $MyPCName$? \nSit by the water right now and \
    start <font color=\"#ffd200\">fishing</font>!"
set key[id=407170214000124] name "Why not join in on this good cause, $MyPCName$? \nSit by the water right now and \
    start <font color=\"#ffd200\">fishing</font>!"
set key[id=407170214000125] name "Did you have a good time? \nAfter you adopt a puppy, enjoy fishing together with \
    it! "
set key[id=407170214000126] name "They say animals love music too, and react especially to soft melodies.\nMusic \
    is a mysterious magic that transcends language and heals every living thing. \n$MyPCName$, would you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">play music</font> for the animals? "
set key[id=407170214000127] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Play an instrument</font> and heal the animals with \
    beautiful music.\nAny instrument, any score will do. \nPlease let all the living things in the world hear \
    beautiful music. "
set key[id=407170214000128] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Play an instrument</font> and heal the animals with \
    beautiful music.\nAny instrument, any score will do. \nPlease let all the living things in the world hear \
    beautiful music. "
set key[id=407170214000129] name "Did you have a beautiful time? \nSomewhere, a wounded soul may have been healed \
    by your <font color=\"#ffd200\">playing</font>, $MyPCName$.\nAfter you adopt a puppy, play beautiful music for \
    it now and then."
set key[id=413174614003139] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nYou know about the Mushking Championship, right? \nWhat \
    are you waiting for, join in! \nEvery day from 7 PM to 10 PM! Head to Primordial Mushroom Island, where the \
    Mushking Championship is held."
set key[id=413174614003140] name "Here is today's mission. \nGo to Primordial Mushroom Island and run the 150 m \
    dash!\nI hope you survive and complete the mission. "
set key[id=413174614003141] name "Hurry to Primordial Mushroom Island!\nOff you go into the heated action of the \
    Mushking Championship!"
set key[id=413174614003142] name "You cleared today's mission!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> I promised!\nTake the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> \
    to Bobby's event shop \nand you can buy great reward items. "
set key[id=413174614003143] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nYou know about the Mushking Championship, right? \nWhat \
    are you waiting for, join in! \nEvery day from 7 PM to 10 PM! Head to Primordial Mushroom Island, where the \
    Mushking Championship is held."
set key[id=413174614003144] name "Here is today's mission. \nGo to Primordial Mushroom Island and jump 30 \
    times!\nI hope you survive and complete the mission. "
set key[id=413174614003145] name "Hurry to Primordial Mushroom Island!\nOff you go into the heated action of the \
