    to Bobby's event shop \nand you can buy great reward items. "
set key[id=413174614003147] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nYou know about the Mushking Championship, right? \nWhat \
    are you waiting for, join in! \nEvery day from 7 PM to 10 PM! Head to Primordial Mushroom Island, where the \
    Mushking Championship is held."
set key[id=413174614003148] name "Here is today's mission. \nGo to Primordial Mushroom Island and survive for 5 \
    minutes or more!\nI hope you survive and complete the mission. "
set key[id=413174614003149] name "Hurry to Primordial Mushroom Island!\nOff you go into the heated action of the \
    Mushking Championship!"
set key[id=413174614003150] name "You cleared today's mission!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> I promised!\nTake the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> \
    to Bobby's event shop \nand you can buy great reward items. "
set key[id=413174614003151] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nYou know about the Mushking Championship, right? \nWhat \
    are you waiting for, join in! \nEvery day from 7 PM to 10 PM! Head to Primordial Mushroom Island, where the \
    Mushking Championship is held."
set key[id=413174614003152] name "Here is today's mission. \nToday's mission is very simple. Just arrive at \
    Primordial Mushroom Island and the mission is complete!\nThis mission is a giveaway, and not one I hand out \
    every day."
set key[id=413174614003153] name "Hurry to Primordial Mushroom Island!\nOff you go into the heated action of the \
    Mushking Championship!"
set key[id=413174614003154] name "You cleared today's mission!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> I promised!\nTake the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> \
    to Bobby's event shop \nand you can buy great reward items. "
set key[id=413174614003155] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nYou know about the Mushking Championship, right? \nWhat \
    are you waiting for, join in! \nEvery day from 7 PM to 10 PM! Head to Primordial Mushroom Island, where the \
    Mushking Championship is held."
set key[id=413174614003156] name "Here is today's mission. \nGo to Primordial Mushroom Island and use the Magic \
    Boom skill 3 or more times.\nI hope you survive and complete the mission. "
set key[id=413174614003157] name "Hurry to Primordial Mushroom Island!\nOff you go into the heated action of the \
    Mushking Championship!"
set key[id=413174614003158] name "You cleared today's mission!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> I promised!\nTake the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> \
    to Bobby's event shop \nand you can buy great reward items. "
set key[id=417214414003159] name "$MyPCName$, you know what happens every Friday, Saturday and Sunday, right?\nA \
    mushroom king called <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mushking</font> appears in $map:02000423$!\nDon't tell me you \
    didn't know?"
set key[id=417214414003160] name "Oh, my! \nThey say all the hot heroes of Maple World are in $map:02000423$ right \
    now.\nWe can't leave you out, $MyPCName$. Heading straight to $map:02000423$ is today's mission."
set key[id=417214414003161] name "Hurry to $map:02000423$ before it's too late. \nLots of heroes have gathered to \
    defeat the greedy <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mushking</font>. \nWhen you come back, I'll give you a nice gift. "
set key[id=417214414003162] name "Oh! You've been to $map:02000423$, haven't you?\nHow did I know? \nBecause you \
    smell strongly of mushroom spores, $MyPCName$.\nYou must have completed the mission, so here's a gift for you! \
    "
set key[id=417214414003163] name "$MyPCName$, what did you do last weekend?\nYou surely met that character called \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mushking</font> in $map:02000423$, right?\nThey say he shows up every Friday, Saturday \
    and Sunday. "
set key[id=417214414003164] name "He showed up again this week after all! \nAll the heroes in Maple World who can \
    fight have gone to $map:02000423$.\nToday's mission is to go to $map:02000423$ and run the 100 meter dash. \nI \
    hope you manage to run 100 meters while dodging the fearsome <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mushking</font>. "
set key[id=417214414003165] name "Hurry to $map:02000423$ before it's too late. \nRunning 100 meters while dodging \
    the greedy <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mushking</font>, isn't that cool? \nWhen you come back, I'll give you a \
    nice gift. "
set key[id=417214414003166] name "Oh! You've been to $map:02000423$, haven't you? \nAnd you ran the 100 meters \
    too?\nYou really are wonderful, $MyPCName$. Here's your gift!"
set key[id=417214414003167] name "$MyPCName$, did you get the <font color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font>?\nYou \
    absolutely need it to face the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mushking</font> in $map:02000423$.\nThey say if you \
    rashly take on the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mushking</font> without <font \
    color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font>, you might get a skin disease. "
set key[id=417214414003168] name "I have a task for this weekend!\nUse <font \
    color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font> 3 times. \nOf course you can use this cream anywhere, but using it in \
    $map:02000423$ is best, right? "
set key[id=417214414003169] name "Hurry to $map:02000423$ before it's too late. \nSpend this weekend with <font \
    color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font> and your skin will turn silky smooth. \nIt may not look it, but it's \
    quite good for the skin. "
set key[id=417214414003170] name "Your skin is glowing. Did you put something good on it?\nAh! You used <font \
    color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font>, didn't you? \nYou really are wonderful, $MyPCName$. Here's your \
    gift!"
set key[id=421173114000130] name "Emergency!\nMonsters are surging in even harder from the Land of Darkness!"
set key[id=421173114000131] name "This is no time to be chatting like this.\nFirst, we have to take care of those \
    monsters."
set key[id=421173114000132] name "Whew... did it finally calm down... \nGreat work!"
set key[id=421200214000133] name "An urgent telegram came from $npcName:11000033[gender:0]$ at $map:02000023$.\nIt \
    says something troubling seems to have happened in a place called $map:02000180$...\nPlease go and find out \
    what's going on!"
set key[id=421200214000134] name "An urgent telegram came from $npcName:11000033[gender:0]$ at $map:02000023$.\nIt \
    says something troubling seems to have happened in a place called $map:02000180$...\nPlease go and find out \
    what's going on!"
set key[id=421200214000135] name "I really can't live like this, cluck!"
set key[id=421200214000136] name "As if my ears weren't sore enough from those $npc:21000280$ guys, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000007$</font> that kicks up swirling\nwhirlwinds all the time makes dust clog my \
    eyes, nose and mouth, cluck!\nWhen that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000007$</font> shows up, I'd like you \
    to chase it far away, cluck!"
set key[id=421200214000137] name "As if my ears weren't sore enough from those $npc:21000280$ guys, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000007$</font> that kicks up swirling\nwhirlwinds all the time makes dust clog my \
    eyes, nose and mouth, cluck!\nWhen that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000007$</font> shows up, I'd like you \
    to chase it far away, cluck!"
set key[id=421200214000138] name "For a human... you're someone I can trust, cluck!\nThanks, cluck!!"
set key[id=421200214000139] name "Oh right! I heard $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ is urgently looking for you at \
    $map:02000001$, cluck~!\nBetter hurry over, cluck!"
set key[id=421200214000140] name "Oh right! I heard $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ is urgently looking for you at \
    $map:02000001$, cluck~!\nBetter hurry over, cluck!"
set key[id=421200214000141] name "Ah, you're back!\nThe Empress was asking for you, and I wandered around for ages \
    wondering where you went!"
set key[id=421200214000142] name "Phew... I'm swamped...\nI heard an emergency rescue signal came from \
    $map:02000231$...\nI'd like you to go find out what's going on and sort it out."
set key[id=421200214000143] name "Phew... I'm swamped...\nI heard an emergency rescue signal came from \
    $map:02000231$...\nI'd like you to go find out what's going on and sort it out."
set key[id=421200214000144] name "Hmm... "
set key[id=421200214000145] name "Ah, did you come because of the rescue signal?\nWell, it doesn't matter if you \
    didn't... but as you can see, we have a performance coming up,\nand with these monsters around we can't go \
    ahead with it.\nCould you take care of those monsters?"
set key[id=421200214000146] name "With these monsters around, we can't go ahead with the performance.\nCould you \
    take care of those monsters?"
set key[id=421200214000147] name "Thank you for helping."
set key[id=421200214000148] name "A message came from $map:02000153$ in $map:02000100$ telling you to \
    return.\nSomething urgent must have come up, so you should go."
set key[id=421200214000149] name "A message came from $map:02000153$ in $map:02000100$ telling you to \
    return.\nSomething urgent must have come up, so you should go."
set key[id=421200214000150] name "Ah, you got the $map:02000231$ business sorted out, right?\nGood work! Now let's \
    get back to our real job~!"
set key[id=423173514000151] name "We've received a report that monsters that gobble up flowing time are running \
    wild around $map:02000262$. \nCould you look into what's going on?"
set key[id=423173514000152] name "We've received a report that monsters that gobble up flowing time are running \
    wild around $map:02000262$. \nCould you look into what's going on?"
set key[id=423173514000153] name "Waaah... I want to grow up fast... "
set key[id=423173514000154] name "The Ludibrium monsters here keep slurping up time... so time can't\nflow and has \
    just stopped dead!\nI want to grow up fast... please help time flow again."
set key[id=423173514000155] name "The Ludibrium monsters here keep slurping up time... so time can't\nflow and has \
    just stopped dead!\nI want to grow up fast... please help time flow again."
set key[id=423173514000156] name "Now... time can flow again, right?\nI'll fold my hands and wait... See you again \
    when I've grown up soon!"
set key[id=423173514000157] name "Once time starts flowing, you'll grow faster too, $MyPCName$... oh no...\nThen \
    you might get old quickly. Hurry back before you get old!"
set key[id=423173514000158] name "Once time starts flowing, you'll grow faster too, $MyPCName$... oh no...\nThen \
    you might get old quickly. Hurry back before you get old!"
set key[id=423173514000159] name "You're back. I heard the story from a child named Corin. Whether time really \
    stopped because\nthe monsters ate it... we'll see by watching."
set key[id=519155114002679] name "Help us, Super Hero $MyPCName$!\n$MyPCName$, can you hear the voices of all the \
    adventurers \nwaiting for you? "
set key[id=519155114002680] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">an adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>,\nand collect \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000778$</font>. \nI'll exchange them for the $item:20300877$, which holds all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$!"
set key[id=519155114002681] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">an adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>,\nand collect \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000778$</font>. \nI'll exchange them for the $item:20300877$, which holds all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$!"
set key[id=519155114002682] name "You helped adventurers in need and cleared this many dungeons?\nYou truly are a \
    Guardian of Maple, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=519155114002683] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nMaple World has so many dungeons where you can experience \
    new adventures.\nIt makes Ruby sad that so many people find the dungeons hard.\nIf strong people like you, \
    $MyPCName$, joined them, there'd be no problem."
set key[id=519155114002684] name "I hear that if you clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> \
    together with <font color=\"#ffd200\">an adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 \
    dungeons</font>,\nyou can get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000778$</font>.\nBring me the $item:30000778$ \
    and I'll exchange them for the $item:20300877$, which holds \nall kinds of valuable items. Give it a try!"
set key[id=519155114002685] name "I hear that if you clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> \
    together with <font color=\"#ffd200\">an adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 \
    dungeons</font>,\nyou can get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000778$</font>.\nBring me the $item:30000778$ \
    and I'll exchange them for the $item:20300877$, which holds \nall kinds of valuable items. Give it a try!"
set key[id=519155114002686] name "Wow! You've already collected this many?\nHere's the $item:20300877$.\nYou \
    really are strong and kind, $MyPCName$.\nNo wonder they call you, $MyPCName$, a Hero of Maple!"
set key[id=523000014002691] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nDid you hear about the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Immortal \
    Weapon event</font> from Ruby?\nHere's how to get an <font color=\"#ffd200\">Immortal Weapon enchanted to \
    level 13</font>!\nAll you have to do is finish one simple mission every day!"
set key[id=523000014002692] name "Today's mission is... \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Defeat \
    $npc:23000054$</font>!\nYou need it to prove you're worthy of carrying $item:30000777$,\nso show me how strong \
    you are, $MyPCName$!\nIt's not hard at all if you team up with other adventurers!"
set key[id=523000014002693] name "Today's mission is... \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Defeat \
    $npc:23000054$</font>!\nYou need it to prove you're worthy of carrying $item:30000777$,\nso show me how strong \
