set key[id=523000014002755] name "Maple World is all abuzz right now \nwith news that you can get a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Legendary Immortal Weapon enchanted to level 13</font> \njust by joining the event, isn't \
    it?\nA powerful weapon filled with the power of the immortal Balrog! How do you get one, you ask?"
set key[id=523000014002756] name "Accept the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Worthy of the Immortal Aura'</font> quest \
    from my twin brother Bobby every day!\nComplete it and you'll get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000777$</font> as a reward!\nCollect that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000777$</font> and bring it to me, and I'll trade it for $item:20300876$!"
set key[id=523000014002757] name "Accept the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Worthy of the Immortal Aura'</font> quest \
    from my twin brother Bobby every day!\nComplete it and you'll get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000777$</font> as a reward!\nCollect that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000777$</font> and bring it to me, and I'll trade it for $item:20300876$!"
set key[id=523000014002758] name "That's plenty of $item:30000777$!\nHere's the $item:20300876$ filled with the \
    power of Balrog, just as I promised!\nYou're more than worthy of an Immortal Weapon, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=615215914002767] name "Please become the Great First Knight, $MyPCName$!\nInnocent adventurers are \
    falling victim to the ever-stronger aura of evil. \nPlease protect the peace of Maple World!"
set key[id=615215914002768] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>, \nand bring back \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000784$</font>. \nI'll trade it for $item:20300920$, which can get you all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$~"
set key[id=615215914002769] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>, \nand bring back \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000784$</font>. \nI'll trade it for $item:20300920$, which can get you all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$~"
set key[id=615215914002770] name "You helped adventurers in need and cleared this many dungeons?\nYou're truly a \
    great knight of Maple World!"
set key[id=615215914002771] name "$MyPCName$, can you hear the voices of the adventurers \nwaiting for \
    $MyPCName$'s help? \nNow that the aura of evil is growing, how reassuring it would be to have someone as \
    strong as \n$MyPCName$ by their side!"
set key[id=615215914002772] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>, \nand bring back \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000784$</font>. \nI'll trade it for $item:20300920$, which can get you all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$~"
set key[id=615215914002773] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>, \nand bring back \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000784$</font>. \nI'll trade it for $item:20300920$, which can get you all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$~"
set key[id=615215914002774] name "Wow! You've already gathered this many?\nHere's your $item:20300920$.\nIsn't a \
    true knight someone just like you, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=619114714002775] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nYou heard the news that the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Immortal Weapon event Season 2 is on</font>, right?\nA special time to get an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Immortal Weapon enchanted to level 13</font>!\nAll you have to do is finish one simple \
    mission every day!"
set key[id=619114714002776] name "Today's mission?!\nIt's <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat \
    $npc:23000054$'</font>!\nDefeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000054$</font> and prove you're worthy of \
    carrying $item:30000785$!\nIt's not hard at all if you team up with other adventurers!"
