set key[id=619114714002839] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nWith the ancient god $npc:23000071$ on the scene, tension \
    is hanging over Maple World.\nTo help adventurers take on Zakum even a little, \nI've prepared a Balrog weapon \
    giveaway event where you can get a <font color=\"#ffd200\">Legendary Immortal Weapon enchanted to level \
    13</font>, \nSeason 2~\n"
set key[id=619114714002840] name "This time too, bring me <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000785$</font> and I'll \
    trade it for $item:20300876$.\nYou can get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000785$</font> from my twin brother \
    Bobby next to me as a reward for finishing the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Worthy of the Immortal Aura'</font> \
    \ndaily quest.\nIn Season 2 you can also get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000785$</font> through the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">stamp event</font>,\nso be sure to trade it for $item:20300876$!"
set key[id=619114714002841] name "This time too, bring me <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000785$</font> and I'll \
    trade it for $item:20300876$.\nYou can get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000785$</font> from my twin brother \
    Bobby next to me as a reward for finishing the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Worthy of the Immortal Aura'</font> \
    \ndaily quest.\nIn Season 2 you can also get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000785$</font> through the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">stamp event</font>,\nso be sure to trade it for $item:20300876$!"
set key[id=619114714002842] name "This much $item:30000785$ is plenty!\nHere's the $item:20300876$ filled with the \
    power of Balrog, just as I promised!\nYou're more than worthy of an Immortal Weapon, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=620195914002846] name "Hello, $MyPCName$. \nMaple World is buzzing now that the ancient god Zakum has \
    appeared.\nHave you heard that Zakum Balloons, celebrating the new boss Zakum, can be found all over \nthe \
    fields?"
set key[id=620195914002847] name "You should <font color=\"#ffd200\">find a Zakum Balloon and investigate \
    it</font> too, $MyPCName$!\nIf you succeed in <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating a Zakum Balloon</font>, \
    I'll give you a tasty '$item:20000596$'~\nCollect 100 $item:20000596$ and you'll get a cute speech bubble \
    badge as an emblem reward, \nso give it a try!"
set key[id=620195914002848] name "You should <font color=\"#ffd200\">find a Zakum Balloon and investigate \
    it</font> too, $MyPCName$!\nIf you succeed in <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating a Zakum Balloon</font>, \
    I'll give you a tasty '$item:20000596$'~\nCollect 100 $item:20000596$ and you'll get a cute speech bubble \
    badge as an emblem reward, \nso give it a try!"
set key[id=620195914002849] name "Here's the $item:20000596$ I promised!\nEat it quickly before it goes soggy!"
set key[id=621113814000464] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nIt's the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'I Want to Go There'</font> \
    event with me, Bobby! \nToday's place of memories is the city of blessing and glory, home of \
    $npc:11000075[gender:1]$,\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>."
