set key[id=621192814002850] name "$MyPCName$!\nOur MapleStory 2 is celebrating its second birthday!\nI think it's \
    thanks to your love and attention, $MyPCName$, \nthat MapleStory 2 could reach this second birthday!\nThank \
    you so much!!!"
set key[id=621192814002851] name "Until the July 27 maintenance, collect the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000781$</font> floating above the field bosses' heads!\nIn the 2nd Anniversary \
    Festival Town you can get all kinds of items with '$item:30000782$', so \nI'll trade it for you~\nIf you \
    collect 50 or more <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000781$</font> items, you can also get the '2nd Anniversary \
    Mark' as an emblem reward, \nwhich you can actually display above your character's head, so be sure to take \
    part! "
set key[id=621192814002852] name "Until the July 27 maintenance, collect the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000781$</font> floating above the field bosses' heads!\nIn the 2nd Anniversary \
    Festival Town you can get all kinds of items with '$item:30000782$', so \nI'll trade it for you~\nIf you \
    collect 50 or more <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000781$</font> items, you can also get the '2nd Anniversary \
    Mark' as an emblem reward, \nwhich you can actually display above your character's head, so be sure to take \
    part! "
set key[id=621192814002853] name "Here's your $item:30000782$!\nI hope you have a great time at the 2nd \
    Anniversary Festival Town~\nThank you once again!"
set key[id=621205014000816] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000817] name "I heard there's a cool, aloof city guy on Carcar Island, right?\nA cold, neatly \
    dressed city man... I really like that type, you know. \nPlease go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010016$</font> and meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001374[gender:0]$</font> for \
    me.\nIf you do me this favor, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000818] name "I heard there's a cool, aloof city guy on Carcar Island, right?\nA cold, neatly \
    dressed city man... I really like that type, you know. \nPlease go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010016$</font> and meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001374[gender:0]$</font> for \
    me.\nIf you do me this favor, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000819] name "Oh, you're back! \nSo, is $npc:11001374[gender:0]$... as handsome as the rumors \
    say? "
set key[id=621205014000820] name "He's really handsome. I bet he can rap, too."
set key[id=621205014000821] name "He's handsome, but I think I'm better looking."
set key[id=621205014000822] name "$MyPCName$... I sometimes think you're a little unusual....\nA-anyway, thank you \
    for bringing me the news. "
set key[id=621205014000823] name "Oh.......\nYes. Thank you. "
set key[id=621205014000824] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000825] name "Do you know <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000514[gender:1]$</font>, the ruler \
    of $map:02000124$?\nI hear the charisma is off the charts, but I haven't met her yet. \nCould you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000124$</font>, meet $npc:11000514[gender:1]$ and tell me how scary she is?\nI'll \
    give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000826] name "Do you know <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000514[gender:1]$</font>, the ruler \
    of $map:02000124$?\nI hear the charisma is off the charts, but I haven't met her yet. \nCould you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000124$</font>, meet $npc:11000514[gender:1]$ and tell me how scary she is?\nI'll \
    give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000827] name "Oh, you're back! \n$npc:11000514[gender:1]$... Did you meet her? How was it?"
set key[id=621205014000828] name "She's really scary. Never meet her."
set key[id=621205014000829] name "She's not scary at all. You could even talk to her casually."
set key[id=621205014000830] name "Ugh... I knew it. I'll have to be careful...!\nThanks for telling me, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000831] name "Really...? Then I'll do just that, trusting only you, $MyPCName$!\nThank you! "
set key[id=621205014000832] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000833] name "If you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000216$</font>, there's a dazzlingly \
    beautiful woman up high.\nThat haughty lady is said to be connected to the Black Star Society. Is that \
    true?\nCould you meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font> in $map:02000216$ and ask her \
    for me?\nIf you do me this favor, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift!"
set key[id=621205014000834] name "If you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000216$</font>, there's a dazzlingly \
    beautiful woman up high.\nThat haughty lady is said to be connected to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black Star \
    Society</font>. Is that true?\nCould you meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font> in \
    $map:02000216$ and ask her for me?\nIf you do me this favor, I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift!"
set key[id=621205014000835] name "Oh, you're back! \nIs <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font> \
    really connected to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Black Star Society</font>?"
set key[id=621205014000836] name "I think there's definitely a connection."
set key[id=621205014000837] name "I think I should join the Black Star Society."
set key[id=621205014000838] name "Wow... I knew it! A woman with dangerous beauty, fatally charming...! \nThanks \
    for telling me, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000839] name "If you ever get hold of a membership application, please share the info with me, \
    too. \nOh, and keep it a secret from my brother! "
set key[id=621205014000840] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000841] name "If you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000064$</font>, you'll find the \
    Bunny Gals of the Bunny Bunny Gang.\nAmong them is a lively girl who calls herself the mascot. \nGo to \
    $map:02000064$, meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000711[gender:1]$</font> and feel her vitamin-like \
    charm.\nFor recharging your energy, a special gift just for you! I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=621205014000842] name "If you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000064$</font>, you'll find the \
    Bunny Gals of the Bunny Bunny Gang.\nAmong them is a lively girl who calls herself the mascot. \nGo to \
    $map:02000064$, meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000711[gender:1]$</font> and feel her vitamin-like \
    charm.\nFor recharging your energy, a special gift just for you! I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=621205014000843] name "Oh, you're back! \n$npc:11000711[gender:1]$ is such a charming girl, isn't she?"
set key[id=621205014000844] name "She was so bright and lively that just looking at her made me happy."
set key[id=621205014000845] name "She's so bright I can't keep up."
set key[id=621205014000846] name "Right? She's a friend I'd really like to learn from! \nThank you for going all \
    that way, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000847] name "Oh, come on. So many people find joy thanks to the lively, upbeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Bunny Bunny Gang</font>. \nPlease be kind to our <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000711[gender:1]$</font>, too, $MyPCName$! "
set key[id=621205014000848] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000849] name "Have you ever been to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000076$</font>? It's a \
    truly peaceful, beautiful village guarded by the\nvigilantes led by the brave and thoughtful <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000015[gender:1]$</font>. \nCould you go to $map:02000076$, meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000015[gender:1]$</font> and ask her the secret to her beauty?\nI'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000850] name "Have you ever been to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000076$</font>? It's a \
    truly peaceful, beautiful village guarded by the\nGreen Hood vigilantes led by the brave and thoughtful <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000015[gender:1]$</font>. \nCould you go to $map:02000076$, meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000015[gender:1]$</font> and ask her the secret to her beauty?\nI'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000851] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nWhat is $npc:11000015[gender:1]$'s secret to beauty?"
set key[id=621205014000852] name "She didn't seem to want to tell me."
set key[id=621205014000853] name "I think I'm prettier, so ask me instead."
set key[id=621205014000854] name "Well, beauty is something you're born with. She probably had nothing to \
    say.\nThank you for going, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000855] name "$MyPCName$...\nNext time we hold an event with a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">mirror</font> as a prize, I'll be sure to call you. Cheer up."
set key[id=621205014000856] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000857] name "If you ask who the prettiest man on Victoria Island is,\nmany people answer \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000406[gender:0]$</font>. \nI hear there's a fan meeting for \
    $npc:11000406[gender:0]$ at <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000137$</font>. Won't you attend?\nIf you bring \
    back an autograph, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000858] name "If you ask who the prettiest man on Victoria Island is,\nmany people answer \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000406[gender:0]$</font>. \nI hear there's a fan meeting for \
    $npc:11000406[gender:0]$ at <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000137$</font>. Won't you attend?\nIf you bring \
    back an autograph, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000859] name "Oh, you're back! \nDid you get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000406[gender:0]$</font>'s autograph?"
set key[id=621205014000860] name "I couldn't get one because I didn't bring a pen."
set key[id=621205014000861] name "He was too busy showing off his face to give autographs."
set key[id=621205014000862] name "Oh no...! I forgot to give you a pen!\nSniff... Still, thank you for trying so \
    hard for me... "
set key[id=621205014000863] name "Hmph, is that so? He must not be very good with fans. \nNext time I'll have to \
    go see him myself! "
set key[id=621205014000864] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000865] name "Do you know <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font>, the dashing \
    man who guards <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>?\nRumor has it his head is so flat you could set \
    a kettle on it... \nCould you meet $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ in $map:02000001$ and check whether the rumor is \
    true?\nI'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000866] name "Do you know <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font>, the dashing \
    man who guards <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>?\nRumor has it his head is so flat you could set \
    a kettle on it... \nCould you meet $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ in $map:02000001$ and check whether the rumor is \
    true?\nI'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000867] name "You're back, $MyPCName$! \nSo? Is $npc:11000119[gender:0]$'s head really that \
    flat?"
set key[id=621205014000868] name "It was square, just like a toy."
set key[id=621205014000869] name "He wears a helmet, so I couldn't tell."
set key[id=621205014000870] name "Wow... So the rumor was true after all.\nThanks for telling me, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000871] name "Ugh... I see. I'll have to wait for a time when he's not wearing his \
    helmet!\nThanks for telling me, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000872] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000873] name "They say <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000252[gender:0]$</font>, the head of \
    the Goldus Group and the richest man in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000100$</font>,\nmakes applicants sing \
    a hymn with his own name in it during the job exam. \nCould you go to $map:02000100$ $map:02000158$ and see \
    whether that rumor is true?\nIf you meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000252[gender:0]$</font> there, I'll \
    give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=621205014000874] name "They say <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000252[gender:0]$</font>, the head of \
    the Goldus Group and the richest man in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000100$</font>,\nmakes applicants sing \
    a hymn with his own name in it during the job exam. \nCould you go to $map:02000100$ $map:02000158$ and see \
    whether that rumor is true?\nIf you meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000252[gender:0]$</font> there, I'll \
    give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=621205014000875] name "Oh, you're back! \nDon't tell me the rumor was true? "
set key[id=621205014000876] name "Gol~ Gol~ Gol~dus..."
set key[id=621205014000877] name "The song turned out to be pretty good, actually."
set key[id=621205014000878] name "Oh no, $MyPCName$!\nDon't sing that song, I'm sorry! "
set key[id=621205014000879] name "Gasp! $MyPCName$, don't tell me you got a job at the Goldus Group? \nPlease \
    don't burn with that much company pride..."
set key[id=621205014000888] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000889] name "Have you been to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000123$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>?\nThere's a rumor that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000185[gender:1]$</font>, who knows every piece of real estate\nin the Maple World \
    inside and out, is actually the richest person in the world. Could you meet $npcName:11000185[gender:1]$\nand \
    ask her how to get rich? I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000890] name "Have you been to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000123$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>?\nThere's a rumor that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000185[gender:1]$</font>, who knows every piece of real estate\nin the Maple World \
    inside and out, is actually the richest person in the world. Could you meet $npcName:11000185[gender:1]$\nand \
    ask her how to get rich? I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000891] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nDid $npc:11000185[gender:1]$ tell you how to get \
    rich?"
set key[id=621205014000892] name "She was so picky that I couldn't ask her anything."
set key[id=621205014000893] name "She told me she isn't rich."
set key[id=621205014000894] name "That's right. $npcName:11000185[gender:1]$ is a bit picky. She'd never tell \
    you\nhow to get rich so easily~ Still, thank you for going!"
set key[id=621205014000895] name "That can't be... I looked into it, and her salary is supposedly higher than a \
    top athlete's...\nI'll have to ask her myself next time. Thank you, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000896] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000897] name "I heard there's a story involving a giant turtle and some adventurers.\nThey say \
    an old man who knows it well lives by the sea...\nWould you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000111$</font> and meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000874[gender:0]$</font>?\nIf \
    you hear the story and tell me, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000898] name "I heard there's a story involving a giant turtle and some adventurers.\nThey say \
    an old man who knows it well lives by the sea...\nWould you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000111$</font> and meet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000874[gender:0]$</font>?\nIf \
    you hear the story and tell me, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000899] name "Did you go see $npc:11000874[gender:0]$?\nNow tell me the story, too! "
set key[id=621205014000900] name "(Pass on $npc:11000874[gender:0]$'s story exactly as told.)"
set key[id=621205014000901] name "I don't remember it very well."
set key[id=621205014000902] name "Oh, what a thrilling story...!\nI'll have to visit that place next time. Thank \
    you, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000903] name "Hmph...! You're so mean, $MyPCName$! "
set key[id=621205014000904] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=621205014000905] name "I heard someone called <font color=\"#ffd200\">GM Chunbae</font> crying out loud \
    the other day that\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">his real name wasn't Chunbae</font>. My brother says he's a \
    pitiful man...\nIf you want to know his story, he says to see someone called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000456[gender:0]$</font>.\nWould you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000070$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000062$</font> and find out what \
    happened?"
set key[id=621205014000906] name "I heard someone called <font color=\"#ffd200\">GM Chunbae</font> sniffling the \
    other day that\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">his real name wasn't Chunbae</font>. My brother says he's a pitiful \
    man...\nIf you want to know his story, he says to see someone called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000456[gender:0]$</font>.\nWould you go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000070$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000062$</font> and find out what \
    happened?"
set key[id=621205014000907] name "You're here, $MyPCName$!\nDid that person called <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000456[gender:0]$</font> tell you what happened?"
set key[id=621205014000908] name "It was a story that's so Chunbae."
set key[id=621205014000909] name "It was a story about everyone finding their own place."
set key[id=621205014000910] name "A <font color=\"#ffd200\">story that's so Chunbae</font>...?\nI don't know what \
    you mean, but somehow I feel like I understand...."
set key[id=621205014000911] name "What on earth...? My brother and you, $MyPCName$, both say such strange things. \
    \nI'll have to go ask in person next time. "
set key[id=621205014000912] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, Maple \
    Daily has run\na special feature introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the stories \
    behind them. \nHow about joining me on this fun trip to meet people,\n$MyPCName$?"
set key[id=621205014000913] name "$MyPCName$, have you ever seen the announcer lady on TV?\nShe looks so pretty \
    and smart, I want to be just like her!\nYou can meet her by turning on a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400002$</font>. "
set key[id=621205014000914] name "You can meet her at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400002$</font> is set up. \nTurn on the TV, say hello to the announcer lady, and \
    I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000915] name "You can meet her at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400002$</font> is set up. \nTurn on the TV, say hello to the announcer lady, and \
    I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000916] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nDid you turn on the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400002$</font>? The announcer lady is so pretty, isn't she? "
set key[id=621205014000917] name "I think she has an elegant, beautiful look."
set key[id=621205014000918] name "To my eyes, you're prettier..."
set key[id=621205014000919] name "Right? I want to become someone that smart and pretty someday, too!"
set key[id=621205014000920] name "Wow~ you have an eye for people, $MyPCName$!\nThank you!"
set key[id=621205014000921] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, Maple \
    Daily has run\na special feature introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the stories \
    behind them. \nHow about joining me on this fun trip to meet people,\n$MyPCName$?"
set key[id=621205014000922] name "$MyPCName$, don't you get bored eating alone? \nSome houses have a piece of \
    furniture called $item:50400125$,\nand they say a friend named Nana eats with you. Isn't that amazing? "
set key[id=621205014000923] name "You can say hello to her at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400125$</font> is set up. She sounds like such a kind friend,\nso would you go \
    meet her?\nWhen you come back, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000924] name "You can say hello to her at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400125$</font> is set up. She sounds like such a kind friend,\nso would you go \
    meet her?\nWhen you come back, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000925] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nWas that friend Nana really in the $item:50400125$? "
set key[id=621205014000926] name "She was a lovely friend who eats a balanced diet."
set key[id=621205014000927] name "She was eating way too hard, all by herself."
set key[id=621205014000928] name "I see! Next time I meet her, I'll greet her warmly, too. "
set key[id=621205014000929] name "Is that so? Hmm... It would be nicer to eat happily together.\nNext time I meet \
    her, I'll pass along what you said, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000930] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, Maple \
    Daily has run\na special feature introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the stories \
    behind them. \nHow about joining me on this fun trip to meet people,\n$MyPCName$?"
set key[id=621205014000931] name "When you go to meet people, what matters most? \nFor me, it's a clean face! If \
    you wash up neatly and greet people with a bright face,\nI think the meeting feels fresh and \
    pleasant.\nWashing at the newly released <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400053$</font> feels so, so \
    refreshing~"
set key[id=621205014000932] name "You can use it at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400053$</font> is set up. \nWash your face clean, and when you come back I'll give \
    you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000933] name "You can use it at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400053$</font> is set up. \nWash your face clean, and when you come back I'll give \
    you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000934] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nMmm~! You look so neat and tidy. It looks great!"
set key[id=621205014000935] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, Maple \
    Daily has run\na special feature introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the stories \
    behind them. \nHow about joining me on this fun trip to meet people,\n$MyPCName$?"
set key[id=621205014000936] name "$MyPCName$, can't you practice biking on indoor exercise equipment? \nI saw an \
    ad on a home shopping channel for the newly released <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400098$</font>,\nand I \
    ordered one because I wanted to ride a bike when I go meet people.\nBut my brother says you can't practice \
    biking on indoor equipment."
set key[id=621205014000937] name "You can try it at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400098$</font> is set up... \nWould you try it and tell me what you think? If it's \
    no good for practice, I might return it.\nIf you do me this favor, I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000938] name "You can try it at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400098$</font> is set up... \nWould you try it and tell me what you think?\nIf you \
    do me this favor, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=621205014000939] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nSo? Is my brother right that it doesn't help with bike \
    practice?"
set key[id=621205014000940] name "(Console her by saying it doesn't seem to work.)"
set key[id=621205014000941] name "I think it can build up your leg muscles."
set key[id=621205014000942] name "Ugh, then I'd better think about returning it.\nThanks for letting me know, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000943] name "Right? I knew there'd be some way to use it.\nThanks for letting me know, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=621205014000944] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, Maple \
    Daily has run\na special feature introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the stories \
    behind them. \nHow about joining me on this fun trip to meet people,\n$MyPCName$?"
set key[id=621205014000945] name "When you go to meet people, I think it's really important to go with a light \
    body and mind. \nThat way you can focus only on the conversation with the person in front of you.  \nIn that \
    sense, the newly released <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400054$</font> is\nmy best partner. A clear face, a \
    bright smile!"
set key[id=621205014000946] name "You can use it at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400054$</font> is set up.\nTry out the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400054$</font> yourself, $MyPCName$.\nTell me what you think afterward, and I'll \
    give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=621205014000947] name "You can use it at $MyPCName$'s house or anyone else's,\nanywhere a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400054$</font> is set up.\nTry out the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50400054$</font> yourself, $MyPCName$.\nTell me what you think afterward, and I'll \
    give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=621205014000948] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nYour face looks so light it could float away! It looks \
    great!"
set key[id=621205014000949] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, Maple \
    Daily has run\na special feature introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the stories \
    behind them. \nHow about joining me on this fun trip to meet people,\n$MyPCName$?"
set key[id=621205014000950] name "When you go visit someone far away, it's important to check the exact location \
    \nbeforehand. For that, a <font color=\"#ffd200\">telescope</font> is the best.\nWould you try using a \
    telescope anywhere? \nWhen you come back, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a \
    gift."
set key[id=621205014000951] name "When you go visit someone far away, it's important to check the exact location \
    \nbeforehand. For that, a <font color=\"#ffd200\">telescope</font> is the best.\nWould you try using a \
    telescope anywhere? \nWhen you come back, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a \
    gift."
set key[id=621205014000952] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nTelescopes are handy, aren't they? Do use one now and \
    then!"
set key[id=621205014000953] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, Maple \
    Daily has run\na special feature introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the stories \
    behind them. \nHow about joining me on this fun trip to meet people,\n$MyPCName$?"
set key[id=621205014000954] name "There was an interesting part in the Maple Daily article. \nWhen they asked \
    readers to pick the person they were glad to meet, some people \npicked not a person but a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">golden treasure chest</font>. "
set key[id=621205014000955] name "Finding rare treasure in a well-hidden <font color=\"#ffd200\">golden treasure \
    chest</font>\nmight be even more fun than meeting people.\nGo find the hidden golden treasure chests. If you \
    manage to find 3,\nI'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=621205014000956] name "Finding rare treasure in a well-hidden <font color=\"#ffd200\">golden treasure \
    chest</font>\nmight be even more fun than meeting people.\nGo find the hidden golden treasure chests. If you \
    manage to find 3,\nI'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=621205014000957] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nThey must have been hard to find. Thanks for all your \
    hard work! "
set key[id=623123914000961] name "It was running wild, so I gave it a bonk on the head."
set key[id=623123914000962] name "Its cry was very charming."
set key[id=623123914000963] name "I knew it! She definitely only put on a <font color=\"#ffd200\">pretty \
    act</font> for the photo!\nThank you for the news, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=623123914000964] name "Its cry? Roaaaar...! Th-this? \nWhat unique taste you have... well, I'll respect \
    it! "
set key[id=623123914000965] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=623123914000966] name "Do you remember the super popular guy chosen by adventurers as the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">man they most want candy from</font>?\nThe one with the charming poker face... what could he \
    be doing now?\nMeet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000617[gender:0]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000118$</font> and come back, and\nas a sp-e-cial gift for someone who treasures \
    memories, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>!"
set key[id=623123914000967] name "Do you remember the super popular guy chosen by adventurers as the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">man they most want candy from</font>?\nThe one with the charming poker face... what could he \
    be doing now?\nMeet <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000617[gender:0]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000118$</font> and come back, and\nas a sp-e-cial gift for someone who treasures \
    memories, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>!"
set key[id=623123914000968] name "Oh, you're back! \n$npc:11000617[gender:0]$... was he still charming? "
set key[id=623123914000969] name "He was still hesitating."
set key[id=623123914000970] name "He really seems to be the best-looking man in the world."
set key[id=623123914000971] name "Oh my... I knew it. Always the same. So cool...!\nThank you for the news, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=623123914000972] name "Ohoho, you're joking...! There are so many handsome men in the world...! \nOops, \
    keep it a secret from $npc:11000617[gender:0]$! "
set key[id=623123914000973] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=623123914000974] name "Do you know <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000076[gender:0]$</font>, the right \
    hand of Empress $npcName:11000075[gender:1]$?\nHe carries out the Empress's orders in $map:02000146$. He's \
    very popular for his warm good looks...\nCould you meet the dashing $npc:11000076[gender:0]$ in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000146$</font> and\ndeliver my greetings? In return, I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=623123914000975] name "Do you know <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000076[gender:0]$</font>, the right \
    hand of Empress $npcName:11000075[gender:1]$?\nHe carries out the Empress's orders in $map:02000146$. He's \
    very popular for his warm good looks...\nCould you meet the dashing $npc:11000076[gender:0]$ in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000146$</font> and\ndeliver my greetings? In return, I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>."
set key[id=623123914000976] name "Oh, you're back! \n$npc:11000076[gender:0]$... does he look healthy? "
set key[id=623123914000977] name "Why are you so shy about it?"
set key[id=623123914000978] name "He really has the warm good looks you described."
set key[id=623123914000979] name "Hehe, I don't know either. Just thinking about him makes me happy for no \
    reason~\nThank you for the news, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=623123914000980] name "Right? You think so too, $MyPCName$? \nI think $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$ is \
    the best-looking, but my brother says no...\nOh! Keep this a <font color=\"#ffd200\">secret</font> from my \
    brother and $npcName:11000076[gender:0]$!"
set key[id=623123914000981] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=623123914000982] name "I heard there's a boy on Carcar Island famous for his good looks, right?\nA kind \
    face but a cold way of speaking... and yet people keep calling him cute... \nPlease go meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001430[gender:0]$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010047$</font> for me.\nIf \
    you do me this favor, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=623123914000983] name "I heard there's a boy on Carcar Island famous for his good looks, right?\nA kind \
    face but a cold way of speaking... and yet people keep calling him cute... \nPlease go meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001430[gender:0]$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010047$</font> for me.\nIf \
    you do me this favor, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font> as a gift."
set key[id=623123914000984] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!\nSo? Is $npc:11001430[gender:0]$... really that \
    handsome?"
set key[id=623123914000985] name "He's handsome, but he talks so coldly that I couldn't warm up to him."
set key[id=623123914000986] name "We agreed to be friends, so don't you dare go after him."
set key[id=623123914000987] name "Oh, come on. They say he's like that at first, but once you get close you'll see \
    he has a warm heart.\n$MyPCName$, go visit often and be <font color=\"#ffd200\">friends with the handsome \
    $npcName:11001430[gender:0]$</font>!"
set key[id=623123914000988] name "...He didn't make you run an <font color=\"#ffd200\">errand</font> right after \
    agreeing to be friends, did he? I hear he does that sometimes.\n$MyPCName$, next time you visit, ask him \
    whether he remembers you two are friends. "
set key[id=623124114000989] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! For the <font color=\"#ffd200\">1st anniversary</font>, the \
    Maple Daily ran\nspecial articles introducing <font color=\"#ffd200\">people in the news</font> and the \
    stories behind them. \nI enjoyed reading them so much. For the anniversary,\nwhy not join this <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fun journey</font> too, $MyPCName$? "
set key[id=623124114000990] name "I heard that in the vote for the woman people most want chocolate from, a bear \
    came in first?\nThey said it was a gentle woman, but that wild instinct can't be easy to calm...\nCould you go \
    check whether the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000022$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000117$</font> is running wild?\nAs a sp-e-cial gift for someone who treasures \
    memories, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>!"
set key[id=623124114000991] name "I heard that in the vote for the woman people most want chocolate from, a bear \
    came in first?\nThey said it was a gentle woman, but that wild instinct can't be easy to calm...\nCould you go \
    check whether the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000022$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000117$</font> is running wild?\nAs a sp-e-cial gift for someone who treasures \
    memories, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000554$</font>!"
set key[id=623124114000992] name "Oh, you're back! \n$npc:22000022$... how was she? "
set key[id=701214214001001] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$!\nI hear that if you <font color=\"#ffd200\">help other \
    adventurers</font> who are struggling with <font color=\"#ffd200\">Challenge/Chaos Mode</font> dungeons \nand \
    clear the dungeon together, you can get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000558$</font>."
set key[id=701214214001002] name "Kind heroes who bring me <font color=\"#ffd200\">4 $item:30000558$</font> will \
    get a gift,\nso be sure to succeed!"
set key[id=701214214001003] name "I hear that if you <font color=\"#ffd200\">help other adventurers</font> who are \
    struggling with <font color=\"#ffd200\">Challenge/Chaos Mode</font> dungeons \nand clear the dungeon together, \
    you can get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000558$</font>.\nKind heroes who bring me <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">4 $item:30000558$</font> will get a gift,\nso be sure to succeed!"
set key[id=701214214001004] name "You helped adventurers in need and cleared this many dungeons?\nYou really are \
    the best, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=701214214001005] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$! \nI've been seeing so many new adventurers lately. "
set key[id=701214214001006] name "It's such a shame that many of them struggle with the dungeons.\nIf strong, kind \
    people like you, $MyPCName$, joined them, there'd be no problem."
set key[id=701214214001007] name "Would you <font color=\"#ffd200\">help other adventurers</font> who are \
    struggling with <font color=\"#ffd200\">Challenge/Chaos Mode</font> dungeons \nand clear the dungeon \
    together?\nBring me <font color=\"#ffd200\">4</font> <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000558$</font> and I'll \
    give you a gift, too!"
set key[id=701214214001008] name "Would you <font color=\"#ffd200\">help other adventurers</font> who are \
    struggling with <font color=\"#ffd200\">Challenge/Chaos Mode</font> dungeons \nand clear the dungeon \
    together?\nBring me <font color=\"#ffd200\">4</font> <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000558$</font> and I'll \
    give you a gift, too!"
set key[id=701214214001009] name "Wow! You collected <font color=\"#ffd200\">4</font> <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000558$</font>!\nYou really are strong and kind, $MyPCName$!\nI fall for you all \
    over again!"
set key[id=713133714002854] name "Over the past two months, so many adventurers helped as Mavengers heroes and \
    First Knights \nthat a great many people fought for the peace of Maple World!\nLately we've been seeing lots \
    of new and returning adventurers.\nCould I ask you, $MyPCName$, to help them as a dungeon master?"
set key[id=713133714002855] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>, \nand bring back \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000868$</font>. \nI'll trade it for $item:20300920$, which can get you all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$~"
set key[id=713133714002856] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>, \nand bring back \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000868$</font>. \nI'll trade it for $item:20300920$, which can get you all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$~"
set key[id=713133714002857] name "Here's the $item:20300920$ I promised.\nYou really are strong and kind, \
    $MyPCName$.\nThank you for protecting the peace of Maple World!"
set key[id=713133714002858] name "Hearing all your adventures over the past two months as a Mavengers hero and \
    First Knight \nreally warmed Ruby's heart.\nBut they say many adventurers still need your help, \
    $MyPCName$.\n$MyPCName$, may I ask you one more time?"
set key[id=713133714002859] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>, \nand bring back \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000868$</font>. \nI'll trade it for $item:20300920$, which can get you all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$~"
set key[id=713133714002860] name "Clear an <font color=\"#ffd200\">event dungeon</font> together with an <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">adventurer who needs help and has cleared fewer than 20 dungeons</font>, \nand bring back \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000868$</font>. \nI'll trade it for $item:20300920$, which can get you all \
    kinds of valuable items \nlike $item:33000160$ and $item:33000161$~"
set key[id=713133714002861] name "Wow! You've already gathered this many?\nIt's so reassuring to have dungeon \
    masters like you, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=718204714002862] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$. \nAfter the ancient god Zakum, now Pink Bean has appeared \
    in the Temple of Time...\nMaple World is badly shaken.\nStill, many adventurers praise how Pink Bean's looks \
    are as cute as its power is great, \nand balloons celebrating Pink Bean's arrival are being found all over \
    Maple World!"
set key[id=718204714002863] name "Please <font color=\"#ffd200\">find a Pink Bean Balloon and investigate \
    it</font>, $MyPCName$!\nIf you succeed in <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating a Pink Bean Balloon</font>, \
    I'll give you a sweet '$item:20000622$'~\nGet 10 '$item:20000622$' and you'll also earn a cute speech bubble \
    badge as an emblem reward, \nso please do it~"
set key[id=718204714002864] name "Please <font color=\"#ffd200\">find a Pink Bean Balloon and investigate \
    it</font>, $MyPCName$!\nIf you succeed in <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating a Pink Bean Balloon</font>, \
    I'll give you a sweet '$item:20000622$'~\nGet 10 '$item:20000622$' and you'll also earn a cute speech bubble \
    badge as an emblem reward, \nso please do it~"
set key[id=718204714002865] name "How was investigating the Pink Bean Balloons?\nHere's the '$item:20000622$' I \
    promised~"
set key[id=719181014002866] name "What should we do, $MyPCName$?\nGM Charlie, Maple World's source of news, went \
    to the Temple of Time to film 'Maple World Now' \nand hasn't been heard from since. Everyone is terribly \
    worried.\nIt looks like the very, very scarily cute boss Pink Bean got to Charlie. \nMay I ask for your help, \
    $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=719181014002867] name "Find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:29000307$ tombstone</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000409$</font>, smash it, and rescue GM Charlie.\nThey say the next 'Maple World Now' \
    shoot is delayed because Charlie is missing,\nso please help~"
set key[id=719181014002868] name "Find the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:29000307$ tombstone</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000409$</font>, smash it, and rescue GM Charlie.\nThey say the next 'Maple World Now' \
    shoot is delayed because Charlie is missing,\nso please help~"
set key[id=719181014002869] name "Phew... Thank you so much for rescuing GM Charlie, $MyPCName$~\nLuckily we'll \
    get to see the next episode of 'Maple World Now'.\nOh! Do you watch 'Maple World Now' too, $MyPCName$?\nIf you \
    haven't, go to Mayview and check it out~ It's packed with all sorts of useful info! \nYou can even get a sneak \
    peek at news from the secretly busy dev team!"
set key[id=801192614001025] name "Oh my! $MyPCName$, you came at just the right time!\nI was about to contact you, \
    because a gift came from the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Allicari Merchant Society</font>.\nOh! $MyPCName$, you \
    know the Allicari Merchant Society, right?"
set key[id=801192614001026] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=801192614001027] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Aliyar</font>, who leads the Allicari Merchant Society, \
    wants to take on monsters\nalong with the adventurers here, so he sent a <font color=\"#ffd200\">powerful \
    weapon</font>."
set key[id=801192614001028] name "If you want the gift from the Allicari Merchant Society, talk to my twin \
    brother, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001003[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=801192614001029] name "If you want the gift from the Allicari Merchant Society, talk to my twin \
    brother, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001003[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=801192614001030] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=801192614001031] name "I'm here to pick up the gift from the Allicari Merchant Society."
set key[id=801192614001032] name "So you're here for the Allicari Merchant Society's gift.\nTo get it, you have to \
    answer a question from the Allicari Merchant Society.\nHere comes the question!"
set key[id=801192614001033] name "Which of these is the <font color=\"#ffd200\">greeting the Allicari Merchant \
    Society uses for new friends</font>? "
set key[id=801192614001034] name "Allario"
set key[id=801192614001035] name "Yallario"
set key[id=801192614001036] name "Yalli Yalli Yalasyeong Yallari Yala"
set key[id=801192614001037] name "Ullario"
set key[id=801192614001038] name "That's right! <font color=\"#ffd200\">Yallario!</font> Correct!\nHere's the gift \
    the Allicari Merchant Society prepared!"
set key[id=801192614001039] name "Hmm... Sorry, wrong! Would you like to try again?"
set key[id=801192614001040] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=810164114002874] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nHave you heard that a huge number of treasure chests were \
    found on the shores of Barbosa, a land of mystery?\nYou can buy chests at a low price from my twin brother \
    $npcName:11001003[gender:0]$ next to me.\nBut to open a Barbosa treasure chest you need a key of the same \
    tier,\nand upgrading a key's tier takes <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font>!"
set key[id=810164114002875] name "Complete Barbosa daily missions and collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font>, \nthe material for upgrading a 'Barbosa Key'!\nToday's Barbosa daily \
    mission is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat $npc:23000054$'</font>!"
set key[id=810164114002876] name "Complete Barbosa daily missions and collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font>, \nthe material for upgrading a 'Barbosa Key'!\nToday's Barbosa daily \
    mission is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat $npc:23000054$'</font>!"
set key[id=810164114002877] name "You cleared today's mission!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font> I promised!\nI hope you keep upgrading your Barbosa Key with <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font> \nand take home great rewards from the higher tiers!"
