    weight...\nSo here's $npcName:11001003[gender:0]$'s recommended Harvest Festival diet method!"
set key[id=902202014001186] name "The basic of exercise is <font color=\"#ffd200\">running</font>, of \
    course!\nRunning in the cool breeze makes you feel great!"
set key[id=902202014001187] name "The basic of exercise is <font color=\"#ffd200\">running</font>, of \
    course!\nRunning in the cool breeze makes you feel great!"
set key[id=902202014001188] name "Good work.\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier now?"
set key[id=902202014001189] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! I'm the event helper $npcName:11001003[gender:0]$.\nToday \
    I've prepared <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000185$</font> for you."
set key[id=902202014001190] name "You can use it anytime, anywhere.\nShoot the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000185$</font> high into the sky!"
set key[id=902202014001191] name "You can use it anytime, anywhere.\nShoot the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000185$</font> high into the sky!"
set key[id=902202014001192] name "Did you have a good trip? \nYour fireworks, $MyPCName$, must have cheered up \
    lots of adventurers!"
set key[id=919133814001213] name "Hello, $MyPCName$.\nDo you remember the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Allicari \
    Merchant Society's gift</font>? \nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">powerful weapon</font> won big support from \
    adventurers."
set key[id=919133814001214] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=919133814001215] name "I heard that many adventurers were disappointed after the event ended,\nso <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Aliyar</font>, who leads the Allicari Merchant Society,\nsent <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20300508$</font> once again."
set key[id=919133814001216] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Allicari Merchant Society's gift</font> is back!\nIf \
    you want the Allicari Merchant Society's gift, talk to my twin brother, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001003[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=919133814001217] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Allicari Merchant Society's gift</font> is back!\nIf \
    you want the Allicari Merchant Society's gift, talk to my twin brother, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001003[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=919133814001218] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=919133814001219] name "I'm here to pick up the gift from the Allicari Merchant Society."
set key[id=919133814001220] name "So you're here for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Allicari Merchant Society's \
    gift</font>.\nTo get it, you once again have to answer <font color=\"#ffd200\">a question from the Allicari \
    Merchant Society</font>.\nHere comes the question!"
set key[id=919133814001221] name "Which of these is <font color=\"#ffd200\">an item you can't buy at the Allicari \
    Merchant Society's shop</font>?\nIf you look through the Allicari Merchant Society's treasure vault in \
    $map:02000064$, it's very easy to tell!"
set key[id=919133814001226] name "That's right! The <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200675$</font> is the correct \
    answer.\n$item:50200675$ is sold by the Red Starkeepers $npcName:11001272[gender:1]$ and \
    $npcName:11001273[gender:1]$.\nHere's the gift the Allicari Merchant Society prepared!"
set key[id=919133814001227] name "Sorry, wrong! That's not the answer!\nThe item you chose can be bought at the \
    Allicari Merchant Society's shop.\nWould you like to try again?"
set key[id=919133814001228] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=921231314001229] name "Hello, I'm $npc:11001002[gender:1]$.\nI've prepared a mission for you, \
    $MyPCName$, whose challenging spirit is so admirable.\nWon't you take it on?"
set key[id=921231314001230] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Week 1 challenge</font> is a lonely challenge for \
    growth!\nTake on the various <font color=\"#ffd200\">solo dungeons</font> in the Maple World!\nClear them and \
    I'll give you $item:20300512$ containing powerful gear!"
set key[id=921231314001231] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Week 1 challenge</font> is a lonely challenge for \
    growth!\nTake on the various <font color=\"#ffd200\">solo dungeons</font> in the Maple World!\nClear them and \
    I'll give you $item:20300512$ containing powerful gear!"
set key[id=921231314001232] name "You've finished already?\nYou really are amazing, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=921231314001233] name "Hello, I'm $npc:11001002[gender:1]$.\nThis Week 2 mission is a fun challenge \
    with MC Kay!"
