    $npcName:23000012$, $npcName:23000009[gender:0]$, $npcName:23000029$. \n\nThere are this many bosses that drop \
    the letters <font color=\"#ffd200\">'$item:30001140$', '$item:30001141$', '$item:30001142$', \
    '$item:30001143$'</font>.\nCollecting letters isn't hard, right?"
set key[id=523134314003233] name "Now then, shall we head out to the field?\nThe bosses I mentioned have the \
    letters <font color=\"#ffd200\">'$item:30001140$', '$item:30001141$', '$item:30001142$', \
    '$item:30001143$'</font> floating over their heads.\nYou'll spot them right away. "
set key[id=523134314003234] name "Here's the $item:30001135$ I promised~\nWhat would you like to buy, \
    $MyPCName$?\nThe goods Bobby has prepared at the Rainbow Coin Shop are so pretty.\nGo take a look right away. \
    You'll be amazed!"
set key[id=523134314003235] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nCollect the letters <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">'$item:30001144$', '$item:30001145$', '$item:30001146$'</font>!\nI'll exchange them for \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001135$</font>, which you can use to buy special goods from Bobby~"
set key[id=523134314003236] name "$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$, $npcName:23000018$, $npcName:23000001[gender:0]$, \
    $npcName:23000019[gender:0]$, $npcName:23000054$, $npcName:23000020[gender:1]$, $npcName:23000035$, \
    \n$npcName:23000099$, $npcName:23000017$, $npcName:23000047$, $npcName:23000024[gender:1]$, \
    $npcName:23000034$, $npcName:23000045$,\n$npcName:23000057[gender:1]$, $npcName:23000026[gender:1]$, \
    $npcName:23000012$, $npcName:23000009[gender:0]$, $npcName:23000029$. \n\nThere are this many bosses that drop \
    the letters <font color=\"#ffd200\">'$item:30001144$', '$item:30001145$', \
    '$item:30001146$'</font>.\nCollecting letters isn't hard, right?"
set key[id=523134314003237] name "Now then, shall we head out to the field?\nThe bosses I mentioned have the \
    letters <font color=\"#ffd200\">'$item:30001144$', '$item:30001145$', '$item:30001146$'</font> floating over \
    their heads.\nYou'll spot them right away. "
set key[id=523134314003238] name "Here's the $item:30001135$ I promised~\nWhat would you like to buy, \
    $MyPCName$?\nThe goods Bobby has prepared at the Rainbow Coin Shop are so pretty.\nGo take a look right away. \
    You'll be amazed!"
set key[id=523134314003239] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nCollect the letters <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">'$item:30001147$', '$item:30001148$', '$item:30001149$', '$item:30001150$'</font>!\nI'll \
    exchange them for <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001135$</font>, which you can use to buy special goods from \
    Bobby~"
set key[id=523134314003240] name "$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$, $npcName:23000018$, $npcName:23000001[gender:0]$, \
    $npcName:23000019[gender:0]$, $npcName:23000054$, $npcName:23000020[gender:1]$, $npcName:23000035$, \
    \n$npcName:23000099$, $npcName:23000017$, $npcName:23000047$, $npcName:23000024[gender:1]$, \
    $npcName:23000034$, $npcName:23000045$,\n$npcName:23000057[gender:1]$, $npcName:23000026[gender:1]$, \
    $npcName:23000012$, $npcName:23000009[gender:0]$, $npcName:23000029$. \n\nThere are this many bosses that drop \
    the letters <font color=\"#ffd200\">'$item:30001147$', '$item:30001148$', '$item:30001149$', \
    '$item:30001150$'</font>.\nCollecting letters isn't hard, right? "
set key[id=523134314003241] name "Now then, shall we head out to the field?\nThe bosses I mentioned have the \
    letters <font color=\"#ffd200\">'$item:30001147$', '$item:30001148$', '$item:30001149$', \
    '$item:30001150$'</font> floating over their heads.\nYou'll spot them right away. "
set key[id=523134314003242] name "Here's the $item:30001135$ I promised~\nWhat would you like to buy, \
    $MyPCName$?\nThe goods Bobby has prepared at the Rainbow Coin Shop are so pretty.\nGo take a look right away. \
    You'll be amazed!"
set key[id=611150414003243] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nHave you heard that we're selling all kinds of goods for \
    3rd Anniversary Coins?\nGo to my twin brother $npcName:11001003[gender:0]$ next to me, and you can browse some \
    amazing items.\nYou can earn coins by completing today's mission. "
