set key[id=713172114003307] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003308] name "Go see <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000004[gender:0]$</font>, the weapon \
    merchant in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>.\nThey say he knows a sad and beautiful love story \
    that tugs at the heart.\nOnce $MyPCName$ has heard the whole story, he'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>."
set key[id=713172114003309] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you can buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003310] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000004[gender:0]$</font>, the weapon \
    merchant in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font>, and ask him to tell you a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">love story</font>.\nWhen you've heard the whole story, you'll receive <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nCollect them and bring them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy some \
    fun items!"
set key[id=713172114003311] name "Welcome, ya~\nLots of good stuff today. Take your time and pick, ya. "
set key[id=713172114003312] name "I came because I want to hear a love story."
set key[id=713172114003313] name "I don't know much about love, ya~ I like candy, though."
set key[id=713172114003314] name "I want to hear the story of the sad and beautiful lovers."
set key[id=713172114003315] name "Ah~ you mean that story, ya? \nThe sad tale of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">lovers</font> frozen over like a cold snowfield... "
set key[id=713172114003316] name "Those two were fated from birth, and loved each other more than anyone.\nBut the \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">darkness</font> that crept into the world turned that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">love</font> into <font color=\"#ffd200\">tragedy</font>..."
set key[id=713172114003317] name "<font color=\"#909090\">$npc:11000004[gender:0]$'s eyes seem to be getting \
    misty. Or is it my imagination?</font>"
set key[id=713172114003318] name "Sorry, $MyPCName$. I'll finish the story next time you visit.\nToday... I just \
    want to rest. Take this as a gift instead, ya."
set key[id=713172114003319] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003320] name "The most famous long-married couple in Maple World lives in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font>.\nWhy not ask Granny <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000705[gender:1]$</font> about <font color=\"#ffd200\">the secret to a loving \
    marriage</font>?\nThey've been together so long, there must be some special secret!"
set key[id=713172114003321] name "When you've heard the whole story, you'll receive <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nCollect them and bring them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy some \
    fun items!"
set key[id=713172114003322] name "Ask Granny <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000705[gender:1]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font> about the secret to a loving marriage.\nWhen you've heard the whole \
    story, you'll receive <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nCollect them and bring them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy some \
    fun items!"
set key[id=713172114003323] name "Standing there blocking the sun while Granny sunbathes?\nMove it, you rascal, \
    right now!"
set key[id=713172114003324] name "I came to hear the secret to your long, loving marriage."
set key[id=713172114003325] name "Love? Hohoho, what's this, a snail rock-paper-scissors contest?\nWe just lived a \
    long time, that's all. It's not like we're stuck together all day."
set key[id=713172114003326] name "(Tell her about the sad couple in $map:63000062$.)"
set key[id=713172114003327] name "Ah, to be young, and so tender about it... hehe. \nI was like that with the old \
    man once, but now it's enough that we're both still alive.\nThese days the old man cares more about the flower \
    growing on his back than about me, too."
set key[id=713172114003328] name "You had a hard time listening to an old lady talk, so take this as a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font>. \nOh, and tell those youngsters something! That everything fades with time. \
    Hoho."
set key[id=713172114003329] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003330] name "They say <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000242[gender:1]$</font> of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000135$</font>, a hot dating spot these days,\nknows the secret to a successful \
    proposal. Please go learn it\nfor the lovers of this world!"
set key[id=713172114003331] name "Oh, and I hear she'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> as \
    a gift too.\nCollect them and bring them to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004101$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy some fun items! "
set key[id=713172114003332] name "Ask <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000242[gender:1]$</font> of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000135$</font>, a hot dating spot these days,\nabout the secret to a successful \
    proposal, and get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nCollect them and bring them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy some \
    fun items! "
set key[id=713172114003333] name "Welcome~ What can I get you?"
set key[id=713172114003334] name "I want to hear the secret to a successful proposal."
set key[id=713172114003335] name "Oh my, I get asked that a lot lately~\nBut it's really nothing special. It's \
    very simple."
set key[id=713172114003336] name "Hurry up and tell me."
set key[id=713172114003337] name "Tsk, for free? <font color=\"#ffd200\">Order</font> something first!"
set key[id=713172114003338] name "(Order a hot tea.)"
set key[id=713172114003339] name "(Order a sweet ice cream parfait.)"
set key[id=713172114003340] name "Hohoho, an excellent choice. \nA warm tea puts your heart at ease.\nThat's the \
    secret you were wondering about, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=713172114003341] name "So what exactly is the secret?"
set key[id=713172114003342] name "Hohoho, an excellent choice. \nSweet ice cream puts you in a great mood.\nThat's \
    the secret you were wondering about, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=713172114003343] name "So what exactly is the secret?"
set key[id=713172114003344] name "Hohoho, so you're saying there's nothing you want to order?\nThen please leave \
    now, customer."
set key[id=713172114003345] name "(Order a hot tea.)"
set key[id=713172114003346] name "(Order a sweet ice cream parfait.)"
set key[id=713172114003347] name "The secret is our shop's <font color=\"#ffd200\">stunning view</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">delicious menu</font>!\nThey help you share your true feelings comfortably. \nWell, isn't \
    that amazing? So please give us lots of love~"
set key[id=713172114003348] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Looks like I fell for a sales pitch...</font>"
set key[id=713172114003349] name "Here, have a gift too, and come again! \nWe love you, dear customer!"
set key[id=713172114003350] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003351] name "Why not express your love with a beautiful song?\nThey say <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000412[gender:0]$</font> of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000086$</font> is a \
    lyricist on the rise... \nPlease commission a <font color=\"#ffd200\">love song</font> for the lovers of this \
    world!"
set key[id=713172114003352] name "Oh, and I hear <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000412[gender:0]$</font> gives \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> as a gift when you commission a song... \nCollect them and \
    bring them to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004101$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy some fun items! "
set key[id=713172114003353] name "Please commission a <font color=\"#ffd200\">love song</font> from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000412[gender:0]$</font> of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000086$</font>!\nOh, and I \
    hear <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000412[gender:0]$</font> gives <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> as a gift when you commission a song... \nCollect them and bring them \
    to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can \
    buy some fun items! "
set key[id=713172114003354] name "I'm a hipster walking the rhythm on the flow,\nyou came to find me, so you're a \
    gangster who knows the show. \nAnything you want, I'll do it, say what you came to say, bro."
set key[id=713172114003355] name "I want you to write a love song for lovers."
set key[id=713172114003356] name "What? Love? What's that, bro. You playin' me?\nWake up, in this cold, harsh \
    world, what's with the love talk!"
set key[id=713172114003357] name "I've got the commission fee ready."
set key[id=713172114003358] name "Then can I commission $npc:11000411[gender:0]$ instead?"
set key[id=713172114003359] name "Hey. I'm a total love guy. I was waiting for you.\nYou came to me, so that's \
    perfect. Wait there, it'll be done soon."
set key[id=713172114003360] name "I'm looking forward to it."
set key[id=713172114003361] name "Hey, you. Total zero. What are you gonna do going to that third-rate \
    hack?\nWait. I'll finish it soon. "
set key[id=713172114003362] name "I'm looking forward to it."
set key[id=713172114003363] name "Yeah, it'll be done soon. Trust me, bro. \nI'm gonna make you a masterpiece, for \
    real, seriously, awesome, wow, a total hit."
set key[id=713172114003364] name "Okay, I'll wait."
set key[id=713172114003365] name "Nope, don't wait. I'm a sensitive artist.\nI'll make it when inspiration hits. \
    Right then, I'll call you, bro."
set key[id=713172114003366] name "How am I supposed to believe that?"
set key[id=713172114003367] name "Here, take this. An item with an artist's heart in it, for you, bro.\nA song \
    that will soak into $MyPCName$'s heart, I'll finish it for sure someday."
set key[id=713172114003368] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003369] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=713172114003370] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=713172114003371] name "No, thanks."
set key[id=713172114003372] name "Great! Right now, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000118$</font> and tell \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000617[gender:0]$</font>\nhow you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your \
    hearts connect, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003373] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003374] name "I refuse your refusal! Right now, go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000118$</font> and tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000617[gender:0]$</font>\nhow \
    you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your hearts connect, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> \
    will appear as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003375] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003376] name "Tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000617[gender:0]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000118$</font> how you feel.\nIf your hearts connect, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!\nTake $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=713172114003377] name "Huh...? Do you need something from me?"
set key[id=713172114003378] name "I love you."
set key[id=713172114003379] name "I lo... lo... lollipop you."
set key[id=713172114003380] name "Ah, yes... I see. Thank you."
set key[id=713172114003381] name "Sorry, I think I flustered you."
set key[id=713172114003382] name "No, it's fine. I get a lot of those <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">letters</font>.\nStrangers send me things like <font color=\"#ffd200\">I love you, Mr. \
    Soldier</font>...\nCome to think of it, I'm not even married yet, and they call me mister... how mean..."
set key[id=713172114003383] name "It's as unfair as when someone asked if all Royal Guards are <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">twins</font>.\nI often hear ridiculous things like <font color=\"#ffd200\">you all look the \
    same</font>.\nIf <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11003534[gender:0]$ $npcFunction:11003534[gender:0]$</font> \
    had heard that, he would have scolded them... "
set key[id=713172114003384] name "(Compliment $npcName:11000617[gender:0]$ on his really handsome eyebrows.)"
set key[id=713172114003385] name "Really? Chief <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11003534[gender:0]$</font> \
    praised them like that too...!\nI'm so glad to meet someone with an eye for beauty. I hope to see you again."
set key[id=713172114003386] name "Me too."
set key[id=713172114003387] name "<font color=\"#00a2ed\">$npc:11000617[gender:0]$ reporting! Nothing unusual at \
    the post!!</font>\n...Ah, sorry. I thought Chief <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11003534[gender:0]$</font> \
    had arrived.\nThat's a <font color=\"#ffd200\">joke</font> he often makes... \nWhen you hear it, you have to \
    report right away, and then laugh loudly and say it's funny, or he's not happy."
set key[id=713172114003388] name "That must be tiring with the Chief around."
set key[id=713172114003389] name "Not at all, he has a warm heart, so I'm always grateful.\n...Please pass that on \
    to the Chief. Understood?"
set key[id=713172114003390] name "Got it."
set key[id=713172114003391] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000617[gender:0]$</font>'s expression has \
    brightened.\nIt seems you've connected with him...!"
set key[id=713172114003392] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003393] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=713172114003394] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=713172114003395] name "No, thanks."
set key[id=713172114003396] name "Great! Right now, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010047$</font> and tell \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001430[gender:0]$</font>\nhow you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your \
    hearts connect, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003397] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003398] name "I refuse your refusal! Right now, go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010047$</font> and tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001430[gender:0]$</font>\nhow \
    you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your hearts connect, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> \
    will appear as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003399] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003400] name "Tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001430[gender:0]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010047$</font> how you feel.\nIf your hearts connect, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!\nTake $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=713172114003401] name "$MyPCName$...?  What brings you here?"
set key[id=713172114003402] name "I love you."
set key[id=713172114003403] name "Were you waiting for me?"
set key[id=713172114003404] name "You really make me dizzy. I don't know who you made a bet with,\nbut stop using \
    me for such a pointless prank."
set key[id=713172114003405] name "It's a misunderstanding."
set key[id=713172114003406] name "I want to make you dizzy."
set key[id=713172114003407] name "Right, no matter how rude and self-centered you are,\nI didn't think you'd be \
    that clueless.\nSo, what's the <font color=\"#ffd200\">real reason</font> you came to see me?"
set key[id=713172114003408] name "Were you waiting for me?"
set key[id=713172114003409] name "...Seriously, did you bet with someone on how I'd react\nwhen you said something \
    like that? Is that it?\n<font color=\"#909090\">($npcName:11001430[gender:0]$'s gaze is so cold. One wrong \
    answer and I'll freeze to death.)</font>"
set key[id=713172114003410] name "It's a misunderstanding."
set key[id=713172114003411] name "...What are you suddenly talking about, out of nowhere.\nYou're a funny one, \
    really."
set key[id=713172114003412] name "I missed you."
set key[id=713172114003413] name "Let's get married."
set key[id=713172114003414] name "Really... how strange.\nWhatever. Do as you like.\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">($npcName:11001430[gender:0]$ seems to smile faintly.)</font>"
set key[id=713172114003415] name "You see a sparkling light behind <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001430[gender:0]$</font>, who has turned away.\nIt seems you've connected with \
    him...!"
set key[id=713172114003416] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003417] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=713172114003418] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=713172114003419] name "No, thanks."
set key[id=713172114003420] name "Great! Right now, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000137$</font> and tell \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000406[gender:0]$</font>\nhow you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your \
    hearts connect, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003421] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you can buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003422] name "I refuse your refusal! Right now, go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000137$</font> and tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000406[gender:0]$</font>\nhow \
    you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your hearts connect, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> \
    will appear as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003423] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you can buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003424] name "Tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000406[gender:0]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000137$</font> how you feel.\nIf your hearts connect, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!\nTake $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=713172114003425] name "I know you like me, but don't poke or touch me.\nMy skin is precious."
set key[id=713172114003426] name "I'm your fan."
set key[id=713172114003427] name "I'm an anti-fan."
set key[id=713172114003428] name "I have a huge number of fans, but you're the first <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">enthusiastic fan</font> like this.\nHow did you get all the way up here without the \
    bodyguards noticing?"
set key[id=713172114003429] name "I climbed up here with the power of love."
set key[id=713172114003430] name "Heh, you can't control your feelings when you see me, can you? \nThat's... \
    because I'm just too beautiful. "
set key[id=713172114003431] name "You're really, really handsome."
set key[id=713172114003432] name "I don't think you're quite that handsome."
set key[id=713172114003433] name "Heh, I know~\nCome see me a lot from now on, too!"
set key[id=713172114003434] name "Got it."
set key[id=713172114003435] name "How funny. Saying such a cute thing to get my attention.\nAll right, I'll give \
    you one autograph."
set key[id=713172114003436] name "You're really, really handsome."
set key[id=713172114003437] name "I don't need one."
set key[id=713172114003438] name "...Hm? What did you just say? \nI couldn't hear it well, can you say it again?"
set key[id=713172114003439] name "I was joking, so please don't be mad."
set key[id=713172114003440] name "Fine~ I'm so handsome, I'll just have to put up with it.\nDo that again and I'll \
    hit you. With my lips."
set key[id=713172114003441] name "Got it."
set key[id=713172114003442] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000406[gender:0]$</font> breaks into a confident \
    smile.\nIt seems you've connected with him...!"
set key[id=713172114003443] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003444] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=713172114003445] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=713172114003446] name "No, thanks."
set key[id=713172114003447] name "Great! Right now, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> and tell \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font>\nhow you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your \
    hearts connect, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003448] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003449] name "I refuse your refusal! Right now, go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> and tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font>\nhow \
    you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your hearts connect, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> \
    will appear as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003450] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003451] name "Tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> how you feel.\nIf your hearts connect, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!\nTake $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=713172114003452] name "What is it?"
set key[id=713172114003453] name "I love you."
set key[id=713172114003454] name "Haha, those words feel good to hear, but they're not easy to say.\nThank you for \
    saying them to me."
set key[id=713172114003455] name "Are you accepting my confession?"
set key[id=713172114003456] name "In my heart... there is already <font color=\"#ffd200\">someone who has a place \
    there</font>.\nI'll gladly accept your feelings, but I have nothing to give you.\nI'm sorry. "
set key[id=713172114003457] name "Actually, I was lying."
set key[id=713172114003458] name "Ha ha, all right. It's fine. Let's say that's the case.\nThank you anyway."
set key[id=713172114003459] name "($npcName:11000119[gender:0]$... Kind of a cool guy.)"
set key[id=713172114003460] name "It seems you have something else you want to say, young one.\nDon't hesitate, \
    just say it. I'll listen."
set key[id=713172114003461] name "This is embarrassing, but... I love you."
set key[id=713172114003462] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000119[gender:0]$</font> pounds his chest and \
    laughs.\nIt seems you've connected with him...!"
set key[id=713172114003463] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003464] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=713172114003465] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=713172114003466] name "No, thanks."
