    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=713172114003511] name "Hello~ What can I do for you?"
set key[id=713172114003512] name "I love you."
set key[id=713172114003513] name "Oh my. Thank you for the confession, but I can't accept it.\nI'm just too busy \
    to have time~"
set key[id=713172114003514] name "I just meant that I like you."
set key[id=713172114003515] name "(Look sad.)"
set key[id=713172114003516] name "Hehe, all right. Let's greet each other warmly when we cross paths.\nI love \
    everyone who comes to $map:02000001$, after all."
set key[id=713172114003517] name "Something feels off, but okay."
set key[id=713172114003518] name "Oh my... $MyPCName$, are you crying? \nCrying because you didn't get an answer \
    you liked makes you a loser. "
set key[id=713172114003519] name "I'm not a loser!"
set key[id=713172114003520] name "Then accept my feelings!"
set key[id=713172114003521] name "Come on~ You have to pick your battles.\nWhen something isn't going to work, \
    it's best to give up quickly, $MyPCName$~"
set key[id=713172114003522] name "(Stop making a fool of myself and back off.)"
set key[id=713172114003523] name "(Cling on just one more time.)"
set key[id=713172114003524] name "Hehe. All right.\nI love everyone who comes to $map:02000001$."
set key[id=713172114003525] name "Got it."
set key[id=713172114003526] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000160[gender:1]$</font> gives a little wink and \
    smiles.\nIt seems you've connected with her...!"
set key[id=713172114003527] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003528] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=713172114003529] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=713172114003530] name "No, thanks."
set key[id=713172114003531] name "Great! Right now, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000124$</font> and tell \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000514[gender:1]$</font>\nhow you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your \
