    will appear as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003563] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003564] name "Tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000216$</font> how you feel.\nIf your hearts connect, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!\nTake $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=713172114003565] name "Who are you?"
set key[id=713172114003566] name "I love you."
set key[id=713172114003567] name "Don't you smell something burning somewhere?"
set key[id=713172114003568] name "Hehehe. What a romantic.\nBut there's no such thing as a free lunch. Especially \
    here at the Black Market."
set key[id=713172114003569] name "How much will it take?"
set key[id=713172114003570] name "Love is eternal, wherever you are."
set key[id=713172114003571] name "Hmm...? The most interesting thing you've said so far.\nDo you have some wealth \
    put away? \nWith the mesos you're carrying now, it doesn't look possible."
set key[id=713172114003572] name "I have a little."
set key[id=713172114003573] name "(I see bodyguards. I'd better apologize and get out fast.)"
set key[id=713172114003574] name "A little... is it. That's not enough. \nTo come on to me, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font>, you'd have to be able to bring me a royal palace."
set key[id=713172114003575] name "I'll work hard and earn more from now on."
set key[id=713172114003576] name "(Apologize and hurry out.)"
set key[id=713172114003577] name "Romance and spirit both. Good, that's what it takes.\nI, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font>, really hate being looked down on.\nBut I have no need for \
    your heart right now."
set key[id=713172114003578] name "My heart is burning for you."
set key[id=713172114003579] name "Oh dear. A burning heart is serious. Put it out quickly.\nOh, and if you need \
    firefighters, just say so.\nThis is the Black Market, so as long as you have mesos, you can get anything \
    done."
set key[id=713172114003580] name "(...Scary. I apologize and hurry out.)"
set key[id=713172114003581] name "Hehe, come back any time if you need something.\nA light heart and a heavy \
    wallet."
set key[id=713172114003582] name "(Nod.)"
set key[id=713172114003583] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font> curls her lips into a \
    grin.\nHave you connected with her...?"
set key[id=713172114003584] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003585] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=713172114003586] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=713172114003587] name "No, thanks."
set key[id=713172114003588] name "Great! Right now, go tell <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000015[gender:1]$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000076$</font>\nhow you \
    feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your hearts connect, you'll get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003589] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003590] name "I refuse your refusal! Right now, go tell <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000015[gender:1]$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000076$</font>\nhow you \
    feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your hearts connect, you'll get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> as proof!"
set key[id=713172114003591] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003592] name "Tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000015[gender:1]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000076$</font> how you feel.\nIf your hearts connect, you'll get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> as proof!\nIf you take $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>,\nyou can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=713172114003593] name "Did you want to say something to me?"
set key[id=713172114003594] name "I love you."
set key[id=713172114003595] name "(Flatter him: so cool, so good with a bow, the strongest in the universe.)"
set key[id=713172114003596] name "Oh, yes. Thank you."
set key[id=713172114003597] name "(Flatter him: so cool, so good with a bow, the strongest in the universe.)"
set key[id=713172114003598] name "Please accept my love."
set key[id=713172114003599] name "That's... too kind of you. \nI'm only doing my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">best</font> every day as a member of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">vigilantes</font>."
set key[id=713172114003600] name "I'd like to join your fan club."
set key[id=713172114003601] name "Ah, that's... it may be a bit of a hassle,\nbut please get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">permission</font> from <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000547[gender:1]$</font> first."
set key[id=713172114003602] name "What on earth are you talking about?"
set key[id=713172114003603] name "$npcName:11000547[gender:1]$ asked me, as a <font color=\"#ffd200\">heartfelt \
    wish</font>, to hear her out for <font color=\"#ffd200\">one month</font>.\nIf anyone confesses to me this \
    month or says they want to join my fan club,\nshe asked me to <font color=\"#ffd200\">send them to her \
    first</font>. "
set key[id=713172114003604] name "I made a <font color=\"#ffd200\">promise</font>... so I have to keep it. \nIt's \
    a favor I'm able to grant. "
set key[id=713172114003605] name "(It doesn't look like this month will work. Step back.)"
set key[id=713172114003606] name "Yes, thank you for understanding."
set key[id=713172114003607] name "Sure."
set key[id=713172114003608] name "(<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000015[gender:1]$</font> smiles gently.\nHave we \
    connected...?)"
set key[id=713172114003609] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003610] name "Being showered with more love than you can handle can sometimes lead to sad \
    results.\nThey say there's someone in Maple World who's a tragic case like that... \nCould you go and calm her \
    down, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=713172114003611] name "When it came out that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000022$</font> of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000117$</font> is a woman, \nmany adventurers reacted with disbelief. Some even \
    teased her... \nChosen as Miss Valentine, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000022$</font> had no time to be \
    happy before\nshe started suffering stress-induced hair loss... how sad!"
set key[id=713172114003612] name "Now that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000022$</font> has grown so wild, she \
    attacks fiercely whenever anyone comes near.\nIt's a pity, but she can't go around threatening people,\nso \
    please calm <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000022$</font> down, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003613] name "Please go and calm down <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000022$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000117$</font>.\nWhen you come back, I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>!\nIf you take $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>,\nyou can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=713172114003614] name "$MyPCName$, you're back?\nHas <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:22000022$</font> \
    calmed down a bit?"
set key[id=713172114003615] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, it feels like there's a little more love in this \
    world!\nGood work today, too!"
set key[id=713172114003621] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003622] name "Try tapping the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Maple Arcade'</font> menu at the bottom \
    of the screen.\nThen you can go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font>."
set key[id=713172114003623] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=713172114003624] name "How about feeling like a farmer growing sprouts and letting love sprout?\nPlay \
    the game in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font> and come back, and I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nIf you take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to \
    $npc:11004101$ in $map:63000062$,\nyou can buy some fun items!"
set key[id=713172114003625] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, it feels like there's a little more love in this \
    world!\nGood work today, too!"
set key[id=713172114003626] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=713172114003627] name "Love connections are felt even among many people... \nHow about looking for your \
    destined one in a place full of people?\nJoin <font color=\"#ffd200\">the event hosted by \
    $npc:11001899[gender:0]$</font> and come back, and I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>."
set key[id=713172114003628] name "Sure."
