set key[id=713172114003694] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, it feels like there's a little more love in this \
    world!\nGood work today, too!"
set key[id=713172114003695] name "Greetings, $MyPCName$.\nI hear you're going to help $npc:11004099[gender:0]$ and \
    $npc:11004100[gender:1]$? \nYou don't walk past other people's suffering. You really are a kind soul.\n"
set key[id=713172114003696] name "Helping kind people is a trait of us magpies, you might say. Ahem.\nCarry out \
    the task I give you and come back, and I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nI'll \
    give you plenty of time, so enjoy the scenery of $map:63000062$ as you go."
set key[id=713172114003697] name "This week's task is... \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Complete the Love Dance Party \
    10 times</font>.\nYou know how it's done, don't you? "
set key[id=713172114003698] name "Yes, I know."
set key[id=713172114003699] name "I don't. Could you explain it?"
set key[id=713172114003700] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Love Dance Party'</font> can only be held right \
    here in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>,\nso don't go off anywhere else by mistake!\nYou have \
    until the seventh moon rises, so take your time~"
set key[id=713172114003701] name "Tap the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Adventure'</font> icon at the bottom of the \
    screen. The <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Love Dance Party'</font> menu is at the top.\nPress the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Request Couple Dance</font> button there and wait for a dance partner. \nWhen your partner \
    arrives, just dance together. Pretty easy, huh?\n"
set key[id=713172114003702] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Love Dance Party'</font> can only be held right \
    here in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>,\nso don't go off anywhere else.\nYou have until the \
    seventh moon rises, so take your time~"
set key[id=713172114003703] name "This week's task is <font color=\"#ffd200\">Complete the Love Dance Party 10 \
    times</font>.\nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Love Dance Party'</font> can only be held right here in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>,\nso don't go off anywhere else, and be sure to do it right here~"
set key[id=713172114003704] name "It was a joy to watch you dance so hard. Here, the gift I promised. \nLook \
    forward to my task next week, too."
set key[id=713172114003705] name "Greetings, $MyPCName$.\nI, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">kind magpie</font>, have \
    prepared a <font color=\"#ffd200\">task</font> for kind people again this week.\nAre you ready for my gift \
    again this week? \n"
set key[id=713172114003706] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font> is a place where mysterious water \
    flows, so it's wonderful for <font color=\"#ffd200\">fishing</font>.\nWhat's more, there are <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">extraordinary fish</font> that live only here.\nHow about enjoying some fishing here and \
    having a special experience?"
set key[id=713172114003707] name "This week's task is... \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Reel in 7 Big Catches</font> in \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>, and catch\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">10 Zappy Heart Rays</font> \
    and <font color=\"#ffd200\">3 Flowerpath Axolotls</font>."
set key[id=713172114003708] name "Go <font color=\"#ffd200\">fishing</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font> and meet some <font color=\"#ffd200\">special fish</font>, too.\nWhen \
    you finish this task, I'll give you plenty of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nYou have until \
    the seventh moon rises, so take your time~"
set key[id=713172114003709] name "This week's task is to <font color=\"#ffd200\">Reel in 7 Big Catches</font> in \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>, and catch\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">10 Zappy Heart Rays</font> \
    and <font color=\"#ffd200\">3 Flowerpath Axolotls</font>.\nDon't go off anywhere else, and be sure to do it \
    right here~"
set key[id=713172114003710] name "It was a joy to watch you fish so hard. Here, the gift I promised. \nLook \
    forward to my task next week, too."
set key[id=713172114003711] name "Greetings, $MyPCName$.\nI, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">kind magpie</font>, have \
    prepared a <font color=\"#ffd200\">task</font> for kind people again this week.\nAre you ready for my gift \
    again this week? \n"
set key[id=713172114003712] name "$map:63000062$... isn't it truly beautiful? \nA beautiful place shines even \
    brighter when there's beautiful music.\nWon't you fill this lovely place with the melody of love?"
set key[id=713172114003713] name "This week's task is... \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Perform for 30 minutes in \
    $map:63000062$</font>, and\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Play in an ensemble 7 times in $map:63000062$</font>."
set key[id=713172114003714] name "Work together with others to keep music flowing in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>.\nWhen you finish this task, I'll give you plenty of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nYou have until the seventh moon rises, so take your time~"
set key[id=713172114003715] name "This week's task is <font color=\"#ffd200\">Perform for 30 minutes in \
    $map:63000062$</font>, and\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Play in an ensemble 7 times in \
    $map:63000062$</font>.\nDon't go off anywhere else, and be sure to do it right here~"
set key[id=713172114003716] name "It was a joy to watch you play so hard. Here, the gift I promised. \nLook \
    forward to my task next week, too."
set key[id=713172114003717] name "Greetings, $MyPCName$.\nI've prepared the <font color=\"#ffd200\">final \
    task</font> for kind people, from the <font color=\"#ffd200\">kind magpie</font>.\nNow, are you ready for my \
    gift? \n"
set key[id=713172114003718] name "This task may be quite hard.\nYou have to find <font color=\"#ffd200\">someone \
    wearing really special clothes</font>.\nBut since it's the last one, do your best and find them. "
set key[id=713172114003719] name "This week's task is... \nto find someone wearing <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:11401061$</font>.\nThey say people called <font color=\"#ffd200\">GMs</font> gave them \
    out as gifts on a very special day? I'd like to try them on, too."
set key[id=713172114003720] name "When you finish this task, I'll give you plenty of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nYou have until the final, seventh moon rises, so take your time~"
set key[id=713172114003721] name "This week's task is to find someone wearing <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:11401061$</font>.\nWhen you finish this task, I'll give you plenty of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nYou have until the final, seventh moon rises, so take your time~"
set key[id=713172114003722] name "You worked hard, and it was wonderful to see. Here is my last gift. \nAnything \
    of mine that catches your eye, I'll trade for these <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>."
set key[id=713172114003723] name "Hee hee~ $MyPCName$!\nThanks to your efforts, the bridge to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Island of Love</font> is complete!\nYou're amazing!"
set key[id=713172114003724] name "But this island can only be open for <font color=\"#ffd200\">just one \
    day</font>.\nOf course I feel for $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ and $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$, who'll be \
    parted again tomorrow,\nbut <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, who worked so hard to fill the world \
    with love, must feel awful too..."
set key[id=713172114003725] name "So I've prepared a little gift. Love doubles when you share it!\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Complete</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance Party 3 times</font> and come back to \
    me. \nI'll be waiting with a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> that'll surprise you."
set key[id=713172114003726] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Complete</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance \
    Party 3 times</font> and come back to me. \nI'll be waiting with a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> that'll \
    surprise you."
set key[id=713172114003727] name "You really can dance. I was totally moved~\nI'll give you some of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">interior decorations</font> that pretty $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$ treasured.\nCome find \
    me again <font color=\"#ffd200\">next week</font> when this place opens!"
set key[id=713172114003728] name "Hee hee~ $MyPCName$! We meet again!\nThanks to you, the bridge to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Island of Love</font> is complete!\nI really praise your efforts!"
set key[id=713172114003729] name "But this island can only be open for <font color=\"#ffd200\">just one \
    day</font>.\nOf course I feel for $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ and $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$, who'll be \
    parted again tomorrow,\nbut <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, who worked so hard to fill the world \
    with love, must feel awful too..."
set key[id=713172114003730] name "So I've prepared a little gift. Love doubles when you share it!\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Complete</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance Party 3 times</font> and come back to \
    me. \nI'll be waiting with a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> that'll surprise you."
set key[id=713172114003731] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Complete</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance \
    Party 3 times</font> and come back to me. \nI'll be waiting with a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> that'll \
    surprise you."
set key[id=713172114003732] name "This week I'll give you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">pretty hair ornament</font> \
    that $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ made thinking of $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$.\nCome find me again <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">next week</font> when this place opens!"
set key[id=713172114003733] name "Hee hee~ $MyPCName$! We meet again!\nThanks to you, the bridge to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Island of Love</font> is complete!\nI really praise your efforts!"
set key[id=713172114003734] name "But this island can only be open for <font color=\"#ffd200\">just one \
    day</font>.\nOf course I feel for $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ and $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$, who'll be \
    parted again tomorrow,\nbut <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, who worked so hard to fill the world \
    with love, must feel awful too..."
set key[id=713172114003735] name "So I've prepared a little gift. Love doubles when you share it!\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Complete</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance Party 3 times</font> and come back to \
    me. \nI'll be waiting with a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> that'll surprise you."
set key[id=713172114003736] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Complete</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance \
    Party 3 times</font> and come back to me. \nI'll be waiting with a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> that'll \
    surprise you."
set key[id=713172114003737] name "This time I'll give you the headband $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ and \
    $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$ wore on their date.\nIf you wear it with someone precious, it'll make a lovely \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">couple item</font>!\nCome find me again <font color=\"#ffd200\">next week</font> when \
    this place opens!"
set key[id=713172114003738] name "Hee hee~ This week, too, the bridge to the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Island of \
    Love</font> is complete!\nAnd thanks to you, some truly <font color=\"#ffd200\">amazing news</font> has come \
    in!\nI'm so glad I get to be the one to tell you!"
set key[id=713172114003739] name "The Island of Love isn't really a place that opens easily. \n$MyPCName$, you \
    gathered the world's love here and made a <font color=\"#ffd200\">miracle</font>.\nOf course, \
    $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ and $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$'s <font color=\"#ffd200\">longing for each \
    other</font> was very strong, too."
set key[id=713172114003740] name "Anyway, the stars who saw this miracle decided to forgive \
    $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ and $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$.\nBut to keep the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">moon</font> from growing too bright with the power of love, \nthey say this place will be \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">closed</font> so that no one can enter. "
set key[id=713172114003741] name "So now we have to say goodbye to this place, too.\nWhile I wrap the last gift \
    for you who made the miracle,\ncould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">complete</font> the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance Party 3 times</font>?\nI'll be waiting here."
set key[id=713172114003742] name "While I wrap the last gift for you who made the miracle,\ncould you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">complete</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance Party 3 times</font>?\nI'll be \
    waiting here."
set key[id=713172114003743] name "Today is the <font color=\"#ffd200\">last</font> time I'll get to see you dance \
    here.\nBut I'll be anywhere there's <font color=\"#ffd200\">love</font>,\nand if you're there, we'll meet \
    again.\nBecause a <font color=\"#ffd200\">goodbye</font> isn't a farewell forever, it's a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">promise to meet again</font>."
set key[id=713172114003744] name "Here. It's a pretty <font color=\"#ffd200\">couple tee</font> that \
    $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ and $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$ designed themselves.\nTry wearing it with <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">your other half</font>, who'll share a love lovelier than $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ and \
    $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$!"
set key[id=716112814003745] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=716112814003746] name "Love is the heart that nurtures small but precious things...\nHow about feeling \
    like a farmer growing sprouts and letting love sprout?\nPlay the game in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font> and come back, and I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>."
set key[id=716112814003747] name "Sure."
set key[id=718135014003751] name "(I can't bring myself to confess, so I talk about something else.)"
set key[id=718135014003752] name "Actually, I was lying."
set key[id=809185314003753] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nHave you heard that you can buy all kinds of goods with \
    Starlight Festival coins?\nGo to my twin brother $npcName:11001003[gender:0]$ next to me and you can look at \
    some amazing items.\nComplete Ruby's request every day and you can earn coins. "
set key[id=809185314003754] name "Do Ruby's request every day,\nand collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>!\nToday Ruby's request is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat \
    $npc:23000054$'</font>!"
