    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>!\nToday Ruby's request is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat \
    $npc:23000034$'</font>!"
set key[id=809185314003804] name "You cleared Ruby's daily request successfully!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font> I promised!\nI hope you can buy some good items from my brother Bobby \
    with <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>."
set key[id=809185314003805] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nHave you heard that you can buy all kinds of goods with \
    Starlight Festival coins?\nGo to my twin brother $npcName:11001003[gender:0]$ next to me and you can look at \
    some amazing items.\nComplete Ruby's request every day and you can earn coins. "
set key[id=809185314003806] name "Do Ruby's request every day,\nand collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>!\nToday Ruby's request is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat \
    $npc:23000009[gender:0]$'</font>!"
set key[id=809185314003807] name "Do Ruby's request every day,\nand collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>!\nToday Ruby's request is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat \
    $npc:23000009[gender:0]$'</font>!"
set key[id=809185314003808] name "You cleared Ruby's daily request successfully!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font> I promised!\nI hope you can buy some good items from my brother Bobby \
    with <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>."
set key[id=809185314003809] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nHave you heard that you can buy all kinds of goods with \
    Starlight Festival coins?\nGo to my twin brother $npcName:11001003[gender:0]$ next to me and you can look at \
    some amazing items.\nComplete Ruby's request every day and you can earn coins. "
set key[id=809185314003810] name "Do Ruby's request every day,\nand collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>!\nToday Ruby's request is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat \
    $npc:23000029$'</font>!"
set key[id=809185314003811] name "Do Ruby's request every day,\nand collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>!\nToday Ruby's request is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat \
    $npc:23000029$'</font>!"
set key[id=809185314003812] name "You cleared Ruby's daily request successfully!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font> I promised!\nI hope you can buy some good items from my brother Bobby \
    with <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>."
set key[id=809185314003813] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nHave you heard that you can buy all kinds of goods with \
    Starlight Festival coins?\nGo to my twin brother $npcName:11001003[gender:0]$ next to me and you can look at \
    some amazing items.\nComplete Ruby's request every day and you can earn coins. "
set key[id=809185314003814] name "Do Ruby's request every day,\nand collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>!\nToday Ruby's request is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat \
    $npc:23000057[gender:1]$'</font>!"
set key[id=809185314003815] name "Do Ruby's request every day,\nand collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>!\nToday Ruby's request is <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Defeat \
    $npc:23000057[gender:1]$'</font>!"
set key[id=809185314003816] name "You cleared Ruby's daily request successfully!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font> I promised!\nI hope you can buy some good items from my brother Bobby \
    with <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001190$</font>."
set key[id=830165614003822] name "$MyPCName$, have you seen $npcFunction:11004248$, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font>, over there?\nRight when she should be busy making <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Moonlight Songpyeon</font> for the Harvest Festival, \nshe came down to Maple World... \
    Something <font color=\"#ffd200\">serious</font> must be <font color=\"#ffd200\">wrong</font>."
set key[id=830165614003823] name "They say the moon rabbits who worked there suddenly changed strangely and ran \
    away.\n$npcName:11004248$ is the daughter of the Full Moon Mill's work foreman,\nand since her mother is \
    bedridden and frustrated that work has stopped,\nit seems she came down to teach adventurers how to make <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Moonlight Songpyeon</font> in her place."
set key[id=830165614003824] name "$MyPCName$, try learning how to make Moonlight Songpyeon from \
    $npc:11004248$.\nShe'll teach you right away if you bring the ingredients... Oh! \nYou can just dig up <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001195$</font>!"
set key[id=830165614003825] name "Search and investigate the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Flower Balloons floating \
    around</font> Maple World to find\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001195$</font>, then bring them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font>!\nShe'll show you how to make Moonlight Songpyeon, and she'll even \
    prepare the ingredients for you!"
set key[id=830165614003826] name "Huh... this fragrance, could it be...? \nDid you bring <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001195$</font>?"
set key[id=830165614003827] name "Wow...! In this condition, I can trim them up and use them as <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">songpyeon ingredients</font>!\nPlease wait just a moment and I'll prepare them neatly for \
    you!"
set key[id=830165614003828] name "$MyPCName$, have you seen $npcFunction:11004248$, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font>, over there?\nRight when she should be busy making <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Moonlight Songpyeon</font> for the Harvest Festival, \nshe came down to Maple World... \
    Something <font color=\"#ffd200\">serious</font> must be <font color=\"#ffd200\">wrong</font>."
set key[id=830165614003829] name "They say the moon rabbits who worked there ran away. Isn't that strange?\nThe \
    gentle, kind moon rabbits would never steal the ingredients and run off like that. \n...But you know, I think \
    I know why. That <font color=\"#ffd200\">suspicious aura</font>..."
set key[id=830165614003830] name "Yes, I felt it. The aura seeping out of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">secret space \
    behind the full moon</font>... \nThere's a rumor that the huge, bizarre-looking rabbits showing up in \
    $map:02000043$ lately\nare the moon rabbits, changed, and I think\nsomething might be going on there."
set key[id=830165614003831] name "$MyPCName$, will you go behind the full moon and unravel its secret?\nIf you use \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301895$</font>, you should be able to get in.\nAfter you come back from there, \
    please tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font> about it!"
set key[id=830165614003832] name "Ah... this aura, this sweet scent... \n$MyPCName$, did you go to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">space behind the full moon</font>? "
set key[id=830165614003833] name "I knew it... \nWhy on earth is this happening... "
set key[id=831180104000282] name "By the way, you... would you do me a favor?"
set key[id=831180104000284] name "Barota Company's leader $npc:11000526[gender:0]$... $npc:11000526[gender:0]$ has \
    vanished...\nThe Black Star Society is making a huge fuss, demanding payment for $item:20000046$...\nTo just \
    vanish like this..."
set key[id=831180104000286] name "No, I'm the go-between who's been picking up the goods and handing over \nthe \
    money, so the Black Star Society guys must be hunting for me like mad.\nI have to take care of my father... \
    and find my sister who was taken to the Land of Darkness...\nI can't just get dragged off and waste my life \
    paying off debts..."
set key[id=831180104000287] name "So here's the thing... $MyPCName$! \nCould you go to the Land of Darkness for me \
    and explain my situation? \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Ask them to push back the payment date just a \
    little...</font>"
set key[id=831180104000288] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000610[gender:0]$</font> of the Black Star \
    Society is a friend of mine, so if you explain well,\nthey might go easy on me. \nPlease pass it along well... \
    I'm begging you!"
set key[id=831180104000289] name "I really hope this works out..."
set key[id=831180104000290] name "Judging by the look of you, you're no smuggler... you're clearly a greenhorn in \
    the Land of Darkness.\nYou look like the type who'd gawk around without knowing how rough this place is and \
    just fall flat on your face."
set key[id=831180104000291] name "I can't stand cleaning up corpses, you know.\nIt's easier to die than to live \
    around here, so take care of your own neck!"
set key[id=831180104000292] name "But didn't you say you came to tell me something?\nWhat is it?"
set key[id=831180104000294] name "What? Delay the payment date?\nIs that guy out of his mind?\nYou think I'd grant \
    a favor like that just because we've met a couple of times? Huh?"
set key[id=831180104000295] name "The Black Star Society never postpones a payment date.\nWhat happens if you \
    can't repay?\nWhat else, we chase you to the ends of the world and drag you back."
set key[id=831180104000296] name "Well, if you'd rather pay off the debt in his place, $MyPCName$, I won't stop \
    you.\nFor the amount of $item:20000046$ that a man called Raymon, the one he serves, took, \nyou'd have to \
    bring <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000102$</font> to settle the account."
set key[id=831180104000297] name "If you can find <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000102$</font> in a place \
    crawling with \ninsanely strong monsters and outlaws, then go ahead and try!"
set key[id=831180104000298] name "Still hanging around me, huh? Figures, you're nobody special!"
set key[id=831180104000299] name "Oho, not bad, kid!\nSurviving this lawless land and coming back alive!"
set key[id=831180104000300] name "You brought <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20000102$</font> and want your debt \
    forgiven?\nDon't make me laugh."
set key[id=831180104000302] name "Trade what?!\n$item:20000102$ is the principal, and the interest is paid \
    separately!\nThat's how the Black Star Society does its math!"
set key[id=831180104000303] name "The moment you set foot in this Land of Darkness, didn't you feel \
    something?!\nThe killing intent and terror given off by vengeful spirits full of resentment...\nIf you can \
    master that power, you can rule the Land of Darkness as a strongman."
set key[id=831180104000304] name "The madness of those beasts in the darkness all comes from the power\nthey \
    absorbed from the spirits wandering the Land of Darkness.\nAs time passes, $item:30000331$ absorbs more and \
    more of the energy flowing through\nthe Land of Darkness and eventually turns into $item:20000103$."
set key[id=831180104000305] name "Well... right now you can't understand a word I'm saying...\nbut someday when \
    you get $item:20000103$, you'll know."
set key[id=831180104000306] name "Anyway... the conclusion is this.\nDefeat the beasts spewing madness in that \
    darkness and find the\n$item:30000331$ they absorbed and bring it to me. \nThen I'll count it as interest."
set key[id=831180104000307] name "Defeat the beasts spewing madness in that darkness and find the\n$item:30000331$ \
    they absorbed and bring it to me. \nThen I'll count it as interest."
set key[id=831180104000308] name "You're pretty skilled, aren't you?\nDon't you want to become one of our Black \
    Star Society members? Heh heh heh..."
set key[id=831180104000309] name "All right, that should cover the debt, interest included.\nGo tell \
    $npcName:11000609[gender:0]$\nthat I'll report to the higher-ups that the debt is paid."
set key[id=831180104000310] name "Why do you keep hanging around?\nDon't tell me you want to join the Black Star \
    Society after all? Heh heh heh..."
set key[id=831180104000311] name "You're back, $MyPCName$!!!\nI waited and waited with no word, so I thought \
    something had happened!"
set key[id=831180104000313] name "Really? I was so worried the Black Star Society would drag me off to grind \
    powder for ten years...\nThank you so much! I owe it all to you!!!"
set key[id=903204514003841] name "Every evening, please subdue the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:27000034$</font>s \
    that appear in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000043$</font>. \nThey're probably my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">colleagues</font> who used to work together at the Full Moon Mill."
set key[id=903204514003842] name "There's a moon rabbit tribe <font color=\"#ffd200\">legend</font> my mother told \
    me when I was little.\nLong ago, moon rabbits tainted by a <font color=\"#ffd200\">strange aura</font> tore \
    the mill apart,\nand they say they never stopped until they were <font color=\"#ffd200\">completely \
    subdued</font> and drained of that aura.\nSome of them returned to normal, but some didn't... "
set key[id=903204514003843] name "The $npc:27000034$s roaming $map:02000043$ are said to appear at\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">8:30 AM and 2:30 PM every day</font> and at\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">7:30, 8:30, 9:30 and \
    10:30 PM</font>.\nPlease subdue them and help them find peace."
set key[id=903204514003844] name "You're back. \n...Thank you for helping, even though you're busy."
set key[id=903204514003845] name "It's all right. They're probably grateful to you too, $MyPCName$.\nAs thanks, \
    I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001194$</font>. Use it as an ingredient for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">songpyeon</font>. "
set key[id=903204614003846] name "$MyPCName$. There's something I'd like to ask... \nWould you listen to my \
    story...?"
set key[id=910142914003847] name "What's the problem?"
set key[id=910142914003849] name "Yes, you can find them by <font color=\"#ffd200\">searching and investigating \
    the Flower Balloons</font> floating around Maple World!\nThey give off a scent quite similar to the songpyeon \
    ingredients used at the Full Moon Mill. \nI think they could be used as songpyeon ingredients once they're \
    prepared.\nCollect <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001195$</font> and bring them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font>!\n"
set key[id=910142914003850] name "(Hand over <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001195$</font>.)"
set key[id=910142914003851] name "(Wait.)"
set key[id=910142914003852] name "Here, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001193$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001194$</font>! If you double-click them in your inventory, \nyou can <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">combine</font> them with $item:30001192$ to make Moonlight Songpyeon!"
set key[id=910142914003853] name "What's the problem?"
set key[id=910142914003854] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Suspicious aura</font>...?"
set key[id=910142914003855] name "$MyPCName$, will you go behind the full moon and unravel its secret?\nIf you use \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301895$</font>, you should be able to get in.\nAfter you come back from there, \
    please tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font> about it!"
set key[id=910142914003856] name "Yes. Let me tell you what I saw there."
set key[id=910142914003857] name "(Comfort $npc:11004248$.)"
set key[id=910142914003858] name "It's all right. I can't keep on being sad forever.\nNo matter what crisis comes, \
    so many people are helping us\nthat we'll surely overcome it...! "
set key[id=910142914003859] name "It looks like you got $item:30001194$, so I'll give you some more\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001192$</font> so you can make more songpyeon. Thank you for bringing me the news. "
set key[id=910142914003860] name "It's fine. Go ahead and tell me."
set key[id=910142914003861] name "Is it really all right to defeat your colleagues?"
set key[id=910142914003862] name "Of course, there may be some among our colleagues now who can't come \
    back.\nBut... disturbing the world doesn't suit the spirit of the moon rabbit tribe. \nI want to give those \
    tainted by darkness <font color=\"#ffd200\">true rest</font>."
set key[id=910142914003863] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=910142914003864] name "The $npc:27000034$s roaming $map:02000043$ are said to appear at\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">8:30 AM and 2:30 PM every day</font> and at\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">7:30, 8:30, 9:30 and \
    10:30 PM</font>.\nPlease subdue them and help them find peace."
set key[id=910142914003865] name "(Reassure $npc:11004248$.)"
set key[id=1011094214003866] name "$MyPCName$, $MyPCName$!\nDo you know about a creature called $npc:50400309$? \
    $npc:50400309$ is a little demon who loves pumpkins.\nThere's a rumor that a little demon who came to the \
    human world to play tricks on Halloween loved pumpkins so much that it turned pumpkin-shaped!"
set key[id=1011094214003867] name "A demon shaped like a pumpkin, does such a thing really exist, you ask?\nHee \
    hee, actually I found a cute $npc:50400309$ not long ago, so if you're interested, how about taking it in and \
    raising it, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1011094214003868] name "They say $npc:50400309$ loves pumpkin pie made from moist, sweet \
    pumpkins.\nDepending on how long you spend in Maple World, you can receive up to 5 $item:20302004$ every day, \
    so it shouldn't be hard to get.\nAnd if you play with $npc:50400309$ at other people's homes, you can get up \
    to 3 more $item:20302004$ every day."
set key[id=1011094214003869] name "Here, I'll give you $item:50400309$, so please set it up in your home and raise \
    $npc:50400309$. \nHee hee, it may look like a demon, but it's cute, so it won't do any harm.\nJust be aware \
    that it's so~ cute that your heart might ache, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1011094214003870] name "Now try setting up $item:50400309$ in your home.\nIt's a tiny little demon, but \
    with your love, $MyPCName$, it might grow big and strong!"
set key[id=1011094214003871] name "Hurry and set up $item:50400309$ in your home.\n$npc:50400309$ will welcome \
    you, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=1011094214003872] name "Here's some $item:20302004$ that $npc:50400309$ likes. Feed $npc:50400309$ and \
    help it grow.\nAnd don't forget that you can get up to 3 more $item:20302004$ a day by playing with \
    $npc:50400309$ at other people's homes, and up to 5 a day depending on your play time!"
set key[id=1023190701000915] name "Yalalario~ \nI recently watched a documentary about ecological anomalies, you \
    see.\nIt said <font color=\"#ffd200\">water hardened into Ludibrium cubes and strange block golems \
    appeared</font>.\nI slapped my knee right then! Ah, that's the one!"
set key[id=1023190701000916] name "Think about it, if we repaired that block golem properly, we could surely \
    reborn it as a toy \nthat children love. What do you think of my idea?"
set key[id=1023190701000917] name "(Say repairing it doesn't seem that easy.)"
set key[id=1023190701000918] name "Don't just think it can't be done, think <font color=\"#ffd200\">it can be \
    done</font>.\nFirst, why not go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000346$</font> and check whether \n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001603$</font> can be repaired?"
set key[id=1023190701000919] name "Well? Could <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001603$</font> be repaired and put \
    to use?"
set key[id=1023190701000920] name "(Say it seems hard unless you're a very skilled repairer.)"
set key[id=1023190701000921] name "Ah... so I'll have to find someone with excellent repair skills and \
    ask.\nAnyway, thanks."
set key[id=1023190701000922] name "Yalalario~ \nI recently watched a documentary about ecological anomalies, you \
    see.\nIt said <font color=\"#ffd200\">a bright red cactus like a mutant appeared</font>.\nI slapped my knee \
    right then! Ah, that's the one!"
set key[id=1023190701000923] name "Now think about it.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Red for love and passion! A cactus \
    that survives even in a desert without a drop of water!</font>\nIf we weave those words together nicely and \
    package it as a home gardening product, wouldn't people \nrush to buy it?"
set key[id=1023190701000924] name "(Ask who would buy a monster cactus.)"
set key[id=1023190701000925] name "Don't just think it can't be done, think <font color=\"#ffd200\">it can be \
    done</font>.\nFirst, could you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000347$</font> and check whether \n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001604$</font> has any appeal as an ornamental plant?"
set key[id=1023190701000926] name "Well? Is <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001604$</font> presentable as an \
    ornamental plant?"
set key[id=1023190701000927] name "(Say, honestly, it's not your taste.)"
set key[id=1023190701000928] name "Ah... I see. Still, there must be someone who finds a cactus like that \
    charming.\nAnyway, thanks."
set key[id=1023190701000929] name "My friend, this is terrible.\nI haven't heard a word for months from <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000348$</font>, which was to hand over coal for me to sell, \nand only a few days ago \
    did I learn why from an ecology documentary.\nCan you believe it, a <font color=\"#ffd200\">nasty-tempered \
    little devil</font> has appeared in the mine!!"
set key[id=1023190701000930] name "Please go defeat the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001605$</font> that's \
    wreaking havoc in the mine.\nI'm counting on you!"
set key[id=1023190701000931] name "Oh, you're back! I heard from <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000348$</font> \
    that they'll send the coal soon. \nThank you so much!"
set key[id=1023190701000932] name "Yalalario~ \nI recently watched a documentary about worldwide anomalies, you \
    see.\nIt said <font color=\"#ffd200\">a jack-in-the-box toy turned into a terrifying monster</font>.\nI \
    slapped my knee right then! Ah, that's the one!"
set key[id=1023190701000933] name "Think about it, if we repaired that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001601$</font> properly, we could surely have it \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">reborn as \
    a toy</font> that children love. What do you think of my idea?"
set key[id=1023190701000934] name "(Say repairing it doesn't seem that easy.)"
set key[id=1023190701000935] name "Don't just think it can't be done, think <font color=\"#ffd200\">it can be \
    done</font>.\nFirst, why not go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000344$</font> and check whether <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001601$</font> can be repaired \nor not?"
set key[id=1023190701000936] name "Well? Could <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001601$</font> be repaired and put \
    to use?"
set key[id=1023190701000937] name "(Say it seems hard unless you're a very skilled repairer.)"
set key[id=1023190701000938] name "Ah... so I'll have to find someone with excellent repair skills and \
    ask.\nAnyway, thanks."
set key[id=1023190701000939] name "Yalalario~ \nI recently watched a documentary about worldwide anomalies, you \
    see.\nIt said <font color=\"#ffd200\">a queen on a chessboard turned into a monster with fatal \
    charm</font>.\nI slapped my knee right then! Ah, that's the one!"
set key[id=1023190701000940] name "Think about it, if only we could calm the evil aura of that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001602[gender:1]$</font>, \nwe could have her <font color=\"#ffd200\">reborn as a \
    toy</font> that children love. \nWhat do you think of my idea?"
set key[id=1023190701000941] name "(Say it won't be easy since she's already a monster.)"
set key[id=1023190701000942] name "Don't just think it can't be done, think <font color=\"#ffd200\">it can be \
    done</font>.\nFirst, why not go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000345$</font> and check whether <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001602[gender:1]$</font> can be purified \nor not?"
set key[id=1023190701000943] name "Oh, you're back!\nWell? Could <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001602[gender:1]$</font> be purified?"
set key[id=1023190701000944] name "(Say it'd be faster to make and sell a new toy.)"
set key[id=1023190701000945] name "Ah... so that's what you think.\nStill, I can't give up so easily. Anyway, \
    thanks."
set key[id=1026122901000951] name "First, why not go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000346$</font> and check \
    whether \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001603$</font> can be repaired?"
set key[id=1026122901000952] name "First, could you go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000347$</font> and check \
    whether \n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001604$</font> has any appeal as an ornamental plant?"
set key[id=1026122901000953] name "Hurry to $map:2000348$ and defeat the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001605$</font> that's wreaking havoc there. \nI'm counting on you!"
set key[id=1026122901000954] name "Why not go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000344$</font> and check whether \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001601$</font> can be repaired \nor not?"
set key[id=1026122901000955] name "Why not go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000345$</font> and check whether \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:24001602[gender:1]$</font> can be purified \nor not?"
set key[id=1031192214003880] name "$MyPCName$, it's terrible! The turkeys who are fated to end up on adventurers' \
    tables every Thanksgiving couldn't take it anymore, and they've raided Maple World to ruin Thanksgiving! An \
    ordinary turkey is just a pretty little bird, but for some reason the $npc:27000051$ that showed up in \
    $map:02000092$ is said to be enormous and violent!"
set key[id=1031192214003881] name "Rumor has it that $npc:27000051$ appears in $map:02000092$ on the hour, every \
    hour. Please defeat $npc:27000051$, $MyPCName$, so it can't hurt the residents of Maple World!"
set key[id=1031192214003882] name "Rumor has it that $npc:27000051$ appears in $map:02000092$ on the hour, every \
    hour. Please defeat $npc:27000051$, $MyPCName$, so it can't hurt the residents of Maple World!"
set key[id=1031192214003883] name "$MyPCName$, you took care of $npc:27000051$! On behalf of the residents of \
    Maple World, I'll give you a tasty $item:20001130$ as thanks!"
set key[id=1031192214003884] name "Rumor has it that the $npc:27000051$ sighted day after day in $map:02000092$ is \
    a delicacy beyond any ordinary turkey! Maybe that's why some people are even buying $npc:27000051$ in bulk to \
    hold a grand Thanksgiving party."
set key[id=1031192214003885] name "This Thanksgiving season, I'd like to serve my guests dishes made from \
    $npc:27000051$ too, but as you know, I have so many guests that I don't think the party will be over in a \
    single day! For a successful Thanksgiving party, could you catch fresh $npc:27000051$ for ten days, \
    $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1031192214003886] name "This Thanksgiving season, I'd like to serve my guests dishes made from \
    $npc:27000051$ too, but as you know, I have so many guests that I don't think the party will be over in a \
    single day! For a successful Thanksgiving party, could you catch fresh $npc:27000051$ for ten days, \
    $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1031192214003887] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, I was able to prepare lots of delicious turkey \
    dishes. This is a gift from me to thank you!"
set key[id=1129204021021715] name "Hmm...."
set key[id=1129204021021716] name "Heh, $MyPCName$...\nDid you come because of my signal?"
set key[id=1129204021021717] name "(What are you talking about?)"
set key[id=1129204021021718] name "Huh? You didn't receive it?\nHmm... was that not the right code?"
set key[id=1129204021021719] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Do I have a code?)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021720] name "Don't worry, next time I'll send the telepathy with the correct code.\nSince \
    you're here anyway, I'll explain the mission verbally this time."
set key[id=1129204021021721] name "A monster tainted by darkness, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$</font>, has been found in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000084$</font>.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$</font> is a \
    mutant born from exposure to industrial waste and sparks, \nand it loves anything flashy and shiny."
set key[id=1129204021021722] name "For now it can't escape <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000084$</font>, \nbut if \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$</font> leaves this area and starts collecting shiny \
    things, Maple World will be in danger."
set key[id=1129204021021723] name "Please defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$</font> \
    before it moves off looking for shiny things and spreads darkness."
set key[id=1129204021021724] name "Ah, will you be heading there right now?"
set key[id=1129204021021725] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021726] name "(Say you'll go on your own.)"
set key[id=1129204021021727] name "Then I'll help you get there quickly."
set key[id=1129204021021728] name "Turning down such a convenient chance. \nI won't help you later when you go."
set key[id=1129204021021729] name "Please defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$</font> \
    before it moves off looking for shiny things and spreads darkness."
set key[id=1129204021021730] name "I thought it was about time you came back."
set key[id=1129204021021731] name "Did you defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$</font>?"
set key[id=1129204021021732] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021733] name "I see. \n$MyPCName$, when you look at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$</font>, doesn't it somehow remind you of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:21090178$</font>?"
set key[id=1129204021021734] name "(Say they look kind of alike.)"
set key[id=1129204021021735] name "As expected, you felt it too.\nThis is only between us... but actually, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:21090178$</font> is a distant relative of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000013[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021736] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(That doesn't seem like useful information.)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021737] name "Next time I'll definitely contact you with the right code.\nThis is your \
    mission reward."
set key[id=1129204021021738] name "The wind is calling me."
set key[id=1129204021021739] name "$MyPCName$, can you hear the sound of the wind too?"
set key[id=1129204021021740] name "(Say not at all.)"
set key[id=1129204021021741] name "(Say the wind is calling you.)"
set key[id=1129204021021742] name "Oh, what a shame.\nIt's such a pleasant sound."
set key[id=1129204021021744] name "$MyPCName$... what are you saying?\nHow is the wind calling you?"
set key[id=1129204021021746] name "Ah, I should explain the mission.\nThe divine beast turtle who came to protest \
    the pollution of the sea has been tainted by darkness."
set key[id=1129204021021747] name "He is resisting the erosion of darkness as hard as he can, \nbut the power of \
    darkness is too strong, so his resistance can't last long."
set key[id=1129204021021748] name "The pollution that has begun can't be stopped, but we can stop the tragedy of \
    them attacking residents and the spread of \nthe power of darkness.\nGo to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000111$</font> and stop <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000018$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021749] name "Ah, will you be heading there right now?"
set key[id=1129204021021750] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021751] name "(Say you'll go on your own.)"
set key[id=1129204021021752] name "Then I'll help you get there quickly."
set key[id=1129204021021753] name "Turning down such a convenient chance. \nI won't help you later when you go."
set key[id=1129204021021754] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000111$</font> and stop <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000018$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021755] name "Welcome."
set key[id=1129204021021756] name "What happened with <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000018$</font>?"
set key[id=1129204021021757] name "(Say you stopped him from causing a tragedy.)"
set key[id=1129204021021758] name "That's a relief.\nI hope something like this never happens again."
set key[id=1129204021021759] name "Thank you, $MyPCName$.\nThanks to you, we were able to stop the power of \
    darkness from spreading."
set key[id=1129204021021762] name "(Call <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11003537[gender:0]$</font>.)"
set key[id=1129204021021763] name "Ah, $MyPCName$.\nYou heard all of what I said, right?"
set key[id=1129204021021764] name "(Ask what he talked about.)"
set key[id=1129204021021765] name "What? You didn't hear any of it?\nSigh... I have to explain again."
set key[id=1129204021021766] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(How unfair!)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021767] name "Please listen carefully this time, $MyPCName$.\nWe don't have clear information \
    on the Shadow Legion yet, but judging from the last invasion, \nthere seem to be especially strong warriors \
    among them."
set key[id=1129204021021768] name "To weaken the forces of darkness, \nit would be good if we could deal a heavy \
    blow to their strength...\nHave you ever heard of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000001[gender:0]$</font>?"
set key[id=1129204021021769] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021770] name "He appears often in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000115$</font> and has great \
    power.\nConsidering that similar monsters came out during the last invasion, \nthere's a very high chance he \
    belongs to the Legion of Darkness, wouldn't you say?"
set key[id=1129204021021771] name "(Say it seems likely.)"
set key[id=1129204021021772] name "(Say you're not sure.)"
set key[id=1129204021021773] name "We'll find out by trying. \nFirst, go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000115$</font> and defeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000001[gender:0]$</font>.\nThen I'll see whether the power of darkness \
    decreases."
set key[id=1129204021021774] name "Ah, will you be heading there right now?"
set key[id=1129204021021775] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021776] name "(Say you'll go on your own.)"
set key[id=1129204021021777] name "Then I'll help you get there quickly."
set key[id=1129204021021778] name "Turning down such a convenient chance. \nI won't help you later when you go."
set key[id=1129204021021779] name "Please defeat <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000001[gender:0]$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021780] name "You're back, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=1129204021021781] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000001[gender:0]$</font>... did you take him \
    down?"
set key[id=1129204021021782] name "(Say you defeated him.)"
set key[id=1129204021021783] name "I see.\nHow is it? Can you feel the power of darkness decreasing?"
set key[id=1129204021021784] name "(Say you can't tell that much.)"
set key[id=1129204021021785] name "Ah, right, you can't sense the power of darkness.\nHeh, you really can't do \
    without me."
set key[id=1129204021021786] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Somehow I feel like I lost.)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021787] name "Hm? $MyPCName$, is something wrong? You look unwell. \nHere, your reward. Why \
    not get some rest now?"
set key[id=1129204021021788] name "The birds are crying."
set key[id=1129204021021789] name "Could it be because of the mission I'm about to ask of you?"
set key[id=1129204021021790] name "(Ask what mission it is.)"
set key[id=1129204021021791] name "The two divine beasts born at the peak of Vayar, the sacred mountain of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000051$</font>, were a loving couple.\nOne day, a fool stole their eggs to gain great \
    power. \nEnraged, the two became incarnations of hatred and vengeance and attacked humans."
set key[id=1129204021021792] name "It is a sad story, but unable to watch the two divine beasts keep attacking \
    humans, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11001663[gender:1]$</font> \nsealed them so they could sleep together."
set key[id=1129204021021793] name "(Say it's so sad.)"
set key[id=1129204021021794] name "But once tainted by darkness, their rage did not stop, \nand hatred and the \
    power of darkness combined to keep creating more <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000019[gender:0]$</font> \
    and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000020[gender:1]$</font>.\nIn particular, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000019[gender:0]$</font>'s rage is so strong that the innocent residents are said \
    to be in danger."
set key[id=1129204021021795] name "(Ask if there's no way to stop this tragedy.)"
set key[id=1129204021021796] name "While the Lumi Knights keep his power of darkness from spreading, \nplease stop \
    his vengeance from turning on good people.  "
set key[id=1129204021021797] name "Ah, will you be heading there right now?"
set key[id=1129204021021798] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021799] name "(Say you'll go on your own.)"
set key[id=1129204021021800] name "Then I'll help you get there quickly."
set key[id=1129204021021801] name "Turning down such a convenient chance. \nI won't help you later when you go."
set key[id=1129204021021802] name "While the Lumi Knights keep their power of darkness from spreading, \nplease \
    stop his vengeance from turning on good people.  "
set key[id=1129204021021803] name "There's no need to say it aloud."
set key[id=1129204021021804] name "I've already received your heart by telepathy."
set key[id=1129204021021805] name "(... Say you completed what was asked.)"
set key[id=1129204021021806] name "The power of darkness he holds is so strong that this won't be the end of \
    it.\nStill, I hope they find peace, if only for a while...."
set key[id=1129204021021807] name "Thank you, $MyPCName$.\nThanks to you, we were able to stop the power of \
    darkness from spreading."
set key[id=1129204021021808] name "I sense the power of darkness."
set key[id=1129204021021809] name "I sense the power of darkness in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000145$</font>....\nHuh?"
set key[id=1129204021021810] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Huh?)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021811] name "I thought I sensed the power of darkness, but I was wrong.... \nThen this isn't \
    our jurisdiction, so <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11003535[gender:1]$</font> will...."
set key[id=1129204021021812] name "Hey! We help each other out, what's this about your zone and my zone!\nIf you \
    keep this up... I'll tell everyone your nickname from when you were little, you know?"
set key[id=1129204021021813] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(A nickname from when he was little?)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021814] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11003537[gender:0]$</font>'s nickname from \
    when he was little?\nEeek~ I'm so curious.\nTell me, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11003535[gender:1]$</font>!"
set key[id=1129204021021815] name "... Hurry to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000145$</font> and defeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000054$</font>.\nRight now!"
set key[id=1129204021021816] name "I'll help you get there quickly."
set key[id=1129204021021817] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021818] name "(Say you'll go on your own.)"
set key[id=1129204021021819] name "Hurry, go!"
set key[id=1129204021021820] name "Turning down such a convenient chance. \nI won't help you later when you go."
set key[id=1129204021021821] name "y:Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000145$</font> and defeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000054$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021822] name "You're back, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=1129204021021823] name "Now, hurry and tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11003535[gender:1]$</font> \
    about our results."
set key[id=1129204021021824] name "Oh, did our little cutie finish the mission?"
set key[id=1129204021021825] name "(Say you defeated <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000054$</font>.)"
set key[id=1129204021021826] name "Well done!\nAccording to our members, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000054$</font> is an early version of \nDr. Katronic's Mark 52 Project, the \
    robotics master's creation."
set key[id=1129204021021827] name "Dr. Katronic vanished after the Mark 52 Project failed, \nand who is building \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000054$</font>, and with what technology and facilities, is unknown."
set key[id=1129204021021828] name "Well, given that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000054$</font> keeps \
    showing up in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000145$</font>, the early testing site, \nafter being built, it \
    looks like the mysterious force succeeded in making <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000054$</font> \nbut \
    failed to analyze its AI, doesn't it? "
set key[id=1129204021021829] name "(Say it seems that way.)"
set key[id=1129204021021830] name "Good thing there was no major damage.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11003537[gender:0]$</font>, this is the mission you asked for, so it's not our \
    jurisdiction, got it?\nYou'll be the one rewarding $MyPCName$, you know that?"
set key[id=1129204021021831] name ".......\nGood work, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=1129204021022775] name "This is the quest start dialogue. (Work in progress)"
set key[id=1129204021022776] name "Would you like to proceed with the quest? (Work in progress)"
set key[id=1129204021022777] name "The quest starts.  (Work in progress)"
set key[id=1129204021022778] name "Quest in progress... (Work in progress)"
set key[id=1129204021022779] name "This is the quest completion dialogue. (Work in progress)"
set key[id=1129204021022780] name "Good work."
set key[id=1219155314003888] name "$MyPCName$! Have you seen any baby lucky piglets around?\nThe lucky piglets are \
    holding a party for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Year of the Pig</font>, which has come around for the first \
    time in 12 years, but some of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">baby lucky piglets</font> haven't shown up. \
    \nThey're <font color=\"#ffd200\">kids who love parties</font>, so they'd dress up and come running... \
    Something's off."
set key[id=1219155314003889] name "Could they have run into a <font color=\"#ffd200\">monster</font>? <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Baby lucky piglets</font> are timid, so they must be terrified....\nTheir feet must be \
    rooted to the ground and they can't budge... Poor things!\nIt'd be fine if the area were safe. Would you help, \
    $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1219155314003891] name "They say the baby lucky piglets heading to the lucky piglet party carry <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">balloons</font> on their backs.\nSo after you defeat the monsters around them, tell them \
    it's all right to leave, and the balloons' power will let them fly away fast.\n$MyPCName$, when you find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">baby lucky piglets</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">send them flying!</font>"
set key[id=1219155314003892] name "They say the baby lucky piglets heading to the lucky piglet party carry <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">balloons</font> on their backs.\nSo after you defeat the monsters around them, tell them \
    it's all right to leave, and the balloons' power will let them fly away fast.\n$MyPCName$, when you find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">baby lucky piglets</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">send them flying!</font>"
set key[id=1219155314003893] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, the baby lucky piglets made it to the party.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Please take care of us this year, too,</font> $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1222174802004586] name "Didn't you hear me tell you to leave?\nWhat a rude brat...!!"
set key[id=1222174802004587] name "Didn't you hear me tell you to leave?\nWhat a rude brat...!!"
set key[id=1222174802004588] name "Oh... no, how can this be... \nThe <font color=\"#ffd200\">Dragon of \
    Light</font>... the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumieragon</font> has truly returned to this land!!"
set key[id=1222174802004589] name "Now then, tell me about yourselves.\nWhat happened?"
set key[id=1222174802004590] name "This place, $map:02010023$, holds the most records of the ancient \
    Lumieragons.\nIf you search thoroughly, you will surely find those records."
set key[id=1222174802004591] name "Oh, you're here?\nThe things I asked you to find...?"
set key[id=1222174802004592] name "For now... let's try it as soon as $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ arrives.\nIf \
    the fate of light guides her... flowers bloom even in barren land... "
set key[id=1222174802004593] name "For now... let's try it as soon as $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ arrives.\nIf \
    the fate of light guides her... flowers bloom even in barren land... "
set key[id=1222174802004594] name "Hmm... "
set key[id=1222174802004595] name "I found an intermediary for the communion ritual!\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001258[gender:1]$</font>! A priestess so mystically gifted that none can match \
    her.\nFor some reason she disappeared one day without a trace... "
set key[id=1222174802004596] name "I heard she's quietly hiding somewhere in $map:02010026$.\nShe should be able \
    to help us, so go find her together with $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$."
set key[id=1222174802004597] name "A faint beam of light pierces the darkness... \nI thought a precious guest \
    bearing a bright light would come."
set key[id=1222174802004598] name "My existence is hidden in deep darkness, yet that you found me through it\nis \
    surely because the fate of light guided you.\nWhat can I help you with?"
set key[id=1222174802004599] name "I need a few things for the ritual... \nLast night, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:21000694$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:21000684$</font> that haunt \
    $map:02010026$ swarmed in and stole them.\n$MyPCName$, could you find my lost belongings for me?"
set key[id=1222174802004600] name "Thank you. \nFortunately, they're all still intact. Nothing needs mending."
set key[id=1222174802004601] name "Now then... I will begin the ritual. \nWhen the passage for communing with the \
    forms of the memories <font color=\"#ffd200\">Leila</font> sent is ready to open, the Orb of Prophecy \nwill \
    begin to glimmer. At that moment, open the orb and light the passage of communion."
set key[id=1222174802004602] name "Now then... I will begin the ritual. \nWhen the passage for communing with the \
    forms of the memories <font color=\"#ffd200\">Leila</font> sent is ready to open, the Orb of Prophecy \nwill \
    begin to glimmer. At that moment, open the orb and light the passage of communion."
set key[id=1222174802004603] name "Ahh... $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$... "
set key[id=1222174802004604] name "Even if $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ knows what she must do, accepting the fate \
    of light alone\nand moving forward will never be easy.\nShe needs the help of companions like you, \
    $MyPCName$... Ahh...!!"
set key[id=1222174802004605] name "$MyPCName$, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010047$</font> and look \
    around.\nThat's a place $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ hasn't set foot yet... "
set key[id=1222174802004608] name "Right before <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001258[gender:1]$</font> lost \
    consciousness... she said... \nto go find the high priest guarding the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Nazkar \
    Temple</font>... <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001224[gender:0]$</font>... "
set key[id=1222174802004609] name "Welcome. \nAnother new guest has come to visit. "
set key[id=1222174802004610] name "You are... a companion of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000735[gender:1]$</font>, aren't you?\nIs that right?"
set key[id=1222174802004611] name "If she didn't lose her way... she should have arrived at $map:52010006$ by \
    now.\n$MyPCName$, why not go there too and give $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ your strength?"
set key[id=1222174802004612] name "$MyPCName$!! \nAn ominous feeling swept over me last night.\nDid something \
    happen to $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ by any chance?"
set key[id=1226234302004757] name "You recognized $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$, didn't you?"
set key[id=1226234302004758] name "How could I not recognize her... \nThough we are of a different bloodline, our \
    Moropapa Tribe stayed with the Lumieragons from the birth of the ancient Lumieragons \nuntil the day they \
    vanished.\nIn a different way from the Dragon Knights who guard the Lumieragons, we were the Lumieragons' \
    companions\nall along."
set key[id=1226234302004759] name "After the Lumieragons vanished from this land for good, our Moropapa Tribe also \
    turned its back on the world \nand wandered the sandy desert, living in hiding.\nBut... not long ago, I saw \
    bright stars pouring down on the edge of the desert, where darkness had settled\n."
set key[id=1226234302004760] name "In that moment we felt it instinctively. That the Lumieragon would return to \
    this land... \nSo I led my kin out into the world once more."
set key[id=1226234302004761] name "(Tell about $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$'s circumstances.)"
set key[id=1226234302004762] name "Hmm... so that is how it was... \nThen the cluster of stars that fell on this \
    land not long ago might be the <font color=\"#ffd200\">memories</font> that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Leila</font> sent.\nHmm... where and how can we find those memories... "
set key[id=1226234302004763] name "Mm... perhaps... we might find a way to locate those memories \nin the records \
    the ancient Lumieragons left behind... \nIf you bring me the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000471$</font> \
    and the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000470$</font> that hold the Lumieragon records, I think I can \
    \ninterpret those records."
set key[id=1226234302004764] name "This place, $map:02010023$, holds the most records of the ancient \
    Lumieragons.\nIf you search thoroughly, you will surely find those records."
set key[id=1226234302004765] name "(Hand over what you found.)"
set key[id=1226234302004766] name "Hmm... will this do... It looks a bit insufficient... "
set key[id=1226234302004767] name "Did you read anything out of it?"
set key[id=1226234302004768] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Communion</font>!! Now I understand. \nWhy <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Leila</font> split her own memories into pieces and sent them to this land,\neven knowing \
    she might never wake again... \nThey say Lumieragons can share each other's memories and thoughts."
set key[id=1226234302004769] name "When a Lumieragon gives form to unseen, untouchable memories and sends them \
    out... she must pour out so much energy\nthat she has to be prepared for death.\nBut when those memories reach \
    another Lumieragon and come back to life whole as one,\nthe Lumieragon who sent them out can wake again, they \
    say... "
set key[id=1226234302004770] name "It seems <font color=\"#ffd200\">Leila</font> hopes that <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11000735[gender:1]$</font> will read those memories\nthrough the Lumieragon \
    communion ritual."
set key[id=1226234302004771] name "(Ask how the communion ritual can be done.)"
set key[id=1226234302004772] name "First... we need to find the memories <font color=\"#ffd200\">Leila</font> sent \
    out, and we need an intermediary to mediate the communion ritual.\nI'll look into an intermediary who can help \
    with the ritual and contact you."
set key[id=1227042502004773] name "I heard she's quietly hiding somewhere in $map:02010026$.\nShe should be able \
    to help us, so go find her together with $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$."
set key[id=1227042502004774] name "(Tell about the communion ritual and ask for help.)"
set key[id=1227042502004775] name "Hmm... I see.\nI think I can help you. \nHowever... one thing worries me."
set key[id=1227042502004776] name "(Ask what is worrying you.)"
set key[id=1227042502004777] name "The reason I have no choice but to hide from the world... \nis that some \
    unknown being in the deep darkness \ncan read everything I see, hear, and feel."
set key[id=1227042502004778] name "(Ask what happened.)"
set key[id=1227042502004779] name "I don't know well myself. \nAfter that I lost the eyes that saw the world, and \
    only faint... dim memories remain... \nI can only guess, feeling the oppressive energy of deep darkness \
    weighing on my body."
set key[id=1227042502004780] name "If you're fine with me as I am, I'll gladly help.\nIs that all right? "
set key[id=1227042502004781] name "(Ask for help, since there's no other way now.)"
set key[id=1227042502004782] name "I understand.\nI need a few things for the ritual... \nLast night, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:21000694$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:21000684$</font> that haunt \
    $map:02010026$ swarmed in and stole them.\n$MyPCName$, could you find my lost belongings for me?"
set key[id=1227042502004783] name "(Ask why $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ suddenly ran off.)"
set key[id=1227042502004784] name "$npcName:11000735[gender:1]$... through this communion ritual, she saw and felt \
    far more than what\nyou saw, $MyPCName$. She read all the memories <font color=\"#ffd200\">Leila</font> wished \
    to convey, completely.\nFrom now on, she will move, knowing for herself what she must do."
set key[id=1227042502004785] name "(Ask what memory Leila passed on to Mika.)"
set key[id=1227042502004786] name "$npcName:11000735[gender:1]$... she is the only Lumieragon who can fully wield \
    the power of light... \nShe is the hope of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Leila</font>, of course, and of Drakenheim \
    and of Carcar here.\nAnd there is a terrifying dragon of darkness... <font color=\"#ffd200\">Kargon</font>, \
    who threatens that hope.\n$npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ must gather all the forms of memory Leila sent, find \
    the old Lumieragon sanctuary,\naccept the full power of light, and be reborn as a true Lumieragon."
set key[id=1227042502004787] name "Only then can the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lamestone</font> regain its original \
    light and be purified, \nand only then will she gain the strength to fight <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Kargon</font>."
set key[id=1227042502004788] name "(Ask what's suddenly wrong.)"
set key[id=1227042502004789] name "Ugh... he... that being in the darkness... is reading what I saw... \
    $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$'s fate... \nBefore... he reads everything... \nwe must find all of Leila's memory \
    fragments that exist somewhere in this land. "
set key[id=1227042502004790] name "If even one of those memory fragments were to fall into the hands \nof <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Kargon</font> or that one in the darkness... \n$npcName:11000735[gender:1]$, Drakenheim... \
    this whole world could all be in danger."
set key[id=1227042502004791] name "(Ask where the memory fragments can be found.)"
set key[id=1227042502004792] name "$npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ must already be finding and gathering the memory \
    fragments little by little... \n$MyPCName$, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02010047$</font> and look \
    around.\nThat's a place $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ hasn't set foot yet... "
set key[id=1227042502004793] name "What happened here?"
set key[id=1227042502004794] name "I don't know... me neither... \nWhen I got back... it was already... "
set key[id=1227042502004795] name "(Ask what she said again.)"
set key[id=1227042502004796] name "Right before <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001258[gender:1]$</font> lost \
    consciousness... she said... \nto go find the high priest guarding the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Nazkar \
    Temple</font>... <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001224[gender:0]$</font>... "
set key[id=1227042502004797] name "How did you know?"
set key[id=1227042502004798] name "Light that illuminates the darkness comes and goes, so how could I not know?\nI \
    heard from $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ that $npcName:11001258[gender:1]$ collapsed with an unexplained \
    injury."
set key[id=1227042502004799] name "(Ask what connection you have with $npcName:11001258[gender:1]$.)"
set key[id=1227042502004800] name "I saved $npcName:11001258[gender:1]$ with these two hands as she flailed in a \
    swamp of darkness. \nThough she lost her light, her aura became clearer, so such a priestess was too precious \
    to lose, \nwasn't she? So I secretly protected and looked after her.\nShe is a strong person... I believe she \
    will overcome the pain and stand again soon. Don't worry too much."
set key[id=1227042502004801] name "That aside... it seems you came here chasing $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$... \
    \nbut $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ has already left this place."
set key[id=1227042502004802] name "(Ask where she went.)"
set key[id=1227042502004803] name "$npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ told me this.\nThat she wants to fully recover the \
    power of light, be reborn as a true Lumieragon, and set \neverything right... "
set key[id=1227042502004804] name "Her will to accept the fate of light was so strong... \nthat I told her the way \
    without hesitation.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:52010006$</font>... that there is a power on that altar that \
    can set everything right..."
set key[id=1227042502004805] name "If she didn't lose her way... she should have arrived at $map:52010006$ by \
    now.\n$MyPCName$, why not go there too and give $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ your strength?"
set key[id=1227042502004806] name "(Tell about what happened at $map:52010006$.)"
set key[id=1227042502004807] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11001224[gender:0]$</font>... \nA member of \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Kargon</font>'s band who chased $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ and the Lamestone all the \
    way from Drakenheim... "
set key[id=1227042502004808] name "As long as <font color=\"#ffd200\">Kargon</font>'s gang continues to exist \
    somewhere in Carcar... \nno one here is safe."
set key[id=1227042502004809] name "You said the Dragon Knights are protecting $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$, \
    right?\nFor now... let's wait until $npcName:11000735[gender:1]$ recovers."
set key[id=11269496264850407433] name "$MyPCName$, did you hear the news?\nThey say mysterious Nao balloons are \
    being found all over Maple World right now.\nThanks to them, Maple World is in a festive mood, too."
set key[id=11269496264850407434] name "They say they look just like Nao from Mabinogi. Aren't you curious what \
    they look like?\nTake a look at the mysterious Nao balloons around the maps to feel the festive mood, \nand \
    let me know."
set key[id=11269496264850407436] name "If you explore the maps of Maple World, you'll find mysterious Nao \
    balloons."
set key[id=11269496264850407437] name "So, how was it? Did you feel the festive mood? If you take this coin to \
    Bobby, you can also exchange it for Mabinogi-related goods, so go and talk to Bobby, too."

# Quest dialogue of the no-feature chapters 10002-81092 quests that no pack has in English (no feature tag): our own
# English for the 589 scriptquest rows of locale KR (or no locale) whose quest a player can get (104 quests), with
# each row's own format fields, font tags and line breaks; the player's lines are first-person choices.
file Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml kms:Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml 032f90f7273bbe7d
set key[id=109175417004285] name "$MyPCName$! Have you seen any baby lucky piglets around?\nThe lucky piglets are \
    holding a party for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Year of the Pig</font>, which has come around for the first \
    time in 12 years, but some of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">baby lucky piglets</font> haven't shown up. \
    \nThey're <font color=\"#ffd200\">kids who love parties</font>, so they'd dress up and come running... \
    Something's off."
set key[id=109175417004286] name "Could they have run into a <font color=\"#ffd200\">monster</font>? <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Baby lucky piglets</font> are timid, so they must be terrified....\nTheir feet must be \
    rooted to the ground and they can't budge... Poor things!\nIt'd be fine if the area were safe. Would you help, \
    $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=109175417004287] name "They say the baby lucky piglets heading to the lucky piglet party carry <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">balloons</font> on their backs.\nSo after you defeat the monsters around them, tell them \
    it's all right to leave, and the balloons' power will let them fly away fast.\n$MyPCName$, when you find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">baby lucky piglets</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">send them flying!</font>"
set key[id=109175417004288] name "They say the baby lucky piglets heading to the lucky piglet party carry <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">balloons</font> on their backs.\nSo after you defeat the monsters around them, tell them \
    it's all right to leave, and the balloons' power will let them fly away fast.\n$MyPCName$, when you find <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">baby lucky piglets</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">send them flying!</font>"
set key[id=109175417004289] name "I hear the baby lucky pigs made it safely to the party thanks to you, \
    $MyPCName$.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">Thank you again this year,</font> $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=111140117003041] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nDid you hear the news?"
set key[id=111140117003042] name "What news?"
set key[id=111140117003043] name "They say a fleet to protect Maple World will set out soon.\nThe details aren't \
    known yet, but they'll be gathering special talents to join the fleet soon, right?"
set key[id=111140117003044] name "Anyway... one of the commanders leading that fleet is a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Priest Knight Mason</font>,\nand for some reason he says he wants to form a special bond \
    with adventurers whose tastes are similar to his.\nHeh heh heh... $MyPCName$, would you like to form a bond \
    with him before the fleet sets out?"
set key[id=111140117003045] name "(Ask how to form a bond.)"
set key[id=111140117003046] name "Just complete the [Mason's Private Taste] quest I give you once a day during the \
    event period and collect <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001051$</font>.\nHow about it? Want to give it a \
    try?"
set key[id=111140117003047] name "If you want to form a special bond with the Priest Knight,\njust complete the \
    [Mason's Private Taste] quest I give you once a day during the event period and collect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001051$</font>."
set key[id=111140117003048] name "$MyPCName$... you've collected them so diligently, day after day.\nI think you \
    more than qualify to form a special bond with Priest Knight Mason."
set key[id=111140117003049] name "As proof of your special bond with Mason, I'll give you the \
    [$item:50600192$]!\nThe Sky Fortress air fleet will set out soon, so I hope you'll be sure to join it and keep \
    up your special bond with Priest Knight Mason! "
set key[id=111140117003050] name "The unusual tastes of <font color=\"#ffd200\">Priest Knight Mason</font>, who's \
    preparing for the fleet's departure soon! Curious?\nThey say that though he looks cold and intellectual, he \
    can't contain his wavering heart when he sees cute, adorable things."
set key[id=111140117003051] name "What has captured his heart lately is the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Human \
    Meret</font>.\nThese bouncy little cuties pop up all over Maple World and play hide-and-seek with \
    adventurers,\nand they say even <font color=\"#ffd200\">Priest Knight Mason</font>, busy as he is, searches \
    for these Human Merets whenever he has a moment... heh heh... "
set key[id=111140117003052] name "You should look for Human Merets all over Maple World too, $MyPCName$.\nIf you \
    pat them and say hello when you meet them, something good will happen!"
set key[id=111140117003053] name "You should look for Human Merets all over Maple World too, $MyPCName$.\nIf you \
    pat them and say hello when you meet them, something good will happen!"
set key[id=111140117003054] name "You found a Human Meret!\nAren't they cute and adorable enough to capture Priest \
    Knight Mason's heart? Hee hee."
set key[id=116133817004290] name "$MyPCName$! Are you strong, by any chance?\nHmm... Is 'strong' too hard a \
    question?\nI, $npc:11001002[gender:1]$, have been looking for strong adventurers."
set key[id=116133817004291] name "I happen to have a good item, but it's only useful to an adventurer with great \
    power.\nConquer $dungeonTitle:23037002$ or $dungeonTitle:23038002$ and come back, and I'll give you a gift!\n"
set key[id=116133817004292] name "I happen to have a good item, but it's only useful to an adventurer with great \
    power.\nConquer $dungeonTitle:23037002$ or $dungeonTitle:23038002$ and come back, and I'll give you a gift!\n"
set key[id=116133817004293] name "As expected, you really are strong, $MyPCName$.\nPlease take my gift!"
set key[id=125153417003055] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$.\nTo celebrate <font color=\"#ffd200\">Valentine's \
    Day</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">chocolate ball balloons</font> are descending all over Maple \
    World.\nInside the chocolate ball balloons are sweet and salty <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001088$</font>!"
set key[id=125153417003056] name "$MyPCName$, collect the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001088$</font> inside \
    the chocolate ball balloons and give them to someone you want to share your feelings with.\nJust ask Mr. \
    $npc:11000012[gender:0]$ to deliver them and you're done!\nComplete the quest to earn the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> and get a reward too!"
set key[id=125153417003057] name "$MyPCName$, collect the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001088$</font> inside \
    the chocolate ball balloons and give them to someone you want to share your feelings with.\nJust ask Mr. \
    $npc:11000012[gender:0]$ to deliver them and you're done!\nComplete the quest to earn the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> and get a reward too!"
set key[id=125153417003058] name "Ah, you've come to request a delivery of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001088$</font>!\nAll right, I'm busy, so... first choose which group the person you \
    want to deliver to belongs to."
set key[id=125153417003059] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Sky Fortress officers</font> group"
set key[id=125153417003060] name "Maple World's top <font color=\"#ffd200\">heartthrob guys</font> group"
set key[id=125153417003061] name "Maple World's top <font color=\"#ffd200\">heartthrob girls</font> group"
set key[id=125163017003067] name "All right, now choose the one person who'll receive the chocolate."
set key[id=125163017003070] name "(Say you'd like to give it to a female officer.)"
set key[id=125163017003071] name "Oh, $npc:11003537[gender:0]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003072] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Heh... even here, the popularity just won't die \
    down...</font>\n<font color=\"#909090\">At this rate, the chocolate will pile up like a mountain, and the ship \
    might crash under its weight...?</font>"
set key[id=125163017003073] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003074] name "Oh, $npc:11003534[gender:0]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003075] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Hmm? What... chocolate?</font>\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">Don't you know we're in a huge crisis right now? This is no time to share chocolate!</font>"
set key[id=125163017003076] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003077] name "True... the explosive coolness of the Sky Fortress officers can't be divided by \
    gender. Which one should I deliver to?"
set key[id=125163017003081] name "Oh, $npc:11003533[gender:0]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003082] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Hm? Valentine chocolate?</font>\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">I'll take it as a show of support for our ship. I'm fine, so hand it out to the crew over \
    there!</font>"
set key[id=125163017003083] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003084] name "Oh, $npc:11003535[gender:1]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003085] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Heh... again?</font>\n<font color=\"#909090\">Wh... \
    whatever. You need something sweet like this to get your strength up, you know? Heh.</font>"
set key[id=125163017003086] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003087] name "Oh, $npc:11003536[gender:0]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003088] name "<font color=\"#909090\">What? A chocolate delivery for me?</font>\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">What an unexpected gift. I'll eat it gratefully and work hard on my missions again!</font>"
set key[id=125163017003089] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003090] name "All right, now choose the one person who'll receive the chocolate."
set key[id=125163017003095] name "Oh, $npc:11000406[gender:0]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003096] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Another chocolate delivery? Ugh... I'm sick of this... \
    </font>\n<font color=\"#909090\">At this rate even my face will turn dark. Next time, tell them to send white \
    chocolate if they're giving gifts.</font>"
set key[id=125163017003097] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003098] name "Oh, $npc:11001430[gender:0]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003099] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Thank you, sweet chocolate...</font>\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">But this alone won't ease my loneliness... It would be nice if they brought it themselves... \
    </font>"
set key[id=125163017003100] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003101] name "Oh, $npc:11000252[gender:0]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003102] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Hey, you! Didn't I tell you to wipe your feet when you \
    come into my penthouse?</font>\n<font color=\"#909090\">What's that? Chocolate? Is that all? If you're going \
    to give a Valentine gift, at least attach some gold to it... </font>"
set key[id=125163017003103] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003104] name "Oh, $npc:11000031[gender:0]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003105] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Oh! Welcome... who would send me such a sweet gift... \
    heh heh heh... </font>\n<font color=\"#909090\">To think there are warm-hearted people who look after even an \
    old man like me... may luck always follow you...!</font>"
set key[id=125163017003106] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003107] name "All right, now choose the one person who'll receive the chocolate."
set key[id=125163017003112] name "Oh, $npc:11000075[gender:1]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003113] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Mm... the warm heart within this sweet chocolate brings \
    me peace, if only for a moment.</font>\n<font color=\"#909090\">How nice it would be if Maple World were \
    always this peaceful and happy... </font>"
set key[id=125163017003114] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003115] name "Oh, $npc:11000511[gender:1]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003116] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Hm? What, what? Is it edible? Chocolate?</font>\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">Heh heh. Does someone secretly like me again? You can bring way more of these, anytime. \
    You're always welcome!</font>"
set key[id=125163017003117] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003118] name "Oh, $npc:11000136[gender:1]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003119] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Wow... it's chocolate? Looks yummy...</font>\n<font \
    color=\"#909090\">I should share it with my friends quickly before it melts. Yay!</font>"
set key[id=125163017003120] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
    I almost forgot.\nCheck the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Choco Choco Gift' emblem</font> in the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Trophy window</font>.\nI gave you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> for Valentine's \
    Day.\nWell, don't feel any pressure. It's just customer care. Ha ha ha. "
set key[id=125163017003121] name "Oh, $npc:11000711[gender:1]$, huh... Hmm... If I deliver it, you'll say this \
    again."
set key[id=125163017003122] name "<font color=\"#909090\">Wow... I get so many chocolate gifts lately... and every \
    time I love it!</font>\n<font color=\"#909090\">I couldn't eat things like this freely before, but now I can \
    eat as much as I want, so it's even better!</font>"
set key[id=125163017003123] name "Anyway, I'll deliver the chocolate you requested safely, so don't worry!\nOh no! \
