    good, a game of tag is just right.\nHow about looking for <font color=\"#ffd200\">today's friend</font>? \
    Sounds fun, right?\nFind today's friend and come back to me, and I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001106$</font>!"
