set key[id=504174817003284] name "$MyPCName$! Do you know what happens <font color=\"#ffd200\">every Friday, \
    Saturday and Sunday</font>?\nA mushroom king called <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font> appears in \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font>!\nDon't tell me you didn't know?"
set key[id=504174817003285] name "They say all the hot heroes these days are in $map:02000423$.\nWe can't leave \
    you out, can we, $MyPCName$?\nToday's mission is to <font color=\"#ffd200\">head out to $map:02000423$</font> \
    right away."
set key[id=504174817003286] name "Hurry to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font> before it's too \
    late.\nLots of heroes have gathered to defeat the greedy <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font>.\nI'll \
    give you a nice gift when you get back. "
set key[id=504174817003287] name "Oh! You've been to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font>?\n$MyPCName$, \
    you smell like mushroom spores, so I knew right away.\nYou must have completed the mission well, so here, have \
    this as a gift! "
set key[id=504174817003288] name "$MyPCName$, what did you do last weekend?\nYou must have met that fellow called \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font> in $map:02000423$, of course?\nThey say he appears <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">every Friday, Saturday and Sunday</font>. "
set key[id=504174817003289] name "That guy showed up again this week without fail!\nAll the heroes who consider \
    themselves good fighters went to $map:02000423$.\nToday's mission is to go to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font> and run a <font color=\"#ffd200\">100-meter dash</font>.\nI hope you \
    manage to dodge the fearsome <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mushking</font> and finish the 100 meters. "
set key[id=504174817003290] name "Hurry to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font> before it's too \
    late.\nDodge the greedy <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font> and run a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">100-meter dash</font>, pretty cool, right?\nI'll give you a nice gift when you get back. "
set key[id=504174817003291] name "Oh, you've been to $map:02000423$?\nAnd you finished the 100-meter dash too?\nAs \
    expected, you're wonderful, $MyPCName$. Here, a gift!"
set key[id=504174817003292] name "$MyPCName$, did you get the <font color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font>?\nYou \
    absolutely need it to face <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font>.\nIf you rashly take on <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font> \
    without <font color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font>,\nyou might catch a skin disease. "
set key[id=504174817003293] name "I have a mission for this weekend!\nIt's to use the <font \
    color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font> <font color=\"#ffd200\">3 times</font>.\nOf course you can use this \
    cream anywhere,\nbut <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font> is probably the best place, right? "
set key[id=504174817003294] name "Hurry to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font> before it's too late.\nIf \
    you spend this weekend with <font color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font>, your skin will turn nice and \
    fair.\nIt may not look like it, but this is actually quite good for the skin. "
set key[id=504174817003295] name "Your skin is sparkling, and the secret is... ah! You applied <font \
    color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301428$</font>?\nYou look even more handsome, $MyPCName$! Here's your gift!"
set key[id=504174817003296] name "$MyPCName$, this weekend is the last weekend you can meet <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font>.\nStill, you've grown attached to him by now, so it's a bit sad, isn't \
    it?\nOf course, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font> is fat, greedy and has a bad personality, but... \
    "
set key[id=504174817003297] name "I'll give you a mission for this weekend!\nYour last mission in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font> is...\nTo jump and stomp your feet so hard that $map:02000423$ would \
    collapse!\nGive the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mushking</font> a real fright."
set key[id=504174817003298] name "If <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font> gets so startled that he falls \
    over backward, will the palanquin bearers help him up?\nPoor bearers... I hope that once <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:23000110$</font> comes to his senses,\nhe'll be a little kinder to the other \
    mushrooms.\nCome back after <font color=\"#ffd200\">jumping 15 times</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font> and I'll give you a gift."
set key[id=504174817003299] name "You look a little tired. You must have had a hard time breathing in mushroom \
    spores\nand jumping on top of that, in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000423$</font>.\nThank you for your hard \
    work. Here, please take your gift."
set key[id=504234817003300] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nYou've heard about the Mushking Championship, right? \
    \nWhat are you waiting for? Let's go to the Primordial Mushroom Island, where the Mushking Championship is \
    being held."
set key[id=504234817003301] name "Here is today's mission. \nGo to Primordial Mushroom Island and run the 150 m \
    dash!\nI hope you survive and complete the mission. "
set key[id=504234817003302] name "Hurry to Primordial Mushroom Island!\nOff you go into the heated action of the \
    Mushking Championship!"
set key[id=504234817003303] name "You cleared today's mission!\nHere's the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> I promised!\nTake the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001105$</font> \
    to Ruby's Event Shop \nand you can buy some great reward items. "
set key[id=511090317003320] name "$MyPCName$, $MyPCName$!\nHave you ever heard of the Rainbow Slime?\nHmm... \
    They're not like ordinary slimes. They look similar, but rainbow colors shimmer across their bodies, and they \
    have wings, and, well, they're very different!"
set key[id=511090317003321] name "Why am I suddenly talking about Rainbow Slimes? \nWell, I found an adorable \
    Rainbow Slime not long ago. When it's young it's just one color, but as it grows it turns into beautiful \
    rainbow colors~\nWould you take care of it and raise it for me, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=511090317003322] name "Rainbow Slimes are picky eaters, and they only eat special food.\nYou can get up \
    to 4 pieces of food every day, depending on how long you spend in Maple World, so it shouldn't be hard to come \
    by.\nOh, and if you play with other people's Rainbow Slimes, you can get up to 2 extra pieces of food each \
    day."
set key[id=511090317003323] name "Here's a nest for your Rainbow Slime. Set it up inside your house and raise your \
    slime there. Please feed it well, too. I'm sure you'll raise it with lots of love!"
set key[id=515211817003324] name "Try setting up the $item:50400282$ I gave you inside your house.\nIt's still \
    green, but if it grows big and strong with your love, $MyPCName$, it will turn a beautiful rainbow color~"
set key[id=515211817003325] name "Please set up the $item:50400282$ in your home.\nYou'll see how cute and pretty \
    $npc:50400282$ is!"
set key[id=515211817003326] name "Here's some $item:20301497$. Please hurry and feed the hungry $npc:50400282$~ \
    It's waiting for its owner's touch!"
