    color=\"#ffd200\">'$item:30001166$', '$item:30001167$', '$item:30001168$', '$item:30001169$'</font>!\nI'll \
    trade them for <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001165$</font>, which you can use to buy special goods from my \
    brother Bobby~"
