set key[id=628193317003339] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$. \nWith summer here, balloons that look like the blazing sun \
    have appeared all over Maple World!"
set key[id=628193317003340] name "Would a balloon that looks like the sun really be hot?\nPlease investigate \
    whether it really is hot, $MyPCName$~\nWhen you finish <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating Sunshine \
    Balloons</font> 10 times and tell me, I'll give you 20 '$item:30001165$'.\nYou can use $item:30001165$ to buy \
    goods at my brother Bobby's shop next door!"
set key[id=628193317003341] name "Would a balloon that looks like the sun really be hot?\nPlease investigate \
    whether it really is hot, $MyPCName$~\nWhen you finish <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating Sunshine \
    Balloons</font> 10 times and tell me, I'll give you 20 '$item:30001165$'.\nYou can use $item:30001165$ to buy \
    goods at my brother Bobby's shop next door!"
set key[id=628193317003342] name "You've finished all the Sunshine Balloon investigations.\nHere are the 20 \
    '$item:30001165$' I promised.\nOh, and don't forget, during the event you can help me once a day!"
set key[id=726145417003763] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the unfortunate couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way they can meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nShall we fill this world with love to bring about that wonderful miracle? "
set key[id=726145417003764] name "The most famous long-married couple in Maple World lives in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font>.\nWhy not ask Granny <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000705[gender:1]$</font> about <font color=\"#ffd200\">the secret to a loving \
    marriage</font>?\nThey've been together so long, there must be some special secret!"
set key[id=726145417003765] name "When you've heard the whole story, you'll receive <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nCollect them and bring them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy some \
    fun items!"
set key[id=726145417003766] name "Ask Granny <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000705[gender:1]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000129$</font> about the secret to a loving marriage.\nWhen you've heard the whole \
    story, you'll receive <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nCollect them and bring them to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy some \
    fun items!"
set key[id=726145417003767] name "Standing there blocking the sun while Granny sunbathes?\nMove it, you rascal, \
    right now!"
set key[id=726145417003768] name "I came to hear the secret to your long, loving marriage."
set key[id=726145417003769] name "Love? Hohoho, what's this, a snail rock-paper-scissors contest?\nWe just lived a \
    long time, that's all. It's not like we're stuck together all day."
set key[id=726145417003770] name "(Tell her about the sad couple in $map:63000062$.)"
set key[id=726145417003771] name "Ah, to be young, and so tender about it... hehe. \nI was like that with the old \
    man once, but now it's enough that we're both still alive.\nThese days the old man cares more about the flower \
    growing on his back than about me, too."
set key[id=726145417003772] name "You had a hard time listening to an old lady talk, so take this as a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font>. \nOh, and tell those youngsters something! That everything fades with time. \
    Hoho."
set key[id=726145417004076] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=726145417004077] name "Love is the heart that nurtures small but precious things...\nHow about \
    sprouting some love while feeling the heart of a farmer who coaxes out new shoots?\nClear Round 1 in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font> and come back, and I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>."
set key[id=726145417004078] name "Sure."
set key[id=726145417004079] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=726145417004080] name "Try tapping the <font color=\"#ffd200\">'Maple Arcade'</font> menu at the bottom \
    of the screen.\nThen you can go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font>."
set key[id=726145417004081] name "Take <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to $npc:11004101$ in \
    $map:63000062$,\nand you should be able to buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=726145417004082] name "How about sprouting some love while feeling the heart of a farmer who coaxes out \
    new shoots?\nClear Round 1 in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:51000001$</font> and come back, and I'll give you \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nTake <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to \
    $npc:11004101$ in $map:63000062$\nand you can buy some fun items!"
set key[id=726145417004083] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, it feels like there's a little more love in this \
    world!\nGood work today, too!"
set key[id=726145417004084] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=726145417004085] name "Did you know that charm depends on the luck of the day?\nSomeone who's lucky \
    that day looks attractive to everyone else.\nWon't you try to find today's lucky one?\nIf you gather up all \
    that good fortune, the power of love will fill this place!"
set key[id=726145417004086] name "Today's lucky one is...\na <font color=\"#ffd200\">Soul Binder of level 60 or \
    higher</font>!\nIt doesn't matter whether they've changed jobs or not! "
set key[id=726145417004087] name "Meet today's lucky one and come back, and I'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font>.\nTake <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> to \
    $npc:11004101$ in $map:63000062$\nand you can buy some fun items.\nGood luck, $MyPCName$!"
