set key[id=726145417004143] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, it feels like there's a little more love in this \
    world!\nGood work today, too!"
set key[id=726145417004166] name "Hee hee~ $MyPCName$!\nThanks to your efforts, the bridge to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Island of Love</font> is complete!\nYou're amazing!"
set key[id=726145417004167] name "But this island can only be open for <font color=\"#ffd200\">just one \
    day</font>.\nOf course I feel for $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$ and $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$, who'll be \
    parted again tomorrow,\nbut <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>, who worked so hard to fill the world \
    with love, must feel awful too..."
set key[id=726145417004168] name "So I've prepared a little gift. Love doubles when you share it!\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Complete</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance Party 3 times</font> and come back to \
    me. \nI'll be waiting with a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> that'll surprise you."
set key[id=726145417004169] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Complete</font> the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Love Dance \
    Party 3 times</font> and come back to me. \nI'll be waiting with a <font color=\"#ffd200\">gift</font> that'll \
    surprise you."
set key[id=726145417004170] name "Here, I'll give you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">pretty hair ornament</font> that I \
    made thinking of $npcName:11004100[gender:1]$ and $npcName:11004099[gender:0]$.\nCome find me <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">next week</font> too, when this place opens again!"
set key[id=810132214002870] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$.\nHave you tried the Festival Card Board at \
    $map:02000360$?\nYou can win cute Duckling skins, mounts, and all kinds of other gifts!\nOh, and you know you \
    need $item:30000888$ to use the Festival Card Board, right?"
set key[id=810132214002871] name "You want to use the Festival Card Board but you're short on \
    $item:30000888$?\nThen, $MyPCName$, please <font color=\"#ffd200\">find and investigate the Duckling \
    balloons</font>!\nI hear Duckling balloons show up in Maple World on weekends, and I'm so curious how cute \
    they are!\nTell me when you've finished <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating Duckling balloons</font> and \
    I'll give you '$item:30000888$'~"
set key[id=810132214002872] name "You want to use the Festival Card Board but you're short on \
    $item:30000888$?\nThen, $MyPCName$, please <font color=\"#ffd200\">find and investigate the Duckling \
    balloons</font>!\nI hear Duckling balloons show up in Maple World on weekends, and I'm so curious how cute \
    they are!\nTell me when you've finished <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating Duckling balloons</font> and \
    I'll give you '$item:30000888$'~"
set key[id=810132214002873] name "Wow~ so Ducklings really are that cute?\nThank you for investigating the \
    Duckling balloons!\nHere's the '$item:30000888$' I promised~"
set key[id=820125914002878] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$.\nI wanted to feel the festival spirit for the happy \
    National Day,\nso I made Star Balloons appear all over Maple World!"
set key[id=820125914002879] name "Accidents can always happen at events,\nso could you check the Star Balloons to \
    make sure nothing is wrong with them, $MyPCName$?\nFinish <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating Star \
    Balloons</font> 10 times and tell me, and I'll give you 10 tasty '$item:20000311$' and\na '$item:20301037$'!"
set key[id=820125914002880] name "Accidents can always happen at events,\nso could you check the Star Balloons to \
    make sure nothing is wrong with them, $MyPCName$?\nFinish <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating Star \
    Balloons</font> 10 times and tell me, and I'll give you 10 tasty '$item:20000311$' and\na '$item:20301037$'!"
set key[id=820125914002881] name "You've finished investigating all the Star Balloons.\nHere are the 10 \
    '$item:20000311$' and the '$item:20301037$' I promised.\nOh, and don't forget, you can help me once a day \
    during the event period!"
set key[id=821102814002882] name "You came just in time, $MyPCName$!\nI prepared gifts for the adventurers of \
    Maple World to celebrate the happy National Day,\nbut the field bosses attacked them!"
set key[id=821102814002883] name "Luckily I hadn't filled them yet, so only the empty lucky pouches were \
    taken.\nIf you, $MyPCName$, <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat the field bosses of Maple World</font> and \nbring \
    back the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000718$</font>, I'll fill them up and give them to you as gifts!"
set key[id=821102814002884] name "Luckily I hadn't filled them yet, so only the empty lucky pouches were \
    taken.\nIf you, $MyPCName$, <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat the field bosses of Maple World</font> and \nbring \
    back the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000718$</font>, I'll fill them up and give them to you as gifts!"
set key[id=821102814002885] name "Wow! Thank you so much!\nYou're the best, $MyPCName$!!!"
set key[id=822175917002886] name "$MyPCName$! Shall I give you a riddle?\nWho is the kindest woman in \
    $map:02000001$?\nFind her and say hello, and I'll give you a gift!"
set key[id=822175917002887] name "You need a hint?\nAw... it's too easy... think about it carefully!"
set key[id=822175917002888] name "That wasn't too hard, was it?\n$npc:11000160[gender:1]$ has a heart as lovely as \
    her face!"
set key[id=822175917002889] name "$MyPCName$! Shall I give you a riddle?\nWho is the most hardworking man in \
    $map:02000001$?\nFind him and say hello, and I'll give you a gift!"
set key[id=822175917002890] name "You need a hint?\nAw... it's too easy... think about it carefully!"
set key[id=822175917002891] name "That wasn't too hard, was it?\nMr. $npcName:11000012[gender:0]$ is great at \
    working hard, but...\nhe has so much work that I worry he'll collapse."
set key[id=822175917002892] name "$MyPCName$! Shall I give you a riddle?\nWho is the most intellectual woman in \
    $map:02000001$?\nFind her and say hello, and I'll give you a gift!"
set key[id=822175917002893] name "You need a hint?\nAw... it's too easy... think about it carefully!"
set key[id=822175917002894] name "That wasn't too hard, was it?\nThey say nobody can keep up with how much \
    $npc:11000005[gender:1]$ reads."
set key[id=822175917002895] name "$MyPCName$! Shall I give you a riddle?\nWho is the most dependable man in \
    $map:02000001$?\nFind him and say hello, and I'll give you a gift!"
set key[id=822175917002896] name "You need a hint?\nAw... it's too easy... think about it carefully!"
set key[id=822175917002897] name "That wasn't too hard, was it?\nThey say everyone can rest easy thanks to \
    $npc:11000119[gender:0]$."
set key[id=822175917002898] name "$MyPCName$! Shall I give you a riddle?\nWho is the most refreshing woman in \
    $map:02000064$?\nFind her and say hello, and I'll give you a gift!"
set key[id=822175917002899] name "You need a hint?\nAw... it's too easy... think about it carefully!"
set key[id=822175917002900] name "That wasn't too hard, was it?\nEven among the Bunny Gals, \
    $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ seems especially refreshing!"
set key[id=822175917002901] name "$MyPCName$! Shall I give you a riddle?\nWho is the most diligent man in \
    $map:02000064$?\nFind him and say hello, and I'll give you a gift!"
set key[id=822175917002902] name "You need a hint?\nAw... it's too easy... think about it carefully!"
set key[id=822175917002903] name "That wasn't too hard, was it?\nLet's all be people who quietly and diligently do \
    our jobs, like $npc:11000172[gender:0]$."
set key[id=822175917002904] name "Hmm... I'm thinking of making a monster encyclopedia while I'm here.\nI'd love \
    your help, $MyPCName$...\nCould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat various plant-type monsters</font> across \
    Maple World and bring back the information?"
set key[id=822175917002905] name "Hmm... I'm thinking of making a monster encyclopedia while I'm here.\nI'd love \
    your help, $MyPCName$...\nCould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat various plant-type monsters</font> across \
    Maple World and bring back the information?"
set key[id=822175917002906] name "You brought back this much information!\nAs expected, $MyPCName$ is the best! "
set key[id=822175917002907] name "Hmm... I'm thinking of making a monster encyclopedia while I'm here.\nI'd love \
    your help, $MyPCName$...\nCould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat various beast-type monsters</font> across \
