set key[id=822175917002915] name "You brought back this much information!\nAs expected, $MyPCName$ is the best! "
set key[id=822175917002916] name "Hmm... I'm thinking of making a monster encyclopedia while I'm here.\nI'd love \
    your help, $MyPCName$...\nCould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat various spirit-type monsters</font> across \
    Maple World and bring back the information?"
set key[id=822175917002917] name "Hmm... I'm thinking of making a monster encyclopedia while I'm here.\nI'd love \
    your help, $MyPCName$...\nCould you <font color=\"#ffd200\">defeat various spirit-type monsters</font> across \
    Maple World and bring back the information?"
set key[id=822175917002918] name "You brought back this much information!\nAs expected, $MyPCName$ is the best! "
set key[id=822175917002919] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nHave you ever run while listening to the wind brush past \
    your ears?"
set key[id=822175917002920] name "Listen to the cool sound of the wind and <font color=\"#ffd200\">run to your \
    heart's content!</font>\nNothing could be better!"
set key[id=822175917002921] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=822175917002922] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nWhen you feel stuffy or down, try <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">jumping</font> toward that blue sky like I do.\nYou'll feel refreshed, as if your chest has \
    opened up!"
set key[id=822175917002923] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Jump</font> up toward that blue sky.\nIt'll feel so \
    refreshing, like your chest has been opened wide!"
set key[id=822175917002924] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=822175917002925] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nHop on a <font color=\"#ffd200\">mount</font> and go \
    sightseeing around Maple World.\nThe beautiful scenery of Maple World will lift your mood even more!"
set key[id=822175917002926] name "Hop on a <font color=\"#ffd200\">mount</font> and go sightseeing around the \
    Maple World.\nThe beautiful scenery will lift your mood even more!"
set key[id=822175917002927] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=822175917002928] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nDon't you feel like sinking into the blue sky when autumn \
    comes?\nLet's splash around and <font color=\"#ffd200\">swim</font> in water as blue as the sky!"
set key[id=822175917002929] name "Don't you feel like sinking into the blue sky when autumn comes?\nLet's splash \
    around and <font color=\"#ffd200\">swim</font> in water as blue as the sky!"
set key[id=822175917002930] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=910150117004183] name "I can only trade if you bring me <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301928$</font>.\nIf you have any spare box pieces, please, please!! let me know.\nI \
    want to collect them and make <font color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301927$</font>!"
set key[id=910150117004184] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, I can finish my box!\nHere, this is <font \
    color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20001033$</font>.\nIt makes you very dizzy when you eat it, so handle it with care~"
set key[id=910150117004185] name "How have you been, $MyPCName$?\nIt's not exactly top-secret info, so you \
    probably know already, \nbut if you collect <font color=\"#ffd200\">5</font> <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301928$</font> and combine them, \nyou can make <font color=\"#00a2ed\">1</font> \
    <font color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20301927$</font>."
set key[id=910150117004189] name "Ugh!! What a shame. Such a shame...\nIf you get a spare <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301928$</font>, tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">me</font> first.\nPerfect for when \
    someone is getting on your nerves!!\nThis Mushking-brand 'thing' makes you dizzy when you eat it!!\nI'm \
    looking for someone to trade me for <font color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20001033$</font>.\n"
set key[id=910150117004190] name "Hmm.. It can't be helped. Making a box is the best way, after all!\nIf you end \
    up with a spare <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301928$</font> after making the box, come back.\nThis 'thing' \
    is great for when you want to make someone who's getting on your nerves eat it just once~~!\nI'm looking for \
    someone to trade me for <font color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20001033$</font>."
set key[id=910150117004191] name "Really??? Then will you trade for this 'thing'?\nIt's~ <font \
    color=\"#00a2ed\">$item:20001033$</font>, which makes you dizzy when you eat it!!\nPerfect for when someone is \
    getting on your nerves!!\nDon't get me wrong. You'll just lose consciousness for a moment, and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">you definitely won't die.</font>\nOf course, if you want to eat it yourself, I won't stop \
    you."
set key[id=910153817004192] name "... Do you happen to have any spare <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301928$</font>?"
set key[id=910153817004193] name "No, I didn't."
set key[id=910153817004194] name "I do, but I'm going to make a box with them."
set key[id=910153817004195] name "I do, but I only have a few, and I don't know what to do with them."
set key[id=911210717004196] name "$MyPCName$, did you hear the news?\nIt's already been one year since the \
    adventure began in MapleStory 2!\nTime flies, doesn't it~?"
set key[id=911210717004197] name "To celebrate a whole year of making memories together, a party is held every day \
    from September 21 to September 23.\nWe'll also give a celebration gift once a day to the adventurers who join \
    the party~\nAre you ready to receive your gift?"
set key[id=911210717004198] name "If you're ready to receive your gift, please tell me."
set key[id=911210717004199] name "Thank you for joining the anniversary party.\nHere's $item:20301971$ as a \
    gift~\nI hope you keep having a fun and happy time in MapleStory 2!"
set key[id=912012617004200] name "$MyPCName$, have you seen the $npcFunction:11004248$ over there, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font>?\nFor Chuseok she should be busy making <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Moonlight Mooncakes</font> right now, \nbut she came down to Maple World... There must be a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">problem</font>, and a <font color=\"#ffd200\">serious</font> one."
set key[id=912012617004201] name "What's the problem?"
set key[id=912012617004202] name "I hear the moon rabbits working there suddenly changed strangely and ran \
    away.\n$npcName:11004248$ is the daughter of the Full Moon Mill foreman,\nand with the work at a standstill, \
    her mother has fallen ill from frustration,\nso she came down to teach adventurers how to make <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Moonlight Mooncakes</font> in her place."
set key[id=912012617004203] name "$MyPCName$, go learn how to make Moonlight Mooncakes from \
    $npc:11004248$.\nShe'll teach you right away if you bring the ingredients... Oh! \nYou can just dig up some \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001201$</font>!"
set key[id=912012617004205] name "Yes, you can find them by <font color=\"#ffd200\">searching for and \
    investigating the flower balloons</font> floating all over Maple World!\nThey smell a lot like the mooncake \
    ingredients used at the Full Moon Mill. \nI think they can be used as mooncake ingredients once they're \
    prepared.\nCollect <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001201$</font> and bring it to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font>!\n"
set key[id=912012617004206] name "Collect the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001201$</font> you can find by <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">searching for and investigating the flower balloons</font> floating all over Maple \
    World,\nand bring it to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font>!\nShe'll show you how to make Moonlight \
    Mooncakes and prepare the ingredients for you!"
set key[id=912012617004207] name "Huh... Is this scent what I think it is...? \nDid you bring <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001201$</font>?"
set key[id=912012617004208] name "(Hand over <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001201$</font>.)"
set key[id=912012617004209] name "Wow...! In this condition, I can prepare it and use it as <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">mooncake ingredients</font>!\nPlease wait just a moment and I'll prepare it neatly for you!"
set key[id=912012617004210] name "(Wait.)"
set key[id=912012617004211] name "Here, I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001199$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001200$</font>! Double-click them in your inventory window to \n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">combine</font> them with $item:30001198$ and make Moonlight Mooncakes!"
set key[id=912012617004212] name "$MyPCName$, have you seen the $npcFunction:11004248$ over there, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font>?\nFor Chuseok she should be busy making <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Moonlight Mooncakes</font> right now, \nbut she came down to Maple World... There must be a \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">problem</font>, and a <font color=\"#ffd200\">serious</font> one."
set key[id=912012617004213] name "What's the problem?"
set key[id=912012617004214] name "They say the moon rabbits who worked there ran away. Isn't that strange?\nThe \
    gentle, kind moon rabbits would never steal the ingredients and run off like that. \n...But you know, I think \
    I know why. That <font color=\"#ffd200\">suspicious aura</font>..."
set key[id=912012617004215] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Suspicious aura</font>...?"
set key[id=912012617004216] name "Yes, I felt it. The aura seeping out of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">secret space \
    behind the full moon</font>... \nThere's a rumor that the huge, bizarre-looking rabbits showing up in \
    $map:02000043$ lately\nare the moon rabbits, changed, and I think\nsomething might be going on there."
set key[id=912012617004217] name "$MyPCName$, will you go behind the full moon and unravel its secret?\nIf you use \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301895$</font>, you should be able to get in.\nAfter you come back from there, \
    please tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font> about it!"
set key[id=912012617004218] name "$MyPCName$, will you go behind the full moon and unravel its secret?\nIf you use \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301895$</font>, you should be able to get in.\nAfter you come back from there, \
    please tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004248$</font> about it!"
set key[id=912012617004219] name "Ah... this aura, this sweet scent... \n$MyPCName$, did you go to the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">space behind the full moon</font>? "
set key[id=912012617004220] name "Yes. Let me tell you what I saw there."
set key[id=912012617004221] name "I knew it... \nWhy on earth is this happening... "
set key[id=912012617004222] name "(Comfort $npc:11004248$.)"
set key[id=912012617004223] name "It's all right. I can't keep on being sad forever.\nNo matter what crisis comes, \
    so many people are helping us\nthat we'll surely overcome it...! "
set key[id=912012617004224] name "It looks like you got some $item:30001200$, so I'll give you a bit more \n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001198$</font> so you can make more mooncakes. Thank you for passing along the news. \
    "
set key[id=912012617004225] name "$MyPCName$. There's something I'd like to ask... \nWould you listen to my \
    story...?"
set key[id=912012617004226] name "It's fine. Go ahead and tell me."
set key[id=912012617004227] name "Every evening, please subdue the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:27000034$</font>s \
    that appear in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000043$</font>. \nThey're probably my <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">colleagues</font> who used to work together at the Full Moon Mill."
set key[id=912012617004228] name "Is it really all right to defeat your colleagues?"
set key[id=912012617004229] name "There's a moon rabbit tribe <font color=\"#ffd200\">legend</font> my mother told \
    me when I was little.\nLong ago, moon rabbits tainted by a <font color=\"#ffd200\">strange aura</font> tore \
    the mill apart,\nand they say they never stopped until they were <font color=\"#ffd200\">completely \
    subdued</font> and drained of that aura.\nSome of them returned to normal, but some didn't... "
set key[id=912012617004230] name "Of course, there may be some among our colleagues now who can't come \
    back.\nBut... disturbing the world doesn't suit the spirit of the moon rabbit tribe. \nI want to give those \
    tainted by darkness <font color=\"#ffd200\">true rest</font>."
set key[id=912012617004231] name "(Say you'll help.)"
set key[id=912012617004232] name "The $npc:27000034$ wandering $map:02000043$\nappear at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">7:30, 8:30, 9:30 and 10:30 every evening</font>.\nPlease subdue them and help them rest in \
    peace."
set key[id=912012617004233] name "The $npc:27000034$ wandering $map:02000043$\nappear at <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">7:30, 8:30, 9:30 and 10:30 every evening</font>.\nPlease subdue them and help them rest in \
    peace."
set key[id=912012617004234] name "You're back. \n...Thank you for helping, even though you're busy."
set key[id=912012617004235] name "(Reassure $npc:11004248$.)"
set key[id=912012617004236] name "It's all right. I'm sure they're grateful to you too, $MyPCName$.\nAs thanks, \
    I'll give you <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001200$</font>. Use it as an ingredient for <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">mooncakes</font>. "
set key[id=912125617004237] name "For the first anniversary of <font color=\"#ffd200\">MapleStory 2</font>, all of \
    Maple World is buzzing with a festive mood!"
set key[id=912125617004238] name "Join the festival too, $MyPCName$.\nWhy not set up an ad balloon and leave a \
    message celebrating the first anniversary?"
set key[id=912125617004239] name "Set up an ad balloon and leave a message celebrating the first anniversary."
set key[id=912125617004240] name "Clap, clap, clap! Thank you for celebrating the first anniversary of <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">MapleStory 2</font>.\nI hope you keep making happy memories with <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">MapleStory 2</font>."
set key[id=914132117002952] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nHave you been to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000350$</font>?\nRumor has it that <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000350$</font> is a \
    place filled with nothing but deep darkness."
set key[id=914132117002953] name "Please go and tell me what kind of place <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000350$</font> is, $MyPCName$.\nIf you clear away the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fifteenth darkness</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000350$</font> and come back, \
    I'll give you a gift!"
set key[id=914132117002954] name "Please go and tell me what kind of place <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000350$</font> is, $MyPCName$.\nIf you clear away the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">fifteenth darkness</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000350$</font> and come back, \
    I'll give you a gift!"
set key[id=914132117002955] name "I knew you could do it, $MyPCName$!\nHere's the $item:20301071$ I promised~"
set key[id=1010154917004241] name "Emergency! Emergency! $MyPCName$, are you listening?\nFor Halloween, we're \
    looking for a <font color=\"#ffd200\">hero</font> to drive out the evil spirits! "
set key[id=1010154917004242] name "The Halloween season, when ghosts run wild, is here! \nPerhaps because of that, \
    a wicked aura is hanging over the <font color=\"#ffd200\">dungeons</font> of Maple World too.\nIsn't this just \
    the time to show the <font color=\"#ffd200\">courage</font> not to lose to evil spirits?"
set key[id=1010154917004243] name "Clear dungeons until you've filled 30 weekly reward claims,\nand if you then \
    obtain <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301427$</font>,\nI'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:11800119$</font>, a gift for Halloween heroes!"
set key[id=1010154917004244] name "Clear dungeons until you've filled 30 weekly reward claims,\nand if you then \
    obtain <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20301427$</font>,\nI'll give you <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:11800119$</font>, a gift for Halloween heroes!"
set key[id=1010154917004245] name "I knew it! You're really brave, $MyPCName$.\nHere, this is the gift I prepared \
    for a Halloween hero!"
set key[id=1106154417002956] name "Nice to meet you, $MyPCName$, kum.\nHave you ever seen $npc:23400071$ in \
    person, kum?\nAs you can tell from looking at me, the $npc:23400071$ in $map:02000207$ has six whole arms, \
    kum."
set key[id=1106154417002957] name "Go to $map:02000207$ and remove $npc:23400071$'s arms, kum.\nIf you can take \
    off even one of $npc:23400071$'s arms and come back, I'll give you a gift to remember it by, kum.\nKum kum, \
    you can find the entrance to $map:02000207$ in $map:63000054$, kum."
set key[id=1106154417002958] name "Go to $map:02000207$ and remove $npc:23400071$'s arms, kum.\nIf you can take \
    off even one of $npc:23400071$'s arms and come back, I'll give you a gift to remember it by, kum.\nKum kum, \
    you can find the entrance to $map:02000207$ in $map:63000054$, kum."
set key[id=1106154417002959] name "$MyPCName$, I'm surprised you're stronger than I thought, kum!\nI'll give you a \
    gift to commemorate removing $npc:23400071$'s arm, kum."
set key[id=1107112617002960] name "Nice to meet you, $MyPCName$, kum.\nI hear balloons that look just like the \
    ancient god Zakum have appeared all over Maple World, kum.\nOh, they may look like Zakum, but they're only \
    cute little balloons, so no need to be startled, kum."
set key[id=1107112617002961] name "Wander around and <font color=\"#ffd200\">find and investigate Zakum \
    Balloons</font>, kum.\nIf you succeed in <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating a Zakum Balloon</font>, I'll \
    give you a tasty '$item:20000691$', kum.\nIf you collect 30 $item:20000691$, you can also get a splendid Zakum \
    staircase as an emblem reward, so be sure to try, kum."
set key[id=1107112617002962] name "Wander around and <font color=\"#ffd200\">find and investigate Zakum \
    Balloons</font>, kum.\nIf you succeed in <font color=\"#ffd200\">investigating a Zakum Balloon</font>, I'll \
    give you a tasty '$item:20000691$', kum.\nIf you collect 30 $item:20000691$, you can also get a splendid Zakum \
    staircase as an emblem reward, so be sure to try, kum."
set key[id=1107112617002963] name "Kum kum, here's the $item:20000691$ I promised, kum.\nEat it quickly before it \
    goes soggy, kum. It tastes best that way."
set key[id=1107161117002964] name "Welcome, $MyPCName$!\nDuring the event period, I'm handing out a gift Santa \
    prepared\nfor adventurers who clear an adventure dungeon: $item:20301147$."
set key[id=1107161117002965] name "When you're ready, try <font color=\"#ffd200\">clearing one of the adventure \
    dungeons for level 40 or higher</font>.\nAnd don't forget to come back after clearing the dungeon to pick up \
    your Christmas present!"
set key[id=1107161117002966] name "When you're ready, try <font color=\"#ffd200\">clearing one of the adventure \
    dungeons for level 40 or higher</font>.\nAnd don't forget to come back after clearing the dungeon to pick up \
    your Christmas present!"
set key[id=1107161117002967] name "As expected of you, $MyPCName$!\nHere's your $item:20301147$.\nWhich gift will \
    you choose, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1110104017002980] name "$MyPCName$! Shall I give you a riddle?\nWho is the most refreshing woman in \
    $map:02000064$?\nFind her and say hello, and I'll give you a gift!"
set key[id=1110104017002981] name "You need a hint?\nAw... it's too easy... think about it carefully!"
set key[id=1110104017002982] name "That wasn't too hard, was it?\nEven among the Bunny Gals, \
    $npc:11000711[gender:1]$ seems especially refreshing!"
set key[id=1110104017003010] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nWhen your chest feels stuffy, don't you feel like sinking \
    into the blue sky?\nLet's splash around and <font color=\"#ffd200\">swim</font> in water as blue as the sky!"
set key[id=1110104017003011] name "When your chest feels stuffy, don't you feel like sinking into the blue \
    sky?\nLet's splash around and <font color=\"#ffd200\">swim</font> in water as blue as the sky!"
set key[id=1110104017003012] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=1115160817003013] name "Hello, $MyPCName$~\nHave you met the various pets that have appeared all over \
    Maple World?\nIf you wander the fields, you can meet many kinds of pets.\nThey're so cute that I want to have \
    a few myself!"
set key[id=1115160817003014] name "Please <font color=\"#ffd200\">capture 15 pets</font>, $MyPCName$!\nIf you \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">capture 15 pets</font>, I'll give you a cute '$item:60000032$'.\nEach pet can be met \
    in a different place, and I hear some pets can't be found in the fields at all.\nIf there's a pet you want, \
    why not trade information with other people?"
set key[id=1115160817003015] name "Please <font color=\"#ffd200\">capture 15 pets</font>, $MyPCName$!\nIf you \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">capture 15 pets</font>, I'll give you a cute '$item:60000032$'.\nEach pet can be met \
    in a different place, and I hear some pets can't be found in the fields at all.\nIf there's a pet you want, \
    why not trade information with other people?"
set key[id=1115160817003016] name "Wow! You've already caught 15 pets? Here's a $item:60000032$ as a gift!\nNow \
    please raise it healthy and happy, $MyPCName$~"
set key[id=1127152517003017] name "$MyPCName$, why don't you try building the ancient god Zakum, kum?"
set key[id=1127155917003021] name "To build the ancient god Zakum, you need 6 parts in total, as listed below, \
    kum.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200835$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200836$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200837$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200838$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200839$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200840$</font> "
set key[id=1127155917003022] name "Gather all 6 building materials, set them up, and come to me, kum.\nIf you \
    manage to restore the glorious form of the ancient god Zakum, I'll give you the '$item:70300019$', kum."
set key[id=1127155917003023] name "To build the ancient god Zakum, you need 6 parts in total, as listed below, \
    kum.\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200835$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200836$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200837$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200838$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200839$</font>, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200840$</font> \nAnd each of these \
    building materials can be obtained a different way, kum."
set key[id=1127155917003024] name "Where can I get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200835$</font>?"
set key[id=1127155917003025] name "Where can I get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200836$</font>?"
set key[id=1127155917003026] name "Where can I get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200840$</font>?"
set key[id=1127155917003027] name "Where can I get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200837$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200838$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200839$</font>?"
set key[id=1127155917003028] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200835$</font> is the final reward of the Stamp \
    event running right now, kum."
set key[id=1127155917003029] name "You can buy <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200836$</font> from \
    $npc:11003385[gender:1]$ in $map:63000054$, kum."
set key[id=1127155917003030] name "You can get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200840$</font> once you collect 30 \
    '$item:20000691$', kum."
set key[id=1127155917003031] name "You can get <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200837$</font>, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200838$</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:50200839$</font> by buying building \
    materials in Build Mode, kum."
set key[id=1127155917003032] name "Impressive, kum. I never thought you could collect all 6, kum.\nTake the \
    '$item:70300019$', kum."
set key[id=1127160217004269] name "Strange energies have been seeping out of the Chaos Dungeons lately. I think \
    the dark energy has grown stronger and become tangled together. "
set key[id=1127160217004270] name "It seems some of the dark energy is slipping out of the dungeons through the \
    confusion. It's only a tiny bit for now, so it isn't a problem, but if we leave it alone, an enormous amount \
    of energy might burst out!"
set key[id=1127160217004271] name "Please help calm the turmoil in the Chaos Dungeons, $MyPCName$.\nI think things \
    will quiet down if you clear the $dungeonTitle:23021003$, $dungeonTitle:23022003$ and $dungeonTitle:23023003$ \
    dungeons about 12 times. Will you help?"
set key[id=1127160217004272] name "Please help calm the turmoil in the Chaos Dungeons, $MyPCName$.\nI think things \
    will quiet down if you clear the $dungeonTitle:23021003$, $dungeonTitle:23022003$ and $dungeonTitle:23023003$ \
    dungeons about 12 times. Will you help?"
set key[id=1127160217004273] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, the turmoil in the Chaos Dungeons seems to have \
    quieted down. This is a gift to thank you!"
set key[id=1127160217004274] name "Have you felt the ground shaking lately? It was a tremor subtle enough that a \
    perceptive person like you, $MyPCName$, could feel it. I think it's the vibration caused by the energy of the \
    Eye of Lapenta dungeon building up. "
set key[id=1127160217004275] name "It's the center of the explosion that happened in the past, and a lot of energy \
    still remains there. It seems the remaining energy is building up again, and another explosion is about to \
    happen. We have to stop the energy from building up so it doesn't explode again!"
set key[id=1127160217004276] name "Please help keep the Eye of Lapenta dungeon from exploding again, \
    $MyPCName$.\nI think the energy will scatter if you clear the $dungeonTitle:27000001$, $dungeonTitle:27001001$ \
    and $dungeonTitle:27002001$ dungeons about 12 times. Will you help?"
set key[id=1127160217004277] name "Please help keep the Eye of Lapenta dungeon from exploding again, \
    $MyPCName$.\nI think the energy will scatter if you clear the $dungeonTitle:27000001$, $dungeonTitle:27001001$ \
    and $dungeonTitle:27002001$ dungeons about 12 times. Will you help?"
set key[id=1127160217004278] name "Thank you, $MyPCName$! I can't feel the vibrations anymore. I prepared a gift \
    to show my thanks!"
set key[id=1129204021021832] name "Did you feel it too?\nThis power of darkness...."
set key[id=1129204021021833] name "$MyPCName$, yes, that's right."
set key[id=1129204021021834] name "(Say you haven't said anything yet.)"
set key[id=1129204021021835] name "The darkened <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:22409035$</font> has lured out \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mumus</font> and is tormenting people.\nSomeone must have tricked the darkened <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:22409035$</font> into putting on a mask filled with the power of darkness."
set key[id=1129204021021836] name "He was always shy and would hesitate to show his face.\nSomeone who knew his \
    nature must have handed him a mask imbued with the power of darkness. "
set key[id=1129204021021837] name "Save <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:22409035$</font> before he falls \
    completely into darkness, and set <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mumus</font> free.\nHe should be in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000103$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021838] name "Ah, will you be heading there right now?"
set key[id=1129204021021839] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021840] name "(Say you'll go on your own.)"
set key[id=1129204021021841] name "Then I'll help you get there quickly."
set key[id=1129204021021842] name "Turning down such a convenient chance. \nI won't help you later when you go."
set key[id=1129204021021843] name "Save <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:22409035$</font> before he falls \
    completely into darkness, and set <font color=\"#ffd200\">Mumus</font> free."
set key[id=1129204021021844] name "I could sense your presence even from far away."
set key[id=1129204021021845] name "Did you go and help him?"
set key[id=1129204021021846] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021847] name "I see. But this won't solve it completely.\nBecause a 'weak' heart falls so \
    easily into 'wicked' darkness, heh."
set key[id=1129204021021848] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Let's get some distance.)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021849] name "Thank you, $MyPCName$.\nAs thanks, I'll share some of my energy with you."
set key[id=1129204021021850] name "Ah, my left hand...."
set key[id=1129204021021851] name "$MyPCName$!\nDo you see where my left hand is pointing?"
set key[id=1129204021021852] name "(Say it's pointing at <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000021$</font>.)"
set key[id=1129204021021853] name "My left hand is telling me it senses the power of darkness there."
set key[id=1129204021021854] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(It seems best to say you'll go along quietly.)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021855] name "The only one who could give off such strong power there is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000099$</font>....\nSomething's suspicious. I'd better check it out."
set key[id=1129204021021856] name "Heh, I know.\nYou were just about to say you'd go right now, weren't you?"
set key[id=1129204021021857] name "(Pretend to be surprised and ask how he knew.)"
set key[id=1129204021021859] name "Hurry to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000021$</font> and check on <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000099$</font>,\nand if it really has been stained by darkness... defeat it."
set key[id=1129204021021860] name "Ah, will you be heading there right now?"
set key[id=1129204021021861] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021862] name "(Say you'll go on your own.)"
set key[id=1129204021021863] name "Then I'll help you get there quickly."
set key[id=1129204021021864] name "Turning down such a convenient chance. \nI won't help you later when you go."
set key[id=1129204021021865] name "Hurry to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000021$</font> and defeat the darkened \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000099$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021866] name "I can tell just by looking in your eyes."
set key[id=1129204021021867] name "Was <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000099$</font> really stained by \
    darkness?"
set key[id=1129204021021868] name "(Say that it was.)"
set key[id=1129204021021869] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:34000103$</font> is good by nature, so it \
    shouldn't be swayed by ordinary darkness,\nbut something is off.\nIt seems someone is practicing how to \
    control <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:34000103$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021870] name "Hmm... if we hadn't noticed, the power of darkness would have spread out of \
    control,\nbut that's my dark-power detection for you... heh."
set key[id=1129204021021871] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Suddenly I feel tired.)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021872] name "You worked hard too, $MyPCName$.\nAs a reward, I'll share my energy with you."
set key[id=1129204021021873] name "Hmm...."
set key[id=1129204021021874] name "Heh, $MyPCName$...\nDid you come because you received my signal?"
set key[id=1129204021021875] name "(Ask what he's talking about.)"
set key[id=1129204021021876] name "Huh? You didn't get it?\nHmm... is this code not right either?"
set key[id=1129204021021877] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(Do I have a code?)</font>"
set key[id=1129204021021878] name "It can't be helped. I'll have to explain it out loud.\n<font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000047$</font> of the Cerberus tribe, sealed away for his wild and violent \
    nature, has appeared."
set key[id=1129204021021879] name "He has been stained by the power of darkness and means to destroy everything \
    around him.\nIf we can't stop him, Maple World will be swallowed by the power of darkness. "
set key[id=1129204021021880] name "$MyPCName$, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000214$</font> and\ndefeat the \
    darkened <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000047$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021881] name "Ah, will you be heading there right now?"
set key[id=1129204021021882] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021883] name "(Say you'll go on your own.)"
set key[id=1129204021021884] name "Then I'll help you get there quickly."
set key[id=1129204021021885] name "Turning down such a convenient chance. \nI won't help you later when you go."
set key[id=1129204021021886] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000214$</font> and\ndefeat the darkened \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000047$</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021887] name "There's no need to say it aloud."
set key[id=1129204021021888] name "I've already received your heart by telepathy."
set key[id=1129204021021889] name "(... Say you completed what was asked.)"
set key[id=1129204021021890] name "The limits of the power of darkness are unknown, so this probably isn't the \
    end.\nStill, we can't sit around doing nothing."
set key[id=1129204021021891] name "Thank you, $MyPCName$.\nThanks to you, we were able to stop the power of \
    darkness from spreading."
set key[id=1129204021021892] name "I sense the power of darkness."
set key[id=1129204021021893] name "Darkened monsters are appearing all across Maple World,\nbut the most \
    threatening of them are the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Wicked Baphomet Brothers</font>."
set key[id=1129204021021894] name "The <font color=\"#ffd200\">Baphomet Brothers</font>, who once served the Demon \
    King's orders,\ncarry a boundless dark energy."
set key[id=1129204021021895] name "Judging by how they keep appearing no matter how hard we strike them down,\nthe \
    brothers seem to share their dark power and revive each other. "
set key[id=1129204021021896] name "If we leave them alone, their dark power might create a second and a third Land \
    of Darkness.\nWe must stop them without fail!"
set key[id=1129204021021897] name "(Say you think you know what he'll say next.)"
set key[id=1129204021021898] name "Heh, did you read my telepathy?\nGo to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000260$</font> and defeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000026[gender:1]$</font>!"
set key[id=1129204021021899] name "Ah, will you be heading there right now?"
set key[id=1129204021021900] name "(Say yes.)"
set key[id=1129204021021901] name "(Say you'll go on your own.)"
set key[id=1129204021021902] name "Then I'll help you get there quickly."
set key[id=1129204021021903] name "Turning down such a convenient chance. \nI won't help you later when you go."
set key[id=1129204021021904] name "Go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000260$</font> and defeat <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:23000026[gender:1]$</font>!"
set key[id=1129204021021905] name "There's no need to say it aloud."
set key[id=1129204021021906] name "I've already received your heart by telepathy."
set key[id=1129204021021907] name "(... Say you completed what was asked.)"
set key[id=1129204021021908] name "The limits of the power of darkness are unknown, so this probably isn't the \
    end.\nStill, we can't sit around doing nothing."
set key[id=1129204021021909] name "Thank you, $MyPCName$.\nThanks to you, we were able to stop the power of \
    darkness from spreading."
set key[id=1207170517004279] name "What was 2018 like for you, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$MyPCName$</font>?"
set key[id=1207170517004280] name "Over the past year, my brother $npcName:11003139[gender:0]$ and I, \
    $npcName:11001002[gender:1]$,\nspent our days happily delivering event news to adventurers.\nWe'll keep \
    delivering news of lots of events with plenty of energy in the new year, too. "
set key[id=1207170517004281] name "I'm cheering for you to have an energetic new year too, $MyPCName$,\nand I \
    prepared a small gift."
set key[id=1207170517004282] name "I'll give it to you once a day for 3 days,\nfrom December 30, 2018 to January \
    1, 2019, so don't forget to claim it!"
set key[id=1207170517004283] name "Let's forget all the bad memories from 2018, keep only the good ones, and \
    welcome the new year."
set key[id=1207170517004284] name "Here comes <font color=\"#ffd200\">2019</font>, which we greet with fluttering \
    hearts!\nI hope it's filled with nothing but joy and happiness."
set key[id=11325883748018290697] name "That Blackbean is causing trouble again.\nIt hasn't been long since we got \
    rid of the balloons that look like him, and now he's scattering balloons all over Maple World again."
set key[id=11325883748018290698] name "Do you know how startled the residents get sometimes, thinking it's the \
    real Blackbean?\nHe's truly the very definition of a troublemaker."
set key[id=11325883748018290699] name "Could you clear away those balloons, $MyPCName$?\nIt's time to teach that \
    guy a lesson!"
set key[id=11325883748018290700] name "Honestly, how long is that prankster Blackbean going to keep this \
    up?\nPlease get rid of the balloons that look like him!"
set key[id=11325883748018290701] name "Phew, it finally looks a bit cleaner!\nThanks to you, $MyPCName$, Maple \
    World is slowly getting back to normal!"

# Quest dialogue of the remaining no-feature quests that no pack has in English (no feature tag): our own English
# for the 908 scriptquest rows of locale KR (or no locale) whose quest a player can get (159 quests), with each
# row's own format fields, font tags and line breaks; the player's lines are first-person choices.
file Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml kms:Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml 032f90f7273bbe7d
set key[id=210014814002021] name "Hello~ $MyPCName$! The petals flutter~ spring has arrived.\nBut I hear that \
    beings who envy spring are after the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000525$</font>!\nThey're the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">elite monsters that appear all over the field</font>."
set key[id=210014814002022] name "We'll only stop the cold from returning if we take back the stolen \
    $item:30000525$...!\n$MyPCName$, could you defeat those wicked monsters and\ncollect <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">10</font> of <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000525$</font> and bring them to me?"
set key[id=210014814002023] name "Thank you, $MyPCName$! \nI was worried the cold would return... but a warm \
    spring breeze is blowing now.\nAs thanks, please accept this <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:20300167$</font>! "
set key[id=212201214002128] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nHave you ever run while listening to maple leaves rustling \
    in the wind?"
set key[id=212201214002129] name "Feel the cool autumn wind and the crimson maple leaves, and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">run to your heart's content!</font>\nIt doesn't get better than this!"
set key[id=212201214002130] name "Feel the cool autumn wind and the crimson maple leaves, and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">run to your heart's content!</font>\nIt doesn't get better than this!"
set key[id=212201214002131] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=212201214002132] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nHere's one more way to enjoy the Maple Leaf Festival! "
set key[id=212201214002133] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Jump</font> up toward that blue sky.\nIt'll feel so \
    refreshing, like your chest has been opened wide!"
set key[id=212201214002134] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Jump</font> up toward that blue sky.\nIt'll feel so \
    refreshing, like your chest has been opened wide!"
set key[id=212201214002135] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=212201214002136] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nThe Maple World has become even more beautiful for the Maple \
    Leaf Festival!"
set key[id=212201214002137] name "Hop on a <font color=\"#ffd200\">mount</font> and go sightseeing around the \
    Maple World.\nThe beautiful scenery will lift your mood even more!"
set key[id=212201214002138] name "Hop on a <font color=\"#ffd200\">mount</font> and go sightseeing around the \
    Maple World.\nThe beautiful scenery will lift your mood even more!"
set key[id=212201214002139] name "How was it?\nWasn't it beautiful?"
set key[id=212201214002140] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nHere's one more way to enjoy the Maple Leaf Festival! "
set key[id=212201214002141] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Float up</font> toward that blue sky!\nIt'll feel so \
    refreshing, like your chest has been opened wide!"
set key[id=212201214002142] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Float up</font> toward that blue sky!\nIt'll feel so \
    refreshing, like your chest has been opened wide!"
set key[id=212201214002143] name "How was it?\nWasn't it refreshing?"
set key[id=212201214002144] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nWhen autumn comes, don't you somehow want to dive right into \
    the blue sky?"
set key[id=212201214002145] name "Ruby's recommended way to dive into the blue sky!\nSplash around and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">swim</font> in water as blue as the sky!"
set key[id=212201214002146] name "Ruby's recommended way to dive into the blue sky!\nSplash around and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">swim</font> in water as blue as the sky!"
set key[id=212201214002147] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel refreshed?"
