set key[id=726145417003929] name "Tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000252[gender:0]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000100$</font> how you feel.\nIf your hearts connect, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!\nTake $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=726145417003930] name "Hm, a young one who came all the way here must have something important.\nWhat \
    is it?"
set key[id=726145417003931] name "I love you."
set key[id=726145417003932] name "(I can't bring myself to confess, so I lie and say I came for an interview.)"
set key[id=726145417003933] name "Nice words, but... what exactly do you love?\nMy money? My company? My honor? \
    Which is it?"
set key[id=726145417003934] name "I just like you, Chairman."
set key[id=726145417003935] name "I want money."
set key[id=726145417003936] name "You like me? Then you can do anything I tell you to, right? "
set key[id=726145417003937] name "I'm confident."
set key[id=726145417003938] name "Never mind. I'd like to cancel."
set key[id=726145417003939] name "Good! Then sing this era's masterpiece, <font color=\"#ffd200\">Praise \
    Goldus</font>. \nBig and strong!"
set key[id=726145417003940] name "My love, your love, Goldus~"
set key[id=726145417003941] name "Gol~ Gol~ Gol~dus"
set key[id=726145417003942] name "Yes~ Keep singing!"
set key[id=726145417003943] name "Don't spend your life sick and wheezing!"
set key[id=726145417003944] name "Can't live without Goldus~ Really can't live~"
set key[id=726145417003945] name "Good~ Good!"
set key[id=726145417003946] name "Let's live for the mighty hospital!"
set key[id=726145417003947] name "Let's live for mighty prosperity!"
set key[id=726145417003948] name "Let's live for mighty woof woof!"
set key[id=726145417003949] name "You've got the basics down. I like you, young one!"
set key[id=726145417003950] name "(Thank you.)"
set key[id=726145417003951] name "Showing up before me without knowing even one Praise Goldus!\nAre you out of \
    your mind? Want a scolding? Huh!"
set key[id=726145417003952] name "Please give me one more chance."
set key[id=726145417003953] name "This is petty, so forget it."
set key[id=726145417003954] name "At least you're honest. But you can't have money just because you want it. \nIf \
    you want to learn how to earn money, I can help you.\nNow then, shall we test whether you're qualified?"
set key[id=726145417003955] name "I'm confident."
set key[id=726145417003956] name "Never mind. I'd like to cancel."
set key[id=726145417003957] name "Then why on earth did you come here...?"
set key[id=726145417003958] name "(No choice... I go back to basics and confess my love again.)"
set key[id=726145417003959] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000252[gender:0]$</font> pushes up his glasses \
    and grins.\nIt seems you've connected with him...!"
set key[id=726145417003960] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=726145417003961] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=726145417003962] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=726145417003963] name "No, thanks."
set key[id=726145417003964] name "Great! Right now, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000001$</font> and tell \
    <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000160[gender:1]$</font>\nhow you feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your \
