set key[id=726145417003993] name "Tell <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000514[gender:1]$</font> in <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000124$</font> how you feel.\nIf your hearts connect, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!\nTake $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=726145417003994] name "What's this, a new prisoner?"
set key[id=726145417003995] name "I'm scared, but... I love you."
set key[id=726145417003996] name "Don't you smell something burning somewhere?"
set key[id=726145417003997] name "You're pulling some really original tricks, aren't you? \nFor a prisoner... "
set key[id=726145417003998] name "I'm not a prisoner."
set key[id=726145417003999] name "Even prisoners can love!"
set key[id=726145417004000] name "Oh? So you weren't a prisoner?\nBut be careful. Anyone can become a prisoner if \
    they do wrong.\nIf you meet me as a prisoner... it'll be very tiring for you."
set key[id=726145417004001] name "I'll keep that in mind."
set key[id=726145417004002] name "Good. Anyone who can talk sense is welcome any time.\nFor sightseeing, or for \
    imprisonment."
set key[id=726145417004003] name "(Nod.)"
set key[id=726145417004004] name "A burning smell...? Hey. What nonsense is that. \nWe don't run an incinerator. "
set key[id=726145417004005] name "My heart is burning."
set key[id=726145417004007] name "Hey, guard. Throw this one in solitary!\nPrisoner number 201507..."
set key[id=726145417004008] name "That's unfair!"
set key[id=726145417004009] name "Unfair? Un~fair~? You committed a crime, so you deserve to be locked up!\nIf \
    recklessly punning in this sacred place of correction isn't a crime, what is?!"
set key[id=726145417004010] name "I'm sorry."
set key[id=726145417004011] name "Never talk such nonsense again. Understood?\nI can make you feel your bones and \
    flesh burning away!"
set key[id=726145417004012] name "I'll keep that in mind."
set key[id=726145417004013] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000514[gender:1]$</font> strokes the whip in her \
    hand and smiles.\nIt seems you've connected with her...!"
set key[id=726145417004014] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=726145417004015] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=726145417004016] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=726145417004017] name "No, thanks."
set key[id=726145417004018] name "Great! Right now, go to <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000216$</font> and tell \
