    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> will appear as proof!\nTake $item:30001182$ to <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004101$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:63000062$</font>\nand you can buy \
    some fun items. Good luck!"
set key[id=726145417004023] name "Who are you?"
set key[id=726145417004024] name "I love you."
set key[id=726145417004025] name "Don't you smell something burning somewhere?"
set key[id=726145417004026] name "Hehehe. What a romantic.\nBut there's no such thing as a free lunch. Especially \
    here at the Black Market."
set key[id=726145417004027] name "How much will it take?"
set key[id=726145417004028] name "Love is eternal, wherever you are."
set key[id=726145417004029] name "Hmm...? The most interesting thing you've said so far.\nDo you have some wealth \
    put away? \nWith the mesos you're carrying now, it doesn't look possible."
set key[id=726145417004030] name "I have a little."
set key[id=726145417004031] name "(I see bodyguards. I'd better apologize and get out fast.)"
set key[id=726145417004032] name "A little... is it. That's not enough. \nTo come on to me, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font>, you'd have to be able to bring me a royal palace."
set key[id=726145417004033] name "I'll work hard and earn more from now on."
set key[id=726145417004034] name "(Apologize and hurry out.)"
set key[id=726145417004035] name "Romance and spirit both. Good, that's what it takes.\nI, <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font>, really hate being looked down on.\nBut I have no need for \
    your heart right now."
set key[id=726145417004036] name "My heart is burning for you."
set key[id=726145417004037] name "Oh dear. A burning heart is serious. Put it out quickly.\nOh, and if you need \
    firefighters, just say so.\nThis is the Black Market, so as long as you have mesos, you can get anything \
    done."
set key[id=726145417004038] name "(...Scary. I apologize and hurry out.)"
set key[id=726145417004039] name "Hehe, come back any time if you need something.\nA light heart and a heavy \
    wallet."
set key[id=726145417004040] name "(Nod.)"
set key[id=726145417004041] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000515[gender:1]$</font> curls her lips into a \
    grin.\nHave you connected with her...?"
set key[id=726145417004042] name "Hello, $MyPCName$! \nHave you heard about the heartbreaking couple in \
    $map:63000062$?\nThe only way for them to meet is to wait for the <font color=\"#ffd200\">seventh moonlit \
    night</font>...\nTo make that amazing miracle happen, shall we fill this world with love?"
set key[id=726145417004043] name "A brave confession of love can sometimes create a miracle.\nWhy don't you try \
    being the star of that miracle, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=726145417004044] name "That's a great idea!"
set key[id=726145417004045] name "No, thanks."
set key[id=726145417004046] name "Great! Right now, go tell <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11000015[gender:1]$</font> in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$map:02000076$</font>\nhow you \
    feel, and make a miracle happen.\nIf your hearts connect, you'll get <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001182$</font> as proof!"
