set key[id=810164114002952] name "The Barbosa weekly mission is\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">to defeat 5 field bosses \
    or adventure dungeon bosses and complete today's mission 10 times</font>!\nComplete the mission and be sure to \
    collect your <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font>!"
set key[id=810164114002953] name "You cleared this week's Barbosa weekly mission!\nHere are the 30 <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font> I promised.\nA weekly mission that gives you 30 <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font> at once! \nIf you're aiming for a high-tier key, you can't afford to \
    miss the weekly mission, right?"
set key[id=816175514002874] name "$MyPCName$! \nTake on the Barbosa weekly mission!\nThe Barbosa weekly mission \
    can be completed only once a week, and when you finish it \nI'll give you 30 <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font> as a reward!"
set key[id=816175514002875] name "The Barbosa weekly mission is\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">to defeat 5 field bosses \
    or adventure dungeon bosses and complete today's mission 10 times</font>!\nComplete the mission and be sure to \
    collect your <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font>!"
set key[id=816175514002876] name "The Barbosa weekly mission is\n<font color=\"#ffd200\">to defeat 5 field bosses \
    or adventure dungeon bosses and complete today's mission 10 times</font>!\nComplete the mission and be sure to \
    collect your <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font>!"
set key[id=816175514002877] name "You cleared this week's Barbosa weekly mission!\nHere are the 30 <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font> I promised.\nA weekly mission that gives you 30 <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30000881$</font> at once! \nIf you're aiming for a high-tier key, you can't afford to \
    miss the weekly mission, right?"
set key[id=1012144117004246] name "$MyPCName$, $MyPCName$!\nDo you know about a creature called $npc:50400309$? \
    $npc:50400309$ is a little demon who loves pumpkins.\nThere's a rumor that a little demon who came to the \
    human world to play tricks on Halloween loved pumpkins so much that it turned pumpkin-shaped!"
set key[id=1012144117004247] name "A demon shaped like a pumpkin, does such a thing really exist, you ask?\nHee \
    hee, actually I found a cute $npc:50400309$ not long ago, so if you're interested, how about taking it in and \
    raising it, $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1012144117004248] name "They say $npc:50400309$ loves pumpkin pie made from moist, sweet \
    pumpkins.\nDepending on how long you spend in Maple World, you can receive up to 5 $item:20302004$ every day, \
    so it shouldn't be hard to get.\nAnd if you play with $npc:50400309$ at other people's homes, you can get up \
    to 3 more $item:20302004$ every day."
set key[id=1012144117004249] name "Here, I'll give you $item:50400309$, so please set it up in your home and raise \
    $npc:50400309$. \nHee hee, it may look like a demon, but it's cute, so it won't do any harm.\nJust be aware \
    that it's so~ cute that your heart might ache, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1012144117004250] name "Now try setting up $item:50400309$ in your home.\nIt's a tiny little demon, but \
    with your love, $MyPCName$, it might grow big and strong!"
set key[id=1012144117004251] name "Hurry and set up $item:50400309$ in your home.\n$npc:50400309$ will welcome \
    you, $MyPCName$."
set key[id=1012144117004252] name "Here's some $item:20302004$ that $npc:50400309$ likes. Feed $npc:50400309$ and \
    help it grow.\nAnd don't forget that you can get up to 3 more $item:20302004$ a day by playing with \
    $npc:50400309$ at other people's homes, and up to 5 a day depending on your play time!"
set key[id=1106130917004253] name "$MyPCName$, it's terrible! The turkeys who are fated to end up on adventurers' \
    tables every Thanksgiving couldn't take it anymore, and they've raided Maple World to ruin Thanksgiving! An \
    ordinary turkey is just a pretty little bird, but for some reason the $npc:27000051$ that showed up in \
    $map:02000092$ is said to be enormous and violent!"
set key[id=1106130917004254] name "Rumor has it that $npc:27000051$ appears in $map:02000092$ on the hour, every \
    hour. Please defeat $npc:27000051$, $MyPCName$, so it can't hurt the residents of Maple World!"
set key[id=1106130917004255] name "Rumor has it that $npc:27000051$ appears in $map:02000092$ on the hour, every \
    hour. Please defeat $npc:27000051$, $MyPCName$, so it can't hurt the residents of Maple World!"
set key[id=1106130917004256] name "$MyPCName$, you took care of $npc:27000051$! On behalf of the residents of \
    Maple World, I'll give you a tasty $item:20001130$ as thanks!"
set key[id=1106130917004257] name "Rumor has it that the $npc:27000051$ sighted day after day in $map:02000092$ is \
    a delicacy beyond any ordinary turkey! Maybe that's why some people are even buying $npc:27000051$ in bulk to \
    hold a grand Thanksgiving party."
set key[id=1106130917004258] name "This Thanksgiving season, I'd like to serve my guests dishes made from \
    $npc:27000051$ too, but as you know, I have so many guests that I don't think the party will be over in a \
    single day! For a successful Thanksgiving party, could you catch fresh $npc:27000051$ for ten days, \
    $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1106130917004259] name "This Thanksgiving season, I'd like to serve my guests dishes made from \
    $npc:27000051$ too, but as you know, I have so many guests that I don't think the party will be over in a \
    single day! For a successful Thanksgiving party, could you catch fresh $npc:27000051$ for ten days, \
    $MyPCName$?"
set key[id=1106130917004260] name "Thanks to you, $MyPCName$, I was able to prepare lots of delicious turkey \
    dishes. This is a gift from me to thank you!"
set key[id=1107202514001395] name "Hello, I'm $npc:11001002[gender:1]$!\nI've prepared a special event to help you \
    level up in a fantastic way!\nJust complete a few missions with me, Ruby, and the gifts will come pouring \
    in!\nIf you're ready, shall we begin?"
set key[id=1107202514001396] name "Today's Fantastic Warm-Up Mission is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Running</font>.\nLimber up with a light run, then move on to the next mission!"
set key[id=1107202514001397] name "Today's Fantastic Warm-Up Mission is <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Running</font>.\nLimber up with a light run, then move on to the next mission!"
set key[id=1107202514001398] name "How was it? Your body feels a lot more relaxed, doesn't it?"
set key[id=1107202514001399] name "The warm-up is over, so shall we start the real missions?"
set key[id=1107202514001400] name "Here's today's Fantastic Mission!\nTake on the various <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">solo dungeons</font> around Maple World!"
set key[id=1107202514001401] name "Here's today's Fantastic Mission!\nTake on the various <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">solo dungeons</font> around Maple World!"
set key[id=1107202514001402] name "I knew you could do it, $MyPCName$!\nCongratulations on clearing the Fantastic \
    Mission!"
set key[id=1107202514001403] name "A mission prepared for adventurers who cleared the Fantastic Missions with \
    flying colors!\nThis one won't be easy at all.\nBut I've prepared a special gift to match the dangerous \
    challenge, so give it a try!"
set key[id=1107202514001404] name "There are powerful dungeons all over Maple World.\nAmong them, the Chaos \
    Dungeons have a terrible reputation among adventurers!"
set key[id=1107202514001405] name "This is the final Fantastic Mission.\nSucceed against the strengthened bosses \
    of the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Dungeons</font>! \nThe Chaos Dungeons are in the Shadow Legion Altar, the \
    Moonlight Captain's Fortress, and the Ludibrium Clock Tower."
set key[id=1107202514001406] name "This is the final Fantastic Mission.\nSucceed against the bosses of the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Chaos Dungeons</font>! \nThe Chaos Dungeons are in <font color=\"#ffd200\">the Shadow Legion \
    Altar, the Moonlight Captain's Fortress, and the Ludibrium Clock Tower</font>."
set key[id=1107202514001407] name "You even cleared the Fantastic Special Mission!\nYou really are the best, \
    $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1107213414001408] name "Hello, I'm $npc:11001002[gender:1]$!\nI've prepared a special event to help you \
    level up in a fantastic way!\nJust complete a few missions with me, Ruby, and the gifts will come pouring \
