set key[id=1110104017003000] name "You brought back this much information!\nAs expected, $MyPCName$ is the best! "
set key[id=1110104017003001] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nHave you ever run while listening to the wind brush past \
    your ears?"
set key[id=1110104017003002] name "Listen to the cool sound of the wind and <font color=\"#ffd200\">run to your \
    heart's content!</font>\nNothing could be better!"
set key[id=1110104017003003] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=1110104017003004] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nWhen you feel stuffy or down, try <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">jumping</font> toward that blue sky like I do.\nYou'll feel refreshed, as if your chest has \
    opened up!"
set key[id=1110104017003005] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">Jump</font> up toward that blue sky.\nIt'll feel so \
    refreshing, like your chest has been opened wide!"
set key[id=1110104017003006] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=1110104017003007] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nHop on a <font color=\"#ffd200\">mount</font> and go \
    sightseeing around Maple World.\nThe beautiful scenery of Maple World will lift your mood even more!"
set key[id=1110104017003008] name "Hop on a <font color=\"#ffd200\">mount</font> and go sightseeing around the \
    Maple World.\nThe beautiful scenery will lift your mood even more!"
set key[id=1110104017003009] name "How was it?\nDon't your body and mind feel healthier?"
set key[id=1113133602005871] name "Phew, any later and things could have gotten much worse...\nThank you for your \
    help."
set key[id=1115193211004938] name "$MyPCName$, it seems $npc:11000119[gender:0]$ is looking for you. \nPlease go \
    see him."
