    $map:02000557$</font>\\n\\n<font color=\"#FF5F5F\">You cannot use two or more lures at the same time. Using \
    one removes the effect of the current lure.</font>\\n\\nUse the World Map or Event Map shortcut button to get \
    to $map:02000557$ quickly and easily."
set key[id=20001800] mainDescription "<font size='14'>Duration 30 Min</font>\\n<font size='20'>Gives a chance to \
