    sells the skin capsule contents. The coin shop only accepts coins of the same round."
set key[id=22201040] guideDescription "$item:22201040$ can be obtained by dismantling items from \
    $item:22001040$.\\nDouble-click the item in your inventory to open the coin shop."
set key[id=30001189] tooltipDescription "A glass bead with a Lumistone pattern, prepared by the Tria royal family \
    for adventurers. It serves as the framework when converting Essence of Darkness into the properties that suit \
    Lumistone energy."
set key[id=30001189] guideDescription "Put it into the Lumina Cube in Tria together with Essence of Darkness to \
    get the materials needed to upgrade Lumistones."
set key[id=30001202] tooltipDescription "A whetstone once used by the legendary blacksmith Toad. It gives the same \
    effect as enchanting when you need it for equipment. When used to enchant a dual-wield weapon, it gives the \
    effect to both pieces of equipment."
set key[id=30001203] tooltipDescription "A whetstone once used by the legendary blacksmith Toad. It gives the same \
    effect as enchanting when you need it for equipment. When used to enchant a dual-wield weapon, it gives the \
    effect to both pieces of equipment."
set key[id=30001345] tooltipDescription "A rainbow candy made with a special recipe. It still looks colorful and \
    tasty, but now it is even more special. If you lock a pet's bonus talents with the shiny rainbow candy, the \
    locked talents keep their type and value even when you change the pet's bonus talents. Its shining power lets \
    you lock up to 2 of the pet's talents."
set key[id=30001345] guideDescription "It is used up when you lock bonus talents while changing pet talents. The \
    type and value of the talents you select are locked with this item. You can lock up to 2 kinds of talents."
set key[id=30001479] tooltipDescription "The key to the lowest-level prison cell of $map:52000189$. They say \
    $npc:11003368$, one of the Seven Heroes, is held inside."
set key[id=30001480] tooltipDescription "An urgent message that $npc:11001812$ sent through $npcName:11004744$, \
    asking Empress $npcName:11004786$ for support to fully seal the Land of Darkness."
set key[id=30001485] tooltipDescription "A symptom that goes hand in hand with the powerful, and it seems even \
    $npc:11000074$ could not avoid it."
set key[id=30001486] tooltipDescription "A diary that $npc:11000074$ has kept for a long time. It is like the \
    history of the Vidblame family, and it is the thing $npc:11000074$ treasures most."
set key[id=30001487] tooltipDescription "A toy teddy bear for a small child. It has been handled a lot and is worn \
    in places. It looks old, so it seems to have no owner now."
set key[id=30001488] tooltipDescription "A letter that $npc:11000074$ left half-written, crumpled up as if given \
    up on sending. It speaks of missing someone, but the ink is smudged and the recipient cannot be made out."
set key[id=30001514] tooltipDescription "A coin you can get from various events for the 5th anniversary."
set key[id=30001514] guideDescription "Double-click to use the Mushking Shop right away."
set key[id=30001521] tooltipDescription "A golden piece with a rainbow drawn on it. In $map:02000557$, you can \
    exchange it for various items at the shop of the event merchant $npc:11004842$."
set key[id=30001521] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001521$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Use a Baki Air Pump \
    at the Baki Pool\\n- Fish in $map:02000557$ using $item:20001798$\\n- Get it as a reward for joining the Kay \
    event</font>\\n\\nYou can visit $map:02000557$ with the world map or the event map shortcut button."
set key[id=30001526] tooltipDescription "A coin used in Maple World events. You can exchange it for various items \
    with Bobby, the event helper in Queenstown or Barbenie."
set key[id=30001526] guideDescription "How to get\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'>- Joining the Me 22 Year attendance \
    check event\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'>- Various in-game activities (fishing, adventure, and life content)"
set key[id=30001527] tooltipDescription "A Maple coin used in Maple World events.\nYou can exchange it for various \
    items with Bobby, the event helper in Queenstown or Barbenie."
set key[id=30001527] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001527$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n - Joining events\\n \
    - Various in-game activities"
set key[id=30001528] tooltipDescription "A letter Clark left for his son $npcName:11004873$. It looks like someone \
    has already read it."
set key[id=30061169] tooltipDescription "A scroll that is used up when you lock an option while changing the bonus \
    options of an Epic grade weapon. Once an option is locked, its type and value do not change even when you \
    change the bonus options."
set key[id=30061169] guideDescription "It is used up when you lock an option while changing bonus options."
set key[id=31001051] tooltipDescription "A runestone with mysterious power that makes equipment stronger when \
    used."
set key[id=31001051] guideDescription "Double-click to use the runestone to enchant equipment.\\nCan only be used \
    on enchantable Normal, Rare, Elite, Exceptional, Legendary, and Epic grade one-handed weapon equipment. Using \
    it has a 100% chance to turn the item into a +10 enchant item."
