set key[id=40100058] tooltipDescription "A strange crystal found in the phantom space beyond the rift in \
    space-time. It is a substance that first appeared in Maple World and holds strong energy from the rift's \
    power. Applying it to a Fire Prism weapon from the Phantom Dungeon creates tremendous synergy."
set key[id=40100058] guideDescription "A material needed for limit break. It lets you push past a weapon's limits \
    and raise its performance."
